msgstr "Loot: Ignore Favourites"

msgid "Favorite items inside of this zone are ignored by \"sort out loot\" zone-action."
msgstr "Favourite items inside of this zone are ignored by \"sort out loot\" zone-action."

msgid "Aikido is a Japanese martial art focused on self-defense, while minimizing injury to the attacker.  It uses defensive throws and disarms but its techniques lack offensive power."
msgstr "Aikido is a Japanese martial art focused on self-defence, while minimising injury to the attacker.  It uses defensive throws and disarms but its techniques lack offensive power."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By disregarding offense in favor of defense, you are better at protecting yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 100% of Dexterity, +2 blocking effectiveness, +1.0 Dodging skill."
msgstr ""
"By disregarding offence in favour of defence, you are better at protecting yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 100% of Dexterity, +2 blocking effectiveness, +1.0 Dodging skill."

msgid "Barbaran Montante originated in 16th century Spain and focuses on overcoming thick armor with heavy weaponry and sweeping blows, transferring kinetic energy through armor and into vulnerable organs and bones."
msgstr "Barbaran Montante originated in 16th century Spain and focuses on overcoming thick armour with heavy weaponry and sweeping blows, transferring kinetic energy through armour and into vulnerable organs and bones."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sliding footwork enhances the crushing continuity of your attacks.\n"
"\n"
"Armor penetration increased by 75% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Sliding footwork enhances the crushing continuity of your attacks.\n"
"\n"
"Armour penetration increased by 75% of Strength."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You prepare for the final crushing strike.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 15% of Strength, armor penetration increased by 225% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"You prepare for the final crushing strike.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 15% of Strength, armour penetration increased by 225% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."

msgid "One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Dragon uses fluid movements and hard strikes.  Intelligence improves your accuracy and damage instead of Dexterity and Strength.  Dodging and blocking increases your damage.  Pausing increases your defenses.  You can perform a powerful strike against a downed opponent."
msgstr "One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Dragon uses fluid movements and hard strikes.  Intelligence improves your accuracy and damage instead of Dexterity and Strength.  Dodging and blocking increases your damage.  Pausing increases your defences.  You can perform a powerful strike against a downed opponent."

msgid "Eskrima, also known as Kali, is a Filipino martial art.  It emphasizes rapid strikes with knife and baton weapons, along with a variety of improvised substitutes."
msgstr "Eskrima, also known as Kali, is a Filipino martial art.  It emphasises rapid strikes with knife and baton weapons, along with a variety of improvised substitutes."

msgid "Defense Break"
msgstr "Defence Break"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Landing a hit allows you to perfectly position yourself for maximum defense against multiple opponents.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt, +1 dodge attempt, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength, -10% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Landing a hit allows you to perfectly position yourself for maximum defence against multiple opponents.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt, +1 dodge attempt, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength, -10% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."

msgid "The art of the longsword and sword & buckler, preceding the later development of fencing.  Designed for combat both unarmored and in armor, it includes grappling as well as defensive and offensive sword techniques.  This style is a combination of the Italian and German traditions."
msgstr "The art of the longsword and sword & buckler, preceding the later development of fencing.  Designed for combat both unarmoured and in armour, it includes grappling as well as defensive and offensive sword techniques.  This style is a combination of the Italian and German traditions."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Through chivalry and vigilance, your defense with a blade has increased.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Through chivalry and vigilance, your defence with a blade has increased.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You parry and return the attack with greater vigor!\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage, -10% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"You parry and return the attack with greater vigour!\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage, -10% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."

msgid "You perform a short wai khru in honor of your teachers."
msgstr "You perform a short wai khru in honour of your teachers."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Cautious watchful eyes,\n"
"measure and display your skill.\n"
"Practice makes perfect.\n"
"\n"
"Armor penetration increased by 50% of Perception, blocked damage reduced by 100% of Perception."
msgstr ""
"Cautious watchful eyes,\n"
"measure and display your skill.\n"
"Practice makes perfect.\n"
"\n"
"Armour penetration increased by 50% of Perception, blocked damage reduced by 100% of Perception."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The enemy has presented an opening in their defense.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage.\n"
"Enables \"Close Combat\" buff.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"The enemy has presented an opening in their defence.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage.\n"
"Enables \"Close Combat\" buff.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each snake bite is more painful than the last.\n"
"\n"
"Armor penetration increased by 25% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns.  Stacks 4 times."
msgstr ""
"Each snake bite is more painful than the last.\n"
"\n"
"Armour penetration increased by 25% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns.  Stacks 4 times."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You hit a weakpoint!  Your next attack will be extra painful.\n"
"\n"
"Armor penetration increased by 100% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"You hit a weakpoint!  Your next attack will be extra painful.\n"
"\n"
"Armour penetration increased by 100% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."

msgid ""
"Your training grants better defense while using a polearm.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt, +2 blocking effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Your training grants better defence while using a polearm.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt, +2 blocking effectiveness."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have given up your defenses for a moment to increase the damage of your attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage, -1 block attempt.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"You have given up your defences for a moment to increase the damage of your attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage, -1 block attempt.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using your legs to attack keeps your hands free for better defense.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Using your legs to attack keeps your hands free for better defence.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength."

msgid "Though Tai Chi is often seen as a form of mental and physical exercise, it is a legitimate martial art, focused on self-defense.  Its ability to absorb the force of an attack makes your Perception decrease damage further on a block.  Pausing for a moment enables powerful palm strike techniques."
msgstr "Though Tai Chi is often seen as a form of mental and physical exercise, it is a legitimate martial art, focused on self-defence.  Its ability to absorb the force of an attack makes your Perception decrease damage further on a block.  Pausing for a moment enables powerful palm strike techniques."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are focused on defense and predicting your opponents' attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt, blocked damage reduced by 100% Perception."
msgstr ""
"You are focused on defence and predicting your opponents' attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt, blocked damage reduced by 100% Perception."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By perfectly positioning yourself and your opponent, you have become more accurate and can bypass your opponent's defenses.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 20% of Perception, armor penetration increased by 50% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"By perfectly positioning yourself and your opponent, you have become more accurate and can bypass your opponent's defences.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 20% of Perception, armour penetration increased by 50% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You do not need defense.  You do not need a plan.  You need strength.  Strength will break your opponents' defenses and overwhelm them completely.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 25% of Strength but decreased by 25% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"You do not need defence.  You do not need a plan.  You need strength.  Strength will break your opponents' defences and overwhelm them completely.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 25% of Strength but decreased by 25% of Dexterity."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are a walking tank!\n"
"\n"
"Bash armor increased by 100% of Strength, cut armor increased by 100% of Dexterity, electric armor increased by 100% of Intelligence, and fire armor increased by 100% of Perception."
msgstr ""
"You are a walking tank!\n"
"\n"
"Bash armour increased by 100% of Strength, cut armour increased by 100% of Dexterity, electric armour increased by 100% of Intelligence, and fire armour increased by 100% of Perception."

msgid "A modern combat style for the post-modern human.  Nicknamed \"Biojutsu\", Bionic Combatives combines integrated weaponry, armor, and augments into a consolidated fighting discipline."
msgstr "A modern combat style for the post-modern human.  Nicknamed \"Biojutsu\", Bionic Combatives combines integrated weaponry, armour, and augments into a consolidated fighting discipline."

msgid ""
"player@CDDA:/root$ sudo apt install improved-armor\n"
"player@CDDA:/root$ sudo apt update\n"
"\n"
"+3 bash, cut, and stab armor.\n"
"Lasts 4 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"player@CDDA:/root$ sudo apt install improved-armour\n"
"player@CDDA:/root$ sudo apt update\n"
"\n"
"+3 bash, cut, and stab armour.\n"
"Lasts 4 turns.  Stacks 3 times."

msgid "Optimization"
msgstr "Optimisation"

msgid ""
"Through patience and observation, you know how to turn the tide of battle in your favor.\n"
"\n"
"+2 accuracy, +2 blocking effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Through patience and observation, you know how to turn the tide of battle in your favour.\n"
"\n"
"+2 accuracy, +2 blocking effectiveness."

msgid "One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Liang Shen.  Masters of Toad Style can focus their Strength to protect against all attacks.  You have powerful armor against physical attacks, though you will lose focus when you move.  You can meditate by pausing, giving yourself more armor for a short time."
msgstr "One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Liang Shen.  Masters of Toad Style can focus their Strength to protect against all attacks.  You have powerful armour against physical attacks, though you will lose focus when you move.  You can meditate by pausing, giving yourself more armour for a short time."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your body is as strong as iron, but only if you don't move.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armor increased by 100% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Your body is as strong as iron, but only if you don't move.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armour increased by 100% of Strength."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Moving causes you to lose your iron skin.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armor reduced by 20% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 5 turns.  Stacks 5 times."
msgstr ""
"Moving causes you to lose your iron skin.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armour reduced by 20% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 5 turns.  Stacks 5 times."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By concentrating for a moment, you can bolster the strength of your iron skin.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armor increased by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"By concentrating for a moment, you can bolster the strength of your iron skin.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armour increased by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."

