msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "You were living the high life when the world ended, surrounded by riches and eating well every day.  Now you've woken up, alone and drugged, in a room of your mansion that you don't recognize.  As you fight to remain conscious, you hear heavy footsteps nearby.  Time to get the hell out of here."
msgstr "You were living the high life when the world ended, surrounded by riches and eating well every day.  Now you've woken up, alone and drugged, in a room of your mansion that you don't recognise.  As you fight to remain conscious, you hear heavy footsteps nearby.  Time to get the hell out of here."

