msgid "Rumors of your takeover of <context_val:camp_name> have begun to spread…"
msgstr "Rumours of your takeover of <context_val:camp_name> have begun to spread…"

msgid "Your sentences are short, and you can't quite control your beak's clicking as you tire.  Still, they will understand, if they want to."
msgstr "Your sentences are short, and you can't quite control your beak's clicking as you tyre.  Still, they will understand, if they want to."

msgid "You realize you don't need to grow anything nearly as complicated as your old insides - one vesicle per word will suffice, but you needed a long time to learn the right rhythm."
msgstr "You realise you don't need to grow anything nearly as complicated as your old insides - one vesicle per word will suffice, but you needed a long time to learn the right rhythm."

msgid "You cough up a lot of off-color blood, but you swear in your own old voice again afterwards."
msgstr "You cough up a lot of off-colour blood, but you swear in your own old voice again afterwards."

msgid "Your exoskeleton grows steadily more rigid until you can no longer move.  You strain against it for a few minutes, and it peels and cracks away in chunks like a plaster mold, revealing a soft and tender new layer beneath."
msgstr "Your exoskeleton grows steadily more rigid until you can no longer move.  You strain against it for a few minutes, and it peels and cracks away in chunks like a plaster mould, revealing a soft and tender new layer beneath."

msgid "Your exoskeleton locks up around you like a straitjacket, completely immobilizing you.  As you try to move, you begin to feel it painlessly rip, opening a hole through which you can slowly emerge, raw, soft, and vulnerable."
msgstr "Your exoskeleton locks up around you like a straitjacket, completely immobilising you.  As you try to move, you begin to feel it painlessly rip, opening a hole through which you can slowly emerge, raw, soft, and vulnerable."

msgid "You suddenly feel wakeful and energized, as if something that was slowing you down is now gone."
msgstr "You suddenly feel wakeful and energised, as if something that was slowing you down is now gone."

msgid "The recorder whirs as it starts printing the recorded data."
msgstr "The recorder whirrs as it starts printing the recorded data."

msgid "Gray Dye"
msgstr "Grey Dye"

msgid "Dye your hair gray."
msgstr "Dye your hair grey."

msgid "You don't have any gray hair dye!"
msgstr "You don't have any grey hair dye!"

msgid "You hear a horn honk, and one of the Isherwoods calling out from their truck.  \"We're swarmed out here!  We're going to have to head back and regroup!\"  The horn bleats again, and there's a sound of an engine revving, followed by the fleshy 'smack' of something large hitting a windshield."
msgstr "You hear a horn honk, and one of the Isherwoods calling out from their truck.  \"We're swarmed out here!  We're going to have to head back and regroup!\"  The horn bleats again, and there's a sound of an engine revving, followed by the fleshy 'smack' of something large hitting a windscreen."

msgid "Active immobilizer"
msgstr "Active immobiliser"

msgid "An immobilizer device prevents starting of the vehicle without the appropriate key."
msgstr "An immobiliser device prevents starting of the vehicle without the appropriate key."

msgid "Required to pump and pressurize diesel from a vehicle's tank."
msgstr "Required to pump and pressurise diesel from a vehicle's tank."

msgid "Required to pump gasoline from a vehicle's tank."
msgstr "Required to pump petrol from a vehicle's tank."

msgid "Deactivate immobilizer"
msgstr "Deactivate immobiliser"

#, c-format
msgid "You successfully deactivate the immobilizer of the %s."
msgstr "You successfully deactivate the immobiliser of the %s."

msgid "Firm, low-pile, high-durability carpet in a green color, for laying down on bare concrete, with a still-functioning light attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr "Firm, low-pile, high-durability carpet in a green colour, for laying down on bare concrete, with a still-functioning light attached to the ceiling above."

msgid "This device effectively sterilizes water.  Activate it to clean all water in a connected tank, at the cost of some electricity."
msgstr "This device effectively sterilises water.  Activate it to clean all water in a connected tank, at the cost of some electricity."

msgid "makeshift water electrolyzer"
msgid_plural "makeshift water electrolyzers"
msgstr[0] "makeshift water electrolyser"
msgstr[1] "makeshift water electrolyzers"

msgid "An autoclave that can steam its contents at high enough temperatures to completely sterilize them, killing any possible contaminants.  This one is plugged into a power grid and running off internal water tanks."
msgstr "An autoclave that can steam its contents at high enough temperatures to completely sterilise them, killing any possible contaminants.  This one is plugged into a power grid and running off internal water tanks."

msgid "A rather heavy brick of metal housing an ASRG, formerly designed by NASA and repurposed for terrestrial use.  Will provide about 130 W, basically forever as far as you're concerned.  Even though the alpha radiation these run off of isn't very dangerous in case of a breach, this unit appears to be armored to take a beating and is a good deal heavier owing to its composite plating."
msgstr "A rather heavy brick of metal housing an ASRG, formerly designed by NASA and repurposed for terrestrial use.  Will provide about 130 W, basically forever as far as you're concerned.  Even though the alpha radiation these run off of isn't very dangerous in case of a breach, this unit appears to be armoured to take a beating and is a good deal heavier owing to its composite plating."

msgid "portable gasoline generator"
msgid_plural "portable gasoline generators"
msgstr[0] "portable petrol generator"
msgstr[1] "portable petrol generators"

msgid "A small, portable generator, one that people buy for a camp.  It just needs to be fueled up, and then turned on."
msgstr "A small, portable generator, one that people buy for a camp.  It just needs to be fuelled up, and then turned on."

msgid "Big and powerful generator, used for street works.  It just needs to be plugged in, fueled up, and then turned on."
msgstr "Big and powerful generator, used for street works.  It just needs to be plugged in, fuelled up, and then turned on."

msgid "Big and powerful generator, painted in camo.  It just needs to be plugged in, fueled up, and then turned on."
msgstr "Big and powerful generator, painted in camo.  It just needs to be plugged in, fuelled up, and then turned on."

msgid "powerful gasoline generator"
msgid_plural "powerful gasoline generators"
msgstr[0] "powerful petrol generator"
msgstr[1] "powerful petrol generators"

msgid "Still reasonably portable, this 12000 W gasoline generator can power up an entire house.  It just needs to be plugged in, fueled up, and then turned on."
msgstr "Still reasonably portable, this 12000 W petrol generator can power up an entire house.  It just needs to be plugged in, fuelled up, and then turned on."

msgid "A meaty green stalactite with a thickened hide like that of a starfish, extending from the floor to the ceiling.  In the center is a series of ports somewhat like mouths, from which pour bursts of a vile-smelling gas."
msgstr "A meaty green stalactite with a thickened hide like that of a starfish, extending from the floor to the ceiling.  In the centre is a series of ports somewhat like mouths, from which pour bursts of a vile-smelling gas."

msgid "A slowly-spinning parabolic dish engraved with an unrecognizable pattern of symbols that might, at a guess, be some sort of circuitry pattern - or maybe a religious incantation.  It is mounted on a completely mismatched electric motor that looks fairly mundane."
msgstr "A slowly-spinning parabolic dish engraved with an unrecognisable pattern of symbols that might, at a guess, be some sort of circuitry pattern - or maybe a religious incantation.  It is mounted on a completely mismatched electric motor that looks fairly mundane."

msgid "The huge, sweating pipes and large tank reveal this clanking and tortuous piece of equipment to be some sort of fluid pump.  It is cobbled together from several apparently ill-fitting parts that have been fitted with some very strange-looking but surprisingly clever adapters."
msgstr "The huge, sweating pipes and large tank reveal this clanking and tortuous piece of equipment to be some sort of fluid pump.  It is cobbled together from several apparently ill-fitting parts that have been fitted with some very strange-looking but surprisingly clever adaptors."

msgid "Twisting reams of copper and steel pipes wrap around a central core that thrums softly.  Although there are no labels in any language you recognize, the cables connected to the base suggest that this is some sort of power generator."
msgstr "Twisting reams of copper and steel pipes wrap around a central core that thrums softly.  Although there are no labels in any language you recognise, the cables connected to the base suggest that this is some sort of power generator."

msgid "A simple, unadorned, corroded metal charging and feeding station, with hookups for two units somewhat larger than a human to stand side by side and be recharged and refueled."
msgstr "A simple, unadorned, corroded metal charging and feeding station, with hookups for two units somewhat larger than a human to stand side by side and be recharged and refuelled."

msgid "A dead body encased in high-tech armor hanging in the air.  Their form seems twisted and refracted in the light of the strange glowing crystal that has seeped out of the ground and impaled their body."
msgstr "A dead body encased in high-tech armour hanging in the air.  Their form seems twisted and refracted in the light of the strange glowing crystal that has seeped out of the ground and impaled their body."

msgid "A dead body encased in military armor hanging in the air.  Their form seems twisted and refracted in the light of the strange glowing crystal that has seeped out of the ground and impaled their body."
msgstr "A dead body encased in military armour hanging in the air.  Their form seems twisted and refracted in the light of the strange glowing crystal that has seeped out of the ground and impaled their body."

msgid "A large rack of specialized computers for storing and transmitting information.  Powerless and largely useless for its intended purpose, the laptops mounted inside can still be used if removed."
msgstr "A large rack of specialised computers for storing and transmitting information.  Powerless and largely useless for its intended purpose, the laptops mounted inside can still be used if removed."

msgid "A full-length mirror mounted in a sleek aluminum frame.  You can easily see all of the dirt and blood on your clothes, and the weariness in your eyes."
msgstr "A full-length mirror mounted in a sleek aluminium frame.  You can easily see all of the dirt and blood on your clothes, and the weariness in your eyes."

msgid "An aluminum frame for a full-length mirror, with most of the mirror missing.  What remains in the frame are large, dangerous-looking shards of fractured glass."
msgstr "An aluminium frame for a full-length mirror, with most of the mirror missing.  What remains in the frame are large, dangerous-looking shards of fractured glass."

msgid "A 2.5-meter tall flagpole on a weighted stand.  You could hoist up a flag here."
msgstr "A 2.5-metre tall flagpole on a weighted stand.  You could hoist up a flag here."

msgid "Somewhere beneath this heap of dying plants you can see the shape of wooden furniture.  Left without care, the plants it used to nurture have shriveled and died."
msgstr "Somewhere beneath this heap of dying plants you can see the shape of wooden furniture.  Left without care, the plants it used to nurture have shrivelled and died."

msgid "A sizable, off-white sac of large eggs.  Upon watching closer, you can see them moving slightly.  Gross."
msgstr "A sizeable, off-white sac of large eggs.  Upon watching closer, you can see them moving slightly.  Gross."

msgid "A misty cloud of water vapor."
msgstr "A misty cloud of water vapour."

msgid "A simple metal stove for hosting wood-fueled fires.  Good for cooking or heating food, and safe to use indoors."
msgstr "A simple metal stove for hosting wood-fuelled fires.  Good for cooking or heating food, and safe to use indoors."

msgid "A foldable metal stove for hosting wood-fueled fires.  Good for cooking or heating food, and safe to use indoors."
msgstr "A foldable metal stove for hosting wood-fuelled fires.  Good for cooking or heating food, and safe to use indoors."

msgid "A common weed with a yellow flower.  Produces seeds that get carried on the wind by thin, gray filaments."
msgstr "A common weed with a yellow flower.  Produces seeds that get carried on the wind by thin, grey filaments."

msgid "A cute white flower with a yellow center, used to brew a soothing tea."
msgstr "A cute white flower with a yellow centre, used to brew a soothing tea."

msgid "A bright, colorful flower with petals forming a small cup at its top.  It can be poisonous to livestock."
msgstr "A bright, colourful flower with petals forming a small cup at its top.  It can be poisonous to livestock."

msgid "A pretty flower that comes in a variety of colors."
msgstr "A pretty flower that comes in a variety of colours."

msgid "A tall, wide-headed flower with a large dark center.  Produces many nutritious seeds."
msgstr "A tall, wide-headed flower with a large dark centre.  Produces many nutritious seeds."

msgid "A sizable pile of leaves.  You could sleep on it if you don't care about comfort or warmth."
msgstr "A sizeable pile of leaves.  You could sleep on it if you don't care about comfort or warmth."

msgid "A small, flowering plant known as 'Aralia nudicaulis'.  It is colored in vibrant shades of orange and red in autumn, making it easy to spot."
msgstr "A small, flowering plant known as 'Aralia nudicaulis'.  It is coloured in vibrant shades of orange and red in autumn, making it easy to spot."

msgid "It is not only toxic to dogs when eaten by them.  Humans and many other animals are affected, too.  Its fibers sure are worth salvaging though.  Despite its name, it is not actually spreading fast."
msgstr "It is not only toxic to dogs when eaten by them.  Humans and many other animals are affected, too.  Its fibres sure are worth salvaging though.  Despite its name, it is not actually spreading fast."

msgid "Also called Indian rice, Northern wild rice, or manoomin in Ojibwe, is a species of rice that has been harvested and used by Native American tribes of the northeast for hundreds of years.  It's similar to other types of wild rice, offering a fiber-rich and healthy basis of a meal."
msgstr "Also called Indian rice, Northern wild rice, or manoomin in Ojibwe, is a species of rice that has been harvested and used by Native American tribes of the northeast for hundreds of years.  It's similar to other types of wild rice, offering a fibre-rich and healthy basis of a meal."

msgid "This flower looks mostly like the other flowers taken by the mushrooms, but its bulb is a brilliant cyan color.  It emits an aroma that is both overwhelming and strangely alluring."
msgstr "This flower looks mostly like the other flowers taken by the mushrooms, but its bulb is a brilliant cyan colour.  It emits an aroma that is both overwhelming and strangely alluring."

msgid "This flower has been overgrown by gray, sinewy tendrils of fungus, and the color has been leached from its petals and stem.  It gently sways of its own volition, maintaining an unsettling rhythm."
msgstr "This flower has been overgrown by grey, sinewy tendrils of fungus, and the colour has been leached from its petals and stem.  It gently sways of its own volition, maintaining an unsettling rhythm."

msgid "Alien mold and stems mingle tightly here, swaying around and weaving together, creating a sort of fungal bush."
msgstr "Alien mould and stems mingle tightly here, swaying around and weaving together, creating a sort of fungal bush."

msgid "A magnificent carved statue with an engraved plaque fixed to the base.  It serves to honor the passing of somebody significant, something one wishes was still a practical goal."
msgstr "A magnificent carved statue with an engraved plaque fixed to the base.  It serves to honour the passing of somebody significant, something one wishes was still a practical goal."

msgid "A makeshift memorial marker, made of a service rifle - buried in the dirt, or nestled in a pair of boots - with a helmet perched on the stock.  A small way to honor the dead."
msgstr "A makeshift memorial marker, made of a service rifle - buried in the dirt, or nestled in a pair of boots - with a helmet perched on the stock.  A small way to honour the dead."

msgid "A large vat with a motorized mixing device for combining large quantities of chemicals."
msgstr "A large vat with a motorised mixing device for combining large quantities of chemicals."

msgid "This hefty lump of steel and lead is the housing unit for a Stirling generator powered by plutonium-238, originally designed by NASA and repurposed by the military.  It is plastered with warning signs.  It's really heavy owing to the thick armor plating, but you could take this down and use it for your own purposes if you wanted."
msgstr "This hefty lump of steel and lead is the housing unit for a Stirling generator powered by plutonium-238, originally designed by NASA and repurposed by the military.  It is plastered with warning signs.  It's really heavy owing to the thick armour plating, but you could take this down and use it for your own purposes if you wanted."

msgid "This fuel assembly consists of cylindrical rods put into bundles.  A uranium oxide ceramic is formed into pellets and inserted into Zircaloy tubes that are bundled together.  The Zircaloy tubes are pressurized with helium to minimize pellet-cladding interaction which can lead to fuel rod failure over long periods.  This fuel cell is used in nuclear power stations to produce heat to power turbines."
msgstr "This fuel assembly consists of cylindrical rods put into bundles.  A uranium oxide ceramic is formed into pellets and inserted into Zircaloy tubes that are bundled together.  The Zircaloy tubes are pressurised with helium to minimise pellet-cladding interaction which can lead to fuel rod failure over long periods.  This fuel cell is used in nuclear power stations to produce heat to power turbines."

msgid "A device that can steam its contents at high enough temperatures to completely sterilize them, killing any possible contaminants."
msgstr "A device that can steam its contents at high enough temperatures to completely sterilise them, killing any possible contaminants."

msgid "A specialized freezer capable of maintaining temperatures of -80 Celsius, best used for the preservation of delicate scientific samples."
msgstr "A specialised freezer capable of maintaining temperatures of -80 Celsius, best used for the preservation of delicate scientific samples."

msgid "A standing sink with a pair of nozzles, along with a large, brightly-colored handle.  It is specially designed to quickly remove contaminants from the eyes, and is easily usable without being able to see very well.  A sizable notice warns against drinking the water it uses."
msgstr "A standing sink with a pair of nozzles, along with a large, brightly-coloured handle.  It is specially designed to quickly remove contaminants from the eyes, and is easily usable without being able to see very well.  A sizeable notice warns against drinking the water it uses."

msgid "Inside this large white box is a carefully balanced set of electric field generators that can precisely separate ionized particles based on their charge-to-mass ratio, firing them into a detector that measures the exact mass of the particle hitting it.  Invaluable for chemical analysis and other advanced sciences, it's not as useful anymore."
msgstr "Inside this large white box is a carefully balanced set of electric field generators that can precisely separate ionised particles based on their charge-to-mass ratio, firing them into a detector that measures the exact mass of the particle hitting it.  Invaluable for chemical analysis and other advanced sciences, it's not as useful anymore."

msgid "anesthetic machine"
msgstr "anaesthetic machine"

msgid "A large machine with various tanks, tubes, and monitoring devices used to maintain precise levels of anesthesia in a patient to ensure they, at least ideally, remain asleep, unfeeling, but alive."
msgstr "A large machine with various tanks, tubes, and monitoring devices used to maintain precise levels of anaesthesia in a patient to ensure they, at least ideally, remain asleep, unfeeling, but alive."

msgid "A sizable box on a set of wheels that will pump air in and out of a patient's lungs when they are incapable of breathing, though often only needed temporarily."
msgstr "A sizeable box on a set of wheels that will pump air in and out of a patient's lungs when they are incapable of breathing, though often only needed temporarily."

msgid "A centrifuge, a liquid separating device with an automated analyzer unit.  For some reason, this one has an attached battery pack.  It could be used to analyze a medical fluid sample, such as blood, if a test tube was placed in it."
msgstr "A centrifuge, a liquid separating device with an automated analyser unit.  For some reason, this one has an attached battery pack.  It could be used to analyse a medical fluid sample, such as blood, if a test tube was placed in it."

msgid "This device effectively sterilizes water.  You can plug it into a power grid to use it."
msgstr "This device effectively sterilises water.  You can plug it into a power grid to use it."

msgid "A simple machine for launching sports balls of various types, with a pair of motorized wheels that, if spun up, would fling the ball at moderate speeds.  Probably not the most effective ranged weapon against the undead."
msgstr "A simple machine for launching sports balls of various types, with a pair of motorised wheels that, if spun up, would fling the ball at moderate speeds.  Probably not the most effective ranged weapon against the undead."

msgid "A motorized conveyor belt with a control panel for running in place.  Without power, it's an immense challenge to move the belt.  Regardless, you're probably getting enough cardio on your own."
msgstr "A motorised conveyor belt with a control panel for running in place.  Without power, it's an immense challenge to move the belt.  Regardless, you're probably getting enough cardio on your own."

msgid "A majestic pipe organ.  Dubbed \"the king of instruments\", it is capable of producing powerful sound harmonies if used by a skilled player.  Rows of off-white and black keys are linked to a set of iron pipes, which resonate at a specific pitch when pressurized air is driven through them."
msgstr "A majestic pipe organ.  Dubbed \"the king of instruments\", it is capable of producing powerful sound harmonies if used by a skilled player.  Rows of off-white and black keys are linked to a set of iron pipes, which resonate at a specific pitch when pressurised air is driven through them."

msgid "armored training dummy"
msgid_plural "armored training dummies"
msgstr[0] "armoured training dummy"
msgstr[1] "armoured training dummies"

msgid "A hand-made humanoid figure, useful for training in close quarters combat.  This one is covered in scrap armor and looks on guard.  It has been erected in the ground on its post."
msgstr "A hand-made humanoid figure, useful for training in close quarters combat.  This one is covered in scrap armour and looks on guard.  It has been erected in the ground on its post."

msgid "A specialized piece of equipment that receives phone signals and amplifies them to reach further destinations with more clarity.  Now that there's no longer signals for them to boost, they're only good for parts."
msgstr "A specialised piece of equipment that receives phone signals and amplifies them to reach further destinations with more clarity.  Now that there's no longer signals for them to boost, they're only good for parts."

msgid "airplane seat"
msgstr "aeroplane seat"

msgid "A cheaply-upholstered folding airplane seat, it has a simple across-the-lap seatbelt.  You likely wouldn't be the first to sleep in this."
msgstr "A cheaply-upholstered folding aeroplane seat, it has a simple across-the-lap seatbelt.  You likely wouldn't be the first to sleep in this."

msgid "A simple stool with four legs and a seat.  While it's a touch more maneuverable to sit on, the lack of back support means it's significantly less comfortable than a normal chair."
msgstr "A simple stool with four legs and a seat.  While it's a touch more manoeuvrable to sit on, the lack of back support means it's significantly less comfortable than a normal chair."

msgid "A wide wooden frame surrounding a sheet of cork, on to which a number of full-page notices have been neatly tacked.  Most seem to provide emergency information, or instructions now woefully outdated considering the state of things, but a map pointing to the nearest refugee center catches your eye.  You should take a closer look."
msgstr "A wide wooden frame surrounding a sheet of cork, on to which a number of full-page notices have been neatly tacked.  Most seem to provide emergency information, or instructions now woefully outdated considering the state of things, but a map pointing to the nearest refugee centre catches your eye.  You should take a closer look."

msgid "You study the board.  One of the pages has a map and address for a nearby refugee center alongside minutia you no longer need trouble yourself with now that society has collapsed, like 'operating hours' and 'acceptable forms of ID'.  You take careful note of the map on the board and mark down the coordinates."
msgstr "You study the board.  One of the pages has a map and address for a nearby refugee centre alongside minutia you no longer need trouble yourself with now that society has collapsed, like 'operating hours' and 'acceptable forms of ID'.  You take careful note of the map on the board and mark down the coordinates."

msgid "entertainment center"
msgstr "entertainment centre"

msgid "A humble wooden casket for the respectful burial of the dead.  While a standard practice before this all happened, it is now a rare honor for one to be given a proper final resting place.  An honor that countless many will likely never receive."
msgstr "A humble wooden casket for the respectful burial of the dead.  While a standard practice before this all happened, it is now a rare honour for one to be given a proper final resting place.  An honour that countless many will likely never receive."

msgid "A humble wooden casket for the respectful burial of the dead.  While a standard practice before this all happened, it is now a rare honor for one to be given a proper final resting place.  This one is open and unoccupied, and gazing inside fills you with a sense of melancholic weariness."
msgstr "A humble wooden casket for the respectful burial of the dead.  While a standard practice before this all happened, it is now a rare honour for one to be given a proper final resting place.  This one is open and unoccupied, and gazing inside fills you with a sense of melancholic weariness."

msgid "mailbox"
msgstr "postbox"

msgid "A metal frame on a set of wheels used for hanging large amounts of clothes.  Usually used in theater or retail environments, it's easy to use and quick to access."
msgstr "A metal frame on a set of wheels used for hanging large amounts of clothes.  Usually used in theatre or retail environments, it's easy to use and quick to access."

msgid "A secure wooden case at about waist-height, with glass paneling on top.  Useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off.  Not actually as secure as it looks, as the display windows are easily broken."
msgstr "A secure wooden case at about waist-height, with glass panelling on top.  Useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off.  Not actually as secure as it looks, as the display windows are easily broken."

msgid "A secure wooden case at about waist-height, with glass paneling on top.  Useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off.  Not actually as secure as it looks, as the display windows are easily broken.  This one has had its lock picked and is open."
msgstr "A secure wooden case at about waist-height, with glass panelling on top.  Useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off.  Not actually as secure as it looks, as the display windows are easily broken.  This one has had its lock picked and is open."

msgid "A secure wooden case at about waist-height, with glass paneling on top.  Would be useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off, if the glass hadn't been shattered.  Careful not to cut yourself when looting."
msgstr "A secure wooden case at about waist-height, with glass panelling on top.  Would be useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off, if the glass hadn't been shattered.  Careful not to cut yourself when looting."

msgid "A 2 meters high tank that can store up to 1500 liters of liquid.  That's a lot."
msgstr "A 2 metres high tank that can store up to 1500 litres of liquid.  That's a lot."

msgid "A tank filled with gasoline."
msgstr "A tank filled with petrol."

msgid "A broken tank which was filled with gasoline."
msgstr "A broken tank which was filled with petrol."

msgid "dumpster"
msgstr "skip"

msgid "A large metal dumpster that will likely not be getting picked up by the city's waste management any time soon.  Despite the unpleasant nature of climbing inside, it could make for a viable hiding spot."
msgstr "A large metal skip that will likely not be getting picked up by the city's waste management any time soon.  Despite the unpleasant nature of climbing inside, it could make for a viable hiding spot."

msgid "aluminum foot locker"
msgid_plural "aluminum foot lockers"
msgstr[0] "aluminium foot locker"
msgstr[1] "aluminium foot lockers"

msgid "An aluminum storage box, capable of holding any number of things.  The lid has a small lock."
msgstr "An aluminium storage box, capable of holding any number of things.  The lid has a small lock."

msgid "An imposing kiln produced by the Exodii, used to produce their ceramic armor"
msgstr "An imposing kiln produced by the Exodii, used to produce their ceramic armour"

msgid "fiber mat"
msgid_plural "fiber mats"
msgstr[0] "fibre mat"
msgstr[1] "fibre mats"

msgid "A standard wooden table.  You could sit down at it to eat like a civilized person."
msgstr "A standard wooden table.  You could sit down at it to eat like a civilised person."

msgid "A signaling device positioned at road intersections and pedestrian crossings to control the flow of traffic, but it's useless without electricity."
msgstr "A signalling device positioned at road intersections and pedestrian crossings to control the flow of traffic, but it's useless without electricity."

msgid "A 6-meter tall metal flagpole.  You could hoist up a flag here."
msgstr "A 6-metre tall metal flagpole.  You could hoist up a flag here."

msgid "A 5-meter tall wooden flagpole.  You could hoist up a flag here."
msgstr "A 5-metre tall wooden flagpole.  You could hoist up a flag here."

msgid "An area of heaped dirt, not easily traversable.  If examined more closely, it's quite favorable for planting seeds and the like."
msgstr "An area of heaped dirt, not easily traversable.  If examined more closely, it's quite favourable for planting seeds and the like."

msgid "An area of dirt heaped up to your shoulders, not easily traversable.  If examined more closely, it's quite favorable for planting seeds and the like."
msgstr "An area of dirt heaped up to your shoulders, not easily traversable.  If examined more closely, it's quite favourable for planting seeds and the like."

msgid "A large wooden device with a mechanical wheel used to combine fibers together into a stronger material."
msgstr "A large wooden device with a mechanical wheel used to combine fibres together into a stronger material."

msgid "A bulky, simple-hinged wooden device to break up the hard parts of fiber plants, with nail combs on the back for separating them out."
msgstr "A bulky, simple-hinged wooden device to break up the hard parts of fibre plants, with nail combs on the back for separating them out."

msgid "aluminum stepladder"
msgid_plural "aluminum stepladders"
msgstr[0] "aluminium stepladder"
msgstr[1] "aluminium stepladders"

msgid "A short, foldable aluminum ladder.  Can help you climb to a rooftop, or maybe slow something down."
msgstr "A short, foldable aluminium ladder.  Can help you climb to a rooftop, or maybe slow something down."

msgid "A massive bench-mounted device with a short guillotine blade mounted to a long lever.  Designed for making straight or curved cuts through sheet metal up to 3 millimeters thick."
msgstr "A massive bench-mounted device with a short guillotine blade mounted to a long lever.  Designed for making straight or curved cuts through sheet metal up to 3 millimetres thick."

msgid "While many survivors would have focused on trying to bring back electric lights, whoever lives here has apparently decided to make use of the changes wrought by the Cataclysm to provide light.  This vivarium contains soil, strange plants you don't recognize immediately, and most strikingly, a giant mutant firefly."
msgstr "While many survivors would have focused on trying to bring back electric lights, whoever lives here has apparently decided to make use of the changes wrought by the Cataclysm to provide light.  This vivarium contains soil, strange plants you don't recognise immediately, and most strikingly, a giant mutant firefly."

msgid "manual tire changer"
msgid_plural "manual tire changers"
msgstr[0] "manual tyre changer"
msgstr[1] "manual tyre changers"

msgid "This floor-mounted machine contains all the levers, clamps and mounts required to remove or fit a tire, plus an integrated foot pump to inflate it."
msgstr "This floor-mounted machine contains all the levers, clamps and mounts required to remove or fit a tyre, plus an integrated foot pump to inflate it."

msgid "A sealable 50-liter vat for fermenting vinegar and various alcoholic brews."
msgstr "A sealable 50-litre vat for fermenting vinegar and various alcoholic brews."

msgid "A sealable 50-liter wooden vat for fermenting vinegar and various alcoholic brews."
msgstr "A sealable 50-litre wooden vat for fermenting vinegar and various alcoholic brews."

msgid "A very tall, mesmerizing blood red flower.  Its beautiful, pristine form is rooted firmly on the innards of the beast.  The flesh around it is decayed, being consumed to feed its ornate, magnanimous body.  You feel an urge to sit and admire this priceless miracle of life."
msgstr "A very tall, mesmerising blood red flower.  Its beautiful, pristine form is rooted firmly on the innards of the beast.  The flesh around it is decayed, being consumed to feed its ornate, magnanimous body.  You feel an urge to sit and admire this priceless miracle of life."

msgid "You focus on the lily and realize it truly is perfection *incarnate*."
msgstr "You focus on the lily and realise it truly is perfection *incarnate*."

msgid "black glass mailbox"
msgstr "black glass postbox"

msgid "A glass sculpture of a mailbox.  The door is open; inside is a pile of envelopes, all razor-edged."
msgstr "A glass sculpture of a postbox.  The door is open; inside is a pile of envelopes, all razor-edged."

msgid "A glass basin and tap.  The inside stops halfway down in sheet of concentric ripples, with the tiny spire of a splashing droplet at the center "
msgstr "A glass basin and tap.  The inside stops halfway down in sheet of concentric ripples, with the tiny spire of a splashing droplet at the centre "

msgid "An industrially fabricated thick sheet carefully positioned and joined seamlessly with perimeter sealant, this wall is capable of resisting extreme elements as well as hostile forces.  Blast load rated and extremely fire-retardant, breaching it will require specialized tools or an industrial vehicle."
msgstr "An industrially fabricated thick sheet carefully positioned and joined seamlessly with perimeter sealant, this wall is capable of resisting extreme elements as well as hostile forces.  Blast load rated and extremely fire-retardant, breaching it will require specialised tools or an industrial vehicle."

msgid "A faux concrete wall positioned and joined seamlessly with the wall, this wall is capable of resisting extreme elements as well as hostile forces.  Blast load rated and extremely fire-retardant, breaching it will require specialized tools or an industrial vehicle."
msgstr "A faux concrete wall positioned and joined seamlessly with the wall, this wall is capable of resisting extreme elements as well as hostile forces.  Blast load rated and extremely fire-retardant, breaching it will require specialised tools or an industrial vehicle."

msgid "A galvanized steel door, forged to withstand punishment and impede anyone or anything.  Typically used in conjunction with automated electronic locking mechanisms that require an external source to unlock."
msgstr "A galvanised steel door, forged to withstand punishment and impede anyone or anything.  Typically used in conjunction with automated electronic locking mechanisms that require an external source to unlock."

msgid "A bare concrete floor, almost completely covered by twitching filaments of gray flesh."
msgstr "A bare concrete floor, almost completely covered by twitching filaments of grey flesh."

