msgid "A section of flooring made out of a tough, gray, rubbery material.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "A section of flooring made out of a tough, grey, rubbery material.  Can support a roof."

msgid "An area of loose dirt, not easily traversable.  If examined more closely, it's quite favorable for planting seeds and the like."
msgstr "An area of loose dirt, not easily traversable.  If examined more closely, it's quite favourable for planting seeds and the like."

msgid "High-quality and tough checkered metal flooring to reduce the risk of slips and falls."
msgstr "High-quality and tough chequered metal flooring to reduce the risk of slips and falls."

msgid "A section of flooring made out of a tough, rubbery material.  Colored a simple white."
