msgid "A checkered switch.  Should you activate it?"
msgstr "A chequered switch.  Should you activate it?"

msgid "A wide, domed section of nearly opaque, plastic-like material.  When the light hits it, a network of multicolored conduits like blood vessels can be seen snaking through its glistening interior."
