msgid "A short divider wall consisting of a wooden support structure with drywall.  Painted an all-too-common and neutral off-white or cream color.  Looks flammable."
msgstr "A short divider wall consisting of a wooden support structure with drywall.  Painted an all-too-common and neutral off-white or cream colour.  Looks flammable."

msgid "An aesthetically pleasing design with simple lines, this type of concrete was used with a weaker chemical mixture in order to have faster setting times.  Not ideal for multi-story buildings, but still capable of supporting a roof."
msgstr "An aesthetically pleasing design with simple lines, this type of concrete was used with a weaker chemical mixture in order to have faster setting times.  Not ideal for multi-storey buildings, but still capable of supporting a roof."

