msgid "A moisturizer containing mushroom extract to help improve the wellbeing of your skin."
msgstr "A moisturiser containing mushroom extract to help improve the wellbeing of your skin."

msgid "anti-aging moisturizer"
msgid_plural "anti-aging moisturizer"
msgstr[0] "anti-ageing moisturiser"
msgstr[1] "anti-ageing moisturiser"

msgid "A favorite among mature customers, this moisturizer will smooth out the wrinkles on your face and make you appear younger."
msgstr "A favourite among mature customers, this moisturiser will smooth out the wrinkles on your face and make you appear younger."

msgid "day and night moisturizer"
msgid_plural "day and night moisturizer"
msgstr[0] "day and night moisturiser"
msgstr[1] "day and night moisturiser"

msgid "A moisturizer that works all day and night.  A perfect fit for those that decide their own sleep schedule."
msgstr "A moisturiser that works all day and night.  A perfect fit for those that decide their own sleep schedule."

msgid "This is neither a fuel cell, nor nuclear, but the name stuck.  It uses plutonium-244 as a catalyst to stabilize a complicated nanocompound that can store enormous amounts of power.  Unfortunately, it cannot be recharged by conventional means: expended cells had to be sent to a central reprocessing facility that almost certainly doesn't exist anymore."
msgstr "This is neither a fuel cell, nor nuclear, but the name stuck.  It uses plutonium-244 as a catalyst to stabilise a complicated nanocompound that can store enormous amounts of power.  Unfortunately, it cannot be recharged by conventional means: expended cells had to be sent to a central reprocessing facility that almost certainly doesn't exist anymore."

msgid "A fluffy down feather from a bird.  Useful for making cozy bedclothes."
msgstr "A fluffy down feather from a bird.  Useful for making cosy bedclothes."

msgid "A canister of pressurized hydrogen so heavily compressed it has turned solid.  With proper equipment, it could be heated into plasma."
msgstr "A canister of pressurised hydrogen so heavily compressed it has turned solid.  With proper equipment, it could be heated into plasma."

msgid "oxidizer powder"
msgid_plural "oxidizer powder"
msgstr[0] "oxidiser powder"
msgstr[1] "oxidiser powder"

msgid "Volatile powdered chemical oxidizer."
msgstr "Volatile powdered chemical oxidiser."

msgid "A primer from a small-caliber pistol round."
msgstr "A primer from a small-calibre pistol round."

msgid "A primer from a large-caliber pistol round."
msgstr "A primer from a large-calibre pistol round."

msgid "A primer from a small-caliber rifle round."
msgstr "A primer from a small-calibre rifle round."

msgid "A primer from a large-caliber rifle round."
msgstr "A primer from a large-calibre rifle round."

msgid "A primer from a small-caliber pistol round.  It has been fired, and must be cleaned and reloaded to use again."
msgstr "A primer from a small-calibre pistol round.  It has been fired, and must be cleaned and reloaded to use again."

msgid "A primer from a large-caliber pistol round.  It has been fired, and must be cleaned and reloaded to use again."
msgstr "A primer from a large-calibre pistol round.  It has been fired, and must be cleaned and reloaded to use again."

msgid "A primer from a small-caliber rifle round.  It has been fired, and must be cleaned and reloaded to use again."
msgstr "A primer from a small-calibre rifle round.  It has been fired, and must be cleaned and reloaded to use again."

msgid "A primer from a large-caliber rifle round.  It has been fired, and must be cleaned and reloaded to use again."
msgstr "A primer from a large-calibre rifle round.  It has been fired, and must be cleaned and reloaded to use again."

msgid "A chunk of useful rubber that can be molded easily."
msgstr "A chunk of useful rubber that can be moulded easily."

msgid "A flammable carbon-based material produced by slowly burning wood.  Utilized in recipes requiring a pure, hot flame.  Can also be used in filters to remove contaminants from air and water."
msgstr "A flammable carbon-based material produced by slowly burning wood.  Utilised in recipes requiring a pure, hot flame.  Can also be used in filters to remove contaminants from air and water."

msgid "A pressurized multi-chamber glass vial filled with powerful chemical stimulants which can only be activated by a Rivtech stimulant delivery system."
msgstr "A pressurised multi-chamber glass vial filled with powerful chemical stimulants which can only be activated by a Rivtech stimulant delivery system."

msgid "A small amount of coal-derived carbon material with many small pores, used for the adsorption of harmful chemicals.  Most commonly employed within respirator filters, it traps and retains chemical gases and vapor contaminants while allowing filtered air to pass unhindered.  Once all the carbon has been bonded to intruding chemicals, the filter is expired and must be replaced."
msgstr "A small amount of coal-derived carbon material with many small pores, used for the adsorption of harmful chemicals.  Most commonly employed within respirator filters, it traps and retains chemical gases and vapour contaminants while allowing filtered air to pass unhindered.  Once all the carbon has been bonded to intruding chemicals, the filter is expired and must be replaced."

msgid "Liquid made up of propylene glycol, vegetable glycerin, flavorings, and nicotine.  Intended for use in an advanced electronic cigarette."
msgstr "Liquid made up of propylene glycol, vegetable glycerine, flavourings, and nicotine.  Intended for use in an advanced electronic cigarette."

msgid "A pile of small 3 cm by 6 cm steel rectangles with a pattern of holes drilled into it.  For use in creating or repairing lamellar armor."
msgstr "A pile of small 3 cm by 6 cm steel rectangles with a pattern of holes drilled into it.  For use in creating or repairing lamellar armour."

msgid "A pile of small 3 cm by 6 cm steel rectangles with a pattern of holes drilled into it, then hardened.  For use in creating or repairing hardened lamellar armor."
msgstr "A pile of small 3 cm by 6 cm steel rectangles with a pattern of holes drilled into it, then hardened.  For use in creating or repairing hardened lamellar armour."

msgid "Graphite powder mixed with a clay binder.  Produces gray or black marks that are easily erased, but otherwise resistant to moisture, most chemicals, ultraviolet radiation, and natural aging."
msgstr "Graphite powder mixed with a clay binder.  Produces grey or black marks that are easily erased, but otherwise resistant to moisture, most chemicals, ultraviolet radiation, and natural ageing."

msgid "Carbon black pigment infused with polymers, stabilizers, and water to help the ink flow properly."
msgstr "Carbon black pigment infused with polymers, stabilisers, and water to help the ink flow properly."

msgid "Prussian blue, crystal violet, and phthalocyanine blue pigments infused with polymers, stabilizers, and water to help the ink flow properly."
msgstr "Prussian blue, crystal violet, and phthalocyanine blue pigments infused with polymers, stabilisers, and water to help the ink flow properly."

msgid "Chlorophyll pigment infused with polymers, stabilizers, and water to help the ink flow properly."
msgstr "Chlorophyll pigment infused with polymers, stabilisers, and water to help the ink flow properly."

msgid "Eosin dye infused with polymers, stabilizers, and water to help the ink flow properly."
msgstr "Eosin dye infused with polymers, stabilisers, and water to help the ink flow properly."

msgid "anesthetic"
msgid_plural "anesthetic"
msgstr[0] "anaesthetic"
msgstr[1] "anaesthetic"

msgid "A device that effectively sterilizes water, but it doesn't take batteries.  You'll need to connect it to a power source."
msgstr "A device that effectively sterilises water, but it doesn't take batteries.  You'll need to connect it to a power source."

msgid "An autoclave, used to sterilize equipment with pressurized steam.  It requires a massive amount of power, so it will need to be plugged into a power grid."
msgstr "An autoclave, used to sterilise equipment with pressurised steam.  It requires a massive amount of power, so it will need to be plugged into a power grid."

msgid "A battery that uses a thin plutonium-244 rod to stabilize an exotic nanocompound.  It is universally compatible with all kinds of industrial-grade equipment and large tools.  Although it stores a huge amount of power, it cannot be recharged."
msgstr "A battery that uses a thin plutonium-244 rod to stabilise an exotic nanocompound.  It is universally compatible with all kinds of industrial-grade equipment and large tools.  Although it stores a huge amount of power, it cannot be recharged."

msgid "A battery that uses a huge plutonium-244 rod to stabilize an exotic nanocompound.  It was used in military mech-suits, was highly experimental, and had no civilian applications.  Although it stores a stupendous amount of power, it cannot be recharged."
msgstr "A battery that uses a huge plutonium-244 rod to stabilise an exotic nanocompound.  It was used in military mech-suits, was highly experimental, and had no civilian applications.  Although it stores a stupendous amount of power, it cannot be recharged."

msgid "A battery that uses a thin plutonium-244 rod to stabilize an exotic nanocompound.  It is universally compatible with all kinds of small devices.  Although it stores a huge amount of power, it cannot be recharged."
msgstr "A battery that uses a thin plutonium-244 rod to stabilise an exotic nanocompound.  It is universally compatible with all kinds of small devices.  Although it stores a huge amount of power, it cannot be recharged."

msgid "A battery that uses a thin plutonium-244 rod to stabilize an exotic nanocompound, designed for small size over everything else."
msgstr "A battery that uses a thin plutonium-244 rod to stabilise an exotic nanocompound, designed for small size over everything else."

msgid "A battery that uses a thin plutonium-244 rod to stabilize an exotic nanocompound.  It is universally compatible with all kinds of appliances and power tools.  Although it stores a huge amount of power, it cannot be recharged."
msgstr "A battery that uses a thin plutonium-244 rod to stabilise an exotic nanocompound.  It is universally compatible with all kinds of appliances and power tools.  Although it stores a huge amount of power, it cannot be recharged."

msgid "Active Defense System CBM"
msgid_plural "Active Defense System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Active Defence System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Active Defence System CBMs"

msgid "Small sensors that are implanted in the user's heart, allowing them to analyze their blood.  This will detect many illnesses, drugs, and other conditions."
msgstr "Small sensors that are implanted in the user's heart, allowing them to analyse their blood.  This will detect many illnesses, drugs, and other conditions."

msgid "A complex port that is mounted above the hip.  While active, it will recharge bionic power when connected to a battery via jumper cable."
msgstr "A complex port that is mounted above the hip.  While active, it will recharge bionic power when connected to a battery via jump lead."

msgid "Thin armor made of carbon nanotubes, implanted just beneath the skin.  It reduces cutting, stabbing and ballistic damage."
msgstr "Thin armour made of carbon nanotubes, implanted just beneath the skin.  It reduces cutting, stabbing and ballistic damage."

msgid "A set of small radiation sensors that are implanted throughout the body, allowing the user to analyze their level of absorbed radiation.  They will also alert the user whenever exposed to environmental radiation."
msgstr "A set of small radiation sensors that are implanted throughout the body, allowing the user to analyse their level of absorbed radiation.  They will also alert the user whenever exposed to environmental radiation."

msgid "Offensive Defense System CBM"
msgid_plural "Offensive Defense System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Offensive Defence System CBM"
msgstr[1] "Offensive Defence System CBMs"

msgid "Increases the body's wavelength, allowing the user to quantum tunnel through walls, reappearing on the other side.  Power drain in standby is minimal, but each tile tunneled through costs 250 bionic power."
msgstr "Increases the body's wavelength, allowing the user to quantum tunnel through walls, reappearing on the other side.  Power drain in standby is minimal, but each tile tunnelled through costs 250 bionic power."

msgid "A set of ten double-edged, four centimeter long razor-sharp claws that are implanted underneath the fingernails.  They deal a small amount of unarmed slashing damage whenever the user's fingertips are uncovered."
msgstr "A set of ten double-edged, four centimetre long razor-sharp claws that are implanted underneath the fingernails.  They deal a small amount of unarmed slashing damage whenever the user's fingertips are uncovered."

msgid "Gasoline Fuel Cell CBM"
msgid_plural "Gasoline Fuel Cell CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Petrol Fuel Cell CBM"
msgstr[1] "Petrol Fuel Cell CBMs"

msgid "A small gasoline fuel cell able to convert gasoline to bionic power.  It's connected to a diffuse network of bio-plastic bladders able to hold up to 500 mL of gasoline."
msgstr "A small petrol fuel cell able to convert petrol to bionic power.  It's connected to a diffuse network of bio-plastic bladders able to hold up to 500 mL of petrol."

msgid "While this system is powered, the user's body will produce very little odor, making it nearly impossible for creatures to track them by scent."
msgstr "While this system is powered, the user's body will produce very little odour, making it nearly impossible for creatures to track them by scent."

msgid "A set of myomer fibers that enhance the user's muscular system, granting a +2 bonus to strength."
msgstr "A set of myomer fibres that enhance the user's muscular system, granting a +2 bonus to strength."

msgid "A bionic module that contains rangefinders and synchronizes the movement of the user's eyes with their arms, to a degree.  Shots they fire will be much more accurate, particularly at long ranges."
msgstr "A bionic module that contains rangefinders and synchronises the movement of the user's eyes with their arms, to a degree.  Shots they fire will be much more accurate, particularly at long ranges."

msgid "A set of servomotors installed on the leg joints to provide power-assisted movement.  They are optimized for running, but walking also requires less effort while this bionic is active.  However, when it's offline it will hamper the user's movement."
msgstr "A set of servomotors installed on the leg joints to provide power-assisted movement.  They are optimised for running, but walking also requires less effort while this bionic is active.  However, when it's offline it will hamper the user's movement."

msgid "A set of hinges, springs, and other synthetic augments for the skeletal structure.  These artificial enhancers strengthen the knees and elbows, allowing the user to carry more weight.  The reinforcement also provides 2 bashing armor to the torso, legs and arms."
msgstr "A set of hinges, springs, and other synthetic augments for the skeletal structure.  These artificial enhancers strengthen the knees and elbows, allowing the user to carry more weight.  The reinforcement also provides 2 bashing armour to the torso, legs and arms."

msgid "A set of highly-sensitive sensors implanted in the user's mouth, combined with a sophisticated analyzer.  While active, it will block all unpleasant taste and texture at the cost of bionic energy."
msgstr "A set of highly-sensitive sensors implanted in the user's mouth, combined with a sophisticated analyser.  While active, it will block all unpleasant taste and texture at the cost of bionic energy."

msgid "You can't recognize what this is supposed to be, but you imagine it'd be a very awkward thing to have in one's body."
msgstr "You can't recognise what this is supposed to be, but you imagine it'd be a very awkward thing to have in one's body."

msgid "A CBM that completely shuts down all communication between the user's brain and the rest of their body when they fall asleep, preventing them from waking up under any circumstance until their natural sleep cycle completes.  An inability to trigger its effects manually makes it useless as an anesthesia substitute."
msgstr "A CBM that completely shuts down all communication between the user's brain and the rest of their body when they fall asleep, preventing them from waking up under any circumstance until their natural sleep cycle completes.  An inability to trigger its effects manually makes it useless as an anaesthesia substitute."

msgid "The culmination of decades of research into hominid palaeoanthropology and biomechanical modeling, the throwing assist CBM was brought to market to revolutionize Beqball tournaments, soon becoming exhibitions of cybernetic human effort and engineering.  A network of neurostimulators and sensors, mostly in the arms and hands, work in tandem with the eyes for a significant increase in throwing accuracy and precision.  When the Exodii came upon this cybernetic enhancement suite, they found it to be an economical way to ensure precise grenade placement in partial cyborgs."
msgstr "The culmination of decades of research into hominid palaeoanthropology and biomechanical modelling, the throwing assist CBM was brought to market to revolutionise Beqball tournaments, soon becoming exhibitions of cybernetic human effort and engineering.  A network of neurostimulators and sensors, mostly in the arms and hands, work in tandem with the eyes for a significant increase in throwing accuracy and precision.  When the Exodii came upon this cybernetic enhancement suite, they found it to be an economical way to ensure precise grenade placement in partial cyborgs."

msgid "A fresh cow pie; this could probably be used to make some great fertilizer."
msgstr "A fresh cow pie; this could probably be used to make some great fertiliser."

msgid "Common manure, could probably be used to make some great fertilizer."
msgstr "Common manure, could probably be used to make some great fertiliser."

msgid "The molted dermis of an adult snake.  This one is in one piece.  You can even see the individual eyes."
msgstr "The moulted dermis of an adult snake.  This one is in one piece.  You can even see the individual eyes."

msgid "A variety of powerful hypnotic, analgesic, and stimulative drugs.  It's intended for use in specialized medical equipment, and can't be administered manually.  You can reload an anesthesia kit with it."
msgstr "A variety of powerful hypnotic, analgesic, and stimulative drugs.  It's intended for use in specialised medical equipment, and can't be administered manually.  You can reload an anaesthesia kit with it."

msgid "sulfur"
msgid_plural "sulfur"
msgstr[0] "sulphur"
msgstr[1] "sulphur"

msgid "A handful of pure sulfur.  Primarily used to make battery acid, sulfur is sometimes used as fuel for explosives.  Can be burned to produce acidic smoke that is deadly to bacteria and humans alike, or oxidized to make paper-bleaching agents.  It also serves as a basis for many kinds of fungicide."
msgstr "A handful of pure sulphur.  Primarily used to make battery acid, sulphur is sometimes used as fuel for explosives.  Can be burned to produce acidic smoke that is deadly to bacteria and humans alike, or oxidised to make paper-bleaching agents.  It also serves as a basis for many kinds of fungicide."

msgid "chunk of sulfur"
msgid_plural "chunks of sulfur"
msgstr[0] "chunk of sulphur"
msgstr[1] "chunks of sulphur"

msgid "A chunk of pure sulfur.  Break it up to use it."
msgstr "A chunk of pure sulphur.  Break it up to use it."

msgid " A handful of slaked lime, a white odorless powder with many uses.  Also known as calcium hydroxide."
msgstr " A handful of slaked lime, a white odourless powder with many uses.  Also known as calcium hydroxide."

msgid "liquid fertilizer"
msgid_plural "liquid fertilizer"
msgstr[0] "liquid fertiliser"
msgstr[1] "liquid fertiliser"

msgid "fermented fertilizer liquid"
msgid_plural "fermented fertilizer liquid"
msgstr[0] "fermented fertiliser liquid"
msgstr[1] "fermented fertiliser liquid"

msgid "A mixture of fermented biomass, will become liquid fertilizer after simple treatment."
msgstr "A mixture of fermented biomass, will become liquid fertiliser after simple treatment."

msgid "commercial fertilizer"
msgid_plural "commercial fertilizer"
msgstr[0] "commercial fertiliser"
msgstr[1] "commercial fertiliser"

msgid "aluminum powder"
msgid_plural "aluminum powder"
msgstr[0] "aluminium powder"
msgstr[1] "aluminium powder"

msgid "A handful of finely-ground aluminum powder.  This strong reducing agent was used in combination with various oxidants for chemical welding and explosives alike.  Just before the Cataclysm, however, it was the basis of virtually all commercial metallic-hued paints and anti-corrosive coatings."
msgstr "A handful of finely-ground aluminium powder.  This strong reducing agent was used in combination with various oxidants for chemical welding and explosives alike.  Just before the Cataclysm, however, it was the basis of virtually all commercial metallic-hued paints and anti-corrosive coatings."

msgid "A handful of zinc powder.  While commercially used mostly in cosmetics and for paints, hobbyists used to mix it with sulfur to make basic rocket fuel or a smokescreen.  When treated with a strong acid, it will produce hydrogen."
msgstr "A handful of zinc powder.  While commercially used mostly in cosmetics and for paints, hobbyists used to mix it with sulphur to make basic rocket fuel or a smokescreen.  When treated with a strong acid, it will produce hydrogen."

msgid "A moisturized mixture of zinc chloride and manganese dioxide, slightly acidic.  It can be used in the production of zinc-carbon batteries."
msgstr "A moisturised mixture of zinc chloride and manganese dioxide, slightly acidic.  It can be used in the production of zinc-carbon batteries."

msgid "A handful of dark green crystalline powder, with a weak pungent smell similar to that of hydrochloric acid.  Commonly used as a Lewis acid for catalyzing various chemical reactions."
msgstr "A handful of dark green crystalline powder, with a weak pungent smell similar to that of hydrochloric acid.  Commonly used as a Lewis acid for catalysing various chemical reactions."

msgid "A handful of soft, colorless powder with a sharp pungent odor, also known as butter of antimony.  It's a catalyst for polymerization, hydrocracking, and chlorination reactions, and has some other niche uses."
msgstr "A handful of soft, colourless powder with a sharp pungent odour, also known as butter of antimony.  It's a catalyst for polymerisation, hydrocracking, and chlorination reactions, and has some other niche uses."

msgid "A handful of potassium chloride.  Although it occurs naturally in the mineral sylvite, it can be produced as a byproduct of the reaction of saltpeter and hydrochloric acid.  It can be used for making fertilizer, or potassium hydroxide by way of electrolysis."
msgstr "A handful of potassium chloride.  Although it occurs naturally in the mineral sylvite, it can be produced as a byproduct of the reaction of saltpetre and hydrochloric acid.  It can be used for making fertiliser, or potassium hydroxide by way of electrolysis."

msgid "sulfuric acid"
msgid_plural "sulfuric acid"
msgstr[0] "sulphuric acid"
msgstr[1] "sulphuric acid"

msgid "Sulfuric acid: viscous, foul-smelling and extremely corrosive, particularly to organic matter and evil clowns.  Although used to prepare a number of chemicals, it is mostly known as battery acid, due to its widest commercial application."
msgstr "Sulphuric acid: viscous, foul-smelling and extremely corrosive, particularly to organic matter and evil clowns.  Although used to prepare a number of chemicals, it is mostly known as battery acid, due to its widest commercial application."

msgid "Nitric acid, a strong oxidant and an extremely corrosive material.  Mainly used in the production of synthetic fertilizers, for the etching of circuit boards, and in woodworking.  Remains quite useful both for making a vast array of pyrotechnic and explosive agents and as a direct weapon: not many beings enjoy being doused in nitric acid."
msgstr "Nitric acid, a strong oxidant and an extremely corrosive material.  Mainly used in the production of synthetic fertilisers, for the etching of circuit boards, and in woodworking.  Remains quite useful both for making a vast array of pyrotechnic and explosive agents and as a direct weapon: not many beings enjoy being doused in nitric acid."

msgid "A handful of chromium oxide.  This substance, typically known as the only stable green pigment for paints, is also a mild oxidizer, which can be mixed with aluminum powder to make thermite for welding.  If one had access to a CVD machine and a laboratory worth of reagents, they might be able to produce very durable ceramic layers."
msgstr "A handful of chromium oxide.  This substance, typically known as the only stable green pigment for paints, is also a mild oxidiser, which can be mixed with aluminium powder to make thermite for welding.  If one had access to a CVD machine and a laboratory worth of reagents, they might be able to produce very durable ceramic layers."

msgid "A handful of ammonium nitrate.  This white, crystalline powder is commonly used as a component of fertilizers and explosives.  Could also be dissolved in water to sharply lower its temperature, but is there any use for this quality in this new world?"
msgstr "A handful of ammonium nitrate.  This white, crystalline powder is commonly used as a component of fertilisers and explosives.  Could also be dissolved in water to sharply lower its temperature, but is there any use for this quality in this new world?"

msgid "A handful of ammonium nitrate pellets.  These pellets are commonly used as a component of fertilizers and explosives.  Could also be dissolved in water to sharply lower its temperature, but is there any use for this quality in this new world?"
msgstr "A handful of ammonium nitrate pellets.  These pellets are commonly used as a component of fertilisers and explosives.  Could also be dissolved in water to sharply lower its temperature, but is there any use for this quality in this new world?"

msgid "saltpeter"
msgid_plural "saltpeter"
msgstr[0] "saltpetre"
msgstr[1] "saltpetre"

msgid "A handful of saltpeter.  Sometimes used as a fertilizer, this ubiquitous nitrate is the principal constituent of black gunpowder and simple rocket propellants, such as rocket candy."
msgstr "A handful of saltpetre.  Sometimes used as a fertiliser, this ubiquitous nitrate is the principal constituent of black gunpowder and simple rocket propellants, such as rocket candy."

msgid "niter"
msgid_plural "niter"
msgstr[0] "nitre"
msgstr[1] "nitre"

msgid "A large crystal of niter, the mineral form of potassium nitrate.  It can be processed into saltpeter."
msgstr "A large crystal of nitre, the mineral form of potassium nitrate.  It can be processed into saltpetre."

msgid "aluminum sulfate"
msgid_plural "aluminum sulfate"
msgstr[0] "aluminium sulphate"
msgstr[1] "aluminium sulphate"

msgid "Several crystals of aluminum sulfate.  Historically, an agent for purifying water and as molluscicide, due to the fact that it degenerates their slime.  Just before the Cataclysm, its main uses were for adjusting the acidity of soil and as an additive to baking powder.  If mixed with a strong acid, it could be used to saturate soil with aluminum, causing all but the most resistant of plants to wither and die."
msgstr "Several crystals of aluminium sulphate.  Historically, an agent for purifying water and as molluscicide, due to the fact that it degenerates their slime.  Just before the Cataclysm, its main uses were for adjusting the acidity of soil and as an additive to baking powder.  If mixed with a strong acid, it could be used to saturate soil with aluminium, causing all but the most resistant of plants to wither and die."

msgid "Formaldehyde, here dissolved in water, was widely used before the Cataclysm as a precursor to production of many chemicals and materials and as an embalming agent.  Easily identifiable by its pungent odor.  Terribly toxic, carcinogenic, and volatile."
msgstr "Formaldehyde, here dissolved in water, was widely used before the Cataclysm as a precursor to production of many chemicals and materials and as an embalming agent.  Easily identifiable by its pungent odour.  Terribly toxic, carcinogenic, and volatile."

msgid "A handful of silvery-greenish powder, produced by mixing aluminum and chromium oxide.  This mixture, burning at a constant pace and at extremely high temperature, was once used for on-the-spot welding.  Can be used as an incendiary material in a pinch."
msgstr "A handful of silvery-greenish powder, produced by mixing aluminium and chromium oxide.  This mixture, burning at a constant pace and at extremely high temperature, was once used for on-the-spot welding.  Can be used as an incendiary material in a pinch."

msgid "A handful of black gunpowder, a mix of saltpeter, charcoal, and sulfur.  Pretty useless for making modern cartridges, as the soot produced when it burns will quickly clog any firearm, but it could be used to make some vicious bombs."
msgstr "A handful of black gunpowder, a mix of saltpetre, charcoal, and sulphur.  Pretty useless for making modern cartridges, as the soot produced when it burns will quickly clog any firearm, but it could be used to make some vicious bombs."

msgid "A chunk of a zinc powder-and-sulfur mixture, bound together by superglue, that can be used as an impromptu rocket fuel."
msgstr "A chunk of a zinc powder-and-sulphur mixture, bound together by superglue, that can be used as an impromptu rocket fuel."

msgid "Intended for the clarification and disinfection of unsafe drinking water while camping or traveling, this sodium dichloroisocyanurate-based purification tablet removes dangerous contaminants using powerful chemicals.  The label says to use one tablet per liter (4 units of water)."
msgstr "Intended for the clarification and disinfection of unsafe drinking water while camping or travelling, this sodium dichloroisocyanurate-based purification tablet removes dangerous contaminants using powerful chemicals.  The label says to use one tablet per litre (4 units of water)."

msgid "A useful industrial solvent, and the first inhalative anesthetic in widespread use.  Its uncomfortable side effects and tendency to explode caused it to fall out of favor decades ago in the developed world.  If you can't get the good stuff, however, it might make a passable substitute."
msgstr "A useful industrial solvent, and the first inhalative anaesthetic in widespread use.  Its uncomfortable side effects and tendency to explode caused it to fall out of favour decades ago in the developed world.  If you can't get the good stuff, however, it might make a passable substitute."

msgid "Dimethyl sulfoxide, or DMSO, is a common and important aprotic solvent, capable of dissolving a huge range of things.  It has the unusual property of being absorbed very quickly through the skin, causing a garlic flavor in the mouth, even if it touched your arm."
msgstr "Dimethyl sulfoxide, or DMSO, is a common and important aprotic solvent, capable of dissolving a huge range of things.  It has the unusual property of being absorbed very quickly through the skin, causing a garlic flavour in the mouth, even if it touched your arm."

msgid "A colorless, highly flammable liquid with a sweet odor, one of the elementary petrochemicals.  Being used primarily as a precursor to the manufacture of chemicals with more complex structure, it's a major industrial chemical, but finds limited use in consumer items because of its toxicity."
msgstr "A colourless, highly flammable liquid with a sweet odour, one of the elementary petrochemicals.  Being used primarily as a precursor to the manufacture of chemicals with more complex structure, it's a major industrial chemical, but finds limited use in consumer items because of its toxicity."

msgid "A colorless, toxic, and highly flammable liquid which smells like paint thinner.  It's predominantly used as an industrial feedstock and a solvent, and is also used as an intoxicative inhalant in a manner unintended by manufacturers."
msgstr "A colourless, toxic, and highly flammable liquid which smells like paint thinner.  It's predominantly used as an industrial feedstock and a solvent, and is also used as an intoxicative inhalant in a manner unintended by manufacturers."

msgid "Also called glycerin, this clear, odorless liquid is both a handy skin moisturizer and an ingredient necessary to make dynamite."
msgstr "Also called glycerine, this clear, odourless liquid is both a handy skin moisturiser and an ingredient necessary to make dynamite."

msgid "A handful of highly carcinogenic white powder that can be readily polymerized into a whole bunch of useful water-soluble gels."
msgstr "A handful of highly carcinogenic white powder that can be readily polymerised into a whole bunch of useful water-soluble gels."

msgid "A wooden bead.  It can be used to craft inscribable jewelry or create a beaded curtain door."
msgstr "A wooden bead.  It can be used to craft inscribable jewellery or create a beaded curtain door."

msgid "A grayish, flexible vesicle filled to the brim with the potent paralytic agent the triffids use to subdue still-moving fertilizer such as yourself.  If you know your way around poisons you might be able to find a use for it."
msgstr "A greyish, flexible vesicle filled to the brim with the potent paralytic agent the triffids use to subdue still-moving fertiliser such as yourself.  If you know your way around poisons you might be able to find a use for it."

msgid "Rocuronium bromide, a fast-acting muscle relaxant.  Used primarily in emergency medicine because of its relative stability, it can serve as a component of a balanced anesthesia in a pinch."
msgstr "Rocuronium bromide, a fast-acting muscle relaxant.  Used primarily in emergency medicine because of its relative stability, it can serve as a component of a balanced anaesthesia in a pinch."

msgid "A colorless liquid that smells strongly of vinegar.  If you have enough chemical knowledge, you could use it to easily convert morphine into heroin."
msgstr "A colourless liquid that smells strongly of vinegar.  If you have enough chemical knowledge, you could use it to easily convert morphine into heroin."

msgid "A thick gray paste used as a sealant in many construction projects."
msgstr "A thick grey paste used as a sealant in many construction projects."

msgid "The tank drone swivels its turret and aims directly at you.  Don your brown pants!"
msgstr "The tank drone swivels its turret and aims directly at you.  Don your brown trousers!"

msgid "The chicken bot swivels its turret and aims directly at you.  Don your brown pants!"
msgstr "The chicken bot swivels its turret and aims directly at you.  Don your brown trousers!"

msgid "A heavily modified handheld nuclear device on a rocket.  Intended to be fired from a specialized launcher, it has been rigged to explode on impact instead of on a timer.  It can fly further than the explosion will reach, probably."
msgstr "A heavily modified handheld nuclear device on a rocket.  Intended to be fired from a specialised launcher, it has been rigged to explode on impact instead of on a timer.  It can fly further than the explosion will reach, probably."

msgid "smoldering embers"
msgid_plural "smoldering embers"
msgstr[0] "smouldering embers"
msgstr[1] "smouldering embers"

msgid "A handful of smoldering embers emitting smoke.  They are fading away before your eyes."
msgstr "A handful of smouldering embers emitting smoke.  They are fading away before your eyes."

msgid "tire changer"
msgid_plural "tire changers"
msgstr[0] "tyre changer"
msgstr[1] "tyre changers"

msgid "Not really a set, just a sheet of paper with a big '#' drawn at the center, alongside three buttons of a specific color, three others from a different color and a proper container for storing it properly.  You can play tic tac toe indefinitely with that!"
msgstr "Not really a set, just a sheet of paper with a big '#' drawn at the centre, alongside three buttons of a specific colour, three others from a different colour and a proper container for storing it properly.  You can play tic tac toe indefinitely with that!"

msgid "compact checkerboard"
msgid_plural "compact checkerboards"
msgstr[0] "compact chequerboard"
msgstr[1] "compact chequerboards"

msgid "A pair of smaller checkered wooden boards that together form a compact checkerboard.  Useful as timber or for crafting a smaller chess or checkers board."
msgstr "A pair of smaller chequered wooden boards that together form a compact chequerboard.  Useful as timber or for crafting a smaller chess or checkers board."

msgid "A modest wooden box containing a square base, two small triangles, two large triangles, a parallelogram, and a rhombus, all painted in different colors to play the traditional Chinese puzzle of tangram.  At the box, there are several figures that you can make with the pieces."
msgstr "A modest wooden box containing a square base, two small triangles, two large triangles, a parallelogram, and a rhombus, all painted in different colours to play the traditional Chinese puzzle of tangram.  At the box, there are several figures that you can make with the pieces."

msgid "A somewhat large wooden box containing a rectangular wooden board with a series of small pits, as well as a number of game pieces that look like different colored beads.  The board features two rows of pits, with each player controlling the row of pits closest to them.  The game pieces are distributed evenly among the pits at the beginning of the game, and players take turns picking up and redistributing the pieces according to the rules.  In the box, there's a comprehensible step-by-step guide on how to play."
msgstr "A somewhat large wooden box containing a rectangular wooden board with a series of small pits, as well as a number of game pieces that look like different coloured beads.  The board features two rows of pits, with each player controlling the row of pits closest to them.  The game pieces are distributed evenly among the pits at the beginning of the game, and players take turns picking up and redistributing the pieces according to the rules.  In the box, there's a comprehensible step-by-step guide on how to play."

msgid "A cardboard box containing a plastic grid with seven columns and six rows, and 42 colored discs, alongside a small booklet explaining how to play Four in a Row."
msgstr "A cardboard box containing a plastic grid with seven columns and six rows, and 42 coloured discs, alongside a small booklet explaining how to play Four in a Row."

msgid "A piece of paper scribbled with a pattern identical to the checkerboard on a, well, checkerboard, along with all the necessary pieces and a container to store everything properly inside."
msgstr "A piece of paper scribbled with a pattern identical to the chequerboard on a, well, chequerboard, along with all the necessary pieces and a container to store everything properly inside."

msgid "A fun strategy board game where players (or just a player, since you can play this alone as a solitaire board game) attempt to improve their farms by plowing fields, sowing crops, raising livestock, and expanding their families.  The game is set in the European farming community during the 17th century."
msgstr "A fun strategy board game where players (or just a player, since you can play this alone as a solitaire board game) attempt to improve their farms by ploughing fields, sowing crops, raising livestock, and expanding their families.  The game is set in the European farming community during the 17th century."

msgid "A highly strategic board game that combines elements of role-playing games with deck-building and traditional board game mechanics.  Players (or a solo player) take on the roles of powerful Knights Mages who explore the land, conquer cities, and engage in epic battles against various enemies.  The game features an intricate leveling system where players can enhance their characters' abilities and acquire new skills as they progress through the game."
msgstr "A highly strategic board game that combines elements of role-playing games with deck-building and traditional board game mechanics.  Players (or a solo player) take on the roles of powerful Knights Mages who explore the land, conquer cities, and engage in epic battles against various enemies.  The game features an intricate levelling system where players can enhance their characters' abilities and acquire new skills as they progress through the game."

msgid "A cooperative board game designed for 1-4 players, where each player takes on the role of a powerful deity defending an island from colonizing invaders.  Before the Cataclysm, inside the board gaming community, it was known for its deep strategic gameplay, thematic richness, and intricate mechanics."
msgstr "A cooperative board game designed for 1-4 players, where each player takes on the role of a powerful deity defending an island from colonising invaders.  Before the Cataclysm, inside the board gaming community, it was known for its deep strategic gameplay, thematic richness, and intricate mechanics."

msgid "The largest edition of Terraforming, this epic board game is set in the 5000s, where players (or just the player) take on the role of corporations competing to terraform and colonize the gas giant Jupiter and its moons (the Jovian System).  This game combines elements of strategy, resource management, and exploration as players work to transform the hostile environment of the Jovian System into a habitable zone for human civilization."
msgstr "The largest edition of Terraforming, this epic board game is set in the 5000s, where players (or just the player) take on the role of corporations competing to terraform and colonise the gas giant Jupiter and its moons (the Jovian System).  This game combines elements of strategy, resource management, and exploration as players work to transform the hostile environment of the Jovian System into a habitable zone for human civilisation."

msgid "This board game is set in the 4600s, and there, the player or the players take on the role of corporations competing to terraform and/or colonize Saturn's moons, rings and Saturn itself, to make them habitable for human life.  The game combines elements of strategy, resource management, and area control, offering an immersive experience for players."
msgstr "This board game is set in the 4600s, and there, the player or the players take on the role of corporations competing to terraform and/or colonise Saturn's moons, rings and Saturn itself, to make them habitable for human life.  The game combines elements of strategy, resource management, and area control, offering an immersive experience for players."

msgid "The smallest set of the Terraforming series, this board game is set in the 2700s in the outer reaches of our solar system.  In this game, players take on the roles of corporations competing to terraform and colonize the dwarf planet Pluto, utilizing resources, technology, and strategic decision-making to transform the icy world into a habitable environment."
msgstr "The smallest set of the Terraforming series, this board game is set in the 2700s in the outer reaches of our solar system.  In this game, players take on the roles of corporations competing to terraform and colonise the dwarf planet Pluto, utilising resources, technology, and strategic decision-making to transform the icy world into a habitable environment."

msgid "A fun strategy board game that simulates the experience of running a vineyard in Tuscany, Italy.  Players take on the roles of vineyard owners who must plant vines, harvest grapes, produce wine, and fulfill orders to earn victory points.  The game is played over several seasons, with players making strategic decisions about which actions to take each season to maximize their vineyard's productivity and efficiency."
msgstr "A fun strategy board game that simulates the experience of running a vineyard in Tuscany, Italy.  Players take on the roles of vineyard owners who must plant vines, harvest grapes, produce wine, and fulfil orders to earn victory points.  The game is played over several seasons, with players making strategic decisions about which actions to take each season to maximise their vineyard's productivity and efficiency."

msgid "In this great strategy board game, players (or the player) assume the role of a Viking chieftain, aiming to expand their territory, amass wealth, and gain favor with the Norse gods.  Players take turns performing actions, such as exploring new territories, constructing buildings, raiding settlements, and trading goods."
msgstr "In this great strategy board game, players (or the player) assume the role of a Viking chieftain, aiming to expand their territory, amass wealth, and gain favour with the Norse gods.  Players take turns performing actions, such as exploring new territories, constructing buildings, raiding settlements, and trading goods."

msgid "A great cooperation-focused fantasy board game set in a dark and evolving fantasy world where players take on the roles of mercenaries seeking fortune and glory in the city of Emporium and its surrounding areas.  This game is characterized by its legacy-style gameplay, which means that decisions made during one play session can have lasting effects on future sessions.  Players must work together to explore dungeons, battle monsters, complete quests, and make choices that shape the narrative and outcome of their campaign."
msgstr "A great cooperation-focused fantasy board game set in a dark and evolving fantasy world where players take on the roles of mercenaries seeking fortune and glory in the city of Emporium and its surrounding areas.  This game is characterised by its legacy-style gameplay, which means that decisions made during one play session can have lasting effects on future sessions.  Players must work together to explore dungeons, battle monsters, complete quests, and make choices that shape the narrative and outcome of their campaign."

msgid "A strategy board game where players (or the player) aim to amass wealth and construct buildings to expand their harbors while carefully managing their resources in the fictitious French region of Le Pourt.  This game involves strategic decision-making as players must balance their investments in buildings, ships, and resources to maximize their profits."
msgstr "A strategy board game where players (or the player) aim to amass wealth and construct buildings to expand their harbours while carefully managing their resources in the fictitious French region of Le Pourt.  This game involves strategic decision-making as players must balance their investments in buildings, ships, and resources to maximise their profits."

msgid "A strategic board game that simulates the rise and fall of nations.  A great civilization-building game designed for 1-4 players.  Each player takes on the role of leading an ancient civilization, making strategic decisions to develop their nation over the course of several ages.  This game involves managing resources, constructing buildings, and competing with other players to achieve dominance in various aspects such as military strength, culture, and economy."
msgstr "A strategic board game that simulates the rise and fall of nations.  A great civilisation-building game designed for 1-4 players.  Each player takes on the role of leading an ancient civilisation, making strategic decisions to develop their nation over the course of several ages.  This game involves managing resources, constructing buildings, and competing with other players to achieve dominance in various aspects such as military strength, culture, and economy."

msgid "A cardboard tube containing 60 pieces in various colors for playing a casual pick-up sticks game alone or with friends.  The rules and different values of each color are printed on the tube."
msgstr "A cardboard tube containing 60 pieces in various colours for playing a casual pick-up sticks game alone or with friends.  The rules and different values of each colour are printed on the tube."

msgid ""
"A sturdy steel briefcase, containing what appears to be an old-fashioned drum seismograph.  The stenciled acronyms of its outer case imply it was used by XEDRA as some sort of recording device.\n"
"\n"
"Thin parallel lines cover both ends of the drum, but as they approach the middle their vibrations intensify, until the ink fuses into a thick red stain."
msgstr ""
"A sturdy steel briefcase, containing what appears to be an old-fashioned drum seismograph.  The stencilled acronyms of its outer case imply it was used by XEDRA as some sort of recording device.\n"
"\n"
"Thin parallel lines cover both ends of the drum, but as they approach the middle their vibrations intensify, until the ink fuses into a thick red stain."

msgid "A piece of canvas on a collapsible aluminum frame.  Used to catch bugs or fish, but might not be as useful for the mutated ones.  It must be extended to use."
msgstr "A piece of canvas on a collapsible aluminium frame.  Used to catch bugs or fish, but might not be as useful for the mutated ones.  It must be extended to use."

msgid "A piece of canvas on a collapsible aluminum frame.  Used to catch bugs or fish, but might not be as useful for the mutated ones."
msgstr "A piece of canvas on a collapsible aluminium frame.  Used to catch bugs or fish, but might not be as useful for the mutated ones."

msgid "A petroleum-based fuel made from a byproduct of the gasoline making process."
msgstr "A petroleum-based fuel made from a byproduct of the petrol making process."

msgid "A specialized type of petroleum-based fuel used to power aircraft."
msgstr "A specialised type of petroleum-based fuel used to power aircraft."

msgid "A thick black slurry that can be refined to produce usable products including gasoline or diesel."
msgstr "A thick black slurry that can be refined to produce usable products including petrol or diesel."

msgid "Gasoline mixed with some other components to make it stick to surfaces and increase burning temperature, meant to be used as flamethrower fuel."
msgstr "Petrol mixed with some other components to make it stick to surfaces and increase burning temperature, meant to be used as flamethrower fuel."

msgid "gelled gasoline"
msgid_plural "gelled gasoline"
msgstr[0] "gelled petrol"
msgstr[1] "gelled petrol"

msgid "A flammable gel composed of gasoline and dissolved shavings of polystyrene, roughly similar in properties to napalm B.  It's meant to be used as flamethrower fuel."
msgstr "A flammable gel composed of petrol and dissolved shavings of polystyrene, roughly similar in properties to napalm B.  It's meant to be used as flamethrower fuel."

msgid "A mixture of gasoline and diesel oil in equal parts.  Its combustion properties make it unfit for applications where you would use any of them separately, but it can be used to feed a flamethrower."
msgstr "A mixture of petrol and diesel oil in equal parts.  Its combustion properties make it unfit for applications where you would use any of them separately, but it can be used to feed a flamethrower."

msgid "ANOMALOUS ARTIFACT REPORT"
msgid_plural "ANOMALOUS ARTIFACT REPORT"
msgstr[0] "ANOMALOUS ARTEFACT REPORT"
msgstr[1] "ANOMALOUS ARTEFACT REPORT"

msgid "A sequence of overlapping numbers plotted in thermal paper, at times so densely-packed that they disappear into thick blots of oxide-colored ink.  A few number sequences repeat in an almost orderly fashion, but you can't tell whether that means anything."
msgstr "A sequence of overlapping numbers plotted in thermal paper, at times so densely-packed that they disappear into thick blots of oxide-coloured ink.  A few number sequences repeat in an almost orderly fashion, but you can't tell whether that means anything."

msgid "A long sequence of overlapping numbers plotted in thermal paper, at times so densely-packed that they disappear into thick blots of oxide-colored ink.  The blots and numbers are arranged in a strangely pleasing pattern."
msgstr "A long sequence of overlapping numbers plotted in thermal paper, at times so densely-packed that they disappear into thick blots of oxide-coloured ink.  The blots and numbers are arranged in a strangely pleasing pattern."

msgid "A long sequence of overlapping numbers plotted in thermal paper, at times so densely-packed that they disappear into thick blots of oxide-colored ink.  The printed values increased along rhythmical waves, but the number 5 is always skipped."
msgstr "A long sequence of overlapping numbers plotted in thermal paper, at times so densely-packed that they disappear into thick blots of oxide-coloured ink.  The printed values increased along rhythmical waves, but the number 5 is always skipped."

msgid "Cyanoacrylate, more commonly known as superglue, is a strong, quick curing glue with many applications.  It was a favorite of many post-Cataclysm hobbyists, but has become a sought-after trade good due to its wide applications, and the fact it has become essentially impossible to manufacture."
msgstr "Cyanoacrylate, more commonly known as superglue, is a strong, quick curing glue with many applications.  It was a favourite of many post-Cataclysm hobbyists, but has become a sought-after trade good due to its wide applications, and the fact it has become essentially impossible to manufacture."

msgid "fertilizer"
msgid_plural "fertilizers"
msgstr[0] "fertiliser"
msgstr[1] "fertilisers"

msgid "A token representing fertilization of a plant."
msgstr "A token representing fertilisation of a plant."

msgid "An unopened biollante flower, brilliant purple in color.  It may still have its sap-producing organ intact."
msgstr "An unopened biollante flower, brilliant purple in colour.  It may still have its sap-producing organ intact."

msgid "A heavy and very durable protective case made of steel and thick plastic, locked with a six-dial combination.  A sticker with the logo of DARPA is attached to the front, but looking at the surface, you can see that another marking - formerly stenciled into the material - was recently and hastily destroyed."
msgstr "A heavy and very durable protective case made of steel and thick plastic, locked with a six-dial combination.  A sticker with the logo of DARPA is attached to the front, but looking at the surface, you can see that another marking - formerly stencilled into the material - was recently and hastily destroyed."

msgid "A motorized pushmower that seems to be broken.  You could take it apart if you had a wrench."
msgstr "A motorised pushmower that seems to be broken.  You could take it apart if you had a wrench."

msgid "broken lab defense bot"
msgid_plural "broken lab defense bots"
msgstr[0] "broken lab defence bot"
msgstr[1] "broken lab defence bots"

msgid "A broken lab defense bot, with its casing broken and fluid drained.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "A broken lab defence bot, with its casing broken and fluid drained.  Could be gutted for parts."

msgid "A state-of-the-art optical storage system, containing the instruction set required for the fabrication of advanced armor materials.  This seems to just be routines for working with the materials, not actual armor schematics."
msgstr "A state-of-the-art optical storage system, containing the instruction set required for the fabrication of advanced armour materials.  This seems to just be routines for working with the materials, not actual armour schematics."

msgid "ceramic armor plate"
msgid_plural "ceramic armor plates"
msgstr[0] "ceramic armour plate"
msgstr[1] "ceramic armour plates"

msgid "A ceramic armor plate, specifically engineered for use as armor.  Not suitable for human use."
msgstr "A ceramic armour plate, specifically engineered for use as armour.  Not suitable for human use."

msgid "Some cooked rice mixed with yeast and koji mold fragments, set aside to let koji mold grow on it so that it can make a passable sake base."
msgstr "Some cooked rice mixed with yeast and koji mould fragments, set aside to let koji mould grow on it so that it can make a passable sake base."

msgid "The koji mold seems to have overtaken all the rice; this batch is usable now."
msgstr "The koji mould seems to have overtaken all the rice; this batch is usable now."

msgid "The koji mold is still growing."
msgstr "The koji mould is still growing."

msgid "Some rice covered in koji mold, mixed in with yeast.  Useful for making sake, but not really tasty on its own.  Smells vaguely of chestnuts."
msgstr "Some rice covered in koji mould, mixed in with yeast.  Useful for making sake, but not really tasty on its own.  Smells vaguely of chestnuts."

msgid "growing wild koji mold"
msgid_plural "growing wild koji mold"
msgstr[0] "growing wild koji mould"
msgstr[1] "growing wild koji mould"

msgid "Some cooked rice sprinkled with ash and wrapped into a corn husk.  If left alone for a while, it will most likely grow koji mold."
msgstr "Some cooked rice sprinkled with ash and wrapped into a corn husk.  If left alone for a while, it will most likely grow koji mould."

msgid "Patches of koji mold have grown on the rice; you can now extract it."
msgstr "Patches of koji mould have grown on the rice; you can now extract it."

msgid "The koji mold hasn't grown yet."
msgstr "The koji mould hasn't grown yet."

msgid "grown wild koji mold"
msgid_plural "grown wild koji mold"
msgstr[0] "grown wild koji mould"
msgstr[1] "grown wild koji mould"

msgid "Some cooked rice sprinkled with ash and wrapped into a corn husk.  It has grown patches of koji mold inside; disassemble this item to extract it."
msgstr "Some cooked rice sprinkled with ash and wrapped into a corn husk.  It has grown patches of koji mould inside; disassemble this item to extract it."

msgid "Dough made from cooked and mashed soybeans and wheat flour, wrapped in wet paper.  If left to dry for some time, it'll grow koji mold, as necessary for making soy sauce."
msgstr "Dough made from cooked and mashed soybeans and wheat flour, wrapped in wet paper.  If left to dry for some time, it'll grow koji mould, as necessary for making soy sauce."

msgid "The koji mold seems to have overtaken all the dough; this batch is usable now."
msgstr "The koji mould seems to have overtaken all the dough; this batch is usable now."

msgid "A block of dried dough made from cooked and mashed soybeans and wheat flour, covered with koji mold.  Usable for making soy sauce."
msgstr "A block of dried dough made from cooked and mashed soybeans and wheat flour, covered with koji mould.  Usable for making soy sauce."

msgid "A compacted mass of soil and natural fibers, still too wet to build with.  Load it onto a pallet and leave it to dry."
msgstr "A compacted mass of soil and natural fibres, still too wet to build with.  Load it onto a pallet and leave it to dry."

msgid "A compacted mass of soil and natural fibers, baked dry enough to harden into a brick."
msgstr "A compacted mass of soil and natural fibres, baked dry enough to harden into a brick."

msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of an aircraft carrier drawn on both sides.  The one on the back is stripped of its armor plating, how naughty.  It is rolled for compact storage and transportation.  You will automatically unroll it when you place it for sleeping."
msgstr "A big, body-sized pillow with a print of an aircraft carrier drawn on both sides.  The one on the back is stripped of its armour plating, how naughty.  It is rolled for compact storage and transportation.  You will automatically unroll it when you place it for sleeping."

msgid "A big, body-sized pillow with an anime-style print of Bear Grillings, Ultimate Survivor on both sides.  On one side he's holding a pneumatic air rifle, and on the other he is clad in nothing but duct tape.  The pillow is stylized to look like Kevlar.  It is rolled for compact storage and transportation.  You will automatically unroll it when you place it for sleeping."
msgstr "A big, body-sized pillow with an anime-style print of Bear Grillings, Ultimate Survivor on both sides.  On one side he's holding a pneumatic air rifle, and on the other he is clad in nothing but duct tape.  The pillow is stylised to look like Kevlar.  It is rolled for compact storage and transportation.  You will automatically unroll it when you place it for sleeping."

msgid "The smoke billowing from this cigar has a sweet, musty odor."
msgstr "The smoke billowing from this cigar has a sweet, musty odour."

msgid "A psychoactive plant indigenous to Central Asia and the Indian subcontinent traditionally cultivated for its fiber, oil, for medicinal purposes, and for use as a recreational drug.  It requires further processing to be useful."
msgstr "A psychoactive plant indigenous to Central Asia and the Indian subcontinent traditionally cultivated for its fibre, oil, for medicinal purposes, and for use as a recreational drug.  It requires further processing to be useful."

msgid "This card gives you a little discount on the purchase of gasoline."
msgstr "This card gives you a little discount on the purchase of petrol."

msgid "This card gives you a good discount on the purchase of gasoline."
msgstr "This card gives you a good discount on the purchase of petrol."

msgid "This card gives you a splendid discount on the purchase of gasoline."
msgstr "This card gives you a splendid discount on the purchase of petrol."

msgid "An armor plate made of very thick steel, specifically engineered for use in a bullet-resistant vest."
msgstr "An armour plate made of very thick steel, specifically engineered for use in a bullet-resistant vest."

msgid "A steel armor plate, specifically engineered for use in a bullet-resistant vest."
msgstr "A steel armour plate, specifically engineered for use in a bullet-resistant vest."

msgid "spare tire carrier"
msgid_plural "spare tire carriers"
msgstr[0] "spare tyre carrier"
msgstr[1] "spare tyre carriers"

msgid "A bumper-mounted rig for attaching and storing a spare tire on the back of a vehicle.  Combine it with a wheel to get a mountable piece."
msgstr "A bumper-mounted rig for attaching and storing a spare tyre on the back of a vehicle.  Combine it with a wheel to get a mountable piece."

msgid "A hand-made humanoid figure, useful for training in close quarters combat.  This one is covered in scrap armor and looks on guard.  Use the construction menu (* by default) to embed it into the ground for training."
msgstr "A hand-made humanoid figure, useful for training in close quarters combat.  This one is covered in scrap armour and looks on guard.  Use the construction menu (* by default) to embed it into the ground for training."

msgid "Maintenance: ocher zone badge"
msgid_plural "Maintenance: ocher zone badges"
msgstr[0] "Maintenance: ochre zone badge"
msgstr[1] "Maintenance: ochre zone badges"

msgid "An employee badge for a maintenance worker.  The reverse side describes the protocol for using it; this could grant access at ocher zone card readers."
msgstr "An employee badge for a maintenance worker.  The reverse side describes the protocol for using it; this could grant access at ochre zone card readers."

msgid "A slurry of tranquility."
msgstr "A slurry of tranquillity."

msgid "A colorfully-printed score card."
msgstr "A colourfully-printed score card."

msgid "Posters promoting movies that were in theaters when the Cataclysm hit."
msgstr "Posters promoting movies that were in theatres when the Cataclysm hit."

msgid "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armor of a police bot."
msgstr "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armour of a police bot."

msgid "Extremely compressed research data, observation and experiment statistics.  The only pattern you manage to recognize is an increase in the amount of report closer to the Cataclysm, but also a reduction in the number of facilities still submitting reports."
msgstr "Extremely compressed research data, observation and experiment statistics.  The only pattern you manage to recognise is an increase in the amount of report closer to the Cataclysm, but also a reduction in the number of facilities still submitting reports."

msgid "recipe catalog"
msgid_plural "recipe catalogs"
msgstr[0] "recipe catalogue"
msgstr[1] "recipe catalogues"

msgid "This is a filtered collection of PDFs, images, and texts that contains instructions for making useful items.  Any electronic recipe catalogs will be added to this one."
msgstr "This is a filtered collection of PDFs, images, and texts that contains instructions for making useful items.  Any electronic recipe catalogues will be added to this one."

msgid "scientific recipe catalog"
msgid_plural "scientific recipe catalogs"
msgstr[0] "scientific recipe catalogue"
msgstr[1] "scientific recipe catalogues"

msgid "medical recipe catalog"
msgid_plural "medical recipe catalogs"
msgstr[0] "medical recipe catalogue"
msgstr[1] "medical recipe catalogues"

msgid "A plastic mask with a very dark visor, meant to protect the entire face while welding.  It also serves as somewhat good armor, but makes it hard to see.  Activate it to push it up your head."
msgstr "A plastic mask with a very dark visor, meant to protect the entire face while welding.  It also serves as somewhat good armour, but makes it hard to see.  Activate it to push it up your head."

msgid "A plastic mask with a very dark visor, meant to protect the entire face while welding.  It also serves as somewhat good armor, but makes it hard to see.  Activate it to lower it over your face."
msgstr "A plastic mask with a very dark visor, meant to protect the entire face while welding.  It also serves as somewhat good armour, but makes it hard to see.  Activate it to lower it over your face."

msgid "A cloak woven with metallic fibers and covered with hexagonal sheets of reflective carbide.  When activated, it will create a holographic decoy of its wearer."
msgstr "A cloak woven with metallic fibres and covered with hexagonal sheets of reflective carbide.  When activated, it will create a holographic decoy of its wearer."

msgid "A high-crowned, wide-brimmed, sable-colored fedora.  Its brim helps keep the sun out of your eyes.  The perfect hat for treasure hunting."
msgstr "A high-crowned, wide-brimmed, sable-coloured fedora.  Its brim helps keep the sun out of your eyes.  The perfect hat for treasure hunting."

msgid "A 35 mm digital SLR (single-lens reflex) camera with optical and digital viewfinders, a zoom lens with auto-focus and stabilizer, and flash.  You can view your photos on it or transfer them with a memory card.  Before the Cataclysm, you could have taken professional-grade photos using this.  This one can be worn over your neck."
msgstr "A 35 mm digital SLR (single-lens reflex) camera with optical and digital viewfinders, a zoom lens with auto-focus and stabiliser, and flash.  You can view your photos on it or transfer them with a memory card.  Before the Cataclysm, you could have taken professional-grade photos using this.  This one can be worn over your neck."

msgid "An armored, electronically-shielded helmet containing a camera, a two-way radio, and a headlamp, all of which can be voice-activated for redundancy.  It is designed to protect against overpressure, fragmentation, impact, and heat."
msgstr "An armoured, electronically-shielded helmet containing a camera, a two-way radio, and a headlamp, all of which can be voice-activated for redundancy.  It is designed to protect against overpressure, fragmentation, impact, and heat."

msgid "RM13 combat armor"
msgid_plural "RM13 combat armors"
msgstr[0] "RM13 combat armour"
msgstr[1] "RM13 combat armours"

msgid "A full-body suit of sleek black military armor that represents the pinnacle of Rivtech's powered armor technology.  It has a proprietary internal battery recharged by UPS.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "A full-body suit of sleek black military armour that represents the pinnacle of Rivtech's powered armour technology.  It has a proprietary internal battery recharged by UPS.  Use it to turn it on."

msgid ""
"You activate your RM13 combat armor.\n"
"Rivtech Model 13 RivOS v2.19:   ONLINE.\n"
"CBRN defense system:            ONLINE.\n"
"Acoustic dampening system:      ONLINE.\n"
"Thermal regulation system:      ONLINE.\n"
"Vision enhancement system:      ONLINE.\n"
"Electro-reactive armor system:  ONLINE.\n"
"All systems nominal."
msgstr ""
"You activate your RM13 combat armour.\n"
"Rivtech Model 13 RivOS v2.19:   ONLINE.\n"
"CBRN defence system:            ONLINE.\n"
"Acoustic dampening system:      ONLINE.\n"
"Thermal regulation system:      ONLINE.\n"
"Vision enhancement system:      ONLINE.\n"
"Electro-reactive armour system:  ONLINE.\n"
"All systems nominal."

msgid "The RM13 combat armor's battery is dead."
msgstr "The RM13 combat armour's battery is dead."

msgid "RM13 combat armor (on)"
msgid_plural "RM13 combat armors (on)"
msgstr[0] "RM13 combat armour (on)"
msgstr[1] "RM13 combat armours (on)"

msgid "A full-body suit of sleek black military armor that represents the pinnacle of Rivtech's powered armor technology.  As you move your fingers over the surface, the armor tenses, almost as though it were alive.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "A full-body suit of sleek black military armour that represents the pinnacle of Rivtech's powered armour technology.  As you move your fingers over the surface, the armour tenses, almost as though it were alive.  Use it to turn it off."

msgid ""
"You deactivate your RM13 combat armor.\n"
"RivOS v2.19 shutdown sequence initiated.\n"
"Shutting down.\n"
"Your RM13 combat armor turns off."
msgstr ""
"You deactivate your RM13 combat armour.\n"
"RivOS v2.19 shutdown sequence initiated.\n"
"Shutting down.\n"
"Your RM13 combat armour turns off."

msgid "Covered in interlocking plates of reflective metal, this advanced suit resembles both plate armor and an astronaut's spacesuit.  Designed to protect its wearer during extradimensional excursions, it offers unparalleled environmental protection, both in this Earth and beyond.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "Covered in interlocking plates of reflective metal, this advanced suit resembles both plate armour and an astronaut's spacesuit.  Designed to protect its wearer during extradimensional excursions, it offers unparalleled environmental protection, both in this Earth and beyond.  Use it to turn it on."

msgid "Covered in interlocking plates of reflective metal, this advanced suit resembles both plate armor and an astronaut's spacesuit.  It is turned on, and continually draining power.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "Covered in interlocking plates of reflective metal, this advanced suit resembles both plate armour and an astronaut's spacesuit.  It is turned on, and continually draining power.  Use it to turn it off."

msgid "A custom-built, armored rebreather mask that covers the face and eyes.  Provides excellent protection from harm as well providing breathing gas while underwater.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "A custom-built, armoured rebreather mask that covers the face and eyes.  Provides excellent protection from harm as well providing breathing gas while underwater.  Use it to turn it on."

msgid "A custom-built, armored rebreather mask that covers the face and eyes.  Provides excellent protection from harm as well providing breathing gas while underwater.  It is turned on, and continually consuming its filter.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "A custom-built, armoured rebreather mask that covers the face and eyes.  Provides excellent protection from harm as well providing breathing gas while underwater.  It is turned on, and continually consuming its filter.  Use it to turn it off."

msgid "A custom-built, armored rebreather mask that covers the face and eyes regardless of your state of mutation.  Provides excellent protection from harm as well providing breathing gas while underwater.  It is turned on, and continually consuming its filter.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "A custom-built, armoured rebreather mask that covers the face and eyes regardless of your state of mutation.  Provides excellent protection from harm as well providing breathing gas while underwater.  It is turned on, and continually consuming its filter.  Use it to turn it off."

msgid "A tasteful wool turtleneck, modeled after cashmere.  Unencumbering and warm, but lacking storage."
msgstr "A tasteful wool turtleneck, modelled after cashmere.  Unencumbering and warm, but lacking storage."

msgid "A pair of earmuffs favored by shooters.  Without batteries or when turned off, they function like normal earmuffs and block all sound.  They will only block sounds over a certain decibel amount when turned on, to protect your ears from injury while otherwise allowing you to hear normally.  The earmuffs are currently off."
msgstr "A pair of earmuffs favoured by shooters.  Without batteries or when turned off, they function like normal earmuffs and block all sound.  They will only block sounds over a certain decibel amount when turned on, to protect your ears from injury while otherwise allowing you to hear normally.  The earmuffs are currently off."

msgid "A pair of earmuffs favored by shooters.  The earmuffs are turned on, and will block sounds over a certain decibel amount while otherwise allowing you to hear normally."
msgstr "A pair of earmuffs favoured by shooters.  The earmuffs are turned on, and will block sounds over a certain decibel amount while otherwise allowing you to hear normally."

msgid "A skeletal frame of sturdy metal with attached motors to allow the user to move heavier loads with less strain on the body.  This model uses a compact internal combustion engine for power.  It is turned on and continually draining gasoline.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "A skeletal frame of sturdy metal with attached motors to allow the user to move heavier loads with less strain on the body.  This model uses a compact internal combustion engine for power.  It is turned on and continually draining petrol.  Use it to turn it off."

msgid "A mass-produced plush teddy bear.  It is wearing a little red t-shirt but no pants."
msgstr "A mass-produced plush teddy bear.  It is wearing a little red t-shirt but no trousers."

msgid "A mass-produced plush black teddy bear with a mark in its face that looks like a pair of white glasses or a white bandit mask.  It is wearing a little white t-shirt and a pajama hat, but no pants."
msgstr "A mass-produced plush black teddy bear with a mark in its face that looks like a pair of white glasses or a white bandit mask.  It is wearing a little white t-shirt and a pyjama hat, but no trousers."

msgid "A mass-produced plush panda teddy bear.  It is wearing a little gray t-shirt, but no pants."
msgstr "A mass-produced plush panda teddy bear.  It is wearing a little grey t-shirt, but no trousers."

msgid "A cuddly seal plushie with soft, grayish fur and big, soulful eyes.  It features a realistic texture that mimics the soft and textural quality of real seals' fur."
msgstr "A cuddly seal plushie with soft, greyish fur and big, soulful eyes.  It features a realistic texture that mimics the soft and textural quality of real seals' fur."

msgid "A plushie with soft, black-gray-and-white fur and a curious expression with its iconic bandit mask.  It has a special feature that makes its tails emerge from its hiding spot in the toy, reminiscent of one of the raccoon's greatest attributes."
msgstr "A plushie with soft, black-grey-and-white fur and a curious expression with its iconic bandit mask.  It has a special feature that makes its tails emerge from its hiding spot in the toy, reminiscent of one of the raccoon's greatest attributes."

msgid "A cute and colorful gecko plushie with soft, vibrant skin and big, playful eyes.  This plushie has a special cotton-based internal mechanism that makes its tail wiggle and move playfully when squeezed enough, just like a real lizard's tail."
msgstr "A cute and colourful gecko plushie with soft, vibrant skin and big, playful eyes.  This plushie has a special cotton-based internal mechanism that makes its tail wiggle and move playfully when squeezed enough, just like a real lizard's tail."

msgid "A cuddly and soft chameleon plushie that can change colors, complete with big, round eyes and a cute expression.  This plushie's soft body has a simple color-changing mechanism on its fabric, that changes from green to brown if you pet it properly, enabling people, especially children, to explore and learn about the biology of this fascinating reptile."
msgstr "A cuddly and soft chameleon plushie that can change colours, complete with big, round eyes and a cute expression.  This plushie's soft body has a simple colour-changing mechanism on its fabric, that changes from green to brown if you pet it properly, enabling people, especially children, to explore and learn about the biology of this fascinating reptile."

msgid "This bright, extremely cute lion plushie features long, soft, and golden-colored fur and a extremely playful demeanor.  On the label it says that it is an ambassador of its species, and that the amounts collected in the sales of the plushies were donated to help the conservation of the species.  Surely now, without many humans, maybe these animals don't have to worry so much about their habitat being destroyed."
msgstr "This bright, extremely cute lion plushie features long, soft, and golden-coloured fur and a extremely playful demeanour.  On the label it says that it is an ambassador of its species, and that the amounts collected in the sales of the plushies were donated to help the conservation of the species.  Surely now, without many humans, maybe these animals don't have to worry so much about their habitat being destroyed."

msgid "A large, funny, cuddly whale plushie with soft, blue-gray fur, big, friendly eyes, and a playful expression."
msgstr "A large, funny, cuddly whale plushie with soft, blue-grey fur, big, friendly eyes, and a playful expression."

msgid "A large figurine of a knight in shining armor standing watch, with its sword planted at the ground at its feet."
msgstr "A large figurine of a knight in shining armour standing watch, with its sword planted at the ground at its feet."

msgid "A figurine of some unnamed swordsman, covered with scars and equipped with sturdy leather armor.  Seems to be ready to fight."
msgstr "A figurine of some unnamed swordsman, covered with scars and equipped with sturdy leather armour.  Seems to be ready to fight."

msgid "A plastic figurine of a young woman.  She's meant to be dressed up and accessorized with a wide variety of clothing, sold separately."
msgstr "A plastic figurine of a young woman.  She's meant to be dressed up and accessorised with a wide variety of clothing, sold separately."

msgid "Your heart leaps to your throat as you see the face of Death itself staring back at you, scythe raised for the harvest!  You relax significantly once you realize it's only a few inches tall and made of plastic."
msgstr "Your heart leaps to your throat as you see the face of Death itself staring back at you, scythe raised for the harvest!  You relax significantly once you realise it's only a few inches tall and made of plastic."

msgid "A fidget spinner.  An artifact from when the times were simpler."
msgstr "A fidget spinner.  An artefact from when the times were simpler."

msgid "They're different colors and different lengths.  It would be hard to run away with these."
msgstr "They're different colours and different lengths.  It would be hard to run away with these."

msgid "Jacketed 10mm Auto ammunition with a 180gr hollow point bullet, intended for use in self-defense, or perhaps hunting.  The 10mm Auto cartridge is a rather powerful handgun round and the progenitor to the more popular .40 S&W."
msgstr "Jacketed 10mm Auto ammunition with a 180gr hollow point bullet, intended for use in self-defence, or perhaps hunting.  The 10mm Auto cartridge is a rather powerful handgun round and the progenitor to the more popular .40 S&W."

msgid "'Full House' 10mm Auto ammunition with a 140gr solid copper penetrator projectile, for hunting or self-defense from dangerous game.  The 10mm Auto cartridge is a rather powerful handgun round and the progenitor to the more popular .40 S&W."
msgstr "'Full House' 10mm Auto ammunition with a 140gr solid copper penetrator projectile, for hunting or self-defence from dangerous game.  The 10mm Auto cartridge is a rather powerful handgun round and the progenitor to the more popular .40 S&W."

msgid "A .22 caliber cartridge loaded with very small pieces of shot contained within a fragmenting plastic capsule.  It has an extremely short range and poor penetration ability, but the spread of shot can hit targets with greater ease."
msgstr "A .22 calibre cartridge loaded with very small pieces of shot contained within a fragmenting plastic capsule.  It has an extremely short range and poor penetration ability, but the spread of shot can hit targets with greater ease."

msgid "5.56x45mm ammunition, developed due to SOF dissatisfaction with the M855 cartridge.  The Mk318 Mod 1 is loaded with a 62 grain Open Tip Match Rear Penetrator bullet, a copper slug enclosed inside an open-tipped brass projectile, providing for consistent loading, enhanced lethality and increased penetration.  When compared to M855, the Mk318 fragments consistently, even out of short-barreled carbines."
msgstr "5.56x45mm ammunition, developed due to SOF dissatisfaction with the M855 cartridge.  The Mk318 Mod 1 is loaded with a 62 grain Open Tip Match Rear Penetrator bullet, a copper slug enclosed inside an open-tipped brass projectile, providing for consistent loading, enhanced lethality and increased penetration.  When compared to M855, the Mk318 fragments consistently, even out of short-barrelled carbines."

msgid "5.56x45mm ammunition with a 62gr FMJ bullet containing a steel penetrator.  Originally designed for the M249 FN Minimi, M855 was designed to penetrate steel helmets and light cover at range, sacrificing terminal performance and accuracy in the process.  The limited yaw and fragmentation is worsened with shorter-barreled carbines shooting this round, and optimization of barrel twist for stabilization of the tracer variant of M855 has resulted in lackluster accuracy overall."
msgstr "5.56x45mm ammunition with a 62gr FMJ bullet containing a steel penetrator.  Originally designed for the M249 FN Minimi, M855 was designed to penetrate steel helmets and light cover at range, sacrificing terminal performance and accuracy in the process.  The limited yaw and fragmentation is worsened with shorter-barrelled carbines shooting this round, and optimisation of barrel twist for stabilisation of the tracer variant of M855 has resulted in lacklustre accuracy overall."

msgid "An updated loading of M855 5.56x45mm ammunition, featuring a 62 grain projectile containing an exposed steel penetrator and copper slug.  Designed as a mostly lead-free projectile, the opportunity was further taken to improve upon M855's penetration and lethality characteristics through penetrator design and increased pressure.  Its improved accuracy, penetration and lethality over M855 are appreciated by users of shorter-barreled AR variants."
msgstr "An updated loading of M855 5.56x45mm ammunition, featuring a 62 grain projectile containing an exposed steel penetrator and copper slug.  Designed as a mostly lead-free projectile, the opportunity was further taken to improve upon M855's penetration and lethality characteristics through penetrator design and increased pressure.  Its improved accuracy, penetration and lethality over M855 are appreciated by users of shorter-barrelled AR variants."

msgid "An armor piercing 5.56x45mm M995 round using a 52gr projectile, featuring a black-tipped, tungsten carbide penetrator over an aluminum slug.  Increased penetration over standard ball rounds at the cost of worse wounding potential in soft tissue."
msgstr "An armour piercing 5.56x45mm M995 round using a 52gr projectile, featuring a black-tipped, tungsten carbide penetrator over an aluminium slug.  Increased penetration over standard ball rounds at the cost of worse wounding potential in soft tissue."

msgid "Armor piercing .30-06 M2 ammunition with a 166gr hardened steel core bullet.  The .30-06 cartridge was adopted in 1906 by the US military, where it served for some 50 years, and it remains popular today among collectors and hunters for its range, versatility, and power."
msgstr "Armour piercing .30-06 M2 ammunition with a 166gr hardened steel core bullet.  The .30-06 cartridge was adopted in 1906 by the US military, where it served for some 50 years, and it remains popular today among collectors and hunters for its range, versatility, and power."

msgid "Jacketed .303 British ammunition loaded with a 180gr soft point bullet, for hunting medium game.  .303 British was the standard caliber for military rifles in the British Empire from 1888 until the 1950s.  This loading allows the round to undergo greater expansion upon striking targets, leading to larger wound channels."
msgstr "Jacketed .303 British ammunition loaded with a 180gr soft point bullet, for hunting medium game.  .303 British was the standard calibre for military rifles in the British Empire from 1888 until the 1950s.  This loading allows the round to undergo greater expansion upon striking targets, leading to larger wound channels."

msgid "Jacketed .303 British ammunition loaded with a 174gr open tip match bullet, for precision shooting.  .303 British was the standard caliber for military rifles in the British Empire from 1888 until the 1950s.  The projectile's open tip construction offers greater manufacturing precision and a marginal amount of increased expansion over regular full metal jacket bullets."
msgstr "Jacketed .303 British ammunition loaded with a 174gr open tip match bullet, for precision shooting.  .303 British was the standard calibre for military rifles in the British Empire from 1888 until the 1950s.  The projectile's open tip construction offers greater manufacturing precision and a marginal amount of increased expansion over regular full metal jacket bullets."

msgid "An armor piercing 7.62x51mm round with a 126gr, tungsten carbide core projectile.  It offers significantly better armor penetration than standard ball rounds at the cost of worse wounding potential in soft tissue."
msgstr "An armour piercing 7.62x51mm round with a 126gr, tungsten carbide core projectile.  It offers significantly better armour penetration than standard ball rounds at the cost of worse wounding potential in soft tissue."

msgid "Jacketed .32 ACP ammunition with a 71gr hollow point bullet, intended for use in self-defense.  This caliber was once a popular handgun cartridge in the 20th century, though it lacks power compared to .380 Auto and 9x19mm."
msgstr "Jacketed .32 ACP ammunition with a 71gr hollow point bullet, intended for use in self-defence.  This calibre was once a popular handgun cartridge in the 20th century, though it lacks power compared to .380 Auto and 9x19mm."

msgid ".338 Lapua ammunition, loaded with a 248-grain armor-piercing bullet.  Developed as a joint venture between Accuracy International, SAKO, and Lapua, the .338 round is a long-range sniping cartridge that boasts impressive accuracy and devastating terminal ballistics.  This specialized loading of .338 Lapua features a highly penetrative full-metal jacketed bullet, which comes at the cost of negligible expansion once the round thunders into, and likely straight through, the target."
msgstr ".338 Lapua ammunition, loaded with a 248-grain armour-piercing bullet.  Developed as a joint venture between Accuracy International, SAKO, and Lapua, the .338 round is a long-range sniping cartridge that boasts impressive accuracy and devastating terminal ballistics.  This specialised loading of .338 Lapua features a highly penetrative full-metal jacketed bullet, which comes at the cost of negligible expansion once the round thunders into, and likely straight through, the target."

msgid ".338 Lapua ammunition, loaded with a 256-grain armor-piercing incendiary bullet.  Developed as a joint venture between Accuracy International, SAKO, and Lapua, the .338 round is a long-range sniping cartridge that boasts impressive accuracy and devastating terminal ballistics.  This specialized loading of .338 Lapua features a tungsten carbide penetrator as well as an extra dose of nastiness in the form of an incendiary loading, which serves to highlight the point of impact and possibly set flammable materials alight."
msgstr ".338 Lapua ammunition, loaded with a 256-grain armour-piercing incendiary bullet.  Developed as a joint venture between Accuracy International, SAKO, and Lapua, the .338 round is a long-range sniping cartridge that boasts impressive accuracy and devastating terminal ballistics.  This specialised loading of .338 Lapua features a tungsten carbide penetrator as well as an extra dose of nastiness in the form of an incendiary loading, which serves to highlight the point of impact and possibly set flammable materials alight."

msgid ".380 ACP ammunition with a brass jacketed 95gr bullet.  Popular in pocket pistols for over a century, it is often considered the weakest caliber to consider for self-defense.  One should be careful not to chamber it in 9x18mm Makarov or 9x19mm firearms."
msgstr ".380 ACP ammunition with a brass jacketed 95gr bullet.  Popular in pocket pistols for over a century, it is often considered the weakest calibre to consider for self-defence.  One should be careful not to chamber it in 9x18mm Makarov or 9x19mm firearms."

msgid ".380 ACP ammunition with a 95gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  It is a popular round for small concealable backup pistols, and often the weakest recommended defensive caliber.  One should be careful not to chamber it in 9x18mm Makarov or 9x19mm firearms."
msgstr ".380 ACP ammunition with a 95gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  It is a popular round for small concealable backup pistols, and often the weakest recommended defensive calibre.  One should be careful not to chamber it in 9x18mm Makarov or 9x19mm firearms."

msgid "Overpressure .380 ACP ammunition with a 90gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  This defensive loading is designed to maximize performance and tends to be more accurate than practice ammo.  One should be careful not to chamber it in 9x18mm Makarov or 9x19mm firearms."
msgstr "Overpressure .380 ACP ammunition with a 90gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  This defensive loading is designed to maximise performance and tends to be more accurate than practice ammo.  One should be careful not to chamber it in 9x18mm Makarov or 9x19mm firearms."

msgid ".38 Super ammunition with a 124gr FMJ bullet.  The .38 Super round was developed from .38 ACP in 1929 to penetrate body armor of the era.  The caliber saw some resurgence in popularity among competition shooters in the 1980's prior to the proliferation of double stack 9mm pistols."
msgstr ".38 Super ammunition with a 124gr FMJ bullet.  The .38 Super round was developed from .38 ACP in 1929 to penetrate body armour of the era.  The calibre saw some resurgence in popularity among competition shooters in the 1980's prior to the proliferation of double stack 9mm pistols."

msgid ".38 Super ammunition with a 115gr JHP bullet.  The .38 Super round was developed from .38 ACP in 1929 to penetrate body armor of the era.  The caliber saw some resurgence in popularity among competition shooters in the 1980's prior to the proliferation of double stack 9mm pistols."
msgstr ".38 Super ammunition with a 115gr JHP bullet.  The .38 Super round was developed from .38 ACP in 1929 to penetrate body armour of the era.  The calibre saw some resurgence in popularity among competition shooters in the 1980's prior to the proliferation of double stack 9mm pistols."

msgid "A low velocity 40x46mm high explosive dual-purpose grenade.  It can penetrate 2 inches of steel armor, and the fragmentation of the projectile body also makes it suitable for use against infantry."
msgstr "A low velocity 40x46mm high explosive dual-purpose grenade.  It can penetrate 2 inches of steel armour, and the fragmentation of the projectile body also makes it suitable for use against infantry."

msgid "A set of ten .22 LR bullets compressed into a 40mm adapter.  Fires all ten rounds simultaneously."
msgstr "A set of ten .22 LR bullets compressed into a 40mm adaptor.  Fires all ten rounds simultaneously."

msgid "A set of four .410 000 shotshells and a large pistol primer loaded into a 40mm adapter.  Fires all four rounds at once with an internal firing assembly, which is set off by the primer."
msgstr "A set of four .410 000 shotshells and a large pistol primer loaded into a 40mm adaptor.  Fires all four rounds at once with an internal firing assembly, which is set off by the primer."

msgid "A set of four .410 slug shells and a large pistol primer loaded into a 40mm adapter.  Fires all four rounds at once with an internal firing assembly, which is set off by the primer."
msgstr "A set of four .410 slug shells and a large pistol primer loaded into a 40mm adaptor.  Fires all four rounds at once with an internal firing assembly, which is set off by the primer."

msgid "A set of four .410 birdshot shells and a large pistol primer loaded into a 40mm adapter.  Fires all four rounds at once with an internal firing assembly, which is set off by the primer."
msgstr "A set of four .410 birdshot shells and a large pistol primer loaded into a 40mm adaptor.  Fires all four rounds at once with an internal firing assembly, which is set off by the primer."

msgid "A set of four .410 'scrap-shot' shells and a large pistol primer loaded into a 40mm adapter.  Fires all four rounds at once with an internal firing assembly, which is set off by the primer."
msgstr "A set of four .410 'scrap-shot' shells and a large pistol primer loaded into a 40mm adaptor.  Fires all four rounds at once with an internal firing assembly, which is set off by the primer."

msgid "A high velocity 40x53mm high explosive dual-purpose grenade.  It can penetrate 3 inches of steel armor, and the fragmentation of the projectile body also makes it suitable for use against infantry."
msgstr "A high velocity 40x53mm high explosive dual-purpose grenade.  It can penetrate 3 inches of steel armour, and the fragmentation of the projectile body also makes it suitable for use against infantry."

msgid "A .410 shotshell loaded with a 110gr slug.  Decent for hunting medium game or possibly self-defense."
msgstr "A .410 shotshell loaded with a 110gr slug.  Decent for hunting medium game or possibly self-defence."

msgid ".450 Bushmaster ammunition, loaded with a plastic-capped 250-grain Flex Tip bullet.  Born from discontent with the .223 Remington's weak stopping potential, the .450 Bushmaster round was crafted in line with the so-called 'Thumper' concept: an envisioned need for a large-bore, semi-automatic sporting cartridge capable of downing game in one shot.  Along with its elder sibling, the .50-caliber Beowulf cartridge, the .450 Bushmaster is one of a number of such high-caliber rounds and is compatible with appropriately converted AR-15-platform rifles.  This particular cartridge possesses a plastic-tipped projectile, which acts as an improved hollow point bullet with uniform and devastating expansion within wound cavities."
msgstr ".450 Bushmaster ammunition, loaded with a plastic-capped 250-grain Flex Tip bullet.  Born from discontent with the .223 Remington's weak stopping potential, the .450 Bushmaster round was crafted in line with the so-called 'Thumper' concept: an envisioned need for a large-bore, semi-automatic sporting cartridge capable of downing game in one shot.  Along with its elder sibling, the .50-calibre Beowulf cartridge, the .450 Bushmaster is one of a number of such high-calibre rounds and is compatible with appropriately converted AR-15-platform rifles.  This particular cartridge possesses a plastic-tipped projectile, which acts as an improved hollow point bullet with uniform and devastating expansion within wound cavities."

msgid ".450 Bushmaster ammunition, loaded with a solid-copper 220-grain penetrator bullet.  Born from discontent with the .223 Remington's weak stopping potential, the .450 Bushmaster round was crafted in line with the so-called 'Thumper' concept: an envisioned need for a large-bore, semi-automatic sporting cartridge capable of downing game in one shot.  Along with its elder sibling, the .50-caliber Beowulf cartridge, the .450 Bushmaster is one of a number of such high-caliber rounds and is compatible with appropriately converted AR-15-platform rifles.  This particular cartridge is loaded with a solid-copper projectile: excellent at punching through thick barriers and delivering massive amounts of energy to anything unfortunate enough to be hit."
msgstr ".450 Bushmaster ammunition, loaded with a solid-copper 220-grain penetrator bullet.  Born from discontent with the .223 Remington's weak stopping potential, the .450 Bushmaster round was crafted in line with the so-called 'Thumper' concept: an envisioned need for a large-bore, semi-automatic sporting cartridge capable of downing game in one shot.  Along with its elder sibling, the .50-calibre Beowulf cartridge, the .450 Bushmaster is one of a number of such high-calibre rounds and is compatible with appropriately converted AR-15-platform rifles.  This particular cartridge is loaded with a solid-copper projectile: excellent at punching through thick barriers and delivering massive amounts of energy to anything unfortunate enough to be hit."

msgid ".45-70 Government ammunition loaded with a 305 grain soft point bullet.  One of the oldest cartridges still in use, it is still a favorite for large game hunting at short ranges."
msgstr ".45-70 Government ammunition loaded with a 305 grain soft point bullet.  One of the oldest cartridges still in use, it is still a favourite for large game hunting at short ranges."

msgid "Jacketed .45 Colt ammunition with a 225gr hollow point bullet, loaded much hotter than regular loads for this cartridge.  Hollowpoints in this venerable caliber were issued by the occasional police department looking for extra lethality before the '97 North Hollywood shootout.  Since then they were mostly used for home defense, and now by the post-apocalyptic cowboy."
msgstr "Jacketed .45 Colt ammunition with a 225gr hollow point bullet, loaded much hotter than regular loads for this cartridge.  Hollowpoints in this venerable calibre were issued by the occasional police department looking for extra lethality before the '97 North Hollywood shootout.  Since then they were mostly used for home defence, and now by the post-apocalyptic cowboy."

msgid "4.6x30mm ammunition with a 31gr copper plated steel bullet.  The 4.6x30mm round was developed by H&K to compete with FN Herstal's 5.7x28mm cartridge.  It has low recoil and excellent armor penetration."
msgstr "4.6x30mm ammunition with a 31gr copper plated steel bullet.  The 4.6x30mm round was developed by H&K to compete with FN Herstal's 5.7x28mm cartridge.  It has low recoil and excellent armour penetration."

msgid "4.6x30mm ammunition with a 31gr copper plated lead bullets.  The 4.6x30mm round was developed by H&K to compete with FN Herstal's 5.7x28mm cartridge.  It has low recoil, but lacks its usual armor penetration due to using a simple lead bullet rather than a proper factory-made penetrator projectile."
msgstr "4.6x30mm ammunition with a 31gr copper plated lead bullets.  The 4.6x30mm round was developed by H&K to compete with FN Herstal's 5.7x28mm cartridge.  It has low recoil, but lacks its usual armour penetration due to using a simple lead bullet rather than a proper factory-made penetrator projectile."

msgid ".50 BMG ammunition with a mild steel cored 661gr FMJ bullet.  The .50 BMG is a very powerful rifle round designed for anti-aircraft use, later adapted to anti-vehicular and anti-personnel roles.  Its stupendous energy and armor piercing capabilities make it one of the most deadly rounds available, offset only by its drastic recoil and noise."
msgstr ".50 BMG ammunition with a mild steel cored 661gr FMJ bullet.  The .50 BMG is a very powerful rifle round designed for anti-aircraft use, later adapted to anti-vehicular and anti-personnel roles.  Its stupendous energy and armour piercing capabilities make it one of the most deadly rounds available, offset only by its drastic recoil and noise."

msgid ".50 BMG ammunition with a lead-cored FMJ bullet.  The .50 BMG is a very powerful rifle round designed for anti-aircraft use, later adapted to anti-vehicular and anti-personnel roles.  Its stupendous energy and armor piercing capabilities make it one of the most deadly rounds available, offset only by its drastic recoil and noise."
msgstr ".50 BMG ammunition with a lead-cored FMJ bullet.  The .50 BMG is a very powerful rifle round designed for anti-aircraft use, later adapted to anti-vehicular and anti-personnel roles.  Its stupendous energy and armour piercing capabilities make it one of the most deadly rounds available, offset only by its drastic recoil and noise."

msgid "This variant of the .50 BMG round makes the most of the caliber's potential payload delivery: The tip is loaded with an incendiary mix, which ignites on impact, detonating the RDX or PETN charge.  This also ignites a secondary zirconium powder incendiary charge that surrounds a tungsten carbide penetrator, both encased by a mild steel cup.  Fragments from the cup and burning metallic powder follow the penetrator through armored targets, increasing lethality.  This rare, complicated, and expensive round is not likely to be manufactured again; use it wisely."
msgstr "This variant of the .50 BMG round makes the most of the calibre's potential payload delivery: The tip is loaded with an incendiary mix, which ignites on impact, detonating the RDX or PETN charge.  This also ignites a secondary zirconium powder incendiary charge that surrounds a tungsten carbide penetrator, both encased by a mild steel cup.  Fragments from the cup and burning metallic powder follow the penetrator through armoured targets, increasing lethality.  This rare, complicated, and expensive round is not likely to be manufactured again; use it wisely."

msgid ".50-caliber Beowulf ammunition, loaded with a copper-jacketed 350-grain eXtreme Terminal Performance bullet.  Developed in 2001 as a powerful short- to medium-range chambering for AR-15 style rifles, this stout cartridge had gained some popularity as a hunting round before the Cataclysm.  This particular version of the cartridge is coated in a layer of polymer, encouraging commendable terminal ballistics, penetrative capabilities, and overall expansion from its 12.7x42mm projectile."
msgstr ".50-calibre Beowulf ammunition, loaded with a copper-jacketed 350-grain eXtreme Terminal Performance bullet.  Developed in 2001 as a powerful short- to medium-range chambering for AR-15 style rifles, this stout cartridge had gained some popularity as a hunting round before the Cataclysm.  This particular version of the cartridge is coated in a layer of polymer, encouraging commendable terminal ballistics, penetrative capabilities, and overall expansion from its 12.7x42mm projectile."

msgid ".50-caliber Beowulf ammunition, loaded with a solid-copper 420-grain Xtreme Penetrator bullet.  Developed in 2001 as a powerful short- to medium-range chambering for AR-15 style rifles, this stout cartridge had gained some popularity as a hunting round before the Cataclysm.  With a blunt nose construction for better initial energy transfer, this 12.7mm-wide bullet's solid copper design allows it to punch through entry barriers while resulting in a larger wound column."
msgstr ".50-calibre Beowulf ammunition, loaded with a solid-copper 420-grain Xtreme Penetrator bullet.  Developed in 2001 as a powerful short- to medium-range chambering for AR-15 style rifles, this stout cartridge had gained some popularity as a hunting round before the Cataclysm.  With a blunt nose construction for better initial energy transfer, this 12.7mm-wide bullet's solid copper design allows it to punch through entry barriers while resulting in a larger wound column."

msgid "5.45x39mm ammunition with a 57gr bullet containing a mild steel penetrator, which penetrates armor marginally better than lead core projectiles.  Developed in 1974 by the Russian military, and banned from import into the US in 2014."
msgstr "5.45x39mm ammunition with a 57gr bullet containing a mild steel penetrator, which penetrates armour marginally better than lead core projectiles.  Developed in 1974 by the Russian military, and banned from import into the US in 2014."

msgid "5.7x28mm ammunition with a 31gr AP FMJ bullet.  The 5.7x28mm cartridge was designed by FN Herstal to replace the 9x19mm round in NATO use.  Although the project to replace 9x19mm Parabellum was effectively canceled, the 5.7x28mm round has seen action in many conflicts and has proven to be reliable.  It has very low recoil and its armor penetration is a defining feature."
msgstr "5.7x28mm ammunition with a 31gr AP FMJ bullet.  The 5.7x28mm cartridge was designed by FN Herstal to replace the 9x19mm round in NATO use.  Although the project to replace 9x19mm Parabellum was effectively cancelled, the 5.7x28mm round has seen action in many conflicts and has proven to be reliable.  It has very low recoil and its armour penetration is a defining feature."

msgid "A subsonic cartridge derived from the 5.7x28mm, designed for silenced firearms.  It offers good armor penetration at the cost of slightly less damage."
msgstr "A subsonic cartridge derived from the 5.7x28mm, designed for silenced firearms.  It offers good armour penetration at the cost of slightly less damage."

msgid "A commercially available cartridge derived from the 5.7x28mm round.  It features a copper-jacketed bullet with an aluminum core, which significantly reduces its armor-piercing capabilities compared to its lead-core counterpart.  However, the hollow-point design enhances terminal performance against unarmored targets.  In all other respects, it remains largely identical to the military version."
msgstr "A commercially available cartridge derived from the 5.7x28mm round.  It features a copper-jacketed bullet with an aluminium core, which significantly reduces its armour-piercing capabilities compared to its lead-core counterpart.  However, the hollow-point design enhances terminal performance against unarmoured targets.  In all other respects, it remains largely identical to the military version."

msgid "5.7x28mm ammunition with a 31gr AP FMJ bullet.  The 5.7x28mm cartridge was designed by FN Herstal to replace the 9x19mm round in NATO use.  Although the project to replace 9x19mm Parabellum was effectively canceled, the 5.7x28mm round has seen action in many conflicts and has proven to be reliable.  It has very low recoil but lacks its usual armor penetration due to using a simple lead bullet rather than a proper factory-made penetrator projectile."
msgstr "5.7x28mm ammunition with a 31gr AP FMJ bullet.  The 5.7x28mm cartridge was designed by FN Herstal to replace the 9x19mm round in NATO use.  Although the project to replace 9x19mm Parabellum was effectively cancelled, the 5.7x28mm round has seen action in many conflicts and has proven to be reliable.  It has very low recoil but lacks its usual armour penetration due to using a simple lead bullet rather than a proper factory-made penetrator projectile."

msgid "Designed to defeat modern body armor, the Rivtech 5x50mm flechette round features a biodegradable sabot and a single, fin-stabilized penetrator."
msgstr "Designed to defeat modern body armour, the Rivtech 5x50mm flechette round features a biodegradable sabot and a single, fin-stabilised penetrator."

msgid "Designed to defeat modern body armor, the Rivtech 5x50mm RA119 penetrator round features a biodegradable sabot and a single, fin-stabilized tungsten alloy projectile."
msgstr "Designed to defeat modern body armour, the Rivtech 5x50mm RA119 penetrator round features a biodegradable sabot and a single, fin-stabilised tungsten alloy projectile."

msgid "Designed to defeat modern body armor, the Rivtech 5x50mm flechette round features a biodegradable sabot and a single, fin-stabilized penetrator.  This one has been hand-reloaded by a lucky survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm corporate spy, leading to slightly inferior performance compared to factory-produced ammo."
msgstr "Designed to defeat modern body armour, the Rivtech 5x50mm flechette round features a biodegradable sabot and a single, fin-stabilised penetrator.  This one has been hand-reloaded by a lucky survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm corporate spy, leading to slightly inferior performance compared to factory-produced ammo."

msgid "A subsonic cartridge derived from the 7.62x25mm, designed for silenced firearms.  It offers good armor penetration at the cost of slightly less damage."
msgstr "A subsonic cartridge derived from the 7.62x25mm, designed for silenced firearms.  It offers good armour penetration at the cost of slightly less damage."

msgid "An 84x245mm smoke marker cartridge for the Carl Gustaf M3 and other 84mm recoilless rifles.  Commonly used for signaling, target designation, and for screening troop movements."
msgstr "An 84x245mm smoke marker cartridge for the Carl Gustaf M3 and other 84mm recoilless rifles.  Commonly used for signalling, target designation, and for screening troop movements."

msgid "An 8x40mm caseless round, saboted high-velocity penetrator type.  Advanced military grade, armor-piercing ammunition that fires a single depleted uranium flechette."
msgstr "An 8x40mm caseless round, saboted high-velocity penetrator type.  Advanced military grade, armour-piercing ammunition that fires a single depleted uranium flechette."

msgid "9x19mm ammunition with a 116gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  JHP rounds have inferior penetration to FMJ rounds, but their expansion slightly increases stopping power against unarmored targets and reduces overpenetration."
msgstr "9x19mm ammunition with a 116gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  JHP rounds have inferior penetration to FMJ rounds, but their expansion slightly increases stopping power against unarmoured targets and reduces overpenetration."

msgid "9x18mm Makarov RG028 ammunition.  The RG028 round uses a bullet with a hardened steel core to improve armor penetration."
msgstr "9x18mm Makarov RG028 ammunition.  The RG028 round uses a bullet with a hardened steel core to improve armour penetration."

msgid "9x18 millimeter Makarov, an old Soviet pistol cartridge used mainly by the Makarov PM.  This one has been hand-reloaded to generate higher internal pressure, boosting flight stability and damage."
msgstr "9x18 millimetre Makarov, an old Soviet pistol cartridge used mainly by the Makarov PM.  This one has been hand-reloaded to generate higher internal pressure, boosting flight stability and damage."

msgid "paralyzing barb"
msgid_plural "paralyzing barbs"
msgstr[0] "paralysing barb"
msgstr[1] "paralysing barbs"

msgid "Fungicide enhanced with sulfur to create sprayable anti-fungal ammo for the chemical thrower.  Best used with some kind of mask or mouth protection."
msgstr "Fungicide enhanced with sulphur to create sprayable anti-fungal ammo for the chemical thrower.  Best used with some kind of mask or mouth protection."

msgid "These flare cartridges are for use in 27.3x44 Diyua guns, or perhaps in 27.3x110 Diyua guns.  They are employed by the Exodii for emergency signaling when their usual communications systems are suffering interference, breakdown, or are being jammed."
msgstr "These flare cartridges are for use in 27.3x44 Diyua guns, or perhaps in 27.3x110 Diyua guns.  They are employed by the Exodii for emergency signalling when their usual communications systems are suffering interference, breakdown, or are being jammed."

msgid "A 27.3x44 Diyua cartridge loaded with a large hollow aluminum projectile, painted blue at the tip, for practicing shooting.  If interdimensional total replacement cyborgs have to practice, maybe you should too."
msgstr "A 27.3x44 Diyua cartridge loaded with a large hollow aluminium projectile, painted blue at the tip, for practicing shooting.  If interdimensional total replacement cyborgs have to practise, maybe you should too."

msgid "Pressurized chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  Highly reactive to oxygen, removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."
msgstr "Pressurised chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  Highly reactive to oxygen, removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."

msgid "Pressurized chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  Highly flammable and reactive to oxygen, removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."
msgstr "Pressurised chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  Highly flammable and reactive to oxygen, removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."

msgid "Pressurized chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  Essentially a juiced up version of pirahna solution, removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."
msgstr "Pressurised chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  Essentially a juiced up version of pirahna solution, removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."

msgid "Pressurized chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  An incredibly powerful binding agent and sealant, removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."
msgstr "Pressurised chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  An incredibly powerful binding agent and sealant, removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."

msgid "A 12 gauge shotgun shell, filled with 9 pellets of 00 buck.  A very common and versatile round, they're useful for both self defense and for hunting.  The spread of the shot doesn't just increase your chances to have a projectile hit, it also causes a much larger wound, greatly increasing lethality.  It does struggle with range, and against body armor."
msgstr "A 12 gauge shotgun shell, filled with 9 pellets of 00 buck.  A very common and versatile round, they're useful for both self defence and for hunting.  The spread of the shot doesn't just increase your chances to have a projectile hit, it also causes a much larger wound, greatly increasing lethality.  It does struggle with range, and against body armour."

msgid "A 12 gauge slug.  Unlike birdshot or buckshot, slugs are a single large projectile fired from a shotgun.  They're mostly used for hunting bigger game, or for longer range shots where typical buck may spread out more.  Not as lethal as buckshot in certain ranges, but much more accurate and with a longer range, and is more effective against armor."
msgstr "A 12 gauge slug.  Unlike birdshot or buckshot, slugs are a single large projectile fired from a shotgun.  They're mostly used for hunting bigger game, or for longer range shots where typical buck may spread out more.  Not as lethal as buckshot in certain ranges, but much more accurate and with a longer range, and is more effective against armour."

msgid "This small paper canister resembling a crude shotshell is filled to the brim with handmade flechettes, giving it some armor piercing capabilities."
msgstr "This small paper canister resembling a crude shotshell is filled to the brim with handmade flechettes, giving it some armour piercing capabilities."

msgid "This small paper canister resembling a crude shotshell is filled to the brim with handmade bearings, stabilizing its flight pattern a tiny bit."
msgstr "This small paper canister resembling a crude shotshell is filled to the brim with handmade bearings, stabilising its flight pattern a tiny bit."

msgid "Pressurized, dangerous acetylene gas.  Can be used for welding or cutting with a torch."
msgstr "Pressurised, dangerous acetylene gas.  Can be used for welding or cutting with a torch."

msgid "aluminum welding rod"
msgid_plural "aluminum welding rods"
msgstr[0] "aluminium welding rod"
msgstr[1] "aluminium welding rods"

msgid "A length of coated welding electrode - a 3.2 mm thick aluminum rod coated in a special protective flux.  Required for arc welding aluminum alloys."
msgstr "A length of coated welding electrode - a 3.2 mm thick aluminium rod coated in a special protective flux.  Required for arc welding aluminium alloys."

msgid "aluminum welding wire"
msgid_plural "aluminum welding wires"
msgstr[0] "aluminium welding wire"
msgstr[1] "aluminium welding wires"

msgid "A length of 0.9 mm aluminum wire for MIG welding."
msgstr "A length of 0.9 mm aluminium wire for MIG welding."

msgid "aluminum brazing rod"
msgid_plural "aluminum brazing rods"
msgstr[0] "aluminium brazing rod"
msgstr[1] "aluminium brazing rods"

msgid "A length of 3.2 mm aluminum rod, for brazing aluminum alloys.  Also suitable for TIG welding."
msgstr "A length of 3.2 mm aluminium rod, for brazing aluminium alloys.  Also suitable for TIG welding."

msgid "Small, portable generator, one that people buy for a camp.  It just needs to be plugged in, fueled up, and then turned on."
msgstr "Small, portable generator, one that people buy for a camp.  It just needs to be plugged in, fuelled up, and then turned on."

msgid "Big and powerful generator, used for street works.  It just needs to be plugged in, fueled up, and then turned on.  Has little wheels to make it easier to move."
msgstr "Big and powerful generator, used for street works.  It just needs to be plugged in, fuelled up, and then turned on.  Has little wheels to make it easier to move."

msgid "A slight temporal distortion appears to be centered around you"
msgstr "A slight temporal distortion appears to be centred around you"

msgid "Popularized during the Vietnam War, chest rigs like these are typically plain, barebones affairs consisting of three or more pouches in a row, with straps to secure them on your chest.  This one can hold four magazines in its pouches."
msgstr "Popularised during the Vietnam War, chest rigs like these are typically plain, barebones affairs consisting of three or more pouches in a row, with straps to secure them on your chest.  This one can hold four magazines in its pouches."

msgid "An American flag is proudly embroidered across the front of each pouch, with a tiny, eagle-winged .50-caliber bullet crowning each banner."
msgstr "An American flag is proudly embroidered across the front of each pouch, with a tiny, eagle-winged .50-calibre bullet crowning each banner."

msgid "Small squares of carpet rolled around your upper and lower arms.  Armor of the truly desperate or crafty."
msgstr "Small squares of carpet rolled around your upper and lower arms.  Armour of the truly desperate or crafty."

msgid "A pair of neoprene arm sleeves covered with molded plastic sheaths."
msgstr "A pair of neoprene arm sleeves covered with moulded plastic sheaths."

msgid "pair of improvised tire arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of improvised tire arm guards"
msgstr[0] "pair of improvised tyre arm guards"
msgstr[1] "pairs of improvised tyre arm guards"

msgid "Arm guards made of thick chunks of tire held together with duct tape."
msgstr "Arm guards made of thick chunks of tyre held together with duct tape."

msgid "pair of tire arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of tire arm guards"
msgstr[0] "pair of tyre arm guards"
msgstr[1] "pairs of tyre arm guards"

msgid "A pair of arm guards made from thick chunks of tire secured by simple strings; the loose collection of rubber plates provides decent but not the most convenient protection."
msgstr "A pair of arm guards made from thick chunks of tyre secured by simple strings; the loose collection of rubber plates provides decent but not the most convenient protection."

msgid "A pair arm sleeves made from aramid, with strips of soft body armor sewn on top to simulate quilting."
msgstr "A pair arm sleeves made from aramid, with strips of soft body armour sewn on top to simulate quilting."

msgid "Customized chainmail arm protection.  Both sleeves have straps to connect them with each other.  They don't cover the hands, making them less cumbersome and allowing them to be worn with gloves."
msgstr "Customised chainmail arm protection.  Both sleeves have straps to connect them with each other.  They don't cover the hands, making them less cumbersome and allowing them to be worn with gloves."

msgid "You can wear some armor over chainmail without penalty."
msgstr "You can wear some armour over chainmail without penalty."

msgid "Customized chainmail arm protection.  The metal shows signs of rust and corrosion.  Both sleeves have straps to connect them with each other.  They don't cover the hands, making them less cumbersome and allowing them to be worn with gloves."
msgstr "Customised chainmail arm protection.  The metal shows signs of rust and corrosion.  Both sleeves have straps to connect them with each other.  They don't cover the hands, making them less cumbersome and allowing them to be worn with gloves."

msgid "Armor made of combined pre-Cataclysm clothing.  Sections from leather clothing are tightened and affixed to the sleeves of a thick cotton shirt, excluding the joints."
msgstr "Armour made of combined pre-Cataclysm clothing.  Sections from leather clothing are tightened and affixed to the sleeves of a thick cotton shirt, excluding the joints."

msgid "A ballistic vest with specialized pockets on the front, back, and sides to hold armor plates.  While this plate carrier is still protective even without inserts, it's too soft to effectively stop high-energy projectiles on its own."
msgstr "A ballistic vest with specialised pockets on the front, back, and sides to hold armour plates.  While this plate carrier is still protective even without inserts, it's too soft to effectively stop high-energy projectiles on its own."

msgid "This version is colored black, and was once used by specialized police forces.  \"SWAT\" is emblazoned on the back."
msgstr "This version is coloured black, and was once used by specialised police forces.  \"SWAT\" is emblazoned on the back."

msgid "Pocket for a large armor plate."
msgstr "Pocket for a large armour plate."

msgid "Pocket for a medium armor plate."
msgstr "Pocket for a medium armour plate."

msgid "A thick armored jacket constructed from Kevlar, Nomex, and foam padding, for use by explosive ordnance disposal technicians.  It features a central pocket for a large plate, and near complete coverage in fragmentation resistant materials.  Aside from the plate, it offers insufficient protection from ballistic threats."
msgstr "A thick armoured jacket constructed from Kevlar, Nomex, and foam padding, for use by explosive ordnance disposal technicians.  It features a central pocket for a large plate, and near complete coverage in fragmentation resistant materials.  Aside from the plate, it offers insufficient protection from ballistic threats."

msgid "Pocket for a huge armor plate."
msgstr "Pocket for a huge armour plate."

msgid "An armored jacket constructed from Kevlar, Nomex, and foam padding, for use by explosive ordnance disposal technicians in 'non-permissive environments'.  It is lighter than normal EOD armor to allow for wearing a plate carrier beneath it.  It features two pockets in the arms covering the deltoids for additional optional protection."
msgstr "An armoured jacket constructed from Kevlar, Nomex, and foam padding, for use by explosive ordnance disposal technicians in 'non-permissive environments'.  It is lighter than normal EOD armour to allow for wearing a plate carrier beneath it.  It features two pockets in the arms covering the deltoids for additional optional protection."

msgid "Pockets for deltoid armor plates."
msgstr "Pockets for deltoid armour plates."

msgid "A polygonal ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile, made of ceramic.  Its inner surface is coated with UHMW polyethylene and is labeled \"TOP\", while the outer surface is labeled \"STRIKE FACE\".  This is intended to be worn in a ballistic vest, and can withstand several high-energy rifle rounds before breaking."
msgstr "A polygonal ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile, made of ceramic.  Its inner surface is coated with UHMW polyethylene and is labelled \"TOP\", while the outer surface is labelled \"STRIKE FACE\".  This is intended to be worn in a ballistic vest, and can withstand several high-energy rifle rounds before breaking."

msgid "A soft armor insert designed to protect against stab wounds.  While it's not great protection, it incurs no additional encumbrance.  This is intended to be inserted into a ballistic vest, and can't be worn on its own."
msgstr "A soft armour insert designed to protect against stab wounds.  While it's not great protection, it incurs no additional encumbrance.  This is intended to be inserted into a ballistic vest, and can't be worn on its own."

msgid "A concave ballistic plate made of hard steel, designed to stop small-caliber rounds.  \"NIJ III A PROTECTION\" is etched into the back of the plate.  This is intended to be inserted into a ballistic vest, and can't be worn on its own."
msgstr "A concave ballistic plate made of hard steel, designed to stop small-calibre rounds.  \"NIJ III A PROTECTION\" is etched into the back of the plate.  This is intended to be inserted into a ballistic vest, and can't be worn on its own."

msgid "A heavy concave ballistic plate made of tempered steel, designed to stop small-caliber rounds.  \"NIJ III PROTECTION\" is etched into the back of the plate.  This is intended to be inserted into a ballistic vest, and can't be worn on its own."
msgstr "A heavy concave ballistic plate made of tempered steel, designed to stop small-calibre rounds.  \"NIJ III PROTECTION\" is etched into the back of the plate.  This is intended to be inserted into a ballistic vest, and can't be worn on its own."

msgid "Heavier ballistic armor used by the US Army, known as the IOTV.  It has pockets on the front, back, and sides for armor plates; additional protection for the lower back; and attachment points for optional shoulder, groin, and neck protection."
msgstr "Heavier ballistic armour used by the US Army, known as the IOTV.  It has pockets on the front, back, and sides for armour plates; additional protection for the lower back; and attachment points for optional shoulder, groin, and neck protection."

msgid "It's a dark olive color."
msgstr "It's a dark olive colour."

msgid "XEDRA containment armor"
msgid_plural "XEDRA containment armors"
msgstr[0] "XEDRA containment armour"
msgstr[1] "XEDRA containment armours"

msgid "A simple plate carrier covering the thorax, with front and back pockets for armor plates.  Designed to keep your organs from being perforated by small-arms fire.  This version has a MOLLE cummerbund that you can tuck a few magazines into."
msgstr "A simple plate carrier covering the thorax, with front and back pockets for armour plates.  Designed to keep your organs from being perforated by small-arms fire.  This version has a MOLLE cummerbund that you can tuck a few magazines into."

msgid "It's styled in a dark olive color."
msgstr "It's styled in a dark olive colour."

msgid "It's styled in a tan color."
msgstr "It's styled in a tan colour."

msgid "It's colored dark gray, like something a contractor might wear."
msgstr "It's coloured dark grey, like something a contractor might wear."

msgid "It's decorated in a pattern of spiraling hexagons that screams style over substance."
msgstr "It's decorated in a pattern of spiralling hexagons that screams style over substance."

msgid "A simple plate carrier covering the thorax, with front and back pockets for armor plates.  Designed to keep your organs from being perforated by small-arms fire.  This version has a small pouch on the front to store stuff."
msgstr "A simple plate carrier covering the thorax, with front and back pockets for armour plates.  Designed to keep your organs from being perforated by small-arms fire.  This version has a small pouch on the front to store stuff."

msgid "A simple plate carrier covering the thorax, with front and back pockets for armor plates.  Designed to keep your organs from being perforated by small-arms fire.  This version has a shoulder-mounted pouch for a radio and a hook on the front for a glowstick."
msgstr "A simple plate carrier covering the thorax, with front and back pockets for armour plates.  Designed to keep your organs from being perforated by small-arms fire.  This version has a shoulder-mounted pouch for a radio and a hook on the front for a glowstick."

msgid "soft armor vest"
msgid_plural "soft armor vests"
msgstr[0] "soft armour vest"
msgstr[1] "soft armour vests"

msgid "A simple soft armor ballistic vest."
msgstr "A simple soft armour ballistic vest."

msgid "A lightweight black vest used by private security, covering the chest and most of the abdomen.  Soft armor plates sealed inside the fabric provide solid defense against shrapnel and small-caliber rounds.  \"SECURITY\" is emblazoned on the front lapel and across the back, and it features a pocket for a notebook and pen."
msgstr "A lightweight black vest used by private security, covering the chest and most of the abdomen.  Soft armour plates sealed inside the fabric provide solid defence against shrapnel and small-calibre rounds.  \"SECURITY\" is emblazoned on the front lapel and across the back, and it features a pocket for a notebook and pen."

msgid "Colored a distinctive navy blue and with a flared collar extending up to the chin, this soft body armor was once used by news crews reporting from combat zones.  It provides good protection from shrapnel, and to a lesser degree, low-caliber bullets.  \"PRESS\" is emblazoned prominently on the front lapel and across the back, and it features a pocket for a notebook and pen."
msgstr "Coloured a distinctive navy blue and with a flared collar extending up to the chin, this soft body armour was once used by news crews reporting from combat zones.  It provides good protection from shrapnel, and to a lesser degree, low-calibre bullets.  \"PRESS\" is emblazoned prominently on the front lapel and across the back, and it features a pocket for a notebook and pen."

msgid "A ranger green soft ballistic vest with MOLLE rigging used by federal law enforcement agencies.  Soft armor plates inside the vest provide solid defense against shrapnel and small-caliber rounds.  \"FBI\" is emblazoned across the front and back in large, yellow lettering, and it includes a pocket for storing evidence.  Use it to attach or detach pouches."
msgstr "A ranger green soft ballistic vest with MOLLE rigging used by federal law enforcement agencies.  Soft armour plates inside the vest provide solid defence against shrapnel and small-calibre rounds.  \"FBI\" is emblazoned across the front and back in large, yellow lettering, and it includes a pocket for storing evidence.  Use it to attach or detach pouches."

msgid "hard armor vest"
msgid_plural "hard armor vests"
msgstr[0] "hard armour vest"
msgstr[1] "hard armour vests"

msgid "Armored panels give this vest solid defense against small caliber firearms, and front and back pockets for hard armor panels give protection from higher calibers."
msgstr "Armoured panels give this vest solid defence against small calibre firearms, and front and back pockets for hard armour panels give protection from higher calibres."

msgid "Bright blue in color, this slim armor vest was used by volunteers and officials from humanitarian groups during the first days of the Cataclysm before order broke down completely.  \"FEMA\" is written on the front lapel and across the back."
msgstr "Bright blue in colour, this slim armour vest was used by volunteers and officials from humanitarian groups during the first days of the Cataclysm before order broke down completely.  \"FEMA\" is written on the front lapel and across the back."

msgid "This charcoal-colored body armor was once a common sight on police officers, and it provides adequate protection against small-caliber firearms in addition to featuring pouches to hold armor inserts.  \"POLICE\" is written on the front lapel and across the back."
msgstr "This charcoal-coloured body armour was once a common sight on police officers, and it provides adequate protection against small-calibre firearms in addition to featuring pouches to hold armour inserts.  \"POLICE\" is written on the front lapel and across the back."

msgid "An enormous handmade ballistic vest built with of lots of salvaged ballistic Kevlar panels.  It's bulkier than a factory made US Army vest, but it is customized for the benefit of an abnormally large mutant who couldn't wear such armors otherwise.  Coated in MOLLE webbing to support modular loadouts for the tacticool mutant.  It could be outfitted with steel plates for further protection."
msgstr "An enormous handmade ballistic vest built with of lots of salvaged ballistic Kevlar panels.  It's bulkier than a factory made US Army vest, but it is customised for the benefit of an abnormally large mutant who couldn't wear such armours otherwise.  Coated in MOLLE webbing to support modular loadouts for the tacticool mutant.  It could be outfitted with steel plates for further protection."

msgid "Nylon armor with soft armor inserts protecting the deltoid and upper arm.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr "Nylon armour with soft armour inserts protecting the deltoid and upper arm.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armour."

msgid "Front and back nylon armor with soft armor inserts for groin and butt protection.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr "Front and back nylon armour with soft armour inserts for groin and butt protection.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armour."

msgid "Front and back nylon collar assemblies with soft armor inserts for neck protection.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr "Front and back nylon collar assemblies with soft armour inserts for neck protection.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armour."

msgid "A leather belt.  Designed to look good and hold up a pair of pants, but you should be able to attach a small tool or weapon to one of the belt loops."
msgstr "A leather belt.  Designed to look good and hold up a pair of trousers, but you should be able to attach a small tool or weapon to one of the belt loops."

