msgid "A heavy woolen cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "A heavy woollen cloak meant to be thrown over your body."

msgid "A classic status symbol for the rich and famous, this is a heavy and expensive coat made from luxuriously thick, soft, and rather short fur, with a color palette consisting of rich, deep brown.  One of the most popular types of fur coats produced and traded, this jacket is incredibly warm and comes with two modest pockets."
msgstr "A classic status symbol for the rich and famous, this is a heavy and expensive coat made from luxuriously thick, soft, and rather short fur, with a colour palette consisting of rich, deep brown.  One of the most popular types of fur coats produced and traded, this jacket is incredibly warm and comes with two modest pockets."

msgid "A straight-cut, classically stylish jacket crafted from soft and voluminous gray fox fur with a blue undercoat, this article of winter apparel comes kitted out with a tall collar and two modest pockets."
msgstr "A straight-cut, classically stylish jacket crafted from soft and voluminous grey fox fur with a blue undercoat, this article of winter apparel comes kitted out with a tall collar and two modest pockets."

msgid "Luxuriously velvety and ridiculously extra, this warm, gray-hued coat is ribbed with patterns of black and white highlights.  Composed of a small army's worth of dead chinchilla pelts and naturally hypoallergenic, the world might be going to hell, but at least you'll look like a celebrity while enveloped within this dreamily soft, timelessly stylish coat."
msgstr "Luxuriously velvety and ridiculously extra, this warm, grey-hued coat is ribbed with patterns of black and white highlights.  Composed of a small army's worth of dead chinchilla pelts and naturally hypoallergenic, the world might be going to hell, but at least you'll look like a celebrity while enveloped within this dreamily soft, timelessly stylish coat."

msgid "The skins of what used to be several beavers have taken to the skies within the composition of this sleek-fitting flight jacket, or, rather, they would if the coat were in any way designed to be a practical piece of kit.  With a soft spread of brown fur lining the inside of this wide-necked overcoat and its exterior finished in a bold, glossy black color, it's safe to say that this garment belongs more within a ski chalet than the cockpit of a fighter craft."
msgstr "The skins of what used to be several beavers have taken to the skies within the composition of this sleek-fitting flight jacket, or, rather, they would if the coat were in any way designed to be a practical piece of kit.  With a soft spread of brown fur lining the inside of this wide-necked overcoat and its exterior finished in a bold, glossy black colour, it's safe to say that this garment belongs more within a ski chalet than the cockpit of a fighter craft."

msgid "Even more prized than regular mink jackets, this coat is exclusively composed of plush white fur with no markings or color in its undercoat.  Extremely warm and equipped with dual pockets, this expensive fashion statement would certainly turn some heads if anyone left alive could still care about aesthetics."
msgstr "Even more prized than regular mink jackets, this coat is exclusively composed of plush white fur with no markings or colour in its undercoat.  Extremely warm and equipped with dual pockets, this expensive fashion statement would certainly turn some heads if anyone left alive could still care about aesthetics."

msgid "The favorite coat of old European royalty, this extravagant jacket of Russian sable is composed of stitched panels of cinnamon brown fur with a pale yellow undercoat and silver tips.  Possessing a tall collar and flaring hips that just might require you to walk sideways through narrower door frames, the coat is impractical, swelteringly warm, and incredibly stylish."
msgstr "The favourite coat of old European royalty, this extravagant jacket of Russian sable is composed of stitched panels of cinnamon brown fur with a pale yellow undercoat and silver tips.  Possessing a tall collar and flaring hips that just might require you to walk sideways through narrower door frames, the coat is impractical, swelteringly warm, and incredibly stylish."

msgid "A garishly-colored faux fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Although not as warm as natural fur, it gives you some of that unique flair."
msgstr "A garishly-coloured faux fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Although not as warm as natural fur, it gives you some of that unique flair."

msgid "This particular garment has a base hue of dark tan, coated by myriad spots, blobs, and splotches of green, reddish brown, black, and grayish green to form a mottled, disruptive camouflage pattern."
msgstr "This particular garment has a base hue of dark tan, coated by myriad spots, blobs, and splotches of green, reddish brown, black, and greyish green to form a mottled, disruptive camouflage pattern."

msgid "This jacket's exterior shell is dyed a mix of blue and gray hues, with extra patches and disruptive striations, flipping between black and dark gray, covering the garment from collar to hem.  Chrome buttons, zips, and other fixtures glint from their home upon the coat."
msgstr "This jacket's exterior shell is dyed a mix of blue and grey hues, with extra patches and disruptive striations, flipping between black and dark grey, covering the garment from collar to hem.  Chrome buttons, zips, and other fixtures glint from their home upon the coat."

msgid "The fabric of this particular jacket is coated in the pixelized camouflage pattern of the United States Army's former combat uniform, combining a sand-brown base with disruptive patterns of urban gray and sage green, as well as plastic zips and buttons."
msgstr "The fabric of this particular jacket is coated in the pixelized camouflage pattern of the United States Army's former combat uniform, combining a sand-brown base with disruptive patterns of urban grey and sage green, as well as plastic zips and buttons."

msgid "This particular jacket is sown from fabric dyed a base color of stoney gray with notes of brown, sprinkled through with large, splinter-like geometric shapes of green, gray, and hues of deep naval blue."
msgstr "This particular jacket is sown from fabric dyed a base colour of stoney grey with notes of brown, sprinkled through with large, splinter-like geometric shapes of green, grey, and hues of deep naval blue."

msgid "It's colored white, the most common color for chef's jackets."
msgstr "It's coloured white, the most common colour for chef's jackets."

msgid "It's colored black, commonly used by chefs working in the night or who just want to look cool."
msgstr "It's coloured black, commonly used by chefs working in the night or who just want to look cool."

msgid "It's a royal blue color."
msgstr "It's a royal blue colour."

msgid "It's colored red."
msgstr "It's coloured red."

msgid "It's colored pink, commonly used by women chefs or men who like pink."
msgstr "It's coloured pink, commonly used by women chefs or men who like pink."

msgid "It's colored yellow."
msgstr "It's coloured yellow."

msgid "It's colored white, and the front and back are printed with a giant skull between crossed kitchen knives.  Perfect for the apocalyptic chef."
msgstr "It's coloured white, and the front and back are printed with a giant skull between crossed kitchen knives.  Perfect for the apocalyptic chef."

msgid "A jacket made from flannel, favored by outdoorsy types."
msgstr "A jacket made from flannel, favoured by outdoorsy types."

msgid "An old denim jacket.  It has wears in several places and has lost its blue color, but its overall integrity is preserved."
msgstr "An old denim jacket.  It has wears in several places and has lost its blue colour, but its overall integrity is preserved."

msgid "This one has a red torso and beige looking arms.  \"'93\" is embedded on both its arms, and there is a crest you can't recognize on its front right."
msgstr "This one has a red torso and beige looking arms.  \"'93\" is embedded on both its arms, and there is a crest you can't recognise on its front right."

msgid "This one's torso is navy colored and has white arms.  You can see the logo of a well known brand in it."
msgstr "This one's torso is navy coloured and has white arms.  You can see the logo of a well known brand in it."

msgid "An easy-to-wear, breezy robe secured with a sash.  Essentially Japanese pajamas.  Great for summer nights."
msgstr "An easy-to-wear, breezy robe secured with a sash.  Essentially Japanese pyjamas.  Great for summer nights."

msgid "A mysterious and arcane-looking robe, signifying status in the wizarding world.  It has a hood and some pockets for your magical artifacts."
msgstr "A mysterious and arcane-looking robe, signifying status in the wizarding world.  It has a hood and some pockets for your magical artefacts."

msgid "An insulated, breathable hoodie made for alpine skiing.  Very warm, and with sizable pockets."
msgstr "An insulated, breathable hoodie made for alpine skiing.  Very warm, and with sizeable pockets."

msgid "A hooded jacket with lots of pockets, thickly padded for warmth.  Favored by the military."
msgstr "A hooded jacket with lots of pockets, thickly padded for warmth.  Favoured by the military."

msgid "A staple companion of gamesmen whose trade lies within the watery recesses of wetlands, this water-resistant jacket is festooned with profile-disrupting lines and patterns printed in tan, gray, green, and black hues."
msgstr "A staple companion of gamesmen whose trade lies within the watery recesses of wetlands, this water-resistant jacket is festooned with profile-disrupting lines and patterns printed in tan, grey, green, and black hues."

msgid "A comfortable overcoat for the summer-time mountaineer, hiker, or alpine hunter, this predominantly gray jacket is coated in jagged lines and geometric shapes of brown and white dye."
msgstr "A comfortable overcoat for the summer-time mountaineer, hiker, or alpine hunter, this predominantly grey jacket is coated in jagged lines and geometric shapes of brown and white dye."

msgid "This particular pattern of jacket proved a relatively common sight among preppers during the end of days, printed in industrial colors — blacks, grays, and dirty whites — to offer better concealment within New England's man-made battle grounds.  Needless to say, a simple camo pattern proved of little help when push came to actual shove."
msgstr "This particular pattern of jacket proved a relatively common sight among preppers during the end of days, printed in industrial colours — blacks, greys, and dirty whites — to offer better concealment within New England's man-made battle grounds.  Needless to say, a simple camo pattern proved of little help when push came to actual shove."

msgid "Resplendent in a wide assortment of blue and light gray tones, this versatile outerwear is the garment of choice for ocean-side activities, namely ocean activities with less fun sea-side paddling and more marine security and over-the-beach gunfights."
msgstr "Resplendent in a wide assortment of blue and light grey tones, this versatile outerwear is the garment of choice for ocean-side activities, namely ocean activities with less fun sea-side paddling and more marine security and over-the-beach gunfights."

msgid "The fabric of this particular jacket is festooned with a camouflage pattern — a muddle of greens, light blues, browns, and gray — that would make it at home with any river-based huntsman or angler.  Its water-repellent construction ensures that one's possessions are protected from river spray."
msgstr "The fabric of this particular jacket is festooned with a camouflage pattern — a muddle of greens, light blues, browns, and grey — that would make it at home with any river-based huntsman or angler.  Its water-repellent construction ensures that one's possessions are protected from river spray."

msgid "Fit for utility in light snowfall and in the colder months, this jacket, while not as insulating as thicker winter overcoats, is resplendent with a mixed camo palette of snowy white, gray, and a hint of light brown."
msgstr "Fit for utility in light snowfall and in the colder months, this jacket, while not as insulating as thicker winter overcoats, is resplendent with a mixed camo palette of snowy white, grey, and a hint of light brown."

msgid "Subtle and unassuming, save for the purely ludicrous number of pockets it's coated in, this hardy overgarment's outer shell is dyed a muted tone of gray verging into beige."
msgstr "Subtle and unassuming, save for the purely ludicrous number of pockets it's coated in, this hardy overgarment's outer shell is dyed a muted tone of grey verging into beige."

