msgid "3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with metallic fibers for reinforcement.  Thanks to a slim under-layer of synthetic fibers, it provides fantastic defense from small-arms fire, and could take the edge off of a rifle bullet, too.  Designed to clip to the chest and shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
