msgid "A greeting card with a stylized picture of a donut and a coffee cup.  Above the picture, it says 'I am thankful for our friendship' and below are the words 'we are better together'."
msgstr "A greeting card with a stylised picture of a donut and a coffee cup.  Above the picture, it says 'I am thankful for our friendship' and below are the words 'we are better together'."

