msgid "A pair of headphones that cover your ears for improved sound quality and private listening.  This pair is from a well-known brand that is very high quality, with a detachable 1/8\" cable.  Comes with a 1/8\" to 1/4\" adapter."
msgstr "A pair of headphones that cover your ears for improved sound quality and private listening.  This pair is from a well-known brand that is very high quality, with a detachable 1/8\" cable.  Comes with a 1/8\" to 1/4\" adaptor."

msgid "A lightweight telescoping boom stand made of aluminum and painted black.  About 6' tall when full extended, or 3' when closed fully.  Has threads for a mic clip on one end."
msgstr "A lightweight telescoping boom stand made of aluminium and painted black.  About 6' tall when full extended, or 3' when closed fully.  Has threads for a mic clip on one end."

msgid "A small, oddly-shaped piece of aluminum hardware with three legs.  When placed on the ground, this can support one guitar in an upright position."
msgstr "A small, oddly-shaped piece of aluminium hardware with three legs.  When placed on the ground, this can support one guitar in an upright position."

msgid "A synthetic rubber V-belt with steel reinforcement fibers.  Commonly fitted to engines or other industrial equipment."
msgstr "A synthetic rubber V-belt with steel reinforcement fibres.  Commonly fitted to engines or other industrial equipment."

msgid "A length of synthetic fiber weaved into a flat band, usually used to securely fasten passenger inside vehicles."
msgstr "A length of synthetic fibre weaved into a flat band, usually used to securely fasten passenger inside vehicles."

msgid "A colorful, hard plastic ball for playing games on a pool table.  Essentially a rock."
msgstr "A colourful, hard plastic ball for playing games on a pool table.  Essentially a rock."

msgid "A collection of laser guns and targets designed to help you practice shooting.  The spot you 'hit' is displayed on the targets."
msgstr "A collection of laser guns and targets designed to help you practise shooting.  The spot you 'hit' is displayed on the targets."

msgid "A brightly colored beach volleyball.  It is slightly larger than a regular white one."
msgstr "A brightly coloured beach volleyball.  It is slightly larger than a regular white one."

msgid "The MP5/10 served the FBI briefly alongside their 10mm Auto pistols, adding to the caliber's overall mystique.  Though the gun's usage was short-lived, a handful of clones were made and sold occasionally.  This semi-automatic clone manufactured by Brethren Arms features a welded-on M1913 rail and a collapsible arm brace."
msgstr "The MP5/10 served the FBI briefly alongside their 10mm Auto pistols, adding to the calibre's overall mystique.  Though the gun's usage was short-lived, a handful of clones were made and sold occasionally.  This semi-automatic clone manufactured by Brethren Arms features a welded-on M1913 rail and a collapsible arm brace."

msgid "A modernized, match-grade variant of the venerable M1911 chambered in hard-hitting 10mm Auto.  Early variants were known to crack frames; modern 1911s, like this one, are slotted to prevent such crack formation."
msgstr "A modernised, match-grade variant of the venerable M1911 chambered in hard-hitting 10mm Auto.  Early variants were known to crack frames; modern 1911s, like this one, are slotted to prevent such crack formation."

msgid "Utilizing a powerful and unusual caliber, the Rivtech RM120c caseless pump-action shotgun was designed for hunting big game, with durability and ease of use as priorities."
msgstr "Utilising a powerful and unusual calibre, the Rivtech RM120c caseless pump-action shotgun was designed for hunting big game, with durability and ease of use as priorities."

msgid "Utilizing a powerful and unusual caliber, the Rivtech RM20 caseless automatic combat shotgun was designed with durability and overwhelming power in mind."
msgstr "Utilising a powerful and unusual calibre, the Rivtech RM20 caseless automatic combat shotgun was designed with durability and overwhelming power in mind."

msgid "Chambering the powerful 20x66mm caseless shotgun cartridge, the Rivtech RM228 PDW was designed for the civilian personal defense market with durability and ease of use as priorities.  While lauded for its small size and light weight, its hefty price tag kept it out of the reach of casual collectors."
msgstr "Chambering the powerful 20x66mm caseless shotgun cartridge, the Rivtech RM228 PDW was designed for the civilian personal defence market with durability and ease of use as priorities.  While lauded for its small size and light weight, its hefty price tag kept it out of the reach of casual collectors."

msgid "A venerable .22 caliber lever-action rifle, with a 19-round tube magazine and a classic design that dates back over a century.  Generally used for the hunting of small game like rabbits, the strict taxonomic classification of zombies as 'small game' is debatable, but this decades-old weapon can still be counted upon to help manage the undead population."
msgstr "A venerable .22 calibre lever-action rifle, with a 19-round tube magazine and a classic design that dates back over a century.  Generally used for the hunting of small game like rabbits, the strict taxonomic classification of zombies as 'small game' is debatable, but this decades-old weapon can still be counted upon to help manage the undead population."

msgid "A lightweight and modular pistol caliber hunting carbine, firing the low power .22 LR cartridge.  Before the Cataclysm, a mix of high customizability, cheap ammunition, and low recoil made this a very popular varmint rifle among civilian shooters."
msgstr "A lightweight and modular pistol calibre hunting carbine, firing the low power .22 LR cartridge.  Before the Cataclysm, a mix of high customizability, cheap ammunition, and low recoil made this a very popular varmint rifle among civilian shooters."

msgid "A combination of negligible recoil, high customization, and inexpensive ammunition made the Ruger 10/22 a popular choice among enthusiasts and small game hunters.  Even though it fires the weak .22 round, it's perfectly capable of killing."
msgstr "A combination of negligible recoil, high customisation, and inexpensive ammunition made the Ruger 10/22 a popular choice among enthusiasts and small game hunters.  Even though it fires the weak .22 round, it's perfectly capable of killing."

msgid ".22 caliber revolver"
msgid_plural ".22 caliber revolvers"
msgstr[0] ".22 calibre revolver"
msgstr[1] ".22 calibre revolvers"

msgid "A compact, double-action-only revolver designed for easy concealment, with a stainless steel cylinder and aluminum frame."
msgstr "A compact, double-action-only revolver designed for easy concealment, with a stainless steel cylinder and aluminium frame."

msgid "A medium sized, .22 caliber semi-automatic pistol, for training with a pistol similar to more powerful pistols.  Built from aluminum and polymer components, the weapon is lightweight and concealable, but its chambering is not very powerful."
msgstr "A medium sized, .22 calibre semi-automatic pistol, for training with a pistol similar to more powerful pistols.  Built from aluminium and polymer components, the weapon is lightweight and concealable, but its chambering is not very powerful."

msgid "A lightweight, wood framed pump action rifle, holding 15 rounds of .22 with an 18 inch barrel.  While pump actions tend to be largely shotguns, they can be made in calibers such as .22 LR."
msgstr "A lightweight, wood framed pump action rifle, holding 15 rounds of .22 with an 18 inch barrel.  While pump actions tend to be largely shotguns, they can be made in calibres such as .22 LR."

msgid "A modern .22 LR lever-action rifle, the Henry Golden Boy features an 20\" octagonal barrel with 16 rounds of ammo in its tube magazine, which is loaded from the front of the rifle.  It fairly resembles the original Henry Model 1860 with its brass colored receiver, though with wooden furniture at the front, and without a doubt using modern manufacturing."
msgstr "A modern .22 LR lever-action rifle, the Henry Golden Boy features an 20\" octagonal barrel with 16 rounds of ammo in its tube magazine, which is loaded from the front of the rifle.  It fairly resembles the original Henry Model 1860 with its brass coloured receiver, though with wooden furniture at the front, and without a doubt using modern manufacturing."

msgid "The common AR-15 platform, with its stock removed and buffer tube covered by a thick, padded sleeve that allows the user to brace it like a rifle.  AR pistols lack stocks, or have arm braces due to restrictions on short barreled rifles, and so without a stock, they're legally classified as a pistol."
msgstr "The common AR-15 platform, with its stock removed and buffer tube covered by a thick, padded sleeve that allows the user to brace it like a rifle.  AR pistols lack stocks, or have arm braces due to restrictions on short barrelled rifles, and so without a stock, they're legally classified as a pistol."

msgid "A handy bolt-action offering from CZ, the 600 Trail is a box magazine-fed ranch rifle that utilizes an aluminum chassis to keep its overall heft to a minimum.  Possessing an extendable buttstock, extensive modularity, and a quick-swap barrel assembly switchable to accommodate the firing of either .223 or 7.62x39mm ammunition, the rifle was intended for use by backpackers, trail hikers, and preppers."
msgstr "A handy bolt-action offering from CZ, the 600 Trail is a box magazine-fed ranch rifle that utilises an aluminium chassis to keep its overall heft to a minimum.  Possessing an extendable buttstock, extensive modularity, and a quick-swap barrel assembly switchable to accommodate the firing of either .223 or 7.62x39mm ammunition, the rifle was intended for use by backpackers, trail hikers, and preppers."

msgid "This is a semi-automatic bullpup rifle with a lightened body due to the use of polymers and aluminum, using standard magazines of the AR-15 platform and a 5.56x45mm cartridge."
msgstr "This is a semi-automatic bullpup rifle with a lightened body due to the use of polymers and aluminium, using standard magazines of the AR-15 platform and a 5.56x45mm cartridge."

msgid "This is a semi-automatic bullpup rifle with a lightened body due to the use of polymers and aluminum, using standard magazines from the AR-15 platform and the 5.56 NATO cartridge.  The name stands for rifle, downward-ejection, bullpup, and its design was intended to incorporate some technical solutions, such as downward case ejection and convenience for left-handers, to solve some problems with bullpup guns.  However, the good idea's execution is not as perfect as the manufacturer (and user) would like.  No good idea from Kel-Tec is immune to Kel-Tec manufacturing issues, sadly."
msgstr "This is a semi-automatic bullpup rifle with a lightened body due to the use of polymers and aluminium, using standard magazines from the AR-15 platform and the 5.56 NATO cartridge.  The name stands for rifle, downward-ejection, bullpup, and its design was intended to incorporate some technical solutions, such as downward case ejection and convenience for left-handers, to solve some problems with bullpup guns.  However, the good idea's execution is not as perfect as the manufacturer (and user) would like.  No good idea from Kel-Tec is immune to Kel-Tec manufacturing issues, sadly."

msgid "Featuring a handsome set of wooden furnishings, a classic design, and a no nonsense .270 caliber chambering, this is a powerful hunting rifle.  With a tried and proven pedigree dating back over 60 years, millions of such rugged arms have been made, exported, and used throughout the United States and the world at large.  Where hunting is concerned, this is a highly capable and well proven weapon in all respects.  Fortunate, given that your prey in these dark days may turn out to be a little bit more feisty than typical White-Tailed deer, moose, and black bears."
msgstr "Featuring a handsome set of wooden furnishings, a classic design, and a no nonsense .270 calibre chambering, this is a powerful hunting rifle.  With a tried and proven pedigree dating back over 60 years, millions of such rugged arms have been made, exported, and used throughout the United States and the world at large.  Where hunting is concerned, this is a highly capable and well proven weapon in all respects.  Fortunate, given that your prey in these dark days may turn out to be a little bit more feisty than typical White-Tailed deer, moose, and black bears."

msgid "A classic bolt-action rifle chambered for .270 Winchester, very popular among hunters.  This is a CDL SF model with a forged, fluted, 416 stainless steel barrel threaded into the receiver and a recessed bolt face.  It has checkered walnut furniture and a recoil pad to reduce perceived recoil."
msgstr "A classic bolt-action rifle chambered for .270 Winchester, very popular among hunters.  This is a CDL SF model with a forged, fluted, 416 stainless steel barrel threaded into the receiver and a recessed bolt face.  It has chequered walnut furniture and a recoil pad to reduce perceived recoil."

msgid "The Browning BLR is notable for being a lever-action rifle, chambered in calibers with spitzer bullets.  This is unusual for lever-actions, as a spitzer bullet risks setting off other cartridges in a typical tube magazine.  The BLR gets around this issue by utilizing box magazines instead, making it quite unique among other lever-action rifles.  This one is chambered for 30-06."
msgstr "The Browning BLR is notable for being a lever-action rifle, chambered in calibres with spitzer bullets.  This is unusual for lever-actions, as a spitzer bullet risks setting off other cartridges in a typical tube magazine.  The BLR gets around this issue by utilising box magazines instead, making it quite unique among other lever-action rifles.  This one is chambered for 30-06."

msgid "A powerful military rifle originally chambered in .30-03 Springfield, developed to replace the US Army's older Krag rifle.  It was quickly rechambered into the .30-06 caliber with its spitzer bullet.  While an American rifle produced and developed around WW1, manufacturing couldn't keep up with demand, and saw service alongside the M1917 Enfield, a British rifle rechambered for the American 30-06.  It saw service as a sniper rifle up to the Vietnam War, but nowadays is mainly used by civilians, either as hunting rifles or in collections."
msgstr "A powerful military rifle originally chambered in .30-03 Springfield, developed to replace the US Army's older Krag rifle.  It was quickly rechambered into the .30-06 calibre with its spitzer bullet.  While an American rifle produced and developed around WW1, manufacturing couldn't keep up with demand, and saw service alongside the M1917 Enfield, a British rifle rechambered for the American 30-06.  It saw service as a sniper rifle up to the Vietnam War, but nowadays is mainly used by civilians, either as hunting rifles or in collections."

msgid "A popular bolt-action hunting rifle first introduced in 2006, the Ruger M77 was originally intended to be a modernized Mauser 98-style long gun.  To this end, the weapon features a Mauser-type fixed blade extractor and an angled large screw that tightly beds the action into the stock.  This particular rifle is a variant with additional features, a smoother trigger, and a recontoured buttstock."
msgstr "A popular bolt-action hunting rifle first introduced in 2006, the Ruger M77 was originally intended to be a modernised Mauser 98-style long gun.  To this end, the weapon features a Mauser-type fixed blade extractor and an angled large screw that tightly beds the action into the stock.  This particular rifle is a variant with additional features, a smoother trigger, and a recontoured buttstock."

msgid "An iconic weapon of both the First and Second World Wars, this bolt-action rifle has seen deployment in the hands of Commonwealth troops across Europe and beyond.  Firing the .303-caliber cartridge and making use of 10-round Enfield magazines, the firearm's reputation precedes it."
msgstr "An iconic weapon of both the First and Second World Wars, this bolt-action rifle has seen deployment in the hands of Commonwealth troops across Europe and beyond.  Firing the .303-calibre cartridge and making use of 10-round Enfield magazines, the firearm's reputation precedes it."

msgid "An English darling and icon of the First World War, the Short Magazine Lee-Enfield Mk III was the standard issue battle rifle of the British commonwealth from 1907.  Chambered for .303 ammunition, the rifle makes use of ten-round detachable magazines.  With its full-length wooden handguard, brass buttplate, and smooth action, the Lee-Enfield cuts a recognizable profile in either the trenches of the Great War or the zombie-strewn wastelands."
msgstr "An English darling and icon of the First World War, the Short Magazine Lee-Enfield Mk III was the standard issue battle rifle of the British commonwealth from 1907.  Chambered for .303 ammunition, the rifle makes use of ten-round detachable magazines.  With its full-length wooden handguard, brass buttplate, and smooth action, the Lee-Enfield cuts a recognisable profile in either the trenches of the Great War or the zombie-strewn wastelands."

msgid "An evolution of Britain's First World War battle rifle, this bolt-action firearm uses the same .303-caliber cartridge as its forerunner.  Much beloved across the globe by collectors, rifles like this served as England's infantry rifle well into the 1950s, with a specialized sniper variant remaining in service until the early nineties."
msgstr "An evolution of Britain's First World War battle rifle, this bolt-action firearm uses the same .303-calibre cartridge as its forerunner.  Much beloved across the globe by collectors, rifles like this served as England's infantry rifle well into the 1950s, with a specialised sniper variant remaining in service until the early nineties."

msgid "A Second World War progression of the British Commonwealth's Lee-Enfield battle rifle, the No. 4 began its decades-long service life in 1939.  Externally similar to its forefather, the rifle possesses a reinforced receiver, an adjusted nose cap, and a heavier barrel.  Still chambered for the same .303-caliber cartridge, the No. 4 represents one of the most populous firearm imports in U.S. history."
msgstr "A Second World War progression of the British Commonwealth's Lee-Enfield battle rifle, the No. 4 began its decades-long service life in 1939.  Externally similar to its forefather, the rifle possesses a reinforced receiver, an adjusted nose cap, and a heavier barrel.  Still chambered for the same .303-calibre cartridge, the No. 4 represents one of the most populous firearm imports in U.S. history."

msgid "Originally designed during the Cold War, this gun is probably the most successful battle rifle ever designed.  Despite being labeled as obsolete, its tunable gas system ensures both reliability and low recoil, allowing the FAL to keep up even among modern competitors.  This is a semi-automatic clone built by a domestic manufacturer."
msgstr "Originally designed during the Cold War, this gun is probably the most successful battle rifle ever designed.  Despite being labelled as obsolete, its tunable gas system ensures both reliability and low recoil, allowing the FAL to keep up even among modern competitors.  This is a semi-automatic clone built by a domestic manufacturer."

msgid "Originally designed during the Cold War, the FAL is probably the most successful battle rifle ever designed.  Despite being labeled as obsolete, its tunable gas system ensures both reliability and low recoil, allowing the FAL to keep up even among modern competitors.  This is a semi-automatic clone of the SA-58 pattern built by DSA."
msgstr "Originally designed during the Cold War, the FAL is probably the most successful battle rifle ever designed.  Despite being labelled as obsolete, its tunable gas system ensures both reliability and low recoil, allowing the FAL to keep up even among modern competitors.  This is a semi-automatic clone of the SA-58 pattern built by DSA."

msgid "The M60 is a general-purpose machine gun developed to replace the .30-caliber M1918 and M1919.  Heavy and difficult to handle fired from the shoulder, as most people aren't action-movie heroes."
msgstr "The M60 is a general-purpose machine gun developed to replace the .30-calibre M1918 and M1919.  Heavy and difficult to handle fired from the shoulder, as most people aren't action-movie heroes."

msgid "A gas-operated, rotating bolt rifle accurate to 1.5 MOA with standard ammunition, and featuring an aluminum upper receiver for reduced weight."
msgstr "A gas-operated, rotating bolt rifle accurate to 1.5 MOA with standard ammunition, and featuring an aluminium upper receiver for reduced weight."

msgid "A derivative of H&K's G28 with an aluminum upper receiver to meet US Army weight requirements.  It is a gas-operated, rotating bolt rifle accurate to 1.5 MOA with standard ammunition."
msgstr "A derivative of H&K's G28 with an aluminium upper receiver to meet US Army weight requirements.  It is a gas-operated, rotating bolt rifle accurate to 1.5 MOA with standard ammunition."

msgid "This is a semi-automatic bullpup rifle with a lightened body due to the use of polymers and aluminum, using standard magazines of the heavy automatic rifle and a 7.62x51mm cartridge."
msgstr "This is a semi-automatic bullpup rifle with a lightened body due to the use of polymers and aluminium, using standard magazines of the heavy automatic rifle and a 7.62x51mm cartridge."

msgid "This is a versatile, all-purpose hunting rifle.  To this end, it is exceedingly lightweight, contains an inbuilt polymer bipod, and fits a spare magazine inside the stock for fast reloading.  While these features made for a hunting rifle too universal for widespread adoption, they might yet fulfill a vital scouting niche for survivors in the post-Cataclysm world."
msgstr "This is a versatile, all-purpose hunting rifle.  To this end, it is exceedingly lightweight, contains an inbuilt polymer bipod, and fits a spare magazine inside the stock for fast reloading.  While these features made for a hunting rifle too universal for widespread adoption, they might yet fulfil a vital scouting niche for survivors in the post-Cataclysm world."

msgid "The Steyr Scout is Steyr's interpretation of Jeff Cooper's concept of a 'scout rifle', a versatile, all-purpose hunting rifle.  To this end, it is exceedingly lightweight, and contains a built-in polymer bipod, and fits a spare magazine inside the stock for fast reloading.  While these features made for a hunting rifle too universal for widespread adoption, they might yet fulfill a vital scouting niche for survivors in the post-Cataclysm world."
msgstr "The Steyr Scout is Steyr's interpretation of Jeff Cooper's concept of a 'scout rifle', a versatile, all-purpose hunting rifle.  To this end, it is exceedingly lightweight, and contains a built-in polymer bipod, and fits a spare magazine inside the stock for fast reloading.  While these features made for a hunting rifle too universal for widespread adoption, they might yet fulfil a vital scouting niche for survivors in the post-Cataclysm world."

msgid "Chambering the .338 Lapua cartridge, the Tac-338 is a high-precision, bolt-action sniper rifle that, before the Cataclysm, complemented the arsenal of the US Navy Special Warfare unit.  Providing Navy SEAL marksmen with the capability to land effective shots on targets at a typical range of 1600 meters, a valuable capability for the long-distance engagements prevalent during the US army's war on terror, the rifle comes kitted with an adjustable cheek pad, butt hook, and muzzle break."
msgstr "Chambering the .338 Lapua cartridge, the Tac-338 is a high-precision, bolt-action sniper rifle that, before the Cataclysm, complemented the arsenal of the US Navy Special Warfare unit.  Providing Navy SEAL marksmen with the capability to land effective shots on targets at a typical range of 1600 metres, a valuable capability for the long-distance engagements prevalent during the US army's war on terror, the rifle comes kitted with an adjustable cheek pad, butt hook, and muzzle break."

msgid "Chambered for the .338 Lapua cartridge, the Barrett MRAD SMR is a civilian variant of the MK22 MRAD sniper rifle, which was in service with elements of the US army and is often regarded as one of the finest bolt-action sniper rifles ever developed.  The primary differences that set this weapon apart from its Marshal sibling are the removal of the MRAD's caliber conversion capabilities and the installation of a fixed buttstock.  These changes have resulted in a lighter and slimmer rifle that, most importantly for the discerning pre-Cataclysmic precision shooter, didn't require a second mortgage to purchase."
msgstr "Chambered for the .338 Lapua cartridge, the Barrett MRAD SMR is a civilian variant of the MK22 MRAD sniper rifle, which was in service with elements of the US army and is often regarded as one of the finest bolt-action sniper rifles ever developed.  The primary differences that set this weapon apart from its Marshal sibling are the removal of the MRAD's calibre conversion capabilities and the installation of a fixed buttstock.  These changes have resulted in a lighter and slimmer rifle that, most importantly for the discerning pre-Cataclysmic precision shooter, didn't require a second mortgage to purchase."

msgid "A weapon platform that prides itself on modularity and customizability, this highly accurate precision rifle may be configured with various caliber conversion kits that can allow it to fire either the .338 Lapua, .300 Win Mag, or .308 Winchester cartridges.  The rifle's size prevents it from being a particularly mobile piece of equipment, but the weapon's folding buttstock aids in portability."
msgstr "A weapon platform that prides itself on modularity and customizability, this highly accurate precision rifle may be configured with various calibre conversion kits that can allow it to fire either the .338 Lapua, .300 Win Mag, or .308 Winchester cartridges.  The rifle's size prevents it from being a particularly mobile piece of equipment, but the weapon's folding buttstock aids in portability."

msgid "Produced by the British precision rifle company Accuracy International, the AX Modular Caliber Weapon System is a highly-accurate combat sniper rifle offered to military, law enforcement, and civilian precision marksmen.  The rifle is compatible with a wide range of aftermarket components, including caliber conversion kits, and is built upon a base aluminum chassis, into which the weapon's parts may be installed or removed at the user's discretion."
msgstr "Produced by the British precision rifle company Accuracy International, the AX Modular Calibre Weapon System is a highly-accurate combat sniper rifle offered to military, law enforcement, and civilian precision marksmen.  The rifle is compatible with a wide range of aftermarket components, including calibre conversion kits, and is built upon a base aluminium chassis, into which the weapon's parts may be installed or removed at the user's discretion."

msgid "The Colt Model 1861 Navy cap & ball .36-caliber revolver was a six-shot, single-action percussion weapon produced by Colt's Manufacturing Company from 1861 until 1873."
msgstr "The Colt Model 1861 Navy cap & ball .36-calibre revolver was a six-shot, single-action percussion weapon produced by Colt's Manufacturing Company from 1861 until 1873."

msgid "The Model 10 is one of the oldest firearm models still in production, and most produced handguns, with production dating back to 1899.  Starting life as the Model 1899 Hand Ejector, it only picked up the current name of Model 10 in the 1950s.  Despite .38 Special and .357 Magnum being the same caliber, Model 10s were produced to handle blackpowder loads, and while modern smokeless loads of .38 Special work fine, .357 Magnum could cause the Model 10 to catastrophically fail."
msgstr "The Model 10 is one of the oldest firearm models still in production, and most produced handguns, with production dating back to 1899.  Starting life as the Model 1899 Hand Ejector, it only picked up the current name of Model 10 in the 1950s.  Despite .38 Special and .357 Magnum being the same calibre, Model 10s were produced to handle blackpowder loads, and while modern smokeless loads of .38 Special work fine, .357 Magnum could cause the Model 10 to catastrophically fail."

msgid "The Ruger LCR (Lightweight Compact Revolver) is a modern revolver, starting production in just 2010.  It's a lightweight, aluminum-framed revolver, designed for conceal carry with its double-action-only trigger, lightweight and compact size.  Due to the double-action trigger, it is more possible to carry it in your pocket instead of a holster due to the heavy trigger, but still ill-advised."
msgstr "The Ruger LCR (Lightweight Compact Revolver) is a modern revolver, starting production in just 2010.  It's a lightweight, aluminium-framed revolver, designed for conceal carry with its double-action-only trigger, lightweight and compact size.  Due to the double-action trigger, it is more possible to carry it in your pocket instead of a holster due to the heavy trigger, but still ill-advised."

msgid "A six inch revolver chambered in .357 Magnum/.38 Special.  Favorite of sheriffs and post-Cataclysm survivor group leaders."
msgstr "A six inch revolver chambered in .357 Magnum/.38 Special.  Favourite of sheriffs and post-Cataclysm survivor group leaders."

msgid ".357-caliber snub-nosed revolver"
msgid_plural ".357-caliber snub-nosed revolver"
msgstr[0] ".357-calibre snub-nosed revolver"
msgstr[1] ".357-calibre snub-nosed revolver"

msgid "Short, stout, and compact, this stainless steel revolver is a handy dispenser of .357-magnum, or lower-power .38-caliber, cartridges.  Six rounds fit within the weapon, though its small stature and short barrel ensure that each pull of the trigger is all but a pyrotechnic spectacle: flashy, loud, and jumpy."
msgstr "Short, stout, and compact, this stainless steel revolver is a handy dispenser of .357-magnum, or lower-power .38-calibre, cartridges.  Six rounds fit within the weapon, though its small stature and short barrel ensure that each pull of the trigger is all but a pyrotechnic spectacle: flashy, loud, and jumpy."

msgid "A small frame, stainless-steel Brazilian wheel gun with rubberized grips, a serrated front sight, and a satin finish, boasting a 6-round cylinder of .357-magnum persuasion.  Affordable, before the world collapsed, and confidently asserted by Rossi themselves to be the ideal carry gun for its rounded butt and 3-inch barrel, you aren't wholly sure that such assertions accounted for zombies."
msgstr "A small frame, stainless-steel Brazilian wheel gun with rubberised grips, a serrated front sight, and a satin finish, boasting a 6-round cylinder of .357-magnum persuasion.  Affordable, before the world collapsed, and confidently asserted by Rossi themselves to be the ideal carry gun for its rounded butt and 3-inch barrel, you aren't wholly sure that such assertions accounted for zombies."

msgid "long-barreled .357 lever-action rifle"
msgid_plural "long-barreled .357 lever-action rifles"
msgstr[0] "long-barrelled .357 lever-action rifle"
msgstr[1] "long-barrelled .357 lever-action rifles"

msgid "The R92 is a widely successful line of lever-action rifles from Rossi, featuring a wide array of different calibers and barrel lengths.  These aim to be less reproductions of old rifles, but rather modern takes on the lever-action formula.  This particular one features wooden furniture, a 20\" barrel, and 10 rounds of .357 Magnum or .38 Special."
msgstr "The R92 is a widely successful line of lever-action rifles from Rossi, featuring a wide array of different calibres and barrel lengths.  These aim to be less reproductions of old rifles, but rather modern takes on the lever-action formula.  This particular one features wooden furniture, a 20\" barrel, and 10 rounds of .357 Magnum or .38 Special."

msgid "The R92 is a widely successful line of lever-action rifles from Rossi, featuring a wide array of different calibers and barrel lengths.  These aim to be less reproductions of old rifles, but rather modern takes on the lever-action formula.  This particular one features wooden furniture, a 16\" barrel, and 8 rounds of .357 Magnum or .38 Special."
msgstr "The R92 is a widely successful line of lever-action rifles from Rossi, featuring a wide array of different calibres and barrel lengths.  These aim to be less reproductions of old rifles, but rather modern takes on the lever-action formula.  This particular one features wooden furniture, a 16\" barrel, and 8 rounds of .357 Magnum or .38 Special."

msgid "This .38 revolver is quite small and lightweight, due to its short barrel and aluminum material."
msgstr "This .38 revolver is quite small and lightweight, due to its short barrel and aluminium material."

msgid "A modern version of the Airweight, the 642 is a lightweight .38 caliber revolver, made with an aluminum frame."
msgstr "A modern version of the Airweight, the 642 is a lightweight .38 calibre revolver, made with an aluminium frame."

msgid ".380 ACP pistol-caliber carbine"
msgid_plural ".380 ACP pistol-caliber carbines"
msgstr[0] ".380 ACP pistol-calibre carbine"
msgstr[1] ".380 ACP pistol-calibre carbines"

msgid "A pistol-caliber carbine chambered in .380 ACP.  It is more powerful and accurate than an equivalent pistol but the .380 ACP round is nonetheless fairly weak.  Accepts 10-round magazines, which are not shared with any .380 ACP pistol unlike many other similar pistol-caliber carbines."
msgstr "A pistol-calibre carbine chambered in .380 ACP.  It is more powerful and accurate than an equivalent pistol but the .380 ACP round is nonetheless fairly weak.  Accepts 10-round magazines, which are not shared with any .380 ACP pistol unlike many other similar pistol-calibre carbines."

msgid "A pistol-caliber carbine chambered in .380 ACP, designed by Hi-Point Firearms.  Its 16.5\" barrel provides extra stopping power over an equivalent pistol, but .380 is still a relatively weak caliber.  Accepts 10-round magazines, which are notably not interchangeable with those of CF380 pistols."
msgstr "A pistol-calibre carbine chambered in .380 ACP, designed by Hi-Point Firearms.  Its 16.5\" barrel provides extra stopping power over an equivalent pistol, but .380 is still a relatively weak calibre.  Accepts 10-round magazines, which are notably not interchangeable with those of CF380 pistols."

msgid "A now-discontinued conceal carry gun, the S&W Bodyguard is a small and lightweight conceal carry gun, firing the .380 ACP cartridge.  Despite the short barrel and weak cartridge, it is still enough for self defense.  Even though it's discontinued, it still remains as a very popular firearm."
msgstr "A now-discontinued conceal carry gun, the S&W Bodyguard is a small and lightweight conceal carry gun, firing the .380 ACP cartridge.  Despite the short barrel and weak cartridge, it is still enough for self defence.  Even though it's discontinued, it still remains as a very popular firearm."

msgid "Lighter than Beretta's iconic 92 series of guns, the Px4 Storm was built by utilizing light-weight polymer construction with steel inserts.  Its shape was also optimized for concealed carry.  This one is chambered in .40 S&W."
msgstr "Lighter than Beretta's iconic 92 series of guns, the Px4 Storm was built by utilising light-weight polymer construction with steel inserts.  Its shape was also optimised for concealed carry.  This one is chambered in .40 S&W."

msgid "Needing little introduction, the Desert Eagle's impact on popular culture is almost as massive as the pistol itself.  The newest Mark XIX model introduced a more modern optics rail.  It was sold in multiple hard-hitting magnum calibers and can swap between them using conversion kits and the appropriate magazine."
msgstr "Needing little introduction, the Desert Eagle's impact on popular culture is almost as massive as the pistol itself.  The newest Mark XIX model introduced a more modern optics rail.  It was sold in multiple hard-hitting magnum calibres and can swap between them using conversion kits and the appropriate magazine."

msgid "Needing little introduction, the Desert Eagle's impact on popular culture is almost as massive as the pistol itself.  The newest Mark XIX model introduced a more modern optics rail.  It was sold in multiple hard-hitting magnum calibers and can swap between them using conversion kits and the appropriate magazine.  For maximum style points (or tackiness, depending on taste), this one is plated in what appears to be 24-karat gold."
msgstr "Needing little introduction, the Desert Eagle's impact on popular culture is almost as massive as the pistol itself.  The newest Mark XIX model introduced a more modern optics rail.  It was sold in multiple hard-hitting magnum calibres and can swap between them using conversion kits and the appropriate magazine.  For maximum style points (or tackiness, depending on taste), this one is plated in what appears to be 24-karat gold."

msgid "A large-frame revolver with a modern plastic handle.  Too large for law enforcement, it was mostly used by sport shooters and hunters, for the manufacturer deemed it to be the most accurate .44-caliber revolver in their line.  This one has an extended 8-inch barrel."
msgstr "A large-frame revolver with a modern plastic handle.  Too large for law enforcement, it was mostly used by sport shooters and hunters, for the manufacturer deemed it to be the most accurate .44-calibre revolver in their line.  This one has an extended 8-inch barrel."

