msgid "The R92 is a widely successful line of lever-action rifles from Rossi, featuring a wide array of different calibers and barrel lengths.  These aim to be less reproductions of old rifles, but rather modern takes on the lever-action formula.  This particular one features all-black furniture, a 16\" barrel, and 8 rounds of .44 Magnum, along with a large lever loop."
