msgid "Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .223-caliber munitions and requiring STANAG magazines for feeding, the assembly makes the most from the weapon's bullpup design with a 20-inch barrel configuration, coaxing increased terminal performance from fired rounds."
msgstr "Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .223-calibre munitions and requiring STANAG magazines for feeding, the assembly makes the most from the weapon's bullpup design with a 20-inch barrel configuration, coaxing increased terminal performance from fired rounds."

msgid "Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .223-caliber munitions, the assembly requires STANAG magazines for feeding."
msgstr "Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .223-calibre munitions, the assembly requires STANAG magazines for feeding."

msgid "Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .223-caliber munitions and requiring STANAG magazines for feeding, the assembly renders the MDRX into a compact CQB carbine, with an 11.5-inch barrel recessed into the weapon's bullpup layout."
msgstr "Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .223-calibre munitions and requiring STANAG magazines for feeding, the assembly renders the MDRX into a compact CQB carbine, with an 11.5-inch barrel recessed into the weapon's bullpup layout."

msgid "This is a specialized 27-inch .338-caliber barrel and bolt face that is installable within the main chassis of an Accuracy International AXMC rifle, converting it to fire the .338 Lapua cartridge."
msgstr "This is a specialised 27-inch .338-calibre barrel and bolt face that is installable within the main chassis of an Accuracy International AXMC rifle, converting it to fire the .338 Lapua cartridge."

msgid "This is a specialized 24-inch .300-caliber barrel and bolt face that is installable within the main chassis of an Accuracy International AXMC rifle, converting it to fire the .300 Winchester Magnum cartridge."
msgstr "This is a specialised 24-inch .300-calibre barrel and bolt face that is installable within the main chassis of an Accuracy International AXMC rifle, converting it to fire the .300 Winchester Magnum cartridge."

msgid "This is a specialized 24-inch .308-caliber barrel and bolt face that is installable within the main chassis of an Accuracy International AXMC rifle, converting it to fire the .308 Winchester cartridge."
msgstr "This is a specialised 24-inch .308-calibre barrel and bolt face that is installable within the main chassis of an Accuracy International AXMC rifle, converting it to fire the .308 Winchester cartridge."

msgid "This is a quick-detach .223-caliber barrel assembly and bolt-head, installable within the frame of a CZ 600 rifle, and secured with three fasteners.  With this assembly installed, a rifle is capable of feeding ammunition from standard STANAG-style magazines."
msgstr "This is a quick-detach .223-calibre barrel assembly and bolt-head, installable within the frame of a CZ 600 rifle, and secured with three fasteners.  With this assembly installed, a rifle is capable of feeding ammunition from standard STANAG-style magazines."

msgid "This is a caliber conversion for a Desert Eagle pistol, allowing it to shoot .357 Magnum ammunition.  It includes the barrel and the reduced-diameter bolt.  Don't forget the .357 magazine!"
msgstr "This is a calibre conversion for a Desert Eagle pistol, allowing it to shoot .357 Magnum ammunition.  It includes the barrel and the reduced-diameter bolt.  Don't forget the .357 magazine!"

msgid "This is a caliber conversion for a Desert Eagle pistol, allowing it to shoot .44 Magnum ammunition.  It includes the barrel, sporting an integral muzzle brake, and the standard-diameter bolt.  Don't forget the .44 magazine!"
msgstr "This is a calibre conversion for a Desert Eagle pistol, allowing it to shoot .44 Magnum ammunition.  It includes the barrel, sporting an integral muzzle brake, and the standard-diameter bolt.  Don't forget the .44 magazine!"

msgid "This is a caliber conversion for a Desert Eagle pistol, allowing it to shoot the infamous .50 Action Express round.  It includes the barrel, sporting an integral muzzle brake, and the standard-diameter bolt.  Don't forget the .50 magazine!"
msgstr "This is a calibre conversion for a Desert Eagle pistol, allowing it to shoot the infamous .50 Action Express round.  It includes the barrel, sporting an integral muzzle brake, and the standard-diameter bolt.  Don't forget the .50 magazine!"

msgid "This is a caliber conversion for a UMP sub-machine gun allowing it to shoot 9x19mm ammo.  It includes the barrel and the bolt.  Don't forget the 9mm UMP magazine!"
msgstr "This is a calibre conversion for a UMP sub-machine gun allowing it to shoot 9x19mm ammo.  It includes the barrel and the bolt.  Don't forget the 9mm UMP magazine!"

msgid "This is a caliber conversion for a UMP sub-machine gun allowing it to shoot .40 S&W ammo.  It includes the barrel and the bolt.  Don't forget the .40 UMP magazine!"
msgstr "This is a calibre conversion for a UMP sub-machine gun allowing it to shoot .40 S&W ammo.  It includes the barrel and the bolt.  Don't forget the .40 UMP magazine!"

msgid "This is a caliber conversion for a UMP sub-machine gun allowing it to shoot .45 ACP ammo.  It includes the barrel and the bolt.  Don't forget the .45 UMP magazine!"
msgstr "This is a calibre conversion for a UMP sub-machine gun allowing it to shoot .45 ACP ammo.  It includes the barrel and the bolt.  Don't forget the .45 UMP magazine!"

msgid "A set of electronics to optimize emitter workcycle and increase overall energy efficiency.  Decreases power consumption."
msgstr "A set of electronics to optimise emitter workcycle and increase overall energy efficiency.  Decreases power consumption."

msgid "A relatively simple switch or button mechanism that replaces the back plate of a Glock slide, allowing it to function as a select-fire machine pistol.  A highly illegal modification, but the feds are zombie food anyway.  This will fit any standard Glock pistol in 9mm, .40, .45, 10mm, or .357 caliber."
msgstr "A relatively simple switch or button mechanism that replaces the back plate of a Glock slide, allowing it to function as a select-fire machine pistol.  A highly illegal modification, but the feds are zombie food anyway.  This will fit any standard Glock pistol in 9mm, .40, .45, 10mm, or .357 calibre."

msgid "A complex set of parts designed to minimize recoil using a reciprocating counterweight."
msgstr "A complex set of parts designed to minimise recoil using a reciprocating counterweight."

msgid "A suppressor designed for pistols, submachine guns, and pistol caliber carbines.  Gunfire is extremely loud and can damage your hearing without protection; a suppressor will bring the loudness of a report down to generally safe levels."
msgstr "A suppressor designed for pistols, submachine guns, and pistol calibre carbines.  Gunfire is extremely loud and can damage your hearing without protection; a suppressor will bring the loudness of a report down to generally safe levels."

msgid "A set of adjustable optic fiber aiming pins with a bracket to mount on modern bows.  It takes more time to calibrate but can improve accuracy more effectively."
msgstr "A set of adjustable optic fibre aiming pins with a bracket to mount on modern bows.  It takes more time to calibrate but can improve accuracy more effectively."

msgid "A single aluminum pin with a bracket to mount on modern bows.  Quick to use."
msgstr "A single aluminium pin with a bracket to mount on modern bows.  Quick to use."

msgid "A grip placed forward on the barrel allows for greater control.  Not as effective as a bipod but usable under all conditions.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon, if you so want."
msgstr "A grip placed forward on the barrel allows for greater control.  Not as effective as a bipod but usable under all conditions.  This one was modified and customised to mount on pretty much any weapon, if you so want."

msgid "The M203 was originally designed for use with M16 variants but today can be attached to almost any rifle.  It allows a single 40mm grenade to be loaded and fired.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns, if you so want."
msgstr "The M203 was originally designed for use with M16 variants but today can be attached to almost any rifle.  It allows a single 40mm grenade to be loaded and fired.  This one was modified and customised to mount on pretty much any weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns, if you so want."

msgid "The M320 Grenade Launcher Module offers the functionality of larger launchers in a very small package at the cost of decreased accuracy.  It can be either attached to a rifle or combined with a buttstock for standalone use.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns, if you so want."
msgstr "The M320 Grenade Launcher Module offers the functionality of larger launchers in a very small package at the cost of decreased accuracy.  It can be either attached to a rifle or combined with a buttstock for standalone use.  This one was modified and customised to mount on pretty much any weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns, if you so want."

msgid "A minimalist pump-action shotgun, which can be mounted under the barrel of many rifles.  It allows a total of four shotgun shells to be loaded and fired.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns, if you so want."
msgstr "A minimalist pump-action shotgun, which can be mounted under the barrel of many rifles.  It allows a total of four shotgun shells to be loaded and fired.  This one was modified and customised to mount on pretty much any weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns, if you so want."

msgid "The Modular Accessory Shotgun System is an underbarrel bolt-action shotgun that was inspired by the \"Masterkey\" and fixed most of its predecessor's problems.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns."
msgstr "The Modular Accessory Shotgun System is an underbarrel bolt-action shotgun that was inspired by the \"Masterkey\" and fixed most of its predecessor's problems.  This one was modified and customised to mount on pretty much any weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns."

msgid "The Rivtech RM121 auxiliary weapon system is a magazine-fed semi-automatic caseless shotgun, which can be mounted under the barrel of many rifles.  Accepts RMSA10 box magazines.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon other than pistols, if you so want."
msgstr "The Rivtech RM121 auxiliary weapon system is a magazine-fed semi-automatic caseless shotgun, which can be mounted under the barrel of many rifles.  Accepts RMSA10 box magazines.  This one was modified and customised to mount on pretty much any weapon other than pistols, if you so want."

msgid "An extended capacity 25-round magazine, for use with .22 caliber varmint rifles."
msgstr "An extended capacity 25-round magazine, for use with .22 calibre varmint rifles."

msgid "A flush fitting 10-round rotary magazine, for use with .22 caliber varmint rifles."
msgstr "A flush fitting 10-round rotary magazine, for use with .22 calibre varmint rifles."

msgid "An extended capacity 15-round magazine, for use with .22 caliber varmint rifles."
msgstr "An extended capacity 15-round magazine, for use with .22 calibre varmint rifles."

msgid "An extended capacity 32-round magazine, for use with .22 caliber varmint rifles."
msgstr "An extended capacity 32-round magazine, for use with .22 calibre varmint rifles."

msgid "A 10-round handgun magazine for use with Walther's .22 caliber pocket pistol."
msgstr "A 10-round handgun magazine for use with Walther's .22 calibre pocket pistol."

msgid "A steel 10-round magazine, for use in .303 caliber Enfield rifles."
msgstr "A steel 10-round magazine, for use in .303 calibre Enfield rifles."

msgid "A 10-round steel box magazine for use with the Hi-Point 3895 pistol-caliber carbine.  Does not fit the Hi-Point CF-380 pistol."
msgstr "A 10-round steel box magazine for use with the Hi-Point 3895 pistol-calibre carbine.  Does not fit the Hi-Point CF-380 pistol."

msgid "An aluminum box magazine containing a single four round stack of .450 Bushmaster cartridges, engineered to fit and feed appropriately converted AR-platform rifles."
msgstr "An aluminium box magazine containing a single four round stack of .450 Bushmaster cartridges, engineered to fit and feed appropriately converted AR-platform rifles."

