msgid "A pressurized tank containing the original firework payload of the Exodii's own ordnance cannon.  This chemical payload contains two different compounds of copper, so that the projectiles burn a sharp blue and green to represent the united Earth it came from.  It isn't intended for combat, but getting hit by a massive firework is dangerous enough that it was brought along.  The tank capacity is larger than the other loads the Exodii created for it."
