msgid "A pressurized tank containing one of the special payloads the Exodii made for their ordnance cannon, an industrial grade chemical that adheres to anything it touches and hardens into a concrete-like resin.  Invented on some alternate Earth for quickly fixing holes in zeppelin and high-altitude craft, the Exodii found the substance useful for area denial, cover creation, or encasing nasty things in when they couldn't be bothered to waste bullets on them."
