msgid "A tiny acetylene tank.  It can pressurize up to 1 liter of welding gas."
msgstr "A tiny acetylene tank.  It can pressurise up to 1 litre of welding gas."

msgid "A compact MC size acetylene tank.  It can pressurize up to 10 cubic feet of welding gas."
