msgid "A stout pole with a large flanged mace head attached to the end with a short chain, a purpose-made combat version of the peasant flail.  It specializes in threshing people in metal armor, rather than grain."
msgstr "A stout pole with a large flanged mace head attached to the end with a short chain, a purpose-made combat version of the peasant flail.  It specialises in threshing people in metal armour, rather than grain."

msgid "A two-handed war club used in feudal Japan by samurai against armored opponents.  Made from hardwood with metal stud inlays."
msgstr "A two-handed war club used in feudal Japan by samurai against armoured opponents.  Made from hardwood with metal stud inlays."

msgid "A two-handed war club used in feudal Japan by samurai against armored opponents.  Made from hardwood with metal spike inlays."
msgstr "A two-handed war club used in feudal Japan by samurai against armoured opponents.  Made from hardwood with metal spike inlays."

msgid "aluminum bat"
msgid_plural "aluminum bats"
msgstr[0] "aluminium bat"
msgstr[1] "aluminium bats"

msgid "An aluminum baseball bat with a plastic handle, lighter than a wooden bat and a little easier to swing as a result."
msgstr "An aluminium baseball bat with a plastic handle, lighter than a wooden bat and a little easier to swing as a result."

msgid "An arcane-looking cane made of wood and aluminum.  It has a white light-up orb on the end.  Using it will turn it on and illuminate the area around you."
msgstr "An arcane-looking cane made of wood and aluminium.  It has a white light-up orb on the end.  Using it will turn it on and illuminate the area around you."

msgid "A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  It is heavy and slow to swing, but its crushing damage is devastating.  This one is custom-made with hardened steel and can pulverize bones."
msgstr "A medieval weapon consisting of a wood handle with a heavy metal head.  It is heavy and slow to swing, but its crushing damage is devastating.  This one is custom-made with hardened steel and can pulverise bones."

msgid "A hardwood stick designed for hitting colorful balls around a felt table.  Truly, the coolest of sports."
msgstr "A hardwood stick designed for hitting colourful balls around a felt table.  Truly, the coolest of sports."

msgid "The Monadnock PR-24 baton is a collapsible, lightweight, side-handle baton used by law enforcement all over the world.  The PR designation is rumored to mean Public Relations.  Activate to retract."
msgstr "The Monadnock PR-24 baton is a collapsible, lightweight, side-handle baton used by law enforcement all over the world.  The PR designation is rumoured to mean Public Relations.  Activate to retract."

msgid "The Monadnock PR-24 baton is a collapsible, lightweight, side-handle baton used by law enforcement all over the world.  The PR designation is rumored to mean Public Relations.  Activate to extend."
msgstr "The Monadnock PR-24 baton is a collapsible, lightweight, side-handle baton used by law enforcement all over the world.  The PR designation is rumoured to mean Public Relations.  Activate to extend."

msgid "A high-powered stun gun.  Use this item to attempt to electrocute an adjacent enemy, temporarily paralyzing them."
msgstr "A high-powered stun gun.  Use this item to attempt to electrocute an adjacent enemy, temporarily paralysing them."

msgid "An ancient Chinese spear, typically with a tassel just below the spearhead and larger than most European spears.  One of the four major weapons in folklore, alongside the dao saber, jian sword, and gun staff."
msgstr "An ancient Chinese spear, typically with a tassel just below the spearhead and larger than most European spears.  One of the four major weapons in folklore, alongside the dao sabre, jian sword, and gun staff."

msgid "A sturdy polearm with a sizable single-edged blade on the end."
msgstr "A sturdy polearm with a sizeable single-edged blade on the end."

msgid "A sturdy polearm with a curved blade, made in the same manner as the katana and other Japanese blades.  Occasionally used by samurai in early periods, or by their wives in defense of the household."
msgstr "A sturdy polearm with a curved blade, made in the same manner as the katana and other Japanese blades.  Occasionally used by samurai in early periods, or by their wives in defence of the household."

msgid "A modern bayonet in use with the US Marine Corps, adopted in an effort to improve USMC hand-to-hand fighting capabilities.  The bayonet is optimized to function as a fighting knife, sporting an ergonomic handle that will minimize hand fatigue during combat.  The blade tip is sharper in profile than other bayonets to assist in penetrating body armor, and also features a small serrated section to provide for some utility."
msgstr "A modern bayonet in use with the US Marine Corps, adopted in an effort to improve USMC hand-to-hand fighting capabilities.  The bayonet is optimised to function as a fighting knife, sporting an ergonomic handle that will minimise hand fatigue during combat.  The blade tip is sharper in profile than other bayonets to assist in penetrating body armour, and also features a small serrated section to provide for some utility."

msgid "This common gardening tool has been customized and rebalanced to improve its performance as a weapon."
msgstr "This common gardening tool has been customised and rebalanced to improve its performance as a weapon."

msgid "This common gardening tool has been customized, rebalanced and tempered to dramatically improve its performance as a weapon."
msgstr "This common gardening tool has been customised, rebalanced and tempered to dramatically improve its performance as a weapon."

