msgid "A compact tool kit intended for welding and cutting metal, this portable oxygen-acetylene torch includes a torch handle and cutting attachment in an easy-to-carry tote.  It needs to be connected to a pressurized cylinder of an appropriate welding gas before use.  In addition to its metalworking uses, you can activate it in order to destroy metal barriers."
