msgstr "An electric kiln, powered by your electric grid.  A bit larger than a refridgerator, this Exodii-manufactured kiln is large enough to repair the sheets of ceramic they use for armour.  It is designed for firing sheets of the Exodii's ceramic, but you could use it to fire anything made of clay.  A large and power-hungry appliance."

