msgstr[0] "hospitalised person"
msgstr[1] "hospitalised persons"

msgid "One of the many models of armored law enforcement robots employed shortly before the collapse of civilization.  Solar powered like many other robots, it maintains its programmed pursuit of law and order, propelled on a trio of omni wheels."
msgstr "One of the many models of armoured law enforcement robots employed shortly before the collapse of civilisation.  Solar powered like many other robots, it maintains its programmed pursuit of law and order, propelled on a trio of omni wheels."

msgid "Nonviolent riot-control bot.  Designed to suppress riots and make mass arrests of those participating.  Though its relaxation gas is by far its best-known weapon, it carries a blinding flash and a low-powered stungun for self-defense--in addition to its supply of electronic handcuffs."
msgstr "Nonviolent riot-control bot.  Designed to suppress riots and make mass arrests of those participating.  Though its relaxation gas is by far its best-known weapon, it carries a blinding flash and a low-powered stungun for self-defence--in addition to its supply of electronic handcuffs."

msgid "The Northrop ATSV, a massive, heavily-armed and armored robot walking on a pair of reverse-jointed legs.  Armed with a 40mm anti-vehicle grenade launcher, 5.56 anti-personnel gun, and the ability to electrify itself against attackers, it is an effective automated sentry, though production was limited due to a legal dispute."
msgstr "The Northrop ATSV, a massive, heavily-armed and armoured robot walking on a pair of reverse-jointed legs.  Armed with a 40mm anti-vehicle grenade launcher, 5.56 anti-personnel gun, and the ability to electrify itself against attackers, it is an effective automated sentry, though production was limited due to a legal dispute."

msgid "A mix of dead human and even deader technology, this twisted mess of steel and flesh moves like a puppet in the hands of an angry toddler.  Its robotic components seem to have shut down, and new bands of flesh have wrapped around them, tugging and pulling them in awkward directions.  Bits of metallic skeleton and armor plating jut from its decaying flesh."
msgstr "A mix of dead human and even deader technology, this twisted mess of steel and flesh moves like a puppet in the hands of an angry toddler.  Its robotic components seem to have shut down, and new bands of flesh have wrapped around them, tugging and pulling them in awkward directions.  Bits of metallic skeleton and armour plating jut from its decaying flesh."

msgid "This feral human's eyes look more focused, and its movements steadier, than others of their kind.  They're carrying a crude spear, and have assembled some basic armor from scavenged clothing and bits of riot armor, though you can see several gaps.  Despite these signs of greater intelligence, this creature is still only a few steps away from being a zombie themself."
msgstr "This feral human's eyes look more focused, and its movements steadier, than others of their kind.  They're carrying a crude spear, and have assembled some basic armour from scavenged clothing and bits of riot armour, though you can see several gaps.  Despite these signs of greater intelligence, this creature is still only a few steps away from being a zombie themself."

msgid "At first glance, this disheveled figure could almost pass for a survivor, but the bloodshot eyes give them away as one of the humans who have gone feral and joined the undead without dying.  Their uniform suggests that this was at some point a security guard, and they still carry a stun gun and a heavy-duty flashlight that looks like it could easily double as a club."
msgstr "At first glance, this dishevelled figure could almost pass for a survivor, but the bloodshot eyes give them away as one of the humans who have gone feral and joined the undead without dying.  Their uniform suggests that this was at some point a security guard, and they still carry a stun gun and a heavy-duty flashlight that looks like it could easily double as a club."

msgid "armored feral"
msgid_plural "armored ferals"
msgstr[0] "armoured feral"
msgstr[1] "armoured ferals"

msgid "Clad in ancient armor and with a mace in hand, this maniac walks around in search of their next prey.  You can see stains of dried blood all over their mace."
msgstr "Clad in ancient armour and with a mace in hand, this maniac walks around in search of their next prey.  You can see stains of dried blood all over their mace."

msgid "Clad in ancient armor and with a battle axe in hand, this maniac walks around in search of their next prey.  You can see stains of dried blood all over their axe."
msgstr "Clad in ancient armour and with a battle axe in hand, this maniac walks around in search of their next prey.  You can see stains of dried blood all over their axe."

msgid "A quick glance at this person would suggest that they have prepared well enough for the apocalypse, with their armor equipped and some makeshift mace in their hands.  Unfortunately, their bloodshot eyes, and the excluding treatment by the undead, shows that they have turned feral."
msgstr "A quick glance at this person would suggest that they have prepared well enough for the apocalypse, with their armour equipped and some makeshift mace in their hands.  Unfortunately, their bloodshot eyes, and the excluding treatment by the undead, shows that they have turned feral."

msgid "A quick glance at this person would suggest that they have prepared well enough for the apocalypse, with their armor equipped and some military-grade knife in their hands.  Unfortunately, their bloodshot eyes, and the excluding treatment by the undead, shows that they have turned feral."
msgstr "A quick glance at this person would suggest that they have prepared well enough for the apocalypse, with their armour equipped and some military-grade knife in their hands.  Unfortunately, their bloodshot eyes, and the excluding treatment by the undead, shows that they have turned feral."

msgid "Wearing a military uniform with an armored vest, this person seems to be a highly trained military professional, now turned feral.  Tense, dirty hands grip a combat knife as their bloodshot eyes scan for threats."
msgstr "Wearing a military uniform with an armoured vest, this person seems to be a highly trained military professional, now turned feral.  Tense, dirty hands grip a combat knife as their bloodshot eyes scan for threats."

msgid "A rough-looking feral human, clad in black leather and wielding a pump-action shotgun, that seems to be empty already.  It seems body-armor wasn't one of their priorities however."
msgstr "A rough-looking feral human, clad in black leather and wielding a pump-action shotgun, that seems to be empty already.  It seems body-armour wasn't one of their priorities however."

msgid "Spattered from head to toe in large swaths of dried viscera, the deep blue of this person's tattered naval uniform has been stained the color of rust.  Having seemingly had enough presence of mind to consider arming itself, this former crewman carries a crash axe in its shaking hands.  The veins on the back of their neck are visibly bulging, their eyes bloodshot, and a mass of crisscrossing blackened veins stand out against the pale skin of their face as they regard the area around them for perceived threats."
msgstr "Spattered from head to toe in large swaths of dried viscera, the deep blue of this person's tattered naval uniform has been stained the colour of rust.  Having seemingly had enough presence of mind to consider arming itself, this former crewman carries a crash axe in its shaking hands.  The veins on the back of their neck are visibly bulging, their eyes bloodshot, and a mass of crisscrossing blackened veins stand out against the pale skin of their face as they regard the area around them for perceived threats."

msgid "This person, clad in the tattered uniform of a naval officer, twitches erratically as their bloodshot eyes dart about and their breaths come in ragged pants.  The Cataclysm has clearly done something horrible to this military professional, inaudible mutterings emanating from their lips as they creep about like a skittish animal.  In their quivering hands they clutch a service pistol, the officer's fingers nervously fidgeting with the weapon.  They may not be an undead corpse, but you doubt that they're any more rational than the zombies which now infest the world."
msgstr "This person, clad in the tattered uniform of a naval officer, twitches erratically as their bloodshot eyes dart about and their breaths come in ragged trousers.  The Cataclysm has clearly done something horrible to this military professional, inaudible mutterings emanating from their lips as they creep about like a skittish animal.  In their quivering hands they clutch a service pistol, the officer's fingers nervously fidgeting with the weapon.  They may not be an undead corpse, but you doubt that they're any more rational than the zombies which now infest the world."

msgid "Another of the crazed humans among the dead.  This police officer angrily mutters to themselves, wandering about with a truncheon in hand in search of someone to brutalize."
msgstr "Another of the crazed humans among the dead.  This police officer angrily mutters to themselves, wandering about with a truncheon in hand in search of someone to brutalise."

msgid "A maddened and crazed police officer infected by the fungus.  Their body armor is overgrown with fungal matter.  Though obviously in pain they don't seem any less keen to batter you to death with their baton."
msgstr "A maddened and crazed police officer infected by the fungus.  Their body armour is overgrown with fungal matter.  Though obviously in pain they don't seem any less keen to batter you to death with their baton."

#, c-format
msgid "The %s is smashed to non-recognizable pieces."
msgstr "The %s is smashed to non-recognisable pieces."

msgid "A very large armored bottom-feeder, the lake sturgeon is one of the largest unmutated fish one can find in the freshwater regions of New England."
msgstr "A very large armoured bottom-feeder, the lake sturgeon is one of the largest unmutated fish one can find in the freshwater regions of New England."

msgid "An enormous mutated gray crayfish with pincer claws and long antennae."
msgstr "An enormous mutated grey crayfish with pincer claws and long antennae."

msgid "A huge mutant salmon, one that outgrows even the other ones present.  On its sides, beneath the fins, are visible two flesh-colored tubes which propel water as it leaps."
msgstr "A huge mutant salmon, one that outgrows even the other ones present.  On its sides, beneath the fins, are visible two flesh-coloured tubes which propel water as it leaps."

msgid "A small, robust fish, the black sea bass is known for its dark, mottled color and meaty texture."
msgstr "A small, robust fish, the black sea bass is known for its dark, mottled colour and meaty texture."

msgid "Also known as porgy, the scup is a small fish commonly found in Atlantic coastal waters, recognizable by its silver body with blue and purple tinges."
msgstr "Also known as porgy, the scup is a small fish commonly found in Atlantic coastal waters, recognisable by its silver body with blue and purple tinges."

msgid "A large, white-meat fish known for its mild flavor and flaky texture.  Highly prized in both commercial and recreational fishing."
msgstr "A large, white-meat fish known for its mild flavour and flaky texture.  Highly prized in both commercial and recreational fishing."

msgid "A popular food fish, the haddock is recognized by its dark lateral line and a black blotch above the pectoral fin."
msgstr "A popular food fish, the haddock is recognised by its dark lateral line and a black blotch above the pectoral fin."

msgid "The largest flatfish in the ocean, known for its dense, firm texture and mild flavor."
msgstr "The largest flatfish in the ocean, known for its dense, firm texture and mild flavour."

msgid "Looking at first glance like a dull gray privet, this \"hedge\" is really a mass of barbed fungal tendrils, defending the fungal tower."
msgstr "Looking at first glance like a dull grey privet, this \"hedge\" is really a mass of barbed fungal tendrils, defending the fungal tower."

msgid "A veritable wall of fungus, grown as a natural defense by the fungal spire.  New spores erupt from the surface every few seconds, and tendrils constrict around it, pulling new mass into its shape.  They move with an inexorable strength that could snap limbs."
msgstr "A veritable wall of fungus, grown as a natural defence by the fungal spire.  New spores erupt from the surface every few seconds, and tendrils constrict around it, pulling new mass into its shape.  They move with an inexorable strength that could snap limbs."

msgid "A pale white fungus, one meaty gray stalk supporting a bloom at the top.  Spores are periodically expelled from its gills, and a few tendrils extend from the base, allowing mobility and some basic means of defense."
msgstr "A pale white fungus, one meaty grey stalk supporting a bloom at the top.  Spores are periodically expelled from its gills, and a few tendrils extend from the base, allowing mobility and some basic means of defence."

msgid "A large white fungus, a bulging gray stalk supporting a bloom at the top.  Spores float from its gills and tendrils extend from the base.  Chunks of rock, metal, bone, and wood are held by tendrils as a kind of armor."
msgstr "A large white fungus, a bulging grey stalk supporting a bloom at the top.  Spores float from its gills and tendrils extend from the base.  Chunks of rock, metal, bone, and wood are held by tendrils as a kind of armour."

msgid "An enormous fungal spire, towering over the ground.  It pulsates slowly, continuously growing new defenses."
msgstr "An enormous fungal spire, towering over the ground.  It pulsates slowly, continuously growing new defences."

msgid "Pale, sickly gray in color, this giant ant's cracked exoskeleton is barely held together by coils of fungus erupting from every joint in its body."
msgstr "Pale, sickly grey in colour, this giant ant's cracked exoskeleton is barely held together by coils of fungus erupting from every joint in its body."

msgid "A huge wasp the size of a large cat.  It's bright yellow markings have faded and ripped to show a disgusting mass of mold and rot beneath.  Her wings jut into extremely odd angles, making flight impossible.  Even still, it chases anything without any sense of self-preservation."
msgstr "A huge wasp the size of a large cat.  It's bright yellow markings have faded and ripped to show a disgusting mass of mould and rot beneath.  Her wings jut into extremely odd angles, making flight impossible.  Even still, it chases anything without any sense of self-preservation."

msgid "A mutated wasp queen that has been consumed by a sickly gray mold covering it's body.  Abandoning it's duty to laying eggs, it seemingly searches for anything to attack, as a mist of spores emit from it's mandibles."
msgstr "A mutated wasp queen that has been consumed by a sickly grey mould covering it's body.  Abandoning it's duty to laying eggs, it seemingly searches for anything to attack, as a mist of spores emit from it's mandibles."

msgid "A mutant bee the size of a small dog.  It's fur, once used to collect pollen has been trapped with thousands of spores.  it moves erratically on the ground, seemingly having great difficulty to keep any sense of coordination as visible growths of mold worsen underneath the thin hairs."
msgstr "A mutant bee the size of a small dog.  It's fur, once used to collect pollen has been trapped with thousands of spores.  it moves erratically on the ground, seemingly having great difficulty to keep any sense of coordination as visible growths of mould worsen underneath the thin hairs."

msgid "A sickly-sweet smelling gray goo pours from the mandibles of this dog-sized insect, stirs an odd sense of hunger within you.  However, the writhing syringe-looking needle and thick plumes of spores around quickly quell your appetite."
msgstr "A sickly-sweet smelling grey goo pours from the mandibles of this dog-sized insect, stirs an odd sense of hunger within you.  However, the writhing syringe-looking needle and thick plumes of spores around quickly quell your appetite."

msgid "This oversized insect's every move is coerced by a seemingly invisible entity, like a puppet on strings.  Thousands of live spores fume from it's mandibles, forming thick clouds.  A stark blue gel leaks from it's splintering limbs, bubbling and sizzling, revealing soft, pulsing gray material beneath."
msgstr "This oversized insect's every move is coerced by a seemingly invisible entity, like a puppet on strings.  Thousands of live spores fume from it's mandibles, forming thick clouds.  A stark blue gel leaks from it's splintering limbs, bubbling and sizzling, revealing soft, pulsing grey material beneath."

msgid "Large, yellow, coral-like fungi grow from this spot, their spires riddled with intersecting holes.  Despite lack of wind, it seems to wave at a set rhythm, occasionally pulsing out spores.  A chorus of weak, whistly voices, mixed with different accents and languages—some you recognize, others that seem like meaningless gibberish—emanates from it."
msgstr "Large, yellow, coral-like fungi grow from this spot, their spires riddled with intersecting holes.  Despite lack of wind, it seems to wave at a set rhythm, occasionally pulsing out spores.  A chorus of weak, whistly voices, mixed with different accents and languages—some you recognise, others that seem like meaningless gibberish—emanates from it."

msgid "This shambling corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "This shambling corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick grey powder."

msgid "This writhing corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "This writhing corpse has grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull."

msgid "Once alive, then undead, now something else entirely.  Fungal tendrils sprout from its mouth, eyes, and other orifices, holding together a shambling mass of mold-covered flesh."
msgstr "Once alive, then undead, now something else entirely.  Fungal tendrils sprout from its mouth, eyes, and other orifices, holding together a shambling mass of mould-covered flesh."

msgid "This grotesquely swollen corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "This grotesquely swollen corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick grey powder."

msgid "This grotesquely swollen corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull.  The overall visual effect is similar to a cherry or upside down lollipop."
msgstr "This grotesquely swollen corpse has grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull.  The overall visual effect is similar to a cherry or upside down lollipop."

msgid "With its swollen gray skin overgrown by thick layer of mold, this balloon-like fungal zombie looks like it could violently burst into a cloud of noxious spores at any moment."
msgstr "With its swollen grey skin overgrown by thick layer of mould, this balloon-like fungal zombie looks like it could violently burst into a cloud of noxious spores at any moment."

msgid "This smoke-shrouded corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder lighter in color than smoke and ash."
msgstr "This smoke-shrouded corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick grey powder lighter in colour than smoke and ash."

msgid "This smoke-shrouded corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "This smoke-shrouded corpse has grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull."

msgid "This moving corpse covered in knobby bone growths has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "This moving corpse covered in knobby bone growths has been heavily dusted with a thick grey powder."

msgid "This already horrific moving corpse covered in bony growths has also grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "This already horrific moving corpse covered in bony growths has also grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull."

msgid "This moving corpse covered in twisted bone growths has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "This moving corpse covered in twisted bone growths has been heavily dusted with a thick grey powder."

msgid "This already horrific moving corpse covered in twisted bony growths has also grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "This already horrific moving corpse covered in twisted bony growths has also grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull."

msgid "This towering creature covered in plated bone has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "This towering creature covered in plated bone has been heavily dusted with a thick grey powder."

msgid "Layers of plates of bone rise high above, ending in a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the enormous bulging skull."
msgstr "Layers of plates of bone rise high above, ending in a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the enormous bulging skull."

msgid "This small, stumbling child has been dusted with a thick gray powder.  Something about the way it moves is uncanny."
msgstr "This small, stumbling child has been dusted with a thick grey powder.  Something about the way it moves is uncanny."

msgid "This child moves slowly, as though sleepy.  A short stalk of gray fungus has burst from the top of the little head."
msgstr "This child moves slowly, as though sleepy.  A short stalk of grey fungus has burst from the top of the little head."

msgid "It is hard to recognize a human child in this creature.  Disgusting-looking mold covers most of its skin.  Many cracks perforate its body, with small fungal stalks poking through."
msgstr "It is hard to recognise a human child in this creature.  Disgusting-looking mould covers most of its skin.  Many cracks perforate its body, with small fungal stalks poking through."

msgid "This rotund and bloated corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "This rotund and bloated corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick grey powder."

msgid "This rotund and bloated corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "This rotund and bloated corpse has grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull."

msgid "A rotund and bloated human body with pasty, fungus-ridden flesh.  Its mouth drips with a frothing gray sludge."
msgstr "A rotund and bloated human body with pasty, fungus-ridden flesh.  Its mouth drips with a frothing grey sludge."

msgid "This small child lies on the ground shaking gently, dusted with a thick gray powder.  The chest of the child appears to have broken open like a gory flower and there is strange pulsing movement and also unpleasant wet sounds within."
msgstr "This small child lies on the ground shaking gently, dusted with a thick grey powder.  The chest of the child appears to have broken open like a gory flower and there is strange pulsing movement and also unpleasant wet sounds within."

msgid "This small child lies on the ground smiling serenely, a short stalk of gray fungus bursting triumphantly from the top of the little head.  The chest of the child appears to have broken open like a gory flower and there is strange pulsing movement and also unpleasant wet sounds within."
msgstr "This small child lies on the ground smiling serenely, a short stalk of grey fungus bursting triumphantly from the top of the little head.  The chest of the child appears to have broken open like a gory flower and there is strange pulsing movement and also unpleasant wet sounds within."

msgid "Heavily dusted with a thick gray powder, this small, winged predator darts through the air on three spongy wings that look like stretched human hands.  A sheer, jagged spike juts out from the point where the wings meet."
msgstr "Heavily dusted with a thick grey powder, this small, winged predator darts through the air on three spongy wings that look like stretched human hands.  A sheer, jagged spike juts out from the point where the wings meet."

msgid "This small, winged predator darts through the air on three spongy wings that look like stretched human hands.  A sheer, jagged spike juts out from the point where the wings meet, joined by a short stalk of gray fungus reaching upward."
msgstr "This small, winged predator darts through the air on three spongy wings that look like stretched human hands.  A sheer, jagged spike juts out from the point where the wings meet, joined by a short stalk of grey fungus reaching upward."

msgid "This recently-risen body has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder, but still moves quickly."
msgstr "This recently-risen body has been heavily dusted with a thick grey powder, but still moves quickly."

msgid "This recently-risen body has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull.  This appears to slow it down in some way."
msgstr "This recently-risen body has grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull.  This appears to slow it down in some way."

msgid "This badly decayed corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "This badly decayed corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick grey powder."

msgid "This badly decayed corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "This badly decayed corpse has grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull."

msgid "This muscular moving corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "This muscular moving corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick grey powder."

msgid "This muscular corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "This muscular corpse has grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull."

msgid "This zombie's entire body bulges with distended muscles heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "This zombie's entire body bulges with distended muscles heavily dusted with a thick grey powder."

msgid "This inhumanly muscular corpse has numerous festering wounds and has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "This inhumanly muscular corpse has numerous festering wounds and has grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull."

msgid "This zombie's muscular body has swollen to six times the size of an average person and has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "This zombie's muscular body has swollen to six times the size of an average person and has been heavily dusted with a thick grey powder."

msgid "This enormous muscular corpse has swollen six times larger and has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "This enormous muscular corpse has swollen six times larger and has grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull."

msgid "This moving corpse with badly damaged legs has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "This moving corpse with badly damaged legs has been heavily dusted with a thick grey powder."

msgid "This moving corpse with badly damaged legs has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "This moving corpse with badly damaged legs has grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull."

msgid "This heavy moving corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "This heavy moving corpse has been heavily dusted with a thick grey powder."

msgid "This heavy corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "This heavy corpse has grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull."

msgid "Thousands upon thousands of fungal bulbs, sprouts and tendrils jut out from every angle of this walking carcass.  Large patches of yellow pulsating mold seem to be growing in the zombie's fat folds."
msgstr "Thousands upon thousands of fungal bulbs, sprouts and tendrils jut out from every angle of this walking carcass.  Large patches of yellow pulsating mould seem to be growing in the zombie's fat folds."

msgid "This heavily scarred moving corpse has been covered with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "This heavily scarred moving corpse has been covered with a thick grey powder."

msgid "This heavily scarred moving corpse has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "This heavily scarred moving corpse has grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull."

msgid "This acrid smelling moving corpse has been covered with a thick gray powder."
msgstr "This acrid smelling moving corpse has been covered with a thick grey powder."

msgid "This sickly looking moving corpse with prominent yellow veins has grown a short stalk of gray fungus bursting from the skull."
msgstr "This sickly looking moving corpse with prominent yellow veins has grown a short stalk of grey fungus bursting from the skull."

msgid "This hulking horse-figure seems to re-learn galloping with every step, as large fungi cling and sprout off of its mane.  It travels towards anything moving, even though in the center of each eye lies multiple fungal blooms."
msgstr "This hulking horse-figure seems to re-learn galloping with every step, as large fungi cling and sprout off of its mane.  It travels towards anything moving, even though in the centre of each eye lies multiple fungal blooms."

msgid "This bumpy, discolored reindeer resembles a malformed Rudolph, its nose having a faintly glowing red fungal sprout.  It'd look almost comical if it wasn't mutilating bodies with its innate strength."
msgstr "This bumpy, discoloured reindeer resembles a malformed Rudolph, its nose having a faintly glowing red fungal sprout.  It'd look almost comical if it wasn't mutilating bodies with its innate strength."

msgid "A brightly-colored mutant centipede the size of a small dog, skittering quickly in the underbrush.  Probably won't think you're suitable prey, but beware its venom."
msgstr "A brightly-coloured mutant centipede the size of a small dog, skittering quickly in the underbrush.  Probably won't think you're suitable prey, but beware its venom."

msgid "A two-meter-long centipede with a menacing set of venom-dripping mandibles and a worrying number of grabbing appendages, moving swiftly on dozens of spindly legs.  It has a pair of small compound eyes, but seems to mostly orient itself with its antennae."
msgstr "A two-metre-long centipede with a menacing set of venom-dripping mandibles and a worrying number of grabbing appendages, moving swiftly on dozens of spindly legs.  It has a pair of small compound eyes, but seems to mostly orient itself with its antennae."

msgid "armored centipede"
msgid_plural "armored centipedes"
msgstr[0] "armoured centipede"
msgstr[1] "armoured centipedes"

msgid "A huge mutated centipede covered in interlocking chitinous plates of metallic gray, reminding you more of a runaway train car than any living animal.  Its mandibles end in jagged points, seemingly specialized to hunt prey at least as well-armored as itself.  You really don't want to try if you'd fare better."
msgstr "A huge mutated centipede covered in interlocking chitinous plates of metallic grey, reminding you more of a runaway train car than any living animal.  Its mandibles end in jagged points, seemingly specialised to hunt prey at least as well-armoured as itself.  You really don't want to try if you'd fare better."

msgid "A predatory, aquatic dragonfly larva, normally barely a centimeter long and feeding on small fishes, grown to the size of a catfish.  Underneath its sharp mandibles you can see that its folded lower jaw has changed into something resembling a barbed spear."
msgstr "A predatory, aquatic dragonfly larva, normally barely a centimetre long and feeding on small fishes, grown to the size of a catfish.  Underneath its sharp mandibles you can see that its folded lower jaw has changed into something resembling a barbed spear."

msgid "A ferocious, bright green dragonfly, still lightning-fast despite growing to the size of a schoolchild.  Its head is little more than a basketball-sized pair of rainbow compound eyes, and its legs - already specialized for grasping prey - end in curved talons."
msgstr "A ferocious, bright green dragonfly, still lightning-fast despite growing to the size of a schoolchild.  Its head is little more than a basketball-sized pair of rainbow compound eyes, and its legs - already specialised for grasping prey - end in curved talons."

msgid "A cow-sized mutant spider with strong, thick legs and a bulbous thorax, dark brown in color.  Anything it pulls into its underground lair is unlikely to see the light of day again."
msgstr "A cow-sized mutant spider with strong, thick legs and a bulbous thorax, dark brown in colour.  Anything it pulls into its underground lair is unlikely to see the light of day again."

msgid "A light gray mutant spider the size of a dog with a long legs, big eyes, and oversized fangs."
msgstr "A light grey mutant spider the size of a dog with a long legs, big eyes, and oversized fangs."

msgid "A giant, light gray mutant grass spider, it waits for prey to become ensnared in the vast webs that it weaves between the trees."
msgstr "A giant, light grey mutant grass spider, it waits for prey to become ensnared in the vast webs that it weaves between the trees."

msgid "A cow-sized mutated grass spider with long spindly legs, light gray in color.  It moves ponderously, depending on its webs to prevent prey from fleeing."
msgstr "A cow-sized mutated grass spider with long spindly legs, light grey in colour.  It moves ponderously, depending on its webs to prevent prey from fleeing."

msgid "A colorful parasitoid wasp grown to the size of a dog, with a huge ovipositor extruding from her abdomen.  She darts around in search of a suitable home for her many, many children."
msgstr "A colourful parasitoid wasp grown to the size of a dog, with a huge ovipositor extruding from her abdomen.  She darts around in search of a suitable home for her many, many children."

msgid "A paralyzed, emaciated deer.  It spasms as it notices your presence, terrified eyes darting around the muddy chamber when it fails to stand and flee."
msgstr "A paralysed, emaciated deer.  It spasms as it notices your presence, terrified eyes darting around the muddy chamber when it fails to stand and flee."

msgid "A large armored larva looking not unlike a centipede.  Even though it's just a juvenile the armor on its back already looks functional."
msgstr "A large armoured larva looking not unlike a centipede.  Even though it's just a juvenile the armour on its back already looks functional."

msgid "Something about this cow-sized larva is pitiable, despite its immense size and sickening cream color."
msgstr "Something about this cow-sized larva is pitiable, despite its immense size and sickening cream colour."

msgid "It was called a giant even before the Cataclysm, but now this mutant beetle is the size of a small horse.  It looks ready to molt again, even though parts of the shell are still soft."
msgstr "It was called a giant even before the Cataclysm, but now this mutant beetle is the size of a small horse.  It looks ready to moult again, even though parts of the shell are still soft."

msgid "This stag beetle rivals an armored personnel carrier in size, bearing horns that could fell a tree and chitin thick enough to ignore most bullets.  Its bulky shell looks nigh-impenetrable, and the cracks have sealed with a foul paste."
msgstr "This stag beetle rivals an armoured personnel carrier in size, bearing horns that could fell a tree and chitin thick enough to ignore most bullets.  Its bulky shell looks nigh-impenetrable, and the cracks have sealed with a foul paste."

msgid "An oversized butterfly with vibrant colored markings.  Unlike the other big insects of the Cataclysm this is a very peaceful nectivore."
msgstr "An oversized butterfly with vibrant coloured markings.  Unlike the other big insects of the Cataclysm this is a very peaceful nectivore."

msgid "A majestic moth painted in pale colors.  This giant of the night only comes out after the moon is out, leaving glittering dust."
msgstr "A majestic moth painted in pale colours.  This giant of the night only comes out after the moon is out, leaving glittering dust."

msgid "Woodlice reproduce by carrying their eggs in a pouch and releasing them as juveniles.  Their mancae look like small adults except for their pale color."
msgstr "Woodlice reproduce by carrying their eggs in a pouch and releasing them as juveniles.  Their mancae look like small adults except for their pale colour."

msgid "Remain in place, unauthorized person.  Security has been activated."
msgstr "Remain in place, unauthorised person.  Security has been activated."

msgid "Remain still.  Scanning for authorization."
msgstr "Remain still.  Scanning for authorisation."

msgid "In the absence of human stewardship, this small, domesticated predator has grown wary of humans.  Harried by the elements and the rigors of survival, it has become very skittish but is still motivated by food."
msgstr "In the absence of human stewardship, this small, domesticated predator has grown wary of humans.  Harried by the elements and the rigours of survival, it has become very skittish but is still motivated by food."

msgid "With cream-colored fur and dark points, you guess this kitten must be a young Siamese."
msgstr "With cream-coloured fur and dark points, you guess this kitten must be a young Siamese."

msgid "Partly white with patches of orange and black, the calico coloring tells you this cat is probably female.  The calico was the Maryland state cat, back when there were still states."
msgstr "Partly white with patches of orange and black, the calico colouring tells you this cat is probably female.  The calico was the Maryland state cat, back when there were still states."

msgid "Splotches of tan and gray mark this young cat as a calico, and probably female."
msgstr "Splotches of tan and grey mark this young cat as a calico, and probably female."

msgid "A cute and currently defenseless cougar kitten, meowing at its surroundings in search of its mother.  Be careful, these kittens grow quite big and ferocious in just a few months."
msgstr "A cute and currently defenceless cougar kitten, meowing at its surroundings in search of its mother.  Be careful, these kittens grow quite big and ferocious in just a few months."

msgid "The majestic tiger, a large feline predator.  Native to Asia, they are now most populous in private reserves in the United States.  Fast and powerful, this predator is one of the most recognizable and beloved animals in the world.  Also one of the deadliest."
msgstr "The majestic tiger, a large feline predator.  Native to Asia, they are now most populous in private reserves in the United States.  Fast and powerful, this predator is one of the most recognisable and beloved animals in the world.  Also one of the deadliest."

msgid "A juvenile northern woodland white-tailed deer, a quick and strong grazing animal.  Favored prey of coyotes, wolves, and giant spider mutants."
msgstr "A juvenile northern woodland white-tailed deer, a quick and strong grazing animal.  Favoured prey of coyotes, wolves, and giant spider mutants."

msgid "The northern woodland white-tailed deer, a quick and strong grazing animal.  Favored prey of coyotes, wolves, and giant spider mutants."
msgstr "The northern woodland white-tailed deer, a quick and strong grazing animal.  Favoured prey of coyotes, wolves, and giant spider mutants."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless Labrador puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless Labrador puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless American bulldog puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless American bulldog puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless pit bull puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless pit bull puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless beagle puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless beagle puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless Border Collie puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless Border Collie puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless boxer puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless boxer puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless Chihuahua puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless Chihuahua puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless dachshund puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless dachshund puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless German Shepherd puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless German Shepherd puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless Great Pyrenees puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless Great Pyrenees puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless Rottweiler puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless Rottweiler puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless Australian cattle dog puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless Australian cattle dog puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless Samoyed puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless Samoyed puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless Flat-coated Retriever puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless Flat-coated Retriever puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."

msgid "A mutant variety of megafauna that evolved after the Cataclysm.  Easily recognized by the underslung tusks off each side of the mouth, in addition to an impressive rack of antlers.  Given the looks and how aggressive normal moose are, you reckon you shouldn't test the patience of this one."
msgstr "A mutant variety of megafauna that evolved after the Cataclysm.  Easily recognised by the underslung tusks off each side of the mouth, in addition to an impressive rack of antlers.  Given the looks and how aggressive normal moose are, you reckon you shouldn't test the patience of this one."

msgid "A large omnivorous rodent with a thick furry pelt, found in wetlands across the Northern Hemisphere.  It marks its territory with a musky odor for which it is named."
msgstr "A large omnivorous rodent with a thick furry pelt, found in wetlands across the Northern Hemisphere.  It marks its territory with a musky odour for which it is named."

msgid "A timid, hooved grazing mammal, and one of the first animals ever domesticated.  Its body is covered in a thick layer of wool, and the males have long, spiraling horns."
msgstr "A timid, hooved grazing mammal, and one of the first animals ever domesticated.  Its body is covered in a thick layer of wool, and the males have long, spiralling horns."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless wolf pup that will, in time, grow into a not-so-defenseless and debatably-adorable wolf.  Be careful of its parents, who are sure to be around nearby!"
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless wolf pup that will, in time, grow into a not-so-defenceless and debatably-adorable wolf.  Be careful of its parents, who are sure to be around nearby!"

msgid "A baby llama.  Unlike their parents, the calves tend to be more friendly in demeanor."
msgstr "A baby llama.  Unlike their parents, the calves tend to be more friendly in demeanour."

msgid "X-03: 'Specter' Recon Mech"
msgid_plural "X-03: 'Specter' Recon Mechs"
msgstr[0] "X-03: 'Spectre' Recon Mech"
msgstr[1] "X-03: 'Spectre' Recon Mechs"

msgid "A more heavily armored version of the common mi-go.  Its trunk is a shapeless mass of strange flesh encased in an iridescent carapace, from which sprout several appendages terminating in what appear to be devices of some sort.  Its pyramidal head is encrusted in barnacle-like armor, aside from the bristling antennae that serve as its - you assume - sensory devices and mouth."
msgstr "A more heavily armoured version of the common mi-go.  Its trunk is a shapeless mass of strange flesh encased in an iridescent carapace, from which sprout several appendages terminating in what appear to be devices of some sort.  Its pyramidal head is encrusted in barnacle-like armour, aside from the bristling antennae that serve as its - you assume - sensory devices and mouth."

msgid "This slender mi-go is a little smaller than most others of its kind.  It has a weird, oblong thing attached to the center of its body with some sort of a diaphragm or a membrane on the end.  The thing seems like an integral part of the mi-go's body, and all its appendages are supporting it to prevent swaying."
msgstr "This slender mi-go is a little smaller than most others of its kind.  It has a weird, oblong thing attached to the centre of its body with some sort of a diaphragm or a membrane on the end.  The thing seems like an integral part of the mi-go's body, and all its appendages are supporting it to prevent swaying."

msgid "A mutated test subject, running on all fours at alarming speed.  Their short fur changes color to match the background in an instant, making you struggle to keep the thing in focus.  Their thin limbs end in long talons, and their mouth is held perpetually open by a set of knife-sized fangs."
msgstr "A mutated test subject, running on all fours at alarming speed.  Their short fur changes colour to match the background in an instant, making you struggle to keep the thing in focus.  Their thin limbs end in long talons, and their mouth is held perpetually open by a set of knife-sized fangs."

msgid "An enormous mutant hidden beneath a gray segmented shell, crawling on a carpet of innumerable tentacles covered with suckers.  They hold three thicker, branching limbs high on their front end, each dotted with dozens of unblinking eyeballs."
msgstr "An enormous mutant hidden beneath a grey segmented shell, crawling on a carpet of innumerable tentacles covered with suckers.  They hold three thicker, branching limbs high on their front end, each dotted with dozens of unblinking eyeballs."

msgid "This mutant beaver's body is covered with brightly-colored feathers in a particularly eyecatching pattern.  It must have been very lucky not to have been caught by a predator before now."
msgstr "This mutant beaver's body is covered with brightly-coloured feathers in a particularly eyecatching pattern.  It must have been very lucky not to have been caught by a predator before now."

msgid "A hellish, vaguely humanoid horror, two stories tall.  Its face is grotesquely stretched out, its limbs deformed to unrecognizable outgrowths."
msgstr "A hellish, vaguely humanoid horror, two storeys tall.  Its face is grotesquely stretched out, its limbs deformed to unrecognisable outgrowths."

msgid "This is some sort of unearthly pink flesh sac; moist and ridged with veins, it is otherwise without discernible exterior features.  Seemingly immobile and defenseless, it sits in place, swelling and collapsing upon itself as it breathes."
msgstr "This is some sort of unearthly pink flesh sac; moist and ridged with veins, it is otherwise without discernible exterior features.  Seemingly immobile and defenceless, it sits in place, swelling and collapsing upon itself as it breathes."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to bite your %2$s, but can't penetrate your armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to bite your %2$s, but can't penetrate your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to bite <npcname>'s %2$s, but can't penetrate their armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to bite <npcname>'s %2$s, but can't penetrate their armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to fasten onto your %2$s, but can't penetrate your armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to fasten onto your %2$s, but can't penetrate your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to fasten onto <npcname>'s %2$s, but can't penetrate their armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to fasten onto <npcname>'s %2$s, but can't penetrate their armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to clutch onto your %2$s, but can't penetrate your armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to clutch onto your %2$s, but can't penetrate your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to clutch onto <npcname>'s %2$s, but can't penetrate their armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to clutch onto <npcname>'s %2$s, but can't penetrate their armour."

msgid "A huge, slimy worm-like creature.  Its pale, flattened head drips an oily mucus as it breaches the ground, searching for prey.  Its pinkish mouth opens and closes, revealing long fangs glistening with ropey strands of saliva, which leave smoldering stains wherever they drip."
msgstr "A huge, slimy worm-like creature.  Its pale, flattened head drips an oily mucus as it breaches the ground, searching for prey.  Its pinkish mouth opens and closes, revealing long fangs glistening with ropey strands of saliva, which leave smouldering stains wherever they drip."

msgid "A twisting spot in the air, with some kind of morphing mass at its center."
msgstr "A twisting spot in the air, with some kind of morphing mass at its centre."

msgid "The material stabilizes and reforms itself into a small chunk of unknown composition."
msgstr "The material stabilises and reforms itself into a small chunk of unknown composition."

msgid "Tall, partially armored, barely humanoid creature with a long appendage growing out of its side.  Flexible spearlike rods protrude throughout its body, seemingly holstered under the skin.  It feverishly darts and scouts the surroundings, looking to rip its victims apart."
msgstr "Tall, partially armoured, barely humanoid creature with a long appendage growing out of its side.  Flexible spearlike rods protrude throughout its body, seemingly holstered under the skin.  It feverishly darts and scouts the surroundings, looking to rip its victims apart."

msgid "As it moves, this cat's colors shift unnaturally in the light.  You can't make out the breed, but its fur pattern seems to change with every step."
msgstr "As it moves, this cat's colours shift unnaturally in the light.  You can't make out the breed, but its fur pattern seems to change with every step."

msgid "A resplendent alien fern, crowned with flowers colored deep indigo.  It appears to be the centerpiece of this otherworldly bloom."
msgstr "A resplendent alien fern, crowned with flowers coloured deep indigo.  It appears to be the centrepiece of this otherworldly bloom."

msgid "A dark-colored species of freshwater turtle with bright orange markings."
msgstr "A dark-coloured species of freshwater turtle with bright orange markings."

msgid "A speckled, gray-brown tadpole.  Its tail is broad and paddle-like, and its body rotund.  Sometime soon it will grow legs and lose its tail entirely."
msgstr "A speckled, grey-brown tadpole.  Its tail is broad and paddle-like, and its body rotund.  Sometime soon it will grow legs and lose its tail entirely."

msgid "This yellowish tadpole is covered in flecks of brown and cream coloring.  Its eyes rest close together on a notably pointed face."
msgstr "This yellowish tadpole is covered in flecks of brown and cream colouring.  Its eyes rest close together on a notably pointed face."

msgid "A giant, gray-brown tadpole.  Its body is covered in irregular, chaotic speckles of pitch black and chalk white."
msgstr "A giant, grey-brown tadpole.  Its body is covered in irregular, chaotic speckles of pitch black and chalk white."

msgid "Fowler's toads secrete a harmful and distasteful compound from their backs.  This helps safeguard them from predators and also gives them a distinctive odor like boiled peanuts."
msgstr "Fowler's toads secrete a harmful and distasteful compound from their backs.  This helps safeguard them from predators and also gives them a distinctive odour like boiled peanuts."

msgid "gray treefrog"
msgid_plural "gray treefrogs"
msgstr[0] "grey treefrog"
msgstr[1] "grey treefrogs"

msgid "This treefrog can change its coloration much like a chameleon, shifting from a near-white gray, through greens and browns, to a dark, almost charcoal color."
msgstr "This treefrog can change its coloration much like a chameleon, shifting from a near-white grey, through greens and browns, to a dark, almost charcoal colour."

msgid "You've seen it wrinkle its skin into bark and disappear on a tree; settle on a toadstool and take its spots.  It's no trick of the light, this frog's skin shifts not just color but texture."
msgstr "You've seen it wrinkle its skin into bark and disappear on a tree; settle on a toadstool and take its spots.  It's no trick of the light, this frog's skin shifts not just colour but texture."

msgid "This pungent frog is named for the mammal with which it shares both name and odor.  Its skin is light green underneath a heavy spatter of almost black mottling."
msgstr "This pungent frog is named for the mammal with which it shares both name and odour.  Its skin is light green underneath a heavy spatter of almost black mottling."

msgid "The eastern variety of the American spadefoot toad is a squat, round toad with vertical pupils.  Its body is colored a muddy mixture of browns, tans, and yellow-greens.  Their name comes from the keratinous projection on their hind legs that aids them in digging."
msgstr "The eastern variety of the American spadefoot toad is a squat, round toad with vertical pupils.  Its body is coloured a muddy mixture of browns, tans, and yellow-greens.  Their name comes from the keratinous projection on their hind legs that aids them in digging."

msgid "Bioluminescent trails trace through the dark speckled patterns on this oversized frog's skin.  What would be cleanly defined spots on another frog, are instead fragmented collages of gray and black pigment over pale skin.  Its vestigial gills have grown into something else.  You can see them bulging the flesh under its mouth."
msgstr "Bioluminescent trails trace through the dark speckled patterns on this oversized frog's skin.  What would be cleanly defined spots on another frog, are instead fragmented collages of grey and black pigment over pale skin.  Its vestigial gills have grown into something else.  You can see them bulging the flesh under its mouth."

msgid "This lumpy oversized toad is a real stinker!  A miasma like rotted onions coated in rancid peanut butter surrounds it.  Even approaching it makes your eyes water and your throat tighten until you're coughing to catch breath.  It doesn't help that its leathery skin looks to be coated in a thick greasy substance, no doubt related to the creature's horrid odor."
msgstr "This lumpy oversized toad is a real stinker!  A miasma like rotted onions coated in rancid peanut butter surrounds it.  Even approaching it makes your eyes water and your throat tighten until you're coughing to catch breath.  It doesn't help that its leathery skin looks to be coated in a thick greasy substance, no doubt related to the creature's horrid odour."

msgid "You've seen enough to gather that this is a frog with some very specialized camouflage.  Its skin appears able to reactively change texture and color to match its surroundings.  Like a morphing ghillie suit it can extend filaments to mimic individual leaves and blades of grass.  It is keen enough to match the swaying of brush in the wind."
msgstr "You've seen enough to gather that this is a frog with some very specialised camouflage.  Its skin appears able to reactively change texture and colour to match its surroundings.  Like a morphing ghillie suit it can extend filaments to mimic individual leaves and blades of grass.  It is keen enough to match the swaying of brush in the wind."

msgid "This pale, trash can-sized frog sports a series of faintly glowing spots among its chaotic skin patterns.  The glow seems most concentrated around its unusually bulky neck and mouth.  Its dark eyes scan for an appetizing target."
msgstr "This pale, trash can-sized frog sports a series of faintly glowing spots among its chaotic skin patterns.  The glow seems most concentrated around its unusually bulky neck and mouth.  Its dark eyes scan for an appetising target."

msgid "Bloated to titanic size, rivaling a moose, this mutated bullfrog takes several seconds just to blink each vacant eye.  In place of the cognition it has lost, the beast has gained an even more voracious appetite and the might to sustain it."
msgstr "Bloated to titanic size, rivalling a moose, this mutated bullfrog takes several seconds just to blink each vacant eye.  In place of the cognition it has lost, the beast has gained an even more voracious appetite and the might to sustain it."

msgid "This appears to be a very experimental automated tower.  Lacking armor plating and seemingly half-built, it's little more than an oversized laser emitter and a camera, both welded to a swiveling platform."
msgstr "This appears to be a very experimental automated tower.  Lacking armour plating and seemingly half-built, it's little more than an oversized laser emitter and a camera, both welded to a swivelling platform."

msgid "An armed and up-armored skitterbot, clad in white plastic plating and mounting a stripped down 7.62 battle rifle over its original cam-arm."
msgstr "An armed and up-armoured skitterbot, clad in white plastic plating and mounting a stripped down 7.62 battle rifle over its original cam-arm."

msgid "This cat-sized rat snuffles along the ground looking for things to eat.  It hisses at anything that comes near it, baring sizable teeth."
msgstr "This cat-sized rat snuffles along the ground looking for things to eat.  It hisses at anything that comes near it, baring sizeable teeth."

msgid ""
"You suddenly realize this area seems almost devoid of life.  The few bits of blackened grass you can see are barely recognizable as grass, even discounting the night.  Sure the zombies might be tearing people apart, but what happened to the grass?  What, is the grass coming to life to eat people too?\n"
"You snort at the idea, but it doesn't feel safe out here."
msgstr ""
"You suddenly realise this area seems almost devoid of life.  The few bits of blackened grass you can see are barely recognisable as grass, even discounting the night.  Sure the zombies might be tearing people apart, but what happened to the grass?  What, is the grass coming to life to eat people too?\n"
"You snort at the idea, but it doesn't feel safe out here."

msgid "Suddenly, there are some vague, but threatening shapes in the distance you do not recognize."
msgstr "Suddenly, there are some vague, but threatening shapes in the distance you do not recognise."

msgid "amoebic mold"
msgid_plural "amoebic molds"
msgstr[0] "amoebic mould"
msgstr[1] "amoebic moulds"

msgid "A formless slime mold the size of a cow.  Crusty bits of cytoplasm fall away as it oozes across the ground."
msgstr "A formless slime mould the size of a cow.  Crusty bits of cytoplasm fall away as it oozes across the ground."

msgid "A small wriggling slime, a first line of defense for the colony."
msgstr "A small wriggling slime, a first line of defence for the colony."

msgid "A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  Nature is healing."
msgstr "A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralysing sting concealed within.  Nature is healing."

msgid "An animated mass of roots and vines, creeping along the ground with alarming speed.  The tangle is thick enough that the center from which they grow is concealed."
msgstr "An animated mass of roots and vines, creeping along the ground with alarming speed.  The tangle is thick enough that the centre from which they grow is concealed."

msgid "A giant plant with a thick stalk adorned by a purple flower.  Its petals are open with an ominous shine in the center."
msgstr "A giant plant with a thick stalk adorned by a purple flower.  Its petals are open with an ominous shine in the centre."

msgid "A 9mm MP5 attached to a motorized chassis with basic autonomous software control.  There is no mechanism to reload the weapon when its magazine is empty, and the fire control system is only designed for semi-automatic fire."
msgstr "A 9mm MP5 attached to a motorised chassis with basic autonomous software control.  There is no mechanism to reload the weapon when its magazine is empty, and the fire control system is only designed for semi-automatic fire."

msgid "A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with autonomous operation software.  This one is fitted with a .50 caliber M2HB machine gun."
msgstr "A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with autonomous operation software.  This one is fitted with a .50 calibre M2HB machine gun."

msgid "A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with autonomous operation software.  This one is fitted with a 5.56 caliber M249 machine gun."
msgstr "A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with autonomous operation software.  This one is fitted with a 5.56 calibre M249 machine gun."

msgid "A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with autonomous operation software.  This one is fitted with a 7.62 caliber M240 machine gun."
msgstr "A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with autonomous operation software.  This one is fitted with a 7.62 calibre M240 machine gun."

msgid "These TALON-derived riot control platforms were widely publicized a few years before the Cataclysm as a new semi-autonomous device that could fire less-lethal rounds with far more accuracy than a human, ensuring safer hits against a target's limbs.  They were quickly adopted by prisons and inner-city police forces, where they demonstrated that 'less lethal' does not mean 'non-lethal'.  In the days before the Cataclysm, massive stockrooms of these things were put into circulation.  On the bright side, although it shoots autonomously, it requires a human operator to relocate, so it's not mobile anymore."
msgstr "These TALON-derived riot control platforms were widely publicised a few years before the Cataclysm as a new semi-autonomous device that could fire less-lethal rounds with far more accuracy than a human, ensuring safer hits against a target's limbs.  They were quickly adopted by prisons and inner-city police forces, where they demonstrated that 'less lethal' does not mean 'non-lethal'.  In the days before the Cataclysm, massive stockrooms of these things were put into circulation.  On the bright side, although it shoots autonomously, it requires a human operator to relocate, so it's not mobile anymore."

msgid "\"Universal curfew is in effect.  Please return to your home.  This unit is authorized to open fire.\""
msgstr "\"Universal curfew is in effect.  Please return to your home.  This unit is authorised to open fire.\""

msgid "A charred and damaged corpse of what you can only assume was once a horribly mutated dog.  Covering its entire body is a layer of fused and melted hide, giving it an armored appearance."
msgstr "A charred and damaged corpse of what you can only assume was once a horribly mutated dog.  Covering its entire body is a layer of fused and melted hide, giving it an armoured appearance."

msgid "smoldering stallion"
msgid_plural "smoldering stallions"
msgstr[0] "smouldering stallion"
msgstr[1] "smouldering stallions"

msgid "Once a former apex predator of the seas, now an undead nightmare, this zombified Great White shark terrorizes the waters with its relentless hunger and aggression."
msgstr "Once a former apex predator of the seas, now an undead nightmare, this zombified Great White shark terrorises the waters with its relentless hunger and aggression."

msgid "A once-dead human corpse.  Its discolored, swollen flesh is riddled with festering wounds and open sores."
msgstr "A once-dead human corpse.  Its discoloured, swollen flesh is riddled with festering wounds and open sores."

msgid "This zombie was part of a specialized unit of law enforcement.  It still wears a battered armor with the SWAT logo emblazoned on the front.  The protective mask makes its head a difficult target, but also prevents it from biting you."
msgstr "This zombie was part of a specialised unit of law enforcement.  It still wears a battered armour with the SWAT logo emblazoned on the front.  The protective mask makes its head a difficult target, but also prevents it from biting you."

msgid "A malformed armor of misshapen bone has grown over this zombie, having pushed what remains of the skin out of the way.  The clothes of a medical worker are still draped over it."
msgstr "A malformed armour of misshapen bone has grown over this zombie, having pushed what remains of the skin out of the way.  The clothes of a medical worker are still draped over it."

msgid "This half of a human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover everything from the neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."
msgstr "This half of a human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibres that cover everything from the neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."

msgid "This human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover everything from the neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."
msgstr "This human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibres that cover everything from the neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."

msgid "This muscular human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover everything from the neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."
msgstr "This muscular human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibres that cover everything from the neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."

msgid "The bloated torso of this gigantic corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."
msgstr "The bloated torso of this gigantic corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibres.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."

msgid "A short, crablike creature waddling around on six multi-jointed legs, its body dominated by a large glowing organ bulging from between the white armor plates.  A single raised appendage connects to the mass, its tip surrounded by brilliant white sparks."
msgstr "A short, crablike creature waddling around on six multi-jointed legs, its body dominated by a large glowing organ bulging from between the white armour plates.  A single raised appendage connects to the mass, its tip surrounded by brilliant white sparks."

msgid "A large, thickly armored creature built not unlike a bear, if a bear had a long, clubbed tail and two short limbs ending in black talons framing a vertical mouth on an otherwise smooth, featureless head.  On second thought, not that much like a bear at all."
msgstr "A large, thickly armoured creature built not unlike a bear, if a bear had a long, clubbed tail and two short limbs ending in black talons framing a vertical mouth on an otherwise smooth, featureless head.  On second thought, not that much like a bear at all."

msgid "The hum coming from this giant, rotten frog sounds unlike any kind of vocalization.  The sound is clearly a result of the bolts of electricity that skip across its skin and arc between its lips."
msgstr "The hum coming from this giant, rotten frog sounds unlike any kind of vocalisation.  The sound is clearly a result of the bolts of electricity that skip across its skin and arc between its lips."

msgid "Even without the haze of smoke that constantly fumes off of it, it would be difficult to tell what this once was.  The massive thing seems to have dried out and shriveled up, though unevenly.  Rind through core it has warped.  Its whole dry body crinkles and folds as it moves."
msgstr "Even without the haze of smoke that constantly fumes off of it, it would be difficult to tell what this once was.  The massive thing seems to have dried out and shrivelled up, though unevenly.  Rind through core it has warped.  Its whole dry body crinkles and folds as it moves."

msgid "A heavily burned zombie that still reeks of charred meat.  Its now leathery flesh has mended into patches, giving it a more armored appearance."
msgstr "A heavily burned zombie that still reeks of charred meat.  Its now leathery flesh has mended into patches, giving it a more armoured appearance."

msgid "A heavily burned corpse with unnaturally long arms dragging behind it as it moves.  The burnt scar tissue covering it gives it a mildly armored appearance."
msgstr "A heavily burned corpse with unnaturally long arms dragging behind it as it moves.  The burnt scar tissue covering it gives it a mildly armoured appearance."

msgid "A monstrous burnt vaguely humanoid creature, walking around on its knuckles like a gorilla.  Tattered and blackened strands of muscle fibers dangle all around its body, with patches of fused melded skin and bone visible between.  Its forelimbs end in lengthy skeletal claws."
msgstr "A monstrous burnt vaguely humanoid creature, walking around on its knuckles like a gorilla.  Tattered and blackened strands of muscle fibres dangle all around its body, with patches of fused melded skin and bone visible between.  Its forelimbs end in lengthy skeletal claws."

msgid "A heavily burned zombie that still reeks of charred meat.  Its now leathery flesh has mended into patches, giving it a more armored appearance.  This one appears to have metal fragments sticking out of its body."
msgstr "A heavily burned zombie that still reeks of charred meat.  Its now leathery flesh has mended into patches, giving it a more armoured appearance.  This one appears to have metal fragments sticking out of its body."

msgid "A strange zombie covered in bone plates from face to toe.  Despite the added weight on its body, its movements are coordinated, almost as if capable of analyzing your movements."
msgstr "A strange zombie covered in bone plates from face to toe.  Despite the added weight on its body, its movements are coordinated, almost as if capable of analysing your movements."

msgid "A twisted visage of the human body decked in bone from head to toe.  Its vague shape is reminiscent of some tabletop monster, and it walks and watches your actions with a cold and calculating demeanor."
msgstr "A twisted visage of the human body decked in bone from head to toe.  Its vague shape is reminiscent of some tabletop monster, and it walks and watches your actions with a cold and calculating demeanour."

msgid "A rotund human body, bloated beyond belief and layered in rolls of fat.  It emits a horrible odor, and a putrid pink sludge dribbles from its mouth."
msgstr "A rotund human body, bloated beyond belief and layered in rolls of fat.  It emits a horrible odour, and a putrid pink sludge dribbles from its mouth."

msgid "With its gray skin swollen to near-rupture with putrid gas, this cyst-covered zombie looks like it could violently burst under the slightest of disturbances."
msgstr "With its grey skin swollen to near-rupture with putrid gas, this cyst-covered zombie looks like it could violently burst under the slightest of disturbances."

msgid "A bloated corpse, its ballooning skin blistered and rashy and its face caked in mucus.  The off-color orange gas that occasionally leaks from it makes your eyes water and smells faintly of pepper."
msgstr "A bloated corpse, its ballooning skin blistered and rashy and its face caked in mucus.  The off-colour orange gas that occasionally leaks from it makes your eyes water and smells faintly of pepper."

msgid "Ruptures in this zombie's skin expose fragments of metal arranged like armor underneath.  Black sludge can be seen in places where the rust has receded."
msgstr "Ruptures in this zombie's skin expose fragments of metal arranged like armour underneath.  Black sludge can be seen in places where the rust has receded."

msgid "A tangle of security personnel fused with their gear and with each other, warped limbs and flesh-covered equipment moving in strange unison.  Every so often you glimpse a pitch-black figure at its center, limbs mirroring the movements of the larger mass."
msgstr "A tangle of security personnel fused with their gear and with each other, warped limbs and flesh-covered equipment moving in strange unison.  Every so often you glimpse a pitch-black figure at its centre, limbs mirroring the movements of the larger mass."

msgid "Covered in grievous wounds, this wretch's gray skin has bloated to near-rupture with putrid gas.  Between lumps of unrecognizable gore, a human head lamely follows your movements with empty, black eyes."
msgstr "Covered in grievous wounds, this wretch's grey skin has bloated to near-rupture with putrid gas.  Between lumps of unrecognisable gore, a human head lamely follows your movements with empty, black eyes."

msgid "A shambling human corpse wearing a gray uniform and a bulletproof vest with \"SECURITY\" emblazoned across the front.  It looks like this guard was quite physically fit before its death; it moves quickly and powerfully, albeit clumsily."
msgstr "A shambling human corpse wearing a grey uniform and a bulletproof vest with \"SECURITY\" emblazoned across the front.  It looks like this guard was quite physically fit before its death; it moves quickly and powerfully, albeit clumsily."

msgid "a gap in the armor"
msgstr "a gap in the armour"

msgid "This zombie's head was once obviously destroyed, the gaps in its scraps of face now filling with a peculiar gray goo.  Human ears hang from the sides, enormous and unsettling.  Thin slits at the front suggest it may have a (very limited) sense of sight."
msgstr "This zombie's head was once obviously destroyed, the gaps in its scraps of face now filling with a peculiar grey goo.  Human ears hang from the sides, enormous and unsettling.  Thin slits at the front suggest it may have a (very limited) sense of sight."

msgid "A zombie prowling around on all fours; its exposed muscles churn and snake, unraveling before restitching themselves elsewhere along its red-raw figure."
msgstr "A zombie prowling around on all fours; its exposed muscles churn and snake, unravelling before restitching themselves elsewhere along its red-raw figure."

msgid "This zombie's head is a hideous gray skull, formed of human bone fragments and some sort of goo.  Jagged teeth are visible as the thing works its jaw, and lidless, disturbingly human eyes stare at you from their sockets.  The thing's fleshy ears are four sizes too large and droop under their own weight."
msgstr "This zombie's head is a hideous grey skull, formed of human bone fragments and some sort of goo.  Jagged teeth are visible as the thing works its jaw, and lidless, disturbingly human eyes stare at you from their sockets.  The thing's fleshy ears are four sizes too large and droop under their own weight."

msgid "This otherwise-regular zombie's head is absolutely filled to the brim with eyes, half of them frantically swiveling in their orbits.  The other half are staring directly at you."
msgstr "This otherwise-regular zombie's head is absolutely filled to the brim with eyes, half of them frantically swivelling in their orbits.  The other half are staring directly at you."

msgid "A human body, swaying awkwardly in a torn cloth suit of an anthropomorphized animal.  Black goo and blood cakes the suit, and it gives off a foul, rotting odor."
msgstr "A human body, swaying awkwardly in a torn cloth suit of an anthropomorphised animal.  Black goo and blood cakes the suit, and it gives off a foul, rotting odour."

msgid "This zombie was a firefighter in its past life, still donned in its turnout equipment - said equipment has melded with its flesh, with the tough, flame resistant fibers becoming incorporated into its skin as armor and body mass."
msgstr "This zombie was a firefighter in its past life, still donned in its turnout equipment - said equipment has melded with its flesh, with the tough, flame resistant fibres becoming incorporated into its skin as armour and body mass."

msgid "This zombie appears to have once been a firefighter or similar first responder, the wilted remains of its turnout gear clinging to it like a molted carapace.  Fibrous streaks resembling the fireproof materials of its gear run through its flesh like roots, giving the thing a mottled, off-yellow appearance as it prowls on all fours."
msgstr "This zombie appears to have once been a firefighter or similar first responder, the wilted remains of its turnout gear clinging to it like a moulted carapace.  Fibrous streaks resembling the fireproof materials of its gear run through its flesh like roots, giving the thing a mottled, off-yellow appearance as it prowls on all fours."

msgid "This zombie appears to have once been a firefighter or similar first responder, its body having ripped through and absorbed the majority of its uniform.  Its torso and back are swollen, and its muscles are marbled with knotted growths resembling the Nomex fibers of its former gear, feeding into lanky arms that drag on the floor."
msgstr "This zombie appears to have once been a firefighter or similar first responder, its body having ripped through and absorbed the majority of its uniform.  Its torso and back are swollen, and its muscles are marbled with knotted growths resembling the Nomex fibres of its former gear, feeding into lanky arms that drag on the floor."

msgid "This zombie appears to have once been a firefighter or similar first responder, but the uniform is hardly recognizable at this point, as the thing has grown new flesh and muscle overtop.  Its sinewy body has taken on a composition similar to the uniform's fire-resistant fabric, most of it congealed into a pair of clubs on the ends of its hands."
msgstr "This zombie appears to have once been a firefighter or similar first responder, but the uniform is hardly recognisable at this point, as the thing has grown new flesh and muscle overtop.  Its sinewy body has taken on a composition similar to the uniform's fire-resistant fabric, most of it congealed into a pair of clubs on the ends of its hands."

msgid "A monstrous overgrowth of ossified tissue has replaced this zombie's rotting skin with an organic armor of dense bone.  Large clumps of black goo seep from its joints as it shambles aimlessly, with sickening crackling sounds filling the surrounding air."
msgstr "A monstrous overgrowth of ossified tissue has replaced this zombie's rotting skin with an organic armour of dense bone.  Large clumps of black goo seep from its joints as it shambles aimlessly, with sickening crackling sounds filling the surrounding air."

msgid "This large, bone-armored zombie has scythe-like blades in place of its hands, resembling a praying mantis.  Its face is covered by a thick, ossified mask, with its only remaining facial features being eyes that ooze black goo.  Its movements are filled with unnatural rage."
msgstr "This large, bone-armoured zombie has scythe-like blades in place of its hands, resembling a praying mantis.  Its face is covered by a thick, ossified mask, with its only remaining facial features being eyes that ooze black goo.  Its movements are filled with unnatural rage."

msgid "This zombie wears what appears to have once been a soldier's uniform and armor, now a series of cracked and melted plates that have fused to its skin and thickened hide.  Its face and arms blister with strange, mutated tubes that pulse and drip with acid."
msgstr "This zombie wears what appears to have once been a soldier's uniform and armour, now a series of cracked and melted plates that have fused to its skin and thickened hide.  Its face and arms blister with strange, mutated tubes that pulse and drip with acid."

msgid "This zombie was once wearing some kind of uniform with heavy, bulletproof materials sewn in.  At this point it's impossible to tell what kind of uniform it was: the monster's skin has grown over the fabric, splitting and tearing it to shreds, turning the remaining Kevlar and other bits of armor material into part of its hide.  Its hands have similarly fused into large, leathery cudgels."
msgstr "This zombie was once wearing some kind of uniform with heavy, bulletproof materials sewn in.  At this point it's impossible to tell what kind of uniform it was: the monster's skin has grown over the fabric, splitting and tearing it to shreds, turning the remaining Kevlar and other bits of armour material into part of its hide.  Its hands have similarly fused into large, leathery cudgels."

msgid "Dressed in the shredded blue dress uniform of a naval officer, this undead corpse was evidently a higher ranking crewman in life.  Having more than likely not been clad in body armor, the result now staggers before you: horrific wounds exposed to the air and large portions of flesh and muscle ripped from its glistening skeleton."
msgstr "Dressed in the shredded blue dress uniform of a naval officer, this undead corpse was evidently a higher ranking crewman in life.  Having more than likely not been clad in body armour, the result now staggers before you: horrific wounds exposed to the air and large portions of flesh and muscle ripped from its glistening skeleton."

msgid "Lumbering about on all fours, this mutated beast's dagger-like claws clack against the ground as it predatorially moves: thick strands of exposed muscle tissue running across its rotting body.  The addition of its new bulk has caused the skin along its arms and back to split, and the brute's teeth have extended into spikes of bone.  The Marine insignias on the remains of the creature's pulverized gear are the only testaments to the soldier that this hulking abomination used to be."
msgstr "Lumbering about on all fours, this mutated beast's dagger-like claws clack against the ground as it predatorially moves: thick strands of exposed muscle tissue running across its rotting body.  The addition of its new bulk has caused the skin along its arms and back to split, and the brute's teeth have extended into spikes of bone.  The Marine insignias on the remains of the creature's pulverised gear are the only testaments to the soldier that this hulking abomination used to be."

msgid "Lumbering about on all fours, this mutated beast's dagger-like claws clack against the ground as it predatorially moves: thick strands of exposed muscle tissue running across its rotting body.  The addition of its new bulk has caused the skin along its arms and back to split, and the brute's teeth have extended into spikes of bone.  The military insignias on the remains of the creature's pulverized gear are the only testaments to the soldier that this hulking abomination used to be."
msgstr "Lumbering about on all fours, this mutated beast's dagger-like claws clack against the ground as it predatorially moves: thick strands of exposed muscle tissue running across its rotting body.  The addition of its new bulk has caused the skin along its arms and back to split, and the brute's teeth have extended into spikes of bone.  The military insignias on the remains of the creature's pulverised gear are the only testaments to the soldier that this hulking abomination used to be."

msgid "armored zombie"
msgid_plural "armored zombies"
msgstr[0] "armoured zombie"
msgstr[1] "armoured zombies"

msgid "Still wearing the tattered remnants of improvised armor and weaponry, it is plain to see that this zombie was once a survivor like you."
msgstr "Still wearing the tattered remnants of improvised armour and weaponry, it is plain to see that this zombie was once a survivor like you."

msgid "Wearing military surplus gear including an armored vest with patches of local militias, cartoon women, obscene statements, or local political groups.  This person definitely thought they were ready for the apocalypse."
msgstr "Wearing military surplus gear including an armoured vest with patches of local militias, cartoon women, obscene statements, or local political groups.  This person definitely thought they were ready for the apocalypse."

msgid "This zombie once was a survivor like you, and a pretty good one at that.  Unfortunately they didn't make it, despite the custom-made, heavy armor pieces they wear and the gear that they are still lugging around."
msgstr "This zombie once was a survivor like you, and a pretty good one at that.  Unfortunately they didn't make it, despite the custom-made, heavy armour pieces they wear and the gear that they are still lugging around."

msgid "What likely used to be the arms of this zombie are now a set of strange, purplish tentacles, with what appear to be vestigial fingers at the end.  They trail several meters behind the tall zombie as it shambles along."
msgstr "What likely used to be the arms of this zombie are now a set of strange, purplish tentacles, with what appear to be vestigial fingers at the end.  They trail several metres behind the tall zombie as it shambles along."

msgid "In front of you lies the most disgusting rendition of a starfish you've ever seen.  Not just the arms, but the legs and even the head have been horrendously deformed and stretched several meters long.  It walks around hunchback, looking through the remains of its head for its next victim."
msgstr "In front of you lies the most disgusting rendition of a starfish you've ever seen.  Not just the arms, but the legs and even the head have been horrendously deformed and stretched several metres long.  It walks around hunchback, looking through the remains of its head for its next victim."

