msgid "You have a mustache and a short beard, that both form a circle around your lips."
msgstr "You have a moustache and a short beard, that both form a circle around your lips."

msgid "You have a mustache and a short beard forming a patch under your lips."
msgstr "You have a moustache and a short beard forming a patch under your lips."

msgid "You have a mustache and a beard starting with a strip going down from the bottom lip, then tracing the jaw lines.  It looks a bit like an anchor, thus the name."
msgstr "You have a moustache and a beard starting with a strip going down from the bottom lip, then tracing the jaw lines.  It looks a bit like an anchor, thus the name."

msgid "You have a mustache and a short beard with trimmed sides.  Thin patches connect them both, forming a 'box' around the lips, thus the name."
msgstr "You have a moustache and a short beard with trimmed sides.  Thin patches connect them both, forming a 'box' around the lips, thus the name."

msgid "Facial hair: chevron mustache"
msgstr "Facial hair: chevron moustache"

msgid "You have a mustache that covers your entire top lip."
msgstr "You have a moustache that covers your entire top lip."

msgid "You have a short trimmed mustache and beard imitating a 3-day stubble."
msgstr "You have a short trimmed moustache and beard imitating a 3-day stubble."

msgid "You have a mustache with patches going down the chin from both ends, thus the name."
msgstr "You have a moustache with patches going down the chin from both ends, thus the name."

msgid "Facial hair: original mustache"
msgstr "Facial hair: original moustache"

msgid "You have a mustache with shortened ends, that covers only the skin above your upper lip."
msgstr "You have a moustache with shortened ends, that covers only the skin above your upper lip."

msgid "You have long sideburns that connect to your mustache, with the tip of the chin shaven clean."
msgstr "You have long sideburns that connect to your moustache, with the tip of the chin shaven clean."

msgid "You have a horseshoe mustache and disconnected sideburns."
msgstr "You have a horseshoe moustache and disconnected sideburns."

msgid "You have a full beard without a mustache, restricted to the chin, sometimes called a 'lion's mane'. Much like Abraham Lincoln's beard."
msgstr "You have a full beard without a moustache, restricted to the chin, sometimes called a 'lion's mane'. Much like Abraham Lincoln's beard."

msgid "You have a beard along the jaw lines, circling the chin, and no mustache."
msgstr "You have a beard along the jaw lines, circling the chin, and no moustache."

msgid "You have a mustache and a long beard, both formed by allowing free growth of hair, with no particular styling."
msgstr "You have a moustache and a long beard, both formed by allowing free growth of hair, with no particular styling."

msgid "Facial hair: handlebar mustache"
msgstr "Facial hair: handlebar moustache"

msgid "You have a mustache with long flared out ends."
msgstr "You have a moustache with long flared out ends."

msgid "You have a beard formed from hair grown on neck below the chin line.  No mustache included."
msgstr "You have a beard formed from hair grown on neck below the chin line.  No moustache included."

msgid "Facial hair: pencil mustache"
msgstr "Facial hair: pencil moustache"

msgid "You have a very thin mustache just above the line of the upper lip."
msgstr "You have a very thin moustache just above the line of the upper lip."

msgid "Long full beard with no mustache, popular among Amish community, often with two pointed ends."
msgstr "Long full beard with no moustache, popular among Amish community, often with two pointed ends."

msgid "Facial hair: toothbrush mustache"
msgstr "Facial hair: toothbrush moustache"

msgid "You have a handlebar mustache with a chin strip or a small goatee."
msgstr "You have a handlebar moustache with a chin strip or a small goatee."

msgid "You have a long thick mustache, overshadowing your lips, that somewhat resembles the facial hair of a walrus."
msgstr "You have a long thick moustache, overshadowing your lips, that somewhat resembles the facial hair of a walrus."

msgid "You have a wide soul patch and a full mustache that extends a bit downwards at the corners of your lips."
msgstr "You have a wide soul patch and a full moustache that extends a bit downwards at the corners of your lips."

msgid "You have a long beard, that goes down to your chest.  Somewhat reminiscent of Santa's mustache."
msgstr "You have a long beard, that goes down to your chest.  Somewhat reminiscent of Santa's moustache."

msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Realized the dream."
msgstr "Realised the dream."

msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Realized the dream."
msgstr "Realised the dream."

msgid "Human Acclimatization"
msgstr "Human Acclimatisation"

msgid "You can spit a wad of bioluminescent goo several meters away.  There it will light up its surroundings until it dissipates."
msgstr "You can spit a wad of bioluminescent goo several metres away.  There it will light up its surroundings until it dissipates."

msgid "Whether due to exercise and good diet, or due to a natural propensity to physical endurance, you tire due to physical exertion much less readily than others.  Your cardio fitness and maximum stamina are higher than usual."
msgstr "Whether due to exercise and good diet, or due to a natural propensity to physical endurance, you tyre due to physical exertion much less readily than others.  Your cardio fitness and maximum stamina are higher than usual."

msgid "Stabilized in Reality"
msgstr "Stabilised in Reality"

msgid "You have regained some substance and have stabilized somewhat, if not entirely.  Portal storm withdrawal will not affect you as strongly as before."
msgstr "You have regained some substance and have stabilised somewhat, if not entirely.  Portal storm withdrawal will not affect you as strongly as before."

msgid "Nothing gets you down!  You savor the joys of life, ignore its hardships, and are generally happier than most people."
msgstr "Nothing gets you down!  You savour the joys of life, ignore its hardships, and are generally happier than most people."

msgid "You've been taught proper table manners from your early childhood on; now, you can't even think about eating without being seated at a table and taking your time.  Eating without a table and chair frustrates you, but eating like a civilized person gives you a bigger morale bonus."
msgstr "You've been taught proper table manners from your early childhood on; now, you can't even think about eating without being seated at a table and taking your time.  Eating without a table and chair frustrates you, but eating like a civilised person gives you a bigger morale bonus."

msgid "You eat faster, and can eat and drink more, than anyone else!  You also enjoy food more; delicious food is better for your morale, and you don't mind unsavory meals as much.  Activate to skip prompt for overeating."
msgstr "You eat faster, and can eat and drink more, than anyone else!  You also enjoy food more; delicious food is better for your morale, and you don't mind unsavoury meals as much.  Activate to skip prompt for overeating."

msgid "You're an excellent navigator and your ability to recognize distant landmarks is unmatched.  Your sight radius on the overmap extends beyond the normal range."
msgstr "You're an excellent navigator and your ability to recognise distant landmarks is unmatched.  Your sight radius on the overmap extends beyond the normal range."

msgid "Focal brain damage has rendered you incapable of recognizing landmarks and orienting yourself in your surroundings, severely crippling your sight radius on the overmap."
msgstr "Focal brain damage has rendered you incapable of recognising landmarks and orienting yourself in your surroundings, severely crippling your sight radius on the overmap."

msgid "Self-Defense Classes"
msgstr "Self-Defence Classes"

msgid "You have taken some self-defense classes at a nearby gym.  You start with your choice of Boxing, Kickboxing, Capoeira, Krav Maga, Muay Thai, Ninjutsu, Wing Chun, or Zui Quan."
msgstr "You have taken some self-defence classes at a nearby gym.  You start with your choice of Boxing, Kickboxing, Capoeira, Krav Maga, Muay Thai, Ninjutsu, Wing Chun, or Zui Quan."

msgid "You were an avid fencer, starting with foil and moving onto saber, then épée.  You competed nationally and dabbled with some of the historical fencing weapons afforded by HEMA's popularity."
msgstr "You were an avid fencer, starting with foil and moving onto sabre, then épée.  You competed nationally and dabbled with some of the historical fencing weapons afforded by HEMA's popularity."

msgid "Whether due to lack of exercise and poor diet, or due to a natural disinclination to physical endurance, you tire due to physical exertion much more readily than others.  Your total cardio fitness and stamina are lower than normal."
msgstr "Whether due to lack of exercise and poor diet, or due to a natural disinclination to physical endurance, you tyre due to physical exertion much more readily than others.  Your total cardio fitness and stamina are lower than normal."

msgid "Disorganized"
msgstr "Disorganised"

#, no-c-format
msgid "You are terrible at organizing and storing your possessions.  You retrieve things from containers 10% slower."
msgstr "You are terrible at organising and storing your possessions.  You retrieve things from containers 10% slower."

msgid "You tend to specialize in one skill and be poor at all others.  You advance at half speed in all skills except your best one.  Note that combining this with Fast Learner will come out to a slower rate of learning for all skills."
msgstr "You tend to specialise in one skill and be poor at all others.  You advance at half speed in all skills except your best one.  Note that combining this with Fast Learner will come out to a slower rate of learning for all skills."

msgid "Your skin has lost some of its color and taken on a smooth, papery texture.  This slightly reduces wet effects, but also makes you a little more vulnerable to cuts and scrapes."
msgstr "Your skin has lost some of its colour and taken on a smooth, papery texture.  This slightly reduces wet effects, but also makes you a little more vulnerable to cuts and scrapes."

msgid "We have spliced the dense, amphibole fibers from Mycus core towers with the resilient, adaptive flesh of local physiology.  This reduces our speed by a moderate amount, but provides powerful armor across our body, nullifies wet effects, and provides complete protection from fire."
msgstr "We have spliced the dense, amphibole fibres from Mycus core towers with the resilient, adaptive flesh of local physiology.  This reduces our speed by a moderate amount, but provides powerful armour across our body, nullifies wet effects, and provides complete protection from fire."

msgid "Local physiology has been fully incorporated with that of Mycus silicate fibers.  In addition to benefits conferred by previous developments, we may join with Mycus fibers beneath us - sleeping on top of fungal areas places us into a dormant state, which spreads spores around us as we sleep and revitalizes our body much more quickly than regular sleep."
msgstr "Local physiology has been fully incorporated with that of Mycus silicate fibres.  In addition to benefits conferred by previous developments, we may join with Mycus fibres beneath us - sleeping on top of fungal areas places us into a dormant state, which spreads spores around us as we sleep and revitalises our body much more quickly than regular sleep."

msgid "Your skin has toughened and grown thin, flexible scales in some places, acting as natural armor."
msgstr "Your skin has toughened and grown thin, flexible scales in some places, acting as natural armour."

msgid "Your skin has grown thick and leathery and a set of heavy green scales has grown to cover most of your body, acting as natural armor.  Further, bony scutes cover your extremities, offering additional protection there.  While difficult to penetrate, it also limits your flexibility.  Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "Your skin has grown thick and leathery and a set of heavy green scales has grown to cover most of your body, acting as natural armour.  Further, bony scutes cover your extremities, offering additional protection there.  While difficult to penetrate, it also limits your flexibility.  Greatly reduces wet effects."

msgid "A set of very flexible and slick scales has grown to cover your toughened skin.  These act as decent natural armor, improve your ability to swim, and make you difficult to grab.  Mostly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "A set of very flexible and slick scales has grown to cover your toughened skin.  These act as decent natural armour, improve your ability to swim, and make you difficult to grab.  Mostly reduces wet effects."

msgid "Gray Fur"
msgstr "Grey Fur"

msgid "Dense gray fur has grown to cover your entire body, providing noticeable protection against attacks, and considerable protection from cold."
msgstr "Dense grey fur has grown to cover your entire body, providing noticeable protection against attacks, and considerable protection from cold."

msgid "Patchwork Armor"
msgstr "Patchwork Armour"

msgid "Epicuticle (Molted)"
msgstr "Epicuticle (Moulted)"

msgid "Your epidermis has turned into a thin, flexible layer of chitin.  Newly molted, it feels a little tender, but it's still tough and leathery."
msgstr "Your epidermis has turned into a thin, flexible layer of chitin.  Newly moulted, it feels a little tender, but it's still tough and leathery."

msgid "Chitin Carapace (Molted)"
msgstr "Chitin Carapace (Moulted)"

msgid "You've recently molted, and your chitin exoskeleton is still soft and vulnerable."
msgstr "You've recently moulted, and your chitin exoskeleton is still soft and vulnerable."

msgid "Sclerotin Plate (Molted)"
msgstr "Sclerotin Plate (Moulted)"

msgid "Your exoskeleton bears thick plates of chitin which have not fully sclerotized.  They won't provide good protection until they've had time to harden."
msgstr "Your exoskeleton bears thick plates of chitin which have not fully sclerotised.  They won't provide good protection until they've had time to harden."

msgid "Your body is covered with a thick, near impenetrable, vividly-colored carapace.  It provides unmatched physical protection and even some protection from corrosive chemicals, but reduces your dexterity by 2 and encumbers all body parts except your eyes.  Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "Your body is covered with a thick, near impenetrable, vividly-coloured carapace.  It provides unmatched physical protection and even some protection from corrosive chemicals, but reduces your dexterity by 2 and encumbers all body parts except your eyes.  Greatly reduces wet effects."

msgid "Crustacean Carapace (Molted)"
msgstr "Crustacean Carapace (Moulted)"

msgid "You're covered in a great chitin carapace which reduces your Dexterity by 1, however it has recently molted and will offer poor protection until it has time to harden.  Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "You're covered in a great chitin carapace which reduces your Dexterity by 1, however it has recently moulted and will offer poor protection until it has time to harden.  Greatly reduces wet effects."

msgid "Your skin is light green and has a slightly woody quality to it.  This provides armor and helps you retain moisture, resulting in less thirst.  Greatly decreases wet penalties."
msgstr "Your skin is light green and has a slightly woody quality to it.  This provides armour and helps you retain moisture, resulting in less thirst.  Greatly decreases wet penalties."

msgid "Your skin is coated in a light bark, like that of a tree.  This provides powerful armor and makes you nearly waterproof."
msgstr "Your skin is coated in a light bark, like that of a tree.  This provides powerful armour and makes you nearly waterproof."

msgid "Your leaves have grown in size and prominence, with additional leaves sprouting along your arms.  While your arms and head are uncovered, you will photosynthesize nutrients while in sunlight.  Reduces wet effects."
msgstr "Your leaves have grown in size and prominence, with additional leaves sprouting along your arms.  While your arms and head are uncovered, you will photosynthesise nutrients while in sunlight.  Reduces wet effects."

msgid "We have synchronized our local physiology with that of the Mycus.  Any spores we may encounter will not attempt to germinate inside the local system, and we may traverse Mycus biospheres easily, as native bioforms shift shape to accommodate us."
msgstr "We have synchronised our local physiology with that of the Mycus.  Any spores we may encounter will not attempt to germinate inside the local system, and we may traverse Mycus biospheres easily, as native bioforms shift shape to accommodate us."

msgid "Your feet have fused into hooves.  This allows you to perform a powerful kicking attack, provides natural armor, and removes the need to wear shoes; however, you cannot wear normal shoes.  Reduces wet effects."
msgstr "Your feet have fused into hooves.  This allows you to perform a powerful kicking attack, provides natural armour, and removes the need to wear shoes; however, you cannot wear normal shoes.  Reduces wet effects."

msgid "So it's fermented?  Whatever, it's still good drinking.  You've developed the ability to metabolize alcohol as a food source."
msgstr "So it's fermented?  Whatever, it's still good drinking.  You've developed the ability to metabolise alcohol as a food source."

msgid "Your digestive system is specialized to allow you to consume decaying material.  You can eat rotten food, albeit for less nutrition than usual."
msgstr "Your digestive system is specialised to allow you to consume decaying material.  You can eat rotten food, albeit for less nutrition than usual."

msgid "Saber Teeth"
msgstr "Sabre Teeth"

#, c-format
msgid "You tear into %s with your saber teeth!"
msgstr "You tear into %s with your sabre teeth!"

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tears into %2$s with their saber teeth!"
msgstr "%1$s tears into %2$s with their sabre teeth!"

msgid "You have a fin-like tail.  It allows you to swim more quickly, but prevents wearing non-fabric pants.  Slightly increases wet benefits."
msgstr "You have a fin-like tail.  It allows you to swim more quickly, but prevents wearing non-fabric trousers.  Slightly increases wet benefits."

msgid "You have a long, graceful tail, like that of a big cat.  It improves your balance, making your ability to dodge higher, but prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "You have a long, graceful tail, like that of a big cat.  It improves your balance, making your ability to dodge higher, but prevents wearing non-fabric trousers."

msgid "You have a long tail with a tuft on the end.  You find yourself instinctively swatting away flies with it, though it's not as effective at balancing you as you'd like.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "You have a long tail with a tuft on the end.  You find yourself instinctively swatting away flies with it, though it's not as effective at balancing you as you'd like.  Prevents wearing non-fabric trousers."

msgid "You have a long but hairless tail.  It's a pretty effective balancing aid, but does look, uh, ratty.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "You have a long but hairless tail.  It's a pretty effective balancing aid, but does look, uh, ratty.  Prevents wearing non-fabric trousers."

msgid "You have a long, thick, lizardlike tail.  It helps you balance a bit but also makes a serviceable whip.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "You have a long, thick, lizardlike tail.  It helps you balance a bit but also makes a serviceable whip.  Prevents wearing non-fabric trousers."

msgid "Your face has drastically mutated, with the bones of your jaws having extended forth into a long, tapered snout.  The palate of your mouth is considerably vaulted, with curved, serrated teeth lining your saurian maw and reptilian scales covering your muzzle's exterior.  While paleobiology has evidently not evolved with mouth gear in mind (making such items unwearable), the bite wounds you can now inflict promise the ferocity of long-dead beasts."
msgstr "Your face has drastically mutated, with the bones of your jaws having extended forth into a long, tapered snout.  The palate of your mouth is considerably vaulted, with curved, serrated teeth lining your saurian maw and reptilian scales covering your muzzle's exterior.  While palaeobiology has evidently not evolved with mouth gear in mind (making such items unwearable), the bite wounds you can now inflict promise the ferocity of long-dead beasts."

msgid "Formed from a network of interlocking bones, a long tail has mutated from the base of your spine, with ossified tendons assisting in keeping the limb stiff and rigid.  A plume of lengthy feathers sprouts from the reptilian flesh along your new tail, drawing the eye.  While it is useless in combat and prevents you from wearing non-fabric pants, you find it's pretty handy for maintaining your balance."
msgstr "Formed from a network of interlocking bones, a long tail has mutated from the base of your spine, with ossified tendons assisting in keeping the limb stiff and rigid.  A plume of lengthy feathers sprouts from the reptilian flesh along your new tail, drawing the eye.  While it is useless in combat and prevents you from wearing non-fabric trousers, you find it's pretty handy for maintaining your balance."

msgid "You have a long, fluffy-furred tail.  It greatly improves your balance, making your ability to dodge much higher.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "You have a long, fluffy-furred tail.  It greatly improves your balance, making your ability to dodge much higher.  Prevents wearing non-fabric trousers."

msgid "You have a long tail that ends in a vicious stinger.  It does not improve your balance at all, but allows for a powerful piercing attack.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "You have a long tail that ends in a vicious stinger.  It does not improve your balance at all, but allows for a powerful piercing attack.  Prevents wearing non-fabric trousers."

msgid "You have a long tail that ends in a heavy, bony club.  It does not improve your balance at all, but allows for a powerful bashing attack.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "You have a long tail that ends in a heavy, bony club.  It does not improve your balance at all, but allows for a powerful bashing attack.  Prevents wearing non-fabric trousers."

msgid "Cenobite"
msgstr "Coenobite"

msgid "You consider yourself something other than human and no longer empathize with them.  Combat skills are easy to learn and maintain, but your critical thinking, so characteristic to these creatures, suffers."
msgstr "You consider yourself something other than human and no longer empathise with them.  Combat skills are easy to learn and maintain, but your critical thinking, so characteristic to these creatures, suffers."

msgid "From time to time the Mycus requires protection from non-Mycus that, for whatever reason, wish it ill.  We have adapted to better carry out this task - our fibers will grow strong and resilient when such threats present themselves to us."
msgstr "From time to time the Mycus requires protection from non-Mycus that, for whatever reason, wish it ill.  We have adapted to better carry out this task - our fibres will grow strong and resilient when such threats present themselves to us."

msgid "A large pair of translucent wings grow from your back.  They are too small to lift you, but if you're not weighed down, they can help a bit if you fall.  You can flutter them quickly to improve your move speed, but this is noisy and tires you out."
msgstr "A large pair of translucent wings grow from your back.  They are too small to lift you, but if you're not weighed down, they can help a bit if you fall.  You can flutter them quickly to improve your move speed, but this is noisy and tyres you out."

msgid "Your legs have consolidated into a single muscular 'foot' that goes up into your belly.  You move about a fourth of your previous speed and can no longer wear pants or shoes, on the other hand you make significantly less noise.  In addition to being harder to knock down, you can move through sludge-covered surfaces easily."
msgstr "Your legs have consolidated into a single muscular 'foot' that goes up into your belly.  You move about a fourth of your previous speed and can no longer wear trousers or shoes, on the other hand you make significantly less noise.  In addition to being harder to knock down, you can move through sludge-covered surfaces easily."

msgid "Your ears are huge, round, and gray!  They're rather fascinating, and help you hear from a much greater distance."
msgstr "Your ears are huge, round, and grey!  They're rather fascinating, and help you hear from a much greater distance."

msgid "Your brain has evolved beyond human imagination.  You'll show them the REAL meaning of 'gray goo'!"
msgstr "Your brain has evolved beyond human imagination.  You'll show them the REAL meaning of 'grey goo'!"

msgid "You have a very large pair of brightly-colored, very beautiful wings.  They can't lift you, and they make balancing tricky, but they certainly catch air and attention!"
msgstr "You have a very large pair of brightly-coloured, very beautiful wings.  They can't lift you, and they make balancing tricky, but they certainly catch air and attention!"

msgid "You can still eat other food, but you crave the taste of blood over everything else.  Without a steady supply or some kind of iron supplement, you're prone to developing anemia."
msgstr "You can still eat other food, but you crave the taste of blood over everything else.  Without a steady supply or some kind of iron supplement, you're prone to developing anaemia."

msgid "You have grown a thick shell over your torso, providing excellent armor, but you cannot wear anything on your torso.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr "You have grown a thick shell over your torso, providing excellent armour, but you cannot wear anything on your torso.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."

msgid "Ninety percent of the planet, and it's yours to explore.  And colonize.  And enjoy.  What was that about a surface?"
msgstr "Ninety percent of the planet, and it's yours to explore.  And colonise.  And enjoy.  What was that about a surface?"

msgid "Civilization collapsed?  Great!  You and your kin will never have to worry about a slaughterhouse again."
msgstr "Civilisation collapsed?  Great!  You and your kin will never have to worry about a slaughterhouse again."

msgid "Hey.  Civilization fell.  You're still around.  'Rat' just isn't respectful."
msgstr "Hey.  Civilisation fell.  You're still around.  'Rat' just isn't respectful."

msgid "Your body has developed a wonderful defense mechanism.  Instead of normal blood, you bleed a strong molecular acid which will damage any creature foolish enough to harm you."
msgstr "Your body has developed a wonderful defence mechanism.  Instead of normal blood, you bleed a strong molecular acid which will damage any creature foolish enough to harm you."

msgid "Like a true fish, your eyes lack eyelids, and are instead covered by a translucent, protective membrane that blocks irritants and water, and provides minor armor.  It also allows you to sleep with your eyes open!  Activate to cause the approach of hostile creatures to wake you up."
msgstr "Like a true fish, your eyes lack eyelids, and are instead covered by a translucent, protective membrane that blocks irritants and water, and provides minor armour.  It also allows you to sleep with your eyes open!  Activate to cause the approach of hostile creatures to wake you up."

msgid "Your teeth have grown incredibly sharp, and have calcified even further.  In addition to letting you eat much faster, you can use them as a lethal natural weapon, as long as your anatomy favors it.  They also grow very fast, and you harmlessly shed them more or less at random."
msgstr "Your teeth have grown incredibly sharp, and have calcified even further.  In addition to letting you eat much faster, you can use them as a lethal natural weapon, as long as your anatomy favours it.  They also grow very fast, and you harmlessly shed them more or less at random."

msgid "You are skilled in maneuvering on skates.  You suffer lower penalties to dodging and are less likely to fall down if hit in melee combat while you're wearing rollerskates or rollerblades."
msgstr "You are skilled in manoeuvring on skates.  You suffer lower penalties to dodging and are less likely to fall down if hit in melee combat while you're wearing rollerskates or rollerblades."

msgid "Debug Deodorizer"
msgstr "Debug Deodoriser"

msgid "Contorting your voice to match your surroundings is just as necessary as changing your color, even if learning it was a pain."
msgstr "Contorting your voice to match your surroundings is just as necessary as changing your colour, even if learning it was a pain."

msgid "Whether from personal choice or childhood trauma, traveling with vehicles is off-limits to you, even if your life depended on it."
msgstr "Whether from personal choice or childhood trauma, travelling with vehicles is off-limits to you, even if your life depended on it."

msgid "Your muscles, joints, and the movement center of your brain have changed internally somewhat, allowing you to traverse obstacles with ease."
msgstr "Your muscles, joints, and the movement centre of your brain have changed internally somewhat, allowing you to traverse obstacles with ease."

msgid "Colorful Skin"
msgstr "Colourful Skin"

msgid "You are the natural leader of any group.  It's just part of who you are, groups naturally form around you and you need these groups to energize you.  Sometimes however, you give in to your worst impulses and this trait will flip."
msgstr "You are the natural leader of any group.  It's just part of who you are, groups naturally form around you and you need these groups to energise you.  Sometimes however, you give in to your worst impulses and this trait will flip."

msgid "Self-centered"
msgstr "Self-centred"

msgid "This computer is somehow still powered; an alarming buzz emanates from its wall plug.  The desktop is cluttered with dozens of unsorted powerpoint files.  After some investigation, you find one labeled \"LAYMAN BRIEFING\"."
msgstr "This computer is somehow still powered; an alarming buzz emanates from its wall plug.  The desktop is cluttered with dozens of unsorted powerpoint files.  After some investigation, you find one labelled \"LAYMAN BRIEFING\"."

msgid "\"LIXA, or 'Liza' as we like to call her, is the forefront of exospatial research.  It has been confirmed that matter from our local n-space (the 4d coordinates in which we exist) can transit through exodimensions.  But it cannot do it safely!  To understand the behavior of exospace, we must first learn about how it works.\""
msgstr "\"LIXA, or 'Liza' as we like to call her, is the forefront of exospatial research.  It has been confirmed that matter from our local n-space (the 4d coordinates in which we exist) can transit through exodimensions.  But it cannot do it safely!  To understand the behaviour of exospace, we must first learn about how it works.\""

msgid "\"LIXA works using the principle of LOCAL EXODIMENSIONAL FLUX, the phenomenon in which ambient spacetime around exospatial breaches moves through the \"portal\".  LIXA is equipped with several LOCAL DIMENSIONAL COMPRESSORS.  These devices turn 'portals' on and off hundreds of times a second, which results in the FLUX repeatedly drawing tiny segments of our local n-space into exospace.  This creates a compression effect, 'storing' an enormous amount of 4d-space in those segments in the neighboring exospace.\""
msgstr "\"LIXA works using the principle of LOCAL EXODIMENSIONAL FLUX, the phenomenon in which ambient spacetime around exospatial breaches moves through the \"portal\".  LIXA is equipped with several LOCAL DIMENSIONAL COMPRESSORS.  These devices turn 'portals' on and off hundreds of times a second, which results in the FLUX repeatedly drawing tiny segments of our local n-space into exospace.  This creates a compression effect, 'storing' an enormous amount of 4d-space in those segments in the neighbouring exospace.\""

msgid ""
"It's a dangerous world out there, right?  So we fight to survive.  I'm on your side, and I'll stick with you, but if I think the situation is too dangerous, I'll be honest, I'm going to run.\n"
"  You can't tell me not to run, because I'm going to flee if things are bad, but you can tell me a safe place to retreat by using the zones manager (keybind 'Y').  I'll run toward the closest place you've designated - and you can set zones on vehicles, so if you've got a car, you could tell me to retreat there.\n"
"  If I see you running but I think it's safe, I'll stay and fight, but you can tell me run with you and I'll stick by you as best I can.\n"
"  You can give me some instructions on when I should attack, but I'll make my own decisions about who - I'll try to defend myself and you, but if you tell me to stay in one place I'll stay there.\n"
"  I'll use guns and grenades if I have them, but you can tell me to not use grenades or not use loud weapons or to not use ranged weapons at all.  If I'm shooting, you can tell me how much to aim and whether to try to avoid shooting you or not.  I'm not so good at recognizing safe shots, so stay out of my line of fire no matter what.\n"
"  I'll respect your rules for what types of weapons to use, but I'll choose what to use from my stuff.\n"
"  You can also tell me to hold the line and fight at chokepoints, but I'm not great at recognizing them so I may go off to fight something elsewhere anyway."
msgstr ""
"It's a dangerous world out there, right?  So we fight to survive.  I'm on your side, and I'll stick with you, but if I think the situation is too dangerous, I'll be honest, I'm going to run.\n"
"  You can't tell me not to run, because I'm going to flee if things are bad, but you can tell me a safe place to retreat by using the zones manager (keybind 'Y').  I'll run toward the closest place you've designated - and you can set zones on vehicles, so if you've got a car, you could tell me to retreat there.\n"
"  If I see you running but I think it's safe, I'll stay and fight, but you can tell me run with you and I'll stick by you as best I can.\n"
"  You can give me some instructions on when I should attack, but I'll make my own decisions about who - I'll try to defend myself and you, but if you tell me to stay in one place I'll stay there.\n"
"  I'll use guns and grenades if I have them, but you can tell me to not use grenades or not use loud weapons or to not use ranged weapons at all.  If I'm shooting, you can tell me how much to aim and whether to try to avoid shooting you or not.  I'm not so good at recognising safe shots, so stay out of my line of fire no matter what.\n"
"  I'll respect your rules for what types of weapons to use, but I'll choose what to use from my stuff.\n"
"  You can also tell me to hold the line and fight at chokepoints, but I'm not great at recognising them so I may go off to fight something elsewhere anyway."

msgid ""
"You give me something to carry, I'll carry it.  But I only have so many pockets and I'm only so strong, so I'll drop stuff that's too big to carry.\n"
"  I'll also wear stuff - I'll decide what I want to wear, but you can take stuff from me.  If I'm wearing something I shouldn't, you can bump into me and sort my armor to get me to take if off.\n"
"  I don't like wearing a lot of gear, so if you give me a lot of bulky stuff and things that don't fit, I'm going to take them off and probably drop them.\n"
"  Also, since we're friends, I'll give you anything I'm carrying, no questions asked.\n"
"  Oh, yeah, if I'm hungry or thirsty and I'm carrying food, I'll eat it.  Same if I need to recharge my bionics and I have some fuel.  So you might want to watch what you give me, y'know?"
msgstr ""
"You give me something to carry, I'll carry it.  But I only have so many pockets and I'm only so strong, so I'll drop stuff that's too big to carry.\n"
"  I'll also wear stuff - I'll decide what I want to wear, but you can take stuff from me.  If I'm wearing something I shouldn't, you can bump into me and sort my armour to get me to take if off.\n"
"  I don't like wearing a lot of gear, so if you give me a lot of bulky stuff and things that don't fit, I'm going to take them off and probably drop them.\n"
"  Also, since we're friends, I'll give you anything I'm carrying, no questions asked.\n"
"  Oh, yeah, if I'm hungry or thirsty and I'm carrying food, I'll eat it.  Same if I need to recharge my bionics and I have some fuel.  So you might want to watch what you give me, y'know?"

msgid ""
"I can help with some tasks if you show me where to work.\n"
"  Use the zone manager (keybind 'Y') to set up sorting zones for your loot, or to draw blueprints for a building, or to define where you want to plant some crops, or where you'd like some trees cut down, or where you want a vehicle dismantled or repaired, or a good fishing spot.  Then talk to me about my current activity and tell me to sort stuff, or build stuff, or cut down trees, or repair or dismantle a vehicle, or do farmwork, or catch some fish, and I'll go off and do my best to get what you want done.\n"
"  If I need tools, you should leave them in a loot zone near where you want me to work - axes for logging, shovels and seeds and fertilizer for farming, wrenches and hacksaws or a toolbox to take apart a vehicle.  I promise to put stuff back in an unsorted loot zone when I'm finished.\n"
"  I can pretty much sort out our stuff without needing tools, but keep the piles of unsorted and sorted stuff kind of close together because I don't want to walk back and forth carrying junk too much."
msgstr ""
"I can help with some tasks if you show me where to work.\n"
"  Use the zone manager (keybind 'Y') to set up sorting zones for your loot, or to draw blueprints for a building, or to define where you want to plant some crops, or where you'd like some trees cut down, or where you want a vehicle dismantled or repaired, or a good fishing spot.  Then talk to me about my current activity and tell me to sort stuff, or build stuff, or cut down trees, or repair or dismantle a vehicle, or do farmwork, or catch some fish, and I'll go off and do my best to get what you want done.\n"
"  If I need tools, you should leave them in a loot zone near where you want me to work - axes for logging, shovels and seeds and fertiliser for farming, wrenches and hacksaws or a toolbox to take apart a vehicle.  I promise to put stuff back in an unsorted loot zone when I'm finished.\n"
"  I can pretty much sort out our stuff without needing tools, but keep the piles of unsorted and sorted stuff kind of close together because I don't want to walk back and forth carrying junk too much."

msgid "What if I want you to build an organized camp?"
msgstr "What if I want you to build an organised camp?"

msgid ""
"When you assign a companion to a faction camp mission, they'll disappear while they go do whatever you want them to do.  When the duration of the mission has elapsed, you'll see a new mission on the bulletin board to have them return and complete the mission by upgrading your camp, returning their hunting kills, dropping off whatever they were crafting, or whatever else the mission results are.\n"
"  There are all kinds of faction camp missions: building up the camp, recruiting new allies, hunting and trapping game, scrounging for materials, farming, disassembling cars, and more.  Not all activities can be done at every camp - you may need to build some additional buildings, or expand the camp, to get access to some missions.\n"
"  Some faction camp missions can be duplicated by companion activities, but building up the camp can only be done via faction camp missions, as only completion of camp construction missions are recognized as fulfillment of those goals.\n"
"  You assign missions by interacting with the bulletin board.  You'll see a list of available missions for your central camp tile.  If your camp has expansions, you can tab through the expansions to see the available missions at each expansion.\n"
"  Remember, companions on camp missions need to be fed, and will become angry if they complete a mission but there isn't any food in the larder.\n"
"  There is one special mission called 'Emergency Recall'.  You can use this to retrieve any companion on a faction camp mission, but this cancels the mission and wastes any resources used on it.  Only use it to recover allies when something has gone really wrong with your camp and you can't get them to come back any other way."
msgstr ""
"When you assign a companion to a faction camp mission, they'll disappear while they go do whatever you want them to do.  When the duration of the mission has elapsed, you'll see a new mission on the bulletin board to have them return and complete the mission by upgrading your camp, returning their hunting kills, dropping off whatever they were crafting, or whatever else the mission results are.\n"
