msgid "I was just in a warehouse, not in Zambonia.  I had the internet.  Watched those crazy videos on YouTube in real time, scared the shit out of me.  I had it pretty good though, I'd lifted a bunch of canned food and shit, and I had a pretty sweet little squat in that warehouse.  I'd been planning on spending a long time there after all, while I figured out how to get in good with my crew."
