msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "OK, so, sometimes I dream that I am a zombie.  I just don't realize it.  And I just act normal to myself and I see zombies as normal people and normal people as zombies.  When I wake up I know it's fake though because if it were real, there would be way more normal people.  Because they'd actually be zombies.  And everyone is a zombie now."
