msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Not exactly.  After a while, I got brave.  I started venturing towards the outskirts of town, picking off zombies here and there.  I learned about traveling in at night to avoid all but those <freaking> shadow-zombies, and that got me pretty far.  Eventually I cleared out a cozy little nook for myself and started really feeling comfortable.  I guess I got a bit complacent."
msgstr "Not exactly.  After a while, I got brave.  I started venturing towards the outskirts of town, picking off zombies here and there.  I learned about travelling in at night to avoid all but those <freaking> shadow-zombies, and that got me pretty far.  Eventually I cleared out a cosy little nook for myself and started really feeling comfortable.  I guess I got a bit complacent."

