msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "There's nothing too special about me, I'm not sure why I survived.  I got evacuated with a handful of others, but we were too late to make the second trip to a FEMA center.  We got attacked by the dead… I was the only one to make it out.  I never looked back."
msgstr "There's nothing too special about me, I'm not sure why I survived.  I got evacuated with a handful of others, but we were too late to make the second trip to a FEMA centre.  We got attacked by the dead… I was the only one to make it out.  I never looked back."

