msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I was in biochemistry.  Specifically, if you're interested, I was studying the folding of non-standard nucleic acids into enzyme-like structures.  It sounds more interesting than it was; most of my time was spent cursing at computer screens and wishing we had more information on threose chains at unusual temperatures and pressures for modeling."
msgstr "I was in biochemistry.  Specifically, if you're interested, I was studying the folding of non-standard nucleic acids into enzyme-like structures.  It sounds more interesting than it was; most of my time was spent cursing at computer screens and wishing we had more information on threose chains at unusual temperatures and pressures for modelling."

