msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I saw it all pretty early, before it all really started.  I worked at the hospital.  It started with a jump in the number of code whites - that's an aggressive patient.  Wasn't my training so I didn't hear about it until later… but rumors started flying about hyperaggressive delirious patients that coded and seemed to die, then started attacking staff, and wouldn't respond to anything we hit them with.  Then a friend of mine was killed by one of them, and I realized it wasn't just a few weird reports.  I called in sick the next day."
