msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "At some point, I felt like I was waking up.  It was around the time they were busting out those Humvees with riot control turrets on top.  Says something about my frame of mind that I don't even remember if I'd seen them before that point.  Anyway I heard the gunfire going off and just kinda realized I was on the edges of a mob charging a heavily armed military emplacement.  That's when I started seeing the mob for what it was, seeing the wild-eyed animals, even the zombies.  I turned and ran."
