msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Well, not having a memory is weird as heck, but I'll be honest: I think it might be better?  With what's going on, I bet you my memories weren't happy ones.  Besides my driver's license, there were pictures of kids in my wallet… not that that sparked any reaction from me.  I didn't see any kids around.  Maybe losing my mind is a mercy.  Hell, maybe it's some kind of psychotic break and my brain did this to itself.  To be honest with you I think I'd rather focus on surviving, and not worry about it."
