msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I thought that us leaving, letting the others have the evac center to themselves, would be enough, but it wasn't.  They tracked us down in the night, a few days later.  They… well… I made it out, along with one other survivor.  The attackers, they were like animals.  We tried to travel together for a while.  I blamed myself, for what had happened, and couldn't really get past it.  We parted ways on good terms not long before I met you.  I just couldn't face the reminder of what had happened."
msgstr "I thought that us leaving, letting the others have the evac centre to themselves, would be enough, but it wasn't.  They tracked us down in the night, a few days later.  They… well… I made it out, along with one other survivor.  The attackers, they were like animals.  We tried to travel together for a while.  I blamed myself, for what had happened, and couldn't really get past it.  We parted ways on good terms not long before I met you.  I just couldn't face the reminder of what had happened."

