msgid "He began killing others to get their bones as fresh as possible.  Later, he… he started carving the bones of the living.  Thought the anguish alone would empower the song.  The goal of the Kindred is to banish the shadow of the Cataclysm, not to cast it.  Such heinous acts will likely twist the song of the world, but I don't think Cooper realizes it.  To him, the end justifies any means."
msgstr "He began killing others to get their bones as fresh as possible.  Later, he… he started carving the bones of the living.  Thought the anguish alone would empower the song.  The goal of the Kindred is to banish the shadow of the Cataclysm, not to cast it.  Such heinous acts will likely twist the song of the world, but I don't think Cooper realises it.  To him, the end justifies any means."

msgid "You do not realize the gravity of your claim.  When you understand the Song better, you will understand the danger of his actions."
msgstr "You do not realise the gravity of your claim.  When you understand the Song better, you will understand the danger of his actions."

msgid "The song can be woven in many forms.  Carved bone charms, weapons and armor all hold immense power, and when the time comes, me and my Kindred shall amass enough Song to restore this world as it was before.  Restore it, or end it.  Makes no difference."
msgstr "The song can be woven in many forms.  Carved bone charms, weapons and armour all hold immense power, and when the time comes, me and my Kindred shall amass enough Song to restore this world as it was before.  Restore it, or end it.  Makes no difference."

