msgstr "Your mind is open.  More than most.  Perhaps one day, you too will feel the power of the song and become Kindred.  For now, traveller, listen, listen and feel the song."

msgid "Your skepticism does not surprise me.  Perhaps one day, you too will hear the inevitability of the song, feel its power.  But until you do, you will remain just another survivor, path to the Kindred closed."
msgstr "Your scepticism does not surprise me.  Perhaps one day, you too will hear the inevitability of the song, feel its power.  But until you do, you will remain just another survivor, path to the Kindred closed."

msgid "Unlike the other stories, she spoke with determination, reverence even.  I didn't realize it back then but it wasn't just a story; she knew that this wasn't just another tale."
msgstr "Unlike the other stories, she spoke with determination, reverence even.  I didn't realise it back then but it wasn't just a story; she knew that this wasn't just another tale."

msgid "Hello again, traveler."
msgstr "Hello again, traveller."

msgid "Just a traveler, trying to survive.  What about you?  Scavenging?"
msgstr "Just a traveller, trying to survive.  What about you?  Scavenging?"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "And how many people have you killed?  Maybe it was in self defense, maybe because you wanted their gear.  It's all the same.  I give their death meaning.  I hate that I have to do it, I truly do, but you really must understand, there is no other way.  The sooner I finish my mission, the sooner all this madness can end."
msgstr "And how many people have you killed?  Maybe it was in self defence, maybe because you wanted their gear.  It's all the same.  I give their death meaning.  I hate that I have to do it, I truly do, but you really must understand, there is no other way.  The sooner I finish my mission, the sooner all this madness can end."

