msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You're like me then, Kindred.  I'm glad I'm not the only one who realizes what's necessary.  Perhaps one day, we'll be able to work together, but what I do now, I must do alone."
msgstr "You're like me then, Kindred.  I'm glad I'm not the only one who realises what's necessary.  Perhaps one day, we'll be able to work together, but what I do now, I must do alone."

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You're like me then, Kindred.  I'm glad I'm not the only one who realizes what's necessary.  Perhaps one day, we'll be able to work together, but what I do now, I must do alone."
msgstr "You're like me then, Kindred.  I'm glad I'm not the only one who realises what's necessary.  Perhaps one day, we'll be able to work together, but what I do now, I must do alone."

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "You're like me then, Kindred.  I'm glad I'm not the only one who realizes what's necessary.  Perhaps one day, we'll be able to work together, but what I do now, I must do alone."
msgstr "You're like me then, Kindred.  I'm glad I'm not the only one who realises what's necessary.  Perhaps one day, we'll be able to work together, but what I do now, I must do alone."

msgid "I'm glad you realize the necessity of the burden I bear.  Maybe someday we'll even join our forces, but for now, I have to do this alone."
msgstr "I'm glad you realise the necessity of the burden I bear.  Maybe someday we'll even join our forces, but for now, I have to do this alone."

msgid "I meant no offense.  I'm sure you have your reasons."
msgstr "I meant no offence.  I'm sure you have your reasons."

msgid "Brigitte did not mention me?  I'm surprised.  Perhaps she's starting to understand I was right.  I was with her for a time, learned from her.  I'm still on her side, but she doesn't realize it yet."
msgstr "Brigitte did not mention me?  I'm surprised.  Perhaps she's starting to understand I was right.  I was with her for a time, learned from her.  I'm still on her side, but she doesn't realise it yet."

msgid "Do you have a favorite food?"
msgstr "Do you have a favourite food?"

msgid "You know, pretty good.  It is cozy here, there is a lot of space, and most importantly, it's safe.  We even started considering this place as our new home.  By the way, while I was fishing, a bottle with a piece of paper came to the shore of our island.  Here, take a look.\", he gave you a piece of paper, something was written on it: '0030045-0030045-35321700', with something similar to lightning scribbled nearby.  \"I wonder what it could mean…"
msgstr "You know, pretty good.  It is cosy here, there is a lot of space, and most importantly, it's safe.  We even started considering this place as our new home.  By the way, while I was fishing, a bottle with a piece of paper came to the shore of our island.  Here, take a look.\", he gave you a piece of paper, something was written on it: '0030045-0030045-35321700', with something similar to lightning scribbled nearby.  \"I wonder what it could mean…"

msgid "We've been wandering around the state with my family for a long time since <the_cataclysm>, and I realized that the safest hideout is the island.  I left my family in a shelter, and went to explore the area, looking for some island nearby, in a lake or in the ocean.  And you know, I found a sea map marked with navigational beacons near here.  If you want, you can help me get to one of these and take a good look at it."
msgstr "We've been wandering around the state with my family for a long time since <the_cataclysm>, and I realised that the safest hideout is the island.  I left my family in a shelter, and went to explore the area, looking for some island nearby, in a lake or in the ocean.  And you know, I found a sea map marked with navigational beacons near here.  If you want, you can help me get to one of these and take a good look at it."

msgid "We found the lighthouse and cleared it of <zombies>.  Now, I need to bring my family here.  May I ask you for a favor?  Since you bring me here, can you go back, find my family and bring them here?"
msgstr "We found the lighthouse and cleared it of <zombies>.  Now, I need to bring my family here.  May I ask you for a favour?  Since you bring me here, can you go back, find my family and bring them here?"

msgid "You are my savior!  I'll take a look around here for a while, prepare everything here for their arrival."
msgstr "You are my saviour!  I'll take a look around here for a while, prepare everything here for their arrival."

msgid "The bunker has a field of solar panels nearby but some of the staff damaged them badly when they turned into those… things.  I need you to gather at least 12 panels so I can stabilize my power output."
msgstr "The bunker has a field of solar panels nearby but some of the staff damaged them badly when they turned into those… things.  I need you to gather at least 12 panels so I can stabilise my power output."

msgid "So you also don't have anything else in the \"control center\"?"
msgstr "So you also don't have anything else in the \"control centre\"?"

msgid "This bunker has a control center for the local bots so I made them only attack when attacked first."
msgstr "This bunker has a control centre for the local bots so I made them only attack when attacked first."

msgid "Wh- Alright, you got me, I can offer you a bot from the control center as well, but that is truly all I have."
msgstr "Wh- Alright, you got me, I can offer you a bot from the control centre as well, but that is truly all I have."

msgid "Balthazar needs some solar panels to stabilize the power to their bunker."
msgstr "Balthazar needs some solar panels to stabilise the power to their bunker."

msgid "The power in my bunker is failing and I need 12 solar panels to stabilize them."
msgstr "The power in my bunker is failing and I need 12 solar panels to stabilise them."

msgid "I got a control center.  Anything else or will you hear me out now?"
msgstr "I got a control centre.  Anything else or will you hear me out now?"

msgid "Obtain 15 liters of hydrochloric acid for the chemist."
msgstr "Obtain 15 litres of hydrochloric acid for the chemist."

msgid "I need 15 liters of hydrochloric acid."
msgstr "I need 15 litres of hydrochloric acid."

msgid "Find Some Gasoline"
msgstr "Find Some Petrol"

msgid "Obtain 100 liters of gasoline for the chemist."
msgstr "Obtain 100 litres of petrol for the chemist."

msgid "I need 100 liters of gas."
msgstr "I need 100 litres of gas."

msgid "I'm in a bit of a spot.  I keep a generator around here to power all my scientific equipment.  It has a bit of gas in it, but I've burned through that and I can't use most of my tools without power.  This may seem like a lot, but if you could get me 100 liters of gas, I'll pay you back any way I can."
msgstr "I'm in a bit of a spot.  I keep a generator around here to power all my scientific equipment.  It has a bit of gas in it, but I've burned through that and I can't use most of my tools without power.  This may seem like a lot, but if you could get me 100 litres of gas, I'll pay you back any way I can."

msgid "I bet the best place to find that much gas is still a gas station.  Bringing it all here is another problem.  You might want one of those big steel drums we used to use to haul off hazardous waste before <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr "I bet the best place to find that much gas is still a petrol station.  Bringing it all here is another problem.  You might want one of those big steel drums we used to use to haul off hazardous waste before <the_cataclysm>."

msgid "Establish trade relations between the chemist and a refugee center, and bring back a writ of the agreement."
msgstr "Establish trade relations between the chemist and a refugee centre, and bring back a writ of the agreement."

msgid "I was out scavenging recently, and I found one of those old evac shelters.  Turns out the computer was still on and it had an address for a refugee center.  I think my skills might be useful to them, for helping maintain medical supplies and whatnot, so I want you to head over there and see if they're interested.  I'd do it myself, but I need to look after this place."
msgstr "I was out scavenging recently, and I found one of those old evac shelters.  Turns out the computer was still on and it had an address for a refugee centre.  I think my skills might be useful to them, for helping maintain medical supplies and whatnot, so I want you to head over there and see if they're interested.  I'd do it myself, but I need to look after this place."

msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Not my place, just somewhere I ended up.  Some old shack, maybe a hunting cabin or something more… criminal, at least judging by some of what I found on the shelves.  You certainly wouldn't attract much attention synthesizing illegal substances all the way out here, that's all I'm saying.  I found it while I was trying to escape all the <zombies> in the city, and I decided to stay."
msgstr "Not my place, just somewhere I ended up.  Some old shack, maybe a hunting cabin or something more… criminal, at least judging by some of what I found on the shelves.  You certainly wouldn't attract much attention synthesising illegal substances all the way out here, that's all I'm saying.  I found it while I was trying to escape all the <zombies> in the city, and I decided to stay."

