msgid "Alright, so it'll be <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>mm armor made of the best high steel a woman can scavenge.  If you're good with that, I'll take the merch up front and we can start taking some very invasive measurements."
msgstr "Alright, so it'll be <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>mm armour made of the best high steel a woman can scavenge.  If you're good with that, I'll take the merch up front and we can start taking some very invasive measurements."

msgid "Alright, so it'll be <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>mm armor made with some of the best fabrication techniques the world has ever seen.  If you're good with that, I'll take the merch up front and we can start taking some very invasive measurements."
msgstr "Alright, so it'll be <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>mm armour made with some of the best fabrication techniques the world has ever seen.  If you're good with that, I'll take the merch up front and we can start taking some very invasive measurements."

msgid "Alright, so it'll be <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>mm armor made with some of the best fabrication techniques the world has ever seen, as well as help from some extradimensional friends.  I'd be lying if I said I wasn't excited.  If you're good with that, I'll take the merch up front and we can start taking some very invasive measurements."
msgstr "Alright, so it'll be <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>mm armour made with some of the best fabrication techniques the world has ever seen, as well as help from some extradimensional friends.  I'd be lying if I said I wasn't excited.  If you're good with that, I'll take the merch up front and we can start taking some very invasive measurements."

msgid "The Pressin was a self defense weapon for politicians in Spain.  It was a small breach loaded handheld pistol that could fit in a glasses case and be fired subtly.  I figure that we can improve on the design by adding a retracting blade while keeping the surprise shots.  To get this working I'm gonna need a .32 gun like a Kel-Tec P-32, or a Walther PPK.  I'll also need a switchblade, 20 merch, and a week."
msgstr "The Pressin was a self defence weapon for politicians in Spain.  It was a small breach loaded handheld pistol that could fit in a glasses case and be fired subtly.  I figure that we can improve on the design by adding a retracting blade while keeping the surprise shots.  To get this working I'm gonna need a .32 gun like a Kel-Tec P-32, or a Walther PPK.  I'll also need a switchblade, 20 merch, and a week."

msgid "The Disorder is already kind of a real thing.  I got the idea from a viral video I saw of a guy making something similar with a baseball bat for hitting home runs.  Takes a sledge hammer with a center mounted piston that you can arm with .22 caliber blanks.  When you hit a zombie with that sweet spot… boom.  The blank goes off and sends the piston straight down into whatever poor fucker you hit it with.  I'll need a sledge hammer, 80 merch, and at least 20 .22 LR rounds.  Fabrication will definitely take two weeks on this one."
msgstr "The Disorder is already kind of a real thing.  I got the idea from a viral video I saw of a guy making something similar with a baseball bat for hitting home runs.  Takes a sledge hammer with a centre mounted piston that you can arm with .22 calibre blanks.  When you hit a zombie with that sweet spot… boom.  The blank goes off and sends the piston straight down into whatever poor fucker you hit it with.  I'll need a sledge hammer, 80 merch, and at least 20 .22 LR rounds.  Fabrication will definitely take two weeks on this one."

msgid "[200 merch, 3 days] I need a cavalry saber."
msgstr "[200 merch, 3 days] I need a cavalry sabre."

msgid "Alright.  So, first you give me your rounds, I'll put them on your account, and then I can reload them in another caliber of your choice.  What ammo do you want to convert?"
msgstr "Alright.  So, first you give me your rounds, I'll put them on your account, and then I can reload them in another calibre of your choice.  What ammo do you want to convert?"

msgid "Pretty simple stuff, bud.  I barter in pre-shitshow ammo, and to stimulate the growing economy, I print and issue more.  I take your goods - Cody would call it labor - and exchange it for the new universal currency.  If you want to convert currency I'm happy to facilitate, but it'll take a few days and there is a service charge."
msgstr "Pretty simple stuff, bud.  I barter in pre-shitshow ammo, and to stimulate the growing economy, I print and issue more.  I take your goods - Cody would call it labour - and exchange it for the new universal currency.  If you want to convert currency I'm happy to facilitate, but it'll take a few days and there is a service charge."

msgid "It's my house.  Cody's in the other building, if you've met her.  We dug a trench and set up some milspec turrets.  I programmed them, Cody armored them.  Now we're just trying to get by.  This ain't the wizard of Oz, you can look behind the curtain over there."
msgstr "It's my house.  Cody's in the other building, if you've met her.  We dug a trench and set up some milspec turrets.  I programmed them, Cody armoured them.  Now we're just trying to get by.  This ain't the wizard of Oz, you can look behind the curtain over there."

msgid "We offer various specialty cuts direct to our customers.  Here's a list of available materials.  Order waiting time depends on the amount of lumber ordered.  So, what would you like?"
msgstr "We offer various speciality cuts direct to our customers.  Here's a list of available materials.  Order waiting time depends on the amount of lumber ordered.  So, what would you like?"

msgid "I'm a lumberjack out here.  Things were quiet for a long time.  We're pretty far out in the woods so it was kind of a shock to find out just how bad it'd gotten in civilization.  We had a couple close run-ins ourselves.  My friend over there almost got eaten!  But we still have resources that I'm sure people can use."
msgstr "I'm a lumberjack out here.  Things were quiet for a long time.  We're pretty far out in the woods so it was kind of a shock to find out just how bad it'd gotten in civilisation.  We had a couple close run-ins ourselves.  My friend over there almost got eaten!  But we still have resources that I'm sure people can use."

msgid "I'm the manager here at the mill.  It's a tight-knit crew, unionized operation.  When <the_cataclysm> broke out, we were all running scared when some <zombies> broke onto the yard, had to fight them off.  Now, we've just held up here.  I imagine any folks left out there might be needing our machinery and skills to keep civilization alive.  Might make new customers yet."
msgstr "I'm the manager here at the mill.  It's a tight-knit crew, unionised operation.  When <the_cataclysm> broke out, we were all running scared when some <zombies> broke onto the yard, had to fight them off.  Now, we've just held up here.  I imagine any folks left out there might be needing our machinery and skills to keep civilisation alive.  Might make new customers yet."

msgid "Establish trade relations between the loggers and a refugee center, and bring back a writ of the agreement."
msgstr "Establish trade relations between the loggers and a refugee centre, and bring back a writ of the agreement."

msgid "I can't say I can think of anything at the moment.  Our remoteness is our defense.  We want to keep a low profile and try to keep out of any trouble in this isolated location.  We are willing to trade for weapons and ammo though.  Keeping the nearby area clear and hunting is always eating away at our supplies."
msgstr "I can't say I can think of anything at the moment.  Our remoteness is our defence.  We want to keep a low profile and try to keep out of any trouble in this isolated location.  We are willing to trade for weapons and ammo though.  Keeping the nearby area clear and hunting is always eating away at our supplies."

msgid "Bring the pizzaiolo to <color_light_blue>their rival's house</color> and don't forget to <color_yellow>bring at least 200 units of gasoline</color>.  After you got there, talk to the pizzaiolo to start burning the house."
msgstr "Bring the pizzaiolo to <color_light_blue>their rival's house</color> and don't forget to <color_yellow>bring at least 200 units of petrol</color>.  After you got there, talk to the pizzaiolo to start burning the house."

msgid "Good.  Let's go to his restaurant and fucking burn it!  Oh, by the way, could you bring gasoline with you, <name_g>?  I was so angry I forgot to bring it with me…"
msgstr "Good.  Let's go to his restaurant and fucking burn it!  Oh, by the way, could you bring petrol with you, <name_g>?  I was so angry I forgot to bring it with me…"

msgid "Maybe we can find some gasoline at gas station."
msgstr "Maybe we can find some petrol at petrol station."

msgid "Pizza parlor"
msgstr "Pizza parlour"

msgid "I need to make a last step to achieve my revenge, and the step is - my pizza parlor.  Before <the_cataclysm>, the bank took my place, and now, some <freaking> <name_b>s occupied it and made it their base!  Just unbelievable, I tell ya.  It's time for me to fight back, deal with this <freaking> <name_b>s and regain my honor.  Are you with me, <name_g>?"
msgstr "I need to make a last step to achieve my revenge, and the step is - my pizza parlour.  Before <the_cataclysm>, the bank took my place, and now, some <freaking> <name_b>s occupied it and made it their base!  Just unbelievable, I tell ya.  It's time for me to fight back, deal with this <freaking> <name_b>s and regain my honour.  Are you with me, <name_g>?"

msgid "Well, they weren't really around to lock it up.  Whoever got here first blew their head off with a 12-gauge, but they were up and movin', tried to kill me too.  They're out in the dumpster now."
msgstr "Well, they weren't really around to lock it up.  Whoever got here first blew their head off with a 12-gauge, but they were up and movin', tried to kill me too.  They're out in the skip now."

msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I used to live here before <the_cataclysm>.  I was asleep when a horde of <zombies> busted through the front, and in the chaos I wound up here.  When the screaming stopped, I peaked out the door to find my neighbor stumbling about with his face half-eaten, and I haven't left since."
msgstr "I used to live here before <the_cataclysm>.  I was asleep when a horde of <zombies> busted through the front, and in the chaos I wound up here.  When the screaming stopped, I peaked out the door to find my neighbour stumbling about with his face half-eaten, and I haven't left since."

