msgstr "There's been rumours.  Folks talkin' about some kind of secret lab, out in the wilds, with survivors in it.  I haven't seen it myself, mind you."

msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Yeah, I'll help out.  I've pretty much been waiting for someone to ask, the mess is in my way but I've been too busy to organize it myself.  Boris is the one to talk to, you say?  I'll let him know."
msgstr "Yeah, I'll help out.  I've pretty much been waiting for someone to ask, the mess is in my way but I've been too busy to organise it myself.  Boris is the one to talk to, you say?  I'll let him know."

msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Yeah, I'll help out.  I've pretty much been waiting for someone to ask, the mess is in my way but I've been too busy to organize it myself.  Boris is the one to talk to, you say?  I'll let him know."
msgstr "Yeah, I'll help out.  I've pretty much been waiting for someone to ask, the mess is in my way but I've been too busy to organise it myself.  Boris is the one to talk to, you say?  I'll let him know."

