msgid "I found a map to this place in an evac center and thought I'd see if it was just full of <zombies> or if there was something up.  Didn't expect to find so many survivors still alive though."
msgstr "I found a map to this place in an evac centre and thought I'd see if it was just full of <zombies> or if there was something up.  Didn't expect to find so many survivors still alive though."

