msgstr "I found a map to this place in an evac centre and thought I'd see if it was just full of <zombies> or if there was something up.  Didn't expect to find so many survivors still alive though."

msgid "You looking for a traveling companion?  I could use someone to watch my back."
msgstr "You looking for a travelling companion?  I could use someone to watch my back."

msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "There's so much weird stuff out there in the wilderness now.  A while back, I found this weird cartoon sign with a map on it, pointing to some kind of trade center.  Haven't been there yet but I can show you my copy of the map if you want."
msgstr "There's so much weird stuff out there in the wilderness now.  A while back, I found this weird cartoon sign with a map on it, pointing to some kind of trade centre.  Haven't been there yet but I can show you my copy of the map if you want."

