msgstr "I was among one of the first groups of immigrants sent here to fortify the outpost.  I might have exaggerated my construction skills to get the hell out of the refugee centre.  Unless you are a trader, there isn't much work there and food was really becoming scarce when I left."

msgid "We'll help plow the land and put up a sign to let everybody know it's yours.  Once it's plowed, you can hire some workers to plant or harvest the crops for a small fee of course.  Oh, and if you're growing anything we have a demand for, we'll gladly take it off your hands after the harvest."
msgstr "We'll help plow the land and put up a sign to let everybody know it's yours.  Once it's ploughed, you can hire some workers to plant or harvest the crops for a small fee of course.  Oh, and if you're growing anything we have a demand for, we'll gladly take it off your hands after the harvest."

msgid "350 merch should be enough to cover the purchase and the labor to plow it."
msgstr "350 merch should be enough to cover the purchase and the labour to plow it."

msgid "<npc_name> jots your name down on a ledger and yells out to nearby laborers to begin plowing your new field."
msgstr "<npc_name> jots your name down on a ledger and yells out to nearby labourers to begin ploughing your new field."

msgid "After counting your money, <npc_name> directs a nearby laborer to begin constructing a fence around your plot…"
msgstr "After counting your money, <npc_name> directs a nearby labourer to begin constructing a fence around your plot…"

msgid "If you mean something like pacemaker, we can't really do much without anesthesia."
msgstr "If you mean something like pacemaker, we can't really do much without anaesthesia."

msgid "I'm running out of office supplies.  I know… of all the things to need at a time like this!  I just need to be able to keep track of and organize medical records so that I can focus on helping people.  Ten binders and a ream of paper should tide me over until some shipments come in."
msgstr "I'm running out of office supplies.  I know… of all the things to need at a time like this!  I just need to be able to keep track of and organise medical records so that I can focus on helping people.  Ten binders and a ream of paper should tide me over until some shipments come in."

msgid "Thanks!  This should help keep things organized for a while."
msgstr "Thanks!  This should help keep things organised for a while."

msgid "One of the laborers injured their foot pretty badly and I don't want them walking on it for a few days at least.  Do you think you could find a pair of crutches?"
msgstr "One of the labourers injured their foot pretty badly and I don't want them walking on it for a few days at least.  Do you think you could find a pair of crutches?"

msgid "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
msgstr "Anaesthetic for the Doctor"

msgid "Bring the doctor 3000 units of anesthetic.  Ask around the commune for assistance in building an anesthetic machine."
msgstr "Bring the doctor 3000 units of anaesthetic.  Ask around the commune for assistance in building an anaesthetic machine."

msgid "I want to make sure we are setup to handle any major surgeries that come our way, but pain management is going to be an issue.  For longer surgeries, we're going to need some anesthetic.  Can you bring me 3000 units to start?  We're also going to need an anesthetic machine to deliver it.  Maybe some people around the commune can help with that?"
msgstr "I want to make sure we are setup to handle any major surgeries that come our way, but pain management is going to be an issue.  For longer surgeries, we're going to need some anaesthetic.  Can you bring me 3000 units to start?  We're also going to need an anaesthetic machine to deliver it.  Maybe some people around the commune can help with that?"

msgid "Any progress on getting some anesthetic or parts?"
msgstr "Any progress on getting some anaesthetic or parts?"

msgid "I'm sorry, I don't have anything to trade.  The work program here splits what we produce between the refugee center, the farm, and ourselves.  If you are a skilled laborer, then you can trade your time for a bit of extra income on the side.  Not much I can do to assist you as a farmer though."
msgstr "I'm sorry, I don't have anything to trade.  The work program here splits what we produce between the refugee centre, the farm, and ourselves.  If you are a skilled labourer, then you can trade your time for a bit of extra income on the side.  Not much I can do to assist you as a farmer though."

msgid "I'm just a lucky guy that went from being chased by the undead to the noble life of a dirt farmer.  We get room and board, but won't see a share of our labor unless the crop is a success."
msgstr "I'm just a lucky guy that went from being chased by the undead to the noble life of a dirt farmer.  We get room and board, but won't see a share of our labour unless the crop is a success."

msgid "The merchant at the Refugee Center sent me to get a prospectus from you."
msgstr "The merchant at the Refugee Centre sent me to get a prospectus from you."

msgid "Hey, are you looking for workers here?  I know a couple people back at the refugee center that might be willing to come."
msgstr "Hey, are you looking for workers here?  I know a couple people back at the refugee centre that might be willing to come."

msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Could easily be hundreds as far as I know.  They chose this ranch because of its rather remote location, decent fence, and huge cleared field.  With as much land as we have fenced off we could build a village if we had the materials.  We would have tried to secure a small town or something, but the lack of good farmland and number of undead makes it more practical for us to build from scratch.  The refugee center I came from is constantly facing starvation and undead assaults."
msgstr "Could easily be hundreds as far as I know.  They chose this ranch because of its rather remote location, decent fence, and huge cleared field.  With as much land as we have fenced off we could build a village if we had the materials.  We would have tried to secure a small town or something, but the lack of good farmland and number of undead makes it more practical for us to build from scratch.  The refugee centre I came from is constantly facing starvation and undead assaults."

