msgid "Practice some basic calisthenics like pushups, squats, dips and crunches."
msgstr "Practice some basic callisthenics like pushups, squats, dips and crunches."

msgid "Practice calisthenics using specialized equipment."
msgstr "Practice callisthenics using specialised equipment."

msgid "Practice working metal into the form of various armor pieces, and test their articulation with you using some cotton for padding along with the armor pieces."
msgstr "Practice working metal into the form of various armour pieces, and test their articulation with you using some cotton for padding along with the armour pieces."

msgid "Practice heating chunks of steel and quickly cooling them down with water, and then, to reduce brittleness and restore ductility, heating them again to maximize its properties."
msgstr "Practice heating chunks of steel and quickly cooling them down with water, and then, to reduce brittleness and restore ductility, heating them again to maximise its properties."

msgid "Practice the basics of fighting with bludgeons, both purpose-made and impromptu.  Learn how to apply your leverage, maximize kinetic energy, and to swing for the fences without tearing your shoulder out of its socket."
msgstr "Practice the basics of fighting with bludgeons, both purpose-made and impromptu.  Learn how to apply your leverage, maximise kinetic energy, and to swing for the fences without tearing your shoulder out of its socket."

msgid "Perform solo drills to practice advanced techniques, such as feints and moulinet cuts."
msgstr "Perform solo drills to practise advanced techniques, such as feints and moulinet cuts."

msgid "Practice using your staff against a dummy, familiarizing yourself with its length."
msgstr "Practice using your staff against a dummy, familiarising yourself with its length."

msgid "Practice the basics of fighting with whips by swinging one around.  Familiarize yourself with the length and accuracy of your unwieldy choice of weapon."
msgstr "Practice the basics of fighting with whips by swinging one around.  Familiarise yourself with the length and accuracy of your unwieldy choice of weapon."

msgid "Practice the use of chitin as an armor component by shaping and attaching several pieces together."
msgstr "Practice the use of chitin as an armour component by shaping and attaching several pieces together."

msgid "Personnel are reminded that unmonitored outside contact will result in disciplinary measures.  I understand that you are upset, but as has been stressed before, this is a temporary measure until the situation stabilizes."
