msgid "A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They depict a large mace with an internal gas reservoir and venting holes between the steel segments.  There are additional diagrams labeled 'IGNITION SYSTEM' and 'TRIGGER?'.  There are two distinct sets of handwriting making notes."
msgstr "A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They depict a large mace with an internal gas reservoir and venting holes between the steel segments.  There are additional diagrams labelled 'IGNITION SYSTEM' and 'TRIGGER?'.  There are two distinct sets of handwriting making notes."

msgid "A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They depict a sledgehammer with a moving center.  There is a references doc for a powder actuated nail gun stapled to the sheets.  There are two distinct sets of handwriting making notes."
msgstr "A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They depict a sledgehammer with a moving centre.  There is a references doc for a powder actuated nail gun stapled to the sheets.  There are two distinct sets of handwriting making notes."

