msgctxt "<color>"
msgid "gray"
msgstr "grey"

msgid "\"Slingshot right through the windshield k?\""
msgstr "\"Slingshot right through the windscreen k?\""

msgid "\"My next-door neighbor had a katana in his basement!\""
msgstr "\"My next-door neighbour had a katana in his basement!\""

msgid "\"I just realized how damn demented those fliers are.\""
msgstr "\"I just realised how damn demented those flyers are.\""

msgid "\"There's nothing wrong with eating people if you HAVE to.  I mean, I only did it because I didn't want to waste my potato chips!\""
msgstr "\"There's nothing wrong with eating people if you HAVE to.  I mean, I only did it because I didn't want to waste my crisps!\""

msgid "\"Heard of a place up in Maine where people have their shit together.  Hundreds of people, defense, food and shelter… let's go raid it, guys!\""
msgstr "\"Heard of a place up in Maine where people have their shit together.  Hundreds of people, defence, food and shelter… let's go raid it, guys!\""

msgid "\"Check out my cooking show on The Television!  Making Mannwurst sausages out of some of those assholes who tried to raid my kitchen earlier…\""
msgstr "\"Check out my cooking show on The Television!  Making Mannwurst sausages out of some of those arseholes who tried to raid my kitchen earlier…\""

msgid "\"FLAMING SWORD HUMANE.  CAUTERIZES WOUNDS.  SURGICAL.\""
msgstr "\"FLAMING SWORD HUMANE.  CAUTERISES WOUNDS.  SURGICAL.\""

msgid "\"Hahahahaa stupid fuck in his mansion, with his plate armor and big axe.  Guy never swung the thing in his life.  Can't block bullets, dipshit\""
msgstr "\"Hahahahaa stupid fuck in his mansion, with his plate armour and big axe.  Guy never swung the thing in his life.  Can't block bullets, dipshit\""

msgid "\"HADENSBROOK REBUILT AROUND FUNGUS.  THEY EAT GRAY APPLES AND SPREAD IT\""
msgstr "\"HADENSBROOK REBUILT AROUND FUNGUS.  THEY EAT GREY APPLES AND SPREAD IT\""

msgid "This note is covered in gray goo, ew… \"I know I have a fetish but THIS IS TOO MUCH.  My hands are made of slime.  My hair is slime.  My body is covered in slime.  I can't even use a crowbar 'cause of slime.  Wherever I go I leave a trail of slime.  Everything's slime.  My bag is falling off my back into slime.\""
msgstr "This note is covered in grey goo, ew… \"I know I have a fetish but THIS IS TOO MUCH.  My hands are made of slime.  My hair is slime.  My body is covered in slime.  I can't even use a crowbar 'cause of slime.  Wherever I go I leave a trail of slime.  Everything's slime.  My bag is falling off my back into slime.\""

msgid "This note is covered in gray goo, ew… \"Blorble\""
msgstr "This note is covered in grey goo, ew… \"Blorble\""

msgid "\"To whoever may find this, I've had enough of cowering and hiding.  I have realized I can't outlast whatever this is.  I saw something different at the grocery store down the block.  Skulking around on all four, faster than all the others.  It jumped at me from behind a car.  It's as if they were all changing.  I'm sure I'll see many more of these as time goes on.  I'm leaving.  Whatever you want, take it.\""
msgstr "\"To whoever may find this, I've had enough of cowering and hiding.  I have realised I can't outlast whatever this is.  I saw something different at the grocery store down the block.  Skulking around on all four, faster than all the others.  It jumped at me from behind a car.  It's as if they were all changing.  I'm sure I'll see many more of these as time goes on.  I'm leaving.  Whatever you want, take it.\""

msgid "\"Saw a group of them today, huddled around something.  When I got closer, I realized they were eating one of their own.\""
msgstr "\"Saw a group of them today, huddled around something.  When I got closer, I realised they were eating one of their own.\""

msgid "\"To my sweet daughter, I left your favorite doll in the blue house on Elm Street.  I hope it gives you comfort.  Stay safe, my angel.\""
msgstr "\"To my sweet daughter, I left your favourite doll in the blue house on Elm Street.  I hope it gives you comfort.  Stay safe, my angel.\""

msgid "Thick fibers are found throughout the body of the creature.  Perhaps they serve a scaffolding purpose similar to that of (very flexible) bones."
msgstr "Thick fibres are found throughout the body of the creature.  Perhaps they serve a scaffolding purpose similar to that of (very flexible) bones."

msgid "The creature appears to have a vascular system vaguely similar to those of animals, with a branching network of vein, although the organization is unfamiliar."
msgstr "The creature appears to have a vascular system vaguely similar to those of animals, with a branching network of vein, although the organisation is unfamiliar."

msgid "At the top of the creature you find what you assume is a brain, although it seems to employ quadrilateral symmetry and thus is shaped and organized completely differently from that of terrestrial versions."
msgstr "At the top of the creature you find what you assume is a brain, although it seems to employ quadrilateral symmetry and thus is shaped and organised completely differently from that of terrestrial versions."

msgid "You didn't realize there had been an ache at the base of your neck all day until just now, when you notice it's gone."
msgstr "You didn't realise there had been an ache at the base of your neck all day until just now, when you notice it's gone."

msgid "You suddenly realize that all matter is merely energy condensed to a slow vibration, and we are all one consciousness experiencing itself subjectively."
msgstr "You suddenly realise that all matter is merely energy condensed to a slow vibration, and we are all one consciousness experiencing itself subjectively."

msgid "The inner contents of the walking dead.  It's hard to tell exactly what kind of tissue this may have once been.  Several structures appear to have molded together."
msgstr "The inner contents of the walking dead.  It's hard to tell exactly what kind of tissue this may have once been.  Several structures appear to have moulded together."

msgid "As you make your first cut into its skin, a pressurized jet of decaying blood almost hits your face."
msgstr "As you make your first cut into its skin, a pressurised jet of decaying blood almost hits your face."

msgid "The corpse twitches as you begin.  It didn't feel like rigor mortis."
msgstr "The corpse twitches as you begin.  It didn't feel like rigour mortis."

msgid "The thing's innards resemble one giant tumor more than the body of a human being."
msgstr "The thing's innards resemble one giant tumour more than the body of a human being."

msgid "You try pulling out some teeth to better analyze them, only to find they've fused with the jawbone."
msgstr "You try pulling out some teeth to better analyse them, only to find they've fused with the jawbone."

msgid "The vestibular organs seem to be nonfunctional, but your question of how the creature balances itself is answered by an odd mass in the center of the brain, that you liken to a gyroscope."
msgstr "The vestibular organs seem to be nonfunctional, but your question of how the creature balances itself is answered by an odd mass in the centre of the brain, that you liken to a gyroscope."

msgid "You find a clump of malformed tissue leading deeper inwards, at the center of which is a bullet."
msgstr "You find a clump of malformed tissue leading deeper inwards, at the centre of which is a bullet."

msgid "The thing's innards resemble one giant tumor more than the body of a living being."
msgstr "The thing's innards resemble one giant tumour more than the body of a living being."

msgid "This one's armor falls off surprisingly easily, almost as if whatever puppets it wishes for it to lose the extra weight."
msgstr "This one's armour falls off surprisingly easily, almost as if whatever puppets it wishes for it to lose the extra weight."

msgid "The layout and segmentation of its bony carapace disturbingly resembles what you want to call plate mail, but it's closer to the armor of an arthropod."
msgstr "The layout and segmentation of its bony carapace disturbingly resembles what you want to call plate mail, but it's closer to the armour of an arthropod."

msgid "These plates are almost impossible to remove until you realize they are linked to the internal skeleton with calcified pillars you must break before removing its armor."
msgstr "These plates are almost impossible to remove until you realise they are linked to the internal skeleton with calcified pillars you must break before removing its armour."

msgid "The sheer pungent acrid odor of the carcass makes you temporarily recoil and reconsider the safety of delving into its entrails."
msgstr "The sheer pungent acrid odour of the carcass makes you temporarily recoil and reconsider the safety of delving into its entrails."

msgid "You have to step back as a gland you inadvertently cut into seems to perform a neutralization reaction between its contents and the rest of its fluids."
msgstr "You have to step back as a gland you inadvertently cut into seems to perform a neutralisation reaction between its contents and the rest of its fluids."

msgid "The black camouflage evaporates off the body where you put your tool through, completely odorless."
msgstr "The black camouflage evaporates off the body where you put your tool through, completely odourless."

msgid "The inner tissues are a mosaic of somewhat normal flesh and flesh interlaced with fibers of the armor."
msgstr "The inner tissues are a mosaic of somewhat normal flesh and flesh interlaced with fibres of the armour."

msgid "Fibers of Kevlar-like material spread through the body like a cobweb, originating from a tiny entry wound in the abdomen."
msgstr "Fibres of Kevlar-like material spread through the body like a cobweb, originating from a tiny entry wound in the abdomen."

msgid "Upon closer examination, some of the Kevlar isn't Kevlar - its off color and composition suggest it's the creature's flesh reformed to imitate it."
msgstr "Upon closer examination, some of the Kevlar isn't Kevlar - its off colour and composition suggest it's the creature's flesh reformed to imitate it."

msgid "Strong fibers run alongside the muscles in a way that you want to compare to marbling."
msgstr "Strong fibres run alongside the muscles in a way that you want to compare to marbling."

msgid "Its legs seem to have been reinforced with a strange lattice of skeletal bracing and muscle fibers to support its immense bulk."
msgstr "Its legs seem to have been reinforced with a strange lattice of skeletal bracing and muscle fibres to support its immense bulk."

msgid "It seems most of the creature was grown as some sort of suit looking as if it was piloted by the still normal sized human corpse found in a fetal position in its torso."
msgstr "It seems most of the creature was grown as some sort of suit looking as if it was piloted by the still normal sized human corpse found in a foetal position in its torso."

msgid "You realize the muscles of the zombie's arms are hollow, their marrow replaced by a thick oily black liquid.  You wonder if the ridiculous muscle mass surrounding them is the other half of a strange hydraulic system."
msgstr "You realise the muscles of the zombie's arms are hollow, their marrow replaced by a thick oily black liquid.  You wonder if the ridiculous muscle mass surrounding them is the other half of a strange hydraulic system."

msgid "You cut into the arms of the creature and realize that instead of what you would expect from what you know of normal human anatomy, its muscles wind around the bones in what looks like a tight spring."
msgstr "You cut into the arms of the creature and realise that instead of what you would expect from what you know of normal human anatomy, its muscles wind around the bones in what looks like a tight spring."

msgid "There are bundles of nerves snaking all throughout the tissues, still channeling small amounts of electricity."
msgstr "There are bundles of nerves snaking all throughout the tissues, still channelling small amounts of electricity."

msgid "Despite the carcass lying still, you still notice churning while investigating its entrails, as if whatever was originally animating this corpse is wrestling with the mycelium fibers to retake control."
msgstr "Despite the carcass lying still, you still notice churning while investigating its entrails, as if whatever was originally animating this corpse is wrestling with the mycelium fibres to retake control."

msgid "Under the stomach you notice a wrinkled fruit that you can't help but think somewhat appetizing despite where you found it."
msgstr "Under the stomach you notice a wrinkled fruit that you can't help but think somewhat appetising despite where you found it."

msgid "The cavities of this creature are filled with lethargic winged creatures hanging off tubes oozing a grayish milky substance."
msgstr "The cavities of this creature are filled with lethargic winged creatures hanging off tubes oozing a greyish milky substance."

msgid "painted using water colors"
msgstr "painted using water colours"

msgid "created using gouache coloring"
msgstr "created using gouache colouring"

msgid "dressed in combat armor, hunkering behind a wall.  Bullets are flying through the air"
msgstr "dressed in combat armour, hunkering behind a wall.  Bullets are flying through the air"

msgid "city center"
msgstr "city centre"

msgid "You realize you now possess a Passcode.  You fail for a moment to reconcile this understanding, because it's no password as you previously understood it.  It is, in fact,"
msgstr "You realise you now possess a Passcode.  You fail for a moment to reconcile this understanding, because it's no password as you previously understood it.  It is, in fact,"

