msgid "shopping cart basket"
msgstr "shopping trolley basket"

msgid "external shopping cart basket"
msgstr "external shopping trolley basket"

msgid "Storage space, mounted outside your vehicle's armor and vulnerable to damage."
msgstr "Storage space, mounted outside your vehicle's armour and vulnerable to damage."

msgid "folding shopping cart basket"
msgstr "folding shopping trolley basket"

msgid "Spare tire stored on an external carrier rig."
msgstr "Spare tyre stored on an external carrier rig."

msgid "An extremely high performance solar panel.  Will recharge the vehicle's electrical power when exposed to the sun.  Clouds will slow the recharge speed.  Extremely fragile and cannot be armored."
msgstr "An extremely high performance solar panel.  Will recharge the vehicle's electrical power when exposed to the sun.  Clouds will slow the recharge speed.  Extremely fragile and cannot be armoured."

msgid "A combustion engine for use on aircraft.  Burns gasoline or avgas fuel from a tank in the vehicle."
msgstr "A combustion engine for use on aircraft.  Burns petrol or avgas fuel from a tank in the vehicle."

msgid "A combustion engine.  Burns gasoline fuel from a tank in the vehicle."
msgstr "A combustion engine.  Burns petrol fuel from a tank in the vehicle."

msgid "An advanced combustion engine.  Burns gasoline or diesel or aviation fuel from a tank in the vehicle.  Can also burn kerosene, though somewhat less efficiently.  Better power-to-weight ratio than a traditional engine, but consumes more fuel."
msgstr "An advanced combustion engine.  Burns petrol or diesel or aviation fuel from a tank in the vehicle.  Can also burn kerosene, though somewhat less efficiently.  Better power-to-weight ratio than a traditional engine, but consumes more fuel."

msgid "A powerful 6-cylinder diesel engine, typical of a bus, RV, large van, or armored personnel carrier."
msgstr "A powerful 6-cylinder diesel engine, typical of a bus, RV, large van, or armoured personnel carrier."

msgid "A large 8-cylinder diesel engine, powerful enough for a semi truck, armored car, or Humvee."
msgstr "A large 8-cylinder diesel engine, powerful enough for a semi truck, armoured car, or Humvee."

msgid "A 50 cc gasoline engine, suitable for a lawnmower, golf cart or moped."
msgstr "A 50 cc petrol engine, suitable for a lawnmower, golf cart or moped."

msgid "A small 25 cc gasoline engine, suitable for a hedge trimmer or installing on a bicycle."
msgstr "A small 25 cc petrol engine, suitable for a hedge trimmer or installing on a bicycle."

msgid "A 1600 cc four-cylinder gasoline engine, commonly found in small passenger cars."
msgstr "A 1600 cc four-cylinder petrol engine, commonly found in small passenger cars."

msgid "A massive 12-cylinder gasoline engine, with the kind of power you might need in a sports car."
msgstr "A massive 12-cylinder petrol engine, with the kind of power you might need in a sports car."

msgid "A powerful 6-cylinder gasoline engine strong enough for a pickup truck, SUV, or full-size van."
msgstr "A powerful 6-cylinder petrol engine strong enough for a pickup truck, SUV, or full-size van."

msgid "A heavy-duty 8-cylinder gasoline engine, like you might find in a fire truck, ambulance, or tow truck."
msgstr "A heavy-duty 8-cylinder petrol engine, like you might find in a fire truck, ambulance, or tow truck."

msgid "A kickstand to keep the bike from falling over.  You could use this to lean it forward or backward to change a tire."
msgstr "A kickstand to keep the bike from falling over.  You could use this to lean it forward or backward to change a tyre."

