msgid "A plastic 100-liter drum of a portable concrete mixer."
msgstr "A plastic 100-litre drum of a portable concrete mixer."

msgid "An armored black box, a device meant to record and preserve data of a military vehicle in the field in case it gets destroyed."
msgstr "An armoured black box, a device meant to record and preserve data of a military vehicle in the field in case it gets destroyed."

msgid "This is an autoclave.  It's useful for sterilizing things like CBMs.  'e'xamine the tile with the autoclave to use it."
msgstr "This is an autoclave.  It's useful for sterilising things like CBMs.  'e'xamine the tile with the autoclave to use it."

msgid "A light weight, advanced carbon fiber rigid sheet that keeps the water out of your boat."
msgstr "A light weight, advanced carbon fibre rigid sheet that keeps the water out of your boat."

#, c-format
msgid "Electronic module that automatically switches combustion and electric engines on and off minimizing fuel consumption and optimizing power output and battery charge rate.  Must be turned on to work.  Simplified ruleset: 1. When throttling, maximize acceleration.  2. Keep battery at 90%.  3. Minimize fuel consumption."
msgstr "Electronic module that automatically switches combustion and electric engines on and off minimising fuel consumption and optimising power output and battery charge rate.  Must be turned on to work.  Simplified ruleset: 1. When throttling, maximise acceleration.  2. Keep battery at 90%.  3. Minimise fuel consumption."

msgid "A large wind turbine with stabilizing legs.  Will cause extra drag on the vehicle."
msgstr "A large wind turbine with stabilising legs.  Will cause extra drag on the vehicle."

msgid "A solar panel.  Reinforced with armored glass to make it more resistant to damage."
msgstr "A solar panel.  Reinforced with armoured glass to make it more resistant to damage."

msgid "A high-performance solar panel.  Reinforced with armored glass to make it more resistant to damage."
msgstr "A high-performance solar panel.  Reinforced with armoured glass to make it more resistant to damage."

msgid "wooden armor"
msgstr "wooden armour"

msgid "military composite armor plating"
msgstr "military composite armour plating"

msgid "A collection of electronic bells.  Use the vehicle's controls to turn it on or off.  When turned on, it makes noise, attracting neighborhood children."
msgstr "A collection of electronic bells.  Use the vehicle's controls to turn it on or off.  When turned on, it makes noise, attracting neighbourhood children."

msgid "An aluminum hull that keeps the water out of your boat."
msgstr "An aluminium hull that keeps the water out of your boat."

msgid "Armor plate.  Will partially protect other components on the same frame from damage from direct attacks but not from the shock damage of a distant collision."
msgstr "Armour plate.  Will partially protect other components on the same frame from damage from direct attacks but not from the shock damage of a distant collision."

msgid "Armor plate.  Will partially protect other components on the same frame from the shock damage of a distant collision but not from direct attacks."
msgstr "Armour plate.  Will partially protect other components on the same frame from the shock damage of a distant collision but not from direct attacks."

msgid "If the center of balance of your vehicle is between all the wheels, the vehicle will be able to move, provided it has an active engine or motor with enough power to move the vehicle."
msgstr "If the centre of balance of your vehicle is between all the wheels, the vehicle will be able to move, provided it has an active engine or motor with enough power to move the vehicle."

msgid "A very strong, armored metal wheel."
msgstr "A very strong, armoured metal wheel."

