msgid "3D printers and carbon fiber crafting, from Cataclysm: Bright Nights.  The 3D printer prints plastic and carbon fiber items and repairs them.  The advanced 3D printer also sinters metal parts, makes carbon fiber filament and repairs metal items.  Either can be carried, placed as an appliance, mounted on a vehicle or kept in a workshop rig."
msgstr "3D printers and carbon fibre crafting, from Cataclysm: Bright Nights.  The 3D printer prints plastic and carbon fibre items and repairs them.  The advanced 3D printer also sinters metal parts, makes carbon fibre filament and repairs metal items.  Either can be carried, placed as an appliance, mounted on a vehicle or kept in a workshop rig."

msgid "pair of carbon fiber arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of carbon fiber arm guards"
msgstr[0] "pair of carbon fibre arm guards"
msgstr[1] "pairs of carbon fibre arm guards"

msgid "Custom arm guards of layered carbon fiber made using a 3D printer, strapped on with leather.  Its rigid plates are more comparable to plate armor than Kevlar, but it's very protective and lightweight."
msgstr "Custom arm guards of layered carbon fibre made using a 3D printer, strapped on with leather.  Its rigid plates are more comparable to plate armour than Kevlar, but it's very protective and lightweight."

msgid "pair of carbon fiber boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of carbon fiber boots"
msgstr[0] "pair of carbon fibre boots"
msgstr[1] "pairs of carbon fibre boots"

msgid "A custom pair of leather boots armored with layered carbon fiber made using a 3D printer.  Its rigid plates are more comparable to plate armor than Kevlar, but it's very protective and lightweight."
msgstr "A custom pair of leather boots armoured with layered carbon fibre made using a 3D printer.  Its rigid plates are more comparable to plate armour than Kevlar, but it's very protective and lightweight."

