msgid_plural "carbon fiber helmets"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre helmet"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre helmets"

msgid "A custom helmet of layered carbon fiber made using a 3D printer, lined with leather.  Its rigid plates are more comparable to plate armor than Kevlar, but it's very protective and lightweight."
msgstr "A custom helmet of layered carbon fibre made using a 3D printer, lined with leather.  Its rigid plates are more comparable to plate armour than Kevlar, but it's very protective and lightweight."

msgid "pair of carbon fiber leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of carbon fiber leg guards"
msgstr[0] "pair of carbon fibre leg guards"
msgstr[1] "pairs of carbon fibre leg guards"

msgid "Custom leg guards of layered carbon fiber made using a 3D printer, strapped on with leather.  Its rigid plates are more comparable to plate armor than Kevlar, but it's very protective and lightweight."
msgstr "Custom leg guards of layered carbon fibre made using a 3D printer, strapped on with leather.  Its rigid plates are more comparable to plate armour than Kevlar, but it's very protective and lightweight."

msgid "carbon fiber chestguard"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber chestguards"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre chestguard"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre chestguards"

msgid "A custom chestplate of layered carbon fiber made using a 3D printer, with leather straps.  Its rigid plates are more comparable to plate armor than Kevlar, but it's very protective and lightweight."
msgstr "A custom chestplate of layered carbon fibre made using a 3D printer, with leather straps.  Its rigid plates are more comparable to plate armour than Kevlar, but it's very protective and lightweight."

msgid "carbon fiber armor"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber armors"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre armour"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre armours"

msgid "A custom suit of layered carbon fiber plates over neoprene padding, made using a 3D printer.  Its rigid plates are more comparable to a suit of armor than Kevlar, but it's very protective and moves surprisingly well."
msgstr "A custom suit of layered carbon fibre plates over neoprene padding, made using a 3D printer.  Its rigid plates are more comparable to a suit of armour than Kevlar, but it's very protective and moves surprisingly well."

msgid "carbon fiber jerrycan"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber jerrycans"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre jerrycan"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre jerrycans"

msgid "A well-made carbon fiber jerrycan, meant to carry fuel, but it can carry other liquids in a pinch."
msgstr "A well-made carbon fibre jerrycan, meant to carry fuel, but it can carry other liquids in a pinch."

msgid "carbon fiber furniture"
msgid_plural "sets of carbon fiber furniture"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre furniture"
msgstr[1] "sets of carbon fibre furniture"

msgid "A set of 3D-printed carbon fiber replacement grips and handguards.  Lighter than polymer furniture, at the cost of handling and melee effectiveness."
msgstr "A set of 3D-printed carbon fibre replacement grips and handguards.  Lighter than polymer furniture, at the cost of handling and melee effectiveness."

msgid "carbon fiber stock"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber stocks"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre stock"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre stocks"

msgid "A 3D-printed carbon fiber replacement stock.  Lighter than polymer or wood stocks, with a slight handling penalty from the reduced mass at the rear of the weapon."
msgstr "A 3D-printed carbon fibre replacement stock.  Lighter than polymer or wood stocks, with a slight handling penalty from the reduced mass at the rear of the weapon."

msgid "carbon fiber lower receiver"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber lower receivers"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre lower receiver"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre lower receivers"

msgid "A 3D-printed carbon fiber replacement lower receiver for AR-15 pattern rifles and pistols.  Significantly lighter than the original aluminum receiver, with no effect on accuracy or reliability."
msgstr "A 3D-printed carbon fibre replacement lower receiver for AR-15 pattern rifles and pistols.  Significantly lighter than the original aluminium receiver, with no effect on accuracy or reliability."

msgid "carbon fiber assault rifle"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre assault rifle"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre assault rifles"

msgid "carbon fiber machine pistol"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber machine pistols"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre machine pistol"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre machine pistols"

msgid "carbon fiber repeating crossbow"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber repeating crossbows"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre repeating crossbow"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre repeating crossbows"

msgid "A custom 3D-printed pump-action repeating crossbow made out of carbon fiber and synthetic cord.  This expensive hunting weapon is surprisingly lightweight thanks to its construction, but only a 3D printer can repair it."
msgstr "A custom 3D-printed pump-action repeating crossbow made out of carbon fibre and synthetic cord.  This expensive hunting weapon is surprisingly lightweight thanks to its construction, but only a 3D printer can repair it."

msgid "carbon fiber knife"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber knifes"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre knife"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre knifes"

msgid "A custom 3D-printed combat knife made out of carbon fiber with a steel edge.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."
msgstr "A custom 3D-printed combat knife made out of carbon fibre with a steel edge.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."

msgid "carbon fiber spear"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber spears"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre spear"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre spears"

msgid "A custom 3D-printed spear made out of carbon fiber with a steel-edged spear tip.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."
msgstr "A custom 3D-printed spear made out of carbon fibre with a steel-edged spear tip.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."

msgid "carbon fiber katana"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber katanas"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre katana"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre katanas"

msgid "A custom 3D-printed single-edged sword made out of carbon fiber with a steel edge.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."
msgstr "A custom 3D-printed single-edged sword made out of carbon fibre with a steel edge.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."

msgid "carbon fiber sword"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber swords"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre sword"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre swords"

msgid "A custom 3D-printed double-edged sword made out of carbon fiber with a steel edge.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."
msgstr "A custom 3D-printed double-edged sword made out of carbon fibre with a steel edge.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."

msgid "carbon fiber nodachi"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber nodachis"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre nodachi"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre nodachis"

msgid "A custom 3D-printed single-edged two-handed sword made out of carbon fiber with a steel edge.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."
msgstr "A custom 3D-printed single-edged two-handed sword made out of carbon fibre with a steel edge.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."

msgid "carbon fiber greatsword"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber greatswords"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre greatsword"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre greatswords"

msgid "A custom 3D-printed two-handed sword made out of carbon fiber with a steel edge.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."
msgstr "A custom 3D-printed two-handed sword made out of carbon fibre with a steel edge.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."

msgid "carbon fiber punch dagger"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber punch daggers"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre punch dagger"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre punch daggers"

msgid "A custom 3D-printed punch dagger made out of carbon fiber with a steel-edged blade.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."
msgstr "A custom 3D-printed punch dagger made out of carbon fibre with a steel-edged blade.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."

msgid "carbon fiber knuckle katar"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber knuckle katars"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre knuckle katar"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre knuckle katars"

msgid "A custom 3D-printed knuckle katar made out of carbon fiber with steel-edged blades.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."
msgstr "A custom 3D-printed knuckle katar made out of carbon fibre with steel-edged blades.  It is lighter than an all-steel weapon thanks to its method of manufacture."

msgid "carbon fiber filament"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber filament"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre filament"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre filament"

msgid "A 3D printer on a frame, wired to run off a vehicle's batteries.  It can produce almost any item out of plastic or carbon fiber, and repair items made of them."
msgstr "A 3D printer on a frame, wired to run off a vehicle's batteries.  It can produce almost any item out of plastic or carbon fibre, and repair items made of them."

msgid "An advanced 3D printer on a frame, wired to run off a vehicle's batteries.  It prints plastic, carbon fiber and sintered metal parts, makes carbon fiber filament, and repairs polymer and metal items alike."
msgstr "An advanced 3D printer on a frame, wired to run off a vehicle's batteries.  It prints plastic, carbon fibre and sintered metal parts, makes carbon fibre filament, and repairs polymer and metal items alike."

msgid "Although it's not nearly as fancy as the experimental nanofabricators, this civilian-grade 3D printer can produce almost any item out of plastic or carbon fiber…  so long as you can program it.  It's also useful for repairing items made out of plastic or carbon fiber.  It runs from a medium battery, or from a power outlet with its cord."
msgstr "Although it's not nearly as fancy as the experimental nanofabricators, this civilian-grade 3D printer can produce almost any item out of plastic or carbon fibre…  so long as you can program it.  It's also useful for repairing items made out of plastic or carbon fibre.  It runs from a medium battery, or from a power outlet with its cord."

msgid "Recent advances in 3D printing technology have resulted in the ability to quickly and cheaply 3D print metals and alloys.  Such 3D printers are highly expensive, but sought out by collectors and preppers alike.  On top of faster polymer printing, it can sinter metal parts from scrap, make carbon fiber filament out of plastic, and repair polymer and metal items alike.  It runs from a medium battery, or from a power outlet with its cord."
msgstr "Recent advances in 3D printing technology have resulted in the ability to quickly and cheaply 3D print metals and alloys.  Such 3D printers are highly expensive, but sought out by collectors and preppers alike.  On top of faster polymer printing, it can sinter metal parts from scrap, make carbon fibre filament out of plastic, and repair polymer and metal items alike.  It runs from a medium battery, or from a power outlet with its cord."

msgid "carbon fiber sheet"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber sheets"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre sheet"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre sheets"

msgid "A thin, rigid sheet of 3D-printed carbon fiber, for building lightweight vehicle walls."
msgstr "A thin, rigid sheet of 3D-printed carbon fibre, for building lightweight vehicle walls."

msgid "carbon fiber plating"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber plating"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre plating"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre plating"

msgid "A piece of vehicle armor plating made of layered carbon fiber.  Far lighter than steel plating, and nearly as tough."
msgstr "A piece of vehicle armour plating made of layered carbon fibre.  Far lighter than steel plating, and nearly as tough."

msgid "carbon fiber frame"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber frames"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre frame"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre frames"

msgid "A foldable frame made from 3D-printed carbon fiber tubing.  Useful for lightweight yet sturdy vehicles."
msgstr "A foldable frame made from 3D-printed carbon fibre tubing.  Useful for lightweight yet sturdy vehicles."

msgid "carbon fiber cargo carrier"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber cargo carriers"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre cargo carrier"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre cargo carriers"

msgid "A sturdy, yet lightweight carbon fiber structure outfitted with tie-downs and attachment points for carrying cargo."
msgstr "A sturdy, yet lightweight carbon fibre structure outfitted with tie-downs and attachment points for carrying cargo."

msgid "carbon fiber floor trunk"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber floor trunks"
msgstr[0] "carbon fibre floor trunk"
msgstr[1] "carbon fibre floor trunks"

msgid "A section of carbon fiber flooring with a cargo space beneath, and a hinged door for access."
msgstr "A section of carbon fibre flooring with a cargo space beneath, and a hinged door for access."

msgid "A carbon fiber framework, designed to fold.  Other vehicle components can be mounted on it.  If all the frames and components of a vehicle are foldable, the vehicle can be folded into a small package and picked up as a normal item."
msgstr "A carbon fibre framework, designed to fold.  Other vehicle components can be mounted on it.  If all the frames and components of a vehicle are foldable, the vehicle can be folded into a small package and picked up as a normal item."

msgid "carbon fiber trunk"
msgstr "carbon fibre trunk"

msgid "A lockable storage compartment built from carbon fiber."
msgstr "A lockable storage compartment built from carbon fibre."

msgid "carbon fiber cargo space"
msgstr "carbon fibre cargo space"

msgid "A big carbon fiber cargo carrier, with tie-downs and attachment points for storing items."
msgstr "A big carbon fibre cargo carrier, with tie-downs and attachment points for storing items."

msgid "external carbon fiber cargo rack"
msgstr "external carbon fibre cargo rack"

msgid "Carbon fiber storage space, mounted outside your vehicle's armor and vulnerable to damage."
msgstr "Carbon fibre storage space, mounted outside your vehicle's armour and vulnerable to damage."

msgid "carbon fiber board"
msgstr "carbon fibre board"

msgid "A carbon fiber wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle and prevents people from seeing through it."
msgstr "A carbon fibre wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle and prevents people from seeing through it."

msgid "carbon fiber quarterpanel"
msgstr "carbon fibre quarterpanel"

msgid "A half-height carbon fiber wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle but allows people to see over it."
msgstr "A half-height carbon fibre wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle but allows people to see over it."

msgid "carbon fiber stow board"
msgstr "carbon fibre stow board"

msgid "A carbon fiber wall with a storage locker.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle and prevents people from seeing through it."
msgstr "A carbon fibre wall with a storage locker.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle and prevents people from seeing through it."

msgid "An armor plate of layered carbon fiber.  Lighter than steel plating, softer against blunt impacts but tougher against cuts and bullets.  Protects other vehicle components on the same square."
msgstr "An armour plate of layered carbon fibre.  Lighter than steel plating, softer against blunt impacts but tougher against cuts and bullets.  Protects other vehicle components on the same square."

msgid "Carbon Fiber Bicycle"
msgstr "Carbon Fibre Bicycle"

msgid "Movement Optimization (1)"
msgstr "Movement Optimisation (1)"

msgid "Movement Optimization (2)"
msgstr "Movement Optimisation (2)"

msgid "Movement Optimization (3)"
msgstr "Movement Optimisation (3)"

msgid "Movement Optimization (4)"
msgstr "Movement Optimisation (4)"

msgid "Post overdose quantities of multiple drugs in analyzed blood."
msgstr "Post overdose quantities of multiple drugs in analysed blood."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to inject you, but fails to penetrate your armor!"
msgstr "%1$s tries to inject you, but fails to penetrate your armour!"

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to inject <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armor!"
msgstr "%1$s tries to inject <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armour!"

#, c-format
msgid "%s tries to grasp you, but it slides off your armor."
msgstr "%s tries to grasp you, but it slides off your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%s tries to grasp <npcname>, but its legs slide of their armor."
msgstr "%s tries to grasp <npcname>, but its legs slide of their armour."

msgid "Reveals a cone shaped area centered on the caster."
msgstr "Reveals a cone shaped area centred on the caster."

msgid "A miniaturized fusion reactor.  It has modest output, but will run continuously for over two hundred years thanks to its internal nuclear fuel reservoir."
msgstr "A miniaturised fusion reactor.  It has modest output, but will run continuously for over two hundred years thanks to its internal nuclear fuel reservoir."

msgid "An implanted miniaturized computer isolated from the rest of your systems by military-grade firewalls.  An accompanying jack allows you to interface with external computer systems with minimal risk.  Skill in computers is important, and a failed use may damage your circuits."
msgstr "An implanted miniaturised computer isolated from the rest of your systems by military-grade firewalls.  An accompanying jack allows you to interface with external computer systems with minimal risk.  Skill in computers is important, and a failed use may damage your circuits."

msgid "A radical nanite treatment that allows its host's circulatory system to function as a secondary nervous system, greatly increasing their mental acuity and allowing them to survive trauma that would otherwise be fatal.  A cybernetic enhancement of this category is a rare find and could be easily traded for significant favors and resources."
msgstr "A radical nanite treatment that allows its host's circulatory system to function as a secondary nervous system, greatly increasing their mental acuity and allowing them to survive trauma that would otherwise be fatal.  A cybernetic enhancement of this category is a rare find and could be easily traded for significant favours and resources."

msgid "Aramid Fiber"
msgstr "Aramid Fibre"

msgid "Armor piercing 7.50mm ammunition with a tungsten carbide penetrator.  These rounds are designed to defeat body armor and other hard targets, but have reduced stopping power against unarmored targets."
msgstr "Armour piercing 7.50mm ammunition with a tungsten carbide penetrator.  These rounds are designed to defeat body armour and other hard targets, but have reduced stopping power against unarmoured targets."

msgid "High precision 7.50mm microjet darts for use in smart weaponry.  These low velocity rounds can adjust mid-flight to exploit weaknesses in the target's defenses."
msgstr "High precision 7.50mm microjet darts for use in smart weaponry.  These low velocity rounds can adjust mid-flight to exploit weaknesses in the target's defences."

msgid "Gibson Gear Splinter flechettes are made with magnetic ceramics that shatter upon impact and dig deeply into flesh, as a consequence of this change these rounds lose almost all of their armor piercing."
msgstr "Gibson Gear Splinter flechettes are made with magnetic ceramics that shatter upon impact and dig deeply into flesh, as a consequence of this change these rounds lose almost all of their armour piercing."

msgid "Gibson Gear Fang flechettes loading a small ampoule of neurotoxic poison within a hollow cobalt dart.  Although principally designed to neutralize the heavily augmented, they are effective against most organic targets."
msgstr "Gibson Gear Fang flechettes loading a small ampoule of neurotoxic poison within a hollow cobalt dart.  Although principally designed to neutralise the heavily augmented, they are effective against most organic targets."

msgid "A brightly colored, standard-fab pattern environmental suit for use in industrial and medical settings.  Offers good protection from chemical and radioactive hazards, but is not insulated against heat or cold.  Requires a gasmask or sealed helmet for full protection."
msgstr "A brightly coloured, standard-fab pattern environmental suit for use in industrial and medical settings.  Offers good protection from chemical and radioactive hazards, but is not insulated against heat or cold.  Requires a gasmask or sealed helmet for full protection."

msgid "A brightly colored, standard-fab pattern environmental suit for use in industrial and medical settings.  The upper portion has been tied around the waist casually."
msgstr "A brightly coloured, standard-fab pattern environmental suit for use in industrial and medical settings.  The upper portion has been tied around the waist casually."

msgid "A cream colored jacket with a large fur collar.  Too thin to be anything more than a fashion statement once winter arrives."
msgstr "A cream coloured jacket with a large fur collar.  Too thin to be anything more than a fashion statement once winter arrives."

msgid "A combat jacket with a high collar and a short waist.  Although it's made from reactive aramid fibers, it's more of a fashion statement than a practical piece of armor.  You could mount MOLLE compatible gear on it alongside a neck guard."
msgstr "A combat jacket with a high collar and a short waist.  Although it's made from reactive aramid fibres, it's more of a fashion statement than a practical piece of armour.  You could mount MOLLE compatible gear on it alongside a neck guard."

msgid "It's black and cut in a style that vaguely resembles the armor of Wraitheon's capital assurance teams."
msgstr "It's black and cut in a style that vaguely resembles the armour of Wraitheon's capital assurance teams."

msgid "An armored black headset that coalesces the feeds of several sensors into a single screen display.  It provides generalized assistance in combat, including targeting assistance for thrown and ranged weaponry, threat identification, conditional NV and thermal vision and protection against high intensity light sources.  It must be active to function."
msgstr "An armoured black headset that coalesces the feeds of several sensors into a single screen display.  It provides generalised assistance in combat, including targeting assistance for thrown and ranged weaponry, threat identification, conditional NV and thermal vision and protection against high intensity light sources.  It must be active to function."

msgid "An armored black headset that coalesces the feeds of several sensors into a single screen display.  It provides generalized assistance in combat, including targeting assistance for thrown and ranged weaponry, threat identification, conditional NV and thermal vision and protection against high intensity light sources."
msgstr "An armoured black headset that coalesces the feeds of several sensors into a single screen display.  It provides generalised assistance in combat, including targeting assistance for thrown and ranged weaponry, threat identification, conditional NV and thermal vision and protection against high intensity light sources."

msgid "Load bearing equipment that can be configured to attach PALS compatible pouches, meant to be worn in conjunction with armor.  It has two magnetic attachment points for a rifle and a sidearm.  Standard issue in the US Army."
msgstr "Load bearing equipment that can be configured to attach PALS compatible pouches, meant to be worn in conjunction with armour.  It has two magnetic attachment points for a rifle and a sidearm.  Standard issue in the US Army."

msgid "A sleek black undersuit criss-crossed with the tubing of a heat regulation unit.  Insulation is kept at a minimum to allow for combat mobility, and the suit is quite power hungry as a result.  Despite the name, it's minimally protective and designed to be worn under a set of armor.  Made to fit the uplifted, the heavily augmented, or similarly sized individuals."
msgstr "A sleek black undersuit criss-crossed with the tubing of a heat regulation unit.  Insulation is kept at a minimum to allow for combat mobility, and the suit is quite power hungry as a result.  Despite the name, it's minimally protective and designed to be worn under a set of armour.  Made to fit the uplifted, the heavily augmented, or similarly sized individuals."

msgid "This is a light duty exosuit frame.  This lighter version of the exosuit draws less power but has less capacity for equipment and uses a fixed cage for collision protection instead of modular armor."
msgstr "This is a light duty exosuit frame.  This lighter version of the exosuit draws less power but has less capacity for equipment and uses a fixed cage for collision protection instead of modular armour."

msgid "This is a light duty exosuit frame.  This lighter version of the exosuit draws less power but has less capacity for equipment and uses a fixed cage for collision protection instead of modular armor.  It is turned on and continually drawing power.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "This is a light duty exosuit frame.  This lighter version of the exosuit draws less power but has less capacity for equipment and uses a fixed cage for collision protection instead of modular armour.  It is turned on and continually drawing power.  Use it to turn it off."

msgid "A laser pistol of tremendous power, equally as likely to melt its targets as it is to melt itself.  Powerful enough to punch through heavy military armor, it'll win most shootouts so long as you can end them in three shots or less."
msgstr "A laser pistol of tremendous power, equally as likely to melt its targets as it is to melt itself.  Powerful enough to punch through heavy military armour, it'll win most shootouts so long as you can end them in three shots or less."

msgid "This light coilgun fires 3x35mm armor-piercing flechette.  Built as a security weapon for aircraft and secure facilities, it could be stashed in hidden lockers throughout a building.  Fired in short bursts, its flechettes rarely over-penetrate walls or fuselages."
msgstr "This light coilgun fires 3x35mm armour-piercing flechette.  Built as a security weapon for aircraft and secure facilities, it could be stashed in hidden lockers throughout a building.  Fired in short bursts, its flechettes rarely over-penetrate walls or fuselages."

msgid "An automatic coilgun made entirely of lightweight ceramics, with no moving pieces and if loaded with splinter rounds almost entirely invisible on most security scanners.  No one is sure who manufactures this assassin's tool, but they randomly come onto the back room markets frequented by the unsavory."
msgstr "An automatic coilgun made entirely of lightweight ceramics, with no moving pieces and if loaded with splinter rounds almost entirely invisible on most security scanners.  No one is sure who manufactures this assassin's tool, but they randomly come onto the back room markets frequented by the unsavoury."

msgid "The single round 00 bore barrel built at the center of the T72 revolver.  Can function as a backup in case the power pack of the main weapon is depleted."
msgstr "The single round 00 bore barrel built at the centre of the T72 revolver.  Can function as a backup in case the power pack of the main weapon is depleted."

msgid "A powerful anti-drone defense weapon, the W3310 Archangel is capable of firing a chain of electrical discharges that can arc between multiple targets.  Most effective against groups of lightly armored foes, use within closed spaces is not recommended due to the risk of self-inflicted injury."
msgstr "A powerful anti-drone defence weapon, the W3310 Archangel is capable of firing a chain of electrical discharges that can arc between multiple targets.  Most effective against groups of lightly armoured foes, use within closed spaces is not recommended due to the risk of self-inflicted injury."

msgid "Custom firmware for the electrical ignition system of caseless firearms.  Tweaks the ignition timing to maximize pressure in the chamber, increasing muzzle velocity and armor penetration at the cost of increased wear on the weapon."
msgstr "Custom firmware for the electrical ignition system of caseless firearms.  Tweaks the ignition timing to maximise pressure in the chamber, increasing muzzle velocity and armour penetration at the cost of increased wear on the weapon."

msgid "Custom firmware for the electrical ignition system of caseless firearms.  Tweaks the ignition timing to ensure that fired bullets remain subsonic, reducing noise at the cost of range and armor penetration."
msgstr "Custom firmware for the electrical ignition system of caseless firearms.  Tweaks the ignition timing to ensure that fired bullets remain subsonic, reducing noise at the cost of range and armour penetration."

msgid ""
"Imagine a computer inside your body playing pong against the universe.  The paddles are made of -color glass condensate- and any and all of their specific functions are the intellectual property of the Hawking Corporation and/or its local subsidiaries.\n"
"-From the owners manual of HawkingCorps Mark I Shield.\n"
"\n"
"Activating the shield will create an energy shield capable of negating a modest amount of damage from weak or improvised weapons."
msgstr ""
"Imagine a computer inside your body playing pong against the universe.  The paddles are made of -colour glass condensate- and any and all of their specific functions are the intellectual property of the Hawking Corporation and/or its local subsidiaries.\n"
"-From the owners manual of HawkingCorps Mark I Shield.\n"
"\n"
"Activating the shield will create an energy shield capable of negating a modest amount of damage from weak or improvised weapons."

msgid "This is a cluster of multicolored membranous bubbles, each about the size of a grape, retrieved from inside an alien animal.  They float like tiny helium balloons - perhaps they are full of lighter-than-air gas."
msgstr "This is a cluster of multicoloured membranous bubbles, each about the size of a grape, retrieved from inside an alien animal.  They float like tiny helium balloons - perhaps they are full of lighter-than-air gas."

msgid "Arrows made from nanoprinted materials where each layer of the arrow is designed for improved efficiency.  A layer that provides the least possible air resistance, followed by a layer of armor piercing, then followed by a frangible layer.  However, this makes each arrow single use."
msgstr "Arrows made from nanoprinted materials where each layer of the arrow is designed for improved efficiency.  A layer that provides the least possible air resistance, followed by a layer of armour piercing, then followed by a frangible layer.  However, this makes each arrow single use."

msgid "A dense, fin-stabilized steel shaft wrapped in a conductive copper armature band, engineered to ride electromagnetic accelerator rails without buckling.  Only an electromagnetic compound bow can fire it, and the armature band rarely survives the shot intact."
msgstr "A dense, fin-stabilised steel shaft wrapped in a conductive copper armature band, engineered to ride electromagnetic accelerator rails without buckling.  Only an electromagnetic compound bow can fire it, and the armature band rarely survives the shot intact."

msgid "A gantry for supporting an exosuit upright during maintenance and repair.  Includes the specialized tools needed for complex repairs and will also charge the suit's power when active."
msgstr "A gantry for supporting an exosuit upright during maintenance and repair.  Includes the specialised tools needed for complex repairs and will also charge the suit's power when active."

msgid "A sleek, unfathomably-complicated machine covered in dozens of blinking lights, worn on the back by sturdy faux-leather straps.  An electrode dangles from the back, attaching to your forehead.  How it operates without annihilating spacetime isn't quite clear, but a localized portal allows things to be stored in an extradimensional space."
msgstr "A sleek, unfathomably-complicated machine covered in dozens of blinking lights, worn on the back by sturdy faux-leather straps.  An electrode dangles from the back, attaching to your forehead.  How it operates without annihilating spacetime isn't quite clear, but a localised portal allows things to be stored in an extradimensional space."

msgid "A lightweight armor vest made of pieces of titanium sewn together, with cloth padding for comfort.  Brittle against blunt force, but highly resistant to cuts and corrosion."
msgstr "A lightweight armour vest made of pieces of titanium sewn together, with cloth padding for comfort.  Brittle against blunt force, but highly resistant to cuts and corrosion."

msgid "XL work pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL work pants"
msgstr[0] "XL work trousers"
msgstr[1] "pairs of XL work trousers"

msgid "A pair of gray work pants."
msgstr "A pair of grey work trousers."

msgid "A pair of XL blue work pants."
msgstr "A pair of XL blue work trousers."

msgid "A pair of XL gray work pants."
msgstr "A pair of XL grey work trousers."

msgid "A pair of XL light-blue work pants."
msgstr "A pair of XL light-blue work trousers."

msgid "A gray XL work t-shirt with a small front pocket."
msgstr "A grey XL work t-shirt with a small front pocket."

msgid "An XL gray work t-shirt with a small front pocket."
msgstr "An XL grey work t-shirt with a small front pocket."

msgid "oversized SWAT armor"
msgid_plural "oversized SWAT armors"
msgstr[0] "oversized SWAT armour"
msgstr[1] "oversized SWAT armours"

msgid "An extra large suit of black bulletproof armor with lots of pockets.  The word SWAT is emblazoned across the back.  Specifically designed for officers from Shady Hills Corporation's Killophant program."
msgstr "An extra large suit of black bulletproof armour with lots of pockets.  The word SWAT is emblazoned across the back.  Specifically designed for officers from Shady Hills Corporation's Killophant program."

msgid "Oversized ballistic armor without any armor inserts.  The soft armor plate carrier is still protective but it won't stop high energy projectiles."
msgstr "Oversized ballistic armour without any armour inserts.  The soft armour plate carrier is still protective but it won't stop high energy projectiles."

msgid "Oversized ballistic armor with ESAPI ceramic armor plates."
msgstr "Oversized ballistic armour with ESAPI ceramic armour plates."

msgid "An XL leather belt.  Useful for making your pair of pants fit if you need really big pants."
msgstr "An XL leather belt.  Useful for making your pair of trousers fit if you need really big trousers."

msgid "This piece of armor harkens back to renaissance designs.  It differs in that it is cast as a single piece in a Rivtech vacuum foundry where conditions can be controlled absolutely."
msgstr "This piece of armour harkens back to renaissance designs.  It differs in that it is cast as a single piece in a Rivtech vacuum foundry where conditions can be controlled absolutely."

msgid "A small folio indicating how to best utilize the equipment of your FEMA survival kit during an emergency.  Its first page urges you to remain calm, and to tune into the emergency broadcast system for further instructions."
msgstr "A small folio indicating how to best utilise the equipment of your FEMA survival kit during an emergency.  Its first page urges you to remain calm, and to tune into the emergency broadcast system for further instructions."

msgid "A Shady Hills Corporation research binder covering mutagen design: the Killophant shock-troop program, mi-go derived strains and a chapter on reanimating the dead.  Someone gave it its title in a fit of dark humor.  Otherwise a dry text about genetic modification."
msgstr "A Shady Hills Corporation research binder covering mutagen design: the Killophant shock-troop program, mi-go derived strains and a chapter on reanimating the dead.  Someone gave it its title in a fit of dark humour.  Otherwise a dry text about genetic modification."

msgid "A sheaf of XEDRA field notes detailing some species of lichen recovered near dimensional anomalies.  Most of the information is useless to you except for the fact that these lichens rely on a macronutrient that acts like a neurotoxin for humans.  One useful note is a detailed procedure to neutralize said neurotoxin."
msgstr "A sheaf of XEDRA field notes detailing some species of lichen recovered near dimensional anomalies.  Most of the information is useless to you except for the fact that these lichens rely on a macronutrient that acts like a neurotoxin for humans.  One useful note is a detailed procedure to neutralise said neurotoxin."

msgid "A set of tiny bionic nerve stimulators that install into the reward center of your brain.  When run with bionic power, it periodically releases a hit of dopamine and other reward chemicals, inducing a state of euphoria and suppressing fear."
msgstr "A set of tiny bionic nerve stimulators that install into the reward centre of your brain.  When run with bionic power, it periodically releases a hit of dopamine and other reward chemicals, inducing a state of euphoria and suppressing fear."

msgid "Melee Optimization Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Melee Optimization Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Melee Optimisation Unit CBM"
msgstr[1] "Melee Optimisation Unit CBMs"

msgid "An implanted AI module and medication dispenser calculates the optimal chemical mix to keep you on your toes and ready for combat.  This bionic must be active to function and while it functions your body is at a heightened performance but if it turns off it will take you several days to get back to normal.  There are a significant number of baseline bonuses granted by this setup but people around will notice your junkie behavior.  This bionic must be active to function."
msgstr "An implanted AI module and medication dispenser calculates the optimal chemical mix to keep you on your toes and ready for combat.  This bionic must be active to function and while it functions your body is at a heightened performance but if it turns off it will take you several days to get back to normal.  There are a significant number of baseline bonuses granted by this setup but people around will notice your junkie behaviour.  This bionic must be active to function."

msgid "A personal kinetic attenuation field that slows incoming projectiles by converting their kinetic energy into bursts of visible light.  Although this version is not powerful enough to defeat most pistol or rifle cartridges by itself, it greatly increases survival odds when combined with traditional ballistic armor.  Activating the field will reduce incoming ballistic and piercing damage by 10 points."
msgstr "A personal kinetic attenuation field that slows incoming projectiles by converting their kinetic energy into bursts of visible light.  Although this version is not powerful enough to defeat most pistol or rifle cartridges by itself, it greatly increases survival odds when combined with traditional ballistic armour.  Activating the field will reduce incoming ballistic and piercing damage by 10 points."

msgid "A military grade kinetic attenuation system developed for the Army's special operations units.  Although far beyond anything on the open market, it remains a pale imitation of the anomalous artifact XEDRA reverse engineered it from.  A side effect its engineers never solved is the tendency for this unit to release electrical fields when hit.  Activating the field will reduce incoming ballistic and piercing damage by 20 points."
msgstr "A military grade kinetic attenuation system developed for the Army's special operations units.  Although far beyond anything on the open market, it remains a pale imitation of the anomalous artefact XEDRA reverse engineered it from.  A side effect its engineers never solved is the tendency for this unit to release electrical fields when hit.  Activating the field will reduce incoming ballistic and piercing damage by 20 points."

msgid "This is a metal box containing survival supplies, stockpiled by FEMA in shelters and evacuation centers.  Its cyan highlights indicate that it's a simpler Type II kit, meant for a few days of sheltering in place."
msgstr "This is a metal box containing survival supplies, stockpiled by FEMA in shelters and evacuation centres.  Its cyan highlights indicate that it's a simpler Type II kit, meant for a few days of sheltering in place."

msgid "A standard intermodal cargo transfer container.  Its faceted corners are adorned with the livery of a company you don't recognize."
msgstr "A standard intermodal cargo transfer container.  Its faceted corners are adorned with the livery of a company you don't recognise."

msgid "A plastic and aluminum foil bag for long term food storage."
msgstr "A plastic and aluminium foil bag for long term food storage."

msgid "A broken defense robot.  Could be gutted for parts or crafted into a salvaged robot."
msgstr "A broken defence robot.  Could be gutted for parts or crafted into a salvaged robot."

msgid "A broken Kabura-ya drone.  Could be disassembled for a meager amount of parts."
msgstr "A broken Kabura-ya drone.  Could be disassembled for a meagre amount of parts."

msgid "A broken defense robot.  Its internal weapons have been removed.  Could be gutted for parts or crafted into a salvaged robot."
msgstr "A broken defence robot.  Its internal weapons have been removed.  Could be gutted for parts or crafted into a salvaged robot."

msgid "broken disarmed defense bot"
msgid_plural "broken disarmed defense bots"
msgstr[0] "broken disarmed defence bot"
msgstr[1] "broken disarmed defence bots"

msgid "A favorite tool of mutineers everywhere, this is a standard issue oxygen candle deliberately tampered to explode upon activation.  Its fuse is dangerously short, so you won't want to waste any time."
msgstr "A favourite tool of mutineers everywhere, this is a standard issue oxygen candle deliberately tampered to explode upon activation.  Its fuse is dangerously short, so you won't want to waste any time."

msgid "A slim card that is used to initialize a STEED, which will then imprint the rider's biometric data and follow them unerringly."
msgstr "A slim card that is used to initialise a STEED, which will then imprint the rider's biometric data and follow them unerringly."

msgid "Crouched and dead still, this armored luxurious robot resembles an ancient knight immersed in deep prayer.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully the robot will identify you as a friendly, and will protect you from nearby foes."
msgstr "Crouched and dead still, this armoured luxurious robot resembles an ancient knight immersed in deep prayer.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully the robot will identify you as a friendly, and will protect you from nearby foes."

msgid "inactive defense robot"
msgid_plural "inactive defense robots"
msgstr[0] "inactive defence robot"
msgstr[1] "inactive defence robots"

msgid "A salvaged skitterbot repurposed to grab onto and immobilize enemies.  Activate this item to deploy the robot."
msgstr "A salvaged skitterbot repurposed to grab onto and immobilise enemies.  Activate this item to deploy the robot."

msgid "A strong, durable metal.  Highly valued for its weight to strength ratio and an excellent upgrade to aluminum for those properties - albeit a lot more expensive due to rarity.  More commonly used in jewelry and medical implants."
msgstr "A strong, durable metal.  Highly valued for its weight to strength ratio and an excellent upgrade to aluminium for those properties - albeit a lot more expensive due to rarity.  More commonly used in jewellery and medical implants."

msgid "An extremely rare mutagen cocktail, it smells of sulfur and glows orange."
msgstr "An extremely rare mutagen cocktail, it smells of sulphur and glows orange."

msgid "Mixed with morphine, this sundew has congealed, and has an immense stimulative and pain-numbing effect.  With sufficient tools, it could be used to create anesthesia."
msgstr "Mixed with morphine, this sundew has congealed, and has an immense stimulative and pain-numbing effect.  With sufficient tools, it could be used to create anaesthesia."

msgid "A medium-sized household refrigerator, converted to utilize vehicle power.  When turned on, food inside will be cooled, extending the time it has before spoiling."
msgstr "A medium-sized household refrigerator, converted to utilise vehicle power.  When turned on, food inside will be cooled, extending the time it has before spoiling."

msgid "This sungel has been mixed with several drugs and yet inherits none of their effects.  Its painkilling effect hasn't changed, but its stimulative properties have been reversed, and it could be used as anesthesia for installation of bionics."
msgstr "This sungel has been mixed with several drugs and yet inherits none of their effects.  Its painkilling effect hasn't changed, but its stimulative properties have been reversed, and it could be used as anaesthesia for installation of bionics."

msgid "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armor of the tripod."
msgstr "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armour of the tripod."

msgid "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armor of the Pathfinder."
msgstr "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armour of the Pathfinder."

msgid "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armor of the Regulator tank."
msgstr "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armour of the Regulator tank."

msgid "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armor of the Seneschal."
msgstr "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armour of the Seneschal."

msgid "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armor of the Likvidator."
msgstr "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armour of the Likvidator."

msgid "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armor of the Udarnik."
msgstr "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armour of the Udarnik."

msgid "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armor of the Brandspojt."
msgstr "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armour of the Brandspojt."

msgid "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armor of the surgical droid."
msgstr "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armour of the surgical droid."

msgid "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armor of the Aegis."
msgstr "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armour of the Aegis."

msgid "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armor of the military robot."
msgstr "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armour of the military robot."

msgid "A compact imaging tool, capable of scanning and visualizing objects hiding behind walls, maintenance panels and all other sort of visual barriers.  While normally used to diagnose faults within industrial machinery, the ability to peer between obstacles grants it obvious surveillance applications.  It can be activated to reveal a small conical area around you."
msgstr "A compact imaging tool, capable of scanning and visualising objects hiding behind walls, maintenance panels and all other sort of visual barriers.  While normally used to diagnose faults within industrial machinery, the ability to peer between obstacles grants it obvious surveillance applications.  It can be activated to reveal a small conical area around you."

msgid "Rivtech's premiere self-heating kitchen appliance, complete with lid, hand-crafted with the power of the atom to reach any temperature in thirty seconds.  As bulky as it is, its plutonium power source means that it can be used to cook an absurd amount of meals without ever worrying about running low on power.  Unsurprisingly, sales weren't particularly good because of the prospect of irradiating your food, but internal shielding ensures that only trace amounts find their way into the center."
msgstr "Rivtech's premiere self-heating kitchen appliance, complete with lid, hand-crafted with the power of the atom to reach any temperature in thirty seconds.  As bulky as it is, its plutonium power source means that it can be used to cook an absurd amount of meals without ever worrying about running low on power.  Unsurprisingly, sales weren't particularly good because of the prospect of irradiating your food, but internal shielding ensures that only trace amounts find their way into the centre."

msgid "A huge, gas-powered saw with a diamond blade.  If it has gasoline, it can be turned on to turn it into a powerful metal cutting tool."
msgstr "A huge, gas-powered saw with a diamond blade.  If it has petrol, it can be turned on to turn it into a powerful metal cutting tool."

msgid "A huge, gas-powered saw with a diamond blade, currently a whirling blur.  It's consuming gasoline, but can be used as a fantastic tool for cutting metal.  You can also use it as a terrifying weapon, if you're into that sort of thing."
msgstr "A huge, gas-powered saw with a diamond blade, currently a whirling blur.  It's consuming petrol, but can be used as a fantastic tool for cutting metal.  You can also use it as a terrifying weapon, if you're into that sort of thing."

msgid "A set of very small tools and encrypted digital keys normally used to repair bionic modules in clinical settings.  They will allow you to disassemble simple bionics, but anything more complex would require even more specialized tools."
msgstr "A set of very small tools and encrypted digital keys normally used to repair bionic modules in clinical settings.  They will allow you to disassemble simple bionics, but anything more complex would require even more specialised tools."

msgid "A modified laptop, now additionally capable of transmitting in the ultra-high frequencies utilized by robots.  Activate it to command robots from afar."
msgstr "A modified laptop, now additionally capable of transmitting in the ultra-high frequencies utilised by robots.  Activate it to command robots from afar."

msgid "Hub 01 created this portable nanotech forge for field teams setting up a basecamp far from population centers.  Once deployed it can be used to craft ultratech marvels that otherwise are too minute for human crafting."
msgstr "Hub 01 created this portable nanotech forge for field teams setting up a basecamp far from population centres.  Once deployed it can be used to craft ultratech marvels that otherwise are too minute for human crafting."

msgid "A military mess kit designed for long-range reconnaissance patrols deployed behind enemy lines.  All of its parts are made from thin sheets of aluminum-superalloy composite and are insulated with ceramic coating.  Relies on a battery-operated hotplate, rather than the smoke-producing chemical-fueled hexamine stove.  Compact, durable and lightweight."
msgstr "A military mess kit designed for long-range reconnaissance patrols deployed behind enemy lines.  All of its parts are made from thin sheets of aluminium-superalloy composite and are insulated with ceramic coating.  Relies on a battery-operated hotplate, rather than the smoke-producing chemical-fuelled hexamine stove.  Compact, durable and lightweight."

msgid "A vehicle-mounted gantry for supporting an exosuit upright during maintenance and repair.  Includes the specialized tools needed for complex repairs and will also charge the suit's power when activated from the vehicle's controls."
msgstr "A vehicle-mounted gantry for supporting an exosuit upright during maintenance and repair.  Includes the specialised tools needed for complex repairs and will also charge the suit's power when activated from the vehicle's controls."

msgid "The CE-4, commonly known as \"The Claw\", is a popular self-defense weapon used by corporate security everywhere.  Made from a cylinder of heat activated memory-alloy, the flick of a switch allows it to morph between a less-lethal bludgeon form and a sharpened, super heated blade.  Currently, it is in its less-lethal configuration, and looks like a sleek side-handle metal baton."
msgstr "The CE-4, commonly known as \"The Claw\", is a popular self-defence weapon used by corporate security everywhere.  Made from a cylinder of heat activated memory-alloy, the flick of a switch allows it to morph between a less-lethal bludgeon form and a sharpened, super heated blade.  Currently, it is in its less-lethal configuration, and looks like a sleek side-handle metal baton."

msgid "The CE-4, commonly known as \"The Claw\", is a popular self-defense weapon used by corporate security everywhere.  Made from a cylinder of heat activated memory-alloy, the flick of a switch allows it to morph between a less-lethal bludgeon form and a sharpened, super heated blade.  Currently, it is in its lethal configuration, and looks like a sleek sword, humming softly as its blade glows from heat."
msgstr "The CE-4, commonly known as \"The Claw\", is a popular self-defence weapon used by corporate security everywhere.  Made from a cylinder of heat activated memory-alloy, the flick of a switch allows it to morph between a less-lethal bludgeon form and a sharpened, super heated blade.  Currently, it is in its lethal configuration, and looks like a sleek sword, humming softly as its blade glows from heat."

msgid "A crossbow constructed of readily available materials, and quickly and cheaply put together.  While it isn't very pretty, it gets the job done, and its drawing mechanism is motorized allowing quick reloading."
msgstr "A crossbow constructed of readily available materials, and quickly and cheaply put together.  While it isn't very pretty, it gets the job done, and its drawing mechanism is motorised allowing quick reloading."

msgid "Standardized 10mm ammunition with a brass jacketed projectile.  For as long as you can remember bullets like these have been used for military, law enforcement, and civilian use."
msgstr "Standardised 10mm ammunition with a brass jacketed projectile.  For as long as you can remember bullets like these have been used for military, law enforcement, and civilian use."

msgid "Standardized 10mm ammunition with a hollow point projectile.  While they have inferior penetration to FMJ rounds, their expansion slightly increases stopping power against unarmed targets and reduces overpenetration."
msgstr "Standardised 10mm ammunition with a hollow point projectile.  While they have inferior penetration to FMJ rounds, their expansion slightly increases stopping power against unarmed targets and reduces overpenetration."

msgid "High precision 10mm microjet darts.  These low velocity rounds can adjust mid-flight to exploit weaknesses in the target's defenses."
msgstr "High precision 10mm microjet darts.  These low velocity rounds can adjust mid-flight to exploit weaknesses in the target's defences."

msgid "A 25mm grenade with a canister shot load, deals devastating damage against moderately armored foes within mid to close range.  Relatively low tech and affordable when compared to other 25mm grenades, these are often fielded by rural militias due to their adequate performance in anti-drone and close quarters combat."
msgstr "A 25mm grenade with a canister shot load, deals devastating damage against moderately armoured foes within mid to close range.  Relatively low tech and affordable when compared to other 25mm grenades, these are often fielded by rural militias due to their adequate performance in anti-drone and close quarters combat."

msgid "Standard issue US Army 25mm rounds, each concealing a finned tungsten-alloy kinetic penetrator within a biodegradable plastic sabot.  Designed to defeat modern personal and light-vehicle armor, these are illegal to own, and thus are seldomly seen outside of military armories."
msgstr "Standard issue US Army 25mm rounds, each concealing a finned tungsten-alloy kinetic penetrator within a biodegradable plastic sabot.  Designed to defeat modern personal and light-vehicle armour, these are illegal to own, and thus are seldomly seen outside of military armories."

msgid "High precision 25mm microjet darts.  These low velocity rounds can adjust mid-flight to exploit weaknesses in the target's defenses."
msgstr "High precision 25mm microjet darts.  These low velocity rounds can adjust mid-flight to exploit weaknesses in the target's defences."

msgid "Pressurized and cryo-cooled rods of solidified hydrogen, used within plasma weapons or portable powerplants."
msgstr "Pressurised and cryo-cooled rods of solidified hydrogen, used within plasma weapons or portable powerplants."

msgid "A synthetic jacket adorned with the logos and colors of some defunct corporation.  Impermeable, but not very warm."
msgstr "A synthetic jacket adorned with the logos and colours of some defunct corporation.  Impermeable, but not very warm."

msgid "A lightweight cloth jumpsuit adorned with the faded corporate regalia of some freight hauling association or another.  This one is a standard design favored by spacers, with ample, easy access pockets."
msgstr "A lightweight cloth jumpsuit adorned with the faded corporate regalia of some freight hauling association or another.  This one is a standard design favoured by spacers, with ample, easy access pockets."

msgid "A lightweight steel-reinforced tool carrier.  Keeps your tools safe and about in zero-g, Mars, the bottom of the Pacific, or other generally inhospitable environments.  It has several deep pockets, and two mounting points for pressurized canisters or other large magazines."
msgstr "A lightweight steel-reinforced tool carrier.  Keeps your tools safe and about in zero-g, Mars, the bottom of the Pacific, or other generally inhospitable environments.  It has several deep pockets, and two mounting points for pressurised canisters or other large magazines."

msgid "The rocket pack fuel tank.  Holds up to 10 liters of pressurized fuel."
msgstr "The rocket pack fuel tank.  Holds up to 10 litres of pressurised fuel."

msgid "IPAV armor"
msgid_plural "IPAV armors"
msgstr[0] "IPAV armour"
msgstr[1] "IPAV armours"

msgid "Multipurpose military armor for the torso and upper arms, intended to protect against a wide variety of ballistic or direct energy attacks.  Made from a single piece of ablative carbide that keeps it relatively lightweight and completely disposable."
msgstr "Multipurpose military armour for the torso and upper arms, intended to protect against a wide variety of ballistic or direct energy attacks.  Made from a single piece of ablative carbide that keeps it relatively lightweight and completely disposable."

msgid "IPAV armor XL"
msgid_plural "IPAV armor XLs"
msgstr[0] "IPAV armour XL"
msgstr[1] "IPAV armour XLs"

msgid "Multipurpose military armor for the torso and upper arms, intended to protect against a wide variety of ballistic or direct energy attacks.  Made from a single piece of ablative carbide that keeps it relatively lightweight and completely disposable.  Made to fit mutants, the heavily augmented, or similarly sized individuals."
msgstr "Multipurpose military armour for the torso and upper arms, intended to protect against a wide variety of ballistic or direct energy attacks.  Made from a single piece of ablative carbide that keeps it relatively lightweight and completely disposable.  Made to fit mutants, the heavily augmented, or similarly sized individuals."

msgid "A military poncho made from heat dissipating ablative fibers.  It is designed to be worn over armor and provide additional protection against direct energy attacks.  Its ablative properties make it disposable and relatively fragile, its not rated to survive more than a single combat engagement."
msgstr "A military poncho made from heat dissipating ablative fibres.  It is designed to be worn over armour and provide additional protection against direct energy attacks.  Its ablative properties make it disposable and relatively fragile, its not rated to survive more than a single combat engagement."

msgid "A sturdy Nomex jumpsuit, normally worn by armed forces during transit or beneath combat armor while in the field."
msgstr "A sturdy Nomex jumpsuit, normally worn by armed forces during transit or beneath combat armour while in the field."

msgid "The high quality helmet of a Space Time Inc Magellan exosuit, built for polar research stations and high-altitude work.  In addition to its life support functionality, it features a minor augmented reality UI overlay and a retractable gold-plated visor to protect against glare and UV light.  Although not armored as such, it's strong enough to handle minor blunt impacts."
msgstr "The high quality helmet of a Space Time Inc Magellan exosuit, built for polar research stations and high-altitude work.  In addition to its life support functionality, it features a minor augmented reality UI overlay and a retractable gold-plated visor to protect against glare and UV light.  Although not armoured as such, it's strong enough to handle minor blunt impacts."

msgid "A sturdy suit meant to protect against the freezing cold, made from a pair of jumpsuits that have been woven around a heavy insulation layer and crisscrossed with the thermal tubing of a heat regulation unit.  The thick insulation allows the suit to function with unrivaled efficiency, but also makes all types of movement difficult."
msgstr "A sturdy suit meant to protect against the freezing cold, made from a pair of jumpsuits that have been woven around a heavy insulation layer and crisscrossed with the thermal tubing of a heat regulation unit.  The thick insulation allows the suit to function with unrivalled efficiency, but also makes all types of movement difficult."

msgid "A sleek black undersuit criss-crossed with the tubing of a heat regulation unit.  Insulation is kept at a minimum to allow for combat mobility, and the suit is quite power hungry as a result.  Despite the name, it's minimally protective and designed to be worn under a set of armor."
msgstr "A sleek black undersuit criss-crossed with the tubing of a heat regulation unit.  Insulation is kept at a minimum to allow for combat mobility, and the suit is quite power hungry as a result.  Despite the name, it's minimally protective and designed to be worn under a set of armour."

msgid "This is a mounting point for torso armor."
msgstr "This is a mounting point for torso armour."

msgid "This is a mounting point for arm armor."
msgstr "This is a mounting point for arm armour."

msgid "This is a mounting point for leg armor."
msgstr "This is a mounting point for leg armour."

msgid "\"Part One: The Underlayer.  Underlayer are specialized clothing meant to interface with the exosuit frame.  While not essential, they do minimize the risk of clothing getting caught on the frame.  Some underlayers offer additional protection to the pilot, ranging from ballistic armor to fully sealed suits designed for operating underwater or outside a breathable atmosphere.\""
msgstr "\"Part One: The Underlayer.  Underlayer are specialised clothing meant to interface with the exosuit frame.  While not essential, they do minimise the risk of clothing getting caught on the frame.  Some underlayers offer additional protection to the pilot, ranging from ballistic armour to fully sealed suits designed for operating underwater or outside a breathable atmosphere.\""

msgid "This is a tank for fuel.  Holds up to 1 liter."
msgstr "This is a tank for fuel.  Holds up to 1 litre."

msgid "exosuit gasoline ICE power supply"
msgid_plural "exosuit gasoline ICE power supplies"
msgstr[0] "exosuit petrol ICE power supply"
msgstr[1] "exosuit petrol ICE power supplies"

msgid "Designed to attach to an exosuit's back, this is an internal combustion engine generator with an integrated UPS, fueled by gasoline."
msgstr "Designed to attach to an exosuit's back, this is an internal combustion engine generator with an integrated UPS, fuelled by petrol."

msgid "This is a tank for gasoline.  Holds up to 10 liters."
msgstr "This is a tank for petrol.  Holds up to 10 litres."

msgid "This is a tank for fuel.  Holds up to 5 liters."
msgstr "This is a tank for fuel.  Holds up to 5 litres."

msgid "This is a prototype Compact Advanced Sterling Radioisotope Generator, intended to power an exosuit indefinitely.  The layered shielding saves space but is quite heavy, and while labeled 'Compact', this only just fits on the exosuit frame.  Due to the complexities of manufacturing, it cannot be repaired, only replaced."
msgstr "This is a prototype Compact Advanced Sterling Radioisotope Generator, intended to power an exosuit indefinitely.  The layered shielding saves space but is quite heavy, and while labelled 'Compact', this only just fits on the exosuit frame.  Due to the complexities of manufacturing, it cannot be repaired, only replaced."

msgid "A compact imaging tool, capable of scanning and visualizing objects hiding behind walls, maintenance panels and all other sort of visual barriers.  While normally used to diagnose faults within industrial machinery, the ability to peer between obstacles grants it obvious surveillance applications.  It can be mounted to an exosuit helmet.  It can be activated to reveal a small conical area around you."
msgstr "A compact imaging tool, capable of scanning and visualising objects hiding behind walls, maintenance panels and all other sort of visual barriers.  While normally used to diagnose faults within industrial machinery, the ability to peer between obstacles grants it obvious surveillance applications.  It can be mounted to an exosuit helmet.  It can be activated to reveal a small conical area around you."

msgid "exosuit dynamic maneuvering unit"
msgid_plural "exosuit dynamic maneuvering units"
msgstr[0] "exosuit dynamic manoeuvring unit"
msgstr[1] "exosuit dynamic manoeuvring units"

msgid "This is the maneuvering unit's fuel tank.  Holds up to 10 liters of pressurized fuel."
msgstr "This is the manoeuvring unit's fuel tank.  Holds up to 10 litres of pressurised fuel."

msgid "A 'less-lethal' weapon mounted on the shoulder of an exosuit.  Causes a painful burning sensation as water molecules are turned to high temperature vapor.  Infamous for its use by federal forces to break up protests, its effectiveness can be hard to predict due to variables like the moisture in the air and protective layers on the target."
msgstr "A 'less-lethal' weapon mounted on the shoulder of an exosuit.  Causes a painful burning sensation as water molecules are turned to high temperature vapour.  Infamous for its use by federal forces to break up protests, its effectiveness can be hard to predict due to variables like the moisture in the air and protective layers on the target."

msgid "An extremely dangerous weapon only deployed for heavy combat, this is mounted on the shoulder of an exosuit.  A laser creates a channel of ionized plasma which acts as a conduit for the follow-up massive energy charge.  The result is a powerful explosion that can impact a large area.  Requires significant energy reserves, draining a standard power cartridge per shot."
msgstr "An extremely dangerous weapon only deployed for heavy combat, this is mounted on the shoulder of an exosuit.  A laser creates a channel of ionised plasma which acts as a conduit for the follow-up massive energy charge.  The result is a powerful explosion that can impact a large area.  Requires significant energy reserves, draining a standard power cartridge per shot."

msgid "a hiss of water vaporizing"
msgstr "a hiss of water vaporising"

msgid "Creates a conductive channel from the exosuit to the target by ionizing air molecules using a high-powered laser beam, then sends a powerful half million volt charge down the channel."
msgstr "Creates a conductive channel from the exosuit to the target by ionising air molecules using a high-powered laser beam, then sends a powerful half million volt charge down the channel."

msgid "A form-fitting suit meant to be worn by the exosuit pilot.  Although not a requirement for the operation of an exosuit, it features haptic feedback systems that offer improved performance and comfort while doing so.  The suit is not designed for use outside of armor.  This standard model uses a scale mail of overlapping plastic disks for incidental protection."
msgstr "A form-fitting suit meant to be worn by the exosuit pilot.  Although not a requirement for the operation of an exosuit, it features haptic feedback systems that offer improved performance and comfort while doing so.  The suit is not designed for use outside of armour.  This standard model uses a scale mail of overlapping plastic disks for incidental protection."

msgid "A form-fitting suit meant to be worn by the exosuit pilot.  Although not a requirement for the operation of an exosuit, it features haptic feedback systems that offer improved performance and comfort while doing so.  The suit is not designed for use outside of armor.  This model offers tough kevlar to protect from spalling."
msgstr "A form-fitting suit meant to be worn by the exosuit pilot.  Although not a requirement for the operation of an exosuit, it features haptic feedback systems that offer improved performance and comfort while doing so.  The suit is not designed for use outside of armour.  This model offers tough kevlar to protect from spalling."

msgid "The organ no longer leaks out a strange liquid, and has faded to a light blue color.  It looks chewy, and has an unpleasant smell."
msgstr "The organ no longer leaks out a strange liquid, and has faded to a light blue colour.  It looks chewy, and has an unpleasant smell."

msgid "Fried and scrambled, this doesn't look the most appetizing, but it's edible (you hope)."
msgstr "Fried and scrambled, this doesn't look the most appetising, but it's edible (you hope)."

msgid "Mealgrubs are a staple aquacultural product, treasured for their ability to process nearly any organic substance into safe for consumption animal protein.  As the result of very heavy-handed gene-modding these are proprietary organisms, and strictly speaking, it's illegal to grow them without a license."
msgstr "Mealgrubs are a staple aquacultural product, treasured for their ability to process nearly any organic substance into safe for consumption animal protein.  As the result of very heavy-handed gene-modding these are proprietary organisms, and strictly speaking, it's illegal to grow them without a licence."

msgid "Rings of caramelized yellow colorant, tasting not exactly like apple."
msgstr "Rings of caramelised yellow colourant, tasting not exactly like apple."

msgid "Smooth crackers colored grayish-green.  Used to be perfectly edible seaweed, or so the wrapper claims."
msgstr "Smooth crackers coloured greyish-green.  Used to be perfectly edible seaweed, or so the wrapper claims."

msgid "soup, flavor 27"
msgid_plural "soup, flavor 27"
msgstr[0] "soup, flavour 27"
msgstr[1] "soup, flavour 27"

msgid "Yellow chunks float on creamy liquid, like flotsam on a filthy summer pond.  Branding implies at least 26 other flavors, but you have neither seen or heard about any of them."
msgstr "Yellow chunks float on creamy liquid, like flotsam on a filthy summer pond.  Branding implies at least 26 other flavours, but you have neither seen or heard about any of them."

msgid "A foil-sealed pack of compressed emergency food bars, the kind Coast Guard regulations require in every lifeboat and life raft on a commercial vessel.  This particular pack should provide around a day's worth of nutrition.  Required by regulation but rarely ever used, the design of these \"meals\" prioritizes a long shelf life and a very low bulk-cost.  Which lends them their disgusting taste of greased sawdust."
msgstr "A foil-sealed pack of compressed emergency food bars, the kind Coast Guard regulations require in every lifeboat and life raft on a commercial vessel.  This particular pack should provide around a day's worth of nutrition.  Required by regulation but rarely ever used, the design of these \"meals\" prioritises a long shelf life and a very low bulk-cost.  Which lends them their disgusting taste of greased sawdust."

msgid "A chalk white blood analogue for emergency medical use.  Far more efficient at oxygenation than natural blood, it can also be used as a general performance enhancer.  Once injected, it will be metabolized or otherwise expunged from the the body in around 8 hours."
msgstr "A chalk white blood analogue for emergency medical use.  Far more efficient at oxygenation than natural blood, it can also be used as a general performance enhancer.  Once injected, it will be metabolised or otherwise expunged from the the body in around 8 hours."

msgid "artificial muscle fibers"
msgid_plural "artificial muscle fibers"
msgstr[0] "artificial muscle fibres"
msgstr[1] "artificial muscle fibres"

msgid "Lab-grown or bioprinted muscle fibers; much denser and with higher performance ratios than baseline human muscles."
msgstr "Lab-grown or bioprinted muscle fibres; much denser and with higher performance ratios than baseline human muscles."

msgid "Materials capable of taking environmental chemicals and utilizing them for self-repair; be careful you don't make gray goo."
msgstr "Materials capable of taking environmental chemicals and utilising them for self-repair; be careful you don't make grey goo."

msgid "An intricately spun and carefully engineered sheet of iridescent fibers."
msgstr "An intricately spun and carefully engineered sheet of iridescent fibres."

msgid "Capable of withstanding extreme temperature gradients, fulleroclathrate supercritical coolants are the lifeblood of high-energy systems, from cutting-edge aerospace engines to experimental small arms tech.  Liquid at room conditions, it has to be used in a pressurized closed-loop system at 450 psi or greater."
msgstr "Capable of withstanding extreme temperature gradients, fulleroclathrate supercritical coolants are the lifeblood of high-energy systems, from cutting-edge aerospace engines to experimental small arms tech.  Liquid at room conditions, it has to be used in a pressurised closed-loop system at 450 psi or greater."

msgid "Manufactured by Gibson Armory, the S86 is a light-weight grenade launcher designed to take care of moderately armored opponents.  While the S86 firepower is nothing to truly gawk at, it still packs quite a punch both for the target and user and is usually mounted as it is impossible to fire with average strength."
msgstr "Manufactured by Gibson Armory, the S86 is a light-weight grenade launcher designed to take care of moderately armoured opponents.  While the S86 firepower is nothing to truly gawk at, it still packs quite a punch both for the target and user and is usually mounted as it is impossible to fire with average strength."

msgid "A powerful tri-barreled laser weapon, still mounted to the robotic hand of the Northrop drone it originally belonged to.  Can still be fired when connected to an UPS."
msgstr "A powerful tri-barrelled laser weapon, still mounted to the robotic hand of the Northrop drone it originally belonged to.  Can still be fired when connected to an UPS."

msgid "This is an x-ray laser stripped from a TX-5LR Cerberus laser turret that has been modified to use UPS power for firing.  Single shot then requires reloading.  Nicknamed the 'Tin Can Killer' for its ability to destroy power armor."
msgstr "This is an x-ray laser stripped from a TX-5LR Cerberus laser turret that has been modified to use UPS power for firing.  Single shot then requires reloading.  Nicknamed the 'Tin Can Killer' for its ability to destroy power armour."

msgid "A common pulse-laser pistol cleared for civilian use.  Recoilless, energy-efficient, and easy to use, the av-22 is often carried as a defense weapon by those who lack the practice required to effectively use ballistic weaponry.  Due to its low power, it must be fired in sequence mode to stand a chance against hardened foes."
msgstr "A common pulse-laser pistol cleared for civilian use.  Recoilless, energy-efficient, and easy to use, the av-22 is often carried as a defence weapon by those who lack the practice required to effectively use ballistic weaponry.  Due to its low power, it must be fired in sequence mode to stand a chance against hardened foes."

msgid "A silver, elegantly-wrought laser pistol that fires armor-piercing bolts of golden light.  XEDRA recovered a handful of these from dimensional anomalies; no one knows who built them, and none have been reproduced.  It is as precious as it is deadly."
msgstr "A silver, elegantly-wrought laser pistol that fires armour-piercing bolts of golden light.  XEDRA recovered a handful of these from dimensional anomalies; no one knows who built them, and none have been reproduced.  It is as precious as it is deadly."

msgid "Crown jewel of Shikishma armories, and possible product of unsanctioned data scavenging, the A-82 is the undisputed market leader when it comes to man portable laser weaponry.  Sustained fire is likely to cause secondary explosions as target layers are vaporized."
msgstr "Crown jewel of Shikishma armories, and possible product of unsanctioned data scavenging, the A-82 is the undisputed market leader when it comes to man portable laser weaponry.  Sustained fire is likely to cause secondary explosions as target layers are vaporised."

msgid "A heavy plasma railgun that easily defeats most forms of conventional armor and flash-incinerates anything  behind it.  Its large size and liability to overheat make it unsuitable for infantry use, but it is a common sight on military vehicles and in the hands of power-armored troops, especially when heavy armor is expected."
msgstr "A heavy plasma railgun that easily defeats most forms of conventional armour and flash-incinerates anything  behind it.  Its large size and liability to overheat make it unsuitable for infantry use, but it is a common sight on military vehicles and in the hands of power-armoured troops, especially when heavy armour is expected."

msgid "The standard issue combat shotgun of Marine Corps and military police units.  Shot shells have poor performance against modern combat armor, so the M2101 is more often used during policing and peacekeeping operations."
msgstr "The standard issue combat shotgun of Marine Corps and military police units.  Shot shells have poor performance against modern combat armour, so the M2101 is more often used during policing and peacekeeping operations."

msgid "Northrop Armories' premier electrolaser personal defense weapon.  The W3100 Volt adjustable power settings make it adaptable to most conflict situations, lethal or otherwise, and make it a favorite among well-off security forces and law enforcement corps."
msgstr "Northrop Armories' premier electrolaser personal defence weapon.  The W3100 Volt adjustable power settings make it adaptable to most conflict situations, lethal or otherwise, and make it a favourite among well-off security forces and law enforcement corps."

msgid "A standardized 30-round magazine compatible with most US Army issue rifles."
msgstr "A standardised 30-round magazine compatible with most US Army issue rifles."

msgid "A standardized 100-round double drum magazine compatible with most US Army issue rifles."
msgstr "A standardised 100-round double drum magazine compatible with most US Army issue rifles."

msgid "A conical device salvaged from an alien artifact.  Grooves etched on its circular face slowly pulse with purple light."
msgstr "A conical device salvaged from an alien artefact.  Grooves etched on its circular face slowly pulse with purple light."

msgid "A thin strip of transuranic metal, glowing a somber blue from within its shielded glass prison.  XEDRA recovered these from dimensional anomalies; it could be used to momentarily power all sorts of anomalous technology."
msgstr "A thin strip of transuranic metal, glowing a sombre blue from within its shielded glass prison.  XEDRA recovered these from dimensional anomalies; it could be used to momentarily power all sorts of anomalous technology."

msgid "pressurized foam tank"
msgid_plural "pressurized foam tanks"
msgstr[0] "pressurised foam tank"
msgstr[1] "pressurised foam tanks"

msgid "A pressurized 5L canister designed to feed an industrial foam gun."
msgstr "A pressurised 5L canister designed to feed an industrial foam gun."

msgid "A tiny canister that can safely store up to 4 grams of solid hydrogen in a cryo-pressurized state."
msgstr "A tiny canister that can safely store up to 4 grams of solid hydrogen in a cryo-pressurised state."

msgid "A reinforced canister that can safely store up to 20 grams of solid hydrogen in a cryo-pressurized state."
msgstr "A reinforced canister that can safely store up to 20 grams of solid hydrogen in a cryo-pressurised state."

msgid "A yellow and red canister that can safely store up to 40 grams of solid hydrogen in a cryo-pressurized state.  A complex nozzle with integrated digital failsafes make it incompatible with military railguns."
msgstr "A yellow and red canister that can safely store up to 40 grams of solid hydrogen in a cryo-pressurised state.  A complex nozzle with integrated digital failsafes make it incompatible with military railguns."

msgid "A near undetectable spatial distortion field centered around a free floating golden mote.  Examining it from up close would let you encode it for use with a translocation device."
msgstr "A near undetectable spatial distortion field centred around a free floating golden mote.  Examining it from up close would let you encode it for use with a translocation device."

msgid "Vandalized remains of a military satellite communications cluster.  Wires and connectors spill out from a torn side panel, revealing the mangled carcass of a decades-old beast.  Although stripped of its core components, careful searching may reveal useful electronics for scavengers like you."
msgstr "Vandalised remains of a military satellite communications cluster.  Wires and connectors spill out from a torn side panel, revealing the mangled carcass of a decades-old beast.  Although stripped of its core components, careful searching may reveal useful electronics for scavengers like you."

msgid "A miniature forest of metallic fins and sparkling panels, this is a dedicated heat dissipation module for a military satellite communications cluster.  It is installed outside to utilize the frigid air for maximum cooling."
msgstr "A miniature forest of metallic fins and sparkling panels, this is a dedicated heat dissipation module for a military satellite communications cluster.  It is installed outside to utilise the frigid air for maximum cooling."

msgid "Mounted on a self-stabilizing gimbal, this high-tech sphere is full of various sensors and scanners that automatically map out the surrounding terrain with an amazing accuracy."
msgstr "Mounted on a self-stabilising gimbal, this high-tech sphere is full of various sensors and scanners that automatically map out the surrounding terrain with an amazing accuracy."

msgid "A gantry for supporting an exosuit upright during maintenance and repair.  Includes the specialized tools needed for complex repairs and will also charge the suit's power when active.  This one is not currently functioning."
msgstr "A gantry for supporting an exosuit upright during maintenance and repair.  Includes the specialised tools needed for complex repairs and will also charge the suit's power when active.  This one is not currently functioning."

msgid "A specialized freezer capable of maintaining temperatures of -80 Celsius, and is often used only for the preservation of delicate scientific samples."
msgstr "A specialised freezer capable of maintaining temperatures of -80 Celsius, and is often used only for the preservation of delicate scientific samples."

msgid "This is a centrifuge, a liquid separating device with an automated analyzer unit.  For some reason, this one has an attached battery pack.  It could be used to analyze a medical fluid sample, such as blood, if a test tube was placed in it."
msgstr "This is a centrifuge, a liquid separating device with an automated analyser unit.  For some reason, this one has an attached battery pack.  It could be used to analyse a medical fluid sample, such as blood, if a test tube was placed in it."

msgid "Armory Entrance"
msgstr "Armoury Entrance"

msgid "fossilized conifer"
msgstr "fossilised conifer"

msgid "infested fossilized conifer"
msgstr "infested fossilised conifer"

msgid "A long dead tree standing on spindly legs similar to a Cypress which tapers into a point until spreading out in a hollow dodecahedron.  The trunk seems to be splitting as tendrils of mold dig into it, clinging onto the tree like a frame."
msgstr "A long dead tree standing on spindly legs similar to a Cypress which tapers into a point until spreading out in a hollow dodecahedron.  The trunk seems to be splitting as tendrils of mould dig into it, clinging onto the tree like a frame."

msgid "A mound of moss, with large colorful stems protruding out of it."
msgstr "A mound of moss, with large colourful stems protruding out of it."

msgid "On the ground here lay several colorless coral reefs, the black veins are noticeably more engorged as they breathe."
msgstr "On the ground here lay several colourless coral reefs, the black veins are noticeably more engorged as they breathe."

msgid "Many colorful species of ice-lichen, thriving above an uncharacteristically fertile patch of ice.  Either a hardy arctic strain, or something that crept through a dimensional anomaly."
msgstr "Many colourful species of ice-lichen, thriving above an uncharacteristically fertile patch of ice.  Either a hardy arctic strain, or something that crept through a dimensional anomaly."

msgid "Familiar, yet unfamiliar.  Lichens and moss cling to rocks and lifeless dirt here, providing a squishy but colorful grass."
msgstr "Familiar, yet unfamiliar.  Lichens and moss cling to rocks and lifeless dirt here, providing a squishy but colourful grass."

msgid "A relatively flat area of gray stone, warm to the touch."
msgstr "A relatively flat area of grey stone, warm to the touch."

msgid "A solid cloud-like structure, formed when water vapor escapes from the crust and meets the freezing air.  It is still emitting some gases."
msgstr "A solid cloud-like structure, formed when water vapour escapes from the crust and meets the freezing air.  It is still emitting some gases."

msgid "A solid cloud-like structure, formed when water vapor escapes from the crust and meets the freezing air."
msgstr "A solid cloud-like structure, formed when water vapour escapes from the crust and meets the freezing air."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless Cyber Mastiff puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog.  CBMs are implanted but immature in growth with the puppy."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless Cyber Mastiff puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog.  CBMs are implanted but immature in growth with the puppy."

msgid "defense robot"
msgid_plural "defense robots"
msgstr[0] "defence robot"
msgstr[1] "defence robots"

msgid "An automated defense robot still active due to its internal power source.  This one is armed with an electric prod and an integrated 9mm firearm."
msgstr "An automated defence robot still active due to its internal power source.  This one is armed with an electric prod and an integrated 9mm firearm."

msgid "A rabbit genetically modified by Shady Hills Corporation to thrive on lichen.  Its fur is rust colored and its ears are shortened to preserve warmth."
msgstr "A rabbit genetically modified by Shady Hills Corporation to thrive on lichen.  Its fur is rust coloured and its ears are shortened to preserve warmth."

msgid "Sky blue irises with gray floating flecks cover the entirety of the eye.  Flurries seem to emanate from around them."
msgstr "Sky blue irises with grey floating flecks cover the entirety of the eye.  Flurries seem to emanate from around them."

msgid "The mi-go have set up some defenses here.  This horrifying techno-organic amalgamation appears to use brains in jars as their operating system.  On the plus side it looks like an easy headshot."
msgstr "The mi-go have set up some defences here.  This horrifying techno-organic amalgamation appears to use brains in jars as their operating system.  On the plus side it looks like an easy headshot."

msgid "An old industrial robot line first made by Rivtech, and still in use thanks to its easily obtained fabrication schematics.  Built to operate within nuclear reactors and waste repositories, the Likvidator is assembled around an armored bipedal chassis that mounts several heavy manipulator arms.  Legend claims it was originally designed after a Cold War nuclear disaster."
msgstr "An old industrial robot line first made by Rivtech, and still in use thanks to its easily obtained fabrication schematics.  Built to operate within nuclear reactors and waste repositories, the Likvidator is assembled around an armoured bipedal chassis that mounts several heavy manipulator arms.  Legend claims it was originally designed after a Cold War nuclear disaster."

msgid ""
"A highly customizable light industrial and agricultural robot.  Its original design dates back to the Cold War Soviet Union; the aptly named Udarnik \"shock worker\" helped trigger the automation revolution, and with subsequent adaptations, became the workhorse of farms and building sites the world over.  Although outdated by modern standards, the Udarnik is still commonly seen in rural areas - thanks to its easily obtainable fabrication schematics.\n"
"\n"
"This particular version is equipped with a mix of construction and heavy cargo-handling tools and was likely involved in the construction of nearby buildings."
msgstr ""
"A highly customisable light industrial and agricultural robot.  Its original design dates back to the Cold War Soviet Union; the aptly named Udarnik \"shock worker\" helped trigger the automation revolution, and with subsequent adaptations, became the workhorse of farms and building sites the world over.  Although outdated by modern standards, the Udarnik is still commonly seen in rural areas - thanks to its easily obtainable fabrication schematics.\n"
"\n"
"This particular version is equipped with a mix of construction and heavy cargo-handling tools and was likely involved in the construction of nearby buildings."

msgid "A free roaming medical robot capable of administering powerful anesthetics and performing complex surgical operations, usually in that order.  Faulty bio-diagnostic programs resulted in numerous lawsuits before the Cataclysm."
msgstr "A free roaming medical robot capable of administering powerful anaesthetics and performing complex surgical operations, usually in that order.  Faulty bio-diagnostic programs resulted in numerous lawsuits before the Cataclysm."

msgid "A salvaged skitterbot repurposed to grab onto and immobilize enemies.  It's meant to work in a pack."
msgstr "A salvaged skitterbot repurposed to grab onto and immobilise enemies.  It's meant to work in a pack."

msgid "The Hashashiyyin is unorthodox in its design as a military humaniform.  While it keeps the strength of most Northrop humaniforms, it also prioritizes stealth.  It comes equipped with an integrated 5x50mm flechette gun."
msgstr "The Hashashiyyin is unorthodox in its design as a military humaniform.  While it keeps the strength of most Northrop humaniforms, it also prioritises stealth.  It comes equipped with an integrated 5x50mm flechette gun."

msgid "An autonomous anti-armor weapons platform, mounting a 5kg plasma railgun over an insectoid chassis.  The Irradiant designation excels at ambush and midrange combat, where it can leverage its superior agility and reduced sensor profile to successfully engage technologically advanced foes."
msgstr "An autonomous anti-armour weapons platform, mounting a 5kg plasma railgun over an insectoid chassis.  The Irradiant designation excels at ambush and midrange combat, where it can leverage its superior agility and reduced sensor profile to successfully engage technologically advanced foes."

msgid "Found on ranches and backcountry worksites everywhere, the Boston Dynamics STEED (Surface Traversing Equine Emulating Drone) is an incredibly rugged quadrupedal machine based on horses and mules.  Capable of crossing the roughest terrain, powered by a compact atomic reactor, generous storage capacity, light armor, and a lifetime warranty, the STEED was a priceless tool for prospectors and homesteaders.  This version has been ruggedized against extreme cold, but does not keep you warm while riding."
msgstr "Found on ranches and backcountry worksites everywhere, the Boston Dynamics STEED (Surface Traversing Equine Emulating Drone) is an incredibly rugged quadrupedal machine based on horses and mules.  Capable of crossing the roughest terrain, powered by a compact atomic reactor, generous storage capacity, light armour, and a lifetime warranty, the STEED was a priceless tool for prospectors and homesteaders.  This version has been ruggedised against extreme cold, but does not keep you warm while riding."

msgid "An alien that appears to have evolved for survival in the depths.  Its tubular gray body bears numerous sets of paired appendages with clawed protrusions, and a pair of thick muscular fins.  You see glimpses of its shape, shifting in and out of the water."
msgstr "An alien that appears to have evolved for survival in the depths.  Its tubular grey body bears numerous sets of paired appendages with clawed protrusions, and a pair of thick muscular fins.  You see glimpses of its shape, shifting in and out of the water."

msgid "An alien that appears to have evolved for survival in the depths.  Its tubular gray body bears numerous sets of paired appendages with clawed protrusions, and a pair of thick muscular fins.  You see glimpses of its shape, shifting in and out of the water.  It is carrying a conical object that hums with an odd keening sound."
msgstr "An alien that appears to have evolved for survival in the depths.  Its tubular grey body bears numerous sets of paired appendages with clawed protrusions, and a pair of thick muscular fins.  You see glimpses of its shape, shifting in and out of the water.  It is carrying a conical object that hums with an odd keening sound."

msgid "The towering corpse of a Killophant, a product of Shady Hills Corporation's mutagen program, risen as one of the undead.  It still wears its assault grade armor."
msgstr "The towering corpse of a Killophant, a product of Shady Hills Corporation's mutagen program, risen as one of the undead.  It still wears its assault grade armour."

msgid "A human stands here, towering around 2 meters high.  Its flesh is frozen solid, colored black and blue from frostbite.  It constantly scratches at its flesh with its claw-like hands, surveying the land with frozen and foggy eyes."
msgstr "A human stands here, towering around 2 metres high.  Its flesh is frozen solid, coloured black and blue from frostbite.  It constantly scratches at its flesh with its claw-like hands, surveying the land with frozen and foggy eyes."

msgid "A human stands here, its body bulging and ripped as the tissue is torn, showing bluish muscle, and gray bones.  Ice crystals jut out of its visible wounds as it wanders."
msgstr "A human stands here, its body bulging and ripped as the tissue is torn, showing bluish muscle, and grey bones.  Ice crystals jut out of its visible wounds as it wanders."

msgid "A human stands here, several rust-colored limbs jutting out of its back, the limbs moving around and grabbing at the air while the person looks blankly around…"
msgstr "A human stands here, several rust-coloured limbs jutting out of its back, the limbs moving around and grabbing at the air while the person looks blankly around…"

msgid "You have crossed the threshold of Shady Hills Corporation's Killophant program, a mutagen line designed to produce the ultimate shock troop.  Your body is massive, armored and tireless; crush the foe."
msgstr "You have crossed the threshold of Shady Hills Corporation's Killophant program, a mutagen line designed to produce the ultimate shock troop.  Your body is massive, armoured and tireless; crush the foe."

msgid "Mi-go acclimatization"
msgstr "Mi-go acclimatisation"

msgid "Your skin has thickened and toughened further, acting as natural armor.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr "Your skin has thickened and toughened further, acting as natural armour.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."

msgid "Your skin has thick diamond shaped enamel scutes that both armor your body and allow you to move more smoothly in water.  While difficult to penetrate, it also limits your flexibility.  Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "Your skin has thick diamond shaped enamel scutes that both armour your body and allow you to move more smoothly in water.  While difficult to penetrate, it also limits your flexibility.  Greatly reduces wet effects."

msgid "Muscle Fiber"
msgstr "Muscle Fibre"

msgid "You have a sinister aspect to your demeanor, no longer part of this world.  You feel no sorrow at the deaths of humans and your brain now processes combat skills more efficiently as you mentally dissect your opponents."
msgstr "You have a sinister aspect to your demeanour, no longer part of this world.  You feel no sorrow at the deaths of humans and your brain now processes combat skills more efficiently as you mentally dissect your opponents."

msgid "Your feet have grown massive and ready to support huge weight.  This allows kicking attacks to do much more damage, provides natural armor, and removes the need to wear shoes; however, you cannot wear normal size shoes.  Reduces wet effects."
msgstr "Your feet have grown massive and ready to support huge weight.  This allows kicking attacks to do much more damage, provides natural armour, and removes the need to wear shoes; however, you cannot wear normal size shoes.  Reduces wet effects."

msgid "Terrible Odor"
msgstr "Terrible Odour"

msgid "I hope you like it, it's one of my favorite things in the world, actually a lot of them all blended together.  It should feel really good.  Or really bad, I guess I don't know much about your body chemistry.  You're still alive, that's a really good sign!"
msgstr "I hope you like it, it's one of my favourite things in the world, actually a lot of them all blended together.  It should feel really good.  Or really bad, I guess I don't know much about your body chemistry.  You're still alive, that's a really good sign!"

msgid "Please be careful cutting that heart out.  If you ruin it I don't know about another good one nearby.  Maybe practice on some friends and neighbors first, you really want to be sure and get it right.  If you break Billy's heart I can use a heart from another of whatever Billy is, but I can't use regular hearts, and I don't know where to find more Billy types."
msgstr "Please be careful cutting that heart out.  If you ruin it I don't know about another good one nearby.  Maybe practice on some friends and neighbours first, you really want to be sure and get it right.  If you break Billy's heart I can use a heart from another of whatever Billy is, but I can't use regular hearts, and I don't know where to find more Billy types."

msgid "What level of hell is this?  I spent weeks in a sulfurous hell being tortured."
msgstr "What level of hell is this?  I spent weeks in a sulphurous hell being tortured."

msgid "Things have been getting weird for the last couple of years.  Then we started hearing rumors of strange lights in the sky at night."
msgstr "Things have been getting weird for the last couple of years.  Then we started hearing rumours of strange lights in the sky at night."

msgid "One night I heard my neighbor calling for me to come help him.  I went outside wondering what he could possibly need my help with in the middle of the night."
msgstr "One night I heard my neighbour calling for me to come help him.  I went outside wondering what he could possibly need my help with in the middle of the night."

msgid "Some kind of hideous alien was standing over my neighbors disemboweled corpse.  It looked at me and said 'You're a great neighbor' then everything faded to black.  I feel like everything in my body fits differently now."
msgstr "Some kind of hideous alien was standing over my neighbours disembowelled corpse.  It looked at me and said 'You're a great neighbour' then everything faded to black.  I feel like everything in my body fits differently now."

