msgid "Thoroughly poring over the map, you memorize the location."
msgstr "Thoroughly poring over the map, you memorise the location."

msgid "A resinous capsule filled with what looks like congealed blood, mixed with stabilizing compounds.  Mimics the effects of purifier, but requires a syringe to use."
msgstr "A resinous capsule filled with what looks like congealed blood, mixed with stabilising compounds.  Mimics the effects of purifier, but requires a syringe to use."

msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "'The Immortal', designed to be a one-man army.  Your body is a lethal weapon, finely tuned arms and defenses ready to destroy anything standing in your way.  You awoke to a horde of enemies, so now you take them all on."
msgstr "'The Immortal', designed to be a one-man army.  Your body is a lethal weapon, finely tuned arms and defences ready to destroy anything standing in your way.  You awoke to a horde of enemies, so now you take them all on."

