msgstr[0] "Rebuilding Civilisation: Devices"
msgstr[1] "Rebuilding Civilisation: Devices"

msgid "The traps volume of the Rebuilding Civilization encyclopedia.  This book contains everything from lockpicking to disarming landmines in fine detail.  This book is so technical, longwinded and dry that even bookworms and fast readers would find it hard to read.  Literally any other book on the subject would be a more efficient way to learn but if the books you have are missing specific information then this is a good substitute until you find something better."
msgstr "The traps volume of the Rebuilding Civilisation encyclopedia.  This book contains everything from lockpicking to disarming landmines in fine detail.  This book is so technical, longwinded and dry that even bookworms and fast readers would find it hard to read.  Literally any other book on the subject would be a more efficient way to learn but if the books you have are missing specific information then this is a good substitute until you find something better."

msgid "This is a journal with what seems to be an invitation of some sort from some unknown organization.  While its contents are rather boring to read, some bits offer promises of 'forbidden knowledge' and that said contents are 'just a taste of true power'…  Science has definitely gone too far…"
msgstr "This is a journal with what seems to be an invitation of some sort from some unknown organisation.  While its contents are rather boring to read, some bits offer promises of 'forbidden knowledge' and that said contents are 'just a taste of true power'…  Science has definitely gone too far…"

msgid "gasoline synthesizing blob glob"
msgid_plural "gasoline synthesizing blob globs"
msgstr[0] "petrol synthesising blob glob"
msgstr[1] "petrol synthesising blob globs"

msgid "A piece of glob that has begun to create gasoline when exposed to the sun.  The gasoline it creates is too mixed up with the glob to be extracted but is still flammable."
msgstr "A piece of glob that has begun to create petrol when exposed to the sun.  The petrol it creates is too mixed up with the glob to be extracted but is still flammable."

msgid "Active Defense"
msgstr "Active Defence"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The best defense is a good offense.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Block attempts, damage blocked increased by 100% of Intelligence.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns, stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"The best defence is a good offence.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Block attempts, damage blocked increased by 100% of Intelligence.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns, stacks 2 times."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One powerful blow makes the follow-up that much easier.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Accuracy, armor penetration increased by 25% of strength.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns, stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"One powerful blow makes the follow-up that much easier.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Accuracy, armour penetration increased by 25% of strength.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns, stacks 2 times."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Get in, hit hard, get back out.\n"
"\n"
"Movement speed increased by 30% of strength, armor penetration increased by 20% of strength.  Enables \"Foe-Tossing Charge\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns, stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Get in, hit hard, get back out.\n"
"\n"
"Movement speed increased by 30% of strength, armour penetration increased by 20% of strength.  Enables \"Foe-Tossing Charge\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns, stacks 3 times."

msgid "Pressurized hydrogen"
msgstr "Pressurised hydrogen"

msgid "JOINT RESEARCH PROJECT TO INCREASE JOBS: A recent announcement confirmed rumors of a joint research project between several commercial and military research firms, with the stated goal of collaborating to advance several cutting-edge fields.  Though details are still sparse at this time, the project is expected to open thousands of employment opportunities in various fields and departments."
msgstr "JOINT RESEARCH PROJECT TO INCREASE JOBS: A recent announcement confirmed rumours of a joint research project between several commercial and military research firms, with the stated goal of collaborating to advance several cutting-edge fields.  Though details are still sparse at this time, the project is expected to open thousands of employment opportunities in various fields and departments."

msgid "\"Saw a whole fuckton of the big ones the other day.  The live ones, followin' an even bigger fucker covered in armor.  Just walked through a horde like nothing.\""
msgstr "\"Saw a whole fuckton of the big ones the other day.  The live ones, followin' an even bigger fucker covered in armour.  Just walked through a horde like nothing.\""

msgid "\"Boss came down to show our supplier around.  Professional-looking person, would look more at home teaching college kids than working with the Organization.  Didn't seem even the least bit squeamish about the animals though.  Given she works for wherever we get our mutagen and CBMs, I don't want to even think about the shit they must be used to.  Didn't even fucking flinch when one of the freaks in Red Team broke its jaw gnawing on the bars, when she and the boss walked past its cell.\""
msgstr "\"Boss came down to show our supplier around.  Professional-looking person, would look more at home teaching college kids than working with the Organisation.  Didn't seem even the least bit squeamish about the animals though.  Given she works for wherever we get our mutagen and CBMs, I don't want to even think about the shit they must be used to.  Didn't even fucking flinch when one of the freaks in Red Team broke its jaw gnawing on the bars, when she and the boss walked past its cell.\""

msgid "\"Got another fresh shipment, couple CBMs, along with the fresh meat to get Blue Team back up to full roster.  Boss is worried that vetting clients is going to make the next show a complete waste of time.  Told him we shouldn't have given up on streaming in favor of hosting fights on-site, but boss won't budge on that.\""
msgstr "\"Got another fresh shipment, couple CBMs, along with the fresh meat to get Blue Team back up to full roster.  Boss is worried that vetting clients is going to make the next show a complete waste of time.  Told him we shouldn't have given up on streaming in favour of hosting fights on-site, but boss won't budge on that.\""

msgid "A mysterious torch that uses the power of the sun (and blob goo) to light itself.  Somehow, the gasoline synthesized goo produces gasoline when in the sun continuously soaking the rag making it \"rechargeable\" in a sense.  You need a lighter to turn it on.  Once lit, it can't be turned off until all fuel is used."
msgstr "A mysterious torch that uses the power of the sun (and blob goo) to light itself.  Somehow, the petrol synthesised goo produces petrol when in the sun continuously soaking the rag making it \"rechargeable\" in a sense.  You need a lighter to turn it on.  Once lit, it can't be turned off until all fuel is used."

msgid "A mysterious torch that uses the power of the sun (and blob goo) to light itself.  Somehow, the gasoline synthesized goo produces gasoline when in the sun continuously soaking the rag making it \"rechargeable\" in a sense.  It is burning, producing plenty of light until it runs out of fuel."
msgstr "A mysterious torch that uses the power of the sun (and blob goo) to light itself.  Somehow, the petrol synthesised goo produces petrol when in the sun continuously soaking the rag making it \"rechargeable\" in a sense.  It is burning, producing plenty of light until it runs out of fuel."

msgid "molded hammer"
msgid_plural "molded hammers"
msgstr[0] "moulded hammer"
msgstr[1] "moulded hammers"

msgid "This is a hammer molded from cast iron.  While a bit brittle if extensively used for combat, it holds up well enough to serve as a tool, though lacks enough of a claw to pry with."
msgstr "This is a hammer moulded from cast iron.  While a bit brittle if extensively used for combat, it holds up well enough to serve as a tool, though lacks enough of a claw to pry with."

msgid "molded knife"
msgid_plural "molded knives"
msgstr[0] "moulded knife"
msgstr[1] "moulded knives"

msgid "This is a sharp knife molded from cast iron.  A bit brittle and heavy to be extensively used as a weapon, but adequate as a cutting tool.  Works better than sharpening any old metal, at least."
msgstr "This is a sharp knife moulded from cast iron.  A bit brittle and heavy to be extensively used as a weapon, but adequate as a cutting tool.  Works better than sharpening any old metal, at least."

msgid "molded pot"
msgid_plural "molded pots"
msgstr[0] "moulded pot"
msgstr[1] "moulded pots"

msgid "A metal molded pot.  Works as intended."
msgstr "A metal moulded pot.  Works as intended."

msgid "molded shovel"
msgid_plural "molded shovels"
msgstr[0] "moulded shovel"
msgstr[1] "moulded shovels"

msgid "This is a shovel molded out of cast iron.  Rather heavy and brittle, but does its job at least."
msgstr "This is a shovel moulded out of cast iron.  Rather heavy and brittle, but does its job at least."

msgid "molded axe"
msgid_plural "molded axes"
msgstr[0] "moulded axe"
msgstr[1] "moulded axes"

msgid "This is an axe molded from cast iron.  Stands up well enough if used as intended, but is too heavy and brittle to make a good weapon."
msgstr "This is an axe moulded from cast iron.  Stands up well enough if used as intended, but is too heavy and brittle to make a good weapon."

msgid "An odd, organic-looking auto-injector that slowly secretes some sort of red, blood-like substance.  From what you can understand from the label, it's an experimental stimulant that stabilizes minor wounds and increases performance at the cost of inflicting pain.  The label additionally warns against using it more than once every two hours."
msgstr "An odd, organic-looking auto-injector that slowly secretes some sort of red, blood-like substance.  From what you can understand from the label, it's an experimental stimulant that stabilises minor wounds and increases performance at the cost of inflicting pain.  The label additionally warns against using it more than once every two hours."

msgid "You read the map.  You gulp and realize what must be done…"
msgstr "You read the map.  You gulp and realise what must be done…"

msgid "Looking down at the note, you memorize the location shown."
msgstr "Looking down at the note, you memorise the location shown."

msgid "molded crowbar"
msgid_plural "molded crowbars"
msgstr[0] "moulded crowbar"
msgstr[1] "moulded crowbars"

msgid "This is a hefty prying tool, molded from cast iron.  A bit brittle and heavy to be extensively used as a weapon, but adequate for prying open locked doors.  Not exactly ideal, but it's an improvement over makeshift tools."
msgstr "This is a hefty prying tool, moulded from cast iron.  A bit brittle and heavy to be extensively used as a weapon, but adequate for prying open locked doors.  Not exactly ideal, but it's an improvement over makeshift tools."

msgid "A shell made of multiple plates of strange resin and iridescent flesh, held together by a network of sinew.  It resembles a biological suit of armor for a distinctly inhuman creature more than an actual body part, though the frayed organic wiring lining the inside paints a much more fleshy picture of how it was operated.  It almost seems like it could still be used, although its shape and function clearly never had humans in mind."
msgstr "A shell made of multiple plates of strange resin and iridescent flesh, held together by a network of sinew.  It resembles a biological suit of armour for a distinctly inhuman creature more than an actual body part, though the frayed organic wiring lining the inside paints a much more fleshy picture of how it was operated.  It almost seems like it could still be used, although its shape and function clearly never had humans in mind."

msgid "A fist-sized clump of gore and torn muscle fibers, from which jut three thin spines of what seems to be synthetic bone, or possibly keratin.  In between the spines are countless thin strands of what looks like brilliant green fiberglass, most likely alien resin.  This seems to be used for either producing or shaping this strange substance, potentially useful but right now it's of little use to anyone like this, human or alien."
msgstr "A fist-sized clump of gore and torn muscle fibres, from which jut three thin spines of what seems to be synthetic bone, or possibly keratin.  In between the spines are countless thin strands of what looks like brilliant green fibreglass, most likely alien resin.  This seems to be used for either producing or shaping this strange substance, potentially useful but right now it's of little use to anyone like this, human or alien."

msgid "Makeshift Command Center roof"
msgstr "Makeshift Command Centre roof"

msgid "Survivor's Militarized RV"
msgstr "Survivor's Militarised RV"

msgid "A glassy green pellet of alien resin, molded in a shape resembling an elongated rifle bullet.  Designed for an exotic pneumatic weapon."
msgstr "A glassy green pellet of alien resin, moulded in a shape resembling an elongated rifle bullet.  Designed for an exotic pneumatic weapon."

msgid "molded projector bullet"
msgid_plural "molded projector bullets"
msgstr[0] "moulded projector bullet"
msgstr[1] "moulded projector bullets"

msgid "A molded metal projectile for an exotic pneumatic weapon, resembling an elongated rifle bullet.  Inferior to purpose-built resin bullets, but easier to make."
msgstr "A moulded metal projectile for an exotic pneumatic weapon, resembling an elongated rifle bullet.  Inferior to purpose-built resin bullets, but easier to make."

msgid "A magazine built for the survivor's .45 SMG.  Roughly modeled after the MAC-10 magazine in design, it's decently-made but not designed for any known factory-made model of firearm."
msgstr "A magazine built for the survivor's .45 SMG.  Roughly modelled after the MAC-10 magazine in design, it's decently-made but not designed for any known factory-made model of firearm."

msgid "This battery uses a thin plutonium-244 rod to stabilize multiple proprietary exotic compounds.  Designed by Omnitech for a military contract, this modified plutonium battery is rechargeable, but as it made for military purposes there is very little this is compatible with."
msgstr "This battery uses a thin plutonium-244 rod to stabilise multiple proprietary exotic compounds.  Designed by Omnitech for a military contract, this modified plutonium battery is rechargeable, but as it made for military purposes there is very little this is compatible with."

msgid "A miniature, custom-built flamethrower that can be attached to all sorts of weapons.  It can use a wide range of fuels and is relatively fuel-efficient.  It is less effective than a proper flamethrower however, and pressurizing the integral tank takes time."
msgstr "A miniature, custom-built flamethrower that can be attached to all sorts of weapons.  It can use a wide range of fuels and is relatively fuel-efficient.  It is less effective than a proper flamethrower however, and pressurising the integral tank takes time."

msgid "A well-made, long-barreled rifle for firing paper cartridges.  Using a breech-loading mechanism and scavenged ferrocerium from a lighter, it compensates for some of the disadvantages common to flintlock firearms."
msgstr "A well-made, long-barrelled rifle for firing paper cartridges.  Using a breech-loading mechanism and scavenged ferrocerium from a lighter, it compensates for some of the disadvantages common to flintlock firearms."

msgid "An electronic rifle that fires crossbow bolts accelerated to high speeds via UPS.  Intended to be used in wilderness operations, allowing the user to reuse or manufacture ammunition if power is maintained.  Its manufacturer is labeled as Omnitech Labs."
msgstr "An electronic rifle that fires crossbow bolts accelerated to high speeds via UPS.  Intended to be used in wilderness operations, allowing the user to reuse or manufacture ammunition if power is maintained.  Its manufacturer is labelled as Omnitech Labs."

msgid "A mi-go weapon that projects pieces of hardened alien resin at high velocities, its exotic controls stripped down it fit human anatomy.  The product of pre-cataclysm biotechnology applied to solve an outside-context problem.  Although it relies on special ammunition, it is relatively easy to mold resin or metal into compatible projectiles, and it packs a decent punch with very little noise."
msgstr "A mi-go weapon that projects pieces of hardened alien resin at high velocities, its exotic controls stripped down it fit human anatomy.  The product of pre-cataclysm biotechnology applied to solve an outside-context problem.  Although it relies on special ammunition, it is relatively easy to mould resin or metal into compatible projectiles, and it packs a decent punch with very little noise."

msgid "The hit cookie from Mycus Industries!  Now comes in addicting flavors such as Marloss, Chanterelle, and The Encroaching, Unavoidable Death of Human Civilization."
msgstr "The hit cookie from Mycus Industries!  Now comes in addicting flavours such as Marloss, Chanterelle, and The Encroaching, Unavoidable Death of Human Civilisation."

msgid "Powerthirst - Manana Flavor"
msgid_plural "Powerthirst - Manana Flavor"
msgstr[0] "Powerthirst - Manana Flavour"
msgstr[1] "Powerthirst - Manana Flavour"

msgid "POWERTHIRST in new Manana flavor.  Contains preposterous amounts of testosterone.  PREPOSTERONE.  It's like crystal meth in a can.  It's crystal meth in a can.  Powerthirst is crystal meth."
msgstr "POWERTHIRST in new Manana flavour.  Contains preposterous amounts of testosterone.  PREPOSTERONE.  It's like crystal meth in a can.  It's crystal meth in a can.  Powerthirst is crystal meth."

msgid "Powerthirst - Fizzbitch Flavor"
msgid_plural "Powerthirst - Fizzbitch Flavor"
msgstr[0] "Powerthirst - Fizzbitch Flavour"
msgstr[1] "Powerthirst - Fizzbitch Flavour"

msgid "POWERTHIRST in new Fizzbitch flavor.  Contains preposterous amounts of testosterone.  PREPOSTERONE.  It's like crystal meth in a can.  It's crystal meth in a can.  Powerthirst is crystal meth."
msgstr "POWERTHIRST in new Fizzbitch flavour.  Contains preposterous amounts of testosterone.  PREPOSTERONE.  It's like crystal meth in a can.  It's crystal meth in a can.  Powerthirst is crystal meth."

msgid "Powerthirst - Gun Flavor"
msgid_plural "Powerthirst - Gun Flavor"
msgstr[0] "Powerthirst - Gun Flavour"
msgstr[1] "Powerthirst - Gun Flavour"

msgid "POWERTHIRST in new Gun flavor.  Contains preposterous amounts of testosterone.  PREPOSTERONE.  It's like crystal meth in a can.  It's crystal meth in a can.  Powerthirst is crystal meth."
msgstr "POWERTHIRST in new Gun flavour.  Contains preposterous amounts of testosterone.  PREPOSTERONE.  It's like crystal meth in a can.  It's crystal meth in a can.  Powerthirst is crystal meth."

msgid "This is sturdy wood bat, wrapped in gasoline-soaked rags and flame-resistant Nomex fabric.  Light it, and the ball game will REALLY heat up.  You'll need a lighter or matches to light it."
msgstr "This is sturdy wood bat, wrapped in petrol-soaked rags and flame-resistant Nomex fabric.  Light it, and the ball game will REALLY heat up.  You'll need a lighter or matches to light it."

msgid "This is a sturdy wood bat, wrapped in gasoline-soaked rags and flame-resistant Nomex fabric.  It is burning brightly, and makes it much easier to see the baselines at night games (It also makes the umpire FAR more likely to call a ball instead of a strike)."
msgstr "This is a sturdy wood bat, wrapped in petrol-soaked rags and flame-resistant Nomex fabric.  It is burning brightly, and makes it much easier to see the baselines at night games (It also makes the umpire FAR more likely to call a ball instead of a strike)."

msgid "0.5L pressurized fuel tank"
msgid_plural "0.5L pressurized fuel tanks"
msgstr[0] "0.5L pressurised fuel tank"
msgstr[1] "0.5L pressurised fuel tanks"

msgid "A pressurized 0.5L canister built crafting into a small auxiliary flamethrower."
msgstr "A pressurised 0.5L canister built crafting into a small auxiliary flamethrower."

msgid "Break into armory to retrieve valued possession"
msgstr "Break into armoury to retrieve valued possession"

msgid "I need you to get my riches from the armory safe."
msgstr "I need you to get my riches from the armoury safe."

msgid "I left my most valued possession in the armory.  I don't have the code, can you get in?"
msgstr "I left my most valued possession in the armoury.  I don't have the code, can you get in?"

msgid "Cake and grief counseling will be available at the conclusion of the test."
msgstr "Cake and grief counselling will be available at the conclusion of the test."

msgid "We are throwing a party in honor of your tremendous success."
msgstr "We are throwing a party in honour of your tremendous success."

msgid "Despite your violent behavior, the only thing you've managed to break so far is my heart."
msgstr "Despite your violent behaviour, the only thing you've managed to break so far is my heart."

msgid "TRIVIALIZE THE EARLY GAME WITH THIS ONE SIMPLE SPEAR WEAPON!  CONTRIBUTORS HATE HIM"
msgstr "TRIVIALISE THE EARLY GAME WITH THIS ONE SIMPLE SPEAR WEAPON!  CONTRIBUTORS HATE HIM"

msgid "\"Back up, put down the gun, and gimme some tropical flavored bubblicious.\""
msgstr "\"Back up, put down the gun, and gimme some tropical flavoured bubblicious.\""

msgid "Crystals, meditation, astral projection, remote viewing, channeling, ESP; it's all real, man.  It all works if you believe."
msgstr "Crystals, meditation, astral projection, remote viewing, channelling, ESP; it's all real, man.  It all works if you believe."

msgid "Defense Mode"
msgstr "Defence Mode"

msgid "This transforms the game into a horde-based wave defense mode.  Pick a starting location, create your character, and defend your bastion against the relentless waves of zombies, insects, aliens, you name it!  Complex customizations allow the game to be tinkered with to your hearts content, and extensive mod compatibility allows for your favorite additions to work perfectly in the new game.  It's kill or be killed!"
msgstr "This transforms the game into a horde-based wave defence mode.  Pick a starting location, create your character, and defend your bastion against the relentless waves of zombies, insects, aliens, you name it!  Complex customisations allow the game to be tinkered with to your hearts content, and extensive mod compatibility allows for your favourite additions to work perfectly in the new game.  It's kill or be killed!"

msgid "Hello, and welcome to Defense Mode!  Please alter the options as you desire, then we'll get started!"
msgstr "Hello, and welcome to Defence Mode!  Please alter the options as you desire, then we'll get started!"

msgid "Squeaking and chittering can be heard nearby, with the pattering of many feet, like a swarm of rats traveling quickly.  However, this sounds more, organized?  Almost like they're all walking in formation."
msgstr "Squeaking and chittering can be heard nearby, with the pattering of many feet, like a swarm of rats travelling quickly.  However, this sounds more, organised?  Almost like they're all walking in formation."

msgid "Dr. Yoshimi has been reprimanded for unauthorized contact with the procompsignathids.  Disgusting behavior, and a terrible example to the junior researchers."
msgstr "Dr. Yoshimi has been reprimanded for unauthorised contact with the procompsignathids.  Disgusting behaviour, and a terrible example to the junior researchers."

msgid "Tingle lab situation normal.  Dr. Tingle believes the Acrocanthosaurus is the best fit for hybridization and the lab is working on safe methods to provide Dr. Tingle the needed material.  Velociraptor is another possibility given prior research.  Testing with chickens and the velociraptor specimens suggests some subject resistance."
msgstr "Tingle lab situation normal.  Dr. Tingle believes the Acrocanthosaurus is the best fit for hybridisation and the lab is working on safe methods to provide Dr. Tingle the needed material.  Velociraptor is another possibility given prior research.  Testing with chickens and the velociraptor specimens suggests some subject resistance."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to rip your %2$s with its sharp teeth, but fails to penetrate your armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to rip your %2$s with its sharp teeth, but fails to penetrate your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to rip a gash into <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to rip a gash into <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to pull your %2$s apart with its sharp teeth, but fails to penetrate your armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to pull your %2$s apart with its sharp teeth, but fails to penetrate your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to pull away a large chunk of flesh from <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to pull away a large chunk of flesh from <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to bite into your %2$s with its sharp teeth, but fails to penetrate your armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to bite into your %2$s with its sharp teeth, but fails to penetrate your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to bite into the flesh of <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to bite into the flesh of <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stomps on your %2$s, but your armor protects you."
msgstr "%1$s stomps on your %2$s, but your armour protects you."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stomps on <npcname>, but their armor protects them."
msgstr "%1$s stomps on <npcname>, but their armour protects them."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s swings its massive tail at your %2$s, pulverizing it!"
msgstr "%1$s swings its massive tail at your %2$s, pulverising it!"

#, c-format
msgid "%s swings its tail at you, but it's blunted by your armor."
msgstr "%s swings its tail at you, but it's blunted by your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%s swings its spiked tail at you, but it's blunted by your armor."
msgstr "%s swings its spiked tail at you, but it's blunted by your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's long horn hits your %2$s, but it glances off your armor."
msgstr "%1$s's long horn hits your %2$s, but it glances off your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's long horn hits <npcname>, but it glances off their armor."
msgstr "%1$s's long horn hits <npcname>, but it glances off their armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's long horns hit your %2$s, but they glance off your armor."
msgstr "%1$s's long horns hit your %2$s, but they glance off your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's long horns hit <npcname>, but they glance off their armor."
msgstr "%1$s's long horns hit <npcname>, but they glance off their armour."

msgid "Seems like the only news we get here is bad.  A weirdo family was staying outside the center, I don't know why.  They said something about germs.  Anyway, they're gone, vanished in the night.  We sent a scout out to find them but now they're gone too.  We have a pretty good idea of where in the woods the scout was searching.  Bring back anyone you can alive and end whatever is keeping them."
msgstr "Seems like the only news we get here is bad.  A weirdo family was staying outside the centre, I don't know why.  They said something about germs.  Anyway, they're gone, vanished in the night.  We sent a scout out to find them but now they're gone too.  We have a pretty good idea of where in the woods the scout was searching.  Bring back anyone you can alive and end whatever is keeping them."

msgid "Dinosaur fecal matter; this could probably be used to make some great fertilizer."
msgstr "Dinosaur faecal matter; this could probably be used to make some great fertiliser."

msgid "The voluminous notes of an obviously talented paleontologist, dedicated biologist, and amateur author.  These notes jump from such topics as fossil digs, science fiction stories, also strangely enough notes on dinosaur biology and potential hybridization efforts."
msgstr "The voluminous notes of an obviously talented palaeontologist, dedicated biologist, and amateur author.  These notes jump from such topics as fossil digs, science fiction stories, also strangely enough notes on dinosaur biology and potential hybridisation efforts."

msgid "A boiled stomach from a sauropod, nothing else.  It looks all but appetizing."
msgstr "A boiled stomach from a sauropod, nothing else.  It looks all but appetising."

msgid "The stomach of a sauropod, cleaned and sealed with strings.  It can hold 6 liters of water."
msgstr "The stomach of a sauropod, cleaned and sealed with strings.  It can hold 6 litres of water."

msgid "A state-of-the-art laser rifle developed by the R&D outfit \"Aerial Labs\".  Initial performance rivaled Rivtech's finest, with rumors flying about corporate skulduggery.  Fitted with a large internal plutonium cell for CyberDinos."
msgstr "A state-of-the-art laser rifle developed by the R&D outfit \"Aerial Labs\".  Initial performance rivalled Rivtech's finest, with rumours flying about corporate skulduggery.  Fitted with a large internal plutonium cell for CyberDinos."

msgid "A sample of tissues and liquids from a living dromaeosaurid, popularly called a 'raptor', a flightless feathered predatory dinosaur popularized by an American film."
msgstr "A sample of tissues and liquids from a living dromaeosaurid, popularly called a 'raptor', a flightless feathered predatory dinosaur popularised by an American film."

msgid "A sample of tissues and liquids from a living thyreophoran, one of many plant eating dinosaurs with natural protective armor."
msgstr "A sample of tissues and liquids from a living thyreophoran, one of many plant eating dinosaurs with natural protective armour."

msgid "bear armor"
msgid_plural "bear armors"
msgstr[0] "bear armour"
msgstr[1] "bear armours"

msgid "A heavy mattress-like armor of cloth, leather, and thick linings of Kevlar, originally used as horse protection for bullfighting, but adapted for the noblest of beasts.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "A heavy mattress-like armour of cloth, leather, and thick linings of Kevlar, originally used as horse protection for bullfighting, but adapted for the noblest of beasts.  You could put this on a friendly bear."

msgid "biosilicified chitin bear armor"
msgid_plural "biosilicified chitin bear armors"
msgstr[0] "biosilicified chitin bear armour"
msgstr[1] "biosilicified chitin bear armours"

msgid "chitin bear armor"
msgid_plural "chitin bear armors"
msgstr[0] "chitin bear armour"
msgstr[1] "chitin bear armours"

msgid "chainmail bear armor"
msgid_plural "chainmail bear armors"
msgstr[0] "chainmail bear armour"
msgstr[1] "chainmail bear armours"

msgid "A full barding for bears, consisting of boiled leather with cloth underneath.  This caparison depicts four men in heavy metal armor riddled with bullet marks.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr "A full barding for bears, consisting of boiled leather with cloth underneath.  This caparison depicts four men in heavy metal armour riddled with bullet marks.  You could put this on a friendly bear."

msgid "iron bear armor"
msgid_plural "iron bear armors"
msgstr[0] "iron bear armour"
msgstr[1] "iron bear armours"

