msgid "Enormous heavily armored zombie dinosaur lifting a spiked tail and what looks like a US Army M1 Abrams Tank with a sparking but still functional turret."
msgstr "Enormous heavily armoured zombie dinosaur lifting a spiked tail and what looks like a US Army M1 Abrams Tank with a sparking but still functional turret."

msgid "Enormous zombie dinosaur with dramatic horns lifting what looks like a US Army armored personnel carrier.  There is movement inside."
msgstr "Enormous zombie dinosaur with dramatic horns lifting what looks like a US Army armoured personnel carrier.  There is movement inside."

msgid "A hideously swollen zombified ankylosaurid body towering into the sky.  Its massive body bulges with distended muscles and enormous bony armor."
msgstr "A hideously swollen zombified ankylosaurid body towering into the sky.  Its massive body bulges with distended muscles and enormous bony armour."

msgid "Large, you are becoming larger every day.  Armored skin, to protect you from the world.  These are the gifts you are receiving."
msgstr "Large, you are becoming larger every day.  Armoured skin, to protect you from the world.  These are the gifts you are receiving."

msgid "You feel your skin toughen.  You are the armor."
msgstr "You feel your skin toughen.  You are the armour."

msgid "Slow, methodical, heavily armored.  A walking tank."
msgstr "Slow, methodical, heavily armoured.  A walking tank."

msgid "You have a long, thick, tail with sharp pointed horns.  It helps you balance a bit but also makes a heavy bludgeon.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "You have a long, thick, tail with sharp pointed horns.  It helps you balance a bit but also makes a heavy bludgeon.  Prevents wearing non-fabric trousers."

msgid "The raggedly flying corpse  of a feathered reptile over three feet long, with short wings and a big colorful beak."
msgstr "The raggedly flying corpse  of a feathered reptile over three feet long, with short wings and a big colourful beak."

msgid "The flying corpse of a feathered reptile over three feet long, with short wings and a big colorful beak.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr "The flying corpse of a feathered reptile over three feet long, with short wings and a big colourful beak.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."

msgid "The raggedly flying corpse of a feathered reptile, with short wings and a colorful glowing beak.  It has been implanted with crackling bionics and is dripping black goo."
msgstr "The raggedly flying corpse of a feathered reptile, with short wings and a colourful glowing beak.  It has been implanted with crackling bionics and is dripping black goo."

msgid "Fed the great Eaters.  Will be honored for all time."
msgstr "Fed the great Eaters.  Will be honoured for all time."

msgid "Those big dinosaurs make a big mess.  If only there was some way to harness the power of those poops for the uplift of all mankind.  Maybe a renewable energy source, or a construction material, or super dino fertilizer"
msgstr "Those big dinosaurs make a big mess.  If only there was some way to harness the power of those poops for the uplift of all mankind.  Maybe a renewable energy source, or a construction material, or super dino fertiliser"

msgid "This is an advertisement for a local wildlife exhibit, claiming to have new and exciting animals on display.  Strangely, the only imagery on it is a stylized silhouette of a T. Rex.  The flier reads \"Witness the rebirth of the extinct, grand opening this week!\""
msgstr "This is an advertisement for a local wildlife exhibit, claiming to have new and exciting animals on display.  Strangely, the only imagery on it is a stylised silhouette of a T. Rex.  The flyer reads \"Witness the rebirth of the extinct, grand opening this week!\""

msgid "CUTEST VISITORS: A mysterious portal of shimmering blue energy and flashing lights opened above Cretaceous Kindergarten today, showering children with the cutest tiny fuzzy dinosaurs and dinosaur babies.  Local paleontologist and exotic dancer Othniel Marsh expressed skepticism that dinosaurs had not died out millions of years ago but 'at this point why not, at least they're cute'.  And cute they are!"
msgstr "CUTEST VISITORS: A mysterious portal of shimmering blue energy and flashing lights opened above Cretaceous Kindergarten today, showering children with the cutest tiny fuzzy dinosaurs and dinosaur babies.  Local palaeontologist and exotic dancer Othniel Marsh expressed scepticism that dinosaurs had not died out millions of years ago but 'at this point why not, at least they're cute'.  And cute they are!"

msgid "GOD IS A DINOSAUR?:  Colorful FEMA official and slug mutant Ernst Stromer reported this morning that he has 'seen god and she is a hungry torvosaurus too beautiful for this world'.  He says that she 'cannot be harmed by bullets' and that she is 'made of beautiful golden light from above' and she demands human flesh.  Stromer says that every fighting man and woman must go to her to be destroyed by her 'atomic majesty'.  Good news America!"
msgstr "GOD IS A DINOSAUR?:  Colourful FEMA official and slug mutant Ernst Stromer reported this morning that he has 'seen god and she is a hungry torvosaurus too beautiful for this world'.  He says that she 'cannot be harmed by bullets' and that she is 'made of beautiful golden light from above' and she demands human flesh.  Stromer says that every fighting man and woman must go to her to be destroyed by her 'atomic majesty'.  Good news America!"

msgid "A grenade cartridge with a high explosive dual purpose load, capable of producing good penetration and a high number of damaging fragments.  Good for armored or soft targets."
msgstr "A grenade cartridge with a high explosive dual purpose load, capable of producing good penetration and a high number of damaging fragments.  Good for armoured or soft targets."

msgid "Modern ubiquitous medium pistol ammo, popularized by usage in two wars and almost a century of post-war defensive and duty usage.  'Ball' is an old term for full metal jacketed bullets which offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and slightly improved penetration compared to plain lead."
msgstr "Modern ubiquitous medium pistol ammo, popularised by usage in two wars and almost a century of post-war defensive and duty usage.  'Ball' is an old term for full metal jacketed bullets which offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and slightly improved penetration compared to plain lead."

msgid "Modern ubiquitous medium pistol ammo, popularized by usage in two wars and almost a century of post-war defensive and duty usage.  Jacketed Hollow Points are defensive/duty projectiles that are more destructive to tissue than plain ball ammunition, and slightly reduce overpenetration concerns."
msgstr "Modern ubiquitous medium pistol ammo, popularised by usage in two wars and almost a century of post-war defensive and duty usage.  Jacketed Hollow Points are defensive/duty projectiles that are more destructive to tissue than plain ball ammunition, and slightly reduce overpenetration concerns."

msgid "Magnum ammunition, developed from early handgun hunting efforts and popularized by law enforcement usage.  It is more powerful than common pistol ammo.  'Ball' is an old term for full metal jacketed bullets which offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and slightly improved penetration compared to plain lead."
msgstr "Magnum ammunition, developed from early handgun hunting efforts and popularised by law enforcement usage.  It is more powerful than common pistol ammo.  'Ball' is an old term for full metal jacketed bullets which offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and slightly improved penetration compared to plain lead."

msgid "Magnum ammunition, developed from early handgun hunting efforts and popularized by law enforcement usage.  It is more powerful than common pistol ammo.  Jacketed Hollow Points are defensive/duty projectiles that are more destructive to tissue than plain ball ammunition, and slightly reduce overpenetration concerns."
msgstr "Magnum ammunition, developed from early handgun hunting efforts and popularised by law enforcement usage.  It is more powerful than common pistol ammo.  Jacketed Hollow Points are defensive/duty projectiles that are more destructive to tissue than plain ball ammunition, and slightly reduce overpenetration concerns."

msgid "Modern rifle ammunition, ubiquitous and affordable.  It's suitable for international conflicts, hunting small to large game, home defense, and these days, zombies.  'Ball' is an old term for full metal jacketed bullets which offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and slightly improved penetration compared to plain lead."
msgstr "Modern rifle ammunition, ubiquitous and affordable.  It's suitable for international conflicts, hunting small to large game, home defence, and these days, zombies.  'Ball' is an old term for full metal jacketed bullets which offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and slightly improved penetration compared to plain lead."

msgid "Modern rifle ammunition, ubiquitous and affordable.  It's suitable for international conflicts, hunting small to large game, home defense, and these days, zombies.  This 'armor piercing' variant features a mild steel penetrator for environmental friendliness, improved barrier penetration, and enhanced effect on armor."
msgstr "Modern rifle ammunition, ubiquitous and affordable.  It's suitable for international conflicts, hunting small to large game, home defence, and these days, zombies.  This 'armour piercing' variant features a mild steel penetrator for environmental friendliness, improved barrier penetration, and enhanced effect on armour."

msgid "Foreign cannon rifle ammo brought by the Exodii, capable to destroy lightly armored vehicles, as well as highly armored mutants."
msgstr "Foreign cannon rifle ammo brought by the Exodii, capable to destroy lightly armoured vehicles, as well as highly armoured mutants."

msgid "Huge rifle ammunition like this bridges the gap between light cannons and big game rifles.  It's suitable for taking on light vehicles and other materiel, or hunting extremely large game.  These armor piercing munitions feature tungsten steel penetrators for use against light-skinned vehicles."
msgstr "Huge rifle ammunition like this bridges the gap between light cannons and big game rifles.  It's suitable for taking on light vehicles and other materiel, or hunting extremely large game.  These armour piercing munitions feature tungsten steel penetrators for use against light-skinned vehicles."

msgid "A rocket loaded with a smoke warhead for a military rocket launcher.  Commonly used for signaling, target designation, and for screening troop movements."
msgstr "A rocket loaded with a smoke warhead for a military rocket launcher.  Commonly used for signalling, target designation, and for screening troop movements."

msgid "A shotgun shell filled with tiny steel darts, definitely not a factory loading.  Flechettes won't pattern as well as normal shot, and they'll likely do less damage.  However, they may fare better against armor than other shotgun loads."
msgstr "A shotgun shell filled with tiny steel darts, definitely not a factory loading.  Flechettes won't pattern as well as normal shot, and they'll likely do less damage.  However, they may fare better against armour than other shotgun loads."

msgid "A single discharge from this plasma rifle easily melts through conventional armor and flash-incinerates anything behind it, but its state of disrepair limits the number of shots it can fire in quick succession."
msgstr "A single discharge from this plasma rifle easily melts through conventional armour and flash-incinerates anything behind it, but its state of disrepair limits the number of shots it can fire in quick succession."

msgid "Since the early days of western expansion, when ammunition supply was infrequent, shooters sought to share ammo between their sidearms and long arms.  This tube magazine lever-action carbine allows the shooter to reduce the number of calibers carried and squeeze more power from their pistol ammunition."
msgstr "Since the early days of western expansion, when ammunition supply was infrequent, shooters sought to share ammo between their sidearms and long arms.  This tube magazine lever-action carbine allows the shooter to reduce the number of calibres carried and squeeze more power from their pistol ammunition."

msgid "A modern pistol fit for duty, military service, or personal defense, with a detachable box magazine and a reliable action.  Though its chambering is capable of meeting FBI penetration minimums, the lack of a shoulder stock limits its utility."
msgstr "A modern pistol fit for duty, military service, or personal defence, with a detachable box magazine and a reliable action.  Though its chambering is capable of meeting FBI penetration minimums, the lack of a shoulder stock limits its utility."

msgid "Revolvers like this, chambered for standard defensive calibers, were a favorite of police departments for nearly a century, up until the 1986 Miami shootout.  Afterwards, the slow reloading and shooting of revolvers were considered liabilities; still, this model's accuracy and moderate recoil make for a serviceable sidearm, and there are no magazines for you to lose or damage."
msgstr "Revolvers like this, chambered for standard defensive calibres, were a favourite of police departments for nearly a century, up until the 1986 Miami shootout.  Afterwards, the slow reloading and shooting of revolvers were considered liabilities; still, this model's accuracy and moderate recoil make for a serviceable sidearm, and there are no magazines for you to lose or damage."

msgid "This large pistol is almost as heavy as a small carbine, and just about as powerful too.  Chambered in hard hitting magnum calibers, it is suitable for hunting medium game, humans, or offsetting any of one's perceived deficiencies.  Though traditionally such magnums are revolvers, this one is a magazine fed semi-automatic."
msgstr "This large pistol is almost as heavy as a small carbine, and just about as powerful too.  Chambered in hard hitting magnum calibres, it is suitable for hunting medium game, humans, or offsetting any of one's perceived deficiencies.  Though traditionally such magnums are revolvers, this one is a magazine fed semi-automatic."

msgid "A modern re-imagining of the classic western lever-action, this larger rifle accepts powerful magnum pistol ammunition as well as weaker pistol ammo.  Carrying this along side a magnum pistol would allow one to reduce the number of calibers carried, and allow you to squeeze more power from ammunition."
msgstr "A modern re-imagining of the classic western lever-action, this larger rifle accepts powerful magnum pistol ammunition as well as weaker pistol ammo.  Carrying this along side a magnum pistol would allow one to reduce the number of calibres carried, and allow you to squeeze more power from ammunition."

msgid "Early handgun hunters helped develop this revolver's magnum ammunition from standard calibers, which needed heavier revolvers to safely fire it.  These revolvers' cylinders can thus chamber both magnum and standard pistol ammunition.  You could take medium to large game with this hefty piece."
msgstr "Early handgun hunters helped develop this revolver's magnum ammunition from standard calibres, which needed heavier revolvers to safely fire it.  These revolvers' cylinders can thus chamber both magnum and standard pistol ammunition.  You could take medium to large game with this hefty piece."

msgid "The products of decades of improvement, rifle such as this are handy, reliable, and adaptable.  An 'assault rifle', it is capable of providing both accurate semi-automatic fire and bursts of automatic fire.  Short of large creatures and light vehicles, this should take care of most of your problems out to several hundred meters."
msgstr "The products of decades of improvement, rifle such as this are handy, reliable, and adaptable.  An 'assault rifle', it is capable of providing both accurate semi-automatic fire and bursts of automatic fire.  Short of large creatures and light vehicles, this should take care of most of your problems out to several hundred metres."

msgid "Though often mislabeled an assault rifle, this common, cheap magazine fed carbine isn't capable of automatic fire.  While almost as effective as a proper rifle, the wider variety of components and varying levels of maintenance make these less reliable than their military brethren.  These rifles are just as adequate for taking on anything smaller than large game, however."
msgstr "Though often mislabelled an assault rifle, this common, cheap magazine fed carbine isn't capable of automatic fire.  While almost as effective as a proper rifle, the wider variety of components and varying levels of maintenance make these less reliable than their military brethren.  These rifles are just as adequate for taking on anything smaller than large game, however."

msgid "Constructed of fiberglass, with crude plastic sights and a titanium barrel, this is a launcher for a single rocket.  Though not as effective as other anti-armor weapons, the true value in this disposable rocket launcher is its portability and lack of dead weight once expended.  Has a backblast, so make sure nothing you mind destroying is behind you."
msgstr "Constructed of fibreglass, with crude plastic sights and a titanium barrel, this is a launcher for a single rocket.  Though not as effective as other anti-armour weapons, the true value in this disposable rocket launcher is its portability and lack of dead weight once expended.  Has a backblast, so make sure nothing you mind destroying is behind you."

msgid "An old-fashioned double barreled shotgun, with a trigger for each barrel.  Follow up shots are incredibly quick with this, but reloading is a bit slow.  Shotshells come in many varieties, and shotguns are suitable for anything from some large game to small birds."
msgstr "An old-fashioned double barrelled shotgun, with a trigger for each barrel.  Follow up shots are incredibly quick with this, but reloading is a bit slow.  Shotshells come in many varieties, and shotguns are suitable for anything from some large game to small birds."

msgid "A crudely handmade double barreled shotgun, with a trigger for each barrel.  Follow up shots are incredibly quick with this, but reloading is slow, as there are no extractors or ejectors.  Shotshells come in many varieties, and shotguns are suitable for anything from some large game to small birds."
msgstr "A crudely handmade double barrelled shotgun, with a trigger for each barrel.  Follow up shots are incredibly quick with this, but reloading is slow, as there are no extractors or ejectors.  Shotshells come in many varieties, and shotguns are suitable for anything from some large game to small birds."

msgid "A 30 round standard capacity magazine for service rifles, cheaper than the cost of a meal due to its adoption by nearly every other common rifle.  They're made of aluminum and were originally meant to be disposable, so they're not the most durable; don't let them get damaged."
msgstr "A 30 round standard capacity magazine for service rifles, cheaper than the cost of a meal due to its adoption by nearly every other common rifle.  They're made of aluminium and were originally meant to be disposable, so they're not the most durable; don't let them get damaged."

msgid "These TALON-derived riot control platforms were widely publicized a few years before the Cataclysm as a new semi-autonomous device that could fire less-lethal rounds with far more accuracy than a human, ensuring safer hits against a target's limbs.  They were quickly adopted by prisons and inner city police forces, where they demonstrated that 'less lethal' is not the same as 'non-lethal'.  In the days before the Cataclysm, massive stockrooms of the things were put into circulation.  On the bright side, although it shoots autonomously, it requires a human operator to relocate, so it's not so mobile anymore."
msgstr "These TALON-derived riot control platforms were widely publicised a few years before the Cataclysm as a new semi-autonomous device that could fire less-lethal rounds with far more accuracy than a human, ensuring safer hits against a target's limbs.  They were quickly adopted by prisons and inner city police forces, where they demonstrated that 'less lethal' is not the same as 'non-lethal'.  In the days before the Cataclysm, massive stockrooms of the things were put into circulation.  On the bright side, although it shoots autonomously, it requires a human operator to relocate, so it's not so mobile anymore."

msgid "Unraveling"
msgstr "Unravelling"

msgid "remediator defense anchor"
msgid_plural "remediator defense anchors"
msgstr[0] "remediator defence anchor"
msgstr[1] "remediator defence anchors"

msgid "A combined harness and armor system designed to protect the wearer from the effects of normality decay.  It mounts a 5-point anchor, attachment points for a kinetic mantle and several pockets and straps for the rest of your gear."
msgstr "A combined harness and armour system designed to protect the wearer from the effects of normality decay.  It mounts a 5-point anchor, attachment points for a kinetic mantle and several pockets and straps for the rest of your gear."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A British light machine gun from the first world war, slightly modernized and modified for hip and shoulder firing while standing.  Its design is somehow stable even under extreme normality distortion and thus its found a new life with lab remediation teams.\n"
"\n"
"Your training allows you to effectively wield this weapon in close quarters, and you perform melee attacks with it at 33% of its base attack speed."
msgstr ""
"A British light machine gun from the first world war, slightly modernised and modified for hip and shoulder firing while standing.  Its design is somehow stable even under extreme normality distortion and thus its found a new life with lab remediation teams.\n"
"\n"
"Your training allows you to effectively wield this weapon in close quarters, and you perform melee attacks with it at 33% of its base attack speed."

msgid "envoy's armor"
msgid_plural "envoy's armors"
msgstr[0] "envoy's armour"
msgstr[1] "envoy's armours"

msgid "A suit of armor worn down by an endless journey.  Only its sturdiest parts remain now."
msgstr "A suit of armour worn down by an endless journey.  Only its sturdiest parts remain now."

#, no-c-format
msgid "An enchanted ebony staff, with diamonds and starmetal on the end to facilitate the channeling of arcane energies.  If lost, it will always return to you.  While wielding the staff, the cost of your enchantments is reduced by 33% and their casting time is reduced by 50%."
msgstr "An enchanted ebony staff, with diamonds and starmetal on the end to facilitate the channelling of arcane energies.  If lost, it will always return to you.  While wielding the staff, the cost of your enchantments is reduced by 33% and their casting time is reduced by 50%."

msgid "Summon the power of an elder wyrm, creating a shell of impenetrable dragon scales around your body.  The scales will withstand a number of blows before the enchant collapse, though their lambent glow will give away your position in the dark.  The enchantment will last several blows before collapsing, and may be canceled at any time."
msgstr "Summon the power of an elder wyrm, creating a shell of impenetrable dragon scales around your body.  The scales will withstand a number of blows before the enchant collapse, though their lambent glow will give away your position in the dark.  The enchantment will last several blows before collapsing, and may be cancelled at any time."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I swear by Apollo the Healer, by Asclepius, by Hygieia, by Panacea, and by all the gods and goddesses, making them my witnesses, that I shall deliver, according to my ability and judgment, death.\n"
"\n"
"You temporarily deal 50% more damage after being hurt.  The first time you bandage or disinfect a limb, it instantly heals by 10hp in addition to normal effects."
msgstr ""
"I swear by Apollo the Healer, by Asclepius, by Hygieia, by Panacea, and by all the gods and goddesses, making them my witnesses, that I shall deliver, according to my ability and judgement, death.\n"
"\n"
"You temporarily deal 50% more damage after being hurt.  The first time you bandage or disinfect a limb, it instantly heals by 10hp in addition to normal effects."

msgid "Your arms fall down paralyzed, and your weapon tumbles to the ground!"
msgstr "Your arms fall down paralysed, and your weapon tumbles to the ground!"

msgid "You prowl the forest with your nestmates in search of prey - you're a strong brood with bright feathers and sharp talons, but fortune seems to elude you lately.  You take them towards the edge of the forest, where the air always smells of smoke, and sneak up on a pack of monkeys with too-colorful fur sitting on a fallen tree and chattering amongst themselves.  The smallest notices you and waves excitedly, just before you pounce."
msgstr "You prowl the forest with your nestmates in search of prey - you're a strong brood with bright feathers and sharp talons, but fortune seems to elude you lately.  You take them towards the edge of the forest, where the air always smells of smoke, and sneak up on a pack of monkeys with too-colourful fur sitting on a fallen tree and chattering amongst themselves.  The smallest notices you and waves excitedly, just before you pounce."

msgid "Clouds surround you as you soar through the sky.  You look down and see the wilderness stretching out as far as the eye can see, but you can't stay here.  You need to go somewhere else, to the land of warmth and plenty.  Your eyes wander over your beautiful wings propelling you along, and you're mesmerized by their rhythmic beating.  Much better than your…hands.  You have hands, not wings.  Not yet."
msgstr "Clouds surround you as you soar through the sky.  You look down and see the wilderness stretching out as far as the eye can see, but you can't stay here.  You need to go somewhere else, to the land of warmth and plenty.  Your eyes wander over your beautiful wings propelling you along, and you're mesmerised by their rhythmic beating.  Much better than your…hands.  You have hands, not wings.  Not yet."

msgid ""
"After another day of dazed mundanity you make your way back home to your dingy cellar apartment, but miss a step and fall down the stairs, landing on your face with a wet thud.  Consciousness fades, but the pain stays.  The pain, and the feeling of myriad cockroach legs running on your skin, coating your wounds in a skittering, biting cloak.\n"
"\n"
"You wake, shedding the weird apey memories, and you are stunned by a dizzying cavalcade of colors you could never have imagined before.  This is a step in the right direction, you decide, regarding your newly-expanded perspective with appreciation before the vertigo takes you."
msgstr ""
"After another day of dazed mundanity you make your way back home to your dingy cellar apartment, but miss a step and fall down the stairs, landing on your face with a wet thud.  Consciousness fades, but the pain stays.  The pain, and the feeling of myriad cockroach legs running on your skin, coating your wounds in a skittering, biting cloak.\n"
"\n"
"You wake, shedding the weird apey memories, and you are stunned by a dizzying cavalcade of colours you could never have imagined before.  This is a step in the right direction, you decide, regarding your newly-expanded perspective with appreciation before the vertigo takes you."

msgid ""
"You dream of a throbbing headache, and the feeling of an imminent molt.  You find a suitable recess, freeze in place and **push**, trying to rip your old exoskeleton up with you pressure of your new armor but nothing happens.  All the pressure seems to well up into your head, and finally you feel a wet snap and a shower of too-warm mammal ichor on your feelers.\n"
"\n"
"You wake up in a puddle of your own blood under your head, a puddle you can see despite looking straight up.  It will be some time before your eyes' crystals harden properly, but already the colors are even richer than they were before, and the world seems somehow sluggish."
msgstr ""
"You dream of a throbbing headache, and the feeling of an imminent moult.  You find a suitable recess, freeze in place and **push**, trying to rip your old exoskeleton up with you pressure of your new armour but nothing happens.  All the pressure seems to well up into your head, and finally you feel a wet snap and a shower of too-warm mammal ichor on your feelers.\n"
"\n"
"You wake up in a puddle of your own blood under your head, a puddle you can see despite looking straight up.  It will be some time before your eyes' crystals harden properly, but already the colours are even richer than they were before, and the world seems somehow sluggish."

msgid "An example armor for testing custom limb/armor interactions.  100 coverage on the first sublimb of your debug tail with little encumbrance"
msgstr "An example armour for testing custom limb/armour interactions.  100 coverage on the first sublimb of your debug tail with little encumbrance"

msgid "An example armor for testing custom limb/armor interactions.  100 coverage on the first sublimb of your debug tail with extreme encumbrance"
msgstr "An example armour for testing custom limb/armour interactions.  100 coverage on the first sublimb of your debug tail with extreme encumbrance"

msgid "The durable alloy armor which protects the sensitive components that operate your bionic arms."
msgstr "The durable alloy armour which protects the sensitive components that operate your bionic arms."

msgid "The durable alloy armor which protects the sensitive components that operate your bionic legs."
msgstr "The durable alloy armour which protects the sensitive components that operate your bionic legs."

msgid "The protective armor for the bionic tank treads which replace the legs."
msgstr "The protective armour for the bionic tank treads which replace the legs."

msgid "You remember having tiny, unassuming eyes condemned into cramped slits in your face.  No more.  Since your last molt your eyes take up most of your head, giving you unparalelled reactions at the cost of fine vision.  You wouldn't want to cover up too much of the view, however.  <color_red>This change is permanent.</color>"
msgstr "You remember having tiny, unassuming eyes condemned into cramped slits in your face.  No more.  Since your last moult your eyes take up most of your head, giving you unparalelled reactions at the cost of fine vision.  You wouldn't want to cover up too much of the view, however.  <color_red>This change is permanent.</color>"

msgid "This rare form of combat has been practiced by many legendary heroes throughout the ages.  Hylian Swordsmanship favors mobility for offense and defense by using spins, jumps, and flips to confuse enemies and strike from unexpected angles."
msgstr "This rare form of combat has been practiced by many legendary heroes throughout the ages.  Hylian Swordsmanship favours mobility for offence and defence by using spins, jumps, and flips to confuse enemies and strike from unexpected angles."

msgid "Panzer Kunst or \"Armor Art\" is a futuristic martial art devised for cyborgs fighting in zero-gravity environments."
msgstr "Panzer Kunst or \"Armour Art\" is a futuristic martial art devised for cyborgs fighting in zero-gravity environments."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\"Armor Penetration\"\n"
"By attuning to the rhythm of your opponent, you can strike where their guard is the weakest.\n"
"\n"
"+1 accuracy, armor penetration increased by 50% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"\"Armour Penetration\"\n"
"By attuning to the rhythm of your opponent, you can strike where their guard is the weakest.\n"
"\n"
"+1 accuracy, armour penetration increased by 50% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Boosts your defense after you get hit.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armor increased by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"Boosts your defence after you get hit.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armour increased by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."

msgid ""
"Each attack against your opponents slowly steels your defenses.\n"
"\n"
"+1 bash, cut, and stab armor.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 5 times."
msgstr ""
"Each attack against your opponents slowly steels your defences.\n"
"\n"
"+1 bash, cut, and stab armour.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 5 times."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You maintain a steady stance that improves your combat prowess.  However, moving too much will break your stance.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage, +2 bash, cut, and stab armor."
msgstr ""
"You maintain a steady stance that improves your combat prowess.  However, moving too much will break your stance.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage, +2 bash, cut, and stab armour."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are unable to maintain your Surefoot Stance and must stop moving for a short time to regain its benefits.\n"
"\n"
"-10% damage, -2 bash, cut, and stab armor.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"You are unable to maintain your Surefoot Stance and must stop moving for a short time to regain its benefits.\n"
"\n"
"-10% damage, -2 bash, cut, and stab armour.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."

msgid ""
"With a powerful strike, you further fortify yourself again counterattacks!\n"
"\n"
"+5 bash, cut, and stab armor.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"With a powerful strike, you further fortify yourself again counterattacks!\n"
"\n"
"+5 bash, cut, and stab armour.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."

msgid "You are trained in the ways of the Jedi.  Your knowledge allows you to utilize a form of lightsaber combat."
msgstr "You are trained in the ways of the Jedi.  Your knowledge allows you to utilise a form of lightsaber combat."

msgid "necrotizing"
msgstr "necrotising"

msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Crystallize Mana)"
msgstr "Dabbler (Crystallise Mana)"

msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  In your case, Crystallize Mana.  Sure, it ruined your social life and you slept for 12 hours a day, but you made a tidy sum of money producing mana crystals for mages who needed them.  Too bad all that money is useless now."
msgstr "You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  In your case, Crystallise Mana.  Sure, it ruined your social life and you slept for 12 hours a day, but you made a tidy sum of money producing mana crystals for mages who needed them.  Too bad all that money is useless now."

