msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  In your case, Sound Bomb.  You mostly used it for jokes, to play pranks on your friends and annoy the neighborhood dogs, but it's proven its worth now at the end of the world."
msgstr "You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  In your case, Sound Bomb.  You mostly used it for jokes, to play pranks on your friends and annoy the neighbourhood dogs, but it's proven its worth now at the end of the world."

