msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Utility Molding)"
msgstr "Dabbler (Utility Moulding)"

msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  In your case, Utility Molding.  You read a pamphlet once entitled, \"One Spell is All You Need!\" and thought it seemed like a good idea.  And true, maybe you've never needed a mining pick before, but the ability to all up a knife or a shovel or a hammer whenever you want has come in handy countless times."
msgstr "You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  In your case, Utility Moulding.  You read a pamphlet once entitled, \"One Spell is All You Need!\" and thought it seemed like a good idea.  And true, maybe you've never needed a mining pick before, but the ability to all up a knife or a shovel or a hammer whenever you want has come in handy countless times."

