msgid "%1$s lashes you with its flaming whip, but fails to penetrate your armor!"
msgstr "%1$s lashes you with its flaming whip, but fails to penetrate your armour!"

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s lashes <npcname> with its flaming whip, but fails to penetrate their armor!"
msgstr "%1$s lashes <npcname> with its flaming whip, but fails to penetrate their armour!"

#, c-format
msgid "The %1$s tries to hit you, but fails to penetrate your armor!"
msgstr "The %1$s tries to hit you, but fails to penetrate your armour!"

#, c-format
msgid "The %1$s tries to hit <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armor!"
msgstr "The %1$s tries to hit <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armour!"

msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You found a pamphlet with bright colors claiming you can be a Wizard, oddly serene with the world falling down around you."
msgstr "You found a pamphlet with bright colours claiming you can be a Wizard, oddly serene with the world falling down around you."

msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You found a pamphlet with bright colors claiming you can be a Wizard, oddly serene with the world falling down around you."
msgstr "You found a pamphlet with bright colours claiming you can be a Wizard, oddly serene with the world falling down around you."

msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You are an expert in dimensionalism, with its most common example being teleportation magic, that is the reason why you could survive while your colleagues could not.  Your only hope is that your highly specialized skills will continue keeping you alive."
msgstr "You are an expert in dimensionalism, with its most common example being teleportation magic, that is the reason why you could survive while your colleagues could not.  Your only hope is that your highly specialised skills will continue keeping you alive."

msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You are an expert in dimensionalism, with its most common example being teleportation magic, that is the reason why you could survive while your colleagues could not.  Your only hope is that your highly specialized skills will continue keeping you alive."
msgstr "You are an expert in dimensionalism, with its most common example being teleportation magic, that is the reason why you could survive while your colleagues could not.  Your only hope is that your highly specialised skills will continue keeping you alive."

msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You were lucky enough to find a weird flask that refills itself with whiskey!  You now spend your days just waiting for every refill and keeping it from the hands of any envious neighbor of yours."
msgstr "You were lucky enough to find a weird flask that refills itself with whiskey!  You now spend your days just waiting for every refill and keeping it from the hands of any envious neighbour of yours."

msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You were lucky enough to find a weird flask that refills itself with whiskey!  You now spend your days just waiting for every refill and keeping it from the hands of any envious neighbor of yours."
msgstr "You were lucky enough to find a weird flask that refills itself with whiskey!  You now spend your days just waiting for every refill and keeping it from the hands of any envious neighbour of yours."

msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "For a long time you lived in the wild, free of interference from whatever inhabited outside the woods, now that the woods are collapsing you finally return to civilization."
msgstr "For a long time you lived in the wild, free of interference from whatever inhabited outside the woods, now that the woods are collapsing you finally return to civilisation."

msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "For a long time you lived in the wild, free of interference from whatever inhabited outside the woods, now that the woods are collapsing you finally return to civilization."
msgstr "For a long time you lived in the wild, free of interference from whatever inhabited outside the woods, now that the woods are collapsing you finally return to civilisation."

msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You were a skillful and committed archer druid, making constant excursions to the forests in which you dedicated yourself to living off of and with what nature had to offer you.  You were returning from your last travel when civilization fell upon itself."
msgstr "You were a skillful and committed archer druid, making constant excursions to the forests in which you dedicated yourself to living off of and with what nature had to offer you.  You were returning from your last travel when civilisation fell upon itself."

msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You were a skillful and committed archer druid, making constant excursions to the forests in which you dedicated yourself to living off of and with what nature had to offer you.  You were returning from your last travel when civilization fell upon itself."
msgstr "You were a skillful and committed archer druid, making constant excursions to the forests in which you dedicated yourself to living off of and with what nature had to offer you.  You were returning from your last travel when civilisation fell upon itself."

msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "A year of enrollment in a wizard's academy has taught you patience, wisdom, and a handful of useful spells.  With the teachers converted into the undead and classes canceled, the final lesson has begun."
msgstr "A year of enrolment in a wizard's academy has taught you patience, wisdom, and a handful of useful spells.  With the teachers converted into the undead and classes cancelled, the final lesson has begun."

msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "A year of enrollment in a wizard's academy has taught you patience, wisdom, and a handful of useful spells.  With the teachers converted into the undead and classes canceled, the final lesson has begun."
msgstr "A year of enrolment in a wizard's academy has taught you patience, wisdom, and a handful of useful spells.  With the teachers converted into the undead and classes cancelled, the final lesson has begun."

msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "After failing out of medical school, you took their mundane methods and combined it with magic to save your patients.  Now that they all want to kill you, the lack of a license is the least of your worries."
msgstr "After failing out of medical school, you took their mundane methods and combined it with magic to save your patients.  Now that they all want to kill you, the lack of a licence is the least of your worries."

msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "After failing out of medical school, you took their mundane methods and combined it with magic to save your patients.  Now that they all want to kill you, the lack of a license is the least of your worries."
msgstr "After failing out of medical school, you took their mundane methods and combined it with magic to save your patients.  Now that they all want to kill you, the lack of a licence is the least of your worries."

msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Hy-Brasilean ambassadorial honor guard"
msgstr "Hy-Brasilean ambassadorial honour guard"

msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Hy-Brasilean ambassadorial honor guard"
msgstr "Hy-Brasilean ambassadorial honour guard"

msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "The ancient druidic art of taking animal forms had mostly fallen out of favor by the modern era, since most people didn't need to be a bear in their daily lives and even if they did transform into a raven, they still had to physically fly to their destination and couldn't check the internet for directions.  You, however, studied the ancient arts and gained the ability to transform yourself.  It's come in very handy since the world ended."
msgstr "The ancient druidic art of taking animal forms had mostly fallen out of favour by the modern era, since most people didn't need to be a bear in their daily lives and even if they did transform into a raven, they still had to physically fly to their destination and couldn't check the internet for directions.  You, however, studied the ancient arts and gained the ability to transform yourself.  It's come in very handy since the world ended."

msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "The ancient druidic art of taking animal forms had mostly fallen out of favor by the modern era, since most people didn't need to be a bear in their daily lives and even if they did transform into a raven, they still had to physically fly to their destination and couldn't check the internet for directions.  You, however, studied the ancient arts and gained the ability to transform yourself.  It's come in very handy since the world ended."
msgstr "The ancient druidic art of taking animal forms had mostly fallen out of favour by the modern era, since most people didn't need to be a bear in their daily lives and even if they did transform into a raven, they still had to physically fly to their destination and couldn't check the internet for directions.  You, however, studied the ancient arts and gained the ability to transform yourself.  It's come in very handy since the world ended."

msgid "Novice Channeling"
msgstr "Novice Channelling"

msgid "Apprentice Channeling"
msgstr "Apprentice Channelling"

msgid "You're proficient in keeping a steady hand when channeling magic for long amounts of time."
msgstr "You're proficient in keeping a steady hand when channelling magic for long amounts of time."

msgid "Master Channeling"
msgstr "Master Channelling"

msgid "Summons ghostly foxfire worked from living marsh vapor to lead your enemies astray.  With more experience, this spell can conjure multiple ghost lights."
msgstr "Summons ghostly foxfire worked from living marsh vapour to lead your enemies astray.  With more experience, this spell can conjure multiple ghost lights."

msgid "You pour mana into an unwilling and unprepared vessel, causing cellular break-down, internal hemorrhaging, muddling ley lines, and overcharging electronics.  The more powerful the spell, the faster the damage happens.  Immensely gruesome and crude, it was once illegal world-wide, not that it matters now."
msgstr "You pour mana into an unwilling and unprepared vessel, causing cellular break-down, internal haemorrhaging, muddling ley lines, and overcharging electronics.  The more powerful the spell, the faster the damage happens.  Immensely gruesome and crude, it was once illegal world-wide, not that it matters now."

msgid ""
"Sever the connections between your spirit and the spirits of everyone around you, rendering them incapable of perceiving you; the light might hit their eyes and the sounds their ears, but they cannot recognize what those impressions mean.  Anything outside the spell's area of effect will have no trouble spotting you.\n"
"\n"
"This spell does not affect any target without a spirit, such as a robot."
msgstr ""
"Sever the connections between your spirit and the spirits of everyone around you, rendering them incapable of perceiving you; the light might hit their eyes and the sounds their ears, but they cannot recognise what those impressions mean.  Anything outside the spell's area of effect will have no trouble spotting you.\n"
"\n"
"This spell does not affect any target without a spirit, such as a robot."

msgid "Grow a pair of lashing tentacles from your shoulders.  While not as long as the Vicious Tentacle, they will strike anyone in melee with you.  You cannot wear rigid armor that covers the shoulders with them."
msgstr "Grow a pair of lashing tentacles from your shoulders.  While not as long as the Vicious Tentacle, they will strike anyone in melee with you.  You cannot wear rigid armour that covers the shoulders with them."

msgid "Crystallize Mana"
msgstr "Crystallise Mana"

msgid "Crystallizes mana into solid form."
msgstr "Crystallises mana into solid form."

msgid "A favorite of overworked mages and dilettantes who, this spell makes it much easier to fall asleep regardless of how tired you are."
msgstr "A favourite of overworked mages and dilettantes who, this spell makes it much easier to fall asleep regardless of how tired you are."

msgid "Return crystallized mana into raw mana and absorb it, restoring some of your mana.  The process is slow and not very efficient, but it's easier to transport than mana potions."
msgstr "Return crystallised mana into raw mana and absorb it, restoring some of your mana.  The process is slow and not very efficient, but it's easier to transport than mana potions."

msgid "You slowly crush the crystallized mana and as it flares into a burst of light, absorb the now-free mana."
msgstr "You slowly crush the crystallised mana and as it flares into a burst of light, absorb the now-free mana."

msgid "Your vision shifts in a flash of colors and you reappear elsewhere."
msgstr "Your vision shifts in a flash of colours and you reappear elsewhere."

msgid "You summon a gift of the earth which will purify water.  Rapidly degrades if not utilized."
msgstr "You summon a gift of the earth which will purify water.  Rapidly degrades if not utilised."

msgid "You focus on the bounty of nature around you and commune with it, improving your health and mood and calming nearby wildlife.  This spell may only be cast outdoors away from civilization."
msgstr "You focus on the bounty of nature around you and commune with it, improving your health and mood and calming nearby wildlife.  This spell may only be cast outdoors away from civilisation."

msgid ""
"Slowly heal your wounds by drawing on the power of nature.\n"
"\n"
"You must be <color_yellow>outdoors and in a natural area</color> away from civilization to cast Restoration."
msgstr ""
"Slowly heal your wounds by drawing on the power of nature.\n"
"\n"
"You must be <color_yellow>outdoors and in a natural area</color> away from civilisation to cast Restoration."

msgid "Blend in the wilds and urge them to speed your passage.  Trees bend out of the way, bushes do not hinder you, and even grass subtly moves your feet along.  The spell cannot be cast near civilization and similarly will fade if your travels take you out of the wilds."
msgstr "Blend in the wilds and urge them to speed your passage.  Trees bend out of the way, bushes do not hinder you, and even grass subtly moves your feet along.  The spell cannot be cast near civilisation and similarly will fade if your travels take you out of the wilds."

msgid "As you approach civilization, your spell fades."
msgstr "As you approach civilisation, your spell fades."

msgid "Envelops your entire body in armor formed from living rock, encumbering yet protective."
msgstr "Envelops your entire body in armour formed from living rock, encumbering yet protective."

msgid "Envelops your entire body in armor formed from living rock, encumbering yet protective.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have started to design your own version."
msgstr "Envelops your entire body in armour formed from living rock, encumbering yet protective.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have started to design your own version."

msgid "Reactive Armor"
msgstr "Reactive Armour"

msgid "Utility Molding"
msgstr "Utility Moulding"

msgid "While holding an item made of natural metal or stone, mold it with your hands, work to repairing any flaws and restoring its condition.  Note that some items may still not be repaired."
msgstr "While holding an item made of natural metal or stone, mould it with your hands, work to repairing any flaws and restoring its condition.  Note that some items may still not be repaired."

msgid "Frost Armor"
msgstr "Frost Armour"

msgid "Enhanced Frost Armor"
msgstr "Enhanced Frost Armour"

msgid "Like the bonfire gathers revelers around it, the kelvinist becomes the life of the party, as their eyes shine with passion and their voice burns with the heat of their conviction.  You will be more convincing while this spell is in effect.  Before the Cataclysm, this was one of the most common spells that apprentices were desperate to learn and master mages were reluctant to teach."
msgstr "Like the bonfire gathers revellers around it, the kelvinist becomes the life of the party, as their eyes shine with passion and their voice burns with the heat of their conviction.  You will be more convincing while this spell is in effect.  Before the Cataclysm, this was one of the most common spells that apprentices were desperate to learn and master mages were reluctant to teach."

msgid "Summons a well of gravity centered on the targeted location.  Dealing bashing damage to all creatures in the affected area."
msgstr "Summons a well of gravity centred on the targeted location.  Dealing bashing damage to all creatures in the affected area."

msgid "This ritual forces small amounts of mana to crystallize out into intricate patterns, making a rune attuned to Magi.  You can use the rune as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr "This ritual forces small amounts of mana to crystallise out into intricate patterns, making a rune attuned to Magi.  You can use the rune as a catalyst for recipes."

msgid ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the sensitivity that your body has to mana, granting you the Lesser Mana Sensitivity trait.  The ritual must take place in a natural location away (at least 4 OM tiles) from buildings, roads, or other evidence of civilization.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft skill."
msgstr ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the sensitivity that your body has to mana, granting you the Lesser Mana Sensitivity trait.  The ritual must take place in a natural location away (at least 4 OM tiles) from buildings, roads, or other evidence of civilisation.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft skill."

msgid ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the sensitivity that your body has to mana, granting you the Mana Sensitivity trait.  You must already have the Lesser Mana Sensitivity trait for the spell to take full effect.  The ritual must take place in a natural location far away (at least 15 OM tiles) from buildings, roads, or other evidence of civilization.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft skill."
msgstr ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the sensitivity that your body has to mana, granting you the Mana Sensitivity trait.  You must already have the Lesser Mana Sensitivity trait for the spell to take full effect.  The ritual must take place in a natural location far away (at least 15 OM tiles) from buildings, roads, or other evidence of civilisation.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft skill."

msgid "Crystallizes mana into solid form.  Your physiological changes have made this spell much more efficient and easier to cast."
msgstr "Crystallises mana into solid form.  Your physiological changes have made this spell much more efficient and easier to cast."

msgid "Ionization"
msgstr "Ionisation"

msgid "Mage Armor"
msgstr "Mage Armour"

msgid "Evil will not make it through your defenses if your faith is strong enough!"
msgstr "Evil will not make it through your defences if your faith is strong enough!"

msgid "Enhanced Mage Armor"
msgstr "Enhanced Mage Armour"

msgid "Evil will not make it through your defenses if your faith is strong enough!  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have started to design your own version."
msgstr "Evil will not make it through your defences if your faith is strong enough!  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have started to design your own version."

msgid "You overcharge your internal batteries to send a semi-directed beam from your face.  The inventor of this spell must have had some weird sense of humor."
msgstr "You overcharge your internal batteries to send a semi-directed beam from your face.  The inventor of this spell must have had some weird sense of humour."

msgid "You overcharge your bionic energy through what ley lines you have left, and channel it through the center of your face."
msgstr "You overcharge your bionic energy through what ley lines you have left, and channel it through the centre of your face."

msgid "Make a manafusion trap, stabilizing manafusion bombs and giving you some of the excess mana."
msgstr "Make a manafusion trap, stabilising manafusion bombs and giving you some of the excess mana."

msgid "A more advanced version of Banishment, which is a ritual spell that attempts to banish a monster.  Being closely related to blood magic, the Blood Mage is much more specialized to use a spell like this."
msgstr "A more advanced version of Banishment, which is a ritual spell that attempts to banish a monster.  Being closely related to blood magic, the Blood Mage is much more specialised to use a spell like this."

msgid "Create a sturdy shell that wraps around your body, bestowing a sturdy defense."
msgstr "Create a sturdy shell that wraps around your body, bestowing a sturdy defence."

msgid "Cause a localized earthquake, knocking down enemies and overturning the earth."
msgstr "Cause a localised earthquake, knocking down enemies and overturning the earth."

msgid "Terra Armor"
msgstr "Terra Armour"

msgid "Cover yourself in dense, invisible energy of Earth.  Higher level increase your defense abilities."
msgstr "Cover yourself in dense, invisible energy of Earth.  Higher level increase your defence abilities."

msgid "Graviton Polarization"
msgstr "Graviton Polarisation"

msgid "Changes and amplifies gravitational pull towards a point you choose, even through walls.  Pulls in items and deals bashing damage in its center."
msgstr "Changes and amplifies gravitational pull towards a point you choose, even through walls.  Pulls in items and deals bashing damage in its centre."

msgid "Magnetize a bullet, and fire it at supersonic speeds by applying an opposite magnetic force to the bullet.  Leaves a trail of sparks"
msgstr "Magnetise a bullet, and fire it at supersonic speeds by applying an opposite magnetic force to the bullet.  Leaves a trail of sparks"

msgid "Creates a conductive channel from the caster's hand to the target by ionizing air molecules using a high-powered laser beam, then sends a powerful half million volt charge down the channel."
msgstr "Creates a conductive channel from the caster's hand to the target by ionising air molecules using a high-powered laser beam, then sends a powerful half million volt charge down the channel."

msgid "Cool down every creature in range 'till their flesh cracks, bones shatter, and armor fractures."
msgstr "Cool down every creature in range 'till their flesh cracks, bones shatter, and armour fractures."

msgid "You feel revitalized."
msgstr "You feel revitalised."

msgid "Long thorns grow through your skin, clothes, and armor."
msgstr "Long thorns grow through your skin, clothes, and armour."

msgid "You are exhausted from channeling a lot of mana."
msgstr "You are exhausted from channelling a lot of mana."

msgid "Channeling so much mana is making you tired"
msgstr "Channelling so much mana is making you tired"

msgid "You can feel Mother Nature welcoming you, revitalizing your body and calming the natural fauna around you."
msgstr "You can feel Mother Nature welcoming you, revitalising your body and calming the natural fauna around you."

msgid "The air around you shimmers in a multitude of colors."
msgstr "The air around you shimmers in a multitude of colours."

msgid "A machine used for the installation and removal of bionics.  The name 'Autodoc' is something of a misnomer, as safe operation is only guaranteed with a ritual circle of technomancers.  The entire surface is carved with runes so fine that they look like spiraling circuitry from a distance."
msgstr "A machine used for the installation and removal of bionics.  The name 'Autodoc' is something of a misnomer, as safe operation is only guaranteed with a ritual circle of technomancers.  The entire surface is carved with runes so fine that they look like spiralling circuitry from a distance."

msgid "A knotted wooden table, looking more like it was grown rather than assembled.  You could sit down at it to eat like a civilized person."
msgstr "A knotted wooden table, looking more like it was grown rather than assembled.  You could sit down at it to eat like a civilised person."

msgid "Small bush, that looks like a pair of dragon curves, with a flower in the very center.  The branches of the plant can be used as a perfect ruler."
msgstr "Small bush, that looks like a pair of dragon curves, with a flower in the very centre.  The branches of the plant can be used as a perfect ruler."

msgid ""
"A silver colored vine, whose luminescent flowers will only bloom during night.\n"
"\n"
"Amazingly rare, it grows only in places where heroic deeds took place, or so it's believed."
msgstr ""
"A silver coloured vine, whose luminescent flowers will only bloom during night.\n"
"\n"
"Amazingly rare, it grows only in places where heroic deeds took place, or so it's believed."

msgid "Dark colored leaves and bitter roots, firmly entrenched in untrodden earth.  They can be used to ward against evil, or to attract it."
msgstr "Dark coloured leaves and bitter roots, firmly entrenched in untrodden earth.  They can be used to ward against evil, or to attract it."

msgid "Thin stalks colored deep yellow, crowned with blue feather-like leaves."
msgstr "Thin stalks coloured deep yellow, crowned with blue feather-like leaves."

msgid "This wall seems to be made up of a combination of webbing, wood splinters, detritus, and some kind of dark-colored resin."
msgstr "This wall seems to be made up of a combination of webbing, wood splinters, detritus, and some kind of dark-coloured resin."

msgid "Strong alcohol, infused with mana and concentrated into a liquid that can stabilize spells into liquid form.  You can still drink it, if you want."
msgstr "Strong alcohol, infused with mana and concentrated into a liquid that can stabilise spells into liquid form.  You can still drink it, if you want."

msgid "The great plates from behind a bulette's head have always been prized for use in shield and armor making."
msgstr "The great plates from behind a bulette's head have always been prized for use in shield and armour making."

msgid "A large piece of demon spider exoskeleton, painstakingly cut from the corpse of an adult demon spider.  A plate of this size can be used to create armor plating."
msgstr "A large piece of demon spider exoskeleton, painstakingly cut from the corpse of an adult demon spider.  A plate of this size can be used to create armour plating."

msgid "Mana bombs are powerful explosive devices developed by a little-known alchemist group for use against enemy spellcasters.  These bombs are fueled by pure arcane energy and can kill instantly.  The exact workings are unclear, but they appear to use some kind of massive mana burn."
msgstr "Mana bombs are powerful explosive devices developed by a little-known alchemist group for use against enemy spellcasters.  These bombs are fuelled by pure arcane energy and can kill instantly.  The exact workings are unclear, but they appear to use some kind of massive mana burn."

msgid "A pair of stabilized alchemist bombs with concentrated mana linking them.  Any movement in the mana linkage zone provokes an extremely powerful explosion in a small area."
msgstr "A pair of stabilised alchemist bombs with concentrated mana linking them.  Any movement in the mana linkage zone provokes an extremely powerful explosion in a small area."

msgid "Ichaival, the bow of Odin.  Rumored to fire 10 arrows with every pull of the string.  It has gold and silver ornaments on it, as well as an ornate Raven."
msgstr "Ichaival, the bow of Odin.  Rumoured to fire 10 arrows with every pull of the string.  It has gold and silver ornaments on it, as well as an ornate Raven."

msgid "demon chitin armor"
msgid_plural "demon chitin armors"
msgstr[0] "demon chitin armour"
msgstr[1] "demon chitin armours"

msgid "Leg and body armor crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned red exoskeletons of demon spiders.  Fire-resistant and very durable."
msgstr "Leg and body armour crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned red exoskeletons of demon spiders.  Fire-resistant and very durable."

msgid "demon chitin horse armor"
msgid_plural "demon chitin horse armors"
msgstr[0] "demon chitin horse armour"
msgstr[1] "demon chitin horse armours"

msgid "Crystallized Mana Nose Replacement CBM"
msgid_plural "Crystallized Mana Nose Replacement CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Crystallised Mana Nose Replacement CBM"
msgstr[1] "Crystallised Mana Nose Replacement CBMs"

msgid "A large gem made with crystallized mana and some other stabilizing metals.  Comes with a specially designed power pack (installed into the skull) that does not interfere with your mana ley lines.  WARNING: for Technomancer use only.  By using this spell you are waiving all liability of Frikken Laser Beams Inc.  and its subsidiaries."
msgstr "A large gem made with crystallised mana and some other stabilising metals.  Comes with a specially designed power pack (installed into the skull) that does not interfere with your mana ley lines.  WARNING: for Technomancer use only.  By using this spell you are waiving all liability of Frikken Laser Beams Inc.  and its subsidiaries."

msgid "Crystallized Mana Nose Replacement"
msgstr "Crystallised Mana Nose Replacement"

msgid "The ultimate in concealable personal defense, thin filaments are implanted along the ley lines in both of your arms leading to embedded mana crystals in your hands, allowing you to launch blasts of pure magical energy at nearby targets.  The only disadvantage is that it draws on your own personal mana supply rather than bionic power."
msgstr "The ultimate in concealable personal defence, thin filaments are implanted along the ley lines in both of your arms leading to embedded mana crystals in your hands, allowing you to launch blasts of pure magical energy at nearby targets.  The only disadvantage is that it draws on your own personal mana supply rather than bionic power."

msgid "A carefully folded raw hide harvested from a black dragon.  It is a large enough piece that it is workable to make armor, and with enough scales you could make scale mail."
msgstr "A carefully folded raw hide harvested from a black dragon.  It is a large enough piece that it is workable to make armour, and with enough scales you could make scale mail."

msgid "Prepared hide from a black dragon.  Hard, acid-resistant, and with more scales could make a suit of armor as hard as steel and half as heavy."
msgstr "Prepared hide from a black dragon.  Hard, acid-resistant, and with more scales could make a suit of armour as hard as steel and half as heavy."

msgid "black dragonscale armor"
msgid_plural "black dragonscale armors"
msgstr[0] "black dragonscale armour"
msgstr[1] "black dragonscale armours"

msgid "black dragonhide armor"
msgid_plural "black dragonhide armors"
msgstr[0] "black dragonhide armour"
msgstr[1] "black dragonhide armours"

msgid "A full suit of very durable black dragonhide armor.  It comes with all the accoutrements that cover your torso, legs, and arms, with the benefit of being very light and flexible."
msgstr "A full suit of very durable black dragonhide armour.  It comes with all the accoutrements that cover your torso, legs, and arms, with the benefit of being very light and flexible."

msgid "A massive full suit of very durable black dragonhide armor.  It comes with all the accoutrements that cover your torso, legs, and arms; sized to fit even the strangest of bodies."
msgstr "A massive full suit of very durable black dragonhide armour.  It comes with all the accoutrements that cover your torso, legs, and arms; sized to fit even the strangest of bodies."

msgid "A history of the treatment of the \"Empty\", people born with the inability to master even the simplest of spells.  From persecution to favored positions (since rulers could be sure the Empty had no magical means of plotting against them), this book chronicles their treatment across the ages."
msgstr "A history of the treatment of the \"Empty\", people born with the inability to master even the simplest of spells.  From persecution to favoured positions (since rulers could be sure the Empty had no magical means of plotting against them), this book chronicles their treatment across the ages."

msgid "This elaborate contraption of wooden sticks under tension and tightly wound strings has a pebble with a magus rune on in its center.  Once activated, this device will transform the stored elastic potential energy into arcane energy, boosting your caster level of magus spells by 1 for as long as the stored energy lasts."
msgstr "This elaborate contraption of wooden sticks under tension and tightly wound strings has a pebble with a magus rune on in its centre.  Once activated, this device will transform the stored elastic potential energy into arcane energy, boosting your caster level of magus spells by 1 for as long as the stored energy lasts."

msgid "This intricate contraption consists of fine gears, screw drivers, belts, pulleys, springs and other clockwork.  The gearwork is contained in a casing of magically treated glass.  An elegantly drawn magus rune is caged in the center, and a wind-up key extends out of the casing, allowing the device to be powered.  Once wound up, it will boost your magus caster level by 2 for as long as the energy lasts."
msgstr "This intricate contraption consists of fine gears, screw drivers, belts, pulleys, springs and other clockwork.  The gearwork is contained in a casing of magically treated glass.  An elegantly drawn magus rune is caged in the centre, and a wind-up key extends out of the casing, allowing the device to be powered.  Once wound up, it will boost your magus caster level by 2 for as long as the energy lasts."

msgid "This intricate contraption consists of fine gears, screw drivers, belts, pulleys, springs and other clockwork parts moving in a mesmerizing dance.  The gearwork is contained in a casing of magically treated glass and gives off a soft ticking noise.  An elegantly drawn magus rune in the center is being spun and rotated in a neverending complex dance of arcane energy.  The wind-up key extending from the casing slowly spins back into its original position.  You feel empowered, as your caster level of magus spells is boosted by 2."
msgstr "This intricate contraption consists of fine gears, screw drivers, belts, pulleys, springs and other clockwork parts moving in a mesmerising dance.  The gearwork is contained in a casing of magically treated glass and gives off a soft ticking noise.  An elegantly drawn magus rune in the centre is being spun and rotated in a neverending complex dance of arcane energy.  The wind-up key extending from the casing slowly spins back into its original position.  You feel empowered, as your caster level of magus spells is boosted by 2."

msgid "A sinister looking staff, made of wood and with a red orb of crystallized mana at the handle.  The orb and its rune faintly glow with magic when you cast spells.  Wielding it slightly increases your mana regeneration and allows you to cast the bleed spell."
msgstr "A sinister looking staff, made of wood and with a red orb of crystallised mana at the handle.  The orb and its rune faintly glow with magic when you cast spells.  Wielding it slightly increases your mana regeneration and allows you to cast the bleed spell."

msgid "bracer of lesser defense"
msgid_plural "bracers of lesser defense"
msgstr[0] "bracer of lesser defence"
msgstr[1] "bracers of lesser defence"

msgid "bracer of greater defense"
msgid_plural "bracers of greater defense"
msgstr[0] "bracer of greater defence"
msgstr[1] "bracers of greater defence"

msgid "A well-made pair of old-fashioned pants, made of silvery iridescent material.  Comfortable, but lacks pockets.  It shimmers as you look at it.  Made of parabolan wool, it sometimes dimly shows reflections of things here and not.  This particular one has piratical flairs and glitters with enchantment."
msgstr "A well-made pair of old-fashioned trousers, made of silvery iridescent material.  Comfortable, but lacks pockets.  It shimmers as you look at it.  Made of parabolan wool, it sometimes dimly shows reflections of things here and not.  This particular one has piratical flairs and glitters with enchantment."

msgid "A well-made pair of old-fashioned pants, made of silvery iridescent material.  Comfortable, but lacks pockets.  It shimmers as you look at it.  Made of parabolan wool, it sometimes dimly shows reflections of things here and not."
msgstr "A well-made pair of old-fashioned trousers, made of silvery iridescent material.  Comfortable, but lacks pockets.  It shimmers as you look at it.  Made of parabolan wool, it sometimes dimly shows reflections of things here and not."

msgid "A padded greatcoat assembled by quilting rarely available iridescent wool that was intended as standalone armor, this is half the thickness of a historical gambeson due to the quality of its material.  Famed for its resistance to arrows in olden times, one might wonder how effective it might be against modern projectiles."
msgstr "A padded greatcoat assembled by quilting rarely available iridescent wool that was intended as standalone armour, this is half the thickness of a historical gambeson due to the quality of its material.  Famed for its resistance to arrows in olden times, one might wonder how effective it might be against modern projectiles."

msgid "parabolan wool heavy arming pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of parabolan wool heavy arming pants"
msgstr[0] "parabolan wool heavy arming trousers"
msgstr[1] "pairs of parabolan wool heavy arming trousers"

msgid "Tough, fairly thick iridescent wool pants worn on their own alongside a gambeson.  These are made of layered wool quilting offering very solid protection, specifically for the purposes of stopping arrows."
msgstr "Tough, fairly thick iridescent wool trousers worn on their own alongside a gambeson.  These are made of layered wool quilting offering very solid protection, specifically for the purposes of stopping arrows."

msgid "Thick iridescent wool gauntlets worn in lieu of metal or leather armor.  These are much less encumbering and warm than conventional wool, but they offer excellent protection against arrows."
msgstr "Thick iridescent wool gauntlets worn in lieu of metal or leather armour.  These are much less encumbering and warm than conventional wool, but they offer excellent protection against arrows."

msgid "Rather than using purely wipe media, an additional localized silence spell in this tube quiets gunshots going through to hearing-safe levels."
msgstr "Rather than using purely wipe media, an additional localised silence spell in this tube quiets gunshots going through to hearing-safe levels."

msgid "Adds a blue dot optic made from crystallized mana to the top of your gun, replacing the iron sights.  Increases accuracy and weight."
msgstr "Adds a blue dot optic made from crystallised mana to the top of your gun, replacing the iron sights.  Increases accuracy and weight."

msgid "aluminum bat +1"
msgid_plural "aluminum bats +1"
msgstr[0] "aluminium bat +1"
msgstr[1] "aluminium bats +1"

msgid "aluminum bat +2"
msgid_plural "aluminum bats +2"
msgstr[0] "aluminium bat +2"
msgstr[1] "aluminium bats +2"

msgid "cavalry saber +1"
msgid_plural "cavalry sabers +1"
msgstr[0] "cavalry sabre +1"
msgstr[1] "cavalry sabres +1"

msgid "cavalry saber +2"
msgid_plural "cavalry sabers +2"
msgstr[0] "cavalry sabre +2"
msgstr[1] "cavalry sabres +2"

msgid "This is a high quality, engraved steel kit with a variety of needles, some plastic spools for thread, some small scissors, even a small heating element for melting and joining plastic.  Use a tailor's kit to customize your clothing and armor.  This uses your tailoring skill.  It also contains one of those magic spiders that constantly, if slowly, makes new thread."
msgstr "This is a high quality, engraved steel kit with a variety of needles, some plastic spools for thread, some small scissors, even a small heating element for melting and joining plastic.  Use a tailor's kit to customise your clothing and armour.  This uses your tailoring skill.  It also contains one of those magic spiders that constantly, if slowly, makes new thread."

msgid "A bow made of multiple materials to maximize energy efficiency.  There are two Druid runes embedded at the tips."
msgstr "A bow made of multiple materials to maximise energy efficiency.  There are two Druid runes embedded at the tips."

msgid "A magically-enhanced update to the Phillips & Rodgers' M47 Medusa, a  multi-caliber revolver aimed at survivalists.  While Technomancy improves the reliability with smaller cartridges, it is not as accurate as dedicated caliber revolvers due to freebore."
msgstr "A magically-enhanced update to the Phillips & Rodgers' M47 Medusa, a  multi-calibre revolver aimed at survivalists.  While Technomancy improves the reliability with smaller cartridges, it is not as accurate as dedicated calibre revolvers due to freebore."

msgid "A modernized version of the Mosin-Nagant 1891/30 by Cannith Industries, chambered in 7.62x51 NATO.  The barrel is enchanted to give bullets a minor freezing property."
msgstr "A modernised version of the Mosin-Nagant 1891/30 by Cannith Industries, chambered in 7.62x51 NATO.  The barrel is enchanted to give bullets a minor freezing property."

msgid "pair of magical armored stone gauntlets"
msgid_plural "pairs of magical armored stone gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "pair of magical armoured stone gauntlets"
msgstr[1] "pairs of magical armoured stone gauntlets"

msgid "A large pouch of tough flesh on your back, filled with tiny tentacles that grasp and hold anything you place inside.  It shifts and adjusts itself to minimize encumbrance."
msgstr "A large pouch of tough flesh on your back, filled with tiny tentacles that grasp and hold anything you place inside.  It shifts and adjusts itself to minimise encumbrance."

msgid "A magically conjured quiver, marvelously light and easy to wear despite the arrows it holds."
msgstr "A magically conjured quiver, marvellously light and easy to wear despite the arrows it holds."

msgid "A magically conjured quiver, marvelously light and easy to wear despite the arrows it holds.  This is an enhanced version, created by your increased mastery of the spell."
msgstr "A magically conjured quiver, marvellously light and easy to wear despite the arrows it holds.  This is an enhanced version, created by your increased mastery of the spell."

msgid "frost armor"
msgid_plural "frost armor"
msgstr[0] "frost armour"
msgstr[1] "frost armour"

msgid "A thin layer of magical ice, covering the entire body.  It doesn't provide much armor, instead dealing significant damage to enemies that try to attack you."
msgstr "A thin layer of magical ice, covering the entire body.  It doesn't provide much armour, instead dealing significant damage to enemies that try to attack you."

msgid "mage armor"
msgid_plural "mage armor"
msgstr[0] "mage armour"
msgstr[1] "mage armour"

msgid "A summoned magic armor.  It gets shinier and sturdier with each spell level and is affected by your intelligence."
msgstr "A summoned magic armour.  It gets shinier and sturdier with each spell level and is affected by your intelligence."

msgid "A three-liter container made out of transparent force.  Can be used to store liquids."
msgstr "A three-litre container made out of transparent force.  Can be used to store liquids."

msgid "A sturdy shell that wraps your body, granting a sturdy defense."
msgstr "A sturdy shell that wraps your body, granting a sturdy defence."

msgid "A smallish patch of iridescent felt; could be disassembled for parabolan wool fiber."
msgstr "A smallish patch of iridescent felt; could be disassembled for parabolan wool fibre."

msgid "A small rod of curled white petals, delicately shielding toxic pollen that will lead to an agonizing, if mercifully quick death.  Infamously used by romantic assassins, when an artistic death is deemed more important than practicality."
msgstr "A small rod of curled white petals, delicately shielding toxic pollen that will lead to an agonising, if mercifully quick death.  Infamously used by romantic assassins, when an artistic death is deemed more important than practicality."

msgid "Dark colored leaves and bitter roots, firmly tied together in a small sheaf.  It's not toxic, but many people have died trying to taste it, due to the airway obstruction."
msgstr "Dark coloured leaves and bitter roots, firmly tied together in a small sheaf.  It's not toxic, but many people have died trying to taste it, due to the airway obstruction."

msgid "The black root of a moly plant, extracted from the ground through great effort.  Rumored to grant protection to those who consume it."
msgstr "The black root of a moly plant, extracted from the ground through great effort.  Rumoured to grant protection to those who consume it."

msgid "Magic armor"
msgstr "Magic armour"

msgid "This magical armor improves with your intelligence and the spell's level."
msgstr "This magical armour improves with your intelligence and the spell's level."

msgid "crystallized mana"
msgid_plural "crystallized mana"
msgstr[0] "crystallised mana"
msgstr[1] "crystallised mana"

msgid "Some crystallized mana.  This can be reloaded into rechargeable mana crystals, but can never be unloaded."
msgstr "Some crystallised mana.  This can be reloaded into rechargeable mana crystals, but can never be unloaded."

msgid "Mjölnir, the legendary hammer of Thor.  It is rumored to be able to level mountains with a single blow.  You feel the power of Asgard coursing through the hammer."
msgstr "Mjölnir, the legendary hammer of Thor.  It is rumoured to be able to level mountains with a single blow.  You feel the power of Asgard coursing through the hammer."

msgid "Gungnir, the spear of Odin.  It is rumored to be the perfect spear, perfectly hitting any target regardless of the wielder's strength or skill.  It feels like Odin's protecting you."
msgstr "Gungnir, the spear of Odin.  It is rumoured to be the perfect spear, perfectly hitting any target regardless of the wielder's strength or skill.  It feels like Odin's protecting you."

msgid "Gram, the sword of Sigurd.  It is rumored to be the sword that slayed the legendary dragon, Fafnir.  Once said to have cleaved Regin's anvil in half, the edge is impeccable."
msgstr "Gram, the sword of Sigurd.  It is rumoured to be the sword that slayed the legendary dragon, Fafnir.  Once said to have cleaved Regin's anvil in half, the edge is impeccable."

msgid "This book details black dragons: The most evil of dragons, who live in ruins generally in swamps.  Immune to acid and breathe acid.  The book also details how to prepare its hide and craft various armors that make use of some of its acid resistance."
msgstr "This book details black dragons: The most evil of dragons, who live in ruins generally in swamps.  Immune to acid and breathe acid.  The book also details how to prepare its hide and craft various armours that make use of some of its acid resistance."

msgid "A reference book discussing the ancient and now mostly-forgot art of enchanted archery.  With firearms so convenient and taking much less training to use, it has long since fallen out of favor, but this book is so detailed you could revive it for yourself with the recipes it contains."
msgstr "A reference book discussing the ancient and now mostly-forgot art of enchanted archery.  With firearms so convenient and taking much less training to use, it has long since fallen out of favour, but this book is so detailed you could revive it for yourself with the recipes it contains."

msgid "Scroll of Crystallize Mana"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Crystallize Mana"
msgstr[0] "Scroll of Crystallise Mana"
msgstr[1] "Scrolls of Crystallise Mana"

msgid "A proper wizard is always prepared, crystallize your mana for the future!"
msgstr "A proper wizard is always prepared, crystallise your mana for the future!"

msgid "You pour mana into an unwilling and unprepared vessel, causing cellular break-down, internal hemorrhaging, leylines to become muddled, and electronics to overcharge.  Immensely gruesome, crude, and was once illegal world-wide, not that it matters now."
msgstr "You pour mana into an unwilling and unprepared vessel, causing cellular break-down, internal haemorrhaging, leylines to become muddled, and electronics to overcharge.  Immensely gruesome, crude, and was once illegal world-wide, not that it matters now."

msgid "Scroll of Reactive Armor"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Reactive Armor"
msgstr[0] "Scroll of Reactive Armour"
msgstr[1] "Scrolls of Reactive Armour"

msgid "Scroll of Utility Molding"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Utility Molding"
msgstr[0] "Scroll of Utility Moulding"
msgstr[1] "Scrolls of Utility Moulding"

msgid "Scroll of Frost Armor"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Frost Armor"
msgstr[0] "Scroll of Frost Armour"
msgstr[1] "Scrolls of Frost Armour"

msgid "Summons a well of gravity with the epicenter at the location.  Deals bashing damage to all creatures in the affected area."
msgstr "Summons a well of gravity with the epicentre at the location.  Deals bashing damage to all creatures in the affected area."

msgid "Scroll of Spiritual Armor"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Spiritual Armor"
msgstr[0] "Scroll of Spiritual Armour"
msgstr[1] "Scrolls of Spiritual Armour"

msgid "Scroll of Ionization"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Ionization"
msgstr[0] "Scroll of Ionisation"
msgstr[1] "Scrolls of Ionisation"

msgid "Summons ghostly foxfire worked from living marsh vapor, to lead your enemies astray.  With more experience, this spell can conjure multiple ghost lights."
msgstr "Summons ghostly foxfire worked from living marsh vapour, to lead your enemies astray.  With more experience, this spell can conjure multiple ghost lights."

msgid "Ignite a wooden sword to create a flaming saber."
msgstr "Ignite a wooden sword to create a flaming sabre."

msgid "Your connection with nature allows you to become one with it; you revitalize your body while in communion with the flora and fauna around you."
msgstr "Your connection with nature allows you to become one with it; you revitalise your body while in communion with the flora and fauna around you."

msgid "Someone has scribbled on this scroll in…colored pencil?  You're pretty sure whatever it does now isn't the spell's original function."
msgstr "Someone has scribbled on this scroll in…coloured pencil?  You're pretty sure whatever it does now isn't the spell's original function."

msgid "A favored spell of those hiking the Appalachian Trail, this spell increases your speed in the wilderness."
msgstr "A favoured spell of those hiking the Appalachian Trail, this spell increases your speed in the wilderness."

msgid "Turn crystallized mana back into mana you can use.  Doing that repeatedly is a great way to make huge quantities of mana vanish into the Aethereum."
msgstr "Turn crystallised mana back into mana you can use.  Doing that repeatedly is a great way to make huge quantities of mana vanish into the Aethereum."

msgid "While no longer popular in the age of nitrogen fertilizer and industrial farm equipment, copies of this tome continued to be published for years for a small audience of back-to-nature, do-it-yourself organic mage-farmers."
msgstr "While no longer popular in the age of nitrogen fertiliser and industrial farm equipment, copies of this tome continued to be published for years for a small audience of back-to-nature, do-it-yourself organic mage-farmers."

msgid "This colorful guide, full of diagrams and cartoons, teaches a couple of very basic Technomancy spells for the not-so-bright pupils."
msgstr "This colourful guide, full of diagrams and cartoons, teaches a couple of very basic Technomancy spells for the not-so-bright pupils."

msgid "A somewhat alarmist book about the ways to survive after the collapse of civilization, using simple magic to deal with common problems.  Sadly, there are no anti-zombie combat spells within."
msgstr "A somewhat alarmist book about the ways to survive after the collapse of civilisation, using simple magic to deal with common problems.  Sadly, there are no anti-zombie combat spells within."

msgid "A study of the inherent non-scalability of magical solutions to problems, touching on the difficulty of producing crystallized mana in the quantities needed for industrial use, the long time period necessary for magical materials like orichalcum, mithril, or crimsonite to reach reliability, the way that earthshaping and druidism specifically require wilderness for some of their spells, and the way that an average mage exhausts their mana pool within fifteen minutes of working on any major project without extensive study and training."
msgstr "A study of the inherent non-scalability of magical solutions to problems, touching on the difficulty of producing crystallised mana in the quantities needed for industrial use, the long time period necessary for magical materials like orichalcum, mithril, or crimsonite to reach reliability, the way that earthshaping and druidism specifically require wilderness for some of their spells, and the way that an average mage exhausts their mana pool within fifteen minutes of working on any major project without extensive study and training."

msgid "A reference tome for using magic to garden in a \"organic, traditional, earth-centered way\", as the back cover states."
msgstr "A reference tome for using magic to garden in a \"organic, traditional, earth-centred way\", as the back cover states."

msgid "This romanticized book of dubious historical accuracy details how pirates used magic to their advantage while sailing.  From better telescopes to banks of fog to hide their approach, it seems that according to this author at least, piracy was a true terror to behold."
msgstr "This romanticised book of dubious historical accuracy details how pirates used magic to their advantage while sailing.  From better telescopes to banks of fog to hide their approach, it seems that according to this author at least, piracy was a true terror to behold."

msgid "This cauldron made of demon spider chitin seems to absorb the light.  It will hold 16 liters of material and will absorb poisons from it.  It may have other properties that require discovery."
msgstr "This cauldron made of demon spider chitin seems to absorb the light.  It will hold 16 litres of material and will absorb poisons from it.  It may have other properties that require discovery."

msgid "The natural cluster of parabolan wool fibers.  Could be processed to felt patches or yarns."
msgstr "The natural cluster of parabolan wool fibres.  Could be processed to felt patches or yarns."

msgid "A folding frame made of orichalcum pipes.  Not as light as aluminum, but significantly sturdier."
msgstr "A folding frame made of orichalcum pipes.  Not as light as aluminium, but significantly sturdier."

msgid "Despite it being the size of a small dog, you can tell this is a very young spider.  Its red color is why you gave it this name; you have never seen this creature before the Cataclysm.  It is quick, and its large fangs drip with venom."
msgstr "Despite it being the size of a small dog, you can tell this is a very young spider.  Its red colour is why you gave it this name; you have never seen this creature before the Cataclysm.  It is quick, and its large fangs drip with venom."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to bite your %2$s, but glances off your armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to bite your %2$s, but glances off your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to bite <npcname>, but glances off their armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to bite <npcname>, but glances off their armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's tries to bite your %2$s, but glances off your armor."
msgstr "%1$s's tries to bite your %2$s, but glances off your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's tries to bite <npcname>, but glances off their armor."
msgstr "%1$s's tries to bite <npcname>, but glances off their armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's lunges at your %2$s, but its teeth glance off your armor."
msgstr "%1$s's lunges at your %2$s, but its teeth glance off your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's lunges at <npcname>, but its teeth glance off their armor."
msgstr "%1$s's lunges at <npcname>, but its teeth glance off their armour."

msgid "A member of a druidic order with the bloodshot eyes you've come to recognize and dread.  Patches of their skin are covered in bark and fur, leaves grow in their hair, and long claws grow from the ends of their fingers.  Protecting nature is obviously the last thing on their mind now."
msgstr "A member of a druidic order with the bloodshot eyes you've come to recognise and dread.  Patches of their skin are covered in bark and fur, leaves grow in their hair, and long claws grow from the ends of their fingers.  Protecting nature is obviously the last thing on their mind now."

msgid "Once a leader of a druidic order, this feral is barely recognizable anymore beneath the patches of bark, fur, and scales that cover their skin.  They occasionally stop and sniff the air like an animal."
msgstr "Once a leader of a druidic order, this feral is barely recognisable anymore beneath the patches of bark, fur, and scales that cover their skin.  They occasionally stop and sniff the air like an animal."

msgid "A mage gone feral, their bloodshot eyes looking to and fro as eldritch light occasionally trails from their hands.  The arcane sigils on their clothing and the rings and jewelry they wear bespeak that they were once a mage of considerable power before the Cataclysm took their mind."
msgstr "A mage gone feral, their bloodshot eyes looking to and fro as eldritch light occasionally trails from their hands.  The arcane sigils on their clothing and the rings and jewellery they wear bespeak that they were once a mage of considerable power before the Cataclysm took their mind."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s raises an arm and a blade of glowing light materializes."
msgstr "%1$s raises an arm and a blade of glowing light materialises."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s raises an arm and a suit of glowing armor appears on their body."
msgstr "%1$s raises an arm and a suit of glowing armour appears on their body."

msgid "A goblin, but like something out of history.  Over the dirty, tattered remnants of their street clothes, they're wearing improvised armor and carrying a heavy club.  They look at you like a wolf seeing a particularly juicy hunk of lamb."
msgstr "A goblin, but like something out of history.  Over the dirty, tattered remnants of their street clothes, they're wearing improvised armour and carrying a heavy club.  They look at you like a wolf seeing a particularly juicy hunk of lamb."

msgid "A goblin, but like something out of history.  Over the dirty, tattered remnants of their street clothes, they're wearing improvised armor and carrying a sling with a pouch for extra stones.  They look at you like a wolf seeing a particularly juicy hunk of lamb."
msgstr "A goblin, but like something out of history.  Over the dirty, tattered remnants of their street clothes, they're wearing improvised armour and carrying a sling with a pouch for extra stones.  They look at you like a wolf seeing a particularly juicy hunk of lamb."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves their hands and %1$s is surrounded in greenish vapors."
msgstr "%1$s waves their hands and %1$s is surrounded in greenish vapours."

msgid "An enormous wolf, a meter and a half high at the shoulder, as large as a young horse.  Tamed wargs were common as pets before the Cataclysm, but this one looks anything but tame."
msgstr "An enormous wolf, a metre and a half high at the shoulder, as large as a young horse.  Tamed wargs were common as pets before the Cataclysm, but this one looks anything but tame."

msgid "An enormous gray-green humanoid, over two meters tall with thick fur at their joints and long, tufted ears, this creature no longer has much resemblance to a goblin other than the color.  Despite their size, they move in almost complete silence and hold a long bladed weapon in their hand."
msgstr "An enormous grey-green humanoid, over two metres tall with thick fur at their joints and long, tufted ears, this creature no longer has much resemblance to a goblin other than the colour.  Despite their size, they move in almost complete silence and hold a long bladed weapon in their hand."

msgid "An enormous gray-green humanoid, over two meters tall with thick fur at their joints and long, tufted ears, this creature no longer has much resemblance to a goblin other than the color.  Despite their size, they move in almost complete silence and hold a long spear in their hand.  Strangely, you can only see them when you're looking directly at them; when in the corner of your vision they simply fade from sight."
msgstr "An enormous grey-green humanoid, over two metres tall with thick fur at their joints and long, tufted ears, this creature no longer has much resemblance to a goblin other than the colour.  Despite their size, they move in almost complete silence and hold a long spear in their hand.  Strangely, you can only see them when you're looking directly at them; when in the corner of your vision they simply fade from sight."

msgid "A tall, powerful, reptilian humanoid with a muscular tail whose skin is covered in dark gray-green scales.  They are tribal and tend to be found in caves and near water, especially in areas inhabited by dragons and wyrms.  They aren't particularly hostile, though they don't care for outsiders and are highly dangerous when provoked.  While they usually prefer to fight with their greatclubs, they are equally ferocious with their sharp teeth and claws."
msgstr "A tall, powerful, reptilian humanoid with a muscular tail whose skin is covered in dark grey-green scales.  They are tribal and tend to be found in caves and near water, especially in areas inhabited by dragons and wyrms.  They aren't particularly hostile, though they don't care for outsiders and are highly dangerous when provoked.  While they usually prefer to fight with their greatclubs, they are equally ferocious with their sharp teeth and claws."

msgid "A monstrous, green-skinned humanoid, almost three meters tall but as thin as the average human.  Trolls are renowned for their thick hides and natural regenerative ability."
msgstr "A monstrous, green-skinned humanoid, almost three metres tall but as thin as the average human.  Trolls are renowned for their thick hides and natural regenerative ability."

msgid "A monstrous, gray-skinned humanoid, almost three meters tall but as thin as the average human.  Rock trolls have rocky skin that's almost impervious to hand weapons, but they turn to stone in the sunlight."
msgstr "A monstrous, grey-skinned humanoid, almost three metres tall but as thin as the average human.  Rock trolls have rocky skin that's almost impervious to hand weapons, but they turn to stone in the sunlight."

msgid "A monstrous, green-skinned humanoid, almost three meters tall but as thin as the average human.  Sea trolls are just as mean and dangerous as trolls on land, but they can also swim and breathe in water."
msgstr "A monstrous, green-skinned humanoid, almost three metres tall but as thin as the average human.  Sea trolls are just as mean and dangerous as trolls on land, but they can also swim and breathe in water."

msgid "A large, brightly colored butterfly with crystalline wings, fluttering incongruously through the air.  This one seems to be patterned with orange runes, and its wings look razor-sharp."
msgstr "A large, brightly coloured butterfly with crystalline wings, fluttering incongruously through the air.  This one seems to be patterned with orange runes, and its wings look razor-sharp."

msgid "A huge, segmented, burrowing insect, two meters long and pale greenish-yellow in color."
msgstr "A huge, segmented, burrowing insect, two metres long and pale greenish-yellow in colour."

msgid "An animate pile of moss, leaves, sticks, and other forest detritus, towering almost three meters high.  Three pits near the top with a lambent green glow might be eyes.  It slowly walks on massive limbs."
msgstr "An animate pile of moss, leaves, sticks, and other forest detritus, towering almost three metres high.  Three pits near the top with a lambent green glow might be eyes.  It slowly walks on massive limbs."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s squeezes your %2$s, but your armor protects you."
msgstr "%1$s squeezes your %2$s, but your armour protects you."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s squeezes <npcname>, but their armor protects them."
msgstr "%1$s squeezes <npcname>, but their armour protects them."

msgid "An enormous, clay-colored beast known for living in swamps and eating passersby.  This one has two heads, both moving independently and gazing around at their surroundings."
msgstr "An enormous, clay-coloured beast known for living in swamps and eating passersby.  This one has two heads, both moving independently and gazing around at their surroundings."

msgid "A gigantic, ogre-like monster, nearly half again as tall as an ogre.  Two huge tusks jut forth from a mouth twisted into a snarl, and a third arm protrudes from the center of its chest."
msgstr "A gigantic, ogre-like monster, nearly half again as tall as an ogre.  Two huge tusks jut forth from a mouth twisted into a snarl, and a third arm protrudes from the centre of its chest."

msgid "Like a goblin, but stretched and exaggerated until they're as tall as a human but much more heavily muscled, wearing improvised armor and carrying a spear."
msgstr "Like a goblin, but stretched and exaggerated until they're as tall as a human but much more heavily muscled, wearing improvised armour and carrying a spear."

msgid "Like a goblin, but stretched and exaggerated until they're as tall as a human but much more heavily muscled, wearing improvised armor and carrying a bow.  They smile silently, baring a set of sharp teeth, as they aim at you."
msgstr "Like a goblin, but stretched and exaggerated until they're as tall as a human but much more heavily muscled, wearing improvised armour and carrying a bow.  They smile silently, baring a set of sharp teeth, as they aim at you."

msgid "Like a goblin, but stretched and exaggerated until they're as tall as a human but much more heavily muscled, wearing improvised armor and carrying an enormous metallic club.  There are red streaks all over their skin, like they had bathed themselves in blood."
msgstr "Like a goblin, but stretched and exaggerated until they're as tall as a human but much more heavily muscled, wearing improvised armour and carrying an enormous metallic club.  There are red streaks all over their skin, like they had bathed themselves in blood."

msgid "Like a goblin, but stretched and exaggerated until they're as tall as a human but much more heavily muscled, wearing improvised armor.  There are red streaks all over their skin, like they had bathed themselves in blood, and their hands glow faintly red."
msgstr "Like a goblin, but stretched and exaggerated until they're as tall as a human but much more heavily muscled, wearing improvised armour.  There are red streaks all over their skin, like they had bathed themselves in blood, and their hands glow faintly red."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s squeezes your %2$s, but fails to penetrate your armor."
msgstr "%1$s squeezes your %2$s, but fails to penetrate your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s squeezes <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armor."
msgstr "%1$s squeezes <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armour."

msgid "A particularly large mobile plant, taller than a moose.  It has a single bark-covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  Some of its fronds move in particular patterns, an eldritch light trailing after them.  Nature will be healed."
msgstr "A particularly large mobile plant, taller than a moose.  It has a single bark-covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralysing sting concealed within.  Some of its fronds move in particular patterns, an eldritch light trailing after them.  Nature will be healed."

msgid "A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  A hazy cloud of pollen hangs around it."
msgstr "A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralysing sting concealed within.  A hazy cloud of pollen hangs around it."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s hits your %2$s, but your armor protects you."
msgstr "%1$s hits your %2$s, but your armour protects you."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s hits <npcname>, but their armor protects them."
msgstr "%1$s hits <npcname>, but their armour protects them."

msgid "Already foul in life, this catoblepas now has oozing sores on its body and an even more rank odor.  At least whatever was odd about its eyes is gone, now that they're black and filled with rage."
msgstr "Already foul in life, this catoblepas now has oozing sores on its body and an even more rank odour.  At least whatever was odd about its eyes is gone, now that they're black and filled with rage."

msgid "School Deficiency: Channeling"
msgstr "School Deficiency: Channelling"

msgid "No matter how hard you try, you never managed to master channeling spells.  You are unable to cast any spell of the channeling school."
msgstr "No matter how hard you try, you never managed to master channelling spells.  You are unable to cast any spell of the channelling school."

msgid "You have a sky- or sea-colored skin tone."
msgstr "You have a sky- or sea-coloured skin tone."

msgid "Skin tone: gray"
msgstr "Skin tone: grey"

msgid "You have a gray skin tone."
msgstr "You have a grey skin tone."

msgid "You have an opalescent skin tone, pale with a faint shimmering rainbow of colors."
msgstr "You have an opalescent skin tone, pale with a faint shimmering rainbow of colours."

msgid ""
"Named for the auroras that grace the poles of the earth, the Boreal mage specializes in auras that protect ethereally.  Boreal mages definitely know their way around cold spells, but their real strength is protection.\n"
"\n"
"Boreal Wind: Your Boreal Mage abilities grant you good resistance to temperature conditions.  Also, your hands emit a small amount of cold, increasing your damage in melee."
msgstr ""
"Named for the auroras that grace the poles of the earth, the Boreal mage specialises in auras that protect ethereally.  Boreal mages definitely know their way around cold spells, but their real strength is protection.\n"
"\n"
"Boreal Wind: Your Boreal Mage abilities grant you good resistance to temperature conditions.  Also, your hands emit a small amount of cold, increasing your damage in melee."

msgid "The Crusader attunement is a clashing dichotomy of Man and Nature.  Utilizing man's propensity for tools and nature's resilience, the Crusader is a juggernaut in armed combat."
msgstr "The Crusader attunement is a clashing dichotomy of Man and Nature.  Utilising man's propensity for tools and nature's resilience, the Crusader is a juggernaut in armed combat."

msgid ""
"Force = Mass x Acceleration.  This is the typical thing that people think of nowadays when the word is used, but Force Mages have a different meaning, coming from traditional roots: untyped magical damage appears to be a ghostly \"force.\"  This might be the effect of the attunement, but the cause is even more intriguing: they appear to turn Newton's Third Law on its head.  Magical scholars of the 21st century have theorized that this isn't really the case; instead of the opposite reaction happening on this plane of existence, a Force Mage uses the Aetherium's alternate Laws to rebound the force back upon itself, effectively doubling the force in the same direction instead.  However this ability comes with limitations, as the Force Mage can only do this for melee damage.\n"
"\n"
"Motion: Your Force Mage abilities grant you better speed, and increased damage in melee."
msgstr ""
"Force = Mass x Acceleration.  This is the typical thing that people think of nowadays when the word is used, but Force Mages have a different meaning, coming from traditional roots: untyped magical damage appears to be a ghostly \"force.\"  This might be the effect of the attunement, but the cause is even more intriguing: they appear to turn Newton's Third Law on its head.  Magical scholars of the 21st century have theorised that this isn't really the case; instead of the opposite reaction happening on this plane of existence, a Force Mage uses the Aetherium's alternate Laws to rebound the force back upon itself, effectively doubling the force in the same direction instead.  However this ability comes with limitations, as the Force Mage can only do this for melee damage.\n"
"\n"
"Motion: Your Force Mage abilities grant you better speed, and increased damage in melee."

msgid ""
"The power of a Glacier Mage is backed by a thousand tons of ice and snow, with a brutal might in their spells.  While they are skilled with cold spells, their greatest strength is in offense.\n"
"\n"
"Stalactite: Your Glacier Mage abilities grant you good resistance to temperature conditions, and enemies are often hurt when try to attack you in melee."
msgstr ""
"The power of a Glacier Mage is backed by a thousand tons of ice and snow, with a brutal might in their spells.  While they are skilled with cold spells, their greatest strength is in offence.\n"
"\n"
"Stalactite: Your Glacier Mage abilities grant you good resistance to temperature conditions, and enemies are often hurt when try to attack you in melee."

msgid "The Technomancer specializes in augmenting humans without actually modifying them; and the Overclocker takes the heat aptitude of a Kelvinist and puts that to work.  You are able to think significantly faster, and are able to align your ley lines for spellcasting faster as a result."
msgstr "The Technomancer specialises in augmenting humans without actually modifying them; and the Overclocker takes the heat aptitude of a Kelvinist and puts that to work.  You are able to think significantly faster, and are able to align your ley lines for spellcasting faster as a result."

msgid ""
"This attunement grants you a magical control over the forces of magnetism.\n"
"\n"
"Power: Your Magnetism Mage abilities grant you a good defense against firearms, perfect electric immunity, and the ability to see electric creatures from any distance."
msgstr ""
"This attunement grants you a magical control over the forces of magnetism.\n"
"\n"
"Power: Your Magnetism Mage abilities grant you a good defence against firearms, perfect electric immunity, and the ability to see electric creatures from any distance."

msgid ""
"You've used your knowledge of Biomancy to change your body into a form befitting a Stormshaper.  You can better withstand the power of electricity, and sparks leap from your skin when something hits you.  You're beginning to study spells that utilize your body's affinity for the electric.\n"
"\n"
"Cyclone: Your Storm Elemental abilities grant you total electric immunity, and reflective zippers to anyone who tries to attack you."
msgstr ""
"You've used your knowledge of Biomancy to change your body into a form befitting a Stormshaper.  You can better withstand the power of electricity, and sparks leap from your skin when something hits you.  You're beginning to study spells that utilise your body's affinity for the electric.\n"
"\n"
"Cyclone: Your Storm Elemental abilities grant you total electric immunity, and reflective zippers to anyone who tries to attack you."

msgid "A stormcaller is a stormshaper with an additional affinity toward the weather in a localized area.  Historians agree that the druid requirement has something to do with the Druid's affinity for nature, just like their ability to summon animals.  You will know a stormcaller is in the room if your ears pop and your hair stands straight on end.  Stormcallers are not known for their subtlety."
msgstr "A stormcaller is a stormshaper with an additional affinity toward the weather in a localised area.  Historians agree that the druid requirement has something to do with the Druid's affinity for nature, just like their ability to summon animals.  You will know a stormcaller is in the room if your ears pop and your hair stands straight on end.  Stormcallers are not known for their subtlety."

msgid "Your skin has grown thick and a set of draconic black scales has grown to cover most of your body, acting as natural armor.  Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "Your skin has grown thick and a set of draconic black scales has grown to cover most of your body, acting as natural armour.  Greatly reduces wet effects."

msgid "You have a short, dragonlike tail.  You can use it decently as a club of sorts, but it's not doing anything to help you balance.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "You have a short, dragonlike tail.  You can use it decently as a club of sorts, but it's not doing anything to help you balance.  Prevents wearing non-fabric trousers."

msgid "You have a long, thick, dragonlike tail.  It doesn't help you balance or dodge any better, but it is a powerful bashing weapon.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "You have a long, thick, dragonlike tail.  It doesn't help you balance or dodge any better, but it is a powerful bashing weapon.  Prevents wearing non-fabric trousers."

msgid "Your teeth are longer and more pointed than not.  Before the Cataclysm it was considered extremely gauche to bite anything in a fight; it was a mark of the goblins' uncivilized past.  But, needs must."
msgstr "Your teeth are longer and more pointed than not.  Before the Cataclysm it was considered extremely gauche to bite anything in a fight; it was a mark of the goblins' uncivilised past.  But, needs must."

msgid "Your internal ley lines have become much easier for you to control, resulting in you being able to naturally create crystallized mana."
msgstr "Your internal ley lines have become much easier for you to control, resulting in you being able to naturally create crystallised mana."

msgid "I organize the books, I sell extra books, back when we still lent books I would hunt down those with late books to return.  I have done this for aeons past and I will continue to do this for aeons to come."
msgstr "I organise the books, I sell extra books, back when we still lent books I would hunt down those with late books to return.  I have done this for aeons past and I will continue to do this for aeons to come."

msgid "What are any of us really doing here in this dead and dying world?  I specialize in scrying, and while I wish I could say I'm in it to help lost souls find their way, the collective pockets of a thousand realities is a very good incentive.  I can help you find any number of things, but I take no responsibility for what happens when you find what you're looking for."
msgstr "What are any of us really doing here in this dead and dying world?  I specialise in scrying, and while I wish I could say I'm in it to help lost souls find their way, the collective pockets of a thousand realities is a very good incentive.  I can help you find any number of things, but I take no responsibility for what happens when you find what you're looking for."

msgid "Seeking to pick around your civilization's corpse?  You're not the first and you won't be the last."
msgstr "Seeking to pick around your civilisation's corpse?  You're not the first and you won't be the last."

msgid "Ah yes, the extradimensional fungal dispersed intelligence known as the Mycus.  Quite a menace to interdimensional travelers, I tell you.  Some see them as a god.  Some see them as an existential threat.  And yet others see them as a good source of plant fibers.  Their cellular structure makes them highly adaptive to a wide variety of levels of reality, much like other fungal lifeforms.  Should you find yourself infected and without antifungal medicine, you can try rubbing sulphur on your skin.  It might not work, and it might irritate your skin, but anything is preferable to letting it run its course.  Should medication fail, don't bother with a bullet through your head.  It won't save you from your impending fate.  Instead, use fire, that's my advice.  Now then, the Mycus have a few different manifestations.  Which one are you interested in?"
msgstr "Ah yes, the extradimensional fungal dispersed intelligence known as the Mycus.  Quite a menace to interdimensional travellers, I tell you.  Some see them as a god.  Some see them as an existential threat.  And yet others see them as a good source of plant fibres.  Their cellular structure makes them highly adaptive to a wide variety of levels of reality, much like other fungal lifeforms.  Should you find yourself infected and without antifungal medicine, you can try rubbing sulphur on your skin.  It might not work, and it might irritate your skin, but anything is preferable to letting it run its course.  Should medication fail, don't bother with a bullet through your head.  It won't save you from your impending fate.  Instead, use fire, that's my advice.  Now then, the Mycus have a few different manifestations.  Which one are you interested in?"

msgid "Right.  Fungal crustaceans from space.  Mighty unpleasant fellas, if you ask me.  But, uh, don't tell them I said so.  The forge lord says they mean no offense, that cutting people up is just their way of saying 'hi'.  Personally I find it rude, but perhaps that's anthropocentric of me.  But I digress.  Are you interested in an encampment or a scout tower?"
msgstr "Right.  Fungal crustaceans from space.  Mighty unpleasant fellas, if you ask me.  But, uh, don't tell them I said so.  The forge lord says they mean no offence, that cutting people up is just their way of saying 'hi'.  Personally I find it rude, but perhaps that's anthropocentric of me.  But I digress.  Are you interested in an encampment or a scout tower?"

msgid "Have you seen mi-go architecture?  They make these living, organic structures out of resin.  Kind of cool.  And disturbing, I guess.  Of course, they'll cut you to pieces if you gawk at it too long.  I'll mark the location of one of these places on your map for one denarius.  I heard a story, not sure if it was true, but allegedly one guy tried to use the mi-go building resin as armor.  Apparently, it bore into the poor guy's flesh!  Like lichen!  His friends tried to tear it off, but it wouldn't bulge.  He was in so much pain they decided to put him out of his misery.  But they couldn't do it, because the armor was too good!  So I guess that in a sense it worked.  Heh.  The mental image still keeps me awake at night, occasionally.  And now you have it too.  You're welcome."
msgstr "Have you seen mi-go architecture?  They make these living, organic structures out of resin.  Kind of cool.  And disturbing, I guess.  Of course, they'll cut you to pieces if you gawk at it too long.  I'll mark the location of one of these places on your map for one denarius.  I heard a story, not sure if it was true, but allegedly one guy tried to use the mi-go building resin as armour.  Apparently, it bore into the poor guy's flesh!  Like lichen!  His friends tried to tear it off, but it wouldn't bulge.  He was in so much pain they decided to put him out of his misery.  But they couldn't do it, because the armour was too good!  So I guess that in a sense it worked.  Heh.  The mental image still keeps me awake at night, occasionally.  And now you have it too.  You're welcome."

msgid "Right.  Extradimensional intelligent plants with a mean streak.  They seem to have a method of traveling from reality to reality without traversing the hazards between.  Interesting, no?  I'd ask them how they do it but I don't think I could get a word in edgewise before they cut me to pieces.  I'll mark one of their groves on your map for one denarius."
msgstr "Right.  Extradimensional intelligent plants with a mean streak.  They seem to have a method of travelling from reality to reality without traversing the hazards between.  Interesting, no?  I'd ask them how they do it but I don't think I could get a word in edgewise before they cut me to pieces.  I'll mark one of their groves on your map for one denarius."

msgid "Good choice.  It seems that shortly before the world started to end, a few of them got it in their heads to just leave civilization alone for a bit and go live in the woods with other goblins.  And wargs.  Not a terrible idea if you ask me.  Anyways, there's a few different types of places they gather, are you looking for an encampment or an outpost?"
msgstr "Good choice.  It seems that shortly before the world started to end, a few of them got it in their heads to just leave civilisation alone for a bit and go live in the woods with other goblins.  And wargs.  Not a terrible idea if you ask me.  Anyways, there's a few different types of places they gather, are you looking for an encampment or an outpost?"

msgid "Contrary to popular belief, goblins are not actually orcs.  Its the other way around.  Orcs are goblins who have taken one too many unlabeled potions and lived to tell the tale.  Sometimes this awakens powers much like my own.  Well, not exactly, if it did I'd be out of a job faster than a Magus could cast Phase Door.  Luckily for you, you shouldn't have to delve too deep into a forest to see for yourself.  I'll mark one of their outposts on your map for one denarius."
msgstr "Contrary to popular belief, goblins are not actually orcs.  Its the other way around.  Orcs are goblins who have taken one too many unlabelled potions and lived to tell the tale.  Sometimes this awakens powers much like my own.  Well, not exactly, if it did I'd be out of a job faster than a Magus could cast Phase Door.  Luckily for you, you shouldn't have to delve too deep into a forest to see for yourself.  I'll mark one of their outposts on your map for one denarius."

msgid "Deeply buried secret installations where shady government organizations conducted unethical experiments, free from moral constrains.  Did such places really exist before the Cataclysm, or did humanity's collective mistrust, superstition and conspiracy theories cause the portal storms to dream these places into existence?  I honestly can't tell, but I suppose it doesn't matter now.  These places do exist, and are ripe with mysteries, dangers, and loot.  You'll have to specify which kind you're looking for."
msgstr "Deeply buried secret installations where shady government organisations conducted unethical experiments, free from moral constrains.  Did such places really exist before the Cataclysm, or did humanity's collective mistrust, superstition and conspiracy theories cause the portal storms to dream these places into existence?  I honestly can't tell, but I suppose it doesn't matter now.  These places do exist, and are ripe with mysteries, dangers, and loot.  You'll have to specify which kind you're looking for."

msgid "Poor druids, they were hit hardest by the rise of technology.  Magi, technomancers, animists, they can just close the windows and keep their chanting low so to not bother the neighbors.  Even earthshapers can just go into the backyard, but druids had to move out to the middle of nowhere.  That's where their tower will be, mind.  There won't be a road there, so you're in for quite the trip.  I'll mark one on your map for one denarius."
msgstr "Poor druids, they were hit hardest by the rise of technology.  Magi, technomancers, animists, they can just close the windows and keep their chanting low so to not bother the neighbours.  Even earthshapers can just go into the backyard, but druids had to move out to the middle of nowhere.  That's where their tower will be, mind.  There won't be a road there, so you're in for quite the trip.  I'll mark one on your map for one denarius."

msgid "The Malignance is the cause for much of our woes.  It is the force animating the zombies.  It is responsible for the portal storms, and it seems to be absolutely bursting with hate.  Valzain theorizes that it used to be a fundamental force of nature or perhaps a school of magic that somehow grew conscious, or perhaps had a consciousness imposed on it. Allegedly, the Mi-Go speak of a time before it existed, or perhaps a time in which it wasn't so dangerous.  By now, it is everywhere on Earth.  As far as I can tell, it builds no structures and has no bases of operation, so there is no place I can point you towards.  Sorry."
msgstr "The Malignance is the cause for much of our woes.  It is the force animating the zombies.  It is responsible for the portal storms, and it seems to be absolutely bursting with hate.  Valzain theorises that it used to be a fundamental force of nature or perhaps a school of magic that somehow grew conscious, or perhaps had a consciousness imposed on it. Allegedly, the Mi-Go speak of a time before it existed, or perhaps a time in which it wasn't so dangerous.  By now, it is everywhere on Earth.  As far as I can tell, it builds no structures and has no bases of operation, so there is no place I can point you towards.  Sorry."

msgid "May the seas be ever in your favor."
msgstr "May the seas be ever in your favour."

msgid "The government doesn't subsidize your purchases here anymore."
msgstr "The government doesn't subsidise your purchases here anymore."

msgid "The awakened congregate in towns and cities, the closer to the center the more you will find."
msgstr "The awakened congregate in towns and cities, the closer to the centre the more you will find."

msgid "black dragon scale armors"
msgstr "black dragon scale armours"

msgid "Recipes related to constructing black dragon scale armor."
msgstr "Recipes related to constructing black dragon scale armour."

msgid "XL black dragon scale armors"
msgstr "XL black dragon scale armours"

msgid "Recipes related to constructing black dragon scale armor in XL sizes."
msgstr "Recipes related to constructing black dragon scale armour in XL sizes."

msgid "black dragon hide armors"
msgstr "black dragon hide armours"

msgid "Recipes related to constructing hide dragon hide armor."
msgstr "Recipes related to constructing hide dragon hide armour."

msgid "Recipes related to constructing black dragon hide armor."
msgstr "Recipes related to constructing black dragon hide armour."

msgid "XL black dragon hide armors"
msgstr "XL black dragon hide armours"

msgid "Recipes related to constructing black dragon hide armor in XL sizes."
msgstr "Recipes related to constructing black dragon hide armour in XL sizes."

msgid ""
"209809238942181449.jpg\n"
"\n"
"A screenshot of a Facebook post, with a picture of a ravenfolk wearing six large gold necklaces, rings on each one of their talons, and gold bracelets around their legs, taken at some sort of music festival.  Their arm is around another ravenfolk, who is wearing a flashy dress made of a series of multi-colored scarves, and both of them have their beaks open as though the picture were taken mid-laugh.  In the background are several people, walking around under a night sky lit by several floodlights.  The caption reads, \"EDC!!  At last!!  Living the dream\"."
msgstr ""
"209809238942181449.jpg\n"
"\n"
"A screenshot of a Facebook post, with a picture of a ravenfolk wearing six large gold necklaces, rings on each one of their talons, and gold bracelets around their legs, taken at some sort of music festival.  Their arm is around another ravenfolk, who is wearing a flashy dress made of a series of multi-coloured scarves, and both of them have their beaks open as though the picture were taken mid-laugh.  In the background are several people, walking around under a night sky lit by several floodlights.  The caption reads, \"EDC!!  At last!!  Living the dream\"."

msgid "This is a public warning from the Federal Government.  Its brief message, repeated in several languages, reads:  \"The Federal Department of Thaumaturgy is investigating the riots for evidence of possible magical activity.  You or members of your family may be subject to a random inspection by a licensed federal thaumaturgical investigator.  Do not attempt to cure or examine any rioters yourself.  Your cooperation is appreciated.  If you are trained in medical biomancy and would like to assist in the investigation, please contact…\"  The flier ends with a list of numbers and email addresses."
msgstr "This is a public warning from the Federal Government.  Its brief message, repeated in several languages, reads:  \"The Federal Department of Thaumaturgy is investigating the riots for evidence of possible magical activity.  You or members of your family may be subject to a random inspection by a licensed federal thaumaturgical investigator.  Do not attempt to cure or examine any rioters yourself.  Your cooperation is appreciated.  If you are trained in medical biomancy and would like to assist in the investigation, please contact…\"  The flyer ends with a list of numbers and email addresses."

msgid ""
"Letter to the Editor:\n"
"\n"
"I am concerned about recent activity among the local goblin population.  While the riots have us all on edge, lately many of them seem to be keeping to themselves.  My neighbors won't even say hello to me anymore or look at me when I pass them on the street.  Sometimes they leave for days at a time, and I swear I've seen fires burning on the hills.  There's something odd going on and we don't need any more strangeness with everything else that's wrong with the world lately.\n"
"\n"
"Sincerely\n"
"Edward Frost"
msgstr ""
"Letter to the Editor:\n"
"\n"
"I am concerned about recent activity among the local goblin population.  While the riots have us all on edge, lately many of them seem to be keeping to themselves.  My neighbours won't even say hello to me anymore or look at me when I pass them on the street.  Sometimes they leave for days at a time, and I swear I've seen fires burning on the hills.  There's something odd going on and we don't need any more strangeness with everything else that's wrong with the world lately.\n"
"\n"
"Sincerely\n"
"Edward Frost"

msgid ""
"SEARCH FOR MISSING CHILD CONTINUES\n"
"\n"
"As the search continues for Theodore O'Connor, age 7, missing since last Thursday, his mother placed the blame on a goblin family in their neighborhood.  \"They've been lurking around our house for days before Theo disappeared,\" she said during an interview on local television, \"and I just know they had something to do with it.  Please bring our Theo back!\"  Local community organizer Shazgra k'Morħet denounced the claims, stating, \"I thought we had moved past this kind of blood libel rhetoric, but apparently rising tensions are all it takes for old accusations to resurface.  We've all seen the footage of the riots.  They're the most multicultural gatherings we've had in modern times.\""
msgstr ""
"SEARCH FOR MISSING CHILD CONTINUES\n"
"\n"
"As the search continues for Theodore O'Connor, age 7, missing since last Thursday, his mother placed the blame on a goblin family in their neighbourhood.  \"They've been lurking around our house for days before Theo disappeared,\" she said during an interview on local television, \"and I just know they had something to do with it.  Please bring our Theo back!\"  Local community organiser Shazgra k'Morħet denounced the claims, stating, \"I thought we had moved past this kind of blood libel rhetoric, but apparently rising tensions are all it takes for old accusations to resurface.  We've all seen the footage of the riots.  They're the most multicultural gatherings we've had in modern times.\""

msgid ""
"NATIONAL PARKS CLOSED\n"
"\n"
"Secretary of Thaumaturgy Adam Maerhanar released a statement today stating that all national parks would be closed to the public until further notice due to increased wilderness spirit activity.  The notice further stated that the cause was under investigation but an unnamed source indicated it was probably due to natural solar cycles: \"The stars, the sun, the moon, we know these all affect spirits' behavior.  Despite existing alongside them for thousands of years, there's still so much we don't know about them.\""
msgstr ""
"NATIONAL PARKS CLOSED\n"
"\n"
"Secretary of Thaumaturgy Adam Maerhanar released a statement today stating that all national parks would be closed to the public until further notice due to increased wilderness spirit activity.  The notice further stated that the cause was under investigation but an unnamed source indicated it was probably due to natural solar cycles: \"The stars, the sun, the moon, we know these all affect spirits' behaviour.  Despite existing alongside them for thousands of years, there's still so much we don't know about them.\""

msgid ""
"GREENSCALE CLOSES BORDERS\n"
"\n"
"The Greenscale Alliance yesterday announced that its borders will be closed to American and Canadian citizens until further notice, and all Alliance citizens are encouraged to return.  \"We appreciate and sympathize with the disruption these measures will cause, but the recent spread of unrest is a threat to our national security,\" said Alliance spokeswyrm Jolgauthrelathenar the Patient, \"In the interests of minimizing risk, the Council of Wyrms has determined that this course is necessary.\"  Jolgauthrelathenar did not take questions after making her statement."
msgstr ""
"GREENSCALE CLOSES BORDERS\n"
"\n"
"The Greenscale Alliance yesterday announced that its borders will be closed to American and Canadian citizens until further notice, and all Alliance citizens are encouraged to return.  \"We appreciate and sympathise with the disruption these measures will cause, but the recent spread of unrest is a threat to our national security,\" said Alliance spokeswyrm Jolgauthrelathenar the Patient, \"In the interests of minimising risk, the Council of Wyrms has determined that this course is necessary.\"  Jolgauthrelathenar did not take questions after making her statement."

msgid ""
"SEARCH FOR UNIVERSAL HEALING SPELL CONTINUES\n"
"\n"
"Staff at Johns Hopkins University yesterday announced promising results in the long search for a health catalyst spell.  While an actual prototype formula has not been released, the draft paper indicates that animal testing showed a five percent decrease in long-term mortality rates in rats suffering from a dozen different types of cancers.  \"A true universal healing catalyst spell would really be the Holy Grail\", said Dr. Olivia k'Ħarzag, Director of Thaumaturgical Oncology Research at Johns Hopkins University.  \"Modern cancer research's greatest limiting factor is that the most potent biomantic healing spells can only affect the caster.  If we can find a way to encourage the body's own defenses that works on a wide scale, even if we can't directly cure the cancer, we could save so many more people.\""
