msgid "This tiger-sized, but more robustly built creature has a sand-colored, spotted coat and a short tail.  Its eponymous sabre-like upper canine teeth look menacing."
msgstr "This tiger-sized, but more robustly built creature has a sand-coloured, spotted coat and a short tail.  Its eponymous sabre-like upper canine teeth look menacing."

msgid "A juvenile sabre-toothed cat.  Still sizable, but much less dangerous than its parent, which will fight fiercely to protect its offspring."
