msgid "A huge lumbering sloth standing at over 3 meters, gracefully wandering through the woods at a glacial tempo.  It is constantly in search for food to support its massive body weight."
msgstr "A huge lumbering sloth standing at over 3 metres, gracefully wandering through the woods at a glacial tempo.  It is constantly in search for food to support its massive body weight."

