msgid "3) Electrokinesis: Control over electricity and some electrochemical processes, including the function of neurons and computers.  Master electrokinetics can shock opponents by touch, recharge electronics on their person, stun or shut down robots, paralyze beings with a nervous system, speed up their own neural processes or those of others, and unleash blasts of lightning."
msgstr "3) Electrokinesis: Control over electricity and some electrochemical processes, including the function of neurons and computers.  Master electrokinetics can shock opponents by touch, recharge electronics on their person, stun or shut down robots, paralyse beings with a nervous system, speed up their own neural processes or those of others, and unleash blasts of lightning."

msgid "8) Teleportation: Movement without crossing the intervening distance.  Master teleporters can increase the relative distances around their enemies to slow their movements, reduce the relative distances around themselves to make melee attacks from several meters away, teleport through walls or from the first floor to the roof, walk through walls, travel long distances to places they have previously been, and open temporary rifts into the Nether."
msgstr "8) Teleportation: Movement without crossing the intervening distance.  Master teleporters can increase the relative distances around their enemies to slow their movements, reduce the relative distances around themselves to make melee attacks from several metres away, teleport through walls or from the first floor to the roof, walk through walls, travel long distances to places they have previously been, and open temporary rifts into the Nether."

msgid "The second is to find one of the strange colored crystals now found in the world, and the third is to stand out in a portal storm unprotected.  Using a matrix crystal works immediately and standing in a portal storm is a small chance each moment, but the effect is the same.  If you succeed, you gain a power path appropriate to the type of crystal, or randomly in the case of a portal storm.  If you fail, you suffer from negative effects related to your failure.  A failed biokinetic awakening will leave you physically weakened, for example, and a failed telekinetic awakening causes unseen forces to press down and inhibit your movement."
msgstr "The second is to find one of the strange coloured crystals now found in the world, and the third is to stand out in a portal storm unprotected.  Using a matrix crystal works immediately and standing in a portal storm is a small chance each moment, but the effect is the same.  If you succeed, you gain a power path appropriate to the type of crystal, or randomly in the case of a portal storm.  If you fail, you suffer from negative effects related to your failure.  A failed biokinetic awakening will leave you physically weakened, for example, and a failed telekinetic awakening causes unseen forces to press down and inhibit your movement."

msgid "Psionic powers are located in your supernatural powers menu, categorized by path.  Each psionic power is preceded by a [Ψ]."
msgstr "Psionic powers are located in your supernatural powers menu, categorised by path.  Each psionic power is preceded by a [Ψ]."

#, c-format
msgid "Powers have a chance to fail based on a number of factors.  The most important by far is your Metaphysics skill vs. the power's Difficulty, and the chance of failure is also reduced by our intelligence and, to a much lesser extent, the power's level.  It is increased by having a high Nether Attunement, by channeling several powers in short succession, and by having lower weariness levels (Moderate or below). Your chance of success is capped based on whether you have the concentration proficiencies or not; only with Concentration (Master) can you reach 100% chance to succeed."
msgstr "Powers have a chance to fail based on a number of factors.  The most important by far is your Metaphysics skill vs. the power's Difficulty, and the chance of failure is also reduced by our intelligence and, to a much lesser extent, the power's level.  It is increased by having a high Nether Attunement, by channelling several powers in short succession, and by having lower weariness levels (Moderate or below). Your chance of success is capped based on whether you have the concentration proficiencies or not; only with Concentration (Master) can you reach 100% chance to succeed."

msgid "Psionics is the psychoactive power of the Nether channeled by careful concentration.  Repeated use of psionics in a short period of time opens the connection to the Nether wider, increasing the amount of power available.  Higher levels of Nether Attunement boost all characteristics of your powers: range, damage, duration, targets affected, bonus granted or penalty caused, and so on.  At 12, the maximum degree of Nether Attunement, your powers are over five times stronger than with no Nether Attunement!"
msgstr "Psionics is the psychoactive power of the Nether channelled by careful concentration.  Repeated use of psionics in a short period of time opens the connection to the Nether wider, increasing the amount of power available.  Higher levels of Nether Attunement boost all characteristics of your powers: range, damage, duration, targets affected, bonus granted or penalty caused, and so on.  At 12, the maximum degree of Nether Attunement, your powers are over five times stronger than with no Nether Attunement!"

msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can breathe underwater and twist yourself enough to squeeze through a half-closed window.  You can run five meters in less than a second and shrug off a punch like it's nothing.  You'd almost be worried you were becoming one of those rioters, except you're definitely still sane.  Right?"
