msgid "Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  While running down an alleyway to escape a group of rioters, you looked back and realized you were going to get caught and then there was a deafening crash of thunder and your vision went white.  When your hearing and sight came back, the rioters were lying in a heap, some still with smoldering clothes, and you were unscathed."
