msgid "You gaze into the strange crystal and the light slowly grows brighter.  As it fills your vision, you become aware of the sound of your heartbeat, of the blood rushing through your veins, of the oxygen fueling your muscles.  You see the connections between them all and, only partially aware of how you're doing it, you reach out and adjust the flow.  Strength and power suddenly fill your body, and as you watch the connections with your inner eye, you see what exactly you did and you know how to do it again.  As the light from the crystal fades, leaving it dull and colorless, your vision clears."
msgstr "You gaze into the strange crystal and the light slowly grows brighter.  As it fills your vision, you become aware of the sound of your heartbeat, of the blood rushing through your veins, of the oxygen fuelling your muscles.  You see the connections between them all and, only partially aware of how you're doing it, you reach out and adjust the flow.  Strength and power suddenly fill your body, and as you watch the connections with your inner eye, you see what exactly you did and you know how to do it again.  As the light from the crystal fades, leaving it dull and colourless, your vision clears."

msgid "You gaze into the strange crystal and the light slowly grows brighter.  As it fills your vision, you see thin lines beneath your skin.  They pulse with energy, bright sparks traveling to your fingers as you flex them and a burst of internal lightning when you touch the crystal with your free hand.  You raise your hand and hold up two fingers, and a thunderbolt jumps between them accompanied by a loud crackle.  Your hair stands on end as lightning travels down your arm, filling the air with the scent of ozone.  As the light from the crystal fades, leaving it dull and colorless, your skin tingles."
msgstr "You gaze into the strange crystal and the light slowly grows brighter.  As it fills your vision, you see thin lines beneath your skin.  They pulse with energy, bright sparks travelling to your fingers as you flex them and a burst of internal lightning when you touch the crystal with your free hand.  You raise your hand and hold up two fingers, and a thunderbolt jumps between them accompanied by a loud crackle.  Your hair stands on end as lightning travels down your arm, filling the air with the scent of ozone.  As the light from the crystal fades, leaving it dull and colourless, your skin tingles."

msgid "You gaze into the strange crystal and the light slowly grows brighter.  As it fills your vision, your muscles tremble.  You see bursts of internal lightning traveling down your limbs for a moment, and then your muscles seize up in a sudden shower of internal sparks.  As the crystal's light fades you crash to the floor."
msgstr "You gaze into the strange crystal and the light slowly grows brighter.  As it fills your vision, your muscles tremble.  You see bursts of internal lightning travelling down your limbs for a moment, and then your muscles seize up in a sudden shower of internal sparks.  As the crystal's light fades you crash to the floor."

msgid "You gaze into the strange crystal and the light slowly grows brighter.  You start emanating light, but as time progresses, it hardens around your skin and tightens, causing you pain, its brightness leaving your head pounding and your eyes burning.  As the light fades you look once more into the crystal, realizing it is now dark."
msgstr "You gaze into the strange crystal and the light slowly grows brighter.  You start emanating light, but as time progresses, it hardens around your skin and tightens, causing you pain, its brightness leaving your head pounding and your eyes burning.  As the light fades you look once more into the crystal, realising it is now dark."

msgid "You gaze into the strange crystal and the light slowly grows brighter.  As the light spreads and illuminates the surrounding terrain, the air shimmers slightly.  Images appear, locations and times, all overlapping in a kaleidoscope of color and sound that makes your head throb.  You tear your gaze away from the now-dark crystal but the pounding in your head remains."
msgstr "You gaze into the strange crystal and the light slowly grows brighter.  As the light spreads and illuminates the surrounding terrain, the air shimmers slightly.  Images appear, locations and times, all overlapping in a kaleidoscope of colour and sound that makes your head throb.  You tear your gaze away from the now-dark crystal but the pounding in your head remains."

msgid "You gaze into the strange crystal and the light slowly grows brighter.  You become aware of your skin, of every cut and bruise and scrape, of the food sitting in your stomach and the air moving in and out of your lungs.  You can feel the bits of smoke in the air from the all the fires unleashed by the Cataclysm, the bits of dirt and debris in your wounds, of the char in your food.  Not quite knowing how, you reach out and push at it, all the dirt and grime and filth of daily life in the Cataclysm, sealing it away.  You instantly feel better, like a weight you didn't realize you were carrying has been taken off your shoulders, and as the light from the crystal dims and goes dark you stand up straight.  You're going to be alright."
msgstr "You gaze into the strange crystal and the light slowly grows brighter.  You become aware of your skin, of every cut and bruise and scrape, of the food sitting in your stomach and the air moving in and out of your lungs.  You can feel the bits of smoke in the air from the all the fires unleashed by the Cataclysm, the bits of dirt and debris in your wounds, of the char in your food.  Not quite knowing how, you reach out and push at it, all the dirt and grime and filth of daily life in the Cataclysm, sealing it away.  You instantly feel better, like a weight you didn't realise you were carrying has been taken off your shoulders, and as the light from the crystal dims and goes dark you stand up straight.  You're going to be alright."

msgid "A roar fills your mind, louder even than the screaming madness of the portal storm.  New strength and vigor suddenly fill you.  You stand up straight and tall, heedless of the wind and the kaleidoscoping sky, and clench your fists.  You feel like you could take on the world, like you could sprint for an hour without stopping, like you could wrestle one of those giant insects to the ground and pin it, like you could dodge bullets.  You unclench your fists and shake your head, but the sense of strength remains."
msgstr "A roar fills your mind, louder even than the screaming madness of the portal storm.  New strength and vigour suddenly fill you.  You stand up straight and tall, heedless of the wind and the kaleidoscoping sky, and clench your fists.  You feel like you could take on the world, like you could sprint for an hour without stopping, like you could wrestle one of those giant insects to the ground and pin it, like you could dodge bullets.  You unclench your fists and shake your head, but the sense of strength remains."

msgid "A roar fills your mind, louder even than the screaming madness of the portal storm.  You close your eyes but you can still see--at first just a light against your eyelids, then like a train approaching the end of a tunnel, light expands and reveals your surroundings.  You can see in all directions.  You can see behind and beneath every blade of grass around you, illuminated in the storm's witchlight, for a moment until your awareness snaps back into your body and you reel back with the shock of it.  When you open your eyes again, the colors around you are brighter and the sounds are clearer than before."
msgstr "A roar fills your mind, louder even than the screaming madness of the portal storm.  You close your eyes but you can still see--at first just a light against your eyelids, then like a train approaching the end of a tunnel, light expands and reveals your surroundings.  You can see in all directions.  You can see behind and beneath every blade of grass around you, illuminated in the storm's witchlight, for a moment until your awareness snaps back into your body and you reel back with the shock of it.  When you open your eyes again, the colours around you are brighter and the sounds are clearer than before."

msgid "A roar fills your mind, louder even than the screaming madness of the portal storm.  Multi-colored lightning flashes across the sky and then freezes.  The lightning expands in your sight, until you can see individual electrons tracing their paths through the air.  You reach out a hand and some of the electrons change their path, and as the world restarts its motion the lightning crashes into you and through you to the ground.  A few sparks remain, dancing across your hand, and as you flex your fingers lightning crackles between them."
msgstr "A roar fills your mind, louder even than the screaming madness of the portal storm.  Multi-coloured lightning flashes across the sky and then freezes.  The lightning expands in your sight, until you can see individual electrons tracing their paths through the air.  You reach out a hand and some of the electrons change their path, and as the world restarts its motion the lightning crashes into you and through you to the ground.  A few sparks remain, dancing across your hand, and as you flex your fingers lightning crackles between them."

msgid "A roar fills your mind, louder even than the screaming madness of the portal storm.  Multi-colored lightning flashes across the sky, first once and then again, then faster and faster until the thunder comes *before* the lightning.  Bolts crash into the ground around you and suddenly one strikes the ground right next to you, hurling you off your feet."
msgstr "A roar fills your mind, louder even than the screaming madness of the portal storm.  Multi-coloured lightning flashes across the sky, first once and then again, then faster and faster until the thunder comes *before* the lightning.  Bolts crash into the ground around you and suddenly one strikes the ground right next to you, hurling you off your feet."

msgid "A roar fills your mind, louder even than the screaming madness of the portal storm.  As you stand there, a sudden warmth envelops your being, far more radiant than the most brilliant of suns.  It begins as a subtle glow deep within, and then it intensifies, growing brighter and brighter, until your entire consciousness is bathed in the incandescent brilliance.  As the light fades, you notice the world is painted in more colors than you ever noticed before, the light seems to respond to your every thought."
msgstr "A roar fills your mind, louder even than the screaming madness of the portal storm.  As you stand there, a sudden warmth envelops your being, far more radiant than the most brilliant of suns.  It begins as a subtle glow deep within, and then it intensifies, growing brighter and brighter, until your entire consciousness is bathed in the incandescent brilliance.  As the light fades, you notice the world is painted in more colours than you ever noticed before, the light seems to respond to your every thought."

msgid "A roar fills your mind, louder even than the screaming madness of the portal storm.  For a moment, you can feel the blood flowing in your veins, every blood cell traveling through your body on its way to your cells.  You can feel the oxygen in your lungs cross through into your blood.  The howling of the portal storm pulses in time with your heartbeat for a moment before your awareness fades, but a lingering trace of it remains in the back of your mind."
msgstr "A roar fills your mind, louder even than the screaming madness of the portal storm.  For a moment, you can feel the blood flowing in your veins, every blood cell travelling through your body on its way to your cells.  You can feel the oxygen in your lungs cross through into your blood.  The howling of the portal storm pulses in time with your heartbeat for a moment before your awareness fades, but a lingering trace of it remains in the back of your mind."

msgid "You've realized that you're far more empathetic to others.  Even those who may not deserve it."
msgstr "You've realised that you're far more empathetic to others.  Even those who may not deserve it."

msgid "It's so much easier to recognize how you are just that much more attractive than everyone else.  You need to make sure they know it."
msgstr "It's so much easier to recognise how you are just that much more attractive than everyone else.  You need to make sure they know it."

msgid "Stop being Disorganized"
msgstr "Stop being Disorganised"

msgid "Perform a comprehensive and corrective surgery to cure your fear of the dark.  No longer will you be paralyzed by errant shadows."
msgstr "Perform a comprehensive and corrective surgery to cure your fear of the dark.  No longer will you be paralysed by errant shadows."

msgid "Help balance your mood by fixing the centers of your brain that are responsible for regulating it.  Be a little more at peace with yourself."
msgstr "Help balance your mood by fixing the centres of your brain that are responsible for regulating it.  Be a little more at peace with yourself."

msgid "You've heard stories of people who heavily specialize in certain skills at the expense of all others.  With a bit of work, you think you can replicate this in yourself."
msgstr "You've heard stories of people who heavily specialise in certain skills at the expense of all others.  With a bit of work, you think you can replicate this in yourself."

msgid "Help yourself stop getting addicted to things by analyzing the relevant pathways and closing them up.  You won't be extra addictive anymore, but you won't necessarily have any special resistance either."
msgstr "Help yourself stop getting addicted to things by analysing the relevant pathways and closing them up.  You won't be extra addictive anymore, but you won't necessarily have any special resistance either."

msgid "With a couple of notes from your Mood Stabilization power, you can permanently alter your brain to make you happier."
msgstr "With a couple of notes from your Mood Stabilisation power, you can permanently alter your brain to make you happier."

msgid "All that information that you didn't used to be able to really handle just got a lot easier to process.  Unfortunately, your prior favorite subject just got a lot more harder to process."
msgstr "All that information that you didn't used to be able to really handle just got a lot easier to process.  Unfortunately, your prior favourite subject just got a lot more harder to process."

msgid "General darkness and dreariness might not be your favorite thing in the world, but you'll live."
msgstr "General darkness and dreariness might not be your favourite thing in the world, but you'll live."

msgid "You begin to take more care in channeling your powers."
msgstr "You begin to take more care in channelling your powers."

msgid "You return to your previous speed in channeling your powers."
msgstr "You return to your previous speed in channelling your powers."

msgid "You feel filled with vigor."
msgstr "You feel filled with vigour."

msgid "Mood Stabilization"
msgstr "Mood Stabilisation"

msgid "You are glowing.  The light is a color you have no name for, a kind of actinic purple-red."
msgstr "You are glowing.  The light is a colour you have no name for, a kind of actinic purple-red."

msgid "You are altering the motion of nearby objects in your favor."
msgstr "You are altering the motion of nearby objects in your favour."

msgid "You feel a little odd and your control over your powers isn't as sure as it was.  There might be unexpected results of you channeling psionics now."
msgstr "You feel a little odd and your control over your powers isn't as sure as it was.  There might be unexpected results of you channelling psionics now."

msgid "You feel a little odd, like you've just awoken from a dream.  All that psionic channeling might have unexpected effects."
msgstr "You feel a little odd, like you've just awoken from a dream.  All that psionic channelling might have unexpected effects."

msgid "Neutralized"
msgstr "Neutralised"

msgid "Gray Elixir"
msgstr "Grey Elixir"

msgid "Gray Elixir Aftereffects"
msgstr "Grey Elixir Aftereffects"

msgid "Swirling colors are visible around others, revealing their emotions."
msgstr "Swirling colours are visible around others, revealing their emotions."

msgid "The colors fade away."
msgstr "The colours fade away."

msgid "You're calling out tactics to your followers.  It's much harder to concentrate on your own defense."
msgstr "You're calling out tactics to your followers.  It's much harder to concentrate on your own defence."

msgid "Cauterized"
msgstr "Cauterised"

msgid "You used your powers to cauterize a wound here.  Whether it worked or not, it still stings terribly."
msgstr "You used your powers to cauterise a wound here.  Whether it worked or not, it still stings terribly."

msgid "Mesmerized"
msgstr "Mesmerised"

msgid "Stabilized Mood"
msgstr "Stabilised Mood"

msgid "Terrorized"
msgstr "Terrorised"

msgid "Revitalizing Meditation"
msgstr "Revitalising Meditation"

msgid "The flames in your heart have kindled, fueling a connection to the Nether.  Your Nether Attunement will not reduce with time."
msgstr "The flames in your heart have kindled, fuelling a connection to the Nether.  Your Nether Attunement will not reduce with time."

msgid "The flames in your heart smolder, maintaining your connection to the Nether.  Your Nether Attunement will reduce with time, but more slowly."
msgstr "The flames in your heart smoulder, maintaining your connection to the Nether.  Your Nether Attunement will reduce with time, but more slowly."

msgid "portal stabilizer"
msgstr "portal stabiliser"

msgid "An area of something that almost looks like grass.  The blades are rolled up into curls, similar to ferns, but they seem to all unroll at once and then roll up again in a steady pattern.  They're a color you can only describe as \"purplish-yellow\"."
msgstr "An area of something that almost looks like grass.  The blades are rolled up into curls, similar to ferns, but they seem to all unroll at once and then roll up again in a steady pattern.  They're a colour you can only describe as \"purplish-yellow\"."

msgid "An area of something that almost looks like moss.  It's a pale bluish color and clumps of it seem to be very slowly moving across the ground."
msgstr "An area of something that almost looks like moss.  It's a pale bluish colour and clumps of it seem to be very slowly moving across the ground."

msgid "An area of something that vaguely resembles grass, except it's a light reddish color and the stalks are much broader.  Some kind of waxy residue seems to rub off onto your clothes when you walk through it."
msgstr "An area of something that vaguely resembles grass, except it's a light reddish colour and the stalks are much broader.  Some kind of waxy residue seems to rub off onto your clothes when you walk through it."

msgid "An area of something that vaguely resembles grass.  Dark red in color and almost waist-high, each stalk splits into two to four other stalks which similarly split on various places along their length, ending in fine fern-like fronds."
msgstr "An area of something that vaguely resembles grass.  Dark red in colour and almost waist-high, each stalk splits into two to four other stalks which similarly split on various places along their length, ending in fine fern-like fronds."

msgid "An alien plant, dark blue-green in color.  The leaves are all interwoven, forming a sphere except for spots where the leaves have been eaten away by some predator or pathogen.  It glows faintly in the dark."
msgstr "An alien plant, dark blue-green in colour.  The leaves are all interwoven, forming a sphere except for spots where the leaves have been eaten away by some predator or pathogen.  It glows faintly in the dark."

msgid "An alien tree, a group of individual dark-colored trunks that intertwine to the point whether you can't tell whether it's a single plant or a group of them.  The branches have nodes of dark red leaves interspersed along their lengths.  You're not entirely sure it's moving with the wind."
msgstr "An alien tree, a group of individual dark-coloured trunks that intertwine to the point whether you can't tell whether it's a single plant or a group of them.  The branches have nodes of dark red leaves interspersed along their lengths.  You're not entirely sure it's moving with the wind."

msgid "An alien tree, a group of thick dark-colored trunks half-fused together.  The drooping branches have nodes of dark red leaves interspersed along their lengths.  You're not entirely sure it's moving with the wind."
msgstr "An alien tree, a group of thick dark-coloured trunks half-fused together.  The drooping branches have nodes of dark red leaves interspersed along their lengths.  You're not entirely sure it's moving with the wind."

msgid "Report: Channeling Protocol PGS38"
msgid_plural "copies of Report: Channeling Protocol PGS38"
msgstr[0] "Report: Channelling Protocol PGS38"
msgstr[1] "copies of Report: Channelling Protocol PGS38"

msgid "A formal report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"VERDANT HAND - EYES ONLY\" centered underneath.  Contrary to your initial assumption, it is not a martial arts training manual.  Instead, it describes a series of meditations and visualization exercises designed to \"increase the subject's unarmed combat prowess fivefold\".  There are several charts showing the results of a VERDANT HAND combatant against training opponents armed with weapons or firearms at various engagement distances.  It's clearly still not as good as just having a rifle, but the data look pretty promising if you can get these exercises down."
msgstr "A formal report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"VERDANT HAND - EYES ONLY\" centred underneath.  Contrary to your initial assumption, it is not a martial arts training manual.  Instead, it describes a series of meditations and visualisation exercises designed to \"increase the subject's unarmed combat prowess fivefold\".  There are several charts showing the results of a VERDANT HAND combatant against training opponents armed with weapons or firearms at various engagement distances.  It's clearly still not as good as just having a rifle, but the data look pretty promising if you can get these exercises down."

msgid "A formal report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"TURQUOISE KEYSTONE - EYES ONLY\" centered underneath.  Skimming through it, you see a lot of very worrying phrases in light of recent events, like \"…the sudden but so-far unexplained increase in our mathematicians' prowess…\" or \"…E71 is now capable of passing through two meters of solid matter.\"  The main topic of the document seems to be using teleportation (\"LOST RAIN\", as the report calls it) in combat.  By lengthening the space between the teleporter and their target to build up momentum on their strikes, warping space to make near-misses turn into hits, or teleporting fractions of a meter to avoid incoming attacks or put themselves in a better position to make strikes, the TURQUOISE KEYSTONE practitioner can vastly increase their prowess in close-quarters combat.  Written at the bottom of the last page is, \"We had better test this soon--I think we're going to need it.\""
msgstr "A formal report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"TURQUOISE KEYSTONE - EYES ONLY\" centred underneath.  Skimming through it, you see a lot of very worrying phrases in light of recent events, like \"…the sudden but so-far unexplained increase in our mathematicians' prowess…\" or \"…E71 is now capable of passing through two metres of solid matter.\"  The main topic of the document seems to be using teleportation (\"LOST RAIN\", as the report calls it) in combat.  By lengthening the space between the teleporter and their target to build up momentum on their strikes, warping space to make near-misses turn into hits, or teleporting fractions of a metre to avoid incoming attacks or put themselves in a better position to make strikes, the TURQUOISE KEYSTONE practitioner can vastly increase their prowess in close-quarters combat.  Written at the bottom of the last page is, \"We had better test this soon--I think we're going to need it.\""

msgid "A thick lab report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"PATIENT MOSAIC - EYES ONLY\" centered underneath.  According to the summary, the report details how a powerful GRAY DAWN participant may use a specifically attuned focusing tool to allow themselves to induce permanent changes in their personality and other segments of their brain.  The report details little success in GRAY DAWN participant applying this process to others."
msgstr "A thick lab report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"PATIENT MOSAIC - EYES ONLY\" centred underneath.  According to the summary, the report details how a powerful GREY DAWN participant may use a specifically attuned focusing tool to allow themselves to induce permanent changes in their personality and other segments of their brain.  The report details little success in GREY DAWN participant applying this process to others."

msgid "A thick liquid, mixed with ground matrix crystal and ready to be catalyzed.  In total darkness, it glows very faintly."
msgstr "A thick liquid, mixed with ground matrix crystal and ready to be catalysed.  In total darkness, it glows very faintly."

msgid "gray crystalline elixir"
msgid_plural "gray crystalline elixir"
msgstr[0] "grey crystalline elixir"
msgstr[1] "grey crystalline elixir"

msgid "Refined matrix crystal mixed directly into water.  The liquid has a faint grayish glow."
msgstr "Refined matrix crystal mixed directly into water.  The liquid has a faint greyish glow."

msgid "A bluish-green ovoid globule, firm to the touch but looking more like gelatin than something you plucked from a tree.  It has a strong acrid odor."
msgstr "A bluish-green ovoid globule, firm to the touch but looking more like gelatin than something you plucked from a tree.  It has a strong acrid odour."

msgid "report (GRAY DAWN)"
msgid_plural "copies of report (GRAY DAWN)"
msgstr[0] "report (GREY DAWN)"
msgstr[1] "copies of report (GREY DAWN)"

msgid "A folder full of what appear to be transcripts of experimental results or reports, with the heading \"GRAY DAWN\".  Most of it is rather trivial, but certain passages catch your eye…"
msgstr "A folder full of what appear to be transcripts of experimental results or reports, with the heading \"GREY DAWN\".  Most of it is rather trivial, but certain passages catch your eye…"

msgid "strange crystal, gray"
msgid_plural "strange crystal, gray"
msgstr[0] "strange crystal, grey"
msgstr[1] "strange crystal, grey"

msgid "A strange-looking, surprisingly-heavy crystal with a faintly-glowing gray light in its depths.  Holding it, you feel more perceptive."
msgstr "A strange-looking, surprisingly-heavy crystal with a faintly-glowing grey light in its depths.  Holding it, you feel more perceptive."

msgid "The gray glow calls to you."
msgstr "The grey glow calls to you."

msgid "crystalline dust, gray"
msgid_plural "crystalline dust, gray"
msgstr[0] "crystalline dust, grey"
msgstr[1] "crystalline dust, grey"

msgid "A bit of crystalline dust with a faint gray shimmer."
msgstr "A bit of crystalline dust with a faint grey shimmer."

msgid "refined matrix crystal powder, gray"
msgid_plural "refined matrix crystal powder, gray"
msgstr[0] "refined matrix crystal powder, grey"
msgstr[1] "refined matrix crystal powder, grey"

msgid "Concentrated matrix crystal dust.  It glitters gray even in complete darkness."
msgstr "Concentrated matrix crystal dust.  It glitters grey even in complete darkness."

msgid "A strange-looking, surprisingly-heavy crystal.  In total darkness, multicolored lights churn and swirl within its depths."
msgstr "A strange-looking, surprisingly-heavy crystal.  In total darkness, multicoloured lights churn and swirl within its depths."

msgid "A clear liquid, designed to alleviate some of the unpredictable effects of excessive psionic channeling."
msgstr "A clear liquid, designed to alleviate some of the unpredictable effects of excessive psionic channelling."

msgid "device labeled OS647-P"
msgid_plural "devices labeled OS647-P"
msgstr[0] "device labelled OS647-P"
msgstr[1] "devices labelled OS647-P"

msgid "matrix channeling array schematics"
msgid_plural "matrix channeling array schematics"
msgstr[0] "matrix channelling array schematics"
msgstr[1] "matrix channelling array schematics"

msgid "This is a series of technical design documents for a \"matrix channeling array\" designed to \"allow an attuned mathematician to direct a stronger level of Netherum energy\".  It sounds like nonsense, but the document does have the XEDRA seal stamped on it."
msgstr "This is a series of technical design documents for a \"matrix channelling array\" designed to \"allow an attuned mathematician to direct a stronger level of Netherum energy\".  It sounds like nonsense, but the document does have the XEDRA seal stamped on it."

msgid "This is a series of design documents for building a transporter beacon and connected transporter remote, which you can use to teleport yourself through the Nether to the beacon.  It's labeled \"for immersion use only\", but that part has a line through it and \"IT WORKS!\" written next to it in pen.  There's another note in red that states that on very rare occasions, \"entities\" can also use the beacon to exit the Nether, and also that as of two weeks before the Cataclysm, the designers have not solved the energy surge problems that make each remote burn out after use."
msgstr "This is a series of design documents for building a transporter beacon and connected transporter remote, which you can use to teleport yourself through the Nether to the beacon.  It's labelled \"for immersion use only\", but that part has a line through it and \"IT WORKS!\" written next to it in pen.  There's another note in red that states that on very rare occasions, \"entities\" can also use the beacon to exit the Nether, and also that as of two weeks before the Cataclysm, the designers have not solved the energy surge problems that make each remote burn out after use."

msgid "This is recognizably a rifle but it's like nothing you've ever seen.  The magazine seems to be inserted into the stock and the barrel is almost as big around as your wrist.  When you hold it, some kind of electronic display above the grip shows a series of odd symbols."
msgstr "This is recognisably a rifle but it's like nothing you've ever seen.  The magazine seems to be inserted into the stock and the barrel is almost as big around as your wrist.  When you hold it, some kind of electronic display above the grip shows a series of odd symbols."

msgid "pāncahcallō torso armor"
msgid_plural "sets of pāncahcallō torso armor"
msgstr[0] "pāncahcallō torso armour"
msgstr[1] "sets of pāncahcallō torso armour"

msgid "A set of torso and upper-arm armor made with mixed leather overlaid with sheets of ichcayolli, pāncahcallō armor derives its effectiveness from the integral generator capable of projecting an ehēcatepantli barrier that provides most of the armor's protection."
msgstr "A set of torso and upper-arm armour made with mixed leather overlaid with sheets of ichcayolli, pāncahcallō armour derives its effectiveness from the integral generator capable of projecting an ehēcatepantli barrier that provides most of the armour's protection."

