msgid_plural "sets of pāncahcallō torso armor (active)"
msgstr[0] "pāncahcallō torso armour (active)"
msgstr[1] "sets of pāncahcallō torso armour (active)"

msgid "A set of torso and upper-arm armor made with mixed leather overlaid with sheets of ichcayolli, pāncahcallō armor derives its effectiveness from the integral generator capable of projecting an ehēcatepantli barrier that provides most of the armor's protection.  The ehēcatepantli is currently active."
msgstr "A set of torso and upper-arm armour made with mixed leather overlaid with sheets of ichcayolli, pāncahcallō armour derives its effectiveness from the integral generator capable of projecting an ehēcatepantli barrier that provides most of the armour's protection.  The ehēcatepantli is currently active."

msgid "strange body armor"
msgid_plural "sets of strange body armor"
msgstr[0] "strange body armour"
msgstr[1] "sets of strange body armour"

msgid "A set of leather armor covered in some kind of very stiff white cloth.  A small textured box is attached to the left side, easily accessible with either hand.  The box has a switch of some kind and several odd pictographs around the switch."
msgstr "A set of leather armour covered in some kind of very stiff white cloth.  A small textured box is attached to the left side, easily accessible with either hand.  The box has a switch of some kind and several odd pictographs around the switch."

msgid "strange body armor  (active)"
msgid_plural "sets of strange body armor  (active)"
msgstr[0] "strange body armour  (active)"
msgstr[1] "sets of strange body armour  (active)"

msgid "A set of leather armor covered in some kind of very stiff white cloth.  A small textured box is attached to the left side, easily accessible with either hand.  The box has a switch of some kind and several odd pictographs around the switch.  The switch is currently flipped."
msgstr "A set of leather armour covered in some kind of very stiff white cloth.  A small textured box is attached to the left side, easily accessible with either hand.  The box has a switch of some kind and several odd pictographs around the switch.  The switch is currently flipped."

msgid "Some sort of uniform dress shirt in a blood-red crimson color with gold accents and a series of yellow bars on the left side.  You can't recall any military that dresses quite like this."
msgstr "Some sort of uniform dress shirt in a blood-red crimson colour with gold accents and a series of yellow bars on the left side.  You can't recall any military that dresses quite like this."

msgid "Itzcuāuhtli Corps pants"
msgid_plural "Itzcuāuhtli Corps pants"
msgstr[0] "Itzcuāuhtli Corps trousers"
msgstr[1] "Itzcuāuhtli Corps trousers"

msgid "A set of gold and crimson uniform pants.  The days of wearing only a maxtlatl are gone following the expansion of the empire out from Anáhuac, and considering the local climate, you're grateful for it."
msgstr "A set of gold and crimson uniform trousers.  The days of wearing only a maxtlatl are gone following the expansion of the empire out from Anáhuac, and considering the local climate, you're grateful for it."

msgid "uniform pants"
msgid_plural "uniform pants"
msgstr[0] "uniform trousers"
msgstr[1] "uniform trousers"

msgid "Some sort of uniform pants in a blood-red crimson color with gold accents.  You can't recall any military that dresses quite like this."
msgstr "Some sort of uniform trousers in a blood-red crimson colour with gold accents.  You can't recall any military that dresses quite like this."

msgid "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform pants"
msgid_plural "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform pants"
msgstr[0] "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform trousers"
msgstr[1] "Itzcuāuhtli Corps combat uniform trousers"

msgid "The standard combat uniform of the Itzcuāuhtli Corps, in shades of dark green and grey.  These are pants, with several pockets."
msgstr "The standard combat uniform of the Itzcuāuhtli Corps, in shades of dark green and grey.  These are trousers, with several pockets."

msgid "A matrix crystal attuned to pyrokinesis.  This one has a (currently) stable loop of energy set up within it.  It would take only a thought to destabilize the energy loop and set up a reaction that would lead to a massive explosion."
msgstr "A matrix crystal attuned to pyrokinesis.  This one has a (currently) stable loop of energy set up within it.  It would take only a thought to destabilise the energy loop and set up a reaction that would lead to a massive explosion."

msgid "With a thought, you destabilize the matrix crystal."
msgstr "With a thought, you destabilise the matrix crystal."

msgid "destabilized pyrokinetic matrix crystal bomb"
msgid_plural "destabilized pyrokinetic matrix crystal bombs"
msgstr[0] "destabilised pyrokinetic matrix crystal bomb"
msgstr[1] "destabilised pyrokinetic matrix crystal bombs"

#, c-format
msgid "The %s is already destabilized, try throwing it instead."
msgstr "The %s is already destabilised, try throwing it instead."

msgid "A simple synthetic fabric belt with a box to the right of the belt loop.  The box has a toggleable switch and a stylized shield with Ψ and the XEDRA logo inside it."
msgstr "A simple synthetic fabric belt with a box to the right of the belt loop.  The box has a toggleable switch and a stylised shield with Ψ and the XEDRA logo inside it."

msgid "A simple synthetic fabric belt with a box to the right of the belt loop.  The box has a toggleable switch and a stylized shield with Ψ and the XEDRA logo inside it.  It also has a large crack across it and rattles when moved."
msgstr "A simple synthetic fabric belt with a box to the right of the belt loop.  The box has a toggleable switch and a stylised shield with Ψ and the XEDRA logo inside it.  It also has a large crack across it and rattles when moved."

msgid "A simple synthetic fabric belt with a box to the right of the belt loop.  The box has a toggleable switch and a stylized flame with a large circle and line superimposed over it and a Ψ behind the XEDRA logo inside it."
msgstr "A simple synthetic fabric belt with a box to the right of the belt loop.  The box has a toggleable switch and a stylised flame with a large circle and line superimposed over it and a Ψ behind the XEDRA logo inside it."

msgid "A simple synthetic fabric belt with a box to the right of the belt loop.  The box has a toggleable switch and a stylized flame with a large circle and line superimposed over it and a Ψ behind the XEDRA logo inside it.  It also has a large crack across it and rattles when moved."
msgstr "A simple synthetic fabric belt with a box to the right of the belt loop.  The box has a toggleable switch and a stylised flame with a large circle and line superimposed over it and a Ψ behind the XEDRA logo inside it.  It also has a large crack across it and rattles when moved."

msgid "matrix channeling array"
msgid_plural "matrix channeling arrays"
msgstr[0] "matrix channelling array"
msgstr[1] "matrix channelling arrays"

msgid "A precise arrangement of cut crystal pieces from the crystal outgrowths left by the portal storms.  The air in the center shimmers like a summer heat gaze when you look through the focal point of the apparatus."
msgstr "A precise arrangement of cut crystal pieces from the crystal outgrowths left by the portal storms.  The air in the centre shimmers like a summer heat gaze when you look through the focal point of the apparatus."

msgid "A blocky item, like an old feature cellphone crossed with a radio.  A matrix channeling array is stick out of the side like an antenna.  There is a small screen on the front, currently off."
msgstr "A blocky item, like an old feature cellphone crossed with a radio.  A matrix channelling array is stick out of the side like an antenna.  There is a small screen on the front, currently off."

msgid "A blocky item, like an old feature cellphone crossed with a radio.  A matrix channeling array is sticking out of the side like an antenna.  There is a small screen on the front, currently running what looks like a series of mathematical calculations."
msgstr "A blocky item, like an old feature cellphone crossed with a radio.  A matrix channelling array is sticking out of the side like an antenna.  There is a small screen on the front, currently running what looks like a series of mathematical calculations."

msgid "A blocky item, like an old feature cellphone crossed with a radio.  A matrix channeling array was sticking out of the side like an antenna, but it's now cracked and probably useless.  There is a small screen on the front, obviously burned out.  Parts of the plastic casing are warped as though the plastic had frozen and cracked."
msgstr "A blocky item, like an old feature cellphone crossed with a radio.  A matrix channelling array was sticking out of the side like an antenna, but it's now cracked and probably useless.  There is a small screen on the front, obviously burned out.  Parts of the plastic casing are warped as though the plastic had frozen and cracked."

msgid "Must have the Biokinetic Power Overcome Pain 5+, the Electrokinetic power Pain Suppression 6+ or the Telepathic power Mood Stabilization 8+."
msgstr "Must have the Biokinetic Power Overcome Pain 5+, the Electrokinetic power Pain Suppression 6+ or the Telepathic power Mood Stabilisation 8+."

msgid "Must have the Torrential Channeling trait."
msgstr "Must have the Torrential Channelling trait."

msgid "Clear-Minded Channeling"
msgstr "Clear-Minded Channelling"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Happy.  In Your Lane.  Focused.  Flourishing.  Your Intelligence is only penalized 66% of the normal amount from pain, and 33% of normal if you're using the Biokinetic power Overcome Pain, the Electrokinetic power Pain Suppression, or the Telepathic power Mood Stabilization."
msgstr "Happy.  In Your Lane.  Focused.  Flourishing.  Your Intelligence is only penalised 66% of the normal amount from pain, and 33% of normal if you're using the Biokinetic power Overcome Pain, the Electrokinetic power Pain Suppression, or the Telepathic power Mood Stabilisation."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Once you get going you just keep rolling.  Your next use of a psionic power within five seconds of channeling one has its stamina cost reduced by 25%."
msgstr "Once you get going you just keep rolling.  Your next use of a psionic power within five seconds of channelling one has its stamina cost reduced by 25%."

msgid "Nether energy easily flows through you, causing your power to rise and fall far faster than normal.  You gain far more Nether Attunement from channeling or maintaining your powers, but you lose your Nether Attunement much faster as well.  You do not lose Nether Attunement at this accelerated rate while maintaining any powers."
msgstr "Nether energy easily flows through you, causing your power to rise and fall far faster than normal.  You gain far more Nether Attunement from channelling or maintaining your powers, but you lose your Nether Attunement much faster as well.  You do not lose Nether Attunement at this accelerated rate while maintaining any powers."

#, c-format
msgid "You are one with the Nether and the Nether is with you.  The stamina cost of channeling your next power is reduced by 25%."
msgstr "You are one with the Nether and the Nether is with you.  The stamina cost of channelling your next power is reduced by 25%."

msgid ""
"I don't want one of those assignments ever again.  They call themselves \"Offworld Acquisitions\" but do you know what they actually do?  They're butchers!  I can only sit through so many lectures about how \"only humans have human rights\" before I want to just start trying to adjust their thought processes.  Give me an hour alone in a room with each one of them and they'll never want to hurt a fly.\n"
"\n"
"Mark my words, those maniacs are making enemies that we can't afford to make.  We don't know everything that's out there beyond the gates and it's pure luck we haven't made contact with a civilization that wants to hunt US for something WE have.  Unless we have and some of those immersion teams that went missing were actually captured.  They're playing with fire and we're all going to get burned."
msgstr ""
"I don't want one of those assignments ever again.  They call themselves \"Offworld Acquisitions\" but do you know what they actually do?  They're butchers!  I can only sit through so many lectures about how \"only humans have human rights\" before I want to just start trying to adjust their thought processes.  Give me an hour alone in a room with each one of them and they'll never want to hurt a fly.\n"
"\n"
"Mark my words, those maniacs are making enemies that we can't afford to make.  We don't know everything that's out there beyond the gates and it's pure luck we haven't made contact with a civilisation that wants to hunt US for something WE have.  Unless we have and some of those immersion teams that went missing were actually captured.  They're playing with fire and we're all going to get burned."

msgid ""
"At 0411 this morning, a GLASS ANVIL mathematician seconded to XEDRA-40 discovered an anomaly in one of the returning immersion teams during a routine random security scan.  While monitoring Dr. Mahika Mittal, the mathematician suddenly screamed and grabbed their head before collapsing to the floor.  In the ensuing confusion, Dr. Mittal attempted to grab Sgt Adams's rifle before making a gesture and \"causing the temperature in the room to drop to freezing\".  Following this, Dr. Mittal grabbed Dr. McDowell and dragged him back through the still-open dive aperture just before it closed.  An attempt to reopen the aperture to the previous destination was unsuccessful at producing a stable connection; further efforts are ongoing.\n"
"\n"
"When awakened, mathematician U72 stated that during her attempt to make contact she felt \"Something cold, icy, like a glacier.  Inhuman.  It wasn't Dr. Mahika, it was something that looked like her, or had taken her place or…I don't know.\"  When told that Dr. Mittal had escaped, U72 was emphatic that it (she only ever used the word it) had to be captured for study and to prevent similar incidents from happening again.\n"
"\n"
"Questioning of the other dive team members is ongoing.  None of them said Dr. Mittal showed any suspicious behavior either before or during the dive."
msgstr ""
"At 0411 this morning, a GLASS ANVIL mathematician seconded to XEDRA-40 discovered an anomaly in one of the returning immersion teams during a routine random security scan.  While monitoring Dr. Mahika Mittal, the mathematician suddenly screamed and grabbed their head before collapsing to the floor.  In the ensuing confusion, Dr. Mittal attempted to grab Sgt Adams's rifle before making a gesture and \"causing the temperature in the room to drop to freezing\".  Following this, Dr. Mittal grabbed Dr. McDowell and dragged him back through the still-open dive aperture just before it closed.  An attempt to reopen the aperture to the previous destination was unsuccessful at producing a stable connection; further efforts are ongoing.\n"
"\n"
"When awakened, mathematician U72 stated that during her attempt to make contact she felt \"Something cold, icy, like a glacier.  Inhuman.  It wasn't Dr. Mahika, it was something that looked like her, or had taken her place or…I don't know.\"  When told that Dr. Mittal had escaped, U72 was emphatic that it (she only ever used the word it) had to be captured for study and to prevent similar incidents from happening again.\n"
"\n"
"Questioning of the other dive team members is ongoing.  None of them said Dr. Mittal showed any suspicious behaviour either before or during the dive."

msgid "A gentle, plump, small-billed bird with a third eye, between its bill and forehead.  On the ground, it struts about with a characteristic bobbing of the head.  It is a strong, swift flier thanks to its long wings and powerful flight muscles.  Is it following you?"
msgstr "A gentle, plump, small-billed bird with a third eye, between its bill and forehead.  On the ground, it struts about with a characteristic bobbing of the head.  It is a strong, swift flyer thanks to its long wings and powerful flight muscles.  Is it following you?"

msgid "A tiny darkly-colored chick, it could be from a number of different species if it weren't for the third eye below the center of its forehead."
msgstr "A tiny darkly-coloured chick, it could be from a number of different species if it weren't for the third eye below the centre of its forehead."

msgid "This large canid has grown to terrifying proportions, roughly three times the size of some of its brethren.  Its teeth give steak knives a run for their money, and it looks to be the social center of any surrounding dogs."
msgstr "This large canid has grown to terrifying proportions, roughly three times the size of some of its brethren.  Its teeth give steak knives a run for their money, and it looks to be the social centre of any surrounding dogs."

msgid "An adorable, defenseless Labrador puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog.  Its breath is very hot."
msgstr "An adorable, defenceless Labrador puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog.  Its breath is very hot."

#, c-format
msgid "Mathematician A57 hits your %2$s without penetrating your armor."
msgstr "Mathematician A57 hits your %2$s without penetrating your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "Mathematician A57 hits <npcname>'s %2$s without penetrating their armor."
msgstr "Mathematician A57 hits <npcname>'s %2$s without penetrating their armour."

msgid "Mathematician A57 touches you but only hits your armor."
msgstr "Mathematician A57 touches you but only hits your armour."

msgid "Mathematician A57 touches <npcname> but only hits their armor."
msgstr "Mathematician A57 touches <npcname> but only hits their armour."

msgid "This person seems to be afraid of his own illusionary tricks, not being used to his 'magic' actually working.  He doesn't seem to be able to control it very well, or willfully."
msgstr "This person seems to be afraid of his own illusionary tricks, not being used to his 'magic' actually working.  He doesn't seem to be able to control it very well, or wilfully."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at you, but the telekinetic attack rebounds off your armor."
msgstr "%1$s stares at you, but the telekinetic attack rebounds off your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at <npcname>, but the telekinetic attack rebounds off their armor."
msgstr "%1$s stares at <npcname>, but the telekinetic attack rebounds off their armour."

msgid "Hovering half a meter off the ground, this feral human is surrounded by a whirling cloud of rock, dust, splintered wood, and various household objects.  As they move, the ground occasionally shakes."
msgstr "Hovering half a metre off the ground, this feral human is surrounded by a whirling cloud of rock, dust, splintered wood, and various household objects.  As they move, the ground occasionally shakes."

#, c-format
msgid "The air around %1$s's hands distorts and they hit your %2$s without penetrating your armor."
msgstr "The air around %1$s's hands distorts and they hit your %2$s without penetrating your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "The air around %1$s's hands distorts and they hit <npcname>'s %2$s without penetrating their armor."
msgstr "The air around %1$s's hands distorts and they hit <npcname>'s %2$s without penetrating their armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s touches you but only hits your armor."
msgstr "%1$s touches you but only hits your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s touches <npcname> but only hits their armor."
msgstr "%1$s touches <npcname> but only hits their armour."

#, c-format
msgid "As %s succumbs to their wounds, they suddenly rise up with new vigor!"
msgstr "As %s succumbs to their wounds, they suddenly rise up with new vigour!"

msgid "A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  You have the distinct sense that it's watching you."
msgstr "A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralysing sting concealed within.  You have the distinct sense that it's watching you."

msgid "A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  The air around it wavers slightly, like a summer haze."
msgstr "A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralysing sting concealed within.  The air around it wavers slightly, like a summer haze."

msgid "A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  Occasionally it vanishes and reappears elsewhere."
msgstr "A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralysing sting concealed within.  Occasionally it vanishes and reappears elsewhere."

msgid "This zombie looks fairly ordinary, other than walking slightly more quickly than the standard shambling.  But there's something subtly wrong about it.  When you look directly at it, gray static flickers on the edge of your vision and you hear a very low droning hum."
msgstr "This zombie looks fairly ordinary, other than walking slightly more quickly than the standard shambling.  But there's something subtly wrong about it.  When you look directly at it, grey static flickers on the edge of your vision and you hear a very low droning hum."

msgid "This zombie's limbs are elongated and its torso is stretched, causing it to occasionally drop on all fours to skitter faster than a normal walk.  When you look directly at it, gray static flickers on the edge of your vision and you hear a very low droning hum."
msgstr "This zombie's limbs are elongated and its torso is stretched, causing it to occasionally drop on all fours to skitter faster than a normal walk.  When you look directly at it, grey static flickers on the edge of your vision and you hear a very low droning hum."

msgid "Thoughts of old creepy Internet memes arise unbidden as you see this zombie.  It's almost ten feet tall but incredibly thin, with spindly legs and with arms that hang down almost all the way to the ground.  Occasionally, it drops on all fours to clamber with uncanny speed over some bit of rubble.  When you look directly at it, gray static flickers on the edge of your vision and you hear a very low droning hum."
msgstr "Thoughts of old creepy Internet memes arise unbidden as you see this zombie.  It's almost ten feet tall but incredibly thin, with spindly legs and with arms that hang down almost all the way to the ground.  Occasionally, it drops on all fours to clamber with uncanny speed over some bit of rubble.  When you look directly at it, grey static flickers on the edge of your vision and you hear a very low droning hum."

msgid "Galvanic Armor"
msgstr "Galvanic Armour"

msgid "Your crystal-fueled powers activate!"
msgstr "Your crystal-fuelled powers activate!"

msgid "Extended Channeling"
msgstr "Extended Channelling"

msgid "You can take more time and care in channeling your powers.  It will take 25x as long to evoke them, but it will be much easier to activate them and you will be less likely to gain Nether Attunement while doing so."
msgstr "You can take more time and care in channelling your powers.  It will take 25x as long to evoke them, but it will be much easier to activate them and you will be less likely to gain Nether Attunement while doing so."

msgid "Extended Channeling Active"
msgstr "Extended Channelling Active"

msgid "The active trait for Extended Channeling.  It's a bug if you can see it."
msgstr "The active trait for Extended Channelling.  It's a bug if you can see it."

msgid "Torrential Channeling"
msgstr "Torrential Channelling"

msgid "Torrential Channeling Active"
msgstr "Torrential Channelling Active"

msgid "The active trait for Torrential Channeling.  It's a bug if you can see it."
msgstr "The active trait for Torrential Channelling.  It's a bug if you can see it."

msgid ""
"Project OBSIDIAN RING.\n"
"\n"
"Project GRAY DAWN.\n"
"\n"
"Enter login credentials."
msgstr ""
"Project OBSIDIAN RING.\n"
"\n"
"Project GREY DAWN.\n"
"\n"
"Enter login credentials."

msgid "I don't think so.  I know there are zombies out there and the world is all fucked up, but I'd rather keep that fucked-up-ness as far away from me as possible.  No offense."
msgstr "I don't think so.  I know there are zombies out there and the world is all fucked up, but I'd rather keep that fucked-up-ness as far away from me as possible.  No offence."

msgid "[Neural Spasms Check] *Paralyze <npc_name>*."
msgstr "[Neural Spasms Check] *Paralyse <npc_name>*."

msgid "You failed to paralyze <npc_name>!"
msgstr "You failed to paralyse <npc_name>!"

msgid "&You reach out to the voice's location(?) and try to touch its thoughts.  In an instant, your mind is filled by a babble of your *own* thoughts, at exactly the moment you think them, which then repeat again as you realize what is happening and your thoughts about the experience are reflected back at you and your brain is filled with an agonizing cacophony until you break the connection."
msgstr "&You reach out to the voice's location(?) and try to touch its thoughts.  In an instant, your mind is filled by a babble of your *own* thoughts, at exactly the moment you think them, which then repeat again as you realise what is happening and your thoughts about the experience are reflected back at you and your brain is filled with an agonising cacophony until you break the connection."

msgid "«Who does this asshole think he is?»"
msgstr "«Who does this arsehole think he is?»"

msgid "&It's only a moment, but that's enough.  You are looking from behind a tree onto a road where a crude roadblock has been set up.  There's a refugee bus, one of the same ones parked outside the refugee center, stopped at the roadblock, and as the driver gets out to look at the roadblock, there's a loud crack and two spots of red appear on his chest and leg.  As he begins to fall and the people in the bus start screaming, the raiders emerge from the trees, already running with guns raised."
msgstr "&It's only a moment, but that's enough.  You are looking from behind a tree onto a road where a crude roadblock has been set up.  There's a refugee bus, one of the same ones parked outside the refugee centre, stopped at the roadblock, and as the driver gets out to look at the roadblock, there's a loud crack and two spots of red appear on his chest and leg.  As he begins to fall and the people in the bus start screaming, the raiders emerge from the trees, already running with guns raised."

msgid "Use a target's own inner fears against them, paralyzing them with overwhelming terror.  The effect will not last long, but is completely immobilizing while it does, and it leaves a lingering horror behind in the target."
msgstr "Use a target's own inner fears against them, paralysing them with overwhelming terror.  The effect will not last long, but is completely immobilising while it does, and it leaves a lingering horror behind in the target."

msgid "You can reshape your physical appearance, changing hair, skin, or eye color.  Your own mother wouldn't recognize you when you're done."
msgstr "You can reshape your physical appearance, changing hair, skin, or eye colour.  Your own mother wouldn't recognise you when you're done."

msgid ""
"You can increase the strength of your skin, making it almost like armor while still allowing you to move freely.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"You can increase the strength of your skin, making it almost like armour while still allowing you to move freely.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."

msgid ""
"You can supercharge your metabolism, allowing you to eat, drink, and sleep much less than normal.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"You can supercharge your metabolism, allowing you to eat, drink, and sleep much less than normal.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>cancelled by engaging in combat</color>."

msgid ""
"With a large amount of focus, you can maintain a targeted control over any alterations to your body.  Whenever you mutate, you will have additional options to select from.  This power does not cause you to mutate on its own.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more concentration</color> than usual."
msgstr ""
"With a large amount of focus, you can maintain a targeted control over any alterations to your body.  Whenever you mutate, you will have additional options to select from.  This power does not cause you to mutate on its own.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>cancelled by engaging in combat</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more concentration</color> than usual."

msgid ""
"Your powers make words fairly leap off the page directly into your mind, allowing you to read much faster and better absorb what you read.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"Your powers make words fairly leap off the page directly into your mind, allowing you to read much faster and better absorb what you read.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>cancelled by engaging in combat</color>."

msgid ""
"You can see people's emotions and physical state as a hazy swirl of color around their body.  This makes it much easier to get them to do what you want.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"You can see people's emotions and physical state as a hazy swirl of colour around their body.  This makes it much easier to get them to do what you want.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>cancelled by engaging in combat</color>."

msgid ""
"Opening yourself up to the immediate future, you can see the best option to take when crafting or working on a task.  However, due to the intensity of the visions you will be <color_red>blind</color> to the outside world while crafting anything.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"Opening yourself up to the immediate future, you can see the best option to take when crafting or working on a task.  However, due to the intensity of the visions you will be <color_red>blind</color> to the outside world while crafting anything.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>cancelled by engaging in combat</color>."

msgid "Swirling colors coalesce around others' bodies"
msgstr "Swirling colours coalesce around others' bodies"

msgid ""
"End your concentration on all of your maintained powers.\n"
"\n"
"Channeling this power <color_green>always succeeds</color>."
msgstr ""
"End your concentration on all of your maintained powers.\n"
"\n"
"Channelling this power <color_green>always succeeds</color>."

msgid ""
"End your concentration on a specific power.\n"
"\n"
"Channeling this power <color_green>always succeeds</color>."
msgstr ""
"End your concentration on a specific power.\n"
"\n"
"Channelling this power <color_green>always succeeds</color>."

msgid "[Ψ]Re-energize"
msgstr "[Ψ]Re-energise"

msgid ""
