msgstr "You spend some time memorising your location."

msgid "A handful of colorful fruit-flavored chewy candy.  They feel warm to the touch and you can almost feel a slow beat coming from them.  How odd…"
msgstr "A handful of colourful fruit-flavoured chewy candy.  They feel warm to the touch and you can almost feel a slow beat coming from them.  How odd…"

msgid "A handful of colorful fruit-flavored chewy candy shaped in a reptilian fashion.  They're warm to the touch and you can feel a slow beat coming from them.  How odd…"
msgstr "A handful of colourful fruit-flavoured chewy candy shaped in a reptilian fashion.  They're warm to the touch and you can feel a slow beat coming from them.  How odd…"

msgid "This is raw, unhomogenized and unpasteurized chocolate milk from a chocolate cow.  It couldn't be any fresher unless you drank it straight from the cow, which might upset it.  Depending on your dietary sensibilities, you might want to pasteurize or even boil this before drinking."
msgstr "This is raw, unhomogenized and unpasteurised chocolate milk from a chocolate cow.  It couldn't be any fresher unless you drank it straight from the cow, which might upset it.  Depending on your dietary sensibilities, you might want to pasteurise or even boil this before drinking."

msgid "A chunk of colorful fruit-flavored chewy candy meat."
msgstr "A chunk of colourful fruit-flavoured chewy candy meat."

msgid "A chunk of colorful fruit-flavored candy meat, this one is extra chewy."
msgstr "A chunk of colourful fruit-flavoured candy meat, this one is extra chewy."

msgid "Bits and pieces of plastic entangled in sticky candy goop.  They spot some bright colors and might have been part of a candy wrapper at some point.  Maybe you could suck the sugar from them, if you're really desperate."
msgstr "Bits and pieces of plastic entangled in sticky candy goop.  They spot some bright colours and might have been part of a candy wrapper at some point.  Maybe you could suck the sugar from them, if you're really desperate."

msgid "A small humanoid made of marshmallow.  Its chocolate-coated cracker armor shines dully as it bumbles around on its stubby marshmallow legs.  How cute!"
msgstr "A small humanoid made of marshmallow.  Its chocolate-coated cracker armour shines dully as it bumbles around on its stubby marshmallow legs.  How cute!"

msgid "A marshmallow humanoid clad in knightly armor made of chocolate-coated crackers.  It bumbles around as if looking around for something.  It's oddly adorable in a majestic sort of way."
msgstr "A marshmallow humanoid clad in knightly armour made of chocolate-coated crackers.  It bumbles around as if looking around for something.  It's oddly adorable in a majestic sort of way."

msgid "Standing tall in its shining armor of chocolate-coated crackers, this marshmallow proudly strides towards an unknown goal."
msgstr "Standing tall in its shining armour of chocolate-coated crackers, this marshmallow proudly strides towards an unknown goal."

msgid "A gigantic humanoid armored with thick plates of chocolate-coated crackers.  Its frozen smile is barely visible from under its heavy helmet as it scans its surroundings."
msgstr "A gigantic humanoid armoured with thick plates of chocolate-coated crackers.  Its frozen smile is barely visible from under its heavy helmet as it scans its surroundings."

msgid "A large bear made of flavored sugary gelatin.  Its smooth, round shape and fruity smell make it somehow less scary than its fleshy counterpart."
msgstr "A large bear made of flavoured sugary gelatin.  Its smooth, round shape and fruity smell make it somehow less scary than its fleshy counterpart."

msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Crystallized."
msgstr "Crystallised."

msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Crystallized."
msgstr "Crystallised."

msgid "The corpse of a deep one shot several times in the back with a low-caliber weapon."
msgstr "The corpse of a deep one shot several times in the back with a low-calibre weapon."

msgid "A large, greenish-gray amphibious humanoid with webbed hands and feet.  It's wide, flabby head is distinctly fish like with wide staring eyes and its gangling limbs end in wickedly sharp claws.  It moves with an odd hopping gait, occasionally dropping down to walk on four limbs."
msgstr "A large, greenish-grey amphibious humanoid with webbed hands and feet.  It's wide, flabby head is distinctly fish like with wide staring eyes and its gangling limbs end in wickedly sharp claws.  It moves with an odd hopping gait, occasionally dropping down to walk on four limbs."

msgid "This humanoid creature has a semi-canine head, hooved feet, and claws.  Its rubbery skin is pale and covered with grave-mold."
msgstr "This humanoid creature has a semi-canine head, hooved feet, and claws.  Its rubbery skin is pale and covered with grave-mould."

msgid "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armor of the chicken walker."
msgstr "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armour of the chicken walker."

msgid "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armor of the Beagle tank."
msgstr "What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and armour of the Beagle tank."

msgid "The Northrop Watchman X-1 is a production series of heavily armored combat robots.  Initially designed for military patrol and escort service, it rolls on a set of hydraulic treads and is armed with a M16A4."
msgstr "The Northrop Watchman X-1 is a production series of heavily armoured combat robots.  Initially designed for military patrol and escort service, it rolls on a set of hydraulic treads and is armed with a M16A4."

msgid "This armored soldier zombie appears to have been some sort of special forces agent.  Its malfunctioning equipment sends out occasional showers of sparks."
msgstr "This armoured soldier zombie appears to have been some sort of special forces agent.  Its malfunctioning equipment sends out occasional showers of sparks."

msgid "Sir you are not authorized to be here… you should leave."
msgstr "Sir you are not authorised to be here… you should leave."

msgid "Ma'am you are not authorized to be here… you should leave."
msgstr "Ma'am you are not authorised to be here… you should leave."

msgid "Vault - Armory"
msgstr "Vault - Armoury"

msgid "Vault - Visitor Center"
msgstr "Vault - Visitor Centre"

msgid "The rhythm of combat is in your favor."
msgstr "The rhythm of combat is in your favour."

msgid "Successful blocking has left you in a favorable position."
msgstr "Successful blocking has left you in a favourable position."

msgid "Perform a finishing attack with a knife or dagger when reaching 3 tempo stacks.  The attack will prioritize enemy weak points."
msgstr "Perform a finishing attack with a knife or dagger when reaching 3 tempo stacks.  The attack will prioritise enemy weak points."

#, no-c-format
msgid "If you have no combat buffs active, perform an opening attack with armor penetration increased by 225% of your strength.  Just hit them with the damn thing."
msgstr "If you have no combat buffs active, perform an opening attack with armour penetration increased by 225% of your strength.  Just hit them with the damn thing."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Whenever you attack a human-sized target with a great axe, great sword or great hammer if the target has less health than the base attack rating of your weapon, you will execute them instead.  Execution attacks ignore armor and will restore 10% of your max stamina."
msgstr "Whenever you attack a human-sized target with a great axe, great sword or great hammer if the target has less health than the base attack rating of your weapon, you will execute them instead.  Execution attacks ignore armour and will restore 10% of your max stamina."

msgid "You passively accumulate up to 20 insight stacks while near enemies.  Each insight stack increases all damage dealt by 1 until your next attack.  Insight greatly favors perceptive warriors."
msgstr "You passively accumulate up to 20 insight stacks while near enemies.  Each insight stack increases all damage dealt by 1 until your next attack.  Insight greatly favours perceptive warriors."

msgid "Rapid movement generates momentum stacks.  Momentum greatly favors dextrous warriors."
msgstr "Rapid movement generates momentum stacks.  Momentum greatly favours dextrous warriors."

msgid "Duelist Form"
msgstr "Duellist Form"

msgid ""
"Perfect.  Now do it again.\n"
"Attacks generate stacks of combat tempo.  Tempo greatly favors the strong."
msgstr ""
"Perfect.  Now do it again.\n"
"Attacks generate stacks of combat tempo.  Tempo greatly favours the strong."

msgid ""
"You've proved you can survive a few excursions to the world below.  Something in the warp pulls at you, quickening your pulse and turning your vision red.  The sensation is indescribable.  You feel… powerful.\n"
"The Heart of the Island may have further use for you.\n"
"\n"
"Healing at the Heart of the Island is no longer free.  Be cautious in your future endeavors."
msgstr ""
"You've proved you can survive a few excursions to the world below.  Something in the warp pulls at you, quickening your pulse and turning your vision red.  The sensation is indescribable.  You feel… powerful.\n"
"The Heart of the Island may have further use for you.\n"
"\n"
"Healing at the Heart of the Island is no longer free.  Be cautious in your future endeavours."

msgid ""
"Set the behavior of the return obelisk.\n"
"With this option, everything in the room with you will return to your sky island.  Getting resources will generally not be a problem as long as you make it to the extraction point."
msgstr ""
"Set the behaviour of the return obelisk.\n"
"With this option, everything in the room with you will return to your sky island.  Getting resources will generally not be a problem as long as you make it to the extraction point."

msgid ""
"Set the behavior of the return obelisk.\n"
"With this option, if you have a warp vortex token with you, everything in the room with you will return to your sky island.  Otherwise, only what you are carrying on your person will return with you.  You may have to make difficult choices about what to bring back."
msgstr ""
"Set the behaviour of the return obelisk.\n"
"With this option, if you have a warp vortex token with you, everything in the room with you will return to your sky island.  Otherwise, only what you are carrying on your person will return with you.  You may have to make difficult choices about what to bring back."

msgid ""
"Set the behavior of the return obelisk.\n"
"With this option, only what you are carrying on your person will return with you.  You will always have to make difficult choices about what to bring back."
msgstr ""
"Set the behaviour of the return obelisk.\n"
"With this option, only what you are carrying on your person will return with you.  You will always have to make difficult choices about what to bring back."

msgid "Adjust Return Obelisk Behavior"
msgstr "Adjust Return Obelisk Behaviour"

msgid "Warp home behavior set to whole room.  You can use the Difficulty Adjuster if you wish to change your setting at any time."
msgstr "Warp home behaviour set to whole room.  You can use the Difficulty Adjuster if you wish to change your setting at any time."

msgid "Warp home behavior set to whole room at a cost.  You can use the Difficulty Adjuster if you wish to change your setting at any time."
msgstr "Warp home behaviour set to whole room at a cost.  You can use the Difficulty Adjuster if you wish to change your setting at any time."

msgid "Warp home behavior set to self only.  You can use the Difficulty Adjuster if you wish to change your setting at any time."
msgstr "Warp home behaviour set to self only.  You can use the Difficulty Adjuster if you wish to change your setting at any time."

msgid "Can you summarize this for me, briefly?"
msgstr "Can you summarise this for me, briefly?"

msgid "The air crackles with static electricity, then stabilizes."
msgstr "The air crackles with static electricity, then stabilises."

msgid "The Island is your home now.  It will be prudent to make it livable."
msgstr "The Island is your home now.  It will be prudent to make it liveable."

msgid "You're going to die.  And if you weren't busy leaking blood out of every pore, you'd find a better way to emphasize just how badly you're dying.  Your only hope is to return home immediately."
msgstr "You're going to die.  And if you weren't busy leaking blood out of every pore, you'd find a better way to emphasise just how badly you're dying.  Your only hope is to return home immediately."

msgid "The very fabric of your being is unraveling!  You're in dire straits.  You need to get back to your sanctuary island NOW!"
msgstr "The very fabric of your being is unravelling!  You're in dire straits.  You need to get back to your sanctuary island NOW!"

msgid "You've stayed earthside WAY too long!  Your body barely responds and your senses are slush.  The world itself feels barbed and frayed, and the very air is like breathing fiberglass.  If you want to survive, you need to warp home as soon as possible."
msgstr "You've stayed earthside WAY too long!  Your body barely responds and your senses are slush.  The world itself feels barbed and frayed, and the very air is like breathing fibreglass.  If you want to survive, you need to warp home as soon as possible."

msgid "You fully materialize.  You're not invisible anymore!"
msgstr "You fully materialise.  You're not invisible anymore!"

msgid ""
"Though visibly little more than a glowing dustbunny, this strange ethereal mote of warp essence reveals, on closer inspection, something more.  A tiny, twisting, half-visible thread of shimmering bluish-purple trails away into the sky and far out of sight, unimpeded by any obstacles.\n"
"\n"
"Taking this rare and valuable artifact with you on an expedition is essentially buying life insurance.  If you die with this mote in your inventory, you will instead be restored to full health and brought home, WITH all items and equipment carried.  But this effect will only last for a single expedition.  Even if you extract safely, any and all motes carried on your person when you return home will be DESTROYED."
msgstr ""
"Though visibly little more than a glowing dustbunny, this strange ethereal mote of warp essence reveals, on closer inspection, something more.  A tiny, twisting, half-visible thread of shimmering bluish-purple trails away into the sky and far out of sight, unimpeded by any obstacles.\n"
"\n"
"Taking this rare and valuable artefact with you on an expedition is essentially buying life insurance.  If you die with this mote in your inventory, you will instead be restored to full health and brought home, WITH all items and equipment carried.  But this effect will only last for a single expedition.  Even if you extract safely, any and all motes carried on your person when you return home will be DESTROYED."

msgid "This strange obsidian-colored plate is capable of mimicking the advanced tech found within a modern Autodoc, and can be used to create a working copy at your sanctuary.  However, it is inert in its current state and must first be imprinted on a working Autodoc.  To do so, find an Autodoc during an expedition and use the construction menu to imprint this plate."
msgstr "This strange obsidian-coloured plate is capable of mimicking the advanced tech found within a modern Autodoc, and can be used to create a working copy at your sanctuary.  However, it is inert in its current state and must first be imprinted on a working Autodoc.  To do so, find an Autodoc during an expedition and use the construction menu to imprint this plate."

msgid "This strange obsidian-colored plate is capable of mimicking the advanced tech found within a modern Autodoc, and can be used to create a working copy at your sanctuary.  It has been successfully activated and can be used as the catalyst to create a new Autodoc at a location of your choosing using the construction menu.  Be aware this cannot be safely moved once placed, and will also require you to add an adjacent couch, then convert it to an Autodoc couch."
msgstr "This strange obsidian-coloured plate is capable of mimicking the advanced tech found within a modern Autodoc, and can be used to create a working copy at your sanctuary.  It has been successfully activated and can be used as the catalyst to create a new Autodoc at a location of your choosing using the construction menu.  Be aware this cannot be safely moved once placed, and will also require you to add an adjacent couch, then convert it to an Autodoc couch."

msgid "A lump of purplish goo, smooth but yielding, sculptable like clay.  If you rub it on a wound, it will immediately heal some of the damage you have taken, but the air of the lower world destabilizes its structure and it will only last a single trip to the surface."
msgstr "A lump of purplish goo, smooth but yielding, sculptable like clay.  If you rub it on a wound, it will immediately heal some of the damage you have taken, but the air of the lower world destabilises its structure and it will only last a single trip to the surface."

msgid "A small quantity of airy-thin material that resembles flaked obsidian.  It glints with a purplish shimmer that seems to stretch off the bounds of itself and into the air itself.  Offered to the powers that be, one could exchange it for valuable artifacts."
msgstr "A small quantity of airy-thin material that resembles flaked obsidian.  It glints with a purplish shimmer that seems to stretch off the bounds of itself and into the air itself.  Offered to the powers that be, one could exchange it for valuable artefacts."

msgid "You're still materializing and not fully visible yet.  In about <global_val:invistime> seconds, the world will be able to see you, so if you were warped into danger, now's your chance to get to cover."
msgstr "You're still materialising and not fully visible yet.  In about <global_val:invistime> seconds, the world will be able to see you, so if you were warped into danger, now's your chance to get to cover."

msgid "An attempt at an entirely new way to play CDDA, inspired by games like Escape from Tarkov and Dark and Darker.  Begin on a floating island in the sky and warp down to random spots on the earth below to conduct expeditions for items you need.  Permadeath is gone - you will return to the island on death but lose any items you had on you.  Build up your stockpile, carry out missions for unique rewards, customize your home island, unlock upgrades, and be prudent about what you take on any given outing.  Be aware that 'PLAY NOW' will NOT work, you MUST make a custom character."
msgstr "An attempt at an entirely new way to play CDDA, inspired by games like Escape from Tarkov and Dark and Darker.  Begin on a floating island in the sky and warp down to random spots on the earth below to conduct expeditions for items you need.  Permadeath is gone - you will return to the island on death but lose any items you had on you.  Build up your stockpile, carry out missions for unique rewards, customise your home island, unlock upgrades, and be prudent about what you take on any given outing.  Be aware that 'PLAY NOW' will NOT work, you MUST make a custom character."

msgid "Utilizing the unstable, reality-changing nature of the warp shards, you could combine several to create a powerful semi-magical item.  This is a skill you have no way of practicing and a field of science no one's ever really touched, so exactly what you'd get from it is anyone's guess."
msgstr "Utilising the unstable, reality-changing nature of the warp shards, you could combine several to create a powerful semi-magical item.  This is a skill you have no way of practicing and a field of science no one's ever really touched, so exactly what you'd get from it is anyone's guess."

msgid "materialize random artifact"
msgstr "materialise random artefact"

msgid "You have come into possession of a medium-sized, ethereal storage container that cannot be removed or destroyed.  It can hold 1 liter and will bring items back to the island with you, even when you die."
msgstr "You have come into possession of a medium-sized, ethereal storage container that cannot be removed or destroyed.  It can hold 1 litre and will bring items back to the island with you, even when you die."

msgid "You have come into possession of a very large, ethereal storage container that cannot be removed or destroyed.  It can hold 2 liters and will bring items back to the island with you, even when you die."
msgstr "You have come into possession of a very large, ethereal storage container that cannot be removed or destroyed.  It can hold 2 litres and will bring items back to the island with you, even when you die."

msgid "A warp pulse shudders through your head like a localized earthquake and your extremities surge with pain like they're peeling open.  You need to get home as soon as possible."
msgstr "A warp pulse shudders through your head like a localised earthquake and your extremities surge with pain like they're peeling open.  You need to get home as soon as possible."

msgid ""
"As the warp pulse hits, you realize there are no words to describe how much trouble you're in.  Your body is crumbling to wet paste and your blood is twisting into a viny tangle.  All you know is pain.\n"
"You're not just dying, you're dying horribly.\n"
"If escape is already near you may survive against all odds, but oblivion is only moments away."
msgstr ""
"As the warp pulse hits, you realise there are no words to describe how much trouble you're in.  Your body is crumbling to wet paste and your blood is twisting into a viny tangle.  All you know is pain.\n"
"You're not just dying, you're dying horribly.\n"
"If escape is already near you may survive against all odds, but oblivion is only moments away."

