msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Scavenged armor and mid-range skills, meant to represent an established survivor before making the jump to (self)-fabricated custom gear."
msgstr "Scavenged armour and mid-range skills, meant to represent an established survivor before making the jump to (self)-fabricated custom gear."

