#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to… uhh, like you?  Well, as certainly as you could tell a mollusk could like you."
msgstr "The %s seems to… uhh, like you?  Well, as certainly as you could tell a mollusc could like you."

#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to… uhh, like you?  Well, as certainly as you could tell a giant mollusk could like you."
msgstr "The %s seems to… uhh, like you?  Well, as certainly as you could tell a giant mollusc could like you."

msgid "This looks like some kind of alien sponge.  It has a bluish color and seems sturdy as a rock."
msgstr "This looks like some kind of alien sponge.  It has a bluish colour and seems sturdy as a rock."

msgid "Freshly cooked cnidarian.  Looks translucent and tasteless, you may want to add something to flavor it."
msgstr "Freshly cooked cnidarian.  Looks translucent and tasteless, you may want to add something to flavour it."

msgid "A strange gray pod that was dropped by one of the giant fungus.  It may be the closest thing to a fungal egg."
msgstr "A strange grey pod that was dropped by one of the giant fungus.  It may be the closest thing to a fungal egg."

msgid "The largest species of toucan sporting dark plumage and a bright colored beak.  This bird can be found pretty much all over South America, feeding on fruits and seeds."
msgstr "The largest species of toucan sporting dark plumage and a bright coloured beak.  This bird can be found pretty much all over South America, feeding on fruits and seeds."

msgid "A small bird with bright green-colored plumage and a short hooked beak.  This species is widespread throughout all of South America, on top of being quite intelligent and sometimes kept as pets."
msgstr "A small bird with bright green-coloured plumage and a short hooked beak.  This species is widespread throughout all of South America, on top of being quite intelligent and sometimes kept as pets."

msgid "A huge species of South American catfish native to the Amazon and Orinoco rivers, they can reach almost 3 meters in length."
msgstr "A huge species of South American catfish native to the Amazon and Orinoco rivers, they can reach almost 3 metres in length."

msgid "stingray fry"
msgid_plural "stingray fries"
msgstr[0] "stingray fry"
msgstr[1] "stingray chips"

msgid "A baby stingray.  Like many other cartilaginous fishes, river stingrays are ovoviviparous and carry the eggs until the fries are ready to get out in to the world."
msgstr "A baby stingray.  Like many other cartilaginous fishes, river stingrays are ovoviviparous and carry the eggs until the chips are ready to get out in to the world."

msgid "A round and colorful genus of fish native to the Amazon river basin.  Very popular in aquariums but expensive to maintain in captivity."
msgstr "A round and colourful genus of fish native to the Amazon river basin.  Very popular in aquariums but expensive to maintain in captivity."

msgid "A domestic variant of the Amur carp originally bred in Japan for its color variations.  These fishes are known to devolve quickly to feral status if left to escape."
msgstr "A domestic variant of the Amur carp originally bred in Japan for its colour variations.  These fishes are known to devolve quickly to feral status if left to escape."

msgid "A species of omnivorous cichlid native to South America.  Quite popular in aquariums with several different colored breeds."
msgstr "A species of omnivorous cichlid native to South America.  Quite popular in aquariums with several different coloured breeds."

msgid "A sickly looking termite riddled with fungal spores.  Traces of a gray substance dribble from its mandibles."
msgstr "A sickly looking termite riddled with fungal spores.  Traces of a grey substance dribble from its mandibles."

msgid "A huge scorpion infected with a parasitic fungus.  The stinger on its tail gushes with an ominous gray liquid."
msgstr "A huge scorpion infected with a parasitic fungus.  The stinger on its tail gushes with an ominous grey liquid."

msgid "A pale-colored juvenile scorpion, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "A pale-coloured juvenile scorpion, about the size of a beer bottle."

msgid "An enormous termite dedicated to the defense of the colony.  It has a pair of enormous mandibles capable of cutting bone and chitin."
msgstr "An enormous termite dedicated to the defence of the colony.  It has a pair of enormous mandibles capable of cutting bone and chitin."

msgid "An enormous termite dedicated to the defense of the colony.  It has a strange horn-like projection on its head."
msgstr "An enormous termite dedicated to the defence of the colony.  It has a strange horn-like projection on its head."

msgid "An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a tiny tropical fish, its scales shifting color with the sky."
msgstr "An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a tiny tropical fish, its scales shifting colour with the sky."

msgid "An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a round fish with bright multicolor scales."
msgstr "An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a round fish with bright multicolour scales."

msgid "An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a bulky beaked fish with colored scales and fins like a parrot or macaw."
msgstr "An alien creature brought by the portal storms.  It resembles a bulky beaked fish with coloured scales and fins like a parrot or macaw."

msgid "A member of the Corytophanes family.  These lizards can be distinguished for their color changing ability and their crested heads."
msgstr "A member of the Corytophanes family.  These lizards can be distinguished for their colour changing ability and their crested heads."

msgid "A member of Chamaeleonidae.  These lizards are popular worldwide due to their long tongues and color shifting abilities, exported to America via pet trade."
msgstr "A member of Chamaeleonidae.  These lizards are popular worldwide due to their long tongues and colour shifting abilities, exported to America via pet trade."

msgid "A huge axolotl grown almost the size of a small croc.  It swims and ambushes prey on the murky depths like some distant paleozoic amphibian."
msgstr "A huge axolotl grown almost the size of a small croc.  It swims and ambushes prey on the murky depths like some distant palaeozoic amphibian."

msgid "A very small triffid born out of a triffid pod.  Like all triffids its a very dangerous plant but for now its just a harmless colorful flower."
msgstr "A very small triffid born out of a triffid pod.  Like all triffids its a very dangerous plant but for now its just a harmless colourful flower."

msgid "A large walking plant with an enormous flower-like upper body.  Its center has what appears to be a mouth and seems to emit a really bad aroma."
msgstr "A large walking plant with an enormous flower-like upper body.  Its centre has what appears to be a mouth and seems to emit a really bad aroma."

msgid "An undead child mutated by alien flora.  It has several colorful flowers on its scalp and an unsettling serene expression."
msgstr "An undead child mutated by alien flora.  It has several colourful flowers on its scalp and an unsettling serene expression."

msgid "An urban fantasy content mod for Agent Mulder in the apocalypse.  Creates a multi decade timeline of dimensional spillage prior to the Cataclysm.  This spillage was characterized by thin places appearing where people could step through into another dimension, but things from those dimensions could wander into our world as well.  XEDRA proliferated into an alphabet soup of agencies dedicated to simultaneously stopping, controlling, and utilizing these thin places with varying degrees of success.  Contains monsters of various types, new professions and locations, new uses for existing skills,the new deduction skill, new magic systems, and content of every type that a multidimensional Cataclysm has to offer.  This is a heavily science-fantasy mod where you are as likely to encounter supernatural monsters as you are UFOs, Sasquatch, and Chupacabra.  Please examine the readme.md file for further details."
msgstr "An urban fantasy content mod for Agent Mulder in the apocalypse.  Creates a multi decade timeline of dimensional spillage prior to the Cataclysm.  This spillage was characterised by thin places appearing where people could step through into another dimension, but things from those dimensions could wander into our world as well.  XEDRA proliferated into an alphabet soup of agencies dedicated to simultaneously stopping, controlling, and utilising these thin places with varying degrees of success.  Contains monsters of various types, new professions and locations, new uses for existing skills,the new deduction skill, new magic systems, and content of every type that a multidimensional Cataclysm has to offer.  This is a heavily science-fantasy mod where you are as likely to encounter supernatural monsters as you are UFOs, Sasquatch, and Chupacabra.  Please examine the readme.md file for further details."

msgid "The trees always hearken to your voice and wood practically molds itself like clay in your hands."
msgstr "The trees always hearken to your voice and wood practically moulds itself like clay in your hands."

msgid "Not only can you create furniture and other large constructs using treesinging, you can mold treesung wood into weapons and armor as well."
msgstr "Not only can you create furniture and other large constructs using treesinging, you can mould treesung wood into weapons and armour as well."

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "You had no idea what was going on the first time it happened, when you woke up with mud on your bare feet and a sour taste in your mouth, but you were soon found.  The People of the Moon, they called themselves, and they said you were one of them.  A werewolf.  You lived out in the wilderness for a while but didn't entirely abandon human civilization, and when the Cataclysm hit you ignored the evacuation warnings and struck it out on your own.  Maybe some of the People are still out there."
msgstr "You had no idea what was going on the first time it happened, when you woke up with mud on your bare feet and a sour taste in your mouth, but you were soon found.  The People of the Moon, they called themselves, and they said you were one of them.  A werewolf.  You lived out in the wilderness for a while but didn't entirely abandon human civilisation, and when the Cataclysm hit you ignored the evacuation warnings and struck it out on your own.  Maybe some of the People are still out there."

