msgid "You realized that one weird tabloid paper you've read a long time ago might have been correct all this time."
msgstr "You realised that one weird tabloid paper you've read a long time ago might have been correct all this time."

msgid "You suddenly realize that your ability to sense the unnatural has expanded to a level beyond those of the normal five senses."
msgstr "You suddenly realise that your ability to sense the unnatural has expanded to a level beyond those of the normal five senses."

msgid "Unknown Hemolytic Parasite"
msgstr "Unknown Haemolytic Parasite"

msgid "The colors brighten and your vision sharpens."
msgstr "The colours brighten and your vision sharpens."

msgid "You have recently realized a new alchemical recipe and your thoughts are scattered."
msgstr "You have recently realised a new alchemical recipe and your thoughts are scattered."

msgid "Energized"
