msgid "Severe Progressive Anemic Autophagy"
msgstr "Severe Progressive Anaemic Autophagy"

msgid "Vigor Mortis"
msgstr "Vigour Mortis"

msgid "You are filled with burning vigor."
msgstr "You are filled with burning vigour."

msgid "Etheric Form"
msgstr "Aetheric Form"

msgid "Armored"
msgstr "Armoured"

msgid "A loud noise fueled by a curse has sent you reeling."
msgstr "A loud noise fuelled by a curse has sent you reeling."

msgid "Stabilized Reality"
msgstr "Stabilised Reality"

msgid "Destabilizing Strikes"
msgstr "Destabilising Strikes"

msgid "You maintain a field of destabilized time around you.  Your attacks cause your targets to erode over time."
msgstr "You maintain a field of destabilised time around you.  Your attacks cause your targets to erode over time."

msgid "Your hands turn gray as the air around them starts to flicker."
msgstr "Your hands turn grey as the air around them starts to flicker."

msgid "Your field of destabilized time fades."
msgstr "Your field of destabilised time fades."

msgid "Stabilized Timeline"
msgstr "Stabilised Timeline"

msgid "Your equipment obtains a gray tint and appears ever so slightly more whole."
msgstr "Your equipment obtains a grey tint and appears ever so slightly more whole."

msgid "Your equipment loses its gray tint."
msgstr "Your equipment loses its grey tint."

msgid "This creature destabilizes time around it, eroding everything it touches."
msgstr "This creature destabilises time around it, eroding everything it touches."

msgid "You recently reshuffled your vampiric weaknesses.  Until your blood stabilizes, further attempts will be fruitless."
msgstr "You recently reshuffled your vampiric weaknesses.  Until your blood stabilises, further attempts will be fruitless."

msgid "Your blood has stabilized enough to let you try to reshuffle your weaknesses again, should they prove too much to bear."
msgstr "Your blood has stabilised enough to let you try to reshuffle your weaknesses again, should they prove too much to bear."

msgid "You are covered in a set of living bark armor."
msgstr "You are covered in a set of living bark armour."

msgid "The bark armor cracks and falls away."
msgstr "The bark armour cracks and falls away."

msgid "A glamour is prematurely aging you."
msgstr "A glamour is prematurely ageing you."

msgid "Your vigor returns."
msgstr "Your vigour returns."

msgid "Pressurized amplification"
msgstr "Pressurised amplification"

msgid "Your muscles are filled with pressurized power!"
msgstr "Your muscles are filled with pressurised power!"

msgid "The skies lose their heightened luster."
msgstr "The skies lose their heightened lustre."

msgid "Suddenly you feel your heart pounding and you realize a new ability."
msgstr "Suddenly you feel your heart pounding and you realise a new ability."

msgid "Suddenly you feel your heart slowing and you realize a new ability."
msgstr "Suddenly you feel your heart slowing and you realise a new ability."

msgid "Suddenly you feel your blood boiling and you realize a new ability."
msgstr "Suddenly you feel your blood boiling and you realise a new ability."

msgid "Your chronomantic powers destabilize and you lose their effects!"
msgstr "Your chronomantic powers destabilise and you lose their effects!"

msgid "Something sparked in your head, and you realize an interesting property of dreamdross.  Maybe you can forge something new?"
msgstr "Something sparked in your head, and you realise an interesting property of dreamdross.  Maybe you can forge something new?"

msgid "A brilliant idea about the properties of dreamdross hits your head, and you think you know how to utilize it now."
msgstr "A brilliant idea about the properties of dreamdross hits your head, and you think you know how to utilise it now."

msgid "You found a pretty smart way to utilize dreamdross' abilities, and you can't wait to use it."
msgstr "You found a pretty smart way to utilise dreamdross' abilities, and you can't wait to use it."

msgid "You realize you know suddenly how to make a low caliber bullet casing."
msgstr "You realise you know suddenly how to make a low calibre bullet casing."

msgid "You realize you know suddenly how to make a larger caliber bullet casing."
msgstr "You realise you know suddenly how to make a larger calibre bullet casing."

msgid "The ginseng plant has leaves that grow in a circle around a straight stem.  Yellowish-green, umbrella-shaped flowers grow in the center and produce red berries.  Wrinkles around the neck of the root tell how old the plant is.  This plant is over a hundred years old and if you decide to harvest it, you will need the roots."
msgstr "The ginseng plant has leaves that grow in a circle around a straight stem.  Yellowish-green, umbrella-shaped flowers grow in the centre and produce red berries.  Wrinkles around the neck of the root tell how old the plant is.  This plant is over a hundred years old and if you decide to harvest it, you will need the roots."

msgid "This specialized looking radio receiver equipment covers most of a table.  It doesn't seem to be fully operational."
msgstr "This specialised looking radio receiver equipment covers most of a table.  It doesn't seem to be fully operational."

msgid "This is a dramatic stone altar, it glows faintly in the dark.  Each of the four corners has a place for one of the cardinal elements as well as several recessed spaces around the center of the altar."
msgstr "This is a dramatic stone altar, it glows faintly in the dark.  Each of the four corners has a place for one of the cardinal elements as well as several recessed spaces around the centre of the altar."

msgid "civilization"
msgstr "civilisation"

msgid "A part of one of the last bastions of civilization.  You could travel here in moments from any road you found yourself on."
msgstr "A part of one of the last bastions of civilisation.  You could travel here in moments from any road you found yourself on."

msgid "memorized location"
msgstr "memorised location"

msgid "A person stands before you, completely motionless in spite of the horrific wound marring their body.  Every part of their figure is leeched of color, and you are completely incapable of affecting them in any way."
msgstr "A person stands before you, completely motionless in spite of the horrific wound marring their body.  Every part of their figure is leeched of colour, and you are completely incapable of affecting them in any way."

msgid "A source of considerable wealth for the few alchemists talented enough to distill them, these potions are capable of adding decades to the lifespan of those who can afford the price of the rare and expensive ingredients they require.  They are however not able to prolong a life indefinitely beyond its natural years, and you will need to find other means to achieve immortality, if that is your goal."
msgstr "A source of considerable wealth for the few alchemists talented enough to distil them, these potions are capable of adding decades to the lifespan of those who can afford the price of the rare and expensive ingredients they require.  They are however not able to prolong a life indefinitely beyond its natural years, and you will need to find other means to achieve immortality, if that is your goal."

msgid "An handwritten set of notes detailing an alchemical recipe for…a musical instrument?  You didn't realize that alchemy could be used to get the band back together again."
msgstr "An handwritten set of notes detailing an alchemical recipe for…a musical instrument?  You didn't realise that alchemy could be used to get the band back together again."

msgid "The 9×21mm Gyurza (Гюрза, Russian for 'blunt-nosed viper') round is a Russian handgun round designed to defeat body armor that was developed by TsNIITochMash for its SR-1 Vektor semi-automatic pistol and SR-2 Veresk submachine gun.  The 7N29 AP loading fires a 6.7 g (103 gr) bullet at 410 m/s (1,300 ft/s) with 560 J (410 ft⋅lb) of muzzle energy, and will reportedly penetrate two 1.2 mm titanium plates, plus 30 layers of Kevlar, at 50 m (160 ft).  The disadvantage of the rounds is that high impact velocities are needed for them to work effectively, so the bullets are relatively light to maximize their muzzle velocity.  This means they will lose velocity relatively quickly, limiting their effective range."
msgstr "The 9×21mm Gyurza (Гюрза, Russian for 'blunt-nosed viper') round is a Russian handgun round designed to defeat body armour that was developed by TsNIITochMash for its SR-1 Vektor semi-automatic pistol and SR-2 Veresk submachine gun.  The 7N29 AP loading fires a 6.7 g (103 gr) bullet at 410 m/s (1,300 ft/s) with 560 J (410 ft⋅lb) of muzzle energy, and will reportedly penetrate two 1.2 mm titanium plates, plus 30 layers of Kevlar, at 50 m (160 ft).  The disadvantage of the rounds is that high impact velocities are needed for them to work effectively, so the bullets are relatively light to maximise their muzzle velocity.  This means they will lose velocity relatively quickly, limiting their effective range."

msgid "A fresh pile of bat guano; this could probably be used to make some great fertilizer."
msgstr "A fresh pile of bat guano; this could probably be used to make some great fertiliser."

msgid "Spawn of my intentions, I address you from across space and time on today the day of your hatching.  As is the custom of our people you have been left in an uncivilized and barbaric place.  You must make your way back to us to become one of us.  For now you will take a name like those of the dead civilization we've deposited you in.  While you must develop on your own and find your way back to us, I have summoned some lesser creatures of the underhill realms to guard this place and you for as long as they can.  Most everything else in this world will attempt to kill you, be sure to kill it first.  I have included instructions for how to make a healing item as well as a developmental potion that you can take to bring yourself further into your destiny and will grant new abilities, somewhat randomly I'm afraid.  The depths will tremble one day in your wake and upon that day you will know how to find us.  If you fail we shall never know your name, like all the other lost children."
msgstr "Spawn of my intentions, I address you from across space and time on today the day of your hatching.  As is the custom of our people you have been left in an uncivilised and barbaric place.  You must make your way back to us to become one of us.  For now you will take a name like those of the dead civilisation we've deposited you in.  While you must develop on your own and find your way back to us, I have summoned some lesser creatures of the underhill realms to guard this place and you for as long as they can.  Most everything else in this world will attempt to kill you, be sure to kill it first.  I have included instructions for how to make a healing item as well as a developmental potion that you can take to bring yourself further into your destiny and will grant new abilities, somewhat randomly I'm afraid.  The depths will tremble one day in your wake and upon that day you will know how to find us.  If you fail we shall never know your name, like all the other lost children."

msgid "This handwritten book contains the detailed yet disorganized notes of a vampire who found how to consume other vampires for power.  Reading it might tell you how to do it, if it is what you want."
msgstr "This handwritten book contains the detailed yet disorganised notes of a vampire who found how to consume other vampires for power.  Reading it might tell you how to do it, if it is what you want."

msgid "A series of documents discussing the properties of the armor and weapons used by a group or organization only referred to as \"LAUGHING DANCER\".  Some of these described specifications don't seem physically possible."
msgstr "A series of documents discussing the properties of the armour and weapons used by a group or organisation only referred to as \"LAUGHING DANCER\".  Some of these described specifications don't seem physically possible."

msgid "Desmodontinae Gargantua Vocalizer"
msgid_plural "Desmodontinae Gargantua Vocalizers"
msgstr[0] "Desmodontinae Gargantua Vocaliser"
msgstr[1] "Desmodontinae Gargantua Vocalisers"

msgid "Crypt Spore Vaporizer"
msgid_plural "Crypt Spore Vaporizers"
msgstr[0] "Crypt Spore Vaporiser"
msgstr[1] "Crypt Spore Vaporisers"

msgid "A simple garment made of gossamer.  It's very light, and the fabric shimmers in a rainbow of colors in the sunlight."
msgstr "A simple garment made of gossamer.  It's very light, and the fabric shimmers in a rainbow of colours in the sunlight."

msgid "A simple, sleeveless garment made of gossamer.  It's very light, and the fabric shimmers in a rainbow of colors in the sunlight."
msgstr "A simple, sleeveless garment made of gossamer.  It's very light, and the fabric shimmers in a rainbow of colours in the sunlight."

msgid "A thick overshirt of gossamer, shimmering in a rainbow of colors.  This would have made you the king of the Renn Faire."
msgstr "A thick overshirt of gossamer, shimmering in a rainbow of colours.  This would have made you the king of the Renn Faire."

msgid "A gossamer dress, shimmering in a mix of rainbow colors."
msgstr "A gossamer dress, shimmering in a mix of rainbow colours."

msgid "A gossamer cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  It looks like ripples of multicolored light when worn."
msgstr "A gossamer cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  It looks like ripples of multicoloured light when worn."

msgid "A pair of gossamer pants with two pockets.  They shimmer opalescently."
msgstr "A pair of gossamer trousers with two pockets.  They shimmer opalescently."

msgid "A pair of tight-fitting gossamer pants with no pockets.  They would have been the absolute height of fashion five hundred years ago."
msgstr "A pair of tight-fitting gossamer trousers with no pockets.  They would have been the absolute height of fashion five hundred years ago."

msgid "A pair of gossamer stockings that shimmer in a rainbow of muted colors."
msgstr "A pair of gossamer stockings that shimmer in a rainbow of muted colours."

msgid "A five-liter ingot of solid cold iron."
msgstr "A five-litre ingot of solid cold iron."

msgid "\"Wyld Candy, our flavors span the possible\" is emblazoned proudly upon this shiny colorful wrapper."
msgstr "\"Wyld Candy, our flavours span the possible\" is emblazoned proudly upon this shiny colourful wrapper."

msgid "A shimmering silvery dust.  Narcotic with the street name of Faewild.  Causes the user to see colors not normally visible to the naked human eye."
msgstr "A shimmering silvery dust.  Narcotic with the street name of Faewild.  Causes the user to see colours not normally visible to the naked human eye."

msgid "A heavy, dark laptop with a swappable battery slot.  The back panel is labeled \"PROPERTY OF XEDRA\".  It uses a non-standard OS, so there's not much you can use it for without reinstalling it."
msgstr "A heavy, dark laptop with a swappable battery slot.  The back panel is labelled \"PROPERTY OF XEDRA\".  It uses a non-standard OS, so there's not much you can use it for without reinstalling it."

msgid "This ephemeral dagger is 15 inches long from the hilt to the tip, the double-edged blade itself is a pearly white color and extremely sharp."
msgstr "This ephemeral dagger is 15 inches long from the hilt to the tip, the double-edged blade itself is a pearly white colour and extremely sharp."

msgid "dream armor"
msgid_plural "dream armor"
msgstr[0] "dream armour"
msgstr[1] "dream armour"

msgid "A summoned medieval armor made from dreamdross.  It shimmers in the light and provides some protection."
msgstr "A summoned medieval armour made from dreamdross.  It shimmers in the light and provides some protection."

msgid "A large pouch of churning water on your back, containing a sealed air bubble.  It shifts and adjusts itself to minimize encumbrance."
msgstr "A large pouch of churning water on your back, containing a sealed air bubble.  It shifts and adjusts itself to minimise encumbrance."

msgid "Designed to work with FN's proprietary 5.7x28mm round and with a built in suppressor, the Five-seveN is a lightweight integrally suppressed pistol with a very high capacity, best used against armored opponents."
msgstr "Designed to work with FN's proprietary 5.7x28mm round and with a built in suppressor, the Five-seveN is a lightweight integrally suppressed pistol with a very high capacity, best used against armoured opponents."

msgid "Use this to fertilize your crops."
msgstr "Use this to fertilise your crops."

msgid "Astute observers of Mesoamerican history may recognize this as a macuahuitl, the favored weapon of the Aztecs.  This macuahuitl looks as though it was made deep inside of a black mirror."
msgstr "Astute observers of Mesoamerican history may recognise this as a macuahuitl, the favoured weapon of the Aztecs.  This macuahuitl looks as though it was made deep inside of a black mirror."

msgid "A well designed steel knife that used to be stuck in your belly.  It lightly flickers in the air and is tainted an unnatural gray.  Despite your best efforts, you aren't even able to smear the gray streaks of your blood that remain frozen along the edge, much less damage the actual metal."
msgstr "A well designed steel knife that used to be stuck in your belly.  It lightly flickers in the air and is tainted an unnatural grey.  Despite your best efforts, you aren't even able to smear the grey streaks of your blood that remain frozen along the edge, much less damage the actual metal."

msgid "A giant spear over three meters long, all formed from a single piece of wood, with twists and curves like it grew in place rather than being made."
msgstr "A giant spear over three metres long, all formed from a single piece of wood, with twists and curves like it grew in place rather than being made."

msgid "A bright gray post-it note."
msgstr "A bright grey post-it note."

msgid "This is a high quality kit consisting of a variety of needles, some wooden spools for thread, some small scissors, and an awl.  Use a tailor's kit to customize your clothing and armor.  This uses your tailoring skill."
msgstr "This is a high quality kit consisting of a variety of needles, some wooden spools for thread, some small scissors, and an awl.  Use a tailor's kit to customise your clothing and armour.  This uses your tailoring skill."

msgid "A dreamdross mesh that condenses within the center.  Use it to set it on the ground, creating a trap that will freeze anything that steps on it for several hours."
msgstr "A dreamdross mesh that condenses within the centre.  Use it to set it on the ground, creating a trap that will freeze anything that steps on it for several hours."

msgid "pair of glimmer fur pants"
msgid_plural "pairs of glimmer fur pants"
msgstr[0] "pair of glimmer fur trousers"
msgstr[1] "pairs of glimmer fur trousers"

msgid "A hefty pair of fae fur-lined pants."
msgstr "A hefty pair of fae fur-lined trousers."

msgid "A padded greatcoat assembled by quilting gossamer and stuffing the layers with more scraps of gossamer.  It shimmers in a soft rainbow of colors."
msgstr "A padded greatcoat assembled by quilting gossamer and stuffing the layers with more scraps of gossamer.  It shimmers in a soft rainbow of colours."

msgid "gossamer arming pants"
msgid_plural "gossamer arming pants"
msgstr[0] "gossamer arming trousers"
msgstr[1] "gossamer arming trousers"

msgid "Thick pants made of gossamer, meant to be worn alongside a gambeson under or without armor.  Stylish and as comfortable as armor can be."
msgstr "Thick trousers made of gossamer, meant to be worn alongside a gambeson under or without armour.  Stylish and as comfortable as armour can be."

msgid "A gossamer coif with neck and forehead protection.  Resting on your shoulders, it serves as padding for a helmet.  The sort of thing a fae knight guarding a crossroads would wear when challenging travelers to duels."
msgstr "A gossamer coif with neck and forehead protection.  Resting on your shoulders, it serves as padding for a helmet.  The sort of thing a fae knight guarding a crossroads would wear when challenging travellers to duels."

msgid "A fully customized high steel chainmail outfit, leaving the head uncovered.  Combine with a gambeson or other padded layer for optimal protection."
msgstr "A fully customised high steel chainmail outfit, leaving the head uncovered.  Combine with a gambeson or other padded layer for optimal protection."

msgid "moon tears chainmail armor"
msgid_plural "moon tears chainmail armors"
msgstr[0] "moon tears chainmail armour"
msgstr[1] "moon tears chainmail armours"

msgid "A fully customized moon tears chainmail suit.  Combine with a gambeson or other padded layer for optimal protection."
msgstr "A fully customised moon tears chainmail suit.  Combine with a gambeson or other padded layer for optimal protection."

msgid "A customized moon tears chainmail vest.  It's a sleeveless piece of chainmail with small straps designed to better distribute the weight."
msgstr "A customised moon tears chainmail vest.  It's a sleeveless piece of chainmail with small straps designed to better distribute the weight."

msgid "dreamforged plate armor"
msgid_plural "dreamforged plate armors"
msgstr[0] "dreamforged plate armour"
msgstr[1] "dreamforged plate armours"

msgid "Lightweight armor, forged using dreamdross.  The only reason it feels soft enough is the magic.  It also has few MOLLE-compatible strips that you can utilize.  The dreamdross grant it some minor magical properties, but you can't control their effects."
msgstr "Lightweight armour, forged using dreamdross.  The only reason it feels soft enough is the magic.  It also has few MOLLE-compatible strips that you can utilise.  The dreamdross grant it some minor magical properties, but you can't control their effects."

msgid "Thin, smooth helmet, that cover your head, with a wide, sharp two-teeth blade from the forehead.  Fueled by damage of berserk knuckles, your feel the helmet pump the tension right into your veins."
msgstr "Thin, smooth helmet, that cover your head, with a wide, sharp two-teeth blade from the forehead.  Fuelled by damage of berserk knuckles, your feel the helmet pump the tension right into your veins."

msgid "Pair of fiery red boots, they are fueled by damage you deal with berserk knuckles, and increase your speed respectively."
msgstr "Pair of fiery red boots, they are fuelled by damage you deal with berserk knuckles, and increase your speed respectively."

msgid "A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on this banner is of a brilliantly colored butterfly in flight, ridden by a knight in armor.  The knight is striking down a foe with a scythe while the butterfly appears to have bitten the head off a different opponent."
msgstr "A back mounted flag identifying the loyalties of troops.  The heraldry on this banner is of a brilliantly coloured butterfly in flight, ridden by a knight in armour.  The knight is striking down a foe with a scythe while the butterfly appears to have bitten the head off a different opponent."

msgid "The cap develops a fearsome aura as the blood pours back out of the fibers."
msgstr "The cap develops a fearsome aura as the blood pours back out of the fibres."

msgid "Your eyes now reflect your mood in the colors of stone.  You are also immune to the glare of the sun."
msgstr "Your eyes now reflect your mood in the colours of stone.  You are also immune to the glare of the sun."

msgid "Your skin has become vaguely gelatinous.  Provides some extra bash defense and immunity to wet effects."
msgstr "Your skin has become vaguely gelatinous.  Provides some extra bash defence and immunity to wet effects."

msgid "Your eyes now reflect your mood in the colors of the deep waters.  From an aquamarine blue when you are pleased to the pitch black of the depths when you are angry or sad.  You are also immune to the glare of the sun and can see under water."
msgstr "Your eyes now reflect your mood in the colours of the deep waters.  From an aquamarine blue when you are pleased to the pitch black of the depths when you are angry or sad.  You are also immune to the glare of the sun and can see under water."

msgid "This oblong goblin fruit shimmers slightly in a rainbow of colors.  It smells like a mix of peach and freshly-baked bread."
msgstr "This oblong goblin fruit shimmers slightly in a rainbow of colours.  It smells like a mix of peach and freshly-baked bread."

msgid "This long, thin goblin fruit is a subdued green color but has a smell that burns your nostrils."
msgstr "This long, thin goblin fruit is a subdued green colour but has a smell that burns your nostrils."

msgid "savory goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "savory goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "savoury goblin fruit"
msgstr[1] "savoury goblin fruits"

msgid "This round goblin fruit is a bluish color changing to red at the ends.  It smells like a freshly-roasted hunk of meat."
msgstr "This round goblin fruit is a bluish colour changing to red at the ends.  It smells like a freshly-roasted hunk of meat."

msgid "This sharply-curved goblin fruit is an off-white color turning red toward the ends.  It smells like the alley outside a club."
msgstr "This sharply-curved goblin fruit is an off-white colour turning red toward the ends.  It smells like the alley outside a club."

msgid "This large goblin fruit is such a deep black color you can't actually tell exactly what shape it is.  It's roundish, but when you hold it, it seems more like you're holding a hole in the fabric of the world.  It smells like an apple."
msgstr "This large goblin fruit is such a deep black colour you can't actually tell exactly what shape it is.  It's roundish, but when you hold it, it seems more like you're holding a hole in the fabric of the world.  It smells like an apple."

msgid "This dark-colored goblin fruit is covered in spikes like a pineapple.  Unlike a pineapple, the spikes are yielding and seem part of the fruit, not a rind.  It smells of freshly-cut grass."
msgstr "This dark-coloured goblin fruit is covered in spikes like a pineapple.  Unlike a pineapple, the spikes are yielding and seem part of the fruit, not a rind.  It smells of freshly-cut grass."

msgid "This large, curved goblin fruit is a dark blue color and feels like it's already on the verge of rotting.  It takes very little pressure for your fingers to bruise the skin and the flesh inside flakes off when you touch it.  It smells like sun-ripened strawberries."
msgstr "This large, curved goblin fruit is a dark blue colour and feels like it's already on the verge of rotting.  It takes very little pressure for your fingers to bruise the skin and the flesh inside flakes off when you touch it.  It smells like sun-ripened strawberries."

msgid "The many colors of this oblong fruit shift to mimic what's behind it, trying to imitate other things with the best of its ability."
msgstr "The many colours of this oblong fruit shift to mimic what's behind it, trying to imitate other things with the best of its ability."

msgid "This spiraled fruit ceaselessly spins on itself.  No matter how tight your grasp, you cannot stop its spinning."
msgstr "This spiralled fruit ceaselessly spins on itself.  No matter how tight your grasp, you cannot stop its spinning."

msgid "You understand everything about this pale green fruit.  You know that it will taste like an apple and you know that it will have the inner structure of a kiwi, the texture of a durian, the smell of a dragon fruit and the colors of an orange.  you also know that eating it will help you understand anything you could try to learn for a few hours."
msgstr "You understand everything about this pale green fruit.  You know that it will taste like an apple and you know that it will have the inner structure of a kiwi, the texture of a durian, the smell of a dragon fruit and the colours of an orange.  you also know that eating it will help you understand anything you could try to learn for a few hours."

msgid "This gray dented fruit numbs your fingers as you hold it and its smell numbs your nose the same way."
msgstr "This grey dented fruit numbs your fingers as you hold it and its smell numbs your nose the same way."

msgid "recoloring goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "recoloring goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "recolouring goblin fruit"
msgstr[1] "recolouring goblin fruits"

msgid "This rectangle fruit smells of lavender and has a mushy texture.  Its colors grow more vibrant for a second when you blink."
msgstr "This rectangle fruit smells of lavender and has a mushy texture.  Its colours grow more vibrant for a second when you blink."

msgid "pressurized goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "pressurized goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "pressurised goblin fruit"
msgstr[1] "pressurised goblin fruits"

msgid "This capsule-shaped goblin fruit behaves as a pressurized tank when you press its surface with your finger.  Fortunately, it doesn't appear to be able to explode if pierced or bitten."
msgstr "This capsule-shaped goblin fruit behaves as a pressurised tank when you press its surface with your finger.  Fortunately, it doesn't appear to be able to explode if pierced or bitten."

msgid "This fruit is the most boring thing you've ever seen.  Everything about it is boring: its drab dark brown color, its smell, its lack of feature, even its taste is boring.  It's not a good fruit.  It's not a bad fruit.  It's just boring."
msgstr "This fruit is the most boring thing you've ever seen.  Everything about it is boring: its drab dark brown colour, its smell, its lack of feature, even its taste is boring.  It's not a good fruit.  It's not a bad fruit.  It's just boring."

msgid "This fruit is easily mistakable for a fist-sized sapphire.  Its color, rigidity and facets bring to mind a gemstone, unlike its green stem."
msgstr "This fruit is easily mistakable for a fist-sized sapphire.  Its colour, rigidity and facets bring to mind a gemstone, unlike its green stem."

msgid "This fruit shaped akin to a chunk torn from a beehive is warm, but becomes cold as long as anyone is looking at it.  It has a strong odor, between maple and oak, but only when unobserved."
msgstr "This fruit shaped akin to a chunk torn from a beehive is warm, but becomes cold as long as anyone is looking at it.  It has a strong odour, between maple and oak, but only when unobserved."

msgid "This fruit what a kiwi would be if kiwi had decimeter-long beige fur.  It smells of steel and lilies."
msgstr "This fruit what a kiwi would be if kiwi had decimetre-long beige fur.  It smells of steel and lilies."

msgid "remolding goblin fruit"
msgid_plural "remolding goblin fruits"
msgstr[0] "remoulding goblin fruit"
msgstr[1] "remoulding goblin fruits"

msgid "This gray fruit is hard to pierce, as it reshapes itself to close any hole you make in it.  Ironically, the fruit keeps tearing its surface apart, making its reshaping a sisyphean task."
msgstr "This grey fruit is hard to pierce, as it reshapes itself to close any hole you make in it.  Ironically, the fruit keeps tearing its surface apart, making its reshaping a sisyphean task."

msgid "A backpack with lot of light aluminum bars inside that hold a perfect vacuum, making the backpack much lighter than it should be."
msgstr "A backpack with lot of light aluminium bars inside that hold a perfect vacuum, making the backpack much lighter than it should be."

msgid "Heavily mechanized boots with small integrated battery slot inside.  Upon activation make you jump higher and farther."
msgstr "Heavily mechanised boots with small integrated battery slot inside.  Upon activation make you jump higher and farther."

msgid "This robust system begins at your hands, where it features a squarish steel frame enhanced with strategic protrusions to amplify impact damage by focusing the point of contact.  It extends along your forearms with thick, hardened steel shields protecting both your limbs and the underlying hydraulic mechanisms.  Aluminum tubes channel these hydraulics up into your upper arms, culminating at your back where the central hub for the hydraulic servos is located.  While the system recovers some energy with each movement, its substantial weight and bulk significantly limit the use of your hands for anything else."
msgstr "This robust system begins at your hands, where it features a squarish steel frame enhanced with strategic protrusions to amplify impact damage by focusing the point of contact.  It extends along your forearms with thick, hardened steel shields protecting both your limbs and the underlying hydraulic mechanisms.  Aluminium tubes channel these hydraulics up into your upper arms, culminating at your back where the central hub for the hydraulic servos is located.  While the system recovers some energy with each movement, its substantial weight and bulk significantly limit the use of your hands for anything else."

msgid "The greatest sandwich that will ever be made, in this universe and the next.  A quadruple stacker with beer-batter fried poultry, caramel chocolate chili, and topped with a specially made sauce of egg, blue cheese, honey mustard, BBQ and extremely concentrated vinegar that oozes down the other layers, before the entire thing is pressed and grilled in a waffle iron and finished with a garnish of gold and silver flakes and a fresh fruit skewered on top.  All the gourmet chefs in existence could not even conceive such a combination which, by all means, should not taste this good - But you did it.  And you don't plan on sharing."
msgstr "The greatest sandwich that will ever be made, in this universe and the next.  A quadruple stacker with beer-batter fried poultry, caramel chocolate chilli, and topped with a specially made sauce of egg, blue cheese, honey mustard, BBQ and extremely concentrated vinegar that oozes down the other layers, before the entire thing is pressed and grilled in a waffle iron and finished with a garnish of gold and silver flakes and a fresh fruit skewered on top.  All the gourmet chefs in existence could not even conceive such a combination which, by all means, should not taste this good - But you did it.  And you don't plan on sharing."

msgid "The Portable Dark Age™ is now active and will soon end all electronic devices in range.  Prepare yourself for a life without mp3s and cell phones, at least in the closest 60 meters."
msgstr "The Portable Dark Age™ is now active and will soon end all electronic devices in range.  Prepare yourself for a life without mp3s and cell phones, at least in the closest 60 metres."

msgid "An abominably huge, two barrel Gast system shotgun.  Recoil from the first shot powers the piston that loads a shell into the second barrel, and vice versa, making it shoot approximately 1000rpm at max.  The biggest part of this weapon is a giant, multi tube magazine, which can store 240 shells at once.  It makes the weapon extremely bulky, so the only way you can utilize it is by handling it like a chainsaw or installing it on a turret base."
msgstr "An abominably huge, two barrel Gast system shotgun.  Recoil from the first shot powers the piston that loads a shell into the second barrel, and vice versa, making it shoot approximately 1000rpm at max.  The biggest part of this weapon is a giant, multi tube magazine, which can store 240 shells at once.  It makes the weapon extremely bulky, so the only way you can utilise it is by handling it like a chainsaw or installing it on a turret base."

msgid "A carbine-sized particle cannon.  It shoots microscopic particles, and due the size of projectile you don't need to reload it for decades.  Instead, you need a ton of energy to generate enough magnetic force.  The damage of the weapon is not great, but it has perfect armor penetration, and no physical armor can stop its bullets."
msgstr "A carbine-sized particle cannon.  It shoots microscopic particles, and due the size of projectile you don't need to reload it for decades.  Instead, you need a ton of energy to generate enough magnetic force.  The damage of the weapon is not great, but it has perfect armour penetration, and no physical armour can stop its bullets."

msgid "skeletonized heat sink"
msgid_plural "skeletonized heat sinks"
msgstr[0] "skeletonised heat sink"
msgstr[1] "skeletonised heat sinks"

msgid "A light, hollow aluminum bar with an installed plasma torch on the end in the form of a circle, emitting 28000 centrigrades of heat on demand.  This probably violates dozens of OSHA regulations."
msgstr "A light, hollow aluminium bar with an installed plasma torch on the end in the form of a circle, emitting 28000 centrigrades of heat on demand.  This probably violates dozens of OSHA regulations."

msgid "You see a blocky arrow, unerringly pointed in some far off direction.  It is completely colorless."
msgstr "You see a blocky arrow, unerringly pointed in some far off direction.  It is completely colourless."

msgid "A circular unit of energy, surrounded by a few other circles that almost connect around the center."
msgstr "A circular unit of energy, surrounded by a few other circles that almost connect around the centre."

msgid "A solid, full size cast of a human fist, made out of some gray metal.  Looks menacing."
msgstr "A solid, full size cast of a human fist, made out of some grey metal.  Looks menacing."

msgid "A pile of gray sand that is clumped together.  When you separate the pieces they seem to flow back together."
msgstr "A pile of grey sand that is clumped together.  When you separate the pieces they seem to flow back together."

msgid "taped jumper cable"
msgid_plural "taped jumper cables"
msgstr[0] "taped jump lead"
msgstr[1] "taped jump leads"

msgid "A 3-ft (or about 1 m) jumper cable, wrapped with blue insulating tape.  Both sides lack connectors."
msgstr "A 3-ft (or about 1 m) jump lead, wrapped with blue insulating tape.  Both sides lack connectors."

msgid "This is a very thin booklet, more of a pamphlet, about various ways to protect from nightmares.  There are quite a few techniques in here, though you're a bit skeptical about whether the author took the end of the world into their calculations."
msgstr "This is a very thin booklet, more of a pamphlet, about various ways to protect from nightmares.  There are quite a few techniques in here, though you're a bit sceptical about whether the author took the end of the world into their calculations."

msgid "Psychic Self-Defense: The Classic Instruction Manual for Protecting Yourself Against Paranormal Attack"
msgid_plural "copies of Psychic Self-Defense: The Classic Instruction Manual for Protecting Yourself Against Paranormal Attack"
msgstr[0] "Psychic Self-Defence: The Classic Instruction Manual for Protecting Yourself Against Paranormal Attack"
msgstr[1] "copies of Psychic Self-Defence: The Classic Instruction Manual for Protecting Yourself Against Paranormal Attack"

msgid "Border Patrol OS v0.A17 - Armory Access"
msgstr "Border Patrol OS v0.A17 - Armoury Access"

msgid "Unlock Armory"
msgstr "Unlock Armoury"

msgid ""
"Excerpt from 'Infinite Dimensions, Finite Magickal Systems by Tyco Arendt':\n"
"\n"
"Threat Classification: Psionics\n"
"OpalPsi\n"
"\n"
"Psionically empowered individuals can often be disarmed using specific methods common across dimensions.  Identification of empowered individuals can be difficult in civilizations that either refuse or lack the knowledge of how to identify psionic individuals.  Upon discovery of any psionically active dimension, agents must immediately return to Cradle Earth and notify XEDRA-23 and then await further instructions.  Under no circumstances is any individual from a psionically-active dimension to be contacted or interacted with without the presence of personnel from XEDRA-23 present."
msgstr ""
"Excerpt from 'Infinite Dimensions, Finite Magickal Systems by Tyco Arendt':\n"
"\n"
"Threat Classification: Psionics\n"
"OpalPsi\n"
"\n"
"Psionically empowered individuals can often be disarmed using specific methods common across dimensions.  Identification of empowered individuals can be difficult in civilisations that either refuse or lack the knowledge of how to identify psionic individuals.  Upon discovery of any psionically active dimension, agents must immediately return to Cradle Earth and notify XEDRA-23 and then await further instructions.  Under no circumstances is any individual from a psionically-active dimension to be contacted or interacted with without the presence of personnel from XEDRA-23 present."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to bite your %2$s, but fails to penetrate your armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to bite your %2$s, but fails to penetrate your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to bite <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armor."
msgstr "%1$s tries to bite <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armour."

msgid "Your instincts are telling you three things about this armored, axe-wielding humanoid foe: they are a vampire far more powerful than you, they thirst for your blood, and they are a vampire hunter wanting all vampires dead.  You know for certain that you will be quickly killed if you attack them without a proper plan."
msgstr "Your instincts are telling you three things about this armoured, axe-wielding humanoid foe: they are a vampire far more powerful than you, they thirst for your blood, and they are a vampire hunter wanting all vampires dead.  You know for certain that you will be quickly killed if you attack them without a proper plan."

msgid "This creature scarcely looks like the human you know they must once have been.  Red eyes lit by a faint inner glow, a pair of protruding fangs, fingers twisted into claws, clothes in tatters, and skin so covered in dirt and blood you have no idea what color it originally was.  They move like a wild animal, occasionally dropping on all fours and raising their head to sniff the air."
msgstr "This creature scarcely looks like the human you know they must once have been.  Red eyes lit by a faint inner glow, a pair of protruding fangs, fingers twisted into claws, clothes in tatters, and skin so covered in dirt and blood you have no idea what colour it originally was.  They move like a wild animal, occasionally dropping on all fours and raising their head to sniff the air."

msgid "The Mega-Chiropteran Vampire (Giant Vampire Bat), began appearing 4 years ago in locations with Northern European Vampire bats.  There were videos of them bringing down large animals like goats and cattle before the Cataclysm as well as pervasive rumors of them coming after humans."
msgstr "The Mega-Chiropteran Vampire (Giant Vampire Bat), began appearing 4 years ago in locations with Northern European Vampire bats.  There were videos of them bringing down large animals like goats and cattle before the Cataclysm as well as pervasive rumours of them coming after humans."

msgid "This diminutive warrior possesses both animalistic features and custom made arms and armor.  The twinkle in its eye seems to giggle as it readies its weapons."
msgstr "This diminutive warrior possesses both animalistic features and custom made arms and armour.  The twinkle in its eye seems to giggle as it readies its weapons."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s slashes your %2$s without penetrating your armor."
msgstr "%1$s slashes your %2$s without penetrating your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s slashes <npcname>'s %2$s without penetrating their armor."
msgstr "%1$s slashes <npcname>'s %2$s without penetrating their armour."

msgid "An enormous dog, a meter and a half high at the shoulder, with silvery fur and multicolored eyes.  It sniffs the air and looks around alertly."
msgstr "An enormous dog, a metre and a half high at the shoulder, with silvery fur and multicoloured eyes.  It sniffs the air and looks around alertly."

msgid "One of the changelings risen as the undead.  Shudders and jerks interrupt its previously smooth movements.  The silvery mail that covered much of its body is now tarnished and where it is damaged it looks more like broken skin than broken armor."
msgstr "One of the changelings risen as the undead.  Shudders and jerks interrupt its previously smooth movements.  The silvery mail that covered much of its body is now tarnished and where it is damaged it looks more like broken skin than broken armour."

msgid "A giant, dark gray goblin spider, the size of a pony.  Above the mandibles, where you would expect to see the eyes, instead there is a child's face.  It seems to vanish into the shadows if you take your eyes off it."
msgstr "A giant, dark grey goblin spider, the size of a pony.  Above the mandibles, where you would expect to see the eyes, instead there is a child's face.  It seems to vanish into the shadows if you take your eyes off it."

msgid "A hooved grazing creature with a thick, shaggy, shimmering mane of hair, a sweeping tail, and powerful-looking muscles.  Impossible to confuse with a regular horse even if you don't spot the spiraled horn coming from its head.  Rumor has it that some of the Fair Lords have ways to tame and ride this magnificent creature."
msgstr "A hooved grazing creature with a thick, shaggy, shimmering mane of hair, a sweeping tail, and powerful-looking muscles.  Impossible to confuse with a regular horse even if you don't spot the spiralled horn coming from its head.  Rumour has it that some of the Fair Lords have ways to tame and ride this magnificent creature."

msgid "A small dog-sized furry lizard colored in ocean blues.  It hisses and then spits gouts of water at whatever attracts its ire."
msgstr "A small dog-sized furry lizard coloured in ocean blues.  It hisses and then spits gouts of water at whatever attracts its ire."

msgid "A small animated mass of roots and vines, creeping along the ground with alarming speed.  The tangle is thick enough that the center from which they grow is concealed."
msgstr "A small animated mass of roots and vines, creeping along the ground with alarming speed.  The tangle is thick enough that the centre from which they grow is concealed."

msgid "A small dog-sized furry lizard colored in fiery reds.  It hisses and then spits napalm-like fluid at whatever attracts its ire."
msgstr "A small dog-sized furry lizard coloured in fiery reds.  It hisses and then spits napalm-like fluid at whatever attracts its ire."

msgid "A sluglike lower body made of barely cooled magma transforms into a glowing red, squat, barrel-like torso and cooling magma forms a beard and hair around its face.  Smoking obsidian hand axes and armor adorn it as it seeks out enemies to destroy."
msgstr "A sluglike lower body made of barely cooled magma transforms into a glowing red, squat, barrel-like torso and cooling magma forms a beard and hair around its face.  Smoking obsidian hand axes and armour adorn it as it seeks out enemies to destroy."

msgid "A ferocious, iridescent multi-hued dragonfly, still lightning-fast despite growing to the size of a football.  Its head is little more than a palm-sized pair of rainbow compound eyes, and its legs - already specialized for grasping prey - end in curved talons."
msgstr "A ferocious, iridescent multi-hued dragonfly, still lightning-fast despite growing to the size of a football.  Its head is little more than a palm-sized pair of rainbow compound eyes, and its legs - already specialised for grasping prey - end in curved talons."

msgid "A truly massive heavy combat cyborg with six independent legs, two arms that look like a cross between shovels and shields that can be rooted into the ground to provide stabilized cover, two close combat arms that can swing over top of the shields, and a weapon pod mounted on a swiveling turret."
msgstr "A truly massive heavy combat cyborg with six independent legs, two arms that look like a cross between shovels and shields that can be rooted into the ground to provide stabilised cover, two close combat arms that can swing over top of the shields, and a weapon pod mounted on a swivelling turret."

msgid "A broken robot, still standing and saturated with electricity.  Between the shattered dreamdross plates, the ruined armor and the electrical discharges, you can barely see the remains of the machinery that once animated it, and yet it moves on its two feet, albeit like some sort of puppet."
msgstr "A broken robot, still standing and saturated with electricity.  Between the shattered dreamdross plates, the ruined armour and the electrical discharges, you can barely see the remains of the machinery that once animated it, and yet it moves on its two feet, albeit like some sort of puppet."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to impale your %2$s, but fails to penetrate your armor!"
msgstr "%1$s tries to impale your %2$s, but fails to penetrate your armour!"

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to impale <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armor!"
msgstr "%1$s tries to impale <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armour!"

msgid "armored warrior with mace"
msgid_plural "armored warriors with maces"
msgstr[0] "armoured warrior with mace"
msgstr[1] "armoured warriors with maces"

msgid "Clad in ancient armor and with a mace in hand, this warrior was summoned by magic to defend you."
msgstr "Clad in ancient armour and with a mace in hand, this warrior was summoned by magic to defend you."

msgid "armored warrior with axe"
msgid_plural "armored warriors with axes"
msgstr[0] "armoured warrior with axe"
msgstr[1] "armoured warriors with axes"

msgid "Clad in ancient armor and with a battleaxe in hand, this warrior was summoned by magic to defend you."
msgstr "Clad in ancient armour and with a battleaxe in hand, this warrior was summoned by magic to defend you."

msgid "Clad in leather armor and with a spear in hand, this warrior was summoned by magic to defend you."
msgstr "Clad in leather armour and with a spear in hand, this warrior was summoned by magic to defend you."

msgid "Clad in leather armor and with a sword in hand, this warrior was summoned by magic to defend you."
msgstr "Clad in leather armour and with a sword in hand, this warrior was summoned by magic to defend you."

msgid "A shadowy figure, only barely visible as more than a mist, but the silhouette of armor and weapons are obvious."
msgstr "A shadowy figure, only barely visible as more than a mist, but the silhouette of armour and weapons are obvious."

msgid "What stands in front of you is one of the healthiest zombies you've ever seen.  If not for the black muck oozing from its orifices and shambling gait, you might even think it human.  Every part of this zombie, even its clothes, is colored some shade of gray, and every couple of seconds it flickers."
msgstr "What stands in front of you is one of the healthiest zombies you've ever seen.  If not for the black muck oozing from its orifices and shambling gait, you might even think it human.  Every part of this zombie, even its clothes, is coloured some shade of grey, and every couple of seconds it flickers."

msgid "This zombie is partially obscured by the gray, distorted air around it.  From what you can see it doesn't have a single wound on its body, and it moves much quicker than a zombie should.  Every few seconds the distortions surge."
msgstr "This zombie is partially obscured by the grey, distorted air around it.  From what you can see it doesn't have a single wound on its body, and it moves much quicker than a zombie should.  Every few seconds the distortions surge."

msgid "Every bit of color around this zombie has been sapped a distorted gray.  In contrast with its healthy appearance, the surrounding environment seems to slowly erode, even after it swiftly moves away.  It sharply flickers every few seconds."
msgstr "Every bit of colour around this zombie has been sapped a distorted grey.  In contrast with its healthy appearance, the surrounding environment seems to slowly erode, even after it swiftly moves away.  It sharply flickers every few seconds."

msgid "A rotund human body, bloated beyond belief.  Its entire body is tainted gray, and it seems to emit a pulsating distortion that saps color from the world around it.  Every few seconds the world around it seems to freeze, and its likely that any damage will easily detonate the distorted time the zombie barely holds within itself."
msgstr "A rotund human body, bloated beyond belief.  Its entire body is tainted grey, and it seems to emit a pulsating distortion that saps colour from the world around it.  Every few seconds the world around it seems to freeze, and its likely that any damage will easily detonate the distorted time the zombie barely holds within itself."

msgid "Your skin has the obviously-unnatural grayish-white tinge of a corpse, and mortals will react appropriately to seeing it."
msgstr "Your skin has the obviously-unnatural greyish-white tinge of a corpse, and mortals will react appropriately to seeing it."

msgid "You can mesmerize your prey, gazing into their eyes and freezing them in their tracks."
msgstr "You can mesmerise your prey, gazing into their eyes and freezing them in their tracks."

msgid "Blood-Fueled Magic"
msgstr "Blood-Fuelled Magic"

msgid "Shape of the Night Flier"
msgstr "Shape of the Night Flyer"

msgid "Fully fueled by the Blood"
msgstr "Fully fuelled by the Blood"

msgid "Through the consumption of self-cannibalizing vampire blood, you gained the ability to consume vampire blood to gain vampiric abilities undreamt of by other vampires."
msgstr "Through the consumption of self-cannibalising vampire blood, you gained the ability to consume vampire blood to gain vampiric abilities undreamt of by other vampires."

msgid "Your vestigial circulatory system is now better at holding stolen blood.  You can hold five more liters inside you."
msgstr "Your vestigial circulatory system is now better at holding stolen blood.  You can hold five more litres inside you."

msgid "Your new power allows you to store even more stolen blood inside your body.  You can hold another ten liters inside you."
msgstr "Your new power allows you to store even more stolen blood inside your body.  You can hold another ten litres inside you."

msgid "Fueled by the Blood-Drinkers' Blood"
msgstr "Fuelled by the Blood-Drinkers' Blood"

msgid "Your constant consumption of vampire blood has permanently destabilized your mind, and it will only grow worse with each new vampire drained.  Each time you drink vampire blood, you have a growing chance to gain a new mental affliction."
msgstr "Your constant consumption of vampire blood has permanently destabilised your mind, and it will only grow worse with each new vampire drained.  Each time you drink vampire blood, you have a growing chance to gain a new mental affliction."

msgid "Through a complicated ritual utilizing a saint's relic, you have transubstantiated your own blood with the holy blood of the saints.  It'll prevent you from becoming infected with vampirism while you live, effects postmortem unknown."
msgstr "Through a complicated ritual utilising a saint's relic, you have transubstantiated your own blood with the holy blood of the saints.  It'll prevent you from becoming infected with vampirism while you live, effects postmortem unknown."

msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after birth.  Your parents were the nobility of the Fair Folk, the great lords and ladies who traveled in spider-silk carriages on roads built of moonbeams and danced the unending nights away before leading fantastic armies in battle the next morning.  When the Cataclysm hit, your parents' slumbering power asserted itself, giving you access to a portion of their fae magick.  Hopefully it will help you survive."
msgstr "You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after birth.  Your parents were the nobility of the Fair Folk, the great lords and ladies who travelled in spider-silk carriages on roads built of moonbeams and danced the unending nights away before leading fantastic armies in battle the next morning.  When the Cataclysm hit, your parents' slumbering power asserted itself, giving you access to a portion of their fae magick.  Hopefully it will help you survive."

msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after birth.  Your parents were the nobility of the Fair Folk, the great lords and ladies who traveled in spider-silk carriages on roads built of moonbeams and danced the unending nights away before leading fantastic armies in battle the next morning.  When the Cataclysm hit, your parents' slumbering power asserted itself, giving you access to a portion of their fae magick.  Hopefully it will help you survive."
msgstr "You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after birth.  Your parents were the nobility of the Fair Folk, the great lords and ladies who travelled in spider-silk carriages on roads built of moonbeams and danced the unending nights away before leading fantastic armies in battle the next morning.  When the Cataclysm hit, your parents' slumbering power asserted itself, giving you access to a portion of their fae magick.  Hopefully it will help you survive."

msgid "You are a member of the Summer Court, sometimes called the Seelie Court, the faeries recognized as benevolent by mortals.  Or, at least, the faeries who are slightly less likely to levy a generational curses on those who wrong them."
msgstr "You are a member of the Summer Court, sometimes called the Seelie Court, the faeries recognised as benevolent by mortals.  Or, at least, the faeries who are slightly less likely to levy a generational curses on those who wrong them."

msgid "The Fair Folk have dealt with many mortal civilizations over the aeons, and have come to mutually beneficial arrangements with some of them.  Activate this trait to make your fae nature obvious, invoking those ancient agreements.  This <color_yellow>may anger</color> some who have especially bad relationships with the fae."
msgstr "The Fair Folk have dealt with many mortal civilisations over the aeons, and have come to mutually beneficial arrangements with some of them.  Activate this trait to make your fae nature obvious, invoking those ancient agreements.  This <color_yellow>may anger</color> some who have especially bad relationships with the fae."

msgid "Invoke your rights as one of noble birth and exert your authority over the commoner fae, forcing them to obey your commands.  The glamour will only last a short time, and the target is under no obligation to look on your favorably afterwards."
msgstr "Invoke your rights as one of noble birth and exert your authority over the commoner fae, forcing them to obey your commands.  The glamour will only last a short time, and the target is under no obligation to look on your favourably afterwards."

msgid "Grow a set of spiraling curled horns, allowing you to make a headbutt attack but preventing you from wearing a helmet."
msgstr "Grow a set of spiralling curled horns, allowing you to make a headbutt attack but preventing you from wearing a helmet."

msgid "Grow a set of long, saber-like fangs, preventing you from wearing mouth gear but allowing you to make rending bite attacks."
msgstr "Grow a set of long, sabre-like fangs, preventing you from wearing mouth gear but allowing you to make rending bite attacks."

msgid "Grow an armored suit of chitin, protecting you and making your punches hit harder."
msgstr "Grow an armoured suit of chitin, protecting you and making your punches hit harder."

msgid "Grow the tail of a wolf, making it harder to wear pants but improving your balance."
msgstr "Grow the tail of a wolf, making it harder to wear trousers but improving your balance."

msgid "Grow the tail of a cat, making it harder to wear pants but improving your balance."
msgstr "Grow the tail of a cat, making it harder to wear trousers but improving your balance."

msgid "Grow the tail of a scorpion, making it harder to wear pants but allowing you to attack with the stinger."
msgstr "Grow the tail of a scorpion, making it harder to wear trousers but allowing you to attack with the stinger."

msgid "You're getting used to moving and reacting like an animal.  When without weapons or armor and using your gifts of shapeshifting, your natural attacks do more damage."
msgstr "You're getting used to moving and reacting like an animal.  When without weapons or armour and using your gifts of shapeshifting, your natural attacks do more damage."

msgid "Animalistic Defense"
msgstr "Animalistic Defence"

msgid "The best defense is not getting hit, especially if you're a wild animal.  When using your shapeshifting and not wearing armor or using a weapon, you gain a bonus to your dodging."
msgstr "The best defence is not getting hit, especially if you're a wild animal.  When using your shapeshifting and not wearing armour or using a weapon, you gain a bonus to your dodging."

msgid "Like the animals you mimic, you're quicker than you seem.  You gain a speed bonus while shapeshifted as long as you're unarmed and unarmored."
msgstr "Like the animals you mimic, you're quicker than you seem.  You gain a speed bonus while shapeshifted as long as you're unarmed and unarmoured."

msgid "The trow don't literally eat stones, but merely being underground fills you with strength and vigor.  You need half as much food and water while you're underground, and cold underground does not affect you."
msgstr "The trow don't literally eat stones, but merely being underground fills you with strength and vigour.  You need half as much food and water while you're underground, and cold underground does not affect you."

msgid "You seem to have stopped aging.  That would have been an amazing gift before the Cataclysm, but now at least you might live long enough to find some way back to your birthplace Under the Hill."
msgstr "You seem to have stopped ageing.  That would have been an amazing gift before the Cataclysm, but now at least you might live long enough to find some way back to your birthplace Under the Hill."

msgid "Magicks of Autumn, affecting decay, the harvest, fear, preservation, concealment, home and the hearth, and colors."
msgstr "Magicks of Autumn, affecting decay, the harvest, fear, preservation, concealment, home and the hearth, and colours."

msgid "You get a taste of blood but stop drinking when you realize it cannot sustain you."
msgstr "You get a taste of blood but stop drinking when you realise it cannot sustain you."

msgid "You don't have enough blood to activate vigor mortis."
msgstr "You don't have enough blood to activate vigour mortis."

msgid "You don't have enough blood to maintain your vigor mortis."
msgstr "You don't have enough blood to maintain your vigour mortis."

msgid "The chaos within your head coalesces and destabilizes your mind."
msgstr "The chaos within your head coalesces and destabilises your mind."

msgid ""
"You are one of the lilin, a hunter in the night, driven to feed on the spiritual essence (some might say the soul) of your prey.  Probably you were born that way, but maybe it happened to due to a malediction, or some artifact you found in a place best forgotten.  Regardless, it is your gift and your curse now, and you must use your powers to survive.\n"
"\n"
"You may activate this trait to spend some ruach toward increasing your power.  You must be outside under the moonlight to have a chance of gaining new lilin powers."
msgstr ""
"You are one of the lilin, a hunter in the night, driven to feed on the spiritual essence (some might say the soul) of your prey.  Probably you were born that way, but maybe it happened to due to a malediction, or some artefact you found in a place best forgotten.  Regardless, it is your gift and your curse now, and you must use your powers to survive.\n"
"\n"
"You may activate this trait to spend some ruach toward increasing your power.  You must be outside under the moonlight to have a chance of gaining new lilin powers."

msgid "In sleep, a person's defenses are down and it is easier for the things in the night to prey upon them.  You gain additional ruach from sleeping targets."
msgstr "In sleep, a person's defences are down and it is easier for the things in the night to prey upon them.  You gain additional ruach from sleeping targets."

msgid "Your body has now stopped aging, massively extending your longevity.  You can still be killed but as long as your body can heal, all your wounds will eventually fully heal no matter how severe they are."
msgstr "Your body has now stopped ageing, massively extending your longevity.  You can still be killed but as long as your body can heal, all your wounds will eventually fully heal no matter how severe they are."

msgid "Attuned to darkness and disease, you can easily spot the cracks in your enemies' defenses.  You have an easier chance to hit enemy weakpoints, increasing as your ruach rises."
msgstr "Attuned to darkness and disease, you can easily spot the cracks in your enemies' defences.  You have an easier chance to hit enemy weakpoints, increasing as your ruach rises."

msgid "Under the light of the moon, you realize a new way to use your stolen ruach to empower yourself."
msgstr "Under the light of the moon, you realise a new way to use your stolen ruach to empower yourself."

msgid "A traveler from another dimension.  A dimension of shadows with few bright lights.  Once your species matures, they gain the ability to create new alterations to their body from ingredients harvested from their kills, shadowstuff and magickal essence."
msgstr "A traveller from another dimension.  A dimension of shadows with few bright lights.  Once your species matures, they gain the ability to create new alterations to their body from ingredients harvested from their kills, shadowstuff and magickal essence."

msgid "Your legs have decreased in length providing you with a lower center of gravity and a slight improvement to agility."
msgstr "Your legs have decreased in length providing you with a lower centre of gravity and a slight improvement to agility."

msgid "Your skin is the color of shadows moving in the twilight."
msgstr "Your skin is the colour of shadows moving in the twilight."

msgid "Your dietary needs are so minimized that you could travel months or years without eating.  There are consequences to this.  One is an inability to process normal food.  Another is a pretty constant state of weariness, but this is the best way to handle interdimensional travel until you are able to develop an organ to consume local foods.  The ambient energies here are much weaker than what you normally encounter out in the Nether between universes, you need exposure to nuclear radiation to gain calories on this planet, for now."
msgstr "Your dietary needs are so minimised that you could travel months or years without eating.  There are consequences to this.  One is an inability to process normal food.  Another is a pretty constant state of weariness, but this is the best way to handle interdimensional travel until you are able to develop an organ to consume local foods.  The ambient energies here are much weaker than what you normally encounter out in the Nether between universes, you need exposure to nuclear radiation to gain calories on this planet, for now."

msgid "Attune to a location for later traveling.  You must attune within the depths of a forest."
msgstr "Attune to a location for later travelling.  You must attune within the depths of a forest."

msgid "Your skin has turned the color of spring growth.  Your skin is now a viridian green.  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "Your skin has turned the colour of spring growth.  Your skin is now a viridian green.  This has no gameplay effects."

msgid "Your skin has turned into a type of plant matter, which in addition to any armoring slows your loss of fluids."
msgstr "Your skin has turned into a type of plant matter, which in addition to any armouring slows your loss of fluids."

msgid "The skin on your body has grown into a barklike state.  This provides significantly more armor but reduces flexibility."
msgstr "The skin on your body has grown into a barklike state.  This provides significantly more armour but reduces flexibility."

msgid "A viridian moss has grown on your skin, forming whorls and eldritch patterns, providing some protection from the cold and the wet.  It also provides a small amount of armor against acid or fire."
msgstr "A viridian moss has grown on your skin, forming whorls and eldritch patterns, providing some protection from the cold and the wet.  It also provides a small amount of armour against acid or fire."

msgid "The trees recognize you as one of their own and allow you to pass easily beneath their boughs.  The grass moves under your feet to speed your passage, and shrubs bend out of the way.  When walking on grass, trees, or other natural foliage, your movement speed is increased."
msgstr "The trees recognise you as one of their own and allow you to pass easily beneath their boughs.  The grass moves under your feet to speed your passage, and shrubs bend out of the way.  When walking on grass, trees, or other natural foliage, your movement speed is increased."

msgid "The trees recognize you as one of their own and allow you to pass easily beneath their boughs.  The grass moves under your feet to speed your passage, and shrubs bend out of the way.  When walking on grass, trees, or other natural foliage, your movement speed is increased.  In addition, when in a forest, the trees bend out of your way, allowing you to pass"
msgstr "The trees recognise you as one of their own and allow you to pass easily beneath their boughs.  The grass moves under your feet to speed your passage, and shrubs bend out of the way.  When walking on grass, trees, or other natural foliage, your movement speed is increased.  In addition, when in a forest, the trees bend out of your way, allowing you to pass"

msgid "Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to grow a goblin fruit when in natural areas away from civilization."
msgstr "Upon gaining this ability the Arvore gains the ability to grow a goblin fruit when in natural areas away from civilisation."

msgid "Like a tree, you are fueled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you will absorb its energy as nutrients and heal slightly faster."
msgstr "Like a tree, you are fuelled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you will absorb its energy as nutrients and heal slightly faster."

msgid "Solar Revitalization"
msgstr "Solar Revitalisation"

msgid "Like a tree, you are fueled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you will absorb its energy as nutrients, heal slightly faster, and your mana regenerates much quicker."
msgstr "Like a tree, you are fuelled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you will absorb its energy as nutrients, heal slightly faster, and your mana regenerates much quicker."

msgid "The forest recognizes your kinship and will hide you beneath its boughs.  When in a forest or in thick foliage, enemies will have a harder time spotting you."
msgstr "The forest recognises your kinship and will hide you beneath its boughs.  When in a forest or in thick foliage, enemies will have a harder time spotting you."

msgid "Every rose has its thorn and so do you.  With a moment's concentration, you can exude thorns through your skin that have a chance of damaging attackers while increasing the damage of your unarmed attacks.  However, you cannot wear rigid armor over your thorns."
msgstr "Every rose has its thorn and so do you.  With a moment's concentration, you can exude thorns through your skin that have a chance of damaging attackers while increasing the damage of your unarmed attacks.  However, you cannot wear rigid armour over your thorns."

msgid "You are exuding thorns through your skin that have a chance of damaging attackers while increasing the damage of your unarmed attacks.  However, you cannot wear rigid armor over your thorns."
msgstr "You are exuding thorns through your skin that have a chance of damaging attackers while increasing the damage of your unarmed attacks.  However, you cannot wear rigid armour over your thorns."

msgid "When in wild areas, you can draw on the revitalizing power of the land to heal yourself.  When in natural areas, your limbs will heal much faster."
msgstr "When in wild areas, you can draw on the revitalising power of the land to heal yourself.  When in natural areas, your limbs will heal much faster."

msgid "Like a tree, you are fueled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you will absorb its energy as nutrients, heal slightly faster, your mana regenerates much quicker, and you gain a bonus to your maximum mana."
msgstr "Like a tree, you are fuelled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you will absorb its energy as nutrients, heal slightly faster, your mana regenerates much quicker, and you gain a bonus to your maximum mana."

msgid "Like a tree, you are fueled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you will absorb its energy as nutrients, heal slightly faster, your mana regenerates much quicker, you gain a bonus to your maximum mana, and you gain a +2 bonus to all stats."
msgstr "Like a tree, you are fuelled by the sun.  When standing in the sunlight, you will absorb its energy as nutrients, heal slightly faster, your mana regenerates much quicker, you gain a bonus to your maximum mana, and you gain a +2 bonus to all stats."

msgid "You must be in the remnants of civilization to call forth a goblin fruit."
msgstr "You must be in the remnants of civilisation to call forth a goblin fruit."

msgid "You must be within one of the remaining bastions of civilization to cast this spell."
msgstr "You must be within one of the remaining bastions of civilisation to cast this spell."

msgid "Though the teeming masses of humanity are gone, the Homullus can evoke their anonymizing essence with magick, rendering them invisible to any humans affected by the spell."
msgstr "Though the teeming masses of humanity are gone, the Homullus can evoke their anonymising essence with magick, rendering them invisible to any humans affected by the spell."

msgid "Fueled by the power charging your leylines, touch a target to restore some of the power in a vehicle or power grid."
msgstr "Fuelled by the power charging your leylines, touch a target to restore some of the power in a vehicle or power grid."

msgid "With the aid of a bit of fae magick, you may find a goblin fruit abandoned among the ruins.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast in the remnants of civilization."
msgstr "With the aid of a bit of fae magick, you may find a goblin fruit abandoned among the ruins.  Goblin fruit have a variety of effects, never predictable but always at least somewhat beneficial.  This spell may only be cast in the remnants of civilisation."

msgid "Humanity crisscrossed the Earth with roads, first small tracks, then earthen projects, and finally mighty asphalt webs upon which billions of people traveled every day.  The Homullus can stand on the remnants of that web and return to any remaining locus of civilization that they have attuned to."
msgstr "Humanity crisscrossed the Earth with roads, first small tracks, then earthen projects, and finally mighty asphalt webs upon which billions of people travelled every day.  The Homullus can stand on the remnants of that web and return to any remaining locus of civilisation that they have attuned to."

msgid "Attune to a location for later traveling.  You must attune at one of the remaining bastions of civilization or concentrations of humanity."
msgstr "Attune to a location for later travelling.  You must attune at one of the remaining bastions of civilisation or concentrations of humanity."

msgid "Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to travel along a road to any bastion of civilization they have attuned to."
msgstr "Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to travel along a road to any bastion of civilisation they have attuned to."

msgid "Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to find a goblin fruit when in the remnants of civilization."
msgstr "Upon gaining this ability the Homullus gains the ability to find a goblin fruit when in the remnants of civilisation."

msgid "Internalized Charge"
msgstr "Internalised Charge"

msgid "Reinforced Armor"
msgstr "Reinforced Armour"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Humans are flimsy creatures compared to even natural animals, yet by crafting armor they obtain durability that unthinking creatures will never reach.  You draw on this legacy, increasing the strength of armor you wear by 20%"
msgstr "Humans are flimsy creatures compared to even natural animals, yet by crafting armour they obtain durability that unthinking creatures will never reach.  You draw on this legacy, increasing the strength of armour you wear by 20%"

msgid "Fortified Armor"
msgstr "Fortified Armour"

#, no-c-format
msgid "You embody the tales of ancient knights, increasing the strength of armor you wear by 40%."
msgstr "You embody the tales of ancient knights, increasing the strength of armour you wear by 40%."

msgid "You conceptually harden your tools and armor, reducing the chance that they are damaged."
msgstr "You conceptually harden your tools and armour, reducing the chance that they are damaged."

msgid "You conceptually harden your tools and armor, immensely reducing the chance that they are damaged."
msgstr "You conceptually harden your tools and armour, immensely reducing the chance that they are damaged."

#, no-c-format
msgid "By standing together, humanity was able to overcome all threats, and it was only when they turned on each other that the Cataclysm grew out of control.  The Homullus regains Stamina 5% faster per ally within 30 meters (10% faster per ally if they have the Homullus trait)."
msgstr "By standing together, humanity was able to overcome all threats, and it was only when they turned on each other that the Cataclysm grew out of control.  The Homullus regains Stamina 5% faster per ally within 30 metres (10% faster per ally if they have the Homullus trait)."

msgid "Though they had no claws or fangs or armored skin, humanity mastered the world through their tools.  When near civilization, your crafting speed is increased."
msgstr "Though they had no claws or fangs or armoured skin, humanity mastered the world through their tools.  When near civilisation, your crafting speed is increased."

msgid "Though they had no claws or fangs or armored skin, humanity mastered the world through their tools.  When near civilization, your crafting speed and ability are increased."
msgstr "Though they had no claws or fangs or armoured skin, humanity mastered the world through their tools.  When near civilisation, your crafting speed and ability are increased."

msgid "Though they had no claws or fangs or armored skin, humanity mastered the world through their tools.  When near civilization, your crafting speed and ability are greatly increased."
msgstr "Though they had no claws or fangs or armoured skin, humanity mastered the world through their tools.  When near civilisation, your crafting speed and ability are greatly increased."

msgid "With their tools, humanity built weapons, grew food, made homes, and tamed the wilderness.  The Homullus has internalized that essence into themselves, allowing them to use their bare hands to accomplish many tasks that would otherwise require tools."
msgstr "With their tools, humanity built weapons, grew food, made homes, and tamed the wilderness.  The Homullus has internalised that essence into themselves, allowing them to use their bare hands to accomplish many tasks that would otherwise require tools."

msgid "Your time spent surrounded by the remnants of civilization has increased your facility with your fae magicks."
msgstr "Your time spent surrounded by the remnants of civilisation has increased your facility with your fae magicks."

msgid "You can mold earth like clay, turning it to stone and back, or raising it and lowering it into pits or ramps or walls."
msgstr "You can mould earth like clay, turning it to stone and back, or raising it and lowering it into pits or ramps or walls."

msgid "Traveling the Veins of the Earth"
msgstr "Travelling the Veins of the Earth"

msgid "The earth is crisscrossed with fissures, with layers of rock and veins of metal, and deeper, with flows of molten rock.  The Ierde can flow along those paths, traveling deep within the earth to any point they have previously been to."
msgstr "The earth is crisscrossed with fissures, with layers of rock and veins of metal, and deeper, with flows of molten rock.  The Ierde can flow along those paths, travelling deep within the earth to any point they have previously been to."

msgid "Your skin has turned the color of manganese stained soil.  Your skin is now a purplish black.  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "Your skin has turned the colour of manganese stained soil.  Your skin is now a purplish black.  This has no gameplay effects."

msgid "Your skin has toughened and formed pebble-like growths in some places, acting as natural armor.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr "Your skin has toughened and formed pebble-like growths in some places, acting as natural armour.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."

msgid "Your skin has developed into strong granite-like covering that retains some flexibility and has grown to cover most of your body, acting as natural armor.  While difficult to penetrate, it also limits your flexibility.  Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "Your skin has developed into strong granite-like covering that retains some flexibility and has grown to cover most of your body, acting as natural armour.  While difficult to penetrate, it also limits your flexibility.  Greatly reduces wet effects."

msgid "With a brief moment to stabilize themselves, the Ierde strikes a wall, door, or other terrain feature with the force of a falling boulder, doing many times their normal damage."
msgstr "With a brief moment to stabilise themselves, the Ierde strikes a wall, door, or other terrain feature with the force of a falling boulder, doing many times their normal damage."

msgid "Stone endures but armor is made of metal.  While standing on natural earth or stone, the Ierde can infuse their skin with metal, slowing their movement and encumbering them but rendering them much harder to damage."
msgstr "Stone endures but armour is made of metal.  While standing on natural earth or stone, the Ierde can infuse their skin with metal, slowing their movement and encumbering them but rendering them much harder to damage."

msgid "When standing on the living earth or underground, the Ierde can root themselves in place.  While doing so, they cannot move, but they are immune to being stunned, dazed, or downed, and gain additional armor."
msgstr "When standing on the living earth or underground, the Ierde can root themselves in place.  While doing so, they cannot move, but they are immune to being stunned, dazed, or downed, and gain additional armour."

msgid "Vigor of the Soil"
msgstr "Vigour of the Soil"

msgid "Vigor of the Stone"
msgstr "Vigour of the Stone"

msgid "Vigor of the Mountain"
msgstr "Vigour of the Mountain"

msgid "Vigor of the Bedrock"
msgstr "Vigour of the Bedrock"

msgid "You awaken with a groggy head, blinking bleary eyes.  Sleeping near the remnants of civilization away from the bounty of nature, your sleep was not as restful as it should have been."
msgstr "You awaken with a groggy head, blinking bleary eyes.  Sleeping near the remnants of civilisation away from the bounty of nature, your sleep was not as restful as it should have been."

msgid "Like your fae ancestors, you can turn gossamer into clothing and armor.  Activate this trait to learn a gossamer recipe (once per week)."
msgstr "Like your fae ancestors, you can turn gossamer into clothing and armour.  Activate this trait to learn a gossamer recipe (once per week)."

msgid "Kindle a flame within the target, slowly burning them from the inside.  This spell does damage only slowly, but there is little defense against being burned from the inside out."
msgstr "Kindle a flame within the target, slowly burning them from the inside.  This spell does damage only slowly, but there is little defence against being burned from the inside out."

msgid "Your skin has turned the color of an autumnal bonfire.  Your skin is now an orange red with dark freckles.  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "Your skin has turned the colour of an autumnal bonfire.  Your skin is now an orange red with dark freckles.  This has no gameplay effects."

msgid "Fueling the Hungry Oven"
msgstr "Fuelling the Hungry Oven"

msgid "The Bonfire Blazes Until the Revelers Have Gone"
msgstr "The Bonfire Blazes Until the Revellers Have Gone"

msgid "Like a fire fueled with fresh wood, you have increased strength.  +1 Strength."
msgstr "Like a fire fuelled with fresh wood, you have increased strength.  +1 Strength."

#, no-c-format
msgid "The Salamander is a font of mana, like a well-fueled bonfire.  25% extra mana."
msgstr "The Salamander is a font of mana, like a well-fuelled bonfire.  25% extra mana."

msgid "With an act of will, you can extend wings of flame from your back.  These aetherial wings are not hindered by clothing or armor, but also do not have enough substance to allow you to fly.  However, they can break a fall or be used in combat."
msgstr "With an act of will, you can extend wings of flame from your back.  These aetherial wings are not hindered by clothing or armour, but also do not have enough substance to allow you to fly.  However, they can break a fall or be used in combat."

msgid "The wind blows where it will, through fences and open windows, across fields and over rivers  The Sylph can blow with it, traveling high above the earth and alighting on a location they have previously been."
msgstr "The wind blows where it will, through fences and open windows, across fields and over rivers  The Sylph can blow with it, travelling high above the earth and alighting on a location they have previously been."

msgid "Attune to a location for later traveling.  You must attune high above the earth and outdoors."
msgstr "Attune to a location for later travelling.  You must attune high above the earth and outdoors."

msgid "Your skin has turned the rolling grey of the clouds.  Your skin is now an ever-shifting color of clouds shifting from stormy to rainy to barely there.  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "Your skin has turned the rolling grey of the clouds.  Your skin is now an ever-shifting colour of clouds shifting from stormy to rainy to barely there.  This has no gameplay effects."

msgid "Updraft Leap"
msgstr "Updraught Leap"

msgid "Your skin has turned the color of the Mediterranean Sea.  Your skin is now a brilliant turquoise color.  This has no gameplay effects."
msgstr "Your skin has turned the colour of the Mediterranean Sea.  Your skin is now a brilliant turquoise colour.  This has no gameplay effects."

msgid "Upon gaining this ability the Undine's eyes begin reflecting their mood with colors of the deep waters, pitch black when angry or sad and green-blue when pleased.  Glare no longer impacts them, and neither do light levels when trying to sleep.  They can also see without problem underwater."
msgstr "Upon gaining this ability the Undine's eyes begin reflecting their mood with colours of the deep waters, pitch black when angry or sad and green-blue when pleased.  Glare no longer impacts them, and neither do light levels when trying to sleep.  They can also see without problem underwater."

msgid "The waters come to the Undine's defense.  When attacked, there is a chance that a burst of water will surge out and push their attackers back."
msgstr "The waters come to the Undine's defence.  When attacked, there is a chance that a burst of water will surge out and push their attackers back."

msgid "Year by year, meter by meter, the waves gradually erode the beaches.  +3 Strength."
msgstr "Year by year, metre by metre, the waves gradually erode the beaches.  +3 Strength."

msgid "Boann dismissively waves a hand before you can say anything, and you are enveloped by a swirl of multicolored lights."
msgstr "Boann dismissively waves a hand before you can say anything, and you are enveloped by a swirl of multicoloured lights."

msgid "I'd like some advice about the armored centipede."
msgstr "I'd like some advice about the armoured centipede."

msgid "I'm back and I killed the armored centipede"
msgstr "I'm back and I killed the armoured centipede"

msgid "[Kill an armored centipede]"
msgstr "[Kill an armoured centipede]"

msgid "A knight must know how to triumph despite their foe's armor.  Kill an armored centipede and I'll grant you an insignia, so you might be recognized as one of my knights."
msgstr "A knight must know how to triumph despite their foe's armour.  Kill an armoured centipede and I'll grant you an insignia, so you might be recognised as one of my knights."

msgid "Study the weak spots of weaker centipedes, it'll give you an advantage.  Its armor isn't as effective against blunt and piercing weapon than it is against slashing weapons and bullets."
msgstr "Study the weak spots of weaker centipedes, it'll give you an advantage.  Its armour isn't as effective against blunt and piercing weapon than it is against slashing weapons and bullets."

msgid "I'm honored to grant you this insignia."
msgstr "I'm honoured to grant you this insignia."

msgid "I want you to brave the harshest environments.  Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart and I'll grant you a powerful set of armor."
msgstr "I want you to brave the harshest environments.  Bring me a chunk of a triffid heart and I'll grant you a powerful set of armour."

msgid "I'm pleased to grant you a set of armor appropriate for a knight."
msgstr "I'm pleased to grant you a set of armour appropriate for a knight."

msgid "Mundane weapons won't do much so try to find something that bypasses its armor.  It's also very slow so keeping your distance is easy.  Learning the weak points of smaller beetles and using high-power ammunitions can work too but expect its shell to block most shots."
msgstr "Mundane weapons won't do much so try to find something that bypasses its armour.  It's also very slow so keeping your distance is easy.  Learning the weak points of smaller beetles and using high-power ammunitions can work too but expect its shell to block most shots."

msgid "I am honored to give you this banner.  Wear it with pride, as you more than earned that right."
msgstr "I am honoured to give you this banner.  Wear it with pride, as you more than earned that right."

msgid "It is strong but slow, so disengaging is possible.  It will summon hounds, but they quickly fade away so they aren't that much of an issue compared to it.  Stand away from corners in walls as it can teleport to them.  It has no armor against fire, electricity and blunt weapons but it quickly heal all its wounds so continuous heavy damage is the key to kill it.  If you cannot manage to injure it, do not hesitate to withdraw and try another way to kill it."
msgstr "It is strong but slow, so disengaging is possible.  It will summon hounds, but they quickly fade away so they aren't that much of an issue compared to it.  Stand away from corners in walls as it can teleport to them.  It has no armour against fire, electricity and blunt weapons but it quickly heal all its wounds so continuous heavy damage is the key to kill it.  If you cannot manage to injure it, do not hesitate to withdraw and try another way to kill it."

msgid "Kill a great beast in my honor and I'll reward you as a new member of my court."
msgstr "Kill a great beast in my honour and I'll reward you as a new member of my court."

msgid "Have you brought me the favor I requested?"
msgstr "Have you brought me the favour I requested?"

msgid "Kill a dangerous monster in my honor and I shall reward you."
msgstr "Kill a dangerous monster in my honour and I shall reward you."

msgid "Kill a great beast in my honor and I'll grant you a reward."
msgstr "Kill a great beast in my honour and I'll grant you a reward."

msgid "Kill an armored centipede for me"
msgstr "Kill an armoured centipede for me"

msgid "Kill a great beast in my honor and I'll reward you."
msgstr "Kill a great beast in my honour and I'll reward you."

msgid "Kill a great foe in my honor and I'll reward you."
msgstr "Kill a great foe in my honour and I'll reward you."

msgid "Kill a great beast in my honor and I'll reward you as a new member of my knights."
msgstr "Kill a great beast in my honour and I'll reward you as a new member of my knights."

msgid "Long story short, I played for them every night like the contract said, it was a good bit better than starving to death.  I saw and heard some of the craziest things while I was there and other humans came and made deals and went.  They told me that this particular 'sith' had strict rules about how to treat people and that I was quite lucky to be here.  It didn't feel like they considered themselves 'people'.  Anyway when my contract was up they said they'd quite enjoyed my time with them and gave me some gifts to help me get along once I'd left their island.  When society broke down I thought about heading there to see if they were still there.  I chickened out when I realized how far it was compared to my evacuation point.  Course, here I am among the unwanted masses, maybe you'll find them there if you decide to go look."
msgstr "Long story short, I played for them every night like the contract said, it was a good bit better than starving to death.  I saw and heard some of the craziest things while I was there and other humans came and made deals and went.  They told me that this particular 'sith' had strict rules about how to treat people and that I was quite lucky to be here.  It didn't feel like they considered themselves 'people'.  Anyway when my contract was up they said they'd quite enjoyed my time with them and gave me some gifts to help me get along once I'd left their island.  When society broke down I thought about heading there to see if they were still there.  I chickened out when I realised how far it was compared to my evacuation point.  Course, here I am among the unwanted masses, maybe you'll find them there if you decide to go look."

msgid "I would love it if you could find my favorite book.  Could you help me find it?  It's an anthology of stories titled 'Apocalypse Now'.  I know it's weird to want to read a book about apocalypses during one, but it gives me hope we'll come out the other side of this one too."
msgstr "I would love it if you could find my favourite book.  Could you help me find it?  It's an anthology of stories titled 'Apocalypse Now'.  I know it's weird to want to read a book about apocalypses during one, but it gives me hope we'll come out the other side of this one too."

