msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "One of your parents was always a little odd.  They stayed out of the sun as much as they could, their eyes were a bit of an odd color, and they vanished without a trace before you grew old enough to ask them why they left the room every time you got a scrape that drew blood.  But now that you're older, you understand.  You are the child of a vampire, and have inherited a small portion of their power."
msgstr "One of your parents was always a little odd.  They stayed out of the sun as much as they could, their eyes were a bit of an odd colour, and they vanished without a trace before you grew old enough to ask them why they left the room every time you got a scrape that drew blood.  But now that you're older, you understand.  You are the child of a vampire, and have inherited a small portion of their power."

