msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Part of Xedra's Offworld Acquisitions group, you specialized in tracking, killing and retrieving useful components from the cyborg tribes that seem to exist on some of the worlds Xedra had access to.  Do you feel guilt about bringing back the cybernetic components that are now inside you or your teammates?  Or do you worry that now they might be on this world hunting you?  You've lost your sidearm and spent half of your heavy ordnance.  Worst of all, you're out of smokes."
msgstr "Part of Xedra's Offworld Acquisitions group, you specialised in tracking, killing and retrieving useful components from the cyborg tribes that seem to exist on some of the worlds Xedra had access to.  Do you feel guilt about bringing back the cybernetic components that are now inside you or your teammates?  Or do you worry that now they might be on this world hunting you?  You've lost your sidearm and spent half of your heavy ordnance.  Worst of all, you're out of smokes."

