msgid ""
"hunternetvulfgar.mp4\n"
"The video cuts in as a montage of school security cameras in hallways, as a young man and woman break into the school.  As they walk past each camera, that image drops and the others rearrange larger, while a popular song from the 90's begins playing.  The young adults enter a classroom and are clearly flirting.\n"
"Awoo oooh, got you where I want you\n"
"plays over top of the video.  The man laughs at something the woman says, and throws his head back laughing while she is clearly annoyed.  His face elongates as his body grows, shredding the clothes he is wearing as limbs change and sprout thick fur.  She has backed away from him and put the students' and teacher's desks between them.  Fully transformed into a hideous wolfman, he begins his approach towards his once date now prey, smashing chairs and students' desks out of his way.  Suddenly the wolfcreature pauses and its ears prick up.  It turns and looks at the wall of windows in the classroom.  Glass erupts into the room as the darkness outside the window shows the muzzle flare of at least a dozen different guns firing.  The wolfcreature is hit more times than you can count in a span of seconds and falls to the ground.\n"
"The song reaches a crescendo 'Got you where I want you, got you, yeahhhhh!' as his date pulls a large caliber pistol out of the teachers desk, walks over to the fallen beast and calmly puts three bullets in its skull.  The video ends."
msgstr ""
"hunternetvulfgar.mp4\n"
"The video cuts in as a montage of school security cameras in hallways, as a young man and woman break into the school.  As they walk past each camera, that image drops and the others rearrange larger, while a popular song from the 90's begins playing.  The young adults enter a classroom and are clearly flirting.\n"
"Awoo oooh, got you where I want you\n"
"plays over top of the video.  The man laughs at something the woman says, and throws his head back laughing while she is clearly annoyed.  His face elongates as his body grows, shredding the clothes he is wearing as limbs change and sprout thick fur.  She has backed away from him and put the students' and teacher's desks between them.  Fully transformed into a hideous wolfman, he begins his approach towards his once date now prey, smashing chairs and students' desks out of his way.  Suddenly the wolfcreature pauses and its ears prick up.  It turns and looks at the wall of windows in the classroom.  Glass erupts into the room as the darkness outside the window shows the muzzle flare of at least a dozen different guns firing.  The wolfcreature is hit more times than you can count in a span of seconds and falls to the ground.\n"
"The song reaches a crescendo 'Got you where I want you, got you, yeahhhhh!' as his date pulls a large calibre pistol out of the teachers desk, walks over to the fallen beast and calmly puts three bullets in its skull.  The video ends."

msgid ""
"hunternetlinda.mp4\n"
"Electronic music plays on a black screen.  Text appears on the screen\n"
"'Stand still, pause clocks, we can make the world stop'\n"
"A video montage follows a woman across multiple days and outfits.  On errands, at work, traveling in different cities.  About a minute into the montage of video there are short cuts to her violently attacking people in secluded settings.  Those gradually become the dominant images until it's only video of her feasting on the blood of her fallen victims.  The final image is her looking up; face covered, blood dripping down onto her ruined outfit; eyes staring straight into the camera as the image freezes.  On the now black screen, a name and address appear."
msgstr ""
"hunternetlinda.mp4\n"
"Electronic music plays on a black screen.  Text appears on the screen\n"
"'Stand still, pause clocks, we can make the world stop'\n"
"A video montage follows a woman across multiple days and outfits.  On errands, at work, travelling in different cities.  About a minute into the montage of video there are short cuts to her violently attacking people in secluded settings.  Those gradually become the dominant images until it's only video of her feasting on the blood of her fallen victims.  The final image is her looking up; face covered, blood dripping down onto her ruined outfit; eyes staring straight into the camera as the image freezes.  On the now black screen, a name and address appear."

msgid "As you are walking you suddenly hear a woman singing mournfully.  As you look around trying to see where the sound is coming from you slowly realize that if you take more than a step and a half in any direction the song fades away.  Eventually you are unable to find it again."
msgstr "As you are walking you suddenly hear a woman singing mournfully.  As you look around trying to see where the sound is coming from you slowly realise that if you take more than a step and a half in any direction the song fades away.  Eventually you are unable to find it again."

msgid "You hear a wolf howl in the distance, swiftly joined by several others.  After a moment of silence, you hear another series of howls, and then another.  It's only after the third set fades that you realize the howls were all in exactly the same pattern; two long, three short."
msgstr "You hear a wolf howl in the distance, swiftly joined by several others.  After a moment of silence, you hear another series of howls, and then another.  It's only after the third set fades that you realise the howls were all in exactly the same pattern; two long, three short."

msgid "Disturbed by your approach, a small animal darts away into the underbrush.  It's only after it disappears that you realize it had six legs."
msgstr "Disturbed by your approach, a small animal darts away into the underbrush.  It's only after it disappears that you realise it had six legs."

msgid "For a moment, all the stars turn a dim reddish color."
msgstr "For a moment, all the stars turn a dim reddish colour."

msgid "You realize that all of your empty pockets have been turned inside out.  How long ago this happened you can't say."
msgstr "You realise that all of your empty pockets have been turned inside out.  How long ago this happened you can't say."

msgid "<color_light_red>You dream about being unraveled, the strands making you falling to the ground.</color>"
msgstr "<color_light_red>You dream about being unravelled, the strands making you falling to the ground.</color>"

msgid "<color_light_red>The Lies are unraveling you as you dared resist them.</color>"
msgstr "<color_light_red>The Lies are unravelling you as you dared resist them.</color>"

msgid "<color_light_red>If you stop reading this book, you will stop unraveling.</color>"
msgstr "<color_light_red>If you stop reading this book, you will stop unravelling.</color>"

msgid "\"We negotiated salvage rights to any biological matter remaining in the event of civilizational collapse.\""
msgstr "\"We negotiated salvage rights to any biological matter remaining in the event of civilisational collapse.\""

msgid "Discovered in an estate sale in upper Chappaquiddick these baubles were labeled as the owners most precious possessions and proof of other worlds."
msgstr "Discovered in an estate sale in upper Chappaquiddick these baubles were labelled as the owners most precious possessions and proof of other worlds."

msgid "Strange Travelers Exhibit 1"
msgstr "Strange Travellers Exhibit 1"

msgid "Strange Travelers Exhibit 2"
msgstr "Strange Travellers Exhibit 2"

msgid "Strange Travelers Exhibit 3"
msgstr "Strange Travellers Exhibit 3"

msgid "STRANGE LIGHTS IN WOODS AND SWAMPS: Locals have stated that near the deep woods and swamps strange lights and sounds have occurred.  \"Late at night I see and hear things coming from the deep swamp, where it wouldn't be safe to go in the dark\", Steve 'Goatman' Mulroy said.  Local police claim that the legalization of various cannabinoids is likely the root cause of these late night occurrences."
msgstr "STRANGE LIGHTS IN WOODS AND SWAMPS: Locals have stated that near the deep woods and swamps strange lights and sounds have occurred.  \"Late at night I see and hear things coming from the deep swamp, where it wouldn't be safe to go in the dark\", Steve 'Goatman' Mulroy said.  Local police claim that the legalisation of various cannabinoids is likely the root cause of these late night occurrences."

msgid "NEW CANDY MAKER OPENS:  Activity at the old Reed and Barton Complex in Taunton, MA has been ongoing for several months.  Locals wondered what exactly was going on at the abandoned complex, but now there are answers!  The entire complex has been taken over by a foreign candy maker known as Wyld Candies.  A spokesperson for the company stated that 'We believe there will be explosive growth opportunities here in New England in the very near future.'  Local children thrilled to try out the new flavors."
msgstr "NEW CANDY MAKER OPENS:  Activity at the old Reed and Barton Complex in Taunton, MA has been ongoing for several months.  Locals wondered what exactly was going on at the abandoned complex, but now there are answers!  The entire complex has been taken over by a foreign candy maker known as Wyld Candies.  A spokesperson for the company stated that 'We believe there will be explosive growth opportunities here in New England in the very near future.'  Local children thrilled to try out the new flavours."

msgid "JODDIT FACES SIGNIFICANT BACKLASH: Joddit, the 'paper of record for the internet' is undergoing significant upheaval as their volunteer workforce began organizing for less interference in their communities from the site owners.  The current CEO of Joddit continues to fan the flames beyond any reasonable length by calling volunteer workforce 'entitled'."
msgstr "JODDIT FACES SIGNIFICANT BACKLASH: Joddit, the 'paper of record for the internet' is undergoing significant upheaval as their volunteer workforce began organising for less interference in their communities from the site owners.  The current CEO of Joddit continues to fan the flames beyond any reasonable length by calling volunteer workforce 'entitled'."

msgid "ZEBRA HIRING SPREE: The border patrol divisions known collectively as Zebra Divisions seem to have gone on an impressive hiring spree judging by the quantity of office buildings and agency marked vehicles in New England, not part of the country historically considered a dangerous border in need of patrols.  However, in this new world where seepage events are regular occurrences and rumors of strange creatures crossing over are commonplace these new teams seem important."
msgstr "ZEBRA HIRING SPREE: The border patrol divisions known collectively as Zebra Divisions seem to have gone on an impressive hiring spree judging by the quantity of office buildings and agency marked vehicles in New England, not part of the country historically considered a dangerous border in need of patrols.  However, in this new world where seepage events are regular occurrences and rumours of strange creatures crossing over are commonplace these new teams seem important."

msgid "CARNIVAL ARRIVES FROM EUROPE.  Mr Shade's Hurly Burly Carnival has arrived back in New England after having spent the last thirty years traveling Olde Europe as they say.  The sights to be seen at this carnival were called 'Once in a generation' by this journalist's grandfather.  I'll be making plans to attend and I hope you do too."
msgstr "CARNIVAL ARRIVES FROM EUROPE.  Mr Shade's Hurly Burly Carnival has arrived back in New England after having spent the last thirty years travelling Olde Europe as they say.  The sights to be seen at this carnival were called 'Once in a generation' by this journalist's grandfather.  I'll be making plans to attend and I hope you do too."

msgid "FATEFUL OBJECTS GRAND FINALE SALE: The pawnshop of princes, the auctioneer of artifacts, Clove Payne has declared that he is holding a 'Grand Finale Sale for the World' at his store Fateful Objects.  He welcomes everyone to come for 'One last round of dealmaking before it all goes to pieces!'"
msgstr "FATEFUL OBJECTS GRAND FINALE SALE: The pawnshop of princes, the auctioneer of artefacts, Clove Payne has declared that he is holding a 'Grand Finale Sale for the World' at his store Fateful Objects.  He welcomes everyone to come for 'One last round of dealmaking before it all goes to pieces!'"

msgid "These organs came from a glittering nether beast, and you really aren't sure what to make of them.  There are things you've possibly seen in an anatomy book, but in colors and shapes that leave you doubtful."
msgstr "These organs came from a glittering nether beast, and you really aren't sure what to make of them.  There are things you've possibly seen in an anatomy book, but in colours and shapes that leave you doubtful."

msgid "I've tracked down rumors an intradimensional contact unit based out a local government building.  I'm going to go recon it, see you in a few days."
msgstr "I've tracked down rumours an intradimensional contact unit based out a local government building.  I'm going to go recon it, see you in a few days."

msgid "Huge amount of time transferred into a knowledge you will utilize well."
msgstr "Huge amount of time transferred into a knowledge you will utilise well."

msgid ""
"Excerpt from 'Infinite Dimensions, Finite Magickal Systems by Tyco Arendt':\n"
"\n"
"Through the efforts of our Offworld Aquisitions Teams and especially the efforts of our Specter Agents we have become aware of numerous worlds where different 'supernatural milieus' exist.  These are worlds what can be lumped together as magick exists but depending on the dimension the process of use and effects can be vastly different."
msgstr ""
"Excerpt from 'Infinite Dimensions, Finite Magickal Systems by Tyco Arendt':\n"
"\n"
"Through the efforts of our Offworld Aquisitions Teams and especially the efforts of our Spectre Agents we have become aware of numerous worlds where different 'supernatural milieus' exist.  These are worlds what can be lumped together as magick exists but depending on the dimension the process of use and effects can be vastly different."

msgid ""
"Excerpt from 'Infinite Dimensions, Finite Magickal Systems by Tyco Arendt':\n"
"\n"
"Threat Classification: Vancian Magick\n"
"JetIota\n"
"\n"
"Vancian Magick is any system that requires the practitioners to learn/memorize a spell and then forget it upon casting at which point it must be relearned again prior to being able to cast again.  Preparation is key for these types of thaumaturgic assets and without being properly prepared for what they face they can be no more threatening than your average citizen.  Conversely we have found that more users of this type of magick retain their powers on Cradle-Earth than any other type than superhumans."
msgstr ""
"Excerpt from 'Infinite Dimensions, Finite Magickal Systems by Tyco Arendt':\n"
"\n"
"Threat Classification: Vancian Magick\n"
"JetIota\n"
"\n"
"Vancian Magick is any system that requires the practitioners to learn/memorise a spell and then forget it upon casting at which point it must be relearned again prior to being able to cast again.  Preparation is key for these types of thaumaturgic assets and without being properly prepared for what they face they can be no more threatening than your average citizen.  Conversely we have found that more users of this type of magick retain their powers on Cradle-Earth than any other type than superhumans."

msgid ""
"Excerpt from 'Infinite Dimensions, Finite Magickal Systems by Tyco Arendt':\n"
"\n"
"Threat Classification: Superhuman\n"
"RubyNu\n"
"\n"
"***QUARANTINE***\n"
"\n"
"Upon identification of any subjects manifesting true superhuman abilities all agents and aquisition teams must immediately return to Xedra Facilities on Cradle-Earth within 12 hours or be written off when the dimensional coordinates are permanently blacklisted in our transportation system.  This reaction may seem extreme but any planet that develops superhuman attributes such as strength and endurance is at risk of also developing superintelligent, superperceptive individuals.  We are titling this hypothetical superhuman type as Sphinxes because Sphinxes eat the people who are less intelligent than themselves.  These individuals could potentially identify our presence on their dimension through variables we cannot even comprehend.  Whether our morality viewed them as good or evil would be irrevalent as we have no defense against this type of cultural/intellectual domination."
msgstr ""
"Excerpt from 'Infinite Dimensions, Finite Magickal Systems by Tyco Arendt':\n"
"\n"
"Threat Classification: Superhuman\n"
"RubyNu\n"
"\n"
"***QUARANTINE***\n"
"\n"
"Upon identification of any subjects manifesting true superhuman abilities all agents and aquisition teams must immediately return to Xedra Facilities on Cradle-Earth within 12 hours or be written off when the dimensional coordinates are permanently blacklisted in our transportation system.  This reaction may seem extreme but any planet that develops superhuman attributes such as strength and endurance is at risk of also developing superintelligent, superperceptive individuals.  We are titling this hypothetical superhuman type as Sphinxes because Sphinxes eat the people who are less intelligent than themselves.  These individuals could potentially identify our presence on their dimension through variables we cannot even comprehend.  Whether our morality viewed them as good or evil would be irrevalent as we have no defence against this type of cultural/intellectual domination."

msgid ""
"Excerpt from 'Infinite Dimensions, Finite Magickal Systems by Tyco Arendt':\n"
"\n"
"Threat Classification: Psionics\n"
"OpalPsi\n"
"\n"
"Psionically empowered individuals can often be disarmed using specific methods common across dimensions.  Identification of empowered individuals can be difficult in civilizations that either refuse or lack the knowledge of how to identify psionic individuals."
msgstr ""
"Excerpt from 'Infinite Dimensions, Finite Magickal Systems by Tyco Arendt':\n"
