msgid "You feel your body become energized, and you are ready to change the world."
msgstr "You feel your body become energised, and you are ready to change the world."

msgid "A spray of colored leaves whirl around you."
msgstr "A spray of coloured leaves whirl around you."

msgid "Grow a set of enchanted living armor around yourself or an ally, providing protection and resistance to chill temperatures.  The glamour offers <color_yellow>no protection from cold</color> in autumn."
msgstr "Grow a set of enchanted living armour around yourself or an ally, providing protection and resistance to chill temperatures.  The glamour offers <color_yellow>no protection from cold</color> in autumn."

msgid "You and your nearby allies' footsteps make almost no sound when you move, like the footsteps of an animal traveling across new-fallen snow.  If used in winter, your footsteps are <color_green>totally silent</color>.  The glamour is <color_yellow>quicker to expire</color> in summer."
msgstr "You and your nearby allies' footsteps make almost no sound when you move, like the footsteps of an animal travelling across new-fallen snow.  If used in winter, your footsteps are <color_green>totally silent</color>.  The glamour is <color_yellow>quicker to expire</color> in summer."

msgid "Instill ice into a single target's tongue, rendering it heavy and unwieldy in their mouth, and silence their voice with it.  The affected target will not be able to speak or make any noise at all.  The glamour <color_green>lasts much longer</color> in winter."
msgstr "Instil ice into a single target's tongue, rendering it heavy and unwieldy in their mouth, and silence their voice with it.  The affected target will not be able to speak or make any noise at all.  The glamour <color_green>lasts much longer</color> in winter."

msgid "Normalize Time"
msgstr "Normalise Time"

msgid "Dangerously destabilize local time in an area, flooding everything within with entropy.  This will destroy any areas of frozen time and steadily erode any creatures caught within."
msgstr "Dangerously destabilise local time in an area, flooding everything within with entropy.  This will destroy any areas of frozen time and steadily erode any creatures caught within."

msgid "Revert yourself to a location you have previously memorized."
msgstr "Revert yourself to a location you have previously memorised."

msgid "Memorize Location"
msgstr "Memorise Location"

msgid "Spend time memorizing an area so you can revert your physical location to that spot."
msgstr "Spend time memorising an area so you can revert your physical location to that spot."

msgid "Stabilize a zone of disjointed time, preventing it from decaying."
msgstr "Stabilise a zone of disjointed time, preventing it from decaying."

msgid "Stabilize target of frozen time.  Part of the main cement spell.  Having this spell is a bug."
msgstr "Stabilise target of frozen time.  Part of the main cement spell.  Having this spell is a bug."

msgid "Destabilizing Strikes (T)"
msgstr "Destabilising Strikes (T)"

msgid "By maintaining a field of destabilized time around your body, you can effortlessly cause your attacks to erode your target over time.  This power will remain active until toggled off."
msgstr "By maintaining a field of destabilised time around your body, you can effortlessly cause your attacks to erode your target over time.  This power will remain active until toggled off."

