msgid "This causes the dot when attacking targets with the destabilizing strikes buff.  Having the spell is a bug."
msgstr "This causes the dot when attacking targets with the destabilising strikes buff.  Having the spell is a bug."

msgid "Stabilize Timeline (T)"
msgstr "Stabilise Timeline (T)"

