msgstr "Boann waves her hands as you strike her, and you are enveloped by a swirl of multicoloured lights."

msgid "Boann waves her hands as her opponent strikes her, and they vanish in a swirl of multicolored lights."
msgstr "Boann waves her hands as her opponent strikes her, and they vanish in a swirl of multicoloured lights."

msgid "Dream Armor"
msgstr "Dream Armour"

msgid "Armor that sits lightly on your body with little in the way of encumbrance and rests on top of whatever you are wearing."
msgstr "Armour that sits lightly on your body with little in the way of encumbrance and rests on top of whatever you are wearing."

msgid "Force pushes your feet off the ground and launches you several meters."
msgstr "Force pushes your feet off the ground and launches you several metres."

msgid "Stabilize in Reality"
msgstr "Stabilise in Reality"

msgid "As you finish the words of the charm, the magic takes hold.  (E)xamine a nearby crop to fertilize it."
msgstr "As you finish the words of the charm, the magic takes hold.  (E)xamine a nearby crop to fertilise it."

msgid "Your mental defenses break under the pain!"
msgstr "Your mental defences break under the pain!"

msgid "You grind the bones to powder and mix in the blood and herbs while rhythmically chanting the words of the charm, and when you're done you have a dark, foul-smelling paste as the reward of your labors."
msgstr "You grind the bones to powder and mix in the blood and herbs while rhythmically chanting the words of the charm, and when you're done you have a dark, foul-smelling paste as the reward of your labours."

msgid "To Project the Etheric Form"
msgstr "To Project the Aetheric Form"

msgid "The first principle of psychic self-defense is to make sure your mind is in proper order so there is no foothold an assault can take advantage of.  While in effect, your mind is protected against psychic attack.  <color_red>Too much pain</color> will disrupt your concentration."
msgstr "The first principle of psychic self-defence is to make sure your mind is in proper order so there is no foothold an assault can take advantage of.  While in effect, your mind is protected against psychic attack.  <color_red>Too much pain</color> will disrupt your concentration."

msgid "A small whip attack that uses energized cables as a conductor."
msgstr "A small whip attack that uses energised cables as a conductor."

msgid "The sandwich is a flavor beyond time and space, and as you lick your fingers clean you feel your youth return to you - Wait, no, Your wounds are just healing."
msgstr "The sandwich is a flavour beyond time and space, and as you lick your fingers clean you feel your youth return to you - Wait, no, Your wounds are just healing."

msgid "The location the grenade occupied is instantly overwhelmed with sounds and colors you've never felt before as space warps in impossible ways.  Whatever used to be there is now gone."
msgstr "The location the grenade occupied is instantly overwhelmed with sounds and colours you've never felt before as space warps in impossible ways.  Whatever used to be there is now gone."

msgid "The world regains color as it speeds up."
msgstr "The world regains colour as it speeds up."

msgid "You close your eyes and listen to the sounds of civilization."
msgstr "You close your eyes and listen to the sounds of civilisation."

msgid ""
"In a fateful instant, the dream of interstellar civilization was shattered in what became known as The Discontinuity, and billions were consigned to death in the far reaches of the Orion Arm.  Three hundred years later, the survivors still eke out a meager existence within the ruins of their once-great civilization, scavenging and fighting for scraps of technology they can barely understand.\n"
"\n"
"You are one of these countless scavengers, come to exploit the frozen ruins of Salus IV for your own benefit."
msgstr ""
"In a fateful instant, the dream of interstellar civilisation was shattered in what became known as The Discontinuity, and billions were consigned to death in the far reaches of the Orion Arm.  Three hundred years later, the survivors still eke out a meagre existence within the ruins of their once-great civilisation, scavenging and fighting for scraps of technology they can barely understand.\n"
"\n"
"You are one of these countless scavengers, come to exploit the frozen ruins of Salus IV for your own benefit."

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "During the riots and chaos, you hid in a robot dispatch center hoping the robots would protect you, but they may prove more dangerous than the zombies."
msgstr "During the riots and chaos, you hid in a robot dispatch centre hoping the robots would protect you, but they may prove more dangerous than the zombies."

