"At night, both water and carbon dioxide freeze in the upper atmosphere, such that every dawn is accompanied by a procession of colourful haloes over the horizon.\n"
"<color_c_dark_gray>  - Salus IV rediscovery report 02.11.2428, submitted by Cpt.  Jean McAllister."

