"A form-fitting suit meant to be worn by an exosuit pilot.  Although not a requirement for the operation of an exosuit, it features haptic feedback systems that offer improved performance and comfort while doing so.  The suit is not designed for use outside of armour.  This standard model uses a scale mail of overlapping plastic disks for incidental protection.\n"
"\n"
"Its temperature control unit can either draw power from an active frame or be powered by its own battery port."

