msgid "Freshly butchered meat from a frozen human carcass, not the most appetizing."
msgstr "Freshly butchered meat from a frozen human carcass, not the most appetising."

msgid "A shriveled gray stomach, it hasn't seen use in a very long time."
msgstr "A shrivelled grey stomach, it hasn't seen use in a very long time."

msgid "A smooth light green block of cleaned and rendered human fat.  While it'll remain edible for a very long time, it won't be the most appetizing."
msgstr "A smooth light green block of cleaned and rendered human fat.  While it'll remain edible for a very long time, it won't be the most appetising."

msgid "A smooth light green block of dry-rendered human fat.  It's very frostburnt, and while it will remain edible for a very long time, it's not the most appetizing."
msgstr "A smooth light green block of dry-rendered human fat.  It's very frostburnt, and while it will remain edible for a very long time, it's not the most appetising."

msgid "Sealed emergency rations invariably found within an escape pod's inventory.  This particular pack should provide around a day's worth of nutrition.  Required by regulation but rarely ever used, the design of these \"meals\" prioritizes a long shelf life and a very low bulk-cost.  Which lends them their disgusting taste of greased sawdust."
msgstr "Sealed emergency rations invariably found within an escape pod's inventory.  This particular pack should provide around a day's worth of nutrition.  Required by regulation but rarely ever used, the design of these \"meals\" prioritises a long shelf life and a very low bulk-cost.  Which lends them their disgusting taste of greased sawdust."

msgid "A chalk white blood analogue for emergency medical use.  Far more efficient at oxygenation than natural blood, it can also be used as a general performance enhancer.  Once injected, it will be metabolized or otherwise expunged from the body in around 8 hours."
msgstr "A chalk white blood analogue for emergency medical use.  Far more efficient at oxygenation than natural blood, it can also be used as a general performance enhancer.  Once injected, it will be metabolised or otherwise expunged from the body in around 8 hours."

msgid "Kibble made for humans.  A heavy dressing of spices makes it impossible to discern the original flavors it might have had."
msgstr "Kibble made for humans.  A heavy dressing of spices makes it impossible to discern the original flavours it might have had."

msgid "A powerful tri-barreled laser weapon, still mounted to the robotic hand of the Wraitheon drone it originally belonged to.  Can still be fired when connected to an UPS."
msgstr "A powerful tri-barrelled laser weapon, still mounted to the robotic hand of the Wraitheon drone it originally belonged to.  Can still be fired when connected to an UPS."

msgid "A silver, elegantly-wrought laser pistol that fires armor-piercing bolts of golden light.  A now-irreplaceable historical artifact built by the engineering AIs of the late Hyperspace Era, it is as precious as it is deadly."
msgstr "A silver, elegantly-wrought laser pistol that fires armour-piercing bolts of golden light.  A now-irreplaceable historical artefact built by the engineering AIs of the late Hyperspace Era, it is as precious as it is deadly."

msgid "This light coilgun fires 3x35mm armor-piercing flechette.  Classified as a support crew weapon that can be stashed in hidden lockers throughout the floors of a ship.  Designed to be fired in short bursts, if the flechettes pierce a ship's hull they leave tiny holes that are easily repaired."
msgstr "This light coilgun fires 3x35mm armour-piercing flechette.  Classified as a support crew weapon that can be stashed in hidden lockers throughout the floors of a ship.  Designed to be fired in short bursts, if the flechettes pierce a ship's hull they leave tiny holes that are easily repaired."

msgid "Exhaust from a salvaged starship engine is channeled through a series of magnetic coils and focused into a searing fan of plasma, creating a crude but effective short range weapon that can easily melt through most forms of armor.  Its makeshift nature and lack of proper cooling systems make it prone to overheating and catastrophic failure."
msgstr "Exhaust from a salvaged starship engine is channelled through a series of magnetic coils and focused into a searing fan of plasma, creating a crude but effective short range weapon that can easily melt through most forms of armour.  Its makeshift nature and lack of proper cooling systems make it prone to overheating and catastrophic failure."

msgid "The standard issue combat shotgun of UICA marine and colonial forces.  Shot shells have poor performance against modern combat armor, so the M2101 is more often used during policing and peacekeeping operations."
msgstr "The standard issue combat shotgun of UICA marine and colonial forces.  Shot shells have poor performance against modern combat armour, so the M2101 is more often used during policing and peacekeeping operations."

msgid "Wraitheon Armories' premier electrolaser personal defense weapon.  The W3100 Volt adjustable power settings make it adaptable to most conflict situations, lethal or otherwise, and make it a favorite among well-off security forces and law enforcement corps."
msgstr "Wraitheon Armories' premier electrolaser personal defence weapon.  The W3100 Volt adjustable power settings make it adaptable to most conflict situations, lethal or otherwise, and make it a favourite among well-off security forces and law enforcement corps."

msgid "A standardized 30-round magazine compatible with most UICA issue rifles."
msgstr "A standardised 30-round magazine compatible with most UICA issue rifles."

msgid "A standardized 100-round double drum magazine compatible with most UICA issue rifles."
msgstr "A standardised 100-round double drum magazine compatible with most UICA issue rifles."

msgid "A thin strip of transuranic metal, glowing a somber blue from within its shielded glass prison.  A rare and sought-after relic, it could be used to momentarily power all sorts of technology from the late Hyperspace Era."
msgstr "A thin strip of transuranic metal, glowing a sombre blue from within its shielded glass prison.  A rare and sought-after relic, it could be used to momentarily power all sorts of technology from the late Hyperspace Era."

msgid "Vandalized remains of a Standard Interstellar Communications Cluster.  Wires and connectors spill out from a torn side panel, revealing the mangled carcass of a century-old beast.  Although stripped of its core components, careful searching may reveal useful electronics for scavengers like you."
msgstr "Vandalised remains of a Standard Interstellar Communications Cluster.  Wires and connectors spill out from a torn side panel, revealing the mangled carcass of a century-old beast.  Although stripped of its core components, careful searching may reveal useful electronics for scavengers like you."

msgid "A miniature forest of metallic fins and sparkling panels, this is a dedicated heat dissipation module for a Standard Interstellar Communications Cluster.  It is installed outside to utilize the frigid air for maximum cooling."
msgstr "A miniature forest of metallic fins and sparkling panels, this is a dedicated heat dissipation module for a Standard Interstellar Communications Cluster.  It is installed outside to utilise the frigid air for maximum cooling."

msgid "robot dispatch center"
msgstr "robot dispatch centre"

msgid "metal vapor forge"
msgstr "metal vapour forge"

msgid "A secure metal case at about waist-height, with reinforced glass paneling on top.  Useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off.  Secured with an electronic lock."
msgstr "A secure metal case at about waist-height, with reinforced glass panelling on top.  Useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off.  Secured with an electronic lock."

msgid "A secure metal case at about waist-height, with reinforced glass paneling on top.  Useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off.  This one had its lock hacked and is open."
msgstr "A secure metal case at about waist-height, with reinforced glass panelling on top.  Useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off.  This one had its lock hacked and is open."

msgid "A secure metal case at about waist-height, with reinforced glass paneling on top.  Would be useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off, if the glass hadn't been shattered."
msgstr "A secure metal case at about waist-height, with reinforced glass panelling on top.  Would be useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off, if the glass hadn't been shattered."

msgid "A powerful fusion engine fueled by helium.  A miracle of hyperspace age technology, painstakingly reproduced from original schematics without true understanding.  Its core components are notably expensive."
msgstr "A powerful fusion engine fuelled by helium.  A miracle of hyperspace age technology, painstakingly reproduced from original schematics without true understanding.  Its core components are notably expensive."

msgid "Multi-axis maneuvering thruster"
msgstr "Multi-axis manoeuvring thruster"

msgid "A set of highly maneuverable chemical thrusters used is small to medium spacecraft."
msgstr "A set of highly manoeuvrable chemical thrusters used is small to medium spacecraft."

msgid "A pile of melted slag from a destroyed spaceship reactor.  Incandescently hot and highly radioactive, you'd need a purposefully armored suit to even approach it."
msgstr "A pile of melted slag from a destroyed spaceship reactor.  Incandescently hot and highly radioactive, you'd need a purposefully armoured suit to even approach it."

msgid "Many colorful species of ice-lichen, thriving above an uncharacteristically fertile segment of ice.  Either endemic, or surviving genecraft from an aborted terraforming project."
msgstr "Many colourful species of ice-lichen, thriving above an uncharacteristically fertile segment of ice.  Either endemic, or surviving genecraft from an aborted terraforming project."

msgid "A pond of rust colored water, a thin sheen of iridescent murk reflects light across its surface.  Even brief immersion is likely to prove fatal."
msgstr "A pond of rust coloured water, a thin sheen of iridescent murk reflects light across its surface.  Even brief immersion is likely to prove fatal."

msgid "A galvanized steel door, forged to withstand punishment and impede anyone or anything.  This one is secured with an electronic lock."
msgstr "A galvanised steel door, forged to withstand punishment and impede anyone or anything.  This one is secured with an electronic lock."

msgid "A roof made from transparent fiber-reinforced concrete, allowing light to pass through.  Often used to build greenhouses in unfavorable environments."
msgstr "A roof made from transparent fibre-reinforced concrete, allowing light to pass through.  Often used to build greenhouses in unfavourable environments."

msgid "High-quality and tough checkered metal flooring to reduce the risk of slips and falls, with a still-functioning inactive light attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr "High-quality and tough chequered metal flooring to reduce the risk of slips and falls, with a still-functioning inactive light attached to the ceiling above."

msgid "A section of flooring made out of a tough, rubbery material.  Colored a simple white.  There is a still-functioning inactive light attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr "A section of flooring made out of a tough, rubbery material.  Coloured a simple white.  There is a still-functioning inactive light attached to the ceiling above."

msgid "An industrially fabricated assembly of lightweight metallic framing and insulated cover sheets, used to quickly assemble standardized colonial infrastructure.  Capable of resisting the merciless cold and not much else."
msgstr "An industrially fabricated assembly of lightweight metallic framing and insulated cover sheets, used to quickly assemble standardised colonial infrastructure.  Capable of resisting the merciless cold and not much else."

msgid "A hull segment from a civilian starship.  Only sufficiently armored to defend against the vacuum and radiation of space, the only dangers you'd expect to find on the other side."
msgstr "A hull segment from a civilian starship.  Only sufficiently armoured to defend against the vacuum and radiation of space, the only dangers you'd expect to find on the other side."

msgid "A hull segment from a combat rated civilian starship.  Provides some defense against weapons fire."
msgstr "A hull segment from a combat rated civilian starship.  Provides some defence against weapons fire."

msgid "An armored and airtight spaceship hatch.  Its locked shut, and can only be opened from a control panel."
msgstr "An armoured and airtight spaceship hatch.  Its locked shut, and can only be opened from a control panel."

msgid "An armored and airtight spaceship hatch.  A side mounted lever allows for its manual operation."
msgstr "An armoured and airtight spaceship hatch.  A side mounted lever allows for its manual operation."

msgid "Armory card reader"
msgstr "Armoury card reader"

msgid "This is a smartcard reader.  Bold lettering proclaims that this controls access to the armory.  You could swipe an appropriate crew ID card near it to unlock the gates."
msgstr "This is a smartcard reader.  Bold lettering proclaims that this controls access to the armoury.  You could swipe an appropriate crew ID card near it to unlock the gates."

msgid "MALAMUTE ARMORY CONTROL"
msgstr "MALAMUTE ARMOURY CONTROL"

msgid "UNLOCK ARMORY DOORS"
msgstr "UNLOCK ARMOURY DOORS"

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to grab you, but finds no grip on your armor!"
msgstr "%1$s tries to grab you, but finds no grip on your armour!"

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to grab <npcname>, but finds no grip on their armor!"
msgstr "%1$s tries to grab <npcname>, but finds no grip on their armour!"

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's attempt to crush your %2$s is deflected by your armor."
msgstr "%1$s's attempt to crush your %2$s is deflected by your armour."

#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's attempt to crush <npcname> is deflected by their armor."
msgstr "%1$s's attempt to crush <npcname> is deflected by their armour."

msgid "The Zenit crouches forward, hiding most of its body behind its upper armor plate."
msgstr "The Zenit crouches forward, hiding most of its body behind its upper armour plate."

msgid "A rabbit from Earth, genetically modified to eat the lichen of Salus IV.  Its fur is rust-colored and its ears are shortened to preserve warmth."
msgstr "A rabbit from Earth, genetically modified to eat the lichen of Salus IV.  Its fur is rust-coloured and its ears are shortened to preserve warmth."

msgid "A rabbit from Earth, genetically modified to eat the lichen of Salus IV.  Its fur is rust-colored and its ears are shortened to preserve warmth.  This one seems well-acclimated to the presence of nearby humans."
msgstr "A rabbit from Earth, genetically modified to eat the lichen of Salus IV.  Its fur is rust-coloured and its ears are shortened to preserve warmth.  This one seems well-acclimated to the presence of nearby humans."

msgid "The Wraitheon Pathfinder is a massive, house-height armored robot.  It is armed to the teeth with a 40mm anti-material grenade launcher, a 5.56 anti-personnel gun, and an electroshock capability to defend against melee strikes.  Manufactured by Wraitheon for the ESCA military, it was used along with infantry thanks to the flexibility of its reverse-jointed legs."
msgstr "The Wraitheon Pathfinder is a massive, house-height armoured robot.  It is armed to the teeth with a 40mm anti-material grenade launcher, a 5.56 anti-personnel gun, and an electroshock capability to defend against melee strikes.  Manufactured by Wraitheon for the ESCA military, it was used along with infantry thanks to the flexibility of its reverse-jointed legs."

msgid "Designed by Wraitheon, the Regulator is effectively an automated battle tank designed for high-risk urban fighting.  Armed with an anti-material missile launcher, a 40mm grenade launcher, and several anti-personnel weapons, it's designed to match the fervor of freedom fighters with the industrial might of Earth."
msgstr "Designed by Wraitheon, the Regulator is effectively an automated battle tank designed for high-risk urban fighting.  Armed with an anti-material missile launcher, a 40mm grenade launcher, and several anti-personnel weapons, it's designed to match the fervour of freedom fighters with the industrial might of Earth."

msgid "Clad in sable and gold armor, this luxurious combat humaniform is intended to serve as a bodyguard to society's wealthiest.  Still with its wrist sword extended, it resembles an ancient knight, standing an eternal watch."
msgstr "Clad in sable and gold armour, this luxurious combat humaniform is intended to serve as a bodyguard to society's wealthiest.  Still with its wrist sword extended, it resembles an ancient knight, standing an eternal watch."

msgid "A now ancient industrial robot line first made by the Soviet TsKBEM, and still in use thanks to its easily obtained fabrication schematics.  Built to operate within nuclear reactors and waste repositories, the Likvidator is assembled around an armored bipedal chassis that mounts several heavy manipulator arms.  Legend claims it was originally designed after a nuclear disaster during early space-age Earth."
msgstr "A now ancient industrial robot line first made by the Soviet TsKBEM, and still in use thanks to its easily obtained fabrication schematics.  Built to operate within nuclear reactors and waste repositories, the Likvidator is assembled around an armoured bipedal chassis that mounts several heavy manipulator arms.  Legend claims it was originally designed after a nuclear disaster during early space-age Earth."

msgid ""
"A highly customizable light industrial and agricultural robot.  Its original design dates back to the ancient Soviet Union; the aptly named Udarnik \"shock worker\" was the trigger behind the automation revolution, and with subsequent adaptations, became the workhorse of early human space colonization.  Although outdated by modern standards, the Udarnik is still commonly seen in frontier worlds - thanks to its easily obtainable fabrication schematics.\n"
"\n"
"This particular version is equipped with a mix of construction and heavy cargo-handling tools and was likely involved in the construction of colony buildings."
msgstr ""
"A highly customisable light industrial and agricultural robot.  Its original design dates back to the ancient Soviet Union; the aptly named Udarnik \"shock worker\" was the trigger behind the automation revolution, and with subsequent adaptations, became the workhorse of early human space colonisation.  Although outdated by modern standards, the Udarnik is still commonly seen in frontier worlds - thanks to its easily obtainable fabrication schematics.\n"
"\n"
"This particular version is equipped with a mix of construction and heavy cargo-handling tools and was likely involved in the construction of colony buildings."

msgid "An ancient security drone intended to safeguard extractive outposts in hostile environments.  Its construction vaguely recalls an alien crustacean, with a single sensory oculus and four spade-like legs mounted underneath a disk of space-ship grade armor.  Zenit units can mount a wide variety of \"deterrent\" weapon modules, and its difficult to tell what this rogue unit is capable of."
msgstr "An ancient security drone intended to safeguard extractive outposts in hostile environments.  Its construction vaguely recalls an alien crustacean, with a single sensory oculus and four spade-like legs mounted underneath a disk of space-ship grade armour.  Zenit units can mount a wide variety of \"deterrent\" weapon modules, and its difficult to tell what this rogue unit is capable of."

msgid "An imaginifer variant of unorthodox design, the Hashashiyyin dispenses with most of its armor in favor of active-camo systems and a lightweight, more agile frame.  Commonly employed in scouting and counter-sniping roles.  This unit is equipped for close range ambush, and weilds a 35x50mm dart gun."
msgstr "An imaginifer variant of unorthodox design, the Hashashiyyin dispenses with most of its armour in favour of active-camo systems and a lightweight, more agile frame.  Commonly employed in scouting and counter-sniping roles.  This unit is equipped for close range ambush, and weilds a 35x50mm dart gun."

msgid "A bulky aerial drone that mounts an advanced AI overwatch unit within it bulbous carapace-like armor.  As an autonomous drone control platform, the Isohypsa is principally meant to coordinate and enhance the combat capabilities of simpler Wraitheon robots in lieu of human operators."
msgstr "A bulky aerial drone that mounts an advanced AI overwatch unit within it bulbous carapace-like armour.  As an autonomous drone control platform, the Isohypsa is principally meant to coordinate and enhance the combat capabilities of simpler Wraitheon robots in lieu of human operators."

msgid "A nonviolent riot-control bot, designed to suppress riots and make mass arrests of those participating.  Though its relaxation gas is by far its best-known weapon, it carries a blinding spotlight and a low-powered stungun for self-defense--in addition to a supply of electronic handcuffs."
msgstr "A nonviolent riot-control bot, designed to suppress riots and make mass arrests of those participating.  Though its relaxation gas is by far its best-known weapon, it carries a blinding spotlight and a low-powered stungun for self-defence--in addition to a supply of electronic handcuffs."

msgid "Found on nearly every frontier planet, the ubiquitous TSKBEM STEED (Surface Traversing Equine Emulating Drone) is an incredibly rugged quadrupedal machine based on old Earth horses and mules.  Capable of crossing the roughest terrain, powered by a compact atomic reactor, generous storage capacity, light armor, and a lifetime warranty, the STEED is a priceless tool for prospectors and homesteaders.  This version has been ruggedized against Salus IV's extreme cold, but does not keep you warm while riding."
msgstr "Found on nearly every frontier planet, the ubiquitous TSKBEM STEED (Surface Traversing Equine Emulating Drone) is an incredibly rugged quadrupedal machine based on old Earth horses and mules.  Capable of crossing the roughest terrain, powered by a compact atomic reactor, generous storage capacity, light armour, and a lifetime warranty, the STEED is a priceless tool for prospectors and homesteaders.  This version has been ruggedised against Salus IV's extreme cold, but does not keep you warm while riding."

msgid "The Scavbot Skorpion is a refurb of colonial perimeter defense bots found across many systems.  Because they are designed to defend against pirates, raiders, feral uplifts, hungry scavengers, rival mining clans, and any other enemy that is unlikely to attack with heavily armored units, these reprogrammed and refurbed versions are often found in the employ of the very types of people it was originally purposed to fight.  Often found as the core of a light patrol or attack squad."
msgstr "The Scavbot Skorpion is a refurb of colonial perimeter defence bots found across many systems.  Because they are designed to defend against pirates, raiders, feral uplifts, hungry scavengers, rival mining clans, and any other enemy that is unlikely to attack with heavily armoured units, these reprogrammed and refurbed versions are often found in the employ of the very types of people it was originally purposed to fight.  Often found as the core of a light patrol or attack squad."

msgid "Schwarz Walders are a bipedal uplifted animal originally developed by a German company as forest rangers for the expanded Black Forest Conservation Area.  Like all Uplifts they have a human level of intelligence and are indentured laborers to the corporation that grew and raised them, until they reach age of enfranchisement dictated by UICA regulations or they earn their citizenship early.  Shortly afterward the creation of the first Schwarz Walders it was determined that they also made excellent long range reconnaissance units that could operate independently indefinitely.  This was one of the most popular Uplift models before the Discontinuity, and many frontier planets still retain significant feral and otherwise independent populations.  They are skilled marksmen and this one appears to be armed with an SMG."
msgstr "Schwarz Walders are a bipedal uplifted animal originally developed by a German company as forest rangers for the expanded Black Forest Conservation Area.  Like all Uplifts they have a human level of intelligence and are indentured labourers to the corporation that grew and raised them, until they reach age of enfranchisement dictated by UICA regulations or they earn their citizenship early.  Shortly afterward the creation of the first Schwarz Walders it was determined that they also made excellent long range reconnaissance units that could operate independently indefinitely.  This was one of the most popular Uplift models before the Discontinuity, and many frontier planets still retain significant feral and otherwise independent populations.  They are skilled marksmen and this one appears to be armed with an SMG."

msgid "An undead Uplifted Elephant of ginormous size.  It still wears its assault grade armor."
msgstr "An undead Uplifted Elephant of ginormous size.  It still wears its assault grade armour."

#, c-format
msgid "The %s armor plating is shredded!"
msgstr "The %s armour plating is shredded!"

msgid "a dense segment of armor"
msgstr "a dense segment of armour"

msgid "its weakly armored backside"
msgstr "its weakly armoured backside"

msgid "an armored limb"
msgstr "an armoured limb"

msgid "the upper armor disk"
msgstr "the upper armour disk"

msgid "The Zenit's armor disk is shredded!"
msgstr "The Zenit's armour disk is shredded!"

msgid "Your concentration and memorization abilities have been increased through genemod treatments."
msgstr "Your concentration and memorisation abilities have been increased through genemod treatments."

msgid "Some worlds maintained human life but lost technologically advanced civilization.  As these worlds get rediscovered some organizations leave the worlds to develop, while others see a source of cheap labor.  Whether you snuck onto a ship or were Shanghaied onto one you've somehow ended up on the hell that is Salus IV.  At least you have some experience surviving outside of what these spacers call 'civilization'."
msgstr "Some worlds maintained human life but lost technologically advanced civilisation.  As these worlds get rediscovered some organisations leave the worlds to develop, while others see a source of cheap labour.  Whether you snuck onto a ship or were Shanghaied onto one you've somehow ended up on the hell that is Salus IV.  At least you have some experience surviving outside of what these spacers call 'civilisation'."

msgid "You are a UICA Inspector from a civilized part of space.  You have the authority to investigate under a variety of different legal frameworks, UICA, planetary, corporate, system, pre-Discontinuity legal systems for worlds that have only recently been re-discovered.  All of this means that you are nearly a law unto yourself, though you wonder how much that matters in a place like Salus IV outside of maybe Port Augustmoon."
msgstr "You are a UICA Inspector from a civilised part of space.  You have the authority to investigate under a variety of different legal frameworks, UICA, planetary, corporate, system, pre-Discontinuity legal systems for worlds that have only recently been re-discovered.  All of this means that you are nearly a law unto yourself, though you wonder how much that matters in a place like Salus IV outside of maybe Port Augustmoon."

msgid "Look for surgical centers inside the labs."
msgstr "Look for surgical centres inside the labs."

msgid "A multitude of frontier homesteading groups brought together by their use of the PrepNet communication protocols.  Spread out onto the edges of the frontier, enthusiastically squatting and building tiny kingdoms often consisting of just a couple families or like-minded individuals.  Their mutual aid societies are wildly varied in their laws; influenced by the people who set them up, but they all share in a distrust for those that wish to impose restrictions upon new colonization efforts."
msgstr "A multitude of frontier homesteading groups brought together by their use of the PrepNet communication protocols.  Spread out onto the edges of the frontier, enthusiastically squatting and building tiny kingdoms often consisting of just a couple families or like-minded individuals.  Their mutual aid societies are wildly varied in their laws; influenced by the people who set them up, but they all share in a distrust for those that wish to impose restrictions upon new colonisation efforts."

msgid ""
"A loose confederation and military alliance composed by Solar Corporations, Governments, and other politically relevant organizations united by their desire to restore Earth's dominion over the Orion Arm.  Due to the disinterest of the Salus Charter owners and the recent rediscovery of the system, UICA administers Salus IV using a combination of military and civilian law designed to maximize wealth extraction, with the bulk of their forces concentrated within Port Augustmoon.\n"
"\n"
"Corruption and nepotism are rampant across UICA's frontier administrations, management is generally more interested in lining their own pockets than in any sort of solar revanchist rhetoric."
msgstr ""
"A loose confederation and military alliance composed by Solar Corporations, Governments, and other politically relevant organisations united by their desire to restore Earth's dominion over the Orion Arm.  Due to the disinterest of the Salus Charter owners and the recent rediscovery of the system, UICA administers Salus IV using a combination of military and civilian law designed to maximise wealth extraction, with the bulk of their forces concentrated within Port Augustmoon.\n"
"\n"
"Corruption and nepotism are rampant across UICA's frontier administrations, management is generally more interested in lining their own pockets than in any sort of solar revanchist rhetoric."

msgid "A massive, multi-system corporation specializing in genetic engineering, terraforming, and biotechnology.  Before the discontinuity, it heavily invested in extrasolar colonization and the study of alien life.  Theoretically it holds the planetary colonization charter for Salus IV, per UICA's constitional treaty, but the corporation's interests currently lie elsewhere."
msgstr "A massive, multi-system corporation specialising in genetic engineering, terraforming, and biotechnology.  Before the discontinuity, it heavily invested in extrasolar colonisation and the study of alien life.  Theoretically it holds the planetary colonisation charter for Salus IV, per UICA's constitional treaty, but the corporation's interests currently lie elsewhere."

msgid "The Whately's are known in these parts for gathering body parts.  Ha!  That's just rumors and hearsay.  But I do need two humming hearts."
msgstr "The Whately's are known in these parts for gathering body parts.  Ha!  That's just rumours and hearsay.  But I do need two humming hearts."

msgid "My great uncle Cyrus had an unconventional relationship with both his neighbors and the mi-go before the Cataclysm.  I'd like to know where he has gotten with his research since I haven't heard from him in years."
msgstr "My great uncle Cyrus had an unconventional relationship with both his neighbours and the mi-go before the Cataclysm.  I'd like to know where he has gotten with his research since I haven't heard from him in years."

msgid "Hospitality rites are civilization."
msgstr "Hospitality rites are civilisation."

msgid "You need an armament license to buy this."
msgstr "You need an armament licence to buy this."

msgid "Staying at the family compounds scattered across New England, we've managed to maintain some organization post Cataclysm."
msgstr "Staying at the family compounds scattered across New England, we've managed to maintain some organisation post Cataclysm."

msgid "&As you approach the counter, you can't help but notice the chaotic scene before you: Juxtaposed to the makeshift structure, an awkward marriage of ship hulls and foamcrete walls, stands neatly arranged shelving, and near-pristine furniture.  The tools and parts lining the shelves have each been meticulously arranged.  A Salvor sits behind the counter with her arm perched on the surface, supporting her head in her hand.  In her other hand, she idly waves a cigarette, making small circles in the air.  Gray hairs peek out from the edges of her Cryo suit, and her wrinkle-creased face wears a permanent scowl."
msgstr "&As you approach the counter, you can't help but notice the chaotic scene before you: Juxtaposed to the makeshift structure, an awkward marriage of ship hulls and foamcrete walls, stands neatly arranged shelving, and near-pristine furniture.  The tools and parts lining the shelves have each been meticulously arranged.  A Salvor sits behind the counter with her arm perched on the surface, supporting her head in her hand.  In her other hand, she idly waves a cigarette, making small circles in the air.  Grey hairs peek out from the edges of her Cryo suit, and her wrinkle-creased face wears a permanent scowl."

msgid "Came in with a crew trying to cozy up 'ere on the DL.  It was a shit plan from the start, told 'em as much.  But those scrap-for brains couldn't see the forest for the trees.  Figured they pull a fortune of ship parts from the graveyards and skip planet fat and happy."
msgstr "Came in with a crew trying to cosy up 'ere on the DL.  It was a shit plan from the start, told 'em as much.  But those scrap-for brains couldn't see the forest for the trees.  Figured they pull a fortune of ship parts from the graveyards and skip planet fat and happy."

msgid ""
"Net Breacher woke up the Ship's AI.  The bastard fried her brain from the inside out.  Rail from a Wraith turned another two to paste while everyone was still losing their shit.  Rest is a haze of bloody screams and a hail of bullets and plasma.  Few that got out died later of blood loss or froze from suits full o' holes.\n"
"Veronica removes her glove revealing a metallic hand that glints brightly in the dim light of the structure.\n"
"Woulda been dead myself but the plasma burst that took my arm cauterized the wound.  Patched the suit up with foamcrete on my way out.  The Doc had a lot of fun with that one."
msgstr ""
"Net Breacher woke up the Ship's AI.  The bastard fried her brain from the inside out.  Rail from a Wraith turned another two to paste while everyone was still losing their shit.  Rest is a haze of bloody screams and a hail of bullets and plasma.  Few that got out died later of blood loss or froze from suits full o' holes.\n"
"Veronica removes her glove revealing a metallic hand that glints brightly in the dim light of the structure.\n"
"Woulda been dead myself but the plasma burst that took my arm cauterised the wound.  Patched the suit up with foamcrete on my way out.  The Doc had a lot of fun with that one."

msgid "I pulled myself together and set up this little abode.  Been selling tools and gear to the folk that come through 'ere for a time now.  Buncha upstarts followed suit and set up their own little places.  And now we got our own neighborhood.  If it weren't for the nosey UICA pricks and especially that little shit Atermis I'd almost call it livable."
msgstr "I pulled myself together and set up this little abode.  Been selling tools and gear to the folk that come through 'ere for a time now.  Buncha upstarts followed suit and set up their own little places.  And now we got our own neighbourhood.  If it weren't for the nosey UICA pricks and especially that little shit Atermis I'd almost call it liveable."

msgid ""
"&The food stall is a colorful array of various dishes, and the smell of spices and cooked meats cuts easily through the frozen air.  The vendor  is busy preparing a meal when you approach.\n"
"\"Oh steemd do you see anything you like?\""
msgstr ""
"&The food stall is a colourful array of various dishes, and the smell of spices and cooked meats cuts easily through the frozen air.  The vendor  is busy preparing a meal when you approach.\n"
"\"Oh steemd do you see anything you like?\""

msgid "&Right?  Right!  Of course you do.  You understand!  This place is about as far a cry from civilization as you can get.  And the people, god, the people!  This post sees a never-ending deluge of criminals and brawn for brains.  And it's like none of them have even heard of a shower!  Just the other day, a man emerged from the icy waste covered in blood and viscera.  And everyone just ignored him acting like that was a completely normal thing to do!  I am going to get off this god-forsaken rock if it's the last thing I do, I swear it."
msgstr "&Right?  Right!  Of course you do.  You understand!  This place is about as far a cry from civilisation as you can get.  And the people, god, the people!  This post sees a never-ending deluge of criminals and brawn for brains.  And it's like none of them have even heard of a shower!  Just the other day, a man emerged from the icy waste covered in blood and viscera.  And everyone just ignored him acting like that was a completely normal thing to do!  I am going to get off this god-forsaken rock if it's the last thing I do, I swear it."

msgid "&Right!  Sorry, this is the vehicle bay, and I run the place.  Mostly I just fix up the patrol vehicles.  But I am also in charge of maintaining our stock of vehicle parts.  As such: I've been authorized to trade with salvors in order to get what we need, and can offer you some of our excess stock or chits in exchange.  I'll give you a nice price, just: Don't tell my boss.  And one more thing, I've got something really special for sale, if you're interested."
msgstr "&Right!  Sorry, this is the vehicle bay, and I run the place.  Mostly I just fix up the patrol vehicles.  But I am also in charge of maintaining our stock of vehicle parts.  As such: I've been authorised to trade with salvors in order to get what we need, and can offer you some of our excess stock or chits in exchange.  I'll give you a nice price, just: Don't tell my boss.  And one more thing, I've got something really special for sale, if you're interested."

msgid "This is the vehicle bay, and I run the place.  Please don't touch anything unless you're buying.  I fix up the patrol vehicles and maintain our stock of spare parts.  As such: I've been authorized to trade with outsiders in order to get what we need, and can offer you some of our excess stock or chits in exchange."
msgstr "This is the vehicle bay, and I run the place.  Please don't touch anything unless you're buying.  I fix up the patrol vehicles and maintain our stock of spare parts.  As such: I've been authorised to trade with outsiders in order to get what we need, and can offer you some of our excess stock or chits in exchange."

msgid "&As I've SAID before: I'm only authorized to trade vehicle parts and scraps.  Our patrol vehicles are not up for auction.  Now if you don't mind, I have work to do."
msgstr "&As I've SAID before: I'm only authorised to trade vehicle parts and scraps.  Our patrol vehicles are not up for auction.  Now if you don't mind, I have work to do."

msgid "I'd report you if this sort of behavior wasn't already so laughably perdictable.  Just go away."
msgstr "I'd report you if this sort of behaviour wasn't already so laughably perdictable.  Just go away."

msgid "The last thing they did was set up their little clinic on the station, and they haven't done jack since.  No communications, no re-colonization efforts, no survey teams.  They hardly even seem to care about going down planetside.  Not like I blame them.  The colony didn't work out before so, why bother?  This place is clearly not worth the effort."
msgstr "The last thing they did was set up their little clinic on the station, and they haven't done jack since.  No communications, no re-colonisation efforts, no survey teams.  They hardly even seem to care about going down planetside.  Not like I blame them.  The colony didn't work out before so, why bother?  This place is clearly not worth the effort."

msgid "The kit is available as a one-time purchase for 3660 USD.  It includes a basic set of thermal clothing for survival, a backpack, basic cooking implements and supplies, a self-defense weapon and some basic medical supplies.  It is designed to help you survive the first few days planetside, but it is not a complete solution for long-term survival."
msgstr "The kit is available as a one-time purchase for 3660 USD.  It includes a basic set of thermal clothing for survival, a backpack, basic cooking implements and supplies, a self-defence weapon and some basic medical supplies.  It is designed to help you survive the first few days planetside, but it is not a complete solution for long-term survival."

