msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "A senior technologist from the Planetary Academy of Khorat, sent to Salus IV to oversee the procurement of valuable technological artifacts.  Although generously equipped, you are neither a fighter nor a good fit for life in the frontier.  You'd feel far more comfortable and capable commanding this salvage operation from the faraway safety of your office."
msgstr "A senior technologist from the Planetary Academy of Khorat, sent to Salus IV to oversee the procurement of valuable technological artefacts.  Although generously equipped, you are neither a fighter nor a good fit for life in the frontier.  You'd feel far more comfortable and capable commanding this salvage operation from the faraway safety of your office."

