msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the moaning is fainter this far from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing out here."
msgstr "You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the moaning is fainter this far from civilisation, but you'd better know what you're doing out here."

