msgid "You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the moaning is fainter this far from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing out here."
msgstr "You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the moaning is fainter this far from civilisation, but you'd better know what you're doing out here."

msgid "This is an oil fueled lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "This is an oil fuelled lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."

msgid "This is a specialized small clay container with a wick, an ancient form of oil lamp.  Unlike newer designs, it isn't windproof, so the flame is likely to be extinguished if exposed to wind; better use it indoors.  It does not provide much light, but lasts a long time.  It is lit, consuming oil and providing light.  Use it to extinguish the flame."
msgstr "This is a specialised small clay container with a wick, an ancient form of oil lamp.  Unlike newer designs, it isn't windproof, so the flame is likely to be extinguished if exposed to wind; better use it indoors.  It does not provide much light, but lasts a long time.  It is lit, consuming oil and providing light.  Use it to extinguish the flame."

msgid "A 12 inch by 24 inch sheet of fabric woven from plant fiber, suitable for making clothing."
msgstr "A 12 inch by 24 inch sheet of fabric woven from plant fibre, suitable for making clothing."

msgid "This is a set of tools to repair damaged metal tools and armor.  It uses charcoal, contained in a small clay vessel, to heat the part and make it easier to work."
msgstr "This is a set of tools to repair damaged metal tools and armour.  It uses charcoal, contained in a small clay vessel, to heat the part and make it easier to work."

