msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You were employed by a major international corporation as a representative and technical advisor, utilizing the incredible power of your cybernetically augmented mind."
msgstr "You were employed by a major international corporation as a representative and technical advisor, utilising the incredible power of your cybernetically augmented mind."

