msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "For better or for worse, bionic augmentation has turned you into a walking power tool.  Upgraded with a standard industrial-grade manual labor surgery and training package, you are augmented with bionic muscles and an integrated toolset, both powered by standard batteries."
msgstr "For better or for worse, bionic augmentation has turned you into a walking power tool.  Upgraded with a standard industrial-grade manual labour surgery and training package, you are augmented with bionic muscles and an integrated toolset, both powered by standard batteries."

